rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "Because the “search” requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\'t have to find the card if you don\'t want to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "If no card of the chosen type is found before your library empties, you don\'t get a card, but you do get to order all the cards in your library any way you choose."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'If you use this on a multi-card draw, each replaced draw is handled separately. In other words, you reveal and then put on the bottom of the library for the first card, then do the same for the second, and so on. In a multi-card draw you do not have to choose how many of those draws will be replaced before you do any drawing or use of this card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'This replacement effect replaces the draw, so nothing that triggers on a draw will trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': "If your library is empty, Abundance can prevent you from losing the game for being unable to draw a card. If an effect or turn-based action would cause you to draw a card, you can replace that draw with Abundance\'s replacement effect. (It doesn\'t matter that you\'d be unable to actually draw a card.) Since Abundance\'s effect has you put a card into your hand instead of drawing a card, you\'ll never be forced to draw a card with an empty library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "If you have at least one of each of the three Urza\'s lands on the battlefield, you must take the 2 mana instead of just one."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The land does not count toward your one per turn limit because it was put onto the battlefield by an effect.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Three Visits allows you to search your library for any card with the land type Forest, not just a card with the name Forest.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Because the “search” requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don’t have to find the card if you don’t want to.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You put the creature onto the battlefield, so you control it and any “enters the battlefield” abilities it has.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Because the “search” requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don’t have to find the card if you don’t want to.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Can never affect the colored part of the cost.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If this card is sacrificed to pay part of a spell’s cost, the cost reduction still applies.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The effect is cumulative.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The generic X cost is still considered generic even if there is a requirement that a specific color be used for it. For example, “only black mana can be spent this way”. This distinction is important for effects which reduce the generic portion of a spell’s cost.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The lower cost is not optional like with some other cost reducers.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This can lower the cost to zero, but not below zero.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Each other player sacrifices a creature for each creature you control that goes to a graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If there is no other legal target for the spell, this does not change the target.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Once the spell resolves, the new target is considered to be targeted by the deflected spell. This will trigger any effects which trigger on being targeted.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The target of a spell that targets another spell on the stack can be changed to any other spell on the stack, even if the new target will resolve before the spell does.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This does not check if the current target is legal. It just checks if the spell has a single target.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This only targets the spell being changed, not the original or new target of the spell it is affecting.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can choose to make a spell on the stack target this spell (if such a target choice would be legal had the spell been cast while this spell was on the stack). The new target for the deflected spell is not chosen until this spell resolves. This spell is still on the stack when new targets are selected for the spell.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can’t make a spell which is on the stack target itself.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You choose the spell to target on announcement, but you pick the new target for that spell on resolution.'}, {'date': '2007-02-01', 'text': 'If a spell has multiple targets but is targeting the same thing with all of them (such as Seeds of Strength targeting the same creature three times), you can’t target that spell with Imp’s Mischief.'}, {'date': '2007-02-01', 'text': 'If a spell targets multiple things, you can’t target it with Imp’s Mischief, even if all but one of the targets has become illegal.'}, {'date': '2007-02-01', 'text': 'If there is no other legal target for the spell, the spell’s target isn’t changed. You still lose the life.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'It only produces one mana even if the land can produce more than one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The ability can be activated if the opponent has no lands that produce mana, but the effect will not be able to generate any mana.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "This works even if the opponent\'s lands are tapped. It only checks what kinds of mana can be produced, not if the abilities that produce them are usable right now."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Fellwar Stone checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands your opponents control, but it doesn\\\'t check their costs. For example, Vivid Crag has the ability "{T}, Remove a charge counter from Vivid Crag: Add one mana of any color." If an opponent controls Vivid Crag and you control Fellwar Stone, you can tap Fellwar Stone for any color of mana. It doesn\\\'t matter whether Vivid Crag has a charge counter on it, and it doesn\\\'t matter whether it\\\'s untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Fellwar Stone doesn\'t care about any restrictions or riders your opponents\' lands (such as Ancient Ziggurat or Hall of the Bandit Lord) put on the mana they produce. It just cares about colors of mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "The colors of mana are white, blue, black, red, and green. Fellwar Stone can\'t be tapped for colorless mana, even if a land an opponent controls could produce colorless mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "When determining what colors of mana your opponents\' lands could produce, take into account any applicable replacement effects that would apply to those lands\' mana abilities (such as Contamination\'s effect, for example). If there is more than one, consider them in any possible order."}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The ability only applies while this card is on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like flying, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the creature type of a Sliver changes so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The first ability applies when this card is not on the battlefield. The second ability applies when this card is on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like flying, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the creature type of a Sliver changes so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'This card is put directly into your hand. It is not drawn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "You don\'t reveal the card to your opponent."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'You pick a card on resolution.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This card’s controller controls the triggered ability, but the controller of the Sliver that deals damage to a player decides whether or not to put the token onto the battlefield under their control.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like flying, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the creature type of a Sliver changes so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You do not have to find a mountain or forest card if you do not want to.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You do not have to find a plains or forest card if you do not want to.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You untap all creatures, control all creatures, and give all creatures Haste.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'The additional combat phase is directly after the combat phase in which Savage Beating is cast. There isn’t a main phase between the two combat phases.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'You can get just one basic land card if you wish (or even none at all). If you get only one land card, you put it onto the battlefield tapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'If an effect takes a card Kaho exiled out of the Exile zone, then you can’t use Kaho’s ability to cast that card.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'If another player gains control of Kaho, that player may cast any of the cards exiled with Kaho’s ability.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Kaho’s activated ability refers only to cards exiled by its triggered ability. If another effect exiled the cards, you won’t be able to use Kaho to cast those cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'You may choose yourself.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-05-01', 'text': 'Unlike with cards like Quicksilver Elemental, the costs of the activated abilities Experiment Kraj gains must be paid with the correct colors of mana.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-07-15', 'text': 'After Commandeer resolves, you control the targeted spell. Any instance of “you” in that spell’s text now refers to you, “an opponent” refers to one of your opponents, and so on. The change of control happens before new targets are chosen, so any targeting restrictions such as “target opponent” or “target creature you control” are now made in reference to you, not the spell’s original controller. You may either change those targets to be legal in reference to you, or, if those are the spell’s only targets, the spell doesn’t resolve for having illegal targets. When the spell resolves, any illegal targets are unaffected by it and you make all decisions the spell’s effect calls for.'}, {'date': '2006-07-15', 'text': 'If the targeted spell has a triggered ability that copies it (for example, replicate or storm), the copies will be controlled by the player who cast that spell.'}, {'date': '2006-07-15', 'text': 'If you don’t have two cards of the right color in your hand, you can’t choose to cast the spell using the alternative cost.'}, {'date': '2006-07-15', 'text': 'If you gain control of an instant or sorcery spell with Commandeer, it will still be put into its owner’s graveyard when it resolves.'}, {'date': '2006-07-15', 'text': 'You can’t exile a card from your hand to pay for itself. At the time you would pay costs, that card is on the stack, not in your hand.'}, {'date': '2006-07-15', 'text': 'You may change any of the targeted spell’s targets. If you change a target, you must choose a legal target for the spell. If you can’t, you must leave the target the same (even if that target is now illegal).'}, {'date': '2006-07-15', 'text': 'You may pay the alternative cost rather than the card’s mana cost. Any additional costs are paid as normal.'}, {'date': '2007-02-01', 'text': 'If you Commandeer a spell for which Buyback has been paid, the card returns to its owner’s hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Face-down spells are creature spells, but they have mana value 0.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'The second ability is a state trigger. Once it triggers, it won’t trigger again as long as the ability is on the stack. If the ability is countered and the trigger condition is still true, it will immediately trigger again.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'When the second ability resolves, Endrek Sahr will be sacrificed regardless of how many Thrulls you control at that time, even if it’s less than seven.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2006-10-15\', \'text\': \'You can fetch any of the “Snow-Covered” lands, since they all also have the supertype basic.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "This ability has an “intervening ‘if\' clause.” That means (1) the ability won\'t trigger at all unless any one of your opponents controls more lands than you, and (2) the ability will do nothing if you control at least as many lands as each of your opponents by the time it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "You shuffle your library if you search, even if you don\'t put any basic land cards into your hand."}]', "[{'date': '2007-02-01', 'text': 'If Body Double copies a Vesuvan Shapeshifter which then copies another creature and then is somehow turned face down, the Body Double is now a face-down Vesuvan Shapeshifter and may be turned face up via its Morph ability.'}, {'date': '2007-02-01', 'text': 'Treat Body Double as though it were the chosen card entering the battlefield. Any “As this card enters the battlefield,” “This card enters the battlefield with,” and “When this card enters the battlefield” abilities of the chosen card will work.'}, {'date': '2007-02-01', 'text': 'You don’t have to choose a card to copy. If you don’t, Body Double enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature and is probably put into your graveyard immediately, unless something is increasing its toughness to keep it alive.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "Counts resolutions, not activations. Any such abilities that are still on the stack won\'t count toward the total."}, {\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "When the ability resolves, it counts the number of times that same ability from that this creature has already resolved that turn. It doesn\'t matter who controlled the creature or the previous abilities when they resolved. A copy of this ability (created by Rings of Brighthearth, for example) will count toward the total. Abilities from other creatures with the same name don\'t count towards the total. Neither does an ability that\'s been countered."}, {\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "You get the bonus only the third time the ability resolves. You won\'t get the bonus the fourth, fifth, sixth, or any subsequent times."}, {\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "“That much damage” refers to the number of +1/+1 counters removed from Ashling the Pilgrim. Since the counters are removed, it\'s likely that the damage will kill Ashling."}]', "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'Effects that cause you to pay more or less to cast a spell will cause you to pay that much more or less while casting it for its evoke cost, too. That’s because they affect the total cost of the spell, not its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'Evoke doesn’t change the timing of when you can cast the creature that has it. If you could cast that creature spell only when you could cast a sorcery, the same is true for cast it with evoke.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'If a creature spell cast with evoke changes controllers before it enters the battlefield, it will still be sacrificed when it enters the battlefield. Similarly, if a creature cast with evoke changes controllers after it enters the battlefield but before its sacrifice ability resolves, it will still be sacrificed. In both cases, the controller of the creature at the time it left the battlefield will control its leaves-the-battlefield ability.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'If you’re casting a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t use its evoke ability.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'When you cast a spell by paying its evoke cost, its mana cost doesn’t change. You just pay the evoke cost instead.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'Whether evoke’s sacrifice ability triggers when the creature enters the battlefield depends on whether the spell’s controller chose to pay the evoke cost, not whether they actually paid it (if it was reduced or otherwise altered by another ability, for example).'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'Note that this spell counts the number of permanents you control of the chosen type, not just the number of creatures you control. It will also take your tribal permanents into account.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Exalted abilities will resolve before blockers are declared.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Exalted bonuses last until end of turn. If an effect creates an additional combat phase during your turn, a creature that attacked alone during the first combat phase will still have its exalted bonuses in that new phase. If a creature attacks alone during the second combat phase, all your exalted abilities will trigger again.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you attack with multiple creatures, but then all but one are removed from combat, your exalted abilities won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you declare exactly one creature as an attacker, each exalted ability on each permanent you control (including, perhaps, the attacking creature itself) will trigger. The bonuses are given to the attacking creature, not to the permanent with exalted. Ultimately, the attacking creature will wind up with +1/+1 for each of your exalted abilities.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, a creature “attacks alone” if it’s the only creature declared as an attacker by your entire team. If you control that attacking creature, your exalted abilities will trigger but your teammate’s exalted abilities won’t.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Some effects put creatures onto the battlefield attacking. Since those creatures were never declared as attackers, they’re ignored by exalted abilities. They won’t cause exalted abilities to trigger. If any exalted abilities have already triggered (because exactly one creature was declared as an attacker), those abilities will resolve as normal even though there may now be multiple attackers.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "If multiple effects modify your hand size, apply them in timestamp order. For example, if you put Null Profusion (an enchantment that says your maximum hand size is two) onto the battlefield and then put Reliquary Tower onto the battlefield, you\'ll have no maximum hand size. However, if those permanents enter the battlefield in the opposite order, your maximum hand size would be two."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Exotic Orchard checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands your opponents control, but it doesn\\\'t check their costs. For example, Vivid Crag has the ability "{T}, Remove a charge counter from Vivid Crag: Add one mana of any color." If an opponent controls Vivid Crag and you control Exotic Orchard, you can tap Exotic Orchard for any color of mana. It doesn\\\'t matter whether Vivid Crag has a charge counter on it, and it doesn\\\'t matter whether it\\\'s untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "Exotic Orchard doesn\'t care about any restrictions or riders your opponents\' lands (such as Ancient Ziggurat or Hall of the Bandit Lord) put on the mana they produce. It just cares about colors of mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Lands that produce mana based only on what other lands "could produce" won\\\'t help each other unless some other land allows one of them to actually produce some type of mana. For example, if you control an Exotic Orchard and your opponent controls an Exotic Orchard and a Reflecting Pool, none of those lands would produce mana if their mana abilities were activated. On the other hand, if you control a Forest and an Exotic Orchard, and your opponent controls an Exotic Orchard and a Reflecting Pool, then each of those lands can be tapped to produce {G}. Your opponent\\\'s Exotic Orchard can produce {G} because you control a Forest. Your Exotic Orchard and your opponent\\\'s Reflecting Pool can each produce {G} because your opponent\\\'s Exotic Orchard can produce {G}.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "The colors of mana are white, blue, black, red, and green. Exotic Orchard can\'t be tapped for colorless mana, even if a land an opponent controls could produce colorless mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "When determining what colors of mana your opponents\' lands could produce, Exotic Orchard takes into account any applicable replacement effects that would apply to those lands\' mana abilities (such as Contamination\'s effect, for example). If there are more than one, consider them in any possible order."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "The landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability (such as Rampant Growth) causes you to put a land onto the battlefield under your control. It will even trigger when a spell or ability causes another player to put a land onto the battlefield under your control (as can happen with Yavimaya Dryad\'s ability, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.\'}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Bloodchief Ascension’s first ability checks how much life was lost by each opponent over the course of the entire turn, even if Bloodchief Ascension wasn’t on the battlefield the whole time.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Bloodchief Ascension’s first ability checks only whether life was lost. It doesn’t care whether life was also gained. For example, if an opponent lost 4 life and gained 6 life during the turn, that player will have a higher life total than they started the turn with — but Bloodchief Ascension’s first ability will still trigger.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Bloodchief Ascension’s first ability has an “intervening ‘if’ clause.” It won’t trigger at all unless an opponent has already lost 2 or more life by the time the end step begins.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Bloodchief Ascension’s second ability doesn’t behave like a leaves-the-battlefield triggered ability, since the card put into an opponent’s graveyard may come from anywhere. If a Bloodchief Ascension with three quest counters on it and a permanent an opponent owns are destroyed at the same time, for example, the game will not “look back in time” at the game state, and Bloodchief Ascension’s second ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'For the first ability to trigger, a single opponent must have lost 2 life. Two opponents each losing 1 life won’t cause it to trigger. It will trigger a maximum of once per turn, no matter how many opponents have lost 2 or more life.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Despite the similarities between horsemanship and flying, horsemanship doesn’t interact with flying or reach.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Sun Quan’s ability affects Sun Quan itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Hellkite Charger’s ability may trigger multiple times in the same turn, since its own ability gives it multiple chances to attack. Each time it resolves, you may create an additional combat phase.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If two Hellkite Chargers attack at the same time, both of their abilities trigger. If you pay {5}{R}{R} for each, two new combat phases will be created. However, all attacking creatures untap as those abilities resolve, not as the combat phases start. Any creature that attacks in the second combat phase will remain tapped during the third combat phase.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If you pay {5}{R}{R}, the new combat phase immediately follows the current combat phase. There is no main phase in between.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'You decide whether to pay {5}{R}{R} as Hellkite Charger’s ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If a targeted permanent is untapped at the time its controller’s next untap step begins, this ability has no effect on it. It won’t apply at some later time when the targeted permanent is tapped.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If an affected permanent changes controllers before its old controller’s next untap step, this ability will prevent it from being untapped during its new controller’s next untap step.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'You may target any eight (or fewer) permanents. It’s okay if any of them are already tapped, and it’s okay if any of them are controlled by someone other than the defending player.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If there are fewer than twenty cards in the targeted player’s library, that player puts all the cards from their library into their graveyard.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "As the ability resolves, you can\'t put the Ogre token onto the battlefield without explicitly giving the attacking player the option to pay {3}, even if the attacking player has forgotten about this ability."}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': \'If an attacking creature has a "Whenever this creature attacks" ability, that ability is put on the stack first, then Kazuul\\\'s ability is put on the stack. Although Kazuul\\\'s ability will resolve first, and potentially create an Ogre token, any target of the other ability will already have been chosen at this point, and thus could not have been the new Ogre token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "If you\'re the defending player, Kazuul\'s ability triggers once for each creature that attacks, not just once per combat. The attacking player chooses whether to pay {3} or let you have an Ogre token each time one of those abilities resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, the ability checks whether you\'re the defending player for each individual attacking creature. For example, if one creature attacks you and two creatures attack another player, Kazuul\'s ability triggers just once."}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': \'The ability triggers and resolves during the declare attackers step. If you put an Ogre token onto the battlefield as a result, you may block with it during that combat phase.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "You\'re the defending player if a creature is attacking you, a planeswalker you control, or a battle you protect."}]', "[{'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'If a green mana you add to your mana pool has certain restrictions or riders associated with it (for example, if it was produced by Ancient Ziggurat), they’ll apply to that mana no matter when you spend it.'}, {'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'Once Omnath leaves the battlefield, you have until the end of the current step or phase to spend whatever green mana is in your mana pool before it too empties as normal. There is no penalty associated with this other than the loss of the mana.'}, {'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'You can keep green mana in your mana pool indefinitely while Omnath is on the battlefield. That means if you add a green mana to your mana pool during one step or phase, you can spend it during a later step or phase, or even a later turn. Other types of mana will continue to empty from your mana pool as each step and phase ends.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "Annihilator abilities trigger and resolve during the declare attackers step. The defending player chooses and sacrifices the required number of permanents before they declare blockers. Any creatures sacrificed this way won\'t be able to block."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "If a creature with annihilator is attacking a planeswalker, and the defending player chooses to sacrifice that planeswalker, the attacking creature continues to attack. It may be blocked. If it isn\'t blocked, it simply won\'t deal combat damage to anything."}]', "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'A colored permanent is a permanent with at least one colored mana symbol in its mana cost. Note that effects may cause a colored permanent to become colorless (as Moonlace could), or a colorless permanent to become colored (as Crimson Wisps could).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'All the colored permanents are sacrificed at the same time.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Lands have no mana cost, so they are colorless unless an effect states otherwise.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Tokens may also be colored permanents. The effect that creates a token states what color it is or whether it’s colorless.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'All Is Dust doesn’t destroy permanents. Rather, it causes them to be sacrificed. Regeneration, totem armor, and indestructible can’t save permanents from All Is Dust.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'A land card that produces colored mana, even a land with a basic land type, normally has no color.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Annihilator abilities trigger and resolve during the declare attackers step. The defending player chooses and sacrifices the required number of permanents before they declare blockers. Any creatures sacrificed this way won’t be able to block.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a creature with annihilator is attacking a planeswalker, and the defending player chooses to sacrifice that planeswalker, the attacking creature continues to attack. It may be blocked. If it isn’t blocked, it simply won’t deal combat damage to anything.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If an opponent sacrifices a nontoken permanent as part of paying the cost of a spell or ability, the second ability triggers and goes on the stack on top of it. This ability will resolve, causing you to return the card to the battlefield before the other spell or ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If an opponent sacrifices an Aura, you’ll choose what it enchants as you return it to the battlefield. No player can respond to the choice. Since an Aura doesn’t target anything if it isn’t cast as a spell, you can enchant a permanent with shroud this way.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the sacrificed permanent that caused the second ability to trigger somehow leaves the graveyard before the ability resolves (possibly because it was returned to the battlefield by the ability of another It That Betrays), the ability simply won’t do anything when it resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'It doesn’t matter whose graveyard the permanent is put into, only that it was last controlled by, and sacrificed by, an opponent.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The second ability triggers whenever an opponent sacrifices a nontoken permanent for any reason, not just due to the annihilator ability.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'When the second ability resolves, you must return the card to the battlefield, even if you don’t want to.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Annihilator abilities trigger and resolve during the declare attackers step. The defending player chooses and sacrifices the required number of permanents before they declare blockers. Any creatures sacrificed this way won’t be able to block.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a creature with annihilator is attacking a planeswalker, and the defending player chooses to sacrifice that planeswalker, the attacking creature continues to attack. It may be blocked. If it isn’t blocked, it simply won’t deal combat damage to anything.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If Ulamog’s Crusher can’t attack for any reason (such as becoming tapped or having just entered the battlefield), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having it attack, its controller isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Annihilator abilities trigger and resolve during the declare attackers step. The defending player chooses and sacrifices the required number of permanents before they declare blockers. Any creatures sacrificed this way won’t be able to block.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a creature with annihilator is attacking a planeswalker, and the defending player chooses to sacrifice that planeswalker, the attacking creature continues to attack. It may be blocked. If it isn’t blocked, it simply won’t deal combat damage to anything.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Gideon Jura’s first ability applies during each combat phase of the affected player’s next turn (as opposed to applying during the affected player’s next combat phase). The distinction is relevant if there are no combat phases during that turn (due to Fatespinner’s effect, for example) or there are multiples (due to World at War, for example).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Gideon Jura’s first ability causes creatures to attack him if able. If, during the affected player’s declare attackers step, a creature they control is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, or is affected by “summoning sickness,” then that creature doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having a creature attack, the player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so the creature doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Gideon Jura’s first ability doesn’t lock in what it applies to. That’s because the effect states a true thing about a set of creatures, but doesn’t actually change the characteristics of those creatures. As a result, whatever creatures the targeted opponent controls during the declare attackers step of their next turn must attack Gideon Jura if able. This includes creatures that come under that player’s control after the ability has resolved and creatures that have lost all abilities.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Gideon Jura’s third ability causes him to become a creature with the creature types Human Soldier. He remains a planeswalker with the planeswalker type Gideon. (He also retains any other card types or subtypes he may have had.) Each subtype is correlated to the proper card type: Gideon is just a planeswalker type (not a creature type), and Human and Soldier are just creature types (not planeswalker types).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If Gideon Jura becomes a creature due to his third ability, that doesn’t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. Gideon Jura was already on the battlefield; he only changed his types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If Gideon Jura becomes a creature, he may be affected by “summoning sickness.” You can’t attack with him or use any of his {T} abilities (if he gains any) unless he began your most recent turn on the battlefield under your control. Note that summoning sickness cares about when Gideon Jura came under your control, not when he became a creature.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a creature controlled by the affected player can’t attack Gideon Jura (because he’s no longer on the battlefield, for example), that player may have it attack you, another one of your planeswalkers, or nothing at all.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you activate Gideon Jura’s third ability and then unpreventable damage is dealt to him (due to Unstable Footing, for example), that damage has all applicable results: specifically, the damage is marked on Gideon Jura (since he’s a creature) and that damage causes that many loyalty counters to be removed from him (since he’s a planeswalker). If the total amount of damage marked on Gideon Jura is lethal damage, he’s destroyed as a state-based action. If Gideon Jura has no loyalty counters on him, he’s put into his owner’s graveyard as a state-based action.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Say you activate Gideon Jura’s third ability, then an opponent gains control of him before combat. You may have any of your creatures attack Gideon Jura (since he’s still a planeswalker). Then Gideon Jura may block (since he’s a creature). He may block any eligible attacking creature, including one that’s attacking him! During combat, he behaves as an attacked planeswalker and/or a blocking creature, as appropriate. For example, he deals combat damage to any creatures he’s blocking, but he doesn’t deal combat damage to any unblocked creatures that are attacking him.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'The first ability only affects the declaration of attackers. If a creature is put onto the battlefield attacking (thanks to Hero of Bladehold, Preeminent Captain, or the Ninjutsu ability, for example), that creature’s controller may choose the defending player or planeswalker that it will be attacking in the normal way.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell or ability targets you, but not a permanent you control, you can’t cast Not of This World targeting it.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Not of This World doesn’t check whether the targets of the spell or ability it’s targeting are currently legal for that spell or ability, only who controls them and what their power is. For example, say a player casts Forked Bolt targeting you and a creature you control. If, in response, another spell or ability causes that creature to gain shroud, then you can still cast Not of This World targeting Forked Bolt.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Not of This World’s first ability checks the current state of the targets of the spell or ability it’s targeting to determine whether one of them is a permanent you control. For example, say a player casts Forked Bolt targeting you and a creature you control. If, in response, another spell or ability causes that creature to no longer be under your control, then you can’t cast Not of This World targeting Forked Bolt. Alternately, if you cast Not of This World targeting Forked Bolt and, in response, another spell or ability causes that creature to no longer be under your control, Not of This World won’t resolve when it tries to resolve for having an illegal target.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Not of This World’s second ability checks the current state of the targets of the spell or ability it’s targeting to determine whether one of them is a creature you control with power 7 or greater. This check is made as you cast Not of This World, before you activate mana abilities. It doesn’t matter what the power of the creature was at the time the targeted spell or ability was cast.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The spell or ability you target with Not of This World may have any number of targets, as long as one of them is a permanent you control.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': "You divide the damage as you put Inferno Titan\'s triggered ability on the stack, not as it resolves. Each target must be assigned at least 1 damage. (In other words, as you put the ability on the stack, you choose whether to have it deal 3 damage to a single target, 2 damage to one target and 1 damage to another target, or 1 damage to each of three targets.)"}]', "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If you choose to find only one basic land card, you put it onto the battlefield tapped.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If Steel Hellkite\'s third ability is activated with X equal to 0, it will destroy each nonland permanent with mana value 0 the appropriate players control."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If a nonland permanent has no mana symbols in its upper right corner (because it\'s a token that\'s not copying of something else, for example), its mana value is 0."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If a permanent is copying something else, its mana value is the mana value of whatever it\'s copying."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'If the mana cost of a permanent includes {X}, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'In all cases, ignore any alternative costs or additional costs (such as kicker) paid when the permanent was cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "It doesn\'t matter who controlled those permanents at the time Steel Hellkite dealt combat damage, or if those permanents were even on the battlefield at that time."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "Steel Hellkite\'s last ability destroys only nonland permanents whose mana value is exactly equal to X, and only those controlled by players who have been dealt combat damage by Steel Hellkite this turn."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "The mana value of a permanent is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner, unless it\'s copying something else (see below). The mana value is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {3}{U}{U} has mana value 5."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "You may activate the last ability even if Steel Hellkite hasn\'t dealt combat damage to any players that turn. If you do, the ability won\'t do anything."}]', "[{'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'If all Equipment attached to Sunspear Shikari somehow becomes unequipped after it deals combat damage in the first combat damage step, it won’t assign combat damage in the second combat damage step.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'Players can lose more life than they have. For example, say you’re playing a multiplayer game in which one of your opponents has 3 life and your other opponent has 10 life. If you cast Exsanguinate with X of 4, your opponents will wind up at -1 life and 6 life, respectively. You’ll gain 8 life.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'A card with Phyrexian mana symbols in its mana cost is each color that appears in that mana cost, regardless of how that cost may have been paid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'As you cast a spell or activate an activated ability with one or more Phyrexian mana symbols in its cost, you choose how to pay for each Phyrexian mana symbol at the same time you would choose modes or choose a value for X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'If a player attacks with more than one creature, that player chooses how to pay each cost individually. For example, if you attack with two creatures, you may pay {W} for one cost and 2 life for the other.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If you control Norn\'s Annex, your opponents can choose not to attack with a creature with an ability that says it must attack."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If you\'re at 1 life or less, you can\'t pay 2 life."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Multiple Norn\'s Annexes controlled by the same player will each impose a cost to attack. Players choose how they pay each cost individually. For example, if a creature you control is attacking a player who controls two Norn\'s Annexes, you may pay {W} for one cost and 2 life for the other."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Phyrexian mana is not a new color. Players can\'t add Phyrexian mana to their mana pools."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'The controller of each creature attacking you or a planeswalker you control pays either {W} or 2 life as attackers are being declared.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'To calculate the mana value of a card with Phyrexian mana symbols in its cost, count each Phyrexian mana symbol as 1.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If, during a player\'s declare attackers step, a creature is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t attack, or hasn\'t been under that player\'s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn\'t have haste), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature attack, the player isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "It\'s possible for a Champion\'s Helm you control to be attached to a creature an opponent controls (if an opponent gains control of your equipped creature, for example). In this case, the creature couldn\'t be the target of spells or abilities you control, as you are an opponent of the controller of the creature with hexproof."}]', "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Grand Abolisher doesn’t affect triggered abilities or static abilities.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Grand Abolisher doesn’t stop your opponents from activating abilities of artifact, creature, or enchantment cards in zones other than the battlefield (like cycling abilities, for example).'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The card-drawing part of the effect is not optional. A player can’t choose to draw fewer than X cards.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': \'All blocking declarations must still be legal.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature block and you choose for that creature to block, its controller can choose to pay that cost or not. If that player decides to not pay that cost, you must propose a new set of blocking creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "You can decide that a creature won\'t block."}]', "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Each creature controlled by an opponent blocks only if it’s able to do so as the declare blockers step begins. If, at that time, the creature is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t block, or no creatures are attacking that player or a planeswalker controlled by that player, then it doesn’t block. If there’s a cost associated with having the creature block, the player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t block in that case either.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Each creature your opponents control blocks if able, even if that creature wasn’t on the battlefield or wasn’t controlled by an opponent when Predatory Rampage resolved.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Only creatures you control when Predatory Rampage resolves will get +3/+3. Creatures that enter the battlefield or that you gain control of later in the turn are unaffected.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Predatory Rampage doesn’t force any creature to attack.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Your opponent still chooses which attacking creature each creature they control blocks.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The ability counts each Goblin you control, including Krenko itself, not just the tokens it creates.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "For each library, the search is complete only when you explicitly say it is. For example, you can look through one player\'s library, set that library down, look at another player\'s library, choose a nonland card in the first library, then choose a nonland card in the second library. Don\'t reveal any cards from those libraries to any other player until you exile them."}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': \'If a card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as its value.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast a card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, or if you choose not to cast one, it will remain exiled. Jace\'s ability won\'t allow you to cast it later."}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t pay alternative costs such as overload costs. You can pay additional costs such as kicker costs. If the card has mandatory additional costs, you must pay those."}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "Jace\'s first ability creates a delayed triggered ability that triggers whenever a creature an opponent controls attacks. It doesn\'t matter which player or planeswalker that creature is attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': \'Piles can be empty. If one of the piles is empty, you choose to put all the revealed cards in your hand or on the bottom of your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "When casting a card this way, ignore timing restrictions based on the card\'s type. Other timing restrictions, such as “Cast [this card] only during combat,” must be followed."}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "When resolving Jace\'s third ability, you search each player\'s library (including yours) and exile the nonland cards before casting any of them."}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': \'You cast the cards by putting them on the stack one at a time, choosing modes, targets, and so on. The last card you cast will be the first one to resolve.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "You pick one of your opponents when Jace\'s second ability resolves. The ability doesn\'t target that opponent. All players may see the revealed cards and offer opinions. You (not your opponent) choose which pile is put into your hand and which pile is put on the bottom of your library."}]', "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'All Rats you control have deathtouch while Ogre Slumlord is on the battlefield, not just the ones created by Ogre Slumlord.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If the spell being copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Debt to the Deathless has), the copy has the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If the spell being copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. You can’t choose a different one.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If the top card of your library changes while you’re casting a spell, playing a land, or activating an ability, the new top card won’t be revealed until you finish doing so.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Instant and sorcery cards with miracle allow a player to cast a card immediately upon drawing it. If you cast a spell this way, you’re casting it from your hand, not your library. Melek’s ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Melek doesn’t affect the timing rules associated with when you can cast the card. If it’s a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Melek’s last ability will copy any instant or sorcery spell you cast from your library, not just one with targets.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The top card of your library isn’t in your hand, so you can’t suspend it, cycle it, discard it, or activate any of its activated abilities.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'When playing with the top card of your library revealed, if an effect tells you to draw several cards, reveal each one before you draw it.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'When the last ability resolves, it creates a copy of the spell. You control the copy. That copy is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger. The copy will then resolve like a normal spell, after players get a chance to cast spells and activate abilities.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You still pay all costs for that spell, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs, such as overload costs. Although you can’t pay additional costs for the copy that’s created, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too. For example, if a player sacrifices a 3/3 creature to cast Fling, and you copy it, the copy of Fling will also deal 3 damage to its target.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If this land enters the battlefield and you control no other lands, its ability will force you to return it to your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Verdeloth won’t give himself +1/+1 unless he somehow becomes a Saproling.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like flying, having more than one instance of the ability doesn\'t provide any additional benefit."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "If the creature type of a Sliver changes so it\'s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures."}]', "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like flying, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If Blur Sliver leaves the battlefield during combat, any attacking Sliver creatures that came under your control this turn will continue to attack, even though they will no longer have haste.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If you change the creature type of a Sliver you control so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like flying, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If Bonescythe Sliver leaves the battlefield after other Sliver creatures you control have dealt first-strike damage but before regular combat damage, those Slivers won’t deal regular combat damage (unless they still have double strike for some other reason).'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If you change the creature type of a Sliver you control so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like flying, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If Striking Sliver leaves the battlefield after Sliver creatures you control have dealt first-strike damage but before regular combat damage, those Slivers won’t deal regular combat damage (unless they have double strike for some reason).'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If you change the creature type of a Sliver you control so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like flying, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the creature type of a Sliver changes so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a Sliver may become lethal if Might Sliver leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': \'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like flying, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': \'If the creature type of a Sliver changes so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a Sliver may become lethal if Sinew Sliver leaves the battlefield during that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Sinew Sliver\'s ability does give itself +1/+1."}]', "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like flying, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the creature type of a Sliver changes so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The ability Harmonic Sliver grants itself triggers when it enters the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The controller of the Sliver that enters the battlefield controls the triggered ability for that Sliver and chooses what to destroy, not necessarily the controller of Harmonic Sliver.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like flying, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the creature type of a Sliver changes so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like flying, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If you change the creature type of a Sliver you control so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the creature type of a Sliver changes so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Multiple instances of menace on the same creature are redundant.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Scry appears on some spells and abilities with one or more targets. If all of the spell or ability\'s targets are illegal when it tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t scry."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "The loss of life is part of the spell\'s effect. It\'s not an additional cost. If Read the Bones doesn\'t resolve, you won\'t lose life."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'When you scry, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards on the bottom of your library, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them on the bottom.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'You choose how to order cards returned to your library after scrying no matter where you put them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, that means you\'ll scry last. For others, that means you\'ll scry and then perform other actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Scry appears on some spells and abilities with one or more targets. If all of the spell or ability\'s targets are illegal when it tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t scry."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'When you scry, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards on the bottom of your library, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them on the bottom.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'You choose how to order cards returned to your library after scrying no matter where you put them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, that means you\'ll scry last. For others, that means you\'ll scry and then perform other actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it\'s still on the battlefield at that time."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don\'t count toward your devotion to any color."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Numeric mana symbols ({0}, {1}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don\'t count toward your devotion to any color."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "As a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color will determine whether any replacement effects that affect creatures entering the battlefield apply to that God. Because replacement effects are considered before the God is on the battlefield, the mana symbols in its mana cost won\'t be counted when determining this."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Counters put on a God remain on it while it\'s not a creature, even if they have no effect."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If a God is attacking or blocking and it stops being a creature, it will be removed from combat. It won\'t rejoin combat if it resumes being a creature later during that combat."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If a God stops being a creature, it loses the type creature and the creature type God. It continues to be a legendary enchantment.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If an effect causes a God to lose all abilities, its ability that causes it to stop being a creature still applies if appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "The abilities of Gods function as long as they\'re on the battlefield, regardless of whether they\'re creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "The type-changing ability that can make a God not be a creature functions only on the battlefield. It\'s always a creature card in other zones, regardless of your devotion to its color. It\'s always a creature spell while it\'s on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'When a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color (including the mana symbols in the mana cost of the God itself) will determine if a creature entered the battlefield or not for abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield.\'}]', "[{'date': '2013-09-20', 'text': 'If a turn has multiple combat phases, the ability can only be activated before the beginning of the declare attackers step of the first combat phase in that turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-10-17', 'text': 'After each opponent has decided, the effect happens simultaneously for each one who accepted the offer. Then, the effect happens again for you a number of times equal to the number of opponents who accepted.'}, {'date': '2013-10-17', 'text': 'Your opponents decide in turn order whether or not they accept the offer, starting with the opponent on your left. Each opponent will know the decisions of previous opponents in turn order when making their decision.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-10-17\', \'text\': \'Darksteel Mutation causes the enchanted creature to lose all abilities except indestructible at the time it becomes enchanted. Any abilities the creature gains after that point will work normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-10-17\', \'text\': "Darksteel Mutation doesn\'t affect the enchanted creature\'s colors, if any. It will continue to be whatever color or colors it was before Darksteel Mutation entered the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2013-10-17\', \'text\': "Darksteel Mutation overwrites any previous effects that set the enchanted creature\'s power or toughness to a specific value. Any such effects that start to apply after Darksteel Mutation entered the battlefield will work normally."}, {\'date\': \'2013-10-17\', \'text\': \'Darksteel Mutation overwrites the printed power and toughness of the enchanted creature, as well as any characteristic-defining abilities that define power and/or toughness.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-10-17\', \'text\': "However, Darksteel Mutation does not overwrite effects that change the enchanted creature\'s power or toughness without setting it to a specific value (such as the ones created by Giant Growth or Glorious Anthem). It also won\'t overwrite the effect of counters."}, {\'date\': \'2013-10-17\', \'text\': "In some rare cases, the creature may have subtypes other than creature types before becoming enchanted with Darksteel Mutation. If it had any other artifact subtypes (such as Equipment), it will retain those. If it had any subtypes other than artifact types and creature types (such as Shrine), it won\'t retain those."}, {\'date\': \'2013-10-17\', \'text\': "The creature will keep any supertypes it previously had. Notably, if Darksteel Mutation is enchanting a legendary creature, that creature will continue to be legendary. Also, if it\'s enchanting a commander, that creature will continue to be a commander."}, {\'date\': \'2013-10-17\', \'text\': \'The enchanted creature will be only an artifact and a creature, not any other card types. It will be only an Insect, not any other creature types.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-02-01\', \'text\': "The defending player may block Tromokratis with each creature they control. If that player can\'t, perhaps because one of those creatures is tapped, or chooses not to, Tromokratis can\'t be blocked."}, {\'date\': \'2014-02-01\', \'text\': \'Tromokratis (like all attacking and blocking creatures) remains an attacking or blocking creature until the end of combat step is over. Notably, it will still be an attacking or blocking creature during the combat damage step, so any abilities an opponent controls that trigger when a creature dies as a result of combat damage could target Tromokratis.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'A constellation ability triggers whenever an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. Enchantments with other card types, such as enchantment creatures, will also cause constellation abilities to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "An Aura spell without bestow that has an illegal target when it tries to resolve won\'t resolve and will be put into its owner\'s graveyard. It won\'t enter the battlefield and constellation abilities won\'t trigger. An Aura spell with bestow won\'t be countered this way. It will revert to being an enchantment creature and resolve, entering the battlefield and triggering constellation abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'When an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, each constellation ability of permanents you control will trigger. You can put these abilities on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'Because the votes are cast in turn order, each player will know the votes of players who voted beforehand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'If Custodi Squire is not on the battlefield when its ability resolves, the vote will still take place and the card(s) that had the most votes will still be returned to your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'No player votes until the spell or ability resolves. Any responses to that spell or ability must be made without knowing the outcome of the vote.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "Players can\'t do anything after they finishing voting but before the spell or ability that included the vote finishes resolving."}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "The phrase “the vote is tied” refers only to when there is more than one choice that received the most votes. For example, if a 5-player vote from among three different choices ends 3 votes to 1 vote to 1 vote, the vote isn\'t tied."}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "You must vote for one of the available options. You can\'t abstain."}, {\'date\': \'2017-06-13\', \'text\': "If a choice has no votes, it can\'t have the most votes. If all choices have zero votes, the voting ability has no effect."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'In a Two-Headed Giant game, dethrone will trigger if the creature attacks either player on the team with the most life or tied for the most life.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "Once dethrone triggers, it doesn\'t matter what happens to the players\' life totals before the ability resolves. You\'ll put a +1/+1 counter on the creature even if the defending player doesn\'t have the most life as the ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'Scourge of the Throne\\\'s ability has an intervening "if" clause. It must be attacking the player with the most life or tied with the most life both when it\\\'s declared as an attacker and as it starts to resolve for it to have any effect. If, at either time, the player isn\\\'t the one with the most life or tied for the most life, the ability will have no effect. Notably, this is different than how dethrone works. (Dethrone checks only once to see if the ability triggers.)\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'The +1/+1 counter is put on the creature before blockers are declared.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "Dethrone doesn\'t trigger if the creature attacks a planeswalker, even if its controller has the most life. The same is true if the creature attacks a battle, even if its protector has the most life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "Exiling the Soul from your graveyard is part of the last ability\'s activation cost. A player can\'t remove the Soul in response to prevent you from activating the ability."}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': \'You can activate the last ability only if the Soul is in your graveyard.\'}]', "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like indestructible and the ability granted by Belligerent Sliver, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners’ graveyards (unless they’re Theros block cards with the bestow ability). Equipment attached to the exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Constricting Sliver gives Slivers you control an ability that causes a zone change with a duration, a newer style of ability that’s somewhat reminiscent of older cards like Oblivion Ring. However, unlike Oblivion Ring’s abilities, this ability creates two one-shot effects: one that exiles the creature when the ability resolves, and another that returns the exiled card to the battlefield immediately after the Sliver leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If a Sliver leaves the battlefield before its enters-the-battlefield ability resolves, the target creature won’t be exiled.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If a Sliver you control leaves the battlefield, only the card that particular Sliver exiled will return to the battlefield. Each card exiled by another Sliver will remain exiled until that Sliver leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If a creature token is exiled, it ceases to exist. It won’t be returned to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If you change the creature type of a Sliver you control so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures you control.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if the Sliver’s owner leaves the game, the exiled card will return to the battlefield. Because the one-shot effect that returns the card isn’t an ability that goes on the stack, it won’t cease to exist along with the leaving player’s spells and abilities on the stack.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Slivers in this set affect only Sliver creatures you control. They don’t grant bonuses to your opponents’ Slivers. This is the same way Slivers from the Magic 2014 core set worked, while Slivers in earlier sets granted bonuses to all Slivers.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The Sliver that enters the battlefield is the source of the ability that exiles the creature. For example, if a blue Sliver enters the battlefield under your control, the ability can target and exile a creature with protection from white.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The exiled card returns to the battlefield immediately after the Sliver leaves the battlefield. Nothing happens between the two events, including state-based actions. The two creatures aren’t on the battlefield at the same time. For example, if the returning creature is a Mercurial Pretender, it can’t enter the battlefield as a copy of the Sliver.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The exiled card will return even if the Sliver whose ability exiled it doesn’t have that ability at the time (perhaps because Constricting Sliver is no longer on the battlefield).'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The exiled card will return to the battlefield under its owner’s control.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'When Constricting Sliver enters the battlefield, the ability it gives itself will trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like indestructible and the ability granted by Belligerent Sliver, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Damage dealt to a Sliver with indestructible is still marked on that creature. If it has lethal damage marked on it and it loses indestructible (perhaps because Sliver Hivelord leaves the battlefield), it will be destroyed.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If you change the creature type of a Sliver you control so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures you control.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Slivers in this set affect only Sliver creatures you control. They don’t grant bonuses to your opponents’ Slivers. This is the same way Slivers from the Magic 2014 core set worked, while Slivers in earlier sets granted bonuses to all Slivers.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like indestructible and the ability granted by Belligerent Sliver, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If you change the creature type of a Sliver you control so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures you control.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Slivers in this set affect only Sliver creatures you control. They don’t grant bonuses to your opponents’ Slivers. This is the same way Slivers from the Magic 2014 core set worked, while Slivers in earlier sets granted bonuses to all Slivers.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The granted ability applies to any spell (including Aura spells), activated ability, or triggered ability that’s controlled by an opponent that targets a Sliver you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like indestructible and the ability granted by Belligerent Sliver, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If you change the creature type of a Sliver you control so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures you control.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Slivers in this set affect only Sliver creatures you control. They don’t grant bonuses to your opponents’ Slivers. This is the same way Slivers from the Magic 2014 core set worked, while Slivers in earlier sets granted bonuses to all Slivers.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'After the last ability resolves, you’ll essentially be able to activate a loyalty ability of each planeswalker you control a total of twice during your turn. The timing rules for when you can activate loyalty abilities apply each time; it must be your main phase and the stack must be empty.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Because the last ability modifies the rules of the game, it affects not only planeswalkers you control when it resolves, but also planeswalkers that come under your control later in the turn.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Each additional time The Chain Veil’s last ability resolves will allow you to activate a loyalty ability of each planeswalker you control an additional time. For example, if you activate The Chain Veil’s last ability, untap it, then activate it again, you can activate a loyalty ability of a planeswalker you control three times that turn.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'For the first ability, it doesn’t matter whether the planeswalker is still on the battlefield as your end step begins. If you activated one of its loyalty abilities that turn, The Chain Veil’s triggered ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The second loyalty ability you activate doesn’t have to be the same as the first ability. For example, you could activate a planeswalker’s first ability twice, or you could activate a planeswalker’s first ability, then activate its second ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Each attacking creature is a separate source of damage. For example, if two 3/3 creatures attack you and are unblocked, the emblem will prevent 2 damage from each creature. You’ll be dealt a total of 2 damage.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If a permanent you control is both a creature and a planeswalker, Ajani’s second ability will put both a +1/+1 counter and a loyalty counter on it.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If multiple effects modify how damage is dealt, the player being dealt damage or the controller of the permanent being dealt damage chooses the order to apply the effects. For example, Dictate of the Twin Gods says, “If a source would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals double that damage to that permanent or player instead.” Suppose you would be dealt 3 damage while Dictate of the Twin Gods is on the battlefield and you control Ajani’s emblem. You can either (a) prevent all but 1 damage first and then let Dictate of the Twin Gods’s effect double that, for a result of being dealt 2 damage, or (b) double the damage to 6 and then prevent all but 1 of that damage.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The emblem’s ability doesn’t consider who controls the source dealing damage to you or a planeswalker you control.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'You may activate the first ability with no targets. If you do, you simply put a loyalty counter on Ajani to pay the cost of the ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If Yisan isn’t on the battlefield when its ability resolves, use the number of verse counters on it when it left the battlefield to determine which creature cards may be put onto the battlefield. This number will include the counter you put on Yisan to activate the ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Any exiled cards you don’t cast remain in exile.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Because you’re already casting the card using an alternative cost (by casting it without paying its mana cost), you can’t pay any other alternative costs for the card, including casting it face down using the morph ability. You can pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value for X when casting it.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The cards are exiled face up. Casting the noncreature cards exiled this way follows the normal rules for casting those cards. You must follow all applicable timing rules. For example, if one of the exiled cards is a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You can’t play any land cards exiled with Narset.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Any instruction, including Sidisi’s first ability, that tells you to put multiple cards from a library into a graveyard moves all the cards at the same time. For example, if Sidisi enters the battlefield and you put three creature cards into your graveyard, Sidisi’s last ability will trigger once and you’ll put one Zombie token onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Sidisi’s last ability triggers any time creature cards are put into your graveyard from anywhere in your library, not just from the top.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Count the number of colorless creatures you control (including face-down creatures) as the last ability resolves to determine how much life you gain.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'Several creatures with outlast also grant an ability to creatures you control with +1/+1 counters on them, including themselves. These counters could come from an outlast ability, but any +1/+1 counter on the creature will count.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "The cost to activate a creature\'s outlast ability includes the tap symbol ({T}). A creature\'s outlast ability can\'t be activated unless that creature has been under your control continuously since the beginning of your turn."}]', "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Several creatures with outlast also grant an ability to creatures you control with +1/+1 counters on them, including themselves. These counters could come from an outlast ability, but any +1/+1 counter on the creature will count.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The cost to activate a creature’s outlast ability includes the tap symbol ({T}). A creature’s outlast ability can’t be activated unless that creature has been under your control continuously since the beginning of your turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "If an effect instructs you to sacrifice a creature, and you control any creatures other than the creature equipped with Assault Suit, you must sacrifice one of them. You can\'t try to sacrifice the equipped creature, fail, and therefore ignore the effect."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "The equipped creature can\'t be sacrificed for any reason. If an effect instructs you to sacrifice it, you can\'t and it remains on the battlefield. You also can\'t sacrifice it to pay a cost that requires you to sacrifice a creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "You must choose six different legal targets in order to cast Aether Gale. If some, but not all, of those targets become illegal before Aether Gale resolves, the remaining legal targets will be put into their owners\' hands."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "“Exiled this way” refers to the exile instruction that\'s part of the ability\'s effect. If the cards each player would put into their graveyard are exiled because of a replacement effect, those cards won\'t be in the graveyards to be exiled by the next part of the ability. In this case, the value of X will be 0. You\'ll put a 0/0 token onto the battlefield, then that token will die and subsequently cease to exist (unless something else raises its toughness above 0)."}]', "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'After the second ability resolves, continuous effects generated by the resolution of spells and abilities that would give hexproof or shroud to one of the affected creatures aren’t created. For example, after the second ability resolves, a spell cast by an opponent that gives creatures they control hexproof wouldn’t cause the creatures to have hexproof. (If that spell has additional effects, such as raising the power of the creatures, those effects will apply as normal.)'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'Continuous effects generated by static abilities (such as an Aura that grants hexproof to a creature) will not apply during the turn, but will resume applying once the turn ends.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'The second ability applies only to creatures controlled by your opponents when it resolves. Creatures that enter the battlefield or come under an opponent’s control later in the turn won’t be affected.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If a triggered ability granted by a lieutenant ability triggers, and in response to that trigger you lose control of your commander (causing the lieutenant to lose that ability), that triggered ability will still resolve.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If you gain control of a creature with a lieutenant ability owned by another player, that ability will check to see if you control your commander and will apply if you do. It won’t check whether its owner controls their commander.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If you lose control of your commander, lieutenant abilities of creatures you control will immediately stop applying. If this causes a creature’s toughness to become less than or equal to the amount of damage marked on it, the creature will be destroyed.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'Lieutenant abilities apply only if your commander is on the battlefield and under your control.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'Lieutenant abilities refer only to whether you control your commander, not any other player’s commander.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If the permanent was an Aura or an Equipment, it becomes unattached from whatever it was attached to.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'The enchanted permanent loses any card types, subtypes, and colors it previously had. It keeps any supertypes it had and its name remains unchanged. It gains “{T}: Add {G}” and loses all other abilities from its rules text. It will still have any abilities it gained from other effects.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If you control Teferi’s emblem, the rule that says you can activate a loyalty ability only if none of that permanent’s loyalty abilities have been activated that turn still applies. In other words, you could activate a planeswalker’s loyalty ability once on your turn and once on each of your opponents’ turns.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If you control The Chain Veil (from the Magic 2015 core set) and its activated ability has resolved, and you also control Teferi’s emblem, for each planeswalker you control, you can activate one of its loyalty abilities during that turn any time you could cast an instant, and then you may activate a loyalty ability again that turn (choosing the same loyalty ability or a different one) any time you could cast an instant.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'The ability of Daretti’s emblem will return the artifact card only if it’s still in your graveyard when the delayed triggered ability resolves at the beginning of the next end step. If the artifact card left your graveyard before that point (even if it was put back into your graveyard), the ability won’t return it to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'You choose which artifact to sacrifice as the second ability resolves. You must sacrifice an artifact if you control at least one at that time. For example, if you control two artifacts when you activate the second ability, but the artifact you intended to sacrifice is destroyed in response, you must sacrifice the other artifact as the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'You may choose to discard zero cards as the first ability resolves. In that case, you won’t draw any cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'The delayed triggered ability that makes you sacrifice the creatures will trigger only once. If you don’t sacrifice one or more of those creatures at that time (perhaps because another player gained control of them), the ability won’t try to make you sacrifice them on future turns.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'Use Lifeblood Hydra’s power when it died (including any +1/+1 counters it had) to determine how much life to gain and how many cards to draw.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren\'t affected."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Any time you have priority, you may turn a manifested creature face up by revealing that it\'s a creature card (ignoring any copy effects or type-changing effects that might be applying to it) and paying its mana cost. This is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "At any time, you can look at a face-down permanent you control. You can\'t look at face-down permanents you don\'t control unless an effect allows you to or instructs you to."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Because face-down creatures don\'t have names, they can\'t have the same name as any other creature, even another face-down creature."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it\'s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn\'t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "If a double-faced card is manifested, it will be put onto the battlefield face down. While face down, it can\'t transform. If the front face of the card is a creature card, you can turn it face up by paying its mana cost. If you do, its front face will be up."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'If a face-down permanent you control leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'If a manifested creature would have morph if it were face up, you may also turn it face up by paying its morph cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "The face-down permanent is a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It\'s colorless and has a mana value of 0. Other effects that apply to the permanent can still grant or change any of these characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "There are no cards in the Fate Reforged set that would turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, but some older cards can try to do this. If something tries to turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, reveal that card to show all players it\'s an instant or sorcery card. The permanent remains on the battlefield face down. Abilities that trigger when a permanent turns face up won\'t trigger, because even though you revealed the card, it never turned face up."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Turning a permanent face up or face down doesn\'t change whether that permanent is tapped or untapped."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Unlike a face-down creature that was cast using the morph ability, a manifested creature may still be turned face up after it loses its abilities if it\'s a creature card."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You\'re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for indicating this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield. You must also track how each became face down (manifested, cast face down using the morph ability, and so on)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Bolster itself doesn\'t target any creature, though some spells and abilities that bolster may have other effects that target creatures. For example, you could put counters on a creature with protection from white with Abzan Skycaptain\'s bolster ability."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'You determine which creature to put counters on as the spell or ability that instructs you to bolster resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "The triggered ability will trigger when one of the Gods from Theros block enters the battlefield only if your devotion is high enough that it\'s a creature when it enters. If Hero\'s Blade is attached to a God that stops being a creature (or any creature that stops being a creature), it will become unattached."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the legendary creature that entered the battlefield leaves the battlefield before Hero\'s Blade becomes attached, Hero\'s Blade stays as it was. If it\'s already attached to another creature, it remains attached to that creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "Bolster itself doesn\'t target any creature, though some spells and abilities that bolster may have other effects that target creatures. For example, you could put counters on a creature with protection from white with Aven Tactician\'s bolster ability."}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "You determine which creature to put counters on as the spell or ability that instructs you to bolster resolves. That could be the creature with the bolster ability, if it\'s still under your control and has the least toughness."}]', "[{'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'If you control a creature with power less than 0, use its actual power when calculating the total power of creatures you control. For example, if you control three creatures with powers 4, 5, and -2, the total power of creatures you control is 7.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'Other formidable abilities are triggered abilities with an “intervening ‘if’” clause. Such abilities check the total power of creatures you control twice: once at the appropriate time to see if the ability will trigger, and again as the ability tries to resolve. If, at that time, the total power of creatures you control is no longer 8 or greater, the ability will have no effect.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'Some formidable abilities are activated abilities that require creatures you control to have total power 8 or greater. Once you activate these abilities, it doesn’t matter what happens to the total power of creatures you control.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Activating the second ability of Whirler Rogue after a creature has become blocked won\'t cause it to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "You may tap any two untapped artifacts you control, including artifact creatures that haven\'t been under your control continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn."}]', "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the first ability returns an Aura card to the battlefield, you choose what that Aura will enchant as it enters the battlefield. If the Aura can’t legally enchant anything, it stays in the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Note that if an Aura is returned to the battlefield this way, whatever the Aura enchants isn’t a target of Starfield of Nyx’s ability, nor is it a target of the Aura card itself. You could put an Aura onto the battlefield this way enchanting a creature with hexproof controlled by an opponent, for example.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Any “at the beginning of the next end step” triggered abilities won’t get the chance to trigger that turn because the end step is skipped. Those abilities will trigger at the beginning of the end step of the next turn. The same is true of abilities that trigger at the beginning of other phases or steps.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Ending the turn this way means the following things happen in order: 1) All spells and abilities on the stack are exiled. This includes spells and abilities that can’t be countered. 2) If there are any attacking and blocking creatures, they’re removed from combat. 3) State-based actions are checked. No player gets priority, and no triggered abilities are put onto the stack. 4) The current phase and/or step ends. The game skips straight to the cleanup step. 5) The cleanup step happens in its entirety.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If any triggered abilities do trigger during the process of ending the turn, they’re put onto the stack during the cleanup step. If this happens, players will have a chance to cast spells and activate abilities, then there will be another cleanup step before the turn ends.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If both your hand and graveyard are empty as Day’s Undoing starts resolving, you’ll still shuffle your library before drawing seven cards.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Though other spells and abilities that are exiled won’t get a chance to resolve, they don’t count as being countered.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If any abilities trigger while players are shuffling cards into their library or drawing seven cards, those abilities cease to exist when the turn ends. They won’t be put on the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Check to see if there are two or more instant and/or sorcery cards in your graveyard as the spell resolves to determine whether the spell mastery ability applies. The spell itself won’t count because it’s still on the stack as you make this check.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the creature becomes an illegal target by the time Ravaging Blaze tries to resolve, Ravaging Blaze won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No damage will be dealt to the creature or its controller.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Ravaging Blaze targets only the creature. It doesn’t target any player, even if the spell mastery ability applies.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Herald of the Pantheon can reduce alternative costs such as bestow costs.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Herald of the Pantheon’s first ability can’t reduce the colored mana requirement of an enchantment spell.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If there are additional costs to cast an enchantment spell, apply those before applying cost reductions.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If enough -1/-1 counters are put on Hangarback Walker at the same time to make its toughness 0 or less, the number of +1/+1 counters on it before it got any -1/-1 counters will be used to determine how many Thopter tokens you get. For example, if there are three +1/+1 counters on Hangarback Walker and it gets four -1/-1 counters, you’ll get three Thopter tokens. That’s because Hangarback Walker’s triggered ability checks the creature’s existence just before it leaves the battlefield, and it still has all those counters on it at that point.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The value of each X in Hangarback Walker’s mana cost must be equal. For example, if X is 2, you’ll pay {4} to cast Hangarback Walker and it will enter the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Cards that are face down in exile have no characteristics. Such cards can\'t be put onto the battlefield with Oblivion Sower\'s ability."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Oblivion Sower\'s ability allows you to put any land cards the player owns from exile onto the battlefield, regardless of how those cards were exiled."}]', "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards exiled by Ulamog’s first and third abilities are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the player has less than twenty cards in their library, exile all of them. That player won’t lose the game until they have to draw a card from an empty library.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Ulamog’s first ability resolves independently of Ulamog once they’ve both been put on the stack. If Ulamog is countered, that triggered ability will still resolve. That triggered ability will always resolve before Ulamog does.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Check the target creature’s power as Titan’s Presence resolves to see if it’s less than or equal to revealed creature card’s power. If it’s greater, Titan’s Presence will finish resolving with no effect.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The colorless creature card stays revealed until Titan’s Presence leaves the stack.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The colorless creature card you reveal doesn’t have to still be in your hand as Titan’s Presence resolves. If it’s not, use its power as it last existed in your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Eldrazi Scions are similar to Eldrazi Spawn, seen in the Zendikar block. Note that Eldrazi Scions are 1/1, not 0/1.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Eldrazi and Scion are each separate creature types. Anything that affects Eldrazi will affect these tokens, for example.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Sacrificing an Eldrazi Scion creature token to add {C} to your mana pool is a mana ability. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Some instants and sorceries that create Eldrazi Scions require targets. If all targets for such a spell have become illegal by the time that spell tries to resolve, the spell won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t get any Eldrazi Scions.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'Even though these lands have basic land types, they are not basic lands because "basic" doesn\\\'t appear on their type line. Notably, controlling two or more of them won\\\'t allow others to enter the battlefield untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'However, because these cards have basic land types, effects that specify a basic land type without also specifying that the land be basic can affect them. For example, a spell or ability that reads "Destroy target Forest" can target Canopy Vista, while one that reads "Destroy target basic Forest" cannot.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'If one of these lands enters the battlefield at the same time as any number of basic lands, those other lands are not counted when determining if this land enters the battlefield tapped or untapped.\'}]', "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If Bane of Bala Ged attacks a planeswalker, the defending player may exile that planeswalker. Bane of Bala Ged will still be attacking and may be blocked as normal. If it’s not blocked, it won’t deal combat damage.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the defending player controls only one permanent, that permanent will be exiled.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The permanents are exiled before blockers are chosen.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "Auras attached to exiled nonland permanents will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Equipment attached to exiled creatures will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on exiled nonland permanents will cease to exist."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'If Grasp of Fate leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, no nonland permanents will be exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled, it ceases to exist. It won\'t be returned to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if Grasp of Fate\'s owner leaves the game, the exiled cards will return to the battlefield. Because the one-shot effect that returns the cards isn\'t an ability that goes on the stack, it won\'t cease to exist along with the leaving player\'s spells and abilities on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'The exiled cards return to the battlefield immediately after Grasp of Fate leaves the battlefield. Nothing happens between the two events, including state-based actions.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "If a Confluence is copied, the effect that creates the copy will usually allow you to choose new targets, but you can\'t choose new modes."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "If a mode requires a target, you can select that mode only if there\'s a legal target available. Ignore the targeting requirements for modes you don\'t choose. Each time you select that mode, you can choose a different target, or you can choose the same target."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "If all targets for the chosen modes become illegal before the Confluence resolves, the spell won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. If at least one target is still legal, the spell will resolve but will have no effect on any illegal targets."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'If the first or second modes are chosen multiple times, each of those modes represents a separate damage-dealing event. For example, if your opponent casts Fiery Confluence choosing the second mode three times, and you control Guardian Seraph (a creature with the ability "If a source an opponent controls would deal damage to you, prevent 1 of that damage"), you\\\'ll be dealt a total of 3 damage.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'No matter which combination of modes you choose, you always follow the instructions of a Confluence in the order they are written. If the same mode is chosen more than once, you choose their relative order as you cast the spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'No player can cast spells or activate abilities in between the modes of a resolving spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "You choose the modes as you cast the spell. Once modes are chosen, they can\'t be changed."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "If no player controls more lands than you do, you\'ll still search and shuffle your library, although you can\'t find any cards."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined as Oreskos Explorer\'s triggered ability resolves."}]', "[{'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If a Confluence is copied, the effect that creates the copy will usually allow you to choose new targets, but you can’t choose new modes.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If a mode requires a target, you can select that mode only if there’s a legal target available. Ignore the targeting requirements for modes you don’t choose. Each time you select that mode, you can choose a different target, or you can choose the same target.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If all targets for the chosen modes become illegal before the Confluence resolves, the spell won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. If at least one target is still legal, the spell will resolve but will have no effect on any illegal targets.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'No matter which combination of modes you choose, you always follow the instructions of a Confluence in the order they are written. If the same mode is chosen more than once, you choose their relative order as you cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'No player can cast spells or activate abilities in between the modes of a resolving spell.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'You choose the modes as you cast the spell. Once modes are chosen, they can’t be changed.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'All experience counters are identical, no matter how you got them. For example, the last ability will count experience counters that you got from the first ability, from another ability, from proliferating, and so on.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'Each game pack includes a card labeled “Experience” with the suggestion “Place your experience counters here.” This card isn’t required for play. It’s simply a convenient spot to put your experience counters, which can be represented with dice, glass beads, or other small items.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'Experience counters are the second kind of counters a player can have, joining poison.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If Meren of Clan Nel Toth leaves the battlefield at the same time as other creatures you control die, its first ability will trigger for each of those creatures.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If a creature card in your graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'You can’t choose to put the creature card into your hand if its mana value is less than or equal to the number of experience counters you have as the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'All experience counters are identical, no matter how you got them. For example, the last ability will count experience counters that you got from the first ability, from another ability, from proliferating, and so on.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'Each game pack includes a card labeled “Experience” with the suggestion “Place your experience counters here.” This card isn’t required for play. It’s simply a convenient spot to put your experience counters, which can be represented with dice, glass beads, or other small items.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'Experience counters are the second kind of counters a player can have, joining poison.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If an instant or sorcery spell you cast has {X} in its mana cost, you choose the value of X before calculating the spell’s total cost. For example, if that spell’s mana cost is {X}{R} and you have one experience counter, you could choose 5 as the value of X and pay {4}{R} to cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If there are additional costs to cast a spell, or if the cost to cast a spell is increased by an effect (such as the one created by Thalia, Guardian of Thraben’s ability), apply those increases before applying cost reductions.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'Mizzix’s last ability can’t reduce the amount of colored mana you pay for a spell. It reduces only the generic component of that cost.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'Mizzix’s last ability doesn’t change the mana cost or converted mana cost of any spell. It changes only the total cost you pay.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'The cost reduction can apply to alternative costs such as flashback costs.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'You finish casting a spell, including paying its costs, before Mizzix’s first ability triggers. The ability that gives you the experience counter will resolve before the spell that caused it to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'Although the tokens enter the battlefield attacking, they were never declared as attackers. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks won’t trigger, including the myriad ability of the tokens. If there any costs to have a creature attack, those costs won’t apply to the tokens.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the copied creature will also work.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'Each token copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing else. It doesn’t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If myriad creates more than one token for any given player (due to an effect such as the one Doubling Season creates), you may choose separately for each token whether it’s attacking the player or a planeswalker they control.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If the defending player is your only opponent, no tokens are put onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'The term “defending player” in the myriad rules (or any other ability of an attacking creature) refers to the player the creature with myriad was attacking at the time it became an attacking creature this combat, or the controller of the planeswalker the creature was attacking at the time it became an attacking creature this combat.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'The token creatures all enter the battlefield at the same time.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'The tokens created by the myriad ability enter the battlefield tapped even though they’ll have vigilance.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'You choose whether each token is attacking the player or a planeswalker they control as the token is created.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'Each of the “fights” happens at the same time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "If Ezuri\'s Predation creates more than one token for any given creature (due to an effect such as the one Doubling Season creates), the extra tokens won\'t fight any creature."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "Players can\'t cast spells or activate any abilities in between the Beasts entering the battlefield and fighting the other creatures. If the Beasts entering the battlefield cause any abilities to trigger, those abilities will be put onto the stack after Ezuri\'s Predation is finished resolving."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'You choose which Beast is fighting which creature an opponent controls.\'}]', "[{'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If a Confluence is copied, the effect that creates the copy will usually allow you to choose new targets, but you can’t choose new modes.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If a mode requires a target, you can select that mode only if there’s a legal target available. Ignore the targeting requirements for modes you don’t choose. Each time you select that mode, you can choose a different target, or you can choose the same target.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If all targets for the chosen modes become illegal before the Confluence resolves, the spell won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. If at least one target is still legal, the spell will resolve but will have no effect on any illegal targets.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If the third mode is chosen multiple times, each of those modes represents a separate life-gaining event. For example, if the third mode is chosen three times, and you control Karlov of the Ghost Council (a creature with the ability “Whenever you gain life, put two +1/+1 counters on Karlov of the Ghost Council.”), Karlov’s ability will trigger three times, for a total of six +1/+1 counters.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'No matter which combination of modes you choose, you always follow the instructions of a Confluence in the order they are written. If the same mode is chosen more than once, you choose their relative order as you cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'No player can cast spells or activate abilities in between the modes of a resolving spell.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'You choose the modes as you cast the spell. Once modes are chosen, they can’t be changed.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If a Confluence is copied, the effect that creates the copy will usually allow you to choose new targets, but you can’t choose new modes.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If a mode requires a target, you can select that mode only if there’s a legal target available. Ignore the targeting requirements for modes you don’t choose. Each time you select that mode, you can choose a different target, or you can choose the same target.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If all targets for the chosen modes become illegal before the Confluence resolves, the spell won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. If at least one target is still legal, the spell will resolve but will have no effect on any illegal targets.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'No matter which combination of modes you choose, you always follow the instructions of a Confluence in the order they are written. If the same mode is chosen more than once, you choose their relative order as you cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'No player can cast spells or activate abilities in between the modes of a resolving spell.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'You choose the modes as you cast the spell. Once modes are chosen, they can’t be changed.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'Like other Equipment, each Equipment with living weapon has an equip cost. You can pay this cost to attach an Equipment to another creature you control. Once the Germ token is no longer equipped, it will be put into your graveyard and subsequently cease to exist, unless another effect raises its toughness above 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "Scytheclaw\'s triggered ability triggers and resolves after combat damage is dealt. For example, if the Germ token deals 1 combat damage to a player with 10 life, combat damage will reduce that player\'s life total to 9. Then Scytheclaw\'s ability will cause the player to lose 5 life, leaving the player at 4."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If the Germ token is destroyed, the Equipment remains on the battlefield as with any other Equipment.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If the living weapon trigger causes two Germs to be created (due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), the Equipment becomes attached to one of them. The other will be put into your graveyard and subsequently cease to exist, unless another effect raises its toughness above 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'The Germ token enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature and the Equipment becomes attached to it before state-based actions would cause the token to die. Abilities that trigger as the token enters the battlefield see that a 0/0 creature entered the battlefield.\'}]', "[{'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'You choose the target player as the ability goes on the stack, but you determine the value of X as that ability resolves. If you target yourself and Corpse Augur is still in the graveyard, its ability will count itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'Activating the second activated ability after a creature has legally been declared as an attacker or blocker won’t change or undo that attack or block.'}, {'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'Endbringer untaps at the same time as the active player’s permanents. You can’t choose to not untap it at that time.'}, {'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'If an effect states that Endbringer doesn’t untap during your untap step, that effect won’t apply during another player’s untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the copied creature will also work.'}, {'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'For Mirrorpool’s last ability, the token copies exactly what’s printed on the original creature and nothing else (unless that creature is copying something else; see below). It doesn’t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on.'}, {'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'For example, if a token copies a Plains that’s been affected by a spell with awaken, the token will be just a land, even though the object being copied is currently a land creature. The same is true if the land has an ability that animates it.'}, {'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.'}, {'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'If the copied creature is copying something else when the ability resolves, then the token enters the battlefield as a copy of whatever that creature is copying.'}, {'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'If the copied spell has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Fall of the Titans does), the copy has the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'If the copied spell is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same modes. You can’t choose different ones.'}, {'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'Mirrorpool’s third ability can target (and copy) any instant or sorcery spell, not just one with targets.'}, {'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'The copy is created on the stack, so it’s not cast. Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger. The copy will then resolve like a normal spell, after players get a chance to cast spells and activate abilities.'}, {'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}, {'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'You can’t choose to pay any additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy, too. For example, if a player sacrifices a 3/3 creature to cast Fling, and you copy it, the copy of Fling will also deal 3 damage to its target.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'Each of the Oaths is legendary: if you control more than one of any particular Oath, you choose one to remain on the battlefield and the others are put into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'Even if you control a particular Oath, you can cast another of that Oath to take advantage of its enters-the-battlefield ability. It will enter the battlefield, causing its first ability to trigger. You will then choose one to keep, as detailed above, and then its enters-the-battlefield ability will resolve.'}, {'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'If you control no planeswalkers as the last ability resolves, you won’t scry at all. Abilities that trigger whenever you scry won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'The “legend rule” checks the full names of legendary permanents. You can control Oath of Gideon and Oath of Chandra at the same time, for example.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'Each of the Oaths is legendary: if you control more than one of any particular Oath, you choose one to remain on the battlefield and the others are put into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'Even if you control a particular Oath, you can cast another of that Oath to take advantage of its enters-the-battlefield ability. It will enter the battlefield, causing its first ability to trigger. You will then choose one to keep, as detailed above, and then its enters-the-battlefield ability will resolve.'}, {'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'The “legend rule” checks the full names of legendary permanents. You can control Oath of Gideon and Oath of Chandra at the same time, for example.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'If there’s an {X} in the mana cost of the card you discard, that X is 0. Any {X} in the mana cost of the target spell will have whatever value was determined for it as the spell was cast.'}, {'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'Kozilek’s triggered ability checks to see if you have fewer than seven cards in hand when you cast it. Kozilek is on the stack at this time and not in your hand. If you don’t, the ability won’t trigger at all. If the ability does trigger, it will check again as it tries to resolve. If you have seven or more cards in hand at that time, the ability won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'The converted mana cost of a spell doesn’t change, even if it’s been cast using an alternative cost (such as an awaken cost). For example, the converted mana cost of a Sheer Drop (a spell with mana cost {2}{W}) that’s been cast for its awaken cost of {5}{W} is 3.'}, {'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'To activate the last ability, there must be a legal target: a spell on the stack. That target will determine the value of X and the converted mana cost of the card you discard. You can’t activate the ability unless you can match the converted mana cost of a spell on the stack to that of a card in your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'If you don’t put the card onto the battlefield for any reason, you put the card into your hand.'}, {'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'If you put an Aura card onto the battlefield this way, you choose what it enchants as it enters the battlefield. You must be able to choose a legal player or permanent or you can’t put the Aura onto the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'It doesn’t matter how many cards are in your hand as the last ability resolves. For example, if you have no cards in hand and control two Sea Gate Wreckages, you can activate the last ability of each of them. You’ll draw a card as each ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'The target of the last ability didn’t necessarily have to be a colorless creature as it entered the battlefield, provided it entered the battlefield during that turn. However, it does have to be a colorless creature to be a legal target of the ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "If you sacrifice a Clue for another card\'s cost or effect, such as that of Angelic Purge or Tamiyo\'s Journal, you can\'t also pay {2} and sacrifice it to draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "The token is named Clue and has the artifact subtype Clue. Clue isn\'t a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'The tokens are normal artifacts. For example, they can be sacrificed to cast Angelic Purge or targeted by Root Out.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If a Forest or Plains is entering the battlefield from your hand at the same time as Fortified Village, you may reveal the other land to have Fortified Village enter untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to put Fortified Village onto the battlefield tapped, it will still enter the battlefield tapped even if you reveal a land card from your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "Lands don\'t have a subtype just because they can produce mana of the corresponding color. Fortified Village itself is neither a Forest nor a Plains, even though it produces green and white mana, so you can\'t reveal one to satisfy the ability of another."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "You may reveal any land card with either or both of the appropriate subtypes. It doesn\'t have to be a basic land. For example, you could reveal Prairie Stream from the Battle for Zendikar set to satisfy the ability of Fortified Village."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If a Plains or Island is entering the battlefield from your hand at the same time as Port Town, you may reveal the other land to have Port Town enter untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to put Port Town onto the battlefield tapped, it will still enter the battlefield tapped even if you reveal a land card from your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "Lands don\'t have a subtype just because they can produce mana of the corresponding color. Port Town itself is neither a Plains nor an Island, even though it produces white and blue mana, so you can\'t reveal one to satisfy the ability of another."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "You may reveal any land card with either or both of the appropriate subtypes. It doesn\'t have to be a basic land. For example, you could reveal Canopy Vista from the Battle for Zendikar set to satisfy the ability of Port Town."}]', "[{'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'If the artifact or creature put onto the battlefield with Nahiri’s third ability leaves the battlefield before the next end step, it won’t be returned to your hand from its new zone.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'If you find a noncreature artifact with Nahiri’s third ability, it will still gain haste, even though it won’t be meaningful unless that artifact becomes a creature.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'You can activate Nahiri’s first ability with no intention of discarding a card just to add loyalty to Nahiri.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'The mana generated by the last ability can’t be spent to activate abilities of Eldrazi sources that aren’t on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Abilities that define a creature’s power and toughness apply while that card is in exile, but abilities that add or subtract from it don’t. For example, the ability of Battle Squadron applies to determine Phyrexian Ingester’s power and toughness, but the ability of Werebear doesn’t. Phyrexian Ingester’s power and toughness are constantly updated if the exiled card’s power and/or toughness change.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'If the card in exile isn’t a creature card (perhaps because it was a land that was temporarily a creature while on the battlefield), Phyrexian Ingester doesn’t get a bonus.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Phyrexian Ingester will get bonuses based on the card’s power and toughness in exile. Counters, Auras, and Equipment it had on it before it was exiled won’t add to those numbers.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'Swampcycling is a form of cycling. Any ability that triggers on a card being cycled also triggers on Swampcycling this card. Any ability that stops a cycling ability from being activated also stops Swampcycling from being activated.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'Swampcycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with Swampcycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "Unlike the normal cycling ability, Swampcycling doesn\'t allow you to draw a card. Instead, it lets you search your library for a Swamp card. After you find a Swamp card in your library, you reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library."}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'You can choose to find any card with the Swamp land type, including nonbasic lands. You can also choose not to find a card, even if there is a Swamp card in your library.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'You draw two cards and discard two cards all while Faithless Looting is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': \'If more than one player discards a card with madness simultaneously, the player whose turn it is puts their madness abilities onto the stack first, then each other player does the same in turn order. The last one put onto the stack resolves first, and a spell cast this way will resolve before resolving the next madness ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': "When you activate Geier Reach Sanitarium\'s last ability, first each player draws a card. Then the player whose turn it is selects a card from their hand and sets it aside without revealing it; proceeding in turn order, each other player does the same. Then the cards that were set aside are discarded at once."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "Abilities that trigger whenever you “become the monarch” trigger only if you aren\'t already the monarch. For example, if you are already the monarch as Custodi Lich enters the battlefield, its last ability won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "Being the monarch carries two inherent triggered abilities. “At the beginning of the monarch\'s end step, that player draws a card” and “Whenever a creature deals combat damage to the monarch, its controller becomes the monarch.”"}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'If the triggered ability that causes the monarch to draw a card goes on the stack, and a different player becomes the monarch before that ability resolves, the first player will still draw the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'The game starts with no monarch. Once an effect makes one player the monarch, the game will have exactly one monarch from that point forward.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "The last ability of Skyline Despot checks to see if you\'re the monarch as your upkeep begins. If you\'re not, the ability won\'t trigger at all. You won\'t be able to do anything that would make you the monarch during your upkeep in time to have that ability trigger. The ability will also check to see if you\'re the monarch as it tries to resolve. If you\'re not the monarch at that time, the ability will have no effect."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "Entourage of Trest checks if you\'re the monarch only as blockers are declared. If it blocks two attacking creatures, another player becoming the monarch won\'t change or undo that block."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If a creature blocks two creatures, its combat damage is assigned to those creatures and vice versa using the same rules as if one creature were blocked by two creatures.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If combat damage dealt to the monarch causes that player to lose the game, the triggered ability that causes the controller of the attacking creature to become the monarch doesn\'t resolve. In most cases, the controller of the attacking creature will still become the monarch as it is likely their turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the monarch leaves the game during another player\'s turn, that player becomes the monarch. If the monarch leaves the game during their turn, the next player in turn order becomes the monarch."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the triggered ability that causes the monarch to draw a card goes on the stack and a different player becomes the monarch before that ability resolves, the first player will still draw the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The game starts with no monarch. Once an effect makes one player the monarch, the game will have exactly one monarch from that point forward. As a player becomes the monarch, the current monarch (if any) ceases being the monarch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'There are two inherent triggered abilities associated with being the monarch. These triggered abilities have no source and are controlled by the player who was the monarch at the time the abilities triggered. The full texts of these abilities are "At the beginning of the monarch\\\'s end step, that player draws a card" and "Whenever a creature deals combat damage to the monarch, its controller becomes the monarch."\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'Abilities that trigger whenever you "become the monarch" trigger only if you aren\\\'t already the monarch. For example, if you are already the monarch as Custodi Lich enters the battlefield, its last ability won\\\'t trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'Being the monarch carries two inherent triggered abilities. "At the beginning of the monarch\\\'s end step, that player draws a card" and "Whenever a creature deals combat damage to the monarch, its controller becomes the monarch."\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'If the triggered ability that causes the monarch to draw a card goes on the stack, and a different player becomes the monarch before that ability resolves, the first player will still draw the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "Regal Behemoth\'s last ability is a triggered mana ability. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'The game starts with no monarch. Once an effect makes one player the monarch, the game will have exactly one monarch from that point forward.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'Abilities that trigger whenever you "become the monarch" trigger only if you aren\\\'t already the monarch. For example, if you are already the monarch as Custodi Lich enters the battlefield, its last ability won\\\'t trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'Being the monarch carries two inherent triggered abilities. "At the beginning of the monarch\\\'s end step, that player draws a card" and "Whenever a creature deals combat damage to the monarch, its controller becomes the monarch."\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'If the triggered ability that causes the monarch to draw a card goes on the stack, and a different player becomes the monarch before that ability resolves, the first player will still draw the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'The game starts with no monarch. Once an effect makes one player the monarch, the game will have exactly one monarch from that point forward.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "The last ability of Queen Marchesa (long may she reign) checks to see if an opponent is the monarch as your upkeep begins. If no opponent is the monarch, Queen Marchesa\'s (long may she reign) ability won\'t trigger at all. Queen Marchesa\'s (long may she reign) ability will also check to see if an opponent is the monarch as it tries to resolve. If no opponent is the monarch at that time, Queen Marchesa\'s (long may she reign) ability will have no effect."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'Abilities that trigger whenever you "become the monarch" trigger only if you aren\\\'t already the monarch. For example, if you are already the monarch as Custodi Lich enters the battlefield, its last ability won\\\'t trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'Being the monarch carries two inherent triggered abilities. "At the beginning of the monarch\\\'s end step, that player draws a card" and "Whenever a creature deals combat damage to the monarch, its controller becomes the monarch."\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'If the triggered ability that causes the monarch to draw a card goes on the stack, and a different player becomes the monarch before that ability resolves, the first player will still draw the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'The game starts with no monarch. Once an effect makes one player the monarch, the game will have exactly one monarch from that point forward.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If combat damage dealt to the monarch causes that player to lose the game, the triggered ability that causes the controller of the attacking creature to become the monarch doesn\'t resolve. In most cases, the controller of the attacking creature will still become the monarch as it is likely their turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the monarch leaves the game during another player\'s turn, that player becomes the monarch. If the monarch leaves the game during their turn, the next player in turn order becomes the monarch."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the triggered ability that causes the monarch to draw a card goes on the stack and a different player becomes the monarch before that ability resolves, the first player will still draw the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The game starts with no monarch. Once an effect makes one player the monarch, the game will have exactly one monarch from that point forward. As a player becomes the monarch, the current monarch (if any) ceases being the monarch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'There are two inherent triggered abilities associated with being the monarch. These triggered abilities have no source and are controlled by the player who was the monarch at the time the abilities triggered. The full texts of these abilities are "At the beginning of the monarch\\\'s end step, that player draws a card" and "Whenever a creature deals combat damage to the monarch, its controller becomes the monarch."\'}]', "[{'date': '2016-08-23', 'text': 'Attacking with a goaded creature doesn’t cause it to stop being goaded. If there is an additional combat phase that turn, or if another player gains control of it before it stops being goaded, it must attack again if able.'}, {'date': '2016-08-23', 'text': 'Being goaded isn’t an ability the creature has. Once it’s been goaded, it must attack as detailed above even if it loses all abilities.'}, {'date': '2016-08-23', 'text': 'If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents that hasn’t goaded it, as that fulfills the maximum number of goad requirements. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, you choose which opponent it attacks.'}, {'date': '2016-08-23', 'text': 'If the creature doesn’t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than the controller of the spell or ability that goaded it if able. It the creature can’t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack an opposing planeswalker (controlled by any opponent) or the player that goaded it.'}, {'date': '2016-08-23', 'text': 'If, during a player’s declare attackers step, a creature that player controls that’s been goaded is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, or hasn’t been under that player’s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn’t have haste), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having a creature attack a player, its controller isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'Casting the exiled card follows the normal rules for casting that card. You must pay its costs, and you must follow all applicable timing rules. For example, if you exile a creature card this way, you must wait until your main phase to cast it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "If you don\'t cast the card, it will remain in exile."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "If you exile a land card this way, you can\'t play it."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'The card exiled by the second mode is exiled face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Attacking with a goaded creature doesn\'t cause it to stop being goaded. If there is an additional combat phase that turn, or if another player gains control of it before it stops being goaded, it must attack again if able."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Being goaded isn\'t an ability the creature has. Once it\'s been goaded, it must attack as detailed above even if it loses all abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents that hasn\'t goaded it, as that fulfills the maximum number of goad requirements. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, the creature must attack an opponent (rather than a planeswalker or battle), but you choose which opponent it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If the creature doesn\'t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than the controller of the spell or ability that goaded it if able. If the creature can\'t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack a planeswalker an opponent controls, a battle an opponent controls, or a player who goaded it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If, during a player\'s declare attackers step, a creature that player controls that\'s been goaded is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t attack, or hasn\'t been under that player\'s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn\'t have haste), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature attack a player, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack that player."}]', "[{'date': '2016-08-23', 'text': 'If the new creature isn’t on the battlefield as the first ability resolves, use its power when it left the battlefield to determine whether its controller may draw a card. Note that effects that reduced its power before it left the battlefield will apply.'}, {'date': '2016-08-23', 'text': 'Selvala’s last ability is a mana ability. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to. If the greatest power among creatures you control is 0 or less at that time, no mana is added to your pool.'}, {'date': '2016-08-23', 'text': 'The new creature’s power is compared to the power of each other creature on the battlefield as the first ability resolves. If another creature has the same or higher power than the new creature’s power, no one may draw a card.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "An effect that instructs you to “cast” a card doesn\'t allow you to play lands. If the card exiled with Chandra\'s first ability is a land card, you can\'t play it and Chandra deals 2 damage to each opponent."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Chandra\'s emblem\'s ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you cast the exiled card, you do so as part of the resolution of Chandra\'s ability. You can\'t wait to cast it later in the turn. Timing permissions based on the card\'s type are ignored, but other restrictions (such as “Cast [this card] only during combat”) are not."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Chandra\'s first ability causes 4 damage total to be dealt to the opposing team."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Loyalty abilities can\'t be mana abilities. Chandra\'s second ability uses the stack and can be countered or otherwise responded to. Like all loyalty abilities, it can be activated only once per turn, during your main phase, when the stack is empty, and only if no other loyalty abilities of the planeswalker have been activated this turn."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The emblem created by Chandra\'s last ability is colorless. The damage it deals is from a colorless source."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You pay the costs for the exiled card if you cast it. You may pay alternative costs such as emerge rather than the card\'s mana cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The Construct token you\'re creating doesn\'t count towards X for the ability that creates it."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined only as Oviya Pashiri\'s last ability resolves. The token\'s power and toughness won\'t change as the number of creatures you control changes."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'An effect that instructs you to "cast" a card doesn\\\'t allow you to play lands.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Casting the card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Gonti doesn\'t change when you can cast the exiled card. For example, if you exile a creature card without flash, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If you leave the game, the card remains exiled face down indefinitely. No player may look at it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You may look at and cast that card (and spend mana as though it were mana of any type to do so) even if Gonti leaves the battlefield. If another player gains control of Gonti, that player can\'t look at or cast the card, and you still can."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You pay the costs for the exiled card if you cast it. You may pay alternative costs such as emerge rather than the card\'s mana cost."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "The six types of mana are white, blue, black, red, green, and colorless. Snow mana is not a type of mana. Gonti, Lord of Luxury won\'t let you pay a snow cost using mana produced by a nonsnow source."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If the total mana value of noncreature artifacts you control is 11 or greater, Metalwork Colossus costs {0} to cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Metalwork Colossus\'s last ability can be activated only if it is in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Once a player has announced that they are casting Metalwork Colossus, no player may take actions to try to change the number of artifacts its controller controls before that spell\'s cost is locked in."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'The total cost to cast Metalwork Colossus is locked in before you pay that cost. For example, if you control three noncreature artifacts each with mana value 2, including one you can sacrifice to add {C} to your mana pool, the total cost of Metalwork Colossus is {5}. Then you can sacrifice the artifact when you activate mana abilities just before paying the cost.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If an artifact has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control an artifact with the highest mana value as your upkeep begins, Padeem\'s second ability won\'t trigger. You can\'t cast an instant to destroy an opponent\'s artifact during your turn before your upkeep begins."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you no longer control an artifact with the highest mana value as Padeem\'s triggered ability resolves, you don\'t draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'The artifact you control has to have the highest mana value only among artifacts on the battlefield, not among all permanents on the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If an artifact spell has {X} in its mana cost, choose the value for X first, and then reduce the cost by {1}. For example, an artifact that costs {X} with X chosen as 4 costs {3} to cast if you control Foundry Inspector.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Once a player has announced an artifact spell, no player may take actions to try to remove Foundry Inspector from the battlefield before that spell\'s cost is locked in."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs, such as emerge costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Incendiary Sabotage, you must pay those to cast the card."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you cast the card, you do so as part of the resolution of Torrential Gearhulk\'s triggered ability. You can\'t wait to cast it later in the turn. Timing restrictions (such as “Cast [this card] only during combat”) still apply."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "Causing an opponent to lose the game after you\'ve announced that you\'re casting a spell with undaunted and determined its total cost won\'t cause you to have to pay more mana."}, {\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "Effects that reduce what you pay to cast a spell don\'t affect its mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast Curtains\' Call without two creatures to target. If one becomes an illegal target after you\'ve cast Curtains\' Call, the other will still be destroyed."}]', "[{'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'A token creature that’s a copy of a player’s commander isn’t a commander.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If the copied permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If the copied permanent is copying something else (for example, if the copied creature is a Clone), then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that permanent copied.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If the permanent copied by the token had any “when [this permanent] enters the battlefield” abilities, then the token also has those abilities and will trigger them when it’s created. Similarly, any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities that the token has copied will also work.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If you control multiple Faerie Artisans, each one’s ability only exiles tokens created with the ability of that specific Faerie Artisans.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'The token copies exactly what was printed on the original permanent and nothing else (unless that permanent is copying something else; see below). It doesn’t copy whether that permanent is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'The token is an artifact in addition to its other types. This is a copiable value of the token that other effects may copy.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Any abilities that trigger during the resolution of Divergent Transformations will wait to be put onto the stack until Divergent Transformations finishes resolving. An ability that triggers on the first creature entering the battlefield may target the second creature and vice versa.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Causing an opponent to lose the game after you’ve announced that you’re casting a spell with undaunted and determined its total cost won’t cause you to have to pay more mana.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Effects that reduce what you pay to cast a spell don’t affect its converted mana cost. Sublime Exhalation’s converted mana cost is 7, regardless of how many opponents you have or how much mana you spent to cast it.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If one player’s creatures are exiled this way, that player repeats this process twice.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If the controller of a creature exiled this way has no creature cards left in their library, that player reveals the cards in their library, then shuffles it.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If two players’ creatures are exiled this way, start with the player whose turn it is. If that player controlled a creature exiled this way, that player follows the process on Divergent Transformations to replace it. If not, proceed to the next player in turn order. Repeat until the players who controlled the exiled creatures have each replaced those creatures.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'The two creatures that are put onto the battlefield are put onto the battlefield sequentially. Triggered abilities of the second won’t see the first enter the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'You can’t cast Divergent Transformations without two target creatures. If a targeted creature becomes an illegal target for Divergent Transformations after it’s been cast, its controller won’t exile or replace that creature, but the other creature is still affected.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Causing an opponent to lose the game after you’ve announced that you’re casting a spell with undaunted and determined its total cost won’t cause you to have to pay more mana.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Effects that reduce what you pay to cast a spell don’t affect its converted mana cost. Sublime Exhalation’s converted mana cost is 7, regardless of how many opponents you have or how much mana you spent to cast it.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If you win the flip, Boompile is destroyed along with all the other nonland permanents.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'You flip a coin as Boompile’s ability resolves. No player may take actions between seeing the result of the flip and all nonland permanents being destroyed.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Because improvise isn\'t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Equipment attached to a creature doesn\'t become tapped when that creature becomes tapped, and tapping that Equipment doesn\'t cause the creature to become tapped."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If an artifact you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with improvise will result in the artifact being tapped when you pay the spell\'s costs. You won\'t be able to tap it again for improvise. Similarly, if you sacrifice an artifact to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with improvise, that artifact won\'t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell\'s costs, so you won\'t be able to tap it for improvise."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If you cast a nonartifact spell that requires you to sacrifice a permanent as an additional cost, you may tap that permanent (if it\'s an artifact) for the spell\'s improvise ability before you sacrifice it to pay that cost."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Improvise can\\\'t be used to pay for anything other than the cost of casting the spell. For example, it can\\\'t be used during the resolution of an ability that says "Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}."\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Improvise can\'t pay for {W}, {U}, {B}, {R}, {G}, or {C} mana symbols in a spell\'s total cost."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Improvise doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Multiple instances of improvise are redundant.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Tapping an artifact won\'t cause its abilities to stop applying unless those abilities say so."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "When calculating a spell\'s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Improvise applies after the total cost is calculated."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "When using improvise to cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, first choose the value for X. That choice, plus any cost increases or decreases, will determine the spell\'s total cost. Then you can tap artifacts you control to help pay that cost. For example, if you cast Whir of Invention (a spell with improvise and mana cost {X}{U}{U}{U}) and choose X to be 3, the total cost is {3}{U}{U}{U}. If you tap two artifacts, you\'ll have to pay {1}{U}{U}{U}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Each creature you control has Rishkar\'s mana ability as long as that creature has any kind of counter on it. The effect isn\'t limited to those with +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Rishkar can be a target of its own triggered ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "You can\'t target the same creature twice to have one recipient get two +1/+1 counters."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If Yahenni and a creature an opponent controls die simultaneously (perhaps because they fought or were in combat together), Yahenni won\'t be on the battlefield as its triggered ability resolves. It can\'t be saved by the +1/+1 counter that would have been put on it."}]', "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Efficient Construction’s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. The ability will resolve even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Craterhoof Behemoth’s triggered ability affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. It won’t affect creatures that come under your control later in the turn.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'The value of X is determined only as Craterhoof Behemoth’s triggered ability resolves, potentially including Craterhoof Behemoth itself. It won’t change later in the turn if the number of creatures you control changes.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'The two targets can have different card types. For example, you can target one artifact and one creature with Ghostly Flicker.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn\'t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'If a Desert has an ability with a cost of "Sacrifice a Desert," you can sacrifice that Desert to pay the cost for its own ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'The sacrificed Desert will be in your graveyard to be exiled by the last ability of Scavenger Grounds.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Once a creature has attacked you or a planeswalker you control, it will remain in combat even if it gains flying. Similarly, if a creature with flying enters the battlefield attacking, Sandwurm Convergence\'s first ability can\'t undo that attack."}]', "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'A split card only counts once for Cryptic Serpent’s ability, even if it’s both an instant and a sorcery.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Cryptic Serpent’s ability can’t reduce its cost to less than {U}{U}.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Cryptic Serpent’s ability doesn’t change its mana cost or converted mana cost. It just reduces the cost to cast the spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If Cast Out leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the target permanent won’t be exiled.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if Cast Out’s owner leaves the game, the exiled card will return to the battlefield. Because the one-shot effect that returns the card isn’t an ability that goes on the stack, it won’t cease to exist along with the leaving player’s spells and abilities on the stack.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The exiled card returns to the battlefield immediately after Cast Out leaves the battlefield. Nothing happens between the two events, including state-based actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Some cards with cycling have an ability that triggers when you cycle them. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Triggered abilities from cycling a card and the cycling ability itself aren’t spells. Effects that interact with spells (such as that of Cancel) won’t affect them.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You can cycle a card even if it has a triggered ability from cycling that won’t have a legal target. This is because the cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. This also means that if either ability doesn’t resolve (due to being countered with Disallow, for example, or if the triggered ability’s targets have become illegal), the other ability will still resolve.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Afflict causes the defending player to lose life; it\'s not damage or combat damage."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Afflict resolves before combat damage is dealt. If this loss of life brings a player to 0 life or less, that player loses the game immediately. A blocking creature with lifelink won\'t deal combat damage in time to save that player."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Because it triggers at the beginning of a phase, Neheb\'s last ability isn\'t a mana ability. It uses the stack and can be countered by effects that interact with triggered abilities, such as that of Nimble Obstructionist."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'Damage dealt to a player causes that player to lose that much life.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If an opponent loses life and subsequently loses the game before your postcombat main phase, Neheb\'s last ability counts that loss of life."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If an opponent loses life but Neheb leaves the battlefield before your postcombat main phase begins, its last ability doesn\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'If multiple creatures block a creature with afflict, afflict triggers only once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If you somehow have more than two main phases in a turn, each main phase after your first one is a postcombat main phase, and Neheb\'s last ability triggers at the beginning of each of them."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Neheb\'s ability checks only how much life opponents lost during the turn, not by how much their life total decreased compared to the start of the turn. For example, if an opponent lost 2 life and then gained 8 life before your postcombat main phase, you\'ll add {R}{R} to your mana pool."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "You get a postcombat main phase even if no creatures attacked during a turn. Neheb\'s last ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "If a creature is attacking a planeswalker, that planeswalker\'s controller is the defending player. If a creature is attacking a battle, that battle\'s protector is the defending player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If Mirage Mirror becomes a copy of a legendary permanent you control, you\'ll put one of them into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If Mirage Mirror becomes a copy of an Aura, it\'s put into its owner\'s graveyard unless it\'s somehow attached to an appropriate object or player already. If it becomes a copy of an Equipment and is attached to a creature, it\'ll become unattached when it becomes a non-Equipment artifact again."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If Mirage Mirror becomes a creature the same turn it enters the battlefield, you can\'t attack with it or use any of its {T} abilities (if it gains any) unless it has haste."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If Mirage Mirror copies a permanent that\'s copying something else, it will become whatever the target is copying."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If an effect begins to apply to Mirage Mirror before it becomes a copy of another permanent, that effect will continue to apply. For example, if Mirage Mirror is activated twice in response to itself targeting first Rampaging Hippo then Frilled Sandwalla, the ability it has while it\'s a copy of Frilled Sandwalla can be activated and its effect will continue to apply while Mirage Mirror is a copy of Rampaging Hippo."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If you activate Mirage Mirror\'s ability multiple times in a turn in response to itself, then each time one of those abilities resolves, it will overwrite whatever Mirage Mirror is copying. Mirage Mirror will wind up as a copy of the permanent targeted by the last ability to resolve. When the turn ends, all instances of the ability will wear off at the same time."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Mirage Mirror copies the printed values of the target permanent, plus any copy effects that have been applied to it. It won\'t copy counters on that permanent or effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on. Notably, it won\'t copy effects that made the target permanent become a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Once Mirage Mirror\'s ability resolves, it no longer has that ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'If this creature dies but leaves your graveyard before the next end step, it will remain in its new zone.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "The “next end step” refers to the next end step that occurs, not the end step of the next turn. If this creature dies before a turn\'s end step (for example, during combat), it will be returned to its owner\'s hand at the beginning of that turn\'s end step."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, The Scarab God\'s first ability causes the opposing team to lose life equal to twice the number of Zombies you control, although you scry only equal to the number of Zombies you control."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "The number of Zombies you control is counted as The Scarab God\'s first ability resolves. Players can try to change that number in response to the ability (perhaps by activating its second ability)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "Creatures that enter the battlefield after Disrupt Decorum resolves won\'t be goaded."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Attacking with a goaded creature doesn\'t cause it to stop being goaded. If there is an additional combat phase that turn, or if another player gains control of it before it stops being goaded, it must attack again if able."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Being goaded isn\'t an ability the creature has. Once it\'s been goaded, it must attack as detailed above even if it loses all abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents that hasn\'t goaded it, as that fulfills the maximum number of goad requirements. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, the creature must attack an opponent (rather than a planeswalker or battle), but you choose which opponent it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If the creature doesn\'t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than the controller of the spell or ability that goaded it if able. If the creature can\'t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack a planeswalker an opponent controls, a battle an opponent controls, or a player who goaded it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If, during a player\'s declare attackers step, a creature that player controls that\'s been goaded is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t attack, or hasn\'t been under that player\'s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn\'t have haste), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature attack a player, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack that player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "If you don\'t put the top card of your library into your hand, you put it back on top of your library without revealing it. You\'ll draw it in that turn\'s draw step."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "If you somehow control a Herald\'s Horn with no chosen creature type, no spells will cost less to cast, not even creature spells with no creature type. You\'ll be able to look at the top card of your library at the beginning of each of your upkeeps, but you can never put it into your hand this way, even if it\'s a creature card with no creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "The effect of Herald\'s Horn reduces only generic mana in a spell\'s cost. If that cost has no generic mana, the cost isn\'t reduced."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': \'You can\\\'t choose multiple creature types, such as "Cat Warrior." A Cat Warrior is both a Cat and a Warrior. It\\\'s affected by anything that affects either type and unaffected by things that affect non-Cat or non-Warrior creatures.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': \'You must choose an existing creature type, such as Vampire or Cat. Card types such as "artifact" can\\\'t be chosen.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "Once Kindred Dominance begins to resolve, no players may take other actions until it\'s done. Notably, players can\'t try to save their creatures after you\'ve chosen a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': \'You can\\\'t choose multiple creature types, such as "Cat Warrior." A Cat Warrior is both a Cat and a Warrior. It\\\'s affected by anything that affects either type and unaffected by things that affect non-Cat or non-Warrior creatures.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': \'You must choose an existing creature type, such as Vampire or Cat. Card types such as "artifact" can\\\'t be chosen.\'}]', "[{'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'Alms Collector’s replacement effect applies to an instruction to draw more than one card before any replacement effects apply to individual cards drawn. For example, if you have a card with dredge in your graveyard, you can’t dredge it before the effect of Divination is modified by Alms Collector’s replacement effect.'}, {'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'If an effect puts cards into a player’s hand without using the word “draw” at all, Alms Collector’s replacement effect doesn’t apply.'}, {'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'If two players each control an Alms Collector and a third player would draw two or more cards, the third player chooses which Alms Collector’s replacement effect will apply, and therefore which of the first two players draws a card.'}, {'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'If two players each control an Alms Collector and an effect instructs them to each draw two or more cards, the replacement effect of each Alms Collector is applied and both players end up drawing two cards.'}, {'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'Once a replacement effect has been applied to an event, it can’t be applied again to the resulting events. For example, once Alms Collector’s replacement effect has modified the effect of a player’s Divination, Thought Reflection can double that player’s resulting card draw without Alms Collector’s replacement effect applying again.'}, {'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'To determine whether a player is instructed to draw multiple once or instructed multiple times to draw one card, count how many times the word “draw” is used. Alms Collector’s replacement effect watches for one “draw” that instructs a player to draw multiple cards (including instructions to “draw a card for each. . .”).'}]", "[{'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'Balan’s activated ability has no timing restriction. You can activate it any time you have priority.'}, {'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'If Balan deals first-strike damage and then gains double strike (most likely because it picked up some Equipment with its activated ability after first-strike damage was dealt), it will also deal regular combat damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'If a Dragon you control enters the battlefield attacking, it won’t cause The Ur-Dragon’s last ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'The Ur-Dragon’s triggered ability resolves after all attackers have been chosen. You can’t attack with some Dragons, put a creature card with haste onto the battlefield, and then attack with that creature. Similarly, any “whenever a creature attacks” abilities of the permanent card you put onto the battlefield won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'You draw one card for each Dragon you controlled that attacked, even if some of them left the battlefield before The Ur-Dragon’s triggered ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'You may only put one permanent card from your hand onto the battlefield, no matter how many Dragons you attacked with or how many players they attacked.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'If an ability targets something controlled by the “defending player” of an attacking creature and the defending player for that creature changes before that ability resolves, the ability won’t resolve because its target has become illegal.'}, {'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'If you reselect which player or planeswalker an attacking creature is attacking, that creature is still considered to have attacked the player or planeswalker as declared, but it is now attacking the new player or planeswalker.'}, {'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'Reselecting which player or planeswalker a creature is attacking doesn’t cause “whenever this creature attacks” abilities to trigger. Notably, the Curses in this set (such as Curse of Vitality) won’t trigger while Portal Mage’s ability is resolving.'}, {'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'Reselecting which player or planeswalker a creature is attacking ignores all requirements, restrictions, and costs associated with attacking.'}, {'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'You may cast Portal Mage outside of a declare attackers step. If Portal Mage enters the battlefield outside of a declare attackers step, its ability simply doesn’t trigger.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': \'Tapping Mirri after creatures have attacked will not remove creatures from combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "While Mirri is tapped, there\'s no restriction on how many creatures can attack planeswalkers you control or battles you protect."}]', "[{'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'The “legend rule” cares about legendary permanents with the exact same English name. You can control Taigam, Sidisi’s Hand and Taigam, Ojutai Master at the same time.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'You can’t choose more modes for Vindictive Lich’s triggered ability than you have opponents, but you need to choose at least one target if you can.'}, {'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'You don’t have to choose a mode for each opponent. For example, you could make one opponent lose 5 life and spare each other opponent. They might not repay your kindness.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If you cast a creature spell that enters the battlefield as a copy of Wakening Sun\'s Avatar, such as Clone, the enters-the-battlefield ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If you put Wakening Sun\'s Avatar onto the battlefield from your hand without casting it, its ability won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "The choice of creature type is made as Vanquisher\'s Banner enters the battlefield. Players can\'t respond to this choice. The bonus starts applying immediately."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "The last ability of Vanquisher\'s Banner resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. The ability will resolve even if the creature spell is countered."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a creature you control of the chosen type may become lethal if Vanquisher\'s Banner leaves the battlefield during that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To choose a creature type, you must choose an existing creature type, such as Fungus or Sliver. You can\'t choose multiple creature types, such as Fungus Sliver. Card types such as artifact can\'t be chosen, nor can subtypes that aren\'t creature types, such as Jace, Vehicle, or Treasure."}]', "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Fog Bank’s prevention effect isn’t considered while assigning combat damage from a creature with trample. For example, if it blocks a 5/5 creature with trample, that creature’s controller must assign 2 of that creature’s combat damage to Fog Bank and the remainder can be assigned to the defending player or planeswalker.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Hoarding Dragon’s two abilities are linked. The second ability refers only to the card exiled by that Hoarding Dragon’s first ability. In other words, each Dragon has its own hoard.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If Hoarding Dragon dies before its first ability resolves, its second ability will trigger and do nothing. Then its first ability will resolve. If you choose to exile an artifact card from your library, it will be exiled indefinitely.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The artifact card you find is exiled face up. All players can see what it is.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "A permanent is any object on the battlefield, including tokens and lands. Spells and emblems aren\'t permanents."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "Ascend on a permanent isn\'t a triggered ability and doesn\'t use the stack. Players can respond to a spell that will give you your tenth permanent, but they can\'t respond to getting the city\'s blessing once you control that tenth permanent. This means that if your tenth permanent is a land you play, players can\'t respond before you get the city\'s blessing."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell with ascend, you don\'t get the city\'s blessing until it resolves. Players may respond to that spell by trying to change whether you get the city\'s blessing."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "If you control ten permanents but don\'t control a permanent or resolving spell with ascend, you don\'t get the city\'s blessing. For example, if you control ten permanents, lose control of one, then cast Golden Demise, you won\'t have the city\'s blessing and the spell will affect creatures you control."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'If your tenth permanent enters the battlefield and then a permanent leaves the battlefield immediately afterwards (most likely due to the "Legend Rule" or due to being a creature with 0 toughness), you get the city\\\'s blessing before it leaves the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "Once you have the city\'s blessing, you have it for the rest of the game, even if you lose control of some or all of your permanents. The city\'s blessing isn\'t a permanent itself and can\'t be removed by any effect."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "Wayward Swordtooth\'s middle ability is cumulative if you control more than one. It\'s also cumulative with other effects that let you play additional lands, such as the one from Enter the Unknown."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "A permanent is any object on the battlefield, including tokens and lands. Spells and emblems aren\'t permanents."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "Ascend on a permanent isn\'t a triggered ability and doesn\'t use the stack. Players can respond to a spell that will give you your tenth permanent, but they can\'t respond to getting the city\'s blessing once you control that tenth permanent. This means that if your tenth permanent is a land you play, players can\'t respond before you get the city\'s blessing."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell with ascend, you don\'t get the city\'s blessing until it resolves. Players may respond to that spell by trying to change whether you get the city\'s blessing."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "If you control ten permanents but don\'t control a permanent or resolving spell with ascend, you don\'t get the city\'s blessing. For example, if you control ten permanents, lose control of one, then cast Golden Demise, you won\'t have the city\'s blessing and the spell will affect creatures you control."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'If your tenth permanent enters the battlefield and then a permanent leaves the battlefield immediately afterwards (most likely due to the "Legend Rule" or due to being a creature with 0 toughness), you get the city\\\'s blessing before it leaves the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "Once you have the city\'s blessing, you have it for the rest of the game, even if you lose control of some or all of your permanents. The city\'s blessing isn\'t a permanent itself and can\'t be removed by any effect."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "A permanent is any object on the battlefield, including tokens and lands. Spells and emblems aren\'t permanents."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "Ascend on a permanent isn\'t a triggered ability and doesn\'t use the stack. Players can respond to a spell that will give you your tenth permanent, but they can\'t respond to getting the city\'s blessing once you control that tenth permanent. This means that if your tenth permanent is a land you play, players can\'t respond before you get the city\'s blessing."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'If the mana cost of the revealed card includes {X}, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "If the revealed card doesn\'t have a mana cost (because it\'s a land card, for example), its mana value is 0."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell with ascend, you don\'t get the city\'s blessing until it resolves. Players may respond to that spell by trying to change whether you get the city\'s blessing."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "If you control ten permanents but don\'t control a permanent or resolving spell with ascend, you don\'t get the city\'s blessing. For example, if you control ten permanents, lose control of one, then cast Golden Demise, you won\'t have the city\'s blessing and the spell will affect creatures you control."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'If your tenth permanent enters the battlefield and then a permanent leaves the battlefield immediately afterwards (most likely due to the "Legend Rule" or due to being a creature with 0 toughness), you get the city\\\'s blessing before it leaves the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Twilight Prophet\'s last ability causes the opposing team to lose twice X life and you gain X life."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "Once you have the city\'s blessing, you have it for the rest of the game, even if you lose control of some or all of your permanents. The city\'s blessing isn\'t a permanent itself and can\'t be removed by any effect."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'Some cards have triggered abilities with an intervening "if" clause that checks whether you have the city\\\'s blessing. These are worded "[Trigger condition], if you have the city\\\'s blessing, [effect]." You must already have the city\\\'s blessing in order for these abilities to trigger; otherwise they do nothing. In other words, there\\\'s no way to have the ability trigger if you don\\\'t have the city\\\'s blessing, even if you intend to get it in response to the triggered ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card, such as cards with aftermath from the Amonkhet block, is based on the combined mana cost of its two halves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "Ghalta\'s first ability can\'t reduce its cost below {G}{G}."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "If a creature\'s power is somehow less than 0, it subtracts from the total power of your other creatures. If the total power of your creatures is 0 or less, Ghalta\'s cost remains {10}{G}{G}."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'The total cost to cast Ghalta is locked in before you pay that cost. For example, if you control three 2/2 creatures, including one you can sacrifice to add {C} to your mana pool, the total cost of Ghalta is {4}{G}{G}. Then you can sacrifice the creature when you activate mana abilities just before paying the cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "To determine Ghalta\'s total cost, start with the mana cost (or an alternative cost if another card\'s effect allows you to pay one instead), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. Ghalta\'s mana value remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "If an attacking creature with double strike and trample destroys all of its blocking creatures with first-strike combat damage, all of its normal combat damage is assigned to the player or planeswalker that creature\'s attacking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "Zacama\'s triggered ability triggers if you cast it from any zone. It doesn\'t trigger if you put Zacama onto the battlefield without casting it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "Zacama\'s damage-dealing ability can be activated during combat, perhaps targeting a creature blocking it. If all creatures blocking Zacama are destroyed, its combat damage is assigned to the player, planeswalker, or battle it\'s attacking because of trample. If the blocking creatures are dealt nonlethal damage, that damage is considered when assigning trample damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'To choose a creature type, you must choose an existing creature type, such as Vampire or Knight. You can\\\'t choose multiple creature types, such as "Vampire Knight." Card types such as artifact can\\\'t be chosen, nor can subtypes that aren\\\'t creature types, such as Jace, Vehicle, or Treasure.\'}]', "[{'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'To choose a creature type, you must choose an existing creature type, such as Vampire or Knight. You can’t choose multiple creature types, such as “Vampire Knight.” Card types such as artifact can’t be chosen, nor can subtypes that aren’t creature types, such as Jace, Vehicle, or Treasure.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Any creature you control that couldn\'t be targeted by the original spell (due to shroud, protection abilities, targeting restrictions, or any other reason) is just ignored by Zada\'s ability."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If the spell that\'s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Rolling Thunder does), the copies have the same value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'If the spell that\\\'s copied is modal (that is, it says "Choose one —" or the like), the copies will have the same mode. You can\\\'t choose a different one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If you cast an instant or sorcery spell that has multiple targets, but it\'s targeting only Zada with all of them, Zada\'s ability will trigger. The copies will similarly each be targeting only one of your other creatures. You can\'t change any of the copy\'s targets to other creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "The controller of a copy can\'t choose to pay any alternative or additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any alternative or additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "The copies that the ability creates are created on the stack, so they\'re not cast. Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell (like Zada\'s ability itself) won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'You control all the copies. You choose the order the copies are put onto the stack. The original spell will be on the stack beneath those copies and will resolve last.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Zada\'s ability triggers whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell that targets only Zada and no other object or player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If each player has fewer than seven cards in their library as Magus of the Wheel\'s ability resolves, the game ends in a draw."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Spikeshot Goblin\'s power is determined as its ability resolves. If Spikeshot Goblin has left the battlefield, use its power as it last existed on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You can choose to find one basic land card with Myriad Landscape\'s last ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'Gisela doubles damage dealt to opponents and permanents your opponents control from any source, including sources controlled by those opponents.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If damage dealt by a source you control is being divided or assigned among multiple permanents an opponent controls or among an opponent and one or more permanents they control simultaneously, divide the original amount and double the results. For example, if you attack with a 5/5 creature with trample and your opponent blocks with a 2/2 creature, you can assign 2 damage to the blocker and 3 damage to the defending player. These amounts are then doubled to 4 and 6 damage, respectively. You can\'t double the damage to 10 first and then assign 2 to the creature and 8 to the player."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'If multiple replacement effects would modify how damage would be dealt, the player being dealt damage (or the controller of the permanent being dealt damage) chooses the order in which to apply those effects.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'If another creature dies at the same time as Murder of Crows, its last ability triggers.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t do anything in between drawing a card and discarding a card, including casting or cycling the card you drew."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "A card, spell, or permanent is historic if it has the legendary supertype, the artifact card type, or the Saga subtype. Having two of those qualities doesn\'t make an object more historic than another or provide an additional bonus—an object either is historic or it isn\'t."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "An ability that triggers “whenever you cast a historic spell” doesn\'t trigger if a historic card is put onto the battlefield without being cast."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'If the mana cost of a card in your graveyard includes {X}, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Lands are never cast, so abilities that trigger “whenever you cast a historic spell” won\'t trigger if you play a legendary land. They also won\'t trigger if a card on the battlefield transforms into a legendary land, as the Ixalan and Rivals of Ixalan double-faced cards do."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'Some abilities trigger “whenever you cast a historic spell.” Such an ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "A card, spell, or permanent is historic if it has the legendary supertype, the artifact card type, or the Saga subtype. Having two of those qualities doesn\'t make an object more historic than another or provide an additional bonus—an object either is historic or it isn\'t."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "A chapter ability doesn\'t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter\'s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won\'t trigger again."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn\'t use the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Each symbol on the left of a Saga\'s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability\'s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "If counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters. Removing lore counters won\'t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won\'t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities—in the Dominaria set, this is always three—the Saga\'s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn\'t use the stack."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "If the target creature\'s power is greater than X as Aryel\'s last ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn\'t resolve. You can\'t tap extra Knights once the ability has been activated."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Once you announce that you\'re activating Aryel\'s last ability, no player may take other actions until the ability\'s been paid for. Notably, players can\'t try to make the value of X invalid by removing or tapping your Knights."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Tapping Aryel to activate either of its abilities while it\'s attacking doesn\'t remove it from combat."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "You can tap any untapped Knights you control, including ones you haven\'t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn, to pay the cost of Aryel\'s last ability. However, you must have controlled Aryel continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn in order to use either of its activated abilities."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Once a creature you control has been blocked, changing its power to 1 or less won\'t cause it to become unblocked. Changing its toughness to 1 won\'t cause it to become unblocked, and changing its toughness to less than 1 will cause it to die."}]', "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'A chapter ability doesn’t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter’s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won’t trigger again.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Each symbol on the left of a Saga’s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability’s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters. Removing lore counters won’t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, the permanent you control from The Eldest Reborn’s final chapter ability is exiled.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won’t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities—in the Dominaria set, this is always three—the Saga’s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'When the first chapter ability of The Eldest Reborn resolves, the next opponent in turn order (or, if it’s an opponent’s turn, that opponent) chooses a creature or planeswalker they control, then each other opponent in turn order (if any) does the same. All chosen permanents are then sacrificed at the same time. Players will know the choices made by earlier players when making their choices.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'When the second chapter ability of The Eldest Reborn resolves, the next opponent in turn order (or, if it’s an opponent’s turn, that opponent) chooses a card in hand without revealing it, then each other opponent in turn order (if any) does the same. All chosen cards are then discarded at the same time.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Demonlord Belzenlok’s ability causes it to deal an amount of damage to you all at once; it doesn’t deal 1 damage multiple times.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the mana cost of the nonland card includes {X}, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the nonland card doesn’t have a mana cost, its converted mana cost is 0.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Land cards exiled this way remain exiled.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Once the triggered ability resolves, the ability will continue until you either exile a nonland card with converted mana cost 3 or less or fail to exile any nonland cards while performing the process. You can’t choose to stop receiving the blessings of Demonlord Belzenlok any sooner.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The converted mana cost of a split card, such as a card with aftermath from the Amonkhet block, is equal to the combined mana cost of its two halves.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'For Oath of Teferi’s second ability, you may activate the same ability of a planeswalker twice, or you may activate two different abilities of that planeswalker.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it ceases to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the exiled card is an Aura, that card’s owner chooses what it will enchant as it returns to the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn’t target anything (so it could be attached to an opponent’s permanent with hexproof, for example), but the Aura’s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If the Aura can’t legally be attached to anything, it remains exiled.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If you somehow control more than one Oath of Teferi, you won’t be able to activate abilities of planeswalkers you control more than twice in one turn.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The exiled card will return to the battlefield at the beginning of the next end step even if Oath of Teferi is no longer on the battlefield at that time.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If there’s no target for the triggered ability of Forebear’s Blade, or if the ability’s target becomes illegal, Forebear’s Blade remains on the battlefield unattached.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If you control Baird, your opponents can choose not to pay to attack with a creature that attacks “if able.” If there’s no other player or planeswalker to attack, that creature simply doesn’t attack.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, creatures can attack your teammate and planeswalkers your teammate controls without requiring a mana payment. This is a change from previous rules.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Neither sacrificed creature can be the target of Whisper’s ability.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Whisper can be one of the creatures sacrificed to activate its ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'Other than the casting restriction, the legendary supertype on a sorcery carries no additional rules. You may cast any number of legendary sorceries in a turn, and your deck may contain any number of legendary cards (but no more than four of any with the same name).\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast a legendary sorcery unless you control a legendary creature or a legendary planeswalker. Once you begin to cast a legendary sorcery, losing control of your legendary creatures and planeswalkers won\'t affect that spell."}]', "[{'date': '2018-06-08', 'text': 'Archfiend of Despair’s last ability counts only how much life was lost. It doesn’t care whether a player also gained life.'}, {'date': '2018-06-08', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, damage and life loss happen to each player individually. If each player on a team is dealt 2 damage, each of those players loses 2 life and the team’s life total goes down by 4. When Archfiend of Despair’s ability resolves, each of those players again loses 2 life and the team’s life total goes down again by 4; they don’t each lose 4 life.'}, {'date': '2018-06-08', 'text': 'The amount of life to lose is determined only as Archfiend of Despair’s triggered ability resolves. For example, if you control two of them and an opponent lost 3 life earlier in the turn, the first ability to resolve would have that player lose 3 life, and the second would have that player lose 6 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-06-08', 'text': 'If the mana cost of a card in your library includes {X}, X is considered to be 0.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Activating Suspicious Bookcase\'s ability after a creature has become blocked won\'t cause that creature to become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Ancient Stone Idol\'s cost is reduced for each attacking creature, not just creatures attacking you. It even counts your attacking creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If there are enough attacking creatures, Ancient Stone Idol\'s cost can be reduced to {0}."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'The total cost to cast a spell is locked in before you pay that cost. For example, if you control five attacking creatures, including one you can sacrifice to add {C} to your mana pool, Ancient Stone Idol costs {5} to cast. Then you can sacrifice the creature when you activate mana abilities just before paying the cost, and it still costs only {5} to cast.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Equipment attached to a creature doesn\'t become tapped when that creature becomes tapped, and tapping that Equipment doesn\'t cause the creature to become tapped."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If an artifact you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with improvise will result in the artifact being tapped when you pay the spell\'s costs. You won\'t be able to tap it again for improvise. Similarly, if you sacrifice an artifact to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with improvise, that artifact won\'t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell\'s costs, so you won\'t be able to tap it for improvise."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Improvise can\'t be used to pay for anything other than the cost of casting the spell. For example, it can\'t be used during the resolution of an ability that says “Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.”"}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Improvise can\'t pay for {W}, {U}, {B}, {R}, {G}, or {C} mana symbols in a spell\'s total cost."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Improvise doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Tapping an artifact won\'t cause its abilities to stop applying unless those abilities say so."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "When calculating a spell\'s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Improvise applies after the total cost is calculated."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "When using improvise to cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, first choose the value for X. That choice, plus any cost increases or decreases, will determine the spell\'s total cost. Then you can tap artifacts you control to help pay that cost. For example, if you cast Saheeli\'s Directive and choose X to be 3, the total cost is {3}{R}{R}{R}. If you tap two artifacts, you\'ll have to pay {1}{R}{R}{R}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Geode Golem\'s triggered ability triggers even if it\'s dealt lethal damage at the same time it deals combat damage to a player."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Geode Golem\'s triggered ability triggers even if your commander isn\'t in the command zone at the time Geode Golem deals combat damage to a player. If your commander finds its way there before the trigger resolves, you can cast it."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs, such as bestow costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as the commander tax, those must be paid to cast the card."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you wish to cast your commander without paying its mana cost, you must cast it while the triggered ability of Geode Golem is resolving. You can\'t cast for free it later in the turn. It may be cast at a time you normally wouldn\'t be able to cast a creature spell, but other restrictions (such as “Cast this card only from your graveyard”) are enforced."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Goreclaw\'s last ability affects only creatures you control with the appropriate power at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t get either bonus, and a creature you control whose power decreases later in the turn won\'t lose either bonus."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If another creature has an ability that changes its power when it attacks, such as Brawl-Bash Ogre, you may have that ability resolve before Goreclaw\'s last ability."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you cast a creature spell that will enter the battlefield with a number of +1/+1 counters, such as Hungering Hydra, those counters aren\'t considered when determining whether Goreclaw reduces that spell\'s cost. Similarly, effects that will raise the creature\'s power once it has entered the battlefield won\'t apply."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Guttersnipe\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Guttersnipe\'s ability causes the opposing team to lose 4 life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control your commander as the lieutenant ability resolves, you won\'t get its effect."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If you have multiple commanders, you need to control only one for the lieutenant effect to happen.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'The lieutenant effect happens only once each combat, even if you somehow control multiple commanders (perhaps because you have two commanders with a partner ability from the Battlebond™ set).\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Sai\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'An artifact is "tapped for mana" when a player activates a mana ability of an artifact that includes {T} (the tap symbol). Notably, tapping an artifact to pay for a spell with the improvise keyword is not tapping that artifact for mana.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If an opponent taps an artifact for mana during your turn, you\'ll gain control of it and keep control of it until the end of your next turn."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If multiple players each control Treasure Nabbers, an artifact tapped for mana will make quite a journey. For example, if player A taps an artifact for mana during their turn, and players B and C are the next players in turn order who control Treasure Nabbers, C\'s ability resolves before B and C gains control of the artifact. Then B gains control of the artifact. B keeps it during their turn, and then C regains control of the artifact once B\'s effect expires, then A will have it back after C\'s expires. However, if B or C taps the artifact for mana, one of them will take it from the other. You may need to pay very careful attention to which effects are still in effect, which have expired, and who owns what."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If the artifact leaves the battlefield, Treasure Nabber doesn\'t nab it from the zone it moved to."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you control multiple Treasure Nabbers, their effects all expire at the same time. You won\'t keep an artifact for any longer."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If that player controls any nabbed treasures, the effect giving that player control of those artifacts ends.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'The artifact remains tapped when you gain control of it.\'}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Because all attackers are chosen at once, a spell cast this way can’t affect which creatures you can attack with, but it can affect which creatures will be able to block.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X if you cast it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the revealed card doesn’t have an odd converted mana cost or if that card does but you choose not to cast it, you draw a card. Keep in mind that revealing a card doesn’t cause it to change zones. This means that the card you draw will be the card you revealed.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs, such as evoke costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Tormenting Voice, those must be paid to cast it.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you wish to cast the revealed card without paying its mana cost, you must cast it while Yennett’s triggered ability is resolving; you can’t cast for free it later in the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Because all attacking creatures are chosen at once, a creature returned this way can’t attack during the same combat as it returns, even if it has haste.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Because to die means to be put into a graveyard from the battlefield, a creature that is exiled instead doesn’t “die.” Abilities that would trigger when it dies won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If Isareth leaves the battlefield, the replacement effect continues to apply. If one of the creatures it returned would leave the battlefield, it’ll be exiled instead.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a card in your graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you somehow remove a corpse counter from a creature Isareth has returned to the battlefield, the replacement effect that will exile it continues to apply. The counter is only to help remind you which creatures will be exiled if they would leave the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Isareth’s triggered ability goes on the stack without a target. While that ability is resolving, you may pay {X}. When you do, a second ability triggers and you pick a target creature card to return. This is different from abilities that say “If you do . . .” in that players may cast spells and activate abilities after mana is paid and the target creature card is chosen, but before that card is returned.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until it’s removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a creature you control may become lethal if Heavenly Blademaster leaves the battlefield during that turn or if an Aura or Equipment is removed from it.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You can’t try to attach an Aura or Equipment to Heavenly Blademaster if that Aura or Equipment can’t legally be attached to it.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You don’t move any Auras or Equipment until Heavenly Blademaster’s triggered ability is resolving. If Heavenly Blademaster is no longer on the battlefield, the Auras and Equipment you intended to attach to it remain as they were.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Casting an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can’t cast it multiple times.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a nonland card has multiple types, such as an artifact creature, you may cast it as either of those types. For example, you could cast one artifact creature as your artifact card and another artifact creature as your creature card.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs, such as evoke costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Tormenting Voice, those must be paid to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you exile a land with another card type, you can’t play it later in the turn. You can only put it onto the battlefield at the time Aminatou’s Augury instructs you to.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you wish to put a land card onto the battlefield, you do so while Aminatou’s Augury is resolving, before you’re allowed to cast any of the other cards. You may do this even if you’ve already played a land this turn.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions of each spell you cast.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If Sower of Discord is dealt lethal damage at the same time that one of the chosen players is dealt damage, its ability will cause the second player to lose life.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If Sower of Discord’s controller is dealt damage that causes them to lose the game at the same time that either of the chosen players is dealt damage, Sower of Discord’s triggered ability won’t resolve and the other chosen player won’t lose life.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Sower of Discord’s triggered ability causes the second player to lose life. This isn’t damage and it’s not caused by the source that dealt damage to the first player.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You must choose two different players. You can be one of those players.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If Xantcha can’t attack for any reason (such as being tapped or having come under that player’s control that turn), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having it attack, the player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a player creates a token that’s a copy of Xantcha, the player who creates the token is its owner, not the player under whose control it enters the battlefield. This is a change from previous rules.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The player who draws a card when Xantcha’s last ability resolves is the player who activated the ability.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Xantcha’s controller may activate its last ability. In this case, the same player loses 2 life and draws a card.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Xantcha’s first ability is a replacement effect that modifies how it enters the battlefield, not a triggered ability. Players can’t take actions (such as activating its last ability) while Xantcha’s on the battlefield before it’s controlled by another player.'}, {'date': '2019-08-23', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if Xantcha’s owner leaves the game, Xantcha leaves the game with them. If Xantcha’s controller leaves the game, Xantcha is exiled. This is a change from previous rulings due to Xantcha’s updated wording.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the target commander is somehow a creature and a planeswalker, most likely because it’s Gideon, it receives both kinds of counters.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the target commander is somehow neither a creature nor a planeswalker (such as Arixmethes, Slumbering Isle may be), it receives no counters.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the target creature is a legal target but can’t be destroyed, most likely because it has indestructible, its controller gets an Ox token and gets to keep that creature.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Transmogrifying Wand’s ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn’t resolve. No player creates an Ox token.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you don’t control your commander as the lieutenant ability resolves, you won’t get its effect.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you have multiple commanders, you need to control only one for the lieutenant effect to happen.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Loyal Unicorn’s effect will prevent all combat damage that would be dealt to creatures you control, even if those creatures weren’t on the battlefield or weren’t creatures when the effect resolved.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Once Loyal Unicorn’s lieutenant ability has resolved while you control your commander, its effects persist this turn even if you lose control of your commander or Loyal Unicorn.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The lieutenant effect happens only once each combat, even if you somehow control multiple commanders (perhaps because you have two commanders with a partner ability from the Battlebond™ set).'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you don’t control your commander as the lieutenant ability resolves, you won’t get its effect.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you have multiple commanders, you need to control only one for the lieutenant effect to happen.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The lieutenant effect happens only once each combat, even if you somehow control multiple commanders (perhaps because you have two commanders with a partner ability from the Battlebond™ set).'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Satyr Enchanter’s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Lands you control won\'t lose any other abilities they had. They also won\'t gain or lose any land types."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Murmuring Mystic\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}]', "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Because tokens aren’t cards, they never count for undergrowth abilities.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Creature cards with other types, such as artifact creature cards, count for undergrowth abilities.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Activating the second ability of Rogue\'s Passage after a creature has become blocked won\'t cause that creature to become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "If you activate Deranged Assistant\'s ability while casting a spell, you can\'t choose to rewind the ability once you see the card that was put into your graveyard."}]', "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Any damage dealt to you by a Human will cause Mikaeus’s ability to trigger, including noncombat damage dealt to you by a Human and damage dealt to you by a Human you control.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a Human deals damage to you at the same time that Mikaeus is dealt lethal damage, Mikaeus’s triggered ability triggers. That Human will be destroyed even though Mikaeus has left the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a non-Human creature you control without a +1/+1 counter dies at the same time as Mikaeus, that creature’s undying ability granted by Mikaeus triggers and will return it to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'The +1/+1 bonus that Mikaeus gives to other non-Human creatures you control isn’t a counter. It won’t prevent undying from triggering.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If Shirei leaves the battlefield and returns to the battlefield after a creature with power 1 or less is put into your graveyard, Shirei is considered a new object. The delayed triggered ability won’t return the creature to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Shirei’s ability can’t return any creatures that died before Shirei entered the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Shirei’s ability only triggers if the creature’s power immediately before leaving the battlefield is 1 or less, regardless of its power in your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Shirei’s ability triggers if a creature you own with power 1 or less dies under another player’s control.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If Squee isn’t in your graveyard as your upkeep begins, its ability won’t trigger. You can’t take any actions during your turn before your upkeep begins.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Rise from the Tides is still on the stack while you count the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard. It doesn’t count itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'The damage dealt by Balefire Dragon’s triggered ability isn’t combat damage.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': \'You draw two cards and discard two cards all while Frantic Search is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "You choose which lands to untap as the spell resolves. They aren\'t targeted, and they don\'t have to be lands that you control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "If Judith dies at the same time as one or more other nontoken creatures you control, Judith\'s ability triggers for each of them."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "If your life total is brought to 0 or less at the same time that nontoken creatures you control are dealt lethal damage, you lose the game before Judith\'s triggered ability goes on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Judith\'s last ability triggers when Judith dies if it\'s not a token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': \'An ability of a permanent that triggers when a card is put into a graveyard “from anywhere” triggers twice only if Teysa and that permanent are both still on the battlefield immediately after the creature has died.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "An ability that triggers on an event that causes a creature to die doesn\'t trigger twice. For example, an ability that triggers “whenever you sacrifice a creature” triggers only once."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a creature “leaves the battlefield” will trigger twice if that creature leaves the battlefield by dying.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': \'If a creature dying at the same time as Teysa (including Teysa itself dying) causes a triggered ability of a permanent you control to trigger, that ability triggers an additional time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': \'If a creature dying at the same time that another permanent you control leaves the battlefield causes a triggered ability of that permanent to trigger, that ability triggers an additional time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': \'If you somehow control two Teysas, a creature dying causes abilities to trigger three times, not four. A third Teysa causes abilities to trigger four times, a fourth causes abilities to trigger five times, and so on. This also means that if you control Teysa and cast a second one, an ability that triggers when it dies due to the “legend rule” triggers three times.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': \'Look at each creature as it exists on the battlefield, taking into account continuous effects, to determine whether any triggered abilities will trigger multiple times. For example, if a land that has become a creature dies, an ability that triggers when it dies triggers twice.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Teysa affects a creature\'s own “when this creature dies” triggered abilities as well as other triggered abilities that trigger when that creature dies. Such triggered abilities start with “when” or “whenever.”"}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Teysa\'s effect doesn\'t copy the triggered ability; it just causes the ability to trigger twice. Any choices made as you put the ability onto the stack, such as modes and targets, are made separately for each instance of the ability. Any choices made on resolution, such as whether to pay a cost for that triggered ability, are also made separately."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "The trigger event doesn\'t have to specifically refer to “creatures.” In these cases, the trigger event may also refer to something being “put into a graveyard from the battlefield.” For example, an ability that triggers “whenever an artifact is put into a graveyard from the battlefield” would trigger twice if an artifact creature dies while Teysa Karlov is on the battlefield."}]', "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'Because blockers are chosen all at once, you can’t block with a creature with afterlife, wait for it to die, then block with the resulting Spirit tokens.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'If an opponent is instructed to draw multiple cards, that player draws all of them before deciding how many times to pay for Smothering Tithe’s triggered ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "An ability that turns a land into a creature also sets that creature\'s power and toughness. If the land was already a creature (for example, if it was the target of Awakening of Vitu-Ghazi), this will overwrite the previous effect that set its power and toughness. Effects that modify its power or toughness will continue to apply no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change its power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters) and effects that switch its power and toughness. For example, if Mobilized District has been made a 0/0 creature with nine +1/+1 counters on it, activating its last ability will turn it into a 12/12 Citizen creature that\'s still a land."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If Mobilized District becomes a creature the same turn it enters the battlefield, you can\'t attack with it or activate its mana ability."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If you control four or more legendary permanents that are creatures and/or planeswalkers, the last ability of Mobilized District costs no mana to activate. A legendary planeswalker that\'s also a creature reduces this cost by only {1}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "An activation cost of {X}{X} means that you pay twice X. If you want X to be 3, you pay {6} to activate Blast Zone\'s ability."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Tokens that aren\'t a copy of something else don\'t have a mana cost. Anything without a mana cost normally has a mana value of 0."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Army is a new creature type. It\'s possible to control a nontoken Army (perhaps a creature with the changeling ability) and, through combinations of other cards, it\'s possible to control multiple Army tokens. When instructed to amass, you may put +1/+1 counters on any of your Army creatures, and you may choose a different one each time."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If the token\'s power changes later in the turn after it has attacked, including while Dreadhorde Invasion\'s second ability is on the stack, it won\'t cause the token to gain or lose lifelink."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control an Army, the Zombie Army token that you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Some cards that cause you to amass also provide bonuses to “Zombie tokens.” These affect any token that happens to be a Zombie, not just a Zombie Army you\'ve amassed."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "The power of the Zombie token is checked only immediately after it attacks. Any other abilities that trigger when creatures you control attack won\'t have resolved yet."}]', "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A colorless spell whose mana cost is {2} or {1} will cost {0} to cast.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A land normally has no color, even if it can produce one or more colors of mana.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an effect such as that of Doubling Season causes Ugin to create two Spirit tokens, you still only exile one card from your library. You’ll put that card into your hand the first time that either of the tokens leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the Spirit leaves the battlefield for any reason, you’ll put the exiled card into your hand, even if Ugin left the battlefield before that happened.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you’ve activated Ugin’s ability multiple times, you must keep track of which exiled card belongs to each Spirit token.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Once you look at the exiled face-down card once, you may look at it again any time you wish. If another player gains control of the Spirit token, that player can’t look at the exiled card.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Ugin). The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A planeswalker that becomes a creature due to Sarkhan’s first loyalty ability can’t attack unless you’ve controlled it continuously since your turn began.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Once Sarkhan’s first loyalty ability has resolved, each planeswalker you control (including Sarkhan) is no longer a planeswalker for the rest of the turn. They don’t lose any loyalty counters or abilities, and you can still activate their loyalty abilities if you haven’t done so yet this turn. They don’t lose loyalty if they’re dealt damage while they’re not planeswalkers.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A split card that’s both an instant and a sorcery is counted only once for Cyclops Electromancer’s ability.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard is counted only as Cyclops Electromancer’s ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied permanent will trigger when Spark Double enters the battlefield. Any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen permanent will also work.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Spark Double somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another permanent, it can’t become a copy of that permanent. You may choose only a creature or planeswalker that’s already on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If it copies a planeswalker, Spark Double enters with the appropriate number of loyalty counters as printed on the card plus one. If it copies a creature, Spark Double enters with a +1/+1 counter on it, plus any counters that will be put on it from abilities it copied and other abilities of other objects.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the chosen permanent is a token, Spark Double copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created the token. Spark Double doesn’t become a token in this case.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the chosen permanent is copying something else (for example, if the chosen permanent is another Spark Double), then Spark Double enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen permanent copied.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the copied permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the copied permanent is affected by a type-changing effect, Spark Double may enter the battlefield with different permanent types than the copied permanent currently has. Use the characteristics of Spark Double as it enters the battlefield, not of the copied permanent, to determine whether it enters with an additional counter on it. Notably, if Spark Double copies a Gideon planeswalker that’s a creature because its loyalty ability caused it to become a planeswalker creature, Spark Double enters as a noncreature planeswalker and doesn’t get a +1/+1 counter. On the other hand, if Spark Double copies Gideon Blackblade during your turn, Spark Double enters as a planeswalker creature and gets both kinds of counters.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Spark Double copies exactly what was printed on the original permanent (unless that permanent is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn’t copy whether that permanent is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or any Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Spark Double isn’t legendary if it copies a legendary permanent, and this exception is copiable. If something else copies Spark Double later, that copy also won’t be legendary. If you control two or more permanents with the same name but only one is legendary, the “legend rule” doesn’t apply.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Because Mowu’s replacement effect affects only Mowu, it will apply if Mowu somehow enters the battlefield with one or more +1/+1 counters on it and give Mowu an additional +1/+1 counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Both mana produced by Interplanar Beacon’s last ability may be spent on the same planeswalker spell, or each may be spent on different planeswalker spells.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Interplanar Beacon’s first ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Flux Channeler’s ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a permanent has +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it, they’re removed in pairs as a state-based action so that the permanent has only one of those kinds of counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Players can respond to a spell or ability whose effect includes proliferating. Once that spell or ability starts to resolve, however, and its controller chooses which permanents and players will get new counters, it’s too late for anyone to respond.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To proliferate, you can choose any permanent that has a counter, including ones controlled by opponents. You can’t choose cards in any zone other than the battlefield, even if they have counters on them.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You don’t have to choose every permanent or player that has a counter, only the ones you want to add another counter to. Since “any number” includes zero, you don’t have to choose any permanents at all, and you don’t have to choose any players at all.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If The Wanderer would be dealt lethal damage at the same time as you and/or other permanents you control would be dealt noncombat damage, the damage that would be dealt to you and your other permanents is prevented.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If X is 10 or more, the creature card you just put onto the battlefield will get +X/+X and haste.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a creature card in your library or graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you don’t find a creature card with converted mana cost X or less, creatures you control still get +X/+X and gain haste if X is 10 or more.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'No player may take action between the time you reveal which creature card you’ll put onto the battlefield and the time it gets +X/+X and haste if X is 10 or more. Any abilities that trigger as it enters the battlefield will be put onto the stack after your creatures get +X/+X and haste.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'If an effect begins to apply to the target artifact before it becomes a copy of another permanent, that effect will continue to apply.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If the target artifact becomes a creature the same turn it enters the battlefield, you can\'t attack with it or use any of its {T} abilities unless it has haste."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If the target artifact copies a permanent that\'s copying something else, it will become whatever the target is copying."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'If the target artifact is an Equipment attached to a creature and it becomes a copy of a non-Equipment permanent, it becomes unattached. If it becomes a copy of an Equipment, it remains attached.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If the target artifact isn\'t an Equipment and becomes a copy of an Equipment, it\'ll become unattached when it becomes a non-Equipment artifact again."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Saheeli\'s first ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Saheeli\'s loyalty ability causes the target artifact to copy the printed values of the target permanent, plus any copy effects that have been applied to it. It won\'t copy counters on that permanent or effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on. Notably, it won\'t copy effects that made the target permanent become a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'The target artifact is an artifact in addition to whatever types the second target has, and this exception is copiable. If something else copies the artifact later in the turn, that copy also will be an artifact.\'}]', "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an opponent hasn’t drawn any cards in a turn and a spell or ability instructs that player to draw multiple cards, that player will just draw one card. However, if the draws are optional, the player can’t choose to draw, even if they could draw one card this way.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Narset will “see” cards drawn by opponents earlier in the turn she entered the battlefield, although Narset can’t affect cards drawn before she entered the battlefield. For example, if an opponent draws two cards, then Narset enters the battlefield, that opponent can’t draw more cards that turn, but the two drawn cards are unaffected.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Replacement effects (such as that of Underrealm Lich or the first ability of Jace, Wielder of Mysteries) can’t be used to replace draws that Narset disallows. However, if an opponent’s first draw is replaced (by Underrealm Lich’s ability, for example), that draw didn’t happen and Narset won’t stop the next draw (which may also be replaced by Underrealm Lich’s ability).'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Your opponents can each draw a maximum of one card each on each player’s turn. Subsequent card draws during that turn are ignored.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You may choose Pollenbright Druid as the target of its own ability.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a permanent has +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it, they’re removed in pairs as a state-based action so that the permanent has only one of those kinds of counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Players can respond to a spell or ability whose effect includes proliferating. Once that spell or ability starts to resolve, however, and its controller chooses which permanents and players will get new counters, it’s too late for anyone to respond.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To proliferate, you can choose any permanent that has a counter, including ones controlled by opponents. You can’t choose cards in any zone other than the battlefield, even if they have counters on them.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You don’t have to choose every permanent or player that has a counter, only the ones you want to add another counter to. Since “any number” includes zero, you don’t have to choose any permanents at all, and you don’t have to choose any players at all.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "Exclude can target a creature spell that can\'t be countered. When Exclude resolves, that spell won\'t be countered, but you\'ll still draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Generous Gift tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. No player creates an Elephant. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), its controller does create an Elephant."}]', "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'A permanent gaining protection may cause a spell or ability on the stack to have an illegal target. As a spell or ability tries to resolve, if all its targets are illegal, that spell or ability doesn’t resolve. None of its effects happen, including effects unrelated to the target. If at least one target is still legal, the spell or ability does as much as it can to the remaining legal targets, and its other effects still happen.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Protection from a color means that the target creature can’t be blocked by creatures of that color, can’t be the target of spells of that color or abilities from sources of that color, can’t be enchanted or equipped by Auras or Equipment of that color, and all damage that sources of that color would deal to it is prevented. Nothing other than these events is prevented or illegal.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The legality of a spell’s targets is checked only as that spell begins to resolve. If Shelter gives the targeted creature protection from white, you’ll still draw a card.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'You can’t choose “artifact” or “colorless” as Shelter asks you to choose a color, since those are not colors.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to other creatures you control of the chosen type may become lethal if Morophon leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Cost reduction effects are applied after other cost modifiers, so Morophon can reduce additional costs or alternative costs of spells of the chosen type.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a spell has hybrid mana symbols in its mana cost, you choose which half you will be paying before determining the total cost. For example, if a spell of the chosen type costs {2}{W/U}{W/U}, you may choose for the cost to be {2}{W}{U} and then reduce it to {2}.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Morophon’s effect reduces the total cost by up to one mana of each color. For example, if a spell of the chosen type costs {4}{R}{W}{W}, it will cost {4}{W} after applying Morophon’s effect.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'You must choose an existing creature type, such as Sliver or Warrior. Card types such as artifact, and supertypes such as legendary or snow, can’t be chosen.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Damage dealt by the Sliver due to its triggered ability isn’t combat damage, even if it was combat damage that caused that ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a Sliver is dealt damage by multiple sources at once (such as by two creatures blocking it), its ability triggers once and one target is dealt that much damage.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The ability granted by Spiteful Sliver will trigger even if the Sliver is dealt lethal damage. For example, if a 2/2 Sliver blocks a 7/7 creature, the Sliver’s ability will trigger and it will deal 7 damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If Cloudshredder Sliver leaves the battlefield during combat, any attacking Slivers that came under your control this turn will continue to attack, even though they will no longer have haste.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word "draw," Fists of Flame\\\'s effect doesn\\\'t count them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Fists of Flame tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. You won\'t draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "The bonus that the target creature receives is locked in as Fists of Flame resolves, counting the card drawn during its first effect. The creature won\'t get an additional +1/+0 if you draw another card later in the turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "If Drakuseth attacks a planeswalker and that planeswalker is reduced to 0 loyalty from the damage caused by Drakuseth\'s ability, Drakuseth continues to attack. It can be blocked, and it won\'t deal any combat damage if it\'s not blocked."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose the same target multiple times to have it be dealt 6, 7, or 10 damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "If you cast an Aura spell targeting an opponent\'s permanent, you still control the Aura after it resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "Kykar\'s triggered ability will resolve before the spell that caused it to trigger but after targets have been chosen for that spell, so the Spirit that will be created can\'t be a target of that spell. Kykar\'s ability resolves even if that spell is countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "You must choose an existing creature type, such as Vampire or Warrior. Card types (such as artifact) and supertypes (such as legendary) can\'t be chosen."}]', "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'A player may have more than one of Chandra’s emblems. Each one’s ability triggers separately.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'A spell or ability that counters spells can still target Chandra. When that spell or ability resolves, Chandra won’t be countered, but any additional effects of that spell or ability will still happen.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Emblems aren’t permanents and can’t be exiled or destroyed. Once you have an emblem, there’s no way to remove it.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If Chandra’s last ability doesn’t deal damage (most likely because the damage has been prevented in some way), the target won’t be exiled if it would die.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If you leave a multiplayer game, your opponents keep any emblems Chandra gave them. Each opponent owns the emblem Chandra gives them. In multiplayer, your opponents continue to burn after you and Chandra leave the game.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Chandra’s first ability grants an emblem to each opponent. The opposing team will be dealt 1 damage twice during their upkeep.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'The ability of Chandra’s emblem triggers at the beginning of the upkeep of the player who gets the emblem, not the upkeep of Chandra’s controller.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'The replacement effect of Chandra’s last ability will exile the target creature or planeswalker if it would die this turn for any reason, not just due to lethal damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keyword abilities, such as equip, are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text. You can’t spend mana added by this ability to pay costs of triggered abilities of artifacts such as the first ability of Chandra’s Regulator.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'The mana generated by Renowned Weaponsmith’s first ability can’t be spent to activate abilities of artifact sources that aren’t on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until it’s removed as the turn ends, lethal damage dealt to other creatures you control with flying may cause them to be destroyed if Sephara leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying (such as Sephara’s alternative cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'To pay Sephara’s alternative cost, you may tap any untapped creatures you control with flying, including ones you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': \'Because you never "cast" a land card, Mystic Forge doesn\\\'t allow you to play an artifact land from the top of your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "If the top card of your library changes while you\'re casting a spell, playing a land, or activating an ability, you can\'t look at the new top card until you finish doing so. This means that if you cast the top card of your library, you can\'t look at the next one until you\'re done paying for that spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "If the top card of your library has a morph ability, you can cast it face down from the top of your library, even if it\'s normally not a colorless card."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "Mystic Forge lets you look at the top card of your library whenever you want (with one restriction—see below), even if you don\'t have priority. This action doesn\'t use the stack. Knowing what that card is becomes part of the information you have access to, just like you can look at the cards in your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': \'You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions of the spells you cast from your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': \'You still pay all costs for a spell you cast from your library, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs.\'}]', "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Copies are created even if the spell or ability that caused Repeated Reverberation’s ability to trigger has been countered by the time that ability resolves. The copies resolve before the original spell or ability.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Copying a loyalty ability doesn’t add or remove loyalty counters from any object.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If the spell or ability that’s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast, the copies will have the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copies will have the same mode or modes. You can’t choose different ones.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If you cast one Repeated Reverberation after another, you’ll copy the second Repeated Reverberation twice. Each resolves, creating three delayed triggered abilities. The next spell you cast or loyalty ability you activate after that will be copied six times. If that spell is also a Repeated Reverberation, the following spell or ability will be copied fourteen times. A fourth Repeated Reverberation will copy the next spell or ability thirty times. Reverberations repeated beyond that shall be left as an exercise for the reader.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Repeated Reverberation’s ability will copy any instant or sorcery spell or loyalty ability, not just one with targets.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'The copies made by Repeated Reverberation’s ability are created on the stack, so they’re not “cast” or “activated.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell or activate an ability don’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'The copies will have the same targets as the spell or ability they’re copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. The new targets must be legal.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'You can’t choose to pay any additional costs for the copies. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copies too.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Heart-Piercer Bow (not the equipped creature) is the source of the triggered ability and the source of the damage. This means that a creature with protection from green may be targeted even if Heart-Piercer Bow is equipped to a green creature, but a creature with protection from artifacts may not.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If a creature is attacking a planeswalker, the controller of that planeswalker is the defending player.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "If Scaretiller becomes tapped while casting a spell or activating an ability, that spell or ability resolves after Scaretiller\'s triggered ability has resolved."}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "Neither mode of Scaretiller\'s ability counts as playing a land. It can put a land card onto the battlefield even if you\'ve already played your land for the turn, and even if it\'s not your turn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "Scaretiller\'s ability is a triggered ability, not an activated ability. It doesn\'t allow you to tap it whenever you want; rather, you need some other way of tapping it, such as by attacking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "You can activate Idol of Oblivion\'s first ability even if the token you\'ve created was created before Idol of Oblivion entered the battlefield or if the token has left the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': \'If a card in a graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "If the target card is an illegal target by the time Sevinne\'s Reclamation tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. You won\'t copy it if you cast it from a graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "If you cast Sevinne\'s Reclamation from your graveyard, any abilities that trigger as the permanent card returns to the battlefield will resolve before the copy of Sevinne\'s Reclamation resolves but after new targets for the copy have been chosen."}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': \'The copy that Sevinne\\\'s Reclamation creates is created on the stack, so it\\\'s not "cast." Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\\\'t trigger. The copy wasn\\\'t cast from a graveyard, so it won\\\'t make another copy of itself.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', "[{'date': '2019-08-23', 'text': 'If one or more creatures you control deal combat damage to players at the same time that lethal damage is dealt to Ohran Frostfang, its ability triggers for each of those creatures.'}, {'date': '2019-08-23', 'text': 'Snow is a supertype, not a card type. It has no rules meaning or function by itself, but other cards and abilities may refer to it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "A permanent that\'s both an artifact and an enchantment is counted only once."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because All That Glitters is an enchantment, the enchanted creature usually gets at least +1/+1.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You still control Auras that you put onto the battlefield attached to a permanent you don\'t control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An adventurer card is a creature card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Giant Killer is a white creature card whose mana value is 1. It can\'t be the target of the triggered ability of Mystic Sanctuary."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a creature spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a creature later."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a creature spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if Giant Killer is exiled with the last ability of Vivien, Champion of the Wilds, you can\'t cast it as Chop Down."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Beanstalk Giant\'s power and toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the creature spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Once The Great Henge\'s last ability has triggered, you\'ll draw a card even if you can\'t put a +1/+1 counter on the creature for some reason (most likely because it has left the battlefield)."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Once you announce that you\'re casting a spell, no player may take actions until the spell has been paid for. Notably, opponents can\'t try to change by how much a relic\'s cost is reduced."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Once you determine the cost to cast The Great Henge, you may activate mana abilities to pay that cost. If the greatest power among creatures you control changes while activating mana abilities, the cost to cast The Great Henge remains what you previously determined.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The cost reduction ability reduces only the generic mana in the relic\'s cost. The colored mana must still be paid."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'The first step of casting a spell is to move it to the stack. If this causes the greatest power among creatures you control to change, that new power will be used to determine the cost reduction.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'As the first mode is performed, first the player whose turn it is chooses a card in hand without revealing it, then each other player in turn order does the same. Then all the chosen cards are discarded at the same time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'As the third mode is performed, first the player whose turn it chooses a creature they control, then each other player in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Then all the chosen creatures are sacrificed at the same time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'For each chosen mode, perform that mode in its entirety before continuing on to the next chosen mode in the order printed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you really want, you can choose zero modes for Rankle\'s triggered ability, but carefully consider the hidden costs in not entertaining someone titled Master of Pranks."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Rankle\'s second mode causes each team to lose 1 life twice."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'You can choose a mode even if some or all players will be unaffected.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose a mode more than once."}]', "[{'date': '2019-10-04', 'text': 'The equipped creature has vigilance even if Mace of the Valiant has no charge counters on it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "A spell or ability that counters spells can still target spells that can\'t be countered. When that spell or ability resolves, the uncounterable spell won\'t be countered, but any additional effects of the countering spell or ability will still happen."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Destiny Spinner\'s activated ability doesn\'t untap the land that becomes a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Destiny Spinner\'s first ability applies only while it\'s on the battlefield. While it\'s a spell, it can be countered."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If you activate Destiny Spinner\'s ability more than once in a turn, the value of X may be different each time. If you choose the same land as the target more than once, the most recent effect (and most recent value of X) applies."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If you control no enchantments at the time Destiny Spinner\'s activated ability resolves, the land becomes a 0/0 creature and is put into its owner\'s graveyard unless another effect is raising its toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined only as Destiny Spinner\'s activated ability resolves. Once that happens, the creature\'s base power and toughness won\'t change later in the turn even if the number of enchantments you control changes."}]', "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'A chapter ability doesn’t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter’s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won’t trigger again.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Each symbol on the left of a Saga’s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability’s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won’t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities, the Saga’s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Removing lore counters won’t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger. If lore counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'A constellation ability triggers whenever an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. Enchantments with other card types, such as enchantment creatures, will also cause constellation abilities to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "An Aura spell that has an illegal target when it tries to resolve doesn\'t resolve and is instead put into its owner\'s graveyard. It doesn\'t enter the battlefield, so constellation abilities don\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If Setessan Champion leaves the battlefield after its ability has triggered, you still draw a card even though you won\'t put a +1/+1 counter on Setessan Champion."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'A constellation ability triggers whenever an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. Enchantments with other card types, such as enchantment creatures, will also cause constellation abilities to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "An Aura spell that has an illegal target when it tries to resolve doesn\'t resolve and is instead put into its owner\'s graveyard. It doesn\'t enter the battlefield, so constellation abilities don\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'Multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.\'}]', "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'A constellation ability triggers whenever an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. Enchantments with other card types, such as enchantment creatures, will also cause constellation abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'An Aura spell that has an illegal target when it tries to resolve doesn’t resolve and is instead put into its owner’s graveyard. It doesn’t enter the battlefield, so constellation abilities don’t trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'A noncreature enchantment with a +1/+1 counter on it will be unaffected by that counter until it becomes a creature, at which time it will get +1/+1 for that counter.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'As a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color will determine whether any replacement effects that affect creatures entering the battlefield apply to that God. Because replacement effects are considered before the God is on the battlefield, the mana symbols in its mana cost won’t be counted when determining this.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Counters put on a God remain on it while it’s not a creature, even if they have no effect.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, Heliod’s ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Heliod can be the target of its own triggered ability.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Heliod’s triggered ability triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it’s 1 life from Daxos, Blessed by the Sun or 3 life from Cling to Dust. If you gain an amount of life “for each” of something or “equal to the number” of something, that life is gained as one event and Heliod’s ability triggers only once.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a God is attacking or blocking and it stops being a creature, it will be removed from combat. It won’t rejoin combat if it resumes being a creature later during that combat.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a God stops being a creature, it loses the type creature and the creature type God. It continues to be a legendary enchantment.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a creature is dealt lethal damage at the same time that you gain life, it can’t receive a counter from Heliod’s ability in time to save it.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it’s still on the battlefield at that time.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an effect causes a God to lose all abilities, its ability that causes it to stop being a creature still applies if appropriate.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you put an Aura on an opponent’s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won’t cause the ability to trigger, even though it caused your team’s life total to increase.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The abilities of Gods function as long as they’re on the battlefield, regardless of whether they’re creatures.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The type-changing ability that can make a God not be a creature functions only on the battlefield. It’s always a creature card in other zones, regardless of your devotion to its color. It’s always a creature spell while it’s on the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'When a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color (including the mana symbols in the mana cost of the God itself) will determine if a creature entered the battlefield or not for abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'A spell or ability that counters spells can still target spells you control with converted mana cost 5 or greater. When that spell or ability resolves, your spell won’t be countered, but any additional effects of the countering spell or ability will still happen.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'For spells with {X} in their mana costs, use the value chosen for X to determine the spell’s converted mana cost.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Thryx enters the battlefield while a spell with converted mana cost 5 or greater that you cast is on the stack, that spell can’t be countered, even though you don’t get the {1} discount.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Players can’t attempt to remove Thryx to raise the cost of a spell you wish to cast, but they can remove it to allow their spells and abilities to counter your spells.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Thryx’s last ability doesn’t apply to itself while it’s a spell.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Thryx). The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'As a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color will determine whether any replacement effects that affect creatures entering the battlefield apply to that God. Because replacement effects are considered before the God is on the battlefield, the mana symbols in its mana cost won’t be counted when determining this.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Counters put on a God remain on it while it’s not a creature, even if they have no effect.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Erebos’s last ability can target the creature you’ll sacrifice to pay its cost. In this case, the ability won’t resolve, but Erebos’s triggered ability will trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a God is attacking or blocking and it stops being a creature, it will be removed from combat. It won’t rejoin combat if it resumes being a creature later during that combat.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a God stops being a creature, it loses the type creature and the creature type God. It continues to be a legendary enchantment.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it’s still on the battlefield at that time.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an effect causes a God to lose all abilities, its ability that causes it to stop being a creature still applies if appropriate.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If one or more creatures you control die at the same time as Erebos, its triggered ability triggers for each of those creatures.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you put an Aura on an opponent’s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The abilities of Gods function as long as they’re on the battlefield, regardless of whether they’re creatures.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The type-changing ability that can make a God not be a creature functions only on the battlefield. It’s always a creature card in other zones, regardless of your devotion to its color. It’s always a creature spell while it’s on the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'When a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color (including the mana symbols in the mana cost of the God itself) will determine if a creature entered the battlefield or not for abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'While resolving Erebos’s triggered ability, you can’t pay more than 2 life to draw more than one card.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist. When the card returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the card that was exiled.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an Aura is being put onto the battlefield at the same time as an enchantment creature, that Aura can’t enchant that creature.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an Aura is put onto the battlefield without being cast, the Aura’s controller-to-be chooses what it will enchant as it comes back onto the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn’t target anything (so it could be attached to an opponent’s permanent with hexproof, for example), but the Aura’s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If the Aura can’t legally be attached to anything, it remains in its current zone.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the target enchantment you control leaves the battlefield or otherwise becomes an illegal target before Calix’s second ability resolves, the target permanent you don’t control won’t be exiled.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Blood Aspirant can be sacrificed to pay for the cost of its own last ability.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Blood Aspirant’s first ability is a triggered ability, not an activated ability. It doesn’t allow you to sacrifice a permanent whenever you want; rather, you need some other way of sacrificing permanents, such as its second ability.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Blood Aspirant’s last ability tries to resolve, the ability won’t resolve. The creature can block as normal. If the target is legal but not dealt damage (most likely because of a prevention effect), it can’t block this turn.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you sacrifice a permanent as part of casting a spell or activating an ability, Blood Aspirant’s first ability will resolve before that spell or ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Anax dies at the same time as another nontoken creature you control, its ability triggers for each of them.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it’s still on the battlefield at that time.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you create a token that’s a copy of Anax, its last ability triggers when it dies.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you put an Aura on an opponent’s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The ability that defines Anax’s power works in all zones, not just the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'To determine whether you create two tokens, check the power of the creature that died immediately before it died.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Dryad of the Ilysian Grove’s first ability is cumulative if you control more than one. It’s also cumulative with other effects that let you play additional lands, such as the one from Escape to the Wilds.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Each land you control will have the land types Plains, Island, Swamp, Mountain, and Forest. They’ll also have the mana ability of each basic land type (for example, Forests have “{T}: Add {G}.”). They’ll still have their other subtypes and abilities.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Giving a land additional basic land types doesn’t change its name or whether it’s legendary or basic.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Ilysian Caryatid’s activated ability is a mana ability. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Creatures your opponents control attacking one of your opponents will cause Frontier Warmonger\'s ability to trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "It doesn\'t matter whose commander you control. Any one will do. If you have two commanders, you just need to control one of them."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Once you begin casting this spell, players can\'t take any other actions until you\'re done casting it. Notably, they can\'t try to remove the commander you control to make you pay its cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Once you announce that you\'re activating the last ability of Bonders\' Enclave, no player may take actions until you\'ve finished activating it. Notably, opponents can\'t try to change whether you control a creature with power 4 or greater."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Once you\'ve activated the last ability of Bonders\' Enclave, it doesn\'t check again at any point whether you control a creature with power 4 or greater."}]', "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'A creature with 0 power isn’t destroyed unless it has at least 1 damage marked on it.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'A creature with 0 toughness is put into its owner’s graveyard. This state-based action isn’t a consequence of damage, so Zilortha doesn’t affect it.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Any time the game is checking whether damage is lethal or if a creature should be destroyed for having lethal damage marked on it, use the power of your creatures rather than their toughness to check the damage against. This includes being assigned trample damage, damage from Flame Spill, and so on.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a creature you control may become lethal if Zilortha enters or leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Because it’s a loyalty ability, Narset’s first ability isn’t a mana ability. It can be activated only any time you could cast a sorcery. It uses the stack and can be responded to.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a card you discard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Narset’s second ability goes on the stack without a target. While that ability is resolving, you draw a card and may choose to discard a card. When you discard a nonland card this way, the reflexive triggered ability triggers and you pick a target to be dealt damage. This is different from effects that say “If you do . . .” in that you choose a target after looking at the card you draw and players can respond to the reflexive triggered ability knowing how much damage will be dealt.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The emblem created by Narset’s last ability is colorless. The damage it deals is from a colorless source.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You can discard a card even if Narset leaves the battlefield before her middle ability resolves. The reflexive triggered ability will still trigger if you discard a nonland card.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Excess damage caused by a spell or ability is similar to how combat damage from a creature with trample is handled. Start with the amount of damage being dealt to the creature and determine what is “lethal.” This is the creature’s toughness minus the amount of damage that it already has marked on it, but ignoring any replacement or prevention effects that will modify this damage. Also ignore whether the creature has an ability such as indestructible that will result in it not being destroyed by this damage.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If either creature is an illegal target as Ram Through tries to resolve, the creature you control won’t deal damage to any creature or player.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the target creature you control has deathtouch, 1 damage from it is lethal.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once you’ve determined how much damage is excess, the creature you control simultaneously deals damage to the creature and to its controller. This damage may be modified by replacement or prevention effects.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Cartographer’s Hawk leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, you can’t return it to its owner’s hand from its new zone.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'If one or more creatures you control die at the same time that Bastion of Remembrance leaves the battlefield, its last ability triggers for each of those creatures.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'If your life total is brought to 0 or less at the same time that creatures you control are dealt lethal damage, you lose the game before the last ability goes on the stack.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Bastion of Remembrance\'s last ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life and you to gain 1 life."}]', "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If one player controls more than one Bonder’s Ornament, that player draws just one card while resolving its second ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the target spell has a variable number of targets, you can’t change how many targets it has.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the target spell has damage divided as it was cast (like Mythos of Vadrok), the division can’t be changed although the targets receiving that damage still can. The same is true of spells that distribute counters.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you choose new targets for the target spell, the new targets must be legal.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'It doesn’t matter whose commander you control. Any one will do. If you have two commanders, you just need to control one of them.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once you begin casting this spell, players can’t take any other actions until you’re done casting it. Notably, they can’t try to remove the commander you control to make you pay its cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you choose the first mode and the creature gains a counter in response, you can’t remove counters from it instead; the spell just doesn’t resolve. Similarly, if you choose the second mode and the creature loses its counters in response, you can’t destroy it instead.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you choose the second mode for Heartless Act, you choose which counters to remove from the creature, no matter who controls the creature. You may choose counters of different kinds.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Serrated Scorpion’s ability causes the opposing team to lose 4 life and you to gain 2 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'It doesn’t matter whose commander you control. Any one will do. If you have two commanders, you just need to control one of them.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once you begin casting this spell, players can’t take any other actions until you’re done casting it. Notably, they can’t try to remove the commander you control to make you pay its cost.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "A legendary permanent that is put into a graveyard because of the “legend rule” isn\'t sacrificed."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Havoc Jester\'s ability is a triggered ability, not an activated ability. It doesn\'t allow you to sacrifice a permanent whenever you want; rather, you need some other way of sacrificing permanents."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Havoc Jester\'s ability triggers when you sacrifice it. If you sacrifice other permanents at the same time, it triggers for them as well."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you sacrifice a permanent as part of casting a spell or activating an ability, Havoc Jester\'s ability will resolve before that spell or ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "A planeswalker with indestructible still loses loyalty counters as it\'s dealt damage and will still be put into its owner\'s graveyard if its loyalty reaches 0."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The set of permanents affected by Heroic Intervention is determined as the spell resolves. Permanents you begin to control later in the turn won\'t gain hexproof and indestructible."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "A battle with indestructible still loses defense counters as it\'s dealt damage. If it\'s a Siege, it will still be exiled when the last defense counter is removed from it, and its controller may still cast it transformed without paying its mana cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Any counters on creatures that die or effects that affect them until end of turn won\'t apply to those cards in their owner\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Carrion Grub\'s first ability applies only while it is on the battlefield. In all other zones, its power is 0."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "As Goremand\'s triggered ability resolves, first the next opponent in turn order (or, if it\'s an opponent\'s turn, the opponent whose turn it is) chooses a creature they control, then each other opponent in turn order does the same knowing the choices made before them. Then all the chosen creatures are sacrificed at the same time."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Azusa\'s ability is cumulative with other effects that allow you to play additional lands, such as that of Song of Creation (from the Ikoria: Lair of Behemoths set)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Furious Rise\'s ability has you exile only one card, no matter how many creatures with power 4 or greater you control beyond the first."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Furious Rise\'s effect doesn\'t change when you can play the exiled card. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty. If you exile a land card, you can\'t play it unless you have land plays available."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If Furious Rise leaves the battlefield before you play the most recently exiled card, you can play that card for as long as it remains exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control a creature with power 4 or greater as your end step begins, Furious Rise\'s ability doesn\'t trigger. If you don\'t control one as the ability resolves, it has no effect. It doesn\'t have to be the same creature at both times, however."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Playing an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t play it multiple times."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If Mazemind Tome leaves the battlefield while its triggered ability is on the stack, you can\'t exile it from the zone it\'s put into."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the target creature\'s power is greater than 2 as the first activated ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn\'t resolve. However, if instead the creature\'s power is raised above 2 after the ability resolves, it still can\'t be blocked that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Once Subira\'s last ability resolves, check to see if the delayed triggered ability should trigger based on the power of the creatures immediately after damage is dealt, not based on their power as the ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Once a creature with power 2 or less has been blocked, Subira\'s middle ability won\'t cause it to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You can activate Subira\'s last ability if your hand is empty. You simply discard zero cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Abilities that trigger when counters are put on a creature trigger when a creature enters the battlefield with counters and when a player puts counters on a creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you have two non-Hydra creatures with Wildwood Scourge\'s ability (perhaps because they were mutated using the Ikoria: Lair of Behemoths mutate ability), putting a +1/+1 counter on any non-Hydra creature you control will cause the two abilities to trigger each other indefinitely. If no player takes an action to break this loop, the game ends in a draw."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Wildwood Scourge gets just one +1/+1 counter, no matter how many counters were put on the non-Hydra creature.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If some of the attacking creatures leave the battlefield while Mangara\'s triggered ability is on the stack, use the player or planeswalker they were attacking before they left to determine whether you draw a card. On the other hand, if they\'re removed from combat without leaving the battlefield, use their current information to determine that they\'re not attacking you or a planeswalker you control anymore."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If your opponent attacks you with one creature and your planeswalker with another, you draw a card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Players can cast spells and activate abilities after the triggered ability resolves but before the spell that caused it to trigger does.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'You draw just one card, no matter how many creatures are attacking you and your planeswalkers beyond the second.\'}]', "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'If an instant or sorcery spell you own causes Living Lightning to die, its ability can target that instant or sorcery card in your graveyard.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "A planeswalker with indestructible still loses loyalty as it\'s dealt damage. It is put into its owner\'s graveyard if its loyalty becomes 0."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a creature you control may become lethal if Avacyn leaves the battlefield during that turn.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Abilities that define a * in a creature\'s power and toughness apply while that card is in exile, but abilities that add or subtract power and toughness don\'t. For example, the ability of Crusader of Odric applies to determine Duplicant\'s power and toughness, but the ability of Death\'s Shadow doesn\'t."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Duplicant\'s base power and toughness change to the imprinted card\'s power and toughness. Counters and other effects that modify Duplicant\'s power and toughness still apply."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Duplicant\'s power and toughness are constantly updated if the exiled card\'s power and/or toughness change."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a melded permanent or a merged permanent is exiled by Duplicant\'s triggered ability, that ability\'s controller chooses the relative timestamp of the exiled cards. Duplicant looks at the information of the one with the latest timestamp."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "As Deepglow Skate\'s ability resolves, you must double each kind of counter on the permanents it targets."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'To double the number of each kind of counter on a permanent, put another counter on it for each counter it already has. Effects that interact with counters being put onto permanents apply as appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You can choose no targets if you don\'t want to double the counters on any permanents."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Because a spell with overload doesn\'t target when its overload cost is paid, it may affect permanents with hexproof or with protection from the appropriate color."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If you are instructed to cast a spell with overload “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to pay its overload cost instead."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If you don\'t pay the overload cost of Cyclonic Rift, that spell will have a single target. If you pay the overload cost, the spell won\'t have any targets."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as an overload cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Braids\'s effect doesn\'t count as playing a land if you put one onto the battlefield with it. You can still play a land for the turn during your main phase."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If the permanent you put onto the battlefield has an ability that triggers at the beginning of your upkeep, it won\'t trigger during that upkeep."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Drown in Sorrow affects only creatures on the battlefield at the time it resolves. Creatures that enter the battlefield or become creatures later in the turn won\'t get -2/-2."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If Bloodspore Thrinax enters the battlefield at the same time as other creatures you control, those creatures won\'t get additional +1/+1 counters from Bloodspore Thrinax\'s last ability. Those creatures also can\'t be devoured by Bloodspore Thrinax."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a creature enters the battlefield under your control and gains haste, but then loses it before attacking, it won\'t be able to attack that turn. This means that you can\'t use one Lightning Greaves to allow two new creatures to attack in the same turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You can\'t simply unequip Equipment from a creature. If Lightning Greaves is attached to the only creature you control, you won\'t be able to attach other equipment to it (or target it with anything else) until you have another creature onto which you can move Lightning Greaves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Once the equip {0} ability is activated, causing Puresteel Paladin to leave the battlefield or causing its controller to control fewer than three artifacts won\'t stop the equip ability from resolving."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You may still activate the Equipment\'s other equip abilities if you wish."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Unlike many effects that grant additional combat phases, you don\'t get an additional main phase with Godo, Bandit Warlord\'s ability. The additional combat phase happens immediately after the first combat phase."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'All creatures on the battlefield when Toxic Deluge resolves are affected. Ones that enter the battlefield or become creatures later in the turn are not.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If you cast Toxic Deluge without paying its mana cost, you\'ll still choose a value for X and pay X life. This is because it doesn\'t have {X} in its mana cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "While resolving Myrsmith\'s ability, you can\'t pay more than {1} to get more than one Myr."}]', "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to the equipped creature may become lethal if you attach Hammer of Nazahn to a different creature during that turn.'}, {'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'If Hammer of Nazahn enters the battlefield at the same time as other Equipment you control, its ability will trigger for each of those Equipment.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Doubling Season affects permanents that enter the battlefield with a certain number of counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If there are two Doubling Seasons on the battlefield, then the number of tokens or counters is four times the original number. If there are three on the battlefield, then the number of tokens or counters is eight times the original number, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Planeswalkers will enter the battlefield with double the normal number of loyalty counters. However, if you activate an ability whose cost has you put loyalty counters on a planeswalker, the number you put on isn\'t doubled. This is because those counters are put on as a cost, not as an effect."}]', "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'The number of Equipment attached to Kemba is determined as the ability resolves. If Kemba is no longer on the battlefield at that time, its last existence on the battlefield is checked to determine the number of Equipment attached to it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "A landfall ability doesn\'t trigger if a permanent already on the battlefield becomes a land."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'A landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability puts a land onto the battlefield under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "Felidar Retreat\'s second mode affects only creatures you control at the time the ability resolves, including creatures you control but that for some reason didn\'t get a +1/+1 counter. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t gain vigilance or get a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.\'}]', "[{'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'A Wizard spell is one with the creature type Wizard. Spells that are Wizard-themed (such as Relic Amulet) aren’t Wizard spells.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger, but after targets have been chosen for that spell (if it has any targets). The ability resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'You draw a card and discard a card while Windrider Wizard’s last ability is resolving. No player may take actions between those events, and nothing can happen.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'A land is normally colorless, regardless of what colors of mana that land can produce. If an effect makes a colorless land into a creature without specifying that it becomes a certain color, the land creature gets +2/+2.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'Forsaken Monument’s last ability won’t trigger when you play a land.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'If you tap a permanent for more than one {C}, you add only one additional {C}.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'You “tap a permanent for {C}” only if you activate a mana ability of that permanent that includes the {T} symbol in its cost, and only if it produces one or more {C} as it resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'Akiri’s first ability has you draw just one card per player you attack with an equipped creature, no matter how many equipped creatures you attack them with beyond the first and no matter how many Equipment that creature’s carrying beyond the first.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'Equipped creatures attacking a planeswalker won’t cause Akiri’s first ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'If the creature is already tapped, it just gains indestructible until end of turn.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'The Equipment that’s unattached remains on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'You choose which Equipment to unattach as Akiri’s second ability resolves. Unattaching an Equipment from a creature won’t affect other Equipment attached to that creature. No player can take actions between the time you unattach that Equipment and the time that the creature becomes tapped and gains indestructible.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a permanent becomes the target of a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a kicked spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger, but after targets have been chosen for that spell. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'If a spell targets Myriad Construct more than once, its last ability triggers only once.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'If you copy a kicked spell, the copy is also kicked. If a card or token enters the battlefield as a copy of a permanent that’s already on the battlefield, the new permanent isn’t kicked, even if the original was.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'If you don’t sacrifice Myriad Construct as its last ability resolves (perhaps because its ability triggered more than once and you’ve already sacrificed it), you still create Construct tokens. The number of tokens you create is determined by Myriad Construct’s power as it last existed on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'If you put a permanent with a kicker ability onto the battlefield without casting it, you can’t kick it.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'Kicker represents an optional additional cost that you may choose to pay as you cast the spell. A spell cast with that additional cost paid is “kicked.”'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'Some instant or sorcery spells require alternative or additional targets if they’re kicked. You ignore these targeting requirements if those spells aren’t kicked, and you can’t kick those spells unless you can choose the appropriate targets. On the other hand, you can kick a permanent spell even if you won’t be able to choose targets for an enters-the-battlefield ability of that permanent once the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'To determine a spell’s total cost, start with the mana cost (or an alternative cost if another card’s effect allows you to pay one instead), add any cost increases (such as kicker), then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'You can’t pay a kicker cost more than once.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a kicked spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger, but after targets have been chosen for that spell. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'If a card in a player’s hand has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'If the card draw from Jace’s last ability is modified by a replacement effect, you don’t reveal any card, even if the draw was replaced by one or more card draws. No loyalty counters will be removed from Jace in that case.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'If the converted mana cost of the drawn card is greater than Jace’s loyalty, you remove all loyalty counters from him. He’ll be put into your graveyard as a state-based action before you can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'If you copy a kicked spell, the copy is also kicked. If a card or token enters the battlefield as a copy of a permanent that’s already on the battlefield, the new permanent isn’t kicked, even if the original was.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'If you put a permanent with a kicker ability onto the battlefield without casting it, you can’t kick it.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'Kicker represents an optional additional cost that you may choose to pay as you cast the spell. A spell cast with that additional cost paid is “kicked.”'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'Some instant or sorcery spells require alternative or additional targets if they’re kicked. You ignore these targeting requirements if those spells aren’t kicked, and you can’t kick those spells unless you can choose the appropriate targets. On the other hand, you can kick a permanent spell even if you won’t be able to choose targets for an enters-the-battlefield ability of that permanent once the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'The token created by Jace’s triggered ability doesn’t have the legendary supertype and has a starting loyalty of 1 rather than 4. If another object becomes a copy of the token, that copy also won’t be legendary and will have a starting loyalty of 1.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'The token from Jace’s triggered ability copies exactly what is printed on Jace and nothing else. It doesn’t copy how many counters are on him, or any non-copy effects that have changed his color or types, and so on. It enters the battlefield with one loyalty counter. You can activate one loyalty ability of each of the Jaces this turn.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'To determine a spell’s total cost, start with the mana cost (or an alternative cost if another card’s effect allows you to pay one instead), add any cost increases (such as kicker), then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'While resolving Jace’s last ability, you must reveal the card before it’s mixed with the other cards in your hand.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'You can control one legendary Jace, Mirror Mage in addition to any number of nonlegendary copies of Jace, Mirror Mage.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'You can’t pay a kicker cost more than once.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'If a permanent on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Feed the Swarm tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. You don\'t lose any life. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), you do lose life."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "The amount of life you lose is determined by the permanent\'s mana value as it last existed on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Activating Yuriko\'s commander ninjutsu ability isn\'t the same as casting Yuriko as a spell. You won\'t have to pay the commander tax to activate that ability, and activating that ability won\'t increase the commander tax to pay later."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Although the ninjutsu ability has the creature enter the battlefield attacking, it was never declared as an attacking creature (for the purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Commander ninjutsu is a variant of ninjutsu that can be activated from the command zone as well as from your hand. Just as with regular ninjutsu, the Ninja enters attacking the player or planeswalker that the returned creature was attacking.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Although players may respond to Blasphemous Act once it\'s been cast, once it\'s announced, they can\'t respond before the cost is calculated and paid."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Blasphemous Act\'s ability can\'t reduce the total cost to cast the spell below {R}."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The total cost to cast Blasphemous Act is locked in before you pay that cost. For example, if there are three creatures on the battlefield, including one you can sacrifice to add {C} to your mana pool, the total cost of Blasphemous Act is {5}{R}. Then you can sacrifice the creature when you activate mana abilities just before paying the cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Blasphemous Act). The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Armorcraft Judge\'s ability counts the number of creatures, not the number of counters. A creature with more than one +1/+1 counter won\'t cause you to draw more than one card."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The number of creatures you control with +1/+1 counters on them is counted only as Armorcraft Judge\'s triggered ability resolves. Players may respond to the triggered ability by trying to change that number."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "As Victimize resolves, you must sacrifice a creature if able. You can\'t change your mind and choose not to sacrifice anything."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If one of the targeted creature cards is an illegal target (for instance, because it has left your graveyard before Victimize resolves), you\'ll still sacrifice a creature and put the other card onto the battlefield. If both are illegal targets, Victimize won\'t resolve. You won\'t sacrifice a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The creature you sacrifice isn\'t chosen until Victimize resolves. You can\'t return the creature you sacrifice because it will still be on the battlefield at the time targets are chosen."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You must choose two targets. You can\'t cast Victimize targeting only one creature card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Color identity is set before the game begins and doesn\'t change during the game, even if your commander is in a hidden zone (like the hand or library) or an effect changes your commander\'s color."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, you can\'t activate War Room\'s last ability at all."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander has no colors in its color identity, you pay no life to activate War Room\'s last ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Feast of Succession affects only creatures on the battlefield at the time it resolves. Creatures that enter the battlefield later in the turn won\'t get -4/-4."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If combat damage dealt to the monarch causes that player to lose the game, the triggered ability that causes the controller of the attacking creature to become the monarch doesn\'t resolve. In most cases, the controller of the attacking creature will still become the monarch as it is likely their turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the monarch leaves the game during another player\'s turn, that player becomes the monarch. If the monarch leaves the game during their turn, the next player in turn order becomes the monarch."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the triggered ability that causes the monarch to draw a card goes on the stack and a different player becomes the monarch before that ability resolves, the first player will still draw the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The game starts with no monarch. Once an effect makes one player the monarch, the game will have exactly one monarch from that point forward. As a player becomes the monarch, the current monarch (if any) ceases being the monarch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'There are two inherent triggered abilities associated with being the monarch. These triggered abilities have no source and are controlled by the player who was the monarch at the time the abilities triggered. The full texts of these abilities are "At the beginning of the monarch\\\'s end step, that player draws a card" and "Whenever a creature deals combat damage to the monarch, its controller becomes the monarch."\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You can cast Feast of Succession to become the monarch while no creatures are on the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Guildless Commons will return itself to its owner\'s hand if you control no other lands when it enters the battlefield or if you choose to return it to its owner\'s hand. It\'s almost never a good idea to play it on your first turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Hamza\'s first ability affects only generic mana costs. It can\'t reduce the total cost to cast the spell below {G}{W}."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once you announce you\'re casting a creature spell, no player may take actions until the spell has been paid for. Notably, opponents can\'t try to change the number of creatures you control with +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Hamza, Guardian of Arashin). The total cost is locked in before any costs are paid. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Opal Palace\'s last ability produces two mana (most likely due to Mana Reflection) and you spend them to cast a commander, that commander enters with two counters for each time it\'s been cast from the command zone this game."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Opal Palace\'s last ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the last ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Opal Palace\'s last ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The "number of times it\\\'s been cast from the command zone" includes the most recent time. For example, the first time you cast your commander from the command zone in a game, if you spent mana from Opal Palace\\\'s last ability to do so, it will enter the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Path of Ancestry\'s last ability produces two mana (most likely due to Mana Reflection), spending those two mana to cast creature spells that share a creature type with your commander will cause two abilities to trigger. Each of those abilities will cause you to scry 1. You won\'t scry 2. This is true whether you spend the mana on one creature spell or two."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you cast your commander with mana from Path of Ancestry, and your commander hasn\'t somehow lost all of its creature types while on the stack, you\'ll scry 1."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Path of Ancestry\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander has no creature types, it can\'t share a creature type with any spell that you cast."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Path of Ancestry\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "If you have two commanders, the last ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities. When you spend that mana on a creature spell that shares a creature type with either of your commanders, you\'ll scry 1."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "Your commander\'s creature types are checked immediately after you cast a creature spell spending mana from Path of Ancestry\'s last ability. They aren\'t set before the game begins, and they may not be the same types your commander had when you activated that ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If a creature enters the battlefield under your control and gains haste, but then loses it before attacking, it won\'t be able to attack that turn. This means that you can\'t use one Haunted Cloak to allow two new creatures to attack in the same turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If an artifact or creature has an ability allowing you to sacrifice it for mana, you can\'t sacrifice that permanent to generate mana and also to pay the sacrifice cost for the activated ability of Makeshift Munitions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If combat damage dealt to the monarch causes that player to lose the game, the triggered ability that causes the controller of the attacking creature to become the monarch doesn\'t resolve. In most cases, the controller of the attacking creature will still become the monarch as it is likely their turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the monarch leaves the game during another player\'s turn, that player becomes the monarch. If the monarch leaves the game during their turn, the next player in turn order becomes the monarch."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Fall from Favor tries to resolve, it doesn\'t resolve. It won\'t enter the battlefield, so its enters-the-battlefield ability won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the triggered ability that causes the monarch to draw a card goes on the stack and a different player becomes the monarch before that ability resolves, the first player will still draw the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The game starts with no monarch. Once an effect makes one player the monarch, the game will have exactly one monarch from that point forward. As a player becomes the monarch, the current monarch (if any) ceases being the monarch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'There are two inherent triggered abilities associated with being the monarch. These triggered abilities have no source and are controlled by the player who was the monarch at the time the abilities triggered. The full texts of these abilities are "At the beginning of the monarch\\\'s end step, that player draws a card" and "Whenever a creature deals combat damage to the monarch, its controller becomes the monarch."\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If combat damage dealt to the monarch causes that player to lose the game, the triggered ability that causes the controller of the attacking creature to become the monarch doesn\'t resolve. In most cases, the controller of the attacking creature will still become the monarch as it is likely their turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the monarch leaves the game during another player\'s turn, that player becomes the monarch. If the monarch leaves the game during their turn, the next player in turn order becomes the monarch."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the triggered ability that causes the monarch to draw a card goes on the stack and a different player becomes the monarch before that ability resolves, the first player will still draw the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The game starts with no monarch. Once an effect makes one player the monarch, the game will have exactly one monarch from that point forward. As a player becomes the monarch, the current monarch (if any) ceases being the monarch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'There are two inherent triggered abilities associated with being the monarch. These triggered abilities have no source and are controlled by the player who was the monarch at the time the abilities triggered. The full texts of these abilities are "At the beginning of the monarch\\\'s end step, that player draws a card" and "Whenever a creature deals combat damage to the monarch, its controller becomes the monarch."\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Arcane Signet\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Arcane Signet\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Commander\'s Sphere\'s first ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Commander\'s Sphere\'s first ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once the ability resolves and the bonus is applied, that bonus won\'t change, even if the greatest power among other creatures you control does."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The value of X is calculated as Tuya Bearclaw\'s ability resolves. If you control no other creatures at that time or if the greatest power among other creatures you control is 0 or less, X will be 0."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once you announce that you\'re casting a spell, players can\'t attempt to remove Shimmer Myr from the battlefield to make that casting illegal. Removing Shimmer My after you\'ve cast a spell won\'t affect that spell."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Shimmer Myr has no effect on artifact lands because they aren\'t cast as spells."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Supernatural Stamina\'s effect works only once. If the targeted creature dies and is then returned to the battlefield, it\'s considered to be a new creature. If that new creature dies, it won\'t come back a second time."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To draw cards equal to the difference, first determine how many cards you\'ll draw, then draw that many cards, as modified by replacement effects. For example, if you have two cards in hand and the chosen opponent has five, Thought Reflection will cause you to draw six cards instead of three."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You choose an opponent while Sandstone Oracle\'s ability is resolving. No player may take actions between the time you make this choice and the time you draw cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You don\'t sacrifice Nevinyrral\'s Disk to activate its ability. It\'s destroyed as part of the ability\'s resolution if it\'s still on the battlefield. If an effect gives Nevinyrral\'s Disk indestructible or regenerates it, it stays on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An effect that checks whether you control your commander is satisfied if you control one or both of your two commanders.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards (or 58 cards in a Commander Draft game) of your deck are shuffled to become your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "For spells with {X} in their mana costs, use the value chosen for X to determine the spell\'s mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If something refers to your commander while you have two commanders, it refers to one of them of your choice. If you are instructed to perform an action on your commander (e.g. put it from the command zone into your hand due to Command Beacon), you choose one of your commanders at the time the effect happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders\' combined color identities. If Falthis and Kediss are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with black and/or red in their color identity, but not cards with green, white, or blue."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won\'t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from any one of them, not from both of them combined."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To have two commanders, both must have the partner ability as the game begins. Losing the ability during the game doesn\'t cause either to cease to be your commander."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You can choose two commanders with partner that are the same color or colors. In Commander Draft, you can even choose two of the same commander with partner if you drafted them. If you do this, make sure you keep the number of times you\\\'ve cast each from the command zone clear for "commander tax" purposes.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An effect that checks whether you control your commander is satisfied if you control one or both of your two commanders.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards (or 58 cards in a Commander Draft game) of your deck are shuffled to become your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If Alharu has a +1/+1 counter on it and dies, its ability triggers for itself.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If a creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it dies at the same time as Alharu, Alharu\'s ability triggers for that creature."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If something refers to your commander while you have two commanders, it refers to one of them of your choice. If you are instructed to perform an action on your commander (e.g. put it from the command zone into your hand due to Command Beacon), you choose one of your commanders at the time the effect happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders\' combined color identities. If Falthis and Kediss are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with black and/or red in their color identity, but not cards with green, white, or blue."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won\'t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from any one of them, not from both of them combined."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To have two commanders, both must have the partner ability as the game begins. Losing the ability during the game doesn\'t cause either to cease to be your commander."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You can choose two commanders with partner that are the same color or colors. In Commander Draft, you can even choose two of the same commander with partner if you drafted them. If you do this, make sure you keep the number of times you\\\'ve cast each from the command zone clear for "commander tax" purposes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You create just one Spirit token, not one for each +1/+1 counter that was on the creature that died.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An effect that checks whether you control your commander is satisfied if you control one or both of your two commanders.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards (or 58 cards in a Commander Draft game) of your deck are shuffled to become your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If something refers to your commander while you have two commanders, it refers to one of them of your choice. If you are instructed to perform an action on your commander (e.g. put it from the command zone into your hand due to Command Beacon), you choose one of your commanders at the time the effect happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders\' combined color identities. If Falthis and Kediss are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with black and/or red in their color identity, but not cards with green, white, or blue."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once a creature with toughness 2 or less has blocked this creature, changing the toughness of the blocking creature won\'t cause this creature to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won\'t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from any one of them, not from both of them combined."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The middle ability can\'t target cards that were discarded on previous turns or put into the graveyard from a library on previous turns."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To have two commanders, both must have the partner ability as the game begins. Losing the ability during the game doesn\'t cause either to cease to be your commander."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You can choose two commanders with partner that are the same color or colors. In Commander Draft, you can even choose two of the same commander with partner if you drafted them. If you do this, make sure you keep the number of times you\\\'ve cast each from the command zone clear for "commander tax" purposes.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An effect that checks whether you control your commander is satisfied if you control one or both of your two commanders.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards (or 58 cards in a Commander Draft game) of your deck are shuffled to become your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If something refers to your commander while you have two commanders, it refers to one of them of your choice. If you are instructed to perform an action on your commander (e.g. put it from the command zone into your hand due to Command Beacon), you choose one of your commanders at the time the effect happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders\' combined color identities. If Falthis and Kediss are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with black and/or red in their color identity, but not cards with green, white, or blue."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won\'t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from any one of them, not from both of them combined."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To have two commanders, both must have the partner ability as the game begins. Losing the ability during the game doesn\'t cause either to cease to be your commander."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You can choose two commanders with partner that are the same color or colors. In Commander Draft, you can even choose two of the same commander with partner if you drafted them. If you do this, make sure you keep the number of times you\\\'ve cast each from the command zone clear for "commander tax" purposes.\'}]', "[{'date': '2020-11-10', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Champion of the Flame may become lethal if an Aura or Equipment attached to it leaves the battlefield or becomes attached to another creature during that turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Count the number of opponents you currently have, not how many you started with. If your four-player game is down to you and a single opponent, the land enters the battlefield tapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If an effect puts the land onto the battlefield tapped, having two or more opponents won\'t untap it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Each instance of cascade triggers and resolves separately. The spell you cast due to the first cascade ability will go on the stack on top of the second cascade ability. That spell will resolve before you exile cards for the second cascade ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Maelstrom Wanderer gives itself haste.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "No matter what spell you cast with the first cascade trigger (or with any cascade triggers that result from casting that spell), the second cascade trigger will look for a spell with mana value less than Maelstrom Wanderer\'s mana value of 8."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cascade triggers when you cast the spell, meaning that it resolves before that spell. If you end up casting the exiled card, it will go on the stack above the spell with cascade.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Due to a 2021 rules change to cascade, not only do you stop exiling cards if you exile a nonland card with lesser mana value than the spell with cascade, but the resulting spell you cast must also have lesser mana value. Previously, in cases where a card\'s mana value differed from the resulting spell, such as with some modal double-faced cards or cards with an Adventure, you could cast a spell with a higher mana value than the exiled card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If a spell with cascade is countered, the cascade ability will still resolve normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If cascade allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half but not both halves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'When the cascade ability resolves, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether or not you cast the last card exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Each token must attack the appropriate player if able.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Exiling the card with encore is a cost to activate the ability. Once you announce that you\'re activating it, no player may take actions until you\'ve finished. They can\'t try to remove the card from your graveyard to stop you from paying the cost."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If one of the tokens can\'t attack for any reason (such as being tapped), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having it attack, you aren\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If one of the tokens somehow is under another player\'s control as the delayed triggered ability resolves, you can\'t sacrifice that token. It remains on the battlefield indefinitely, even if you regain control of it later."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Opponents who have left the game aren\'t counted when determining how many tokens to create."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The tokens copy only what\'s on the original card. Effects that modified that creature when it was previously on the battlefield won\'t be copied."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "If an effect stops a token from attacking a specific player, that token can attack any player, planeswalker, or battle, or not attack at all. If the effect stops the token from attacking a specific player unless a cost is paid, you don\'t have to pay that cost unless you want to attack that player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If a creature card is put into your graveyard during your main phase and the stack is empty, you have a chance to cast it before any player may attempt to remove that card from your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If multiple effects allow you to play a card from your graveyard, you must announce which permission you\'re using as you begin to play the card."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you cast one creature spell from your graveyard and then have a new Karador come under your control in the same turn, you may cast another creature spell from your graveyard that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once you begin to cast the spell, losing control of Karador won\'t affect the spell. You can finish casting it as normal."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases (such as the commander tax), then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Karador). The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions of the spell you cast from your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You must pay the costs to cast that spell. If it has an alternative cost, you may cast it for that cost instead.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word "draw," it doesn\\\'t count as drawing cards and it doesn\\\'t cause Nekusar\\\'s second ability to trigger.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the triggered ability causes two Soldiers to be created (due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), Ancestral Blade becomes attached to one of them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'No player may take any actions between the time you create the Soldier token and the time Ancestral Blade becomes attached to it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The Soldier token that you create enters the battlefield as a 1/1 creature. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield will see the token enter as a 1/1 creature. Static abilities that affect the Soldier\\\'s power and toughness may change this, but Ancestral Blade will be attached to the Soldier before the game checks to see if it has toughness 0 or less. For example, if Illness in the Ranks ("Creature tokens get -1/-1") is on the battlefield, the Soldier will enter as a 0/0 creature, but then Ancestral Blade will make it a 1/1 and the token will survive.\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-02-01', 'text': 'Spatial Contortion is banned in Pauper (not just non-legal), due to a special case on MTGO: https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/news/january-21-2019-banned-and-restricted-announcement'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "Crippling Fear affects only creatures that aren\'t of the chosen type that are on the battlefield as it resolves. It won\'t affect creatures that enter the battlefield later in the turn, regardless of creature type. If a creature changes creature types later in the turn, Crippling Fear won\'t start or stop affecting that creature."}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "You choose the creature type as Crippling Fear resolves, and then creatures not of that type get -3/-3. Once Crippling Fear starts to resolve, players can\'t respond to the choice or take any actions until Crippling Fear finishes resolving."}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "You must choose an existing creature type, such as Fish or Artificer. You can\'t choose card types (e.g., artifact) or supertypes (e.g., snow)."}]', "[{'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'A chapter ability doesn’t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter’s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the chapter III ability to trigger, but chapters I and II won’t trigger again.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of tokens you create will trigger when they enter the battlefield. Any “As [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[This permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the tokens will also work.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Each symbol on the left of a Saga’s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability’s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Each token you create copies the original characteristics of the token it’s copying as stated by the effect that created that token. The newly created token doesn’t copy whether the original token is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it, whether it has any Auras and/or Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'If the original token is copying something else, the token you create will use the copiable values of the original token. In most cases, it will be a copy of whatever the original token is copying. If it’s copying a permanent or card with {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won’t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities, the Saga’s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Removing lore counters won’t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger. If lore counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives more lore counters.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'The chapter III ability doesn’t target any of the tokens. You choose which ones you’re copying as the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Unless the effect that creates a token specifies a different name, the name of a token is the same as its creature types. In particular, a Human Warrior creature token has a different name than an Elf Warrior creature token, and you may create a copy of each using the chapter III ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'A chapter ability doesn’t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter’s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the chapter III ability to trigger, but chapters I and II won’t trigger again.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Each symbol on the left of a Saga’s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability’s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won’t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities, the Saga’s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Removing lore counters won’t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger. If lore counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives more lore counters.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': \'An indestructible counter on a permanent gives that permanent indestructible.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "You can activate the middle ability targeting a legendary creature that\'s already a God. You\'ll put a +1/+1 counter on it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': \'Changeling is a characteristic-defining ability. It functions in all zones, not only while a card that has it is on the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "If Realmwalker is somehow on the battlefield with no choice having been made for it, you may still look at the top card of your library any time. You won\'t be able to cast any creature spells from the top of your library, even if they have no creature types."}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': \'If an effect causes a creature with changeling to become a new creature type, it will be only that new creature type. It will still have changeling; the effect making it all creature types will simply be overwritten.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': \'If an effect causes a creature with changeling to lose all abilities, it will remain all creature types, even though it will no longer have changeling. This is because changeling applies before the effect that removes it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "If the top card of your library changes while you\'re casting a spell, playing a land, or activating an ability, you can\'t look at the new top card until you finish doing so. This means that if you cast a spell from the top of your library, you can\'t look at the next one until you\'re done paying for that spell."}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "Realmwalker doesn\'t change when you can cast creature spells. Normally, this means during your main phase when the stack is empty, although flash may change this."}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': \'The subtype Shapeshifter that appears on the type line is mostly there to reinforce the flavor. A creature card with changeling is just as much an Elf, a Dwarf, a Sliver, a Goat, a Coward, and a Zombie as it is a Shapeshifter.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "The top card of your library isn\'t in your hand, so you can\'t foretell it, discard it, or activate any of its activated abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "You can look at the top card of your library whenever you want (with one restriction; see below), even if you don\'t have priority. This action doesn\'t use the stack. Knowing what that card is becomes part of the information you have access to, just like you can look at the cards in your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "You must choose an existing creature type, such as Elk or Advisor. You can\'t choose card types (e.g., artifact) or supertypes (e.g., snow)."}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "You\'ll still pay all costs for the spell, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs if any are available."}]', "[{'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'The Dwarf Berserker creature token enters the battlefield as a 2/1 creature. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield will see the token enter as a 2/1 creature.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'You decide whether to pay {2} as the enters-the-battlefield ability resolves. If you do, you immediately create the Dwarf Berserker creature token and attach Dwarven Hammer to it. No players may respond to your decision to pay or not, and no player may take actions during this process.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'The last ability will count any creature that died, no matter who controlled it.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'The number of creatures that have died that turn is checked as the last ability resolves. Inga Rune-Eyes will count, as will creatures that die at the same time as Inga Rune-Eyes and creatures that die while that ability is on the stack but has not yet resolved.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Being the monarch carries two inherent triggered abilities. "At the beginning of the monarch\\\'s end step, that player draws a card" and "Whenever a creature deals combat damage to the monarch, its controller becomes the monarch."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a creature token is exiled, it ceases to exist. It won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you\'re not the monarch as Palace Jailer\'s second ability resolves, the creature will be exiled until there\'s a new monarch and that player is one of your opponents. The creature won\'t immediately return just because an opponent is the monarch."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'In a multiplayer game, if the monarch leaves the game, the player whose turn it is immediately becomes the monarch. If the player whose turn it is has left the game, instead the next player in turn order becomes the monarch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Palace Jailer leaving the battlefield won\'t cause the exiled creature to return. The game will continue to watch for the next time an opponent becomes the monarch."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'The game starts with no monarch. Once an effect makes one player the monarch, the game will have exactly one monarch from that point forward.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "The opponent that controlled the exiled card doesn\'t have to be the same opponent that becomes the monarch in order to cause that card to return to the battlefield. Any opponent becoming the monarch will cause the card to return."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Courser of Kruphix doesn\'t change when you can play lands. You can do so only during your main phase when you have priority and the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the top card of your library changes while you\'re casting a spell, playing a land, or activating an ability, you don\'t reveal the new top card until you finish doing so. This means that if you play a land from the top of your library, you can\'t look at the next one until you\'ve handled any replacement effects that modify that land entering the battlefield, such as that of Vesuva."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Playing a land from the top of your library counts as your land play for the turn. Once you play a land during your turn, you won\'t be able to play an additional land from the top of your library unless another effect (such as that of Azusa, Lost but Seeking) allows you to."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'While playing with the top card of your library revealed, if you draw multiple cards, reveal each one before you draw it. If you put multiple cards on top of your library at once, reveal only the one new top card.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If Mystic Confluence is copied, the effect that creates the copy will usually allow you to choose new targets, but you can\'t choose new modes."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If the middle mode is chosen more than once, you choose the relative order to return the target creatures.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you choose the first and/or second modes but all of the targets become illegal before Mystic Confluence resolves, the spell won\'t resolve. If you also chose the last mode once or twice, you won\'t draw any cards. If at least one target is still legal, the spell will resolve but will have no effect on any illegal targets."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'No matter which combination of modes you choose, you always follow the instructions in the order they are written.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "No player can cast spells or activate abilities in between the modes of a resolving spell. Any abilities that trigger won\'t be put onto the stack until Mystic Confluence is done resolving."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a resolving spell puts Eternal Witness onto the battlefield, Eternal Witness\'s ability can target that card if it\'s put into your graveyard as it resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability copies Return to Dust, the copy exiles only the first target artifact or enchantment. This is because the copy wasn\'t cast at all."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Return to Dust can always target a second artifact or enchantment; it just won\'t exile it if it\'s not your main phase when you cast Return to Dust."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Path to Exile tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. The creature\'s controller won\'t search for a basic land card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "The controller of the exiled creature isn\'t required to search their library for a basic land. If that player doesn\'t, the player won\'t shuffle their library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You can cast Everflowing Chalice without kicking it at all if you wish. However, if Everflowing Chalice has no charge counters on it, activating its last ability won\'t produce any mana."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "You choose the target for Dread Return before paying any of its costs, so it\'s not possible to cast it using flashback and bring back one of the creatures you sacrifice."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'You can tap any untapped white creatures you control to pay for Battle Screech’s flashback cost, even ones you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn.\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger, but after targets have been chosen for that spell. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because it’s not on the battlefield yet, casting Sigil of the Empty Throne won’t cause its own ability to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger, but after targets have been chosen for that spell. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because Wastes is a basic land, you can include as many of them as you like in your Constructed decks.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'In Limited events (including Sealed Deck and Booster Draft), Wastes must be in your card pool to be included in your deck. You can’t add Wastes to your card pool in the same way that you can add other basic lands.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Wastes is not a land type. If something asks you to name a land type, you can’t choose Wastes.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Farseek can find any land with any of the listed land types, including nonbasic ones, even if that land is a Forest in addition to one or more of those types.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a permanent has +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it, they’re removed in pairs as a state-based action so that the permanent has only one of those kinds of counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Players can respond to a spell or ability whose effect includes proliferating. Once that spell or ability starts to resolve, however, and its controller chooses which permanents and players will get new counters, it’s too late for anyone to respond.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To proliferate, you can choose any permanent that has a counter, including ones controlled by opponents. You can’t choose cards in any zone other than the battlefield, even if they have counters on them.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You don’t have to choose every permanent or player that has a counter, only the ones you want to add another counter to. Since “any number” includes zero, you don’t have to choose any permanents at all, and you don’t have to choose any players at all.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If an attacking creature has multiple evasion abilities, such as shadow and flying, a creature can block it only if that creature satisfies all of the appropriate evasion abilities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Multiple instances of shadow on the same creature are redundant.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Once a creature has been blocked, that creature remains blocked and will deal and be dealt combat damage even if it gains or loses shadow or if the blocking creature gains or loses shadow.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You draw a card and discard a card all while Looter il-Kor\'s ability is resolving. Nothing can happen in between, and no player can take actions."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If one or more Saprolings you control die at the same time as Slimefoot, Slimefoot’s first ability will still trigger once for each Saproling that died.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Temur Battle Rage checks whether you control a creature with power 4 or greater as it resolves. If you do, the target creature has trample until end of turn even if you no longer control a creature with power 4 or greater later in the turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "If an attacking creature with double strike and trample destroys all of its blocking creatures with first-strike combat damage, all of its normal combat damage is assigned to the player, planeswalker, or battle that creature\'s attacking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Each player, including you, must put a vow counter on a creature they control if able. They can\'t choose to opt out and sacrifice all of their creatures. The creature you put a vow counter on will remember its promise if another player gains control of it."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If the vow counter is moved to another creature, it won\'t prevent the second creature from attacking normally."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If the vow counter is removed from the creature, it can attack as normal.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If you play a card this way, it leaves exile and becomes a new object. If it returns to exile later in the turn, you can\'t play it again."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions for the exiled card. If it\'s a land, you can\'t play it unless you have land plays available."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "You\'ll still pay all costs for a spell cast this way, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs if any are available."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Use the characteristics of each permanent as it returns to the battlefield to determine if it should enter with an additional +1/+1 counter, an additional loyalty counter, or in very unusual cases, both. Notably, if you exile a creature that was only a creature because of a type-changing effect, it will enter as a noncreature permanent and won\'t get any additional +1/+1 counters from the effect of Semester\'s End."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "You can choose to add either {B} or {G} for each permanent destroyed. You aren\'t limited to one color."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' Each magecraft ability has a different effect, although they all have the same trigger condition, whenever you cast or copy an instant or sorcery spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': " For example, if you control Archmage Emeritus and cast an instant or sorcery spell, Archmage Emeritus\'s magecraft ability will trigger and you will draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If an effect creates a copy of an instant or sorcery spell, this will also cause the magecraft ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If an effect creates multiple copies of an instant or sorcery spell, magecraft abilities trigger once for each copy created by the effect.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' Some effects instruct you to copy an instant or sorcery card in a zone other than the stack. These copies do not cause magecraft abilities to trigger. However, most effects that do this also allow you to cast the copy, and casting the copy will cause magecraft abilities to trigger.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If a land card with an appropriate subtype is entering the battlefield from your hand at the same time as one of these lands, you may reveal the other land to have the "Snarl" enter untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If an effect instructs you to put one of these lands onto the battlefield tapped, it will still enter the battlefield tapped even if you reveal a land card from your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' The "Snarl" itself doesn\\\'t have any land subtypes. You can\\\'t reveal one to satisfy the ability of another.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': " You may reveal any land card with either or both of the appropriate subtypes. It doesn\'t have to be a basic land card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If a land card with an appropriate subtype is entering the battlefield from your hand at the same time as one of these lands, you may reveal the other land to have the "Snarl" enter untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to put one of these lands onto the battlefield tapped, it will still enter the battlefield tapped even if you reveal a land card from your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'The "Snarl" itself doesn\\\'t have any land subtypes. You can\\\'t reveal one to satisfy the ability of another.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "You may reveal any land card with either or both of the appropriate subtypes. It doesn\'t have to be a basic land card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If one of these Forests is turned face up, the effect making it a Forest land will expire. The face-up permanent will again have its printed name, type line, mana cost, abilities, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If the face-down card has morph, you can pay its morph cost to turn it face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'The face-down card has no name or colors. Its only type is land, its only subtype is Forest, and its only ability is "{T}: Add {G}."\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "A creature cast using suspend will enter the battlefield with haste. It will have haste until another player gains control of it. (In some rare cases, another player may gain control of the creature spell itself. If this happens, the creature won\'t enter the battlefield with haste.)"}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don\'t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card\'s type are ignored."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Exiling a card with suspend isn\'t casting that card. This action doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a “suspended card,” that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card\'s owner\'s next upkeep."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can\'t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it\'s no longer suspended."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it\'s exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it\'s no longer suspended."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” such as with suspend, you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it\'s on the stack)."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn\'t paid."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn\'t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage\'s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cascade triggers when you cast the spell, meaning that it resolves before that spell. If you end up casting the exiled card, it will go on the stack above the spell with cascade.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Due to a 2021 rules change to cascade, not only do you stop exiling cards if you exile a nonland card with lesser mana value than the spell with cascade, but the resulting spell you cast must also have lesser mana value. Previously, in cases where a card\'s mana value differed from the resulting spell, such as with some modal double-faced cards or cards with an Adventure, you could cast a spell with a higher mana value than the exiled card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If a spell with cascade is countered, the cascade ability will still resolve normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If cascade allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half but not both halves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'When the cascade ability resolves, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether or not you cast the last card exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Because damage remains marked on a creature until the cleanup step or an effect removes that damage, nonlethal damage dealt to creatures you control may become lethal if Mirari\'s Wake leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If tapping a land produces more than one type of mana, you choose one type that was produced and add one mana of that type.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the mana produced by the land has any additional restrictions or riders, those restrictions or riders don\'t apply to the mana added by Mirari\'s Wake. You just get one mana of the appropriate type."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'The types of mana are white, blue, black, red, green, and colorless.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Believe it or not, Ripley counts spells that were cast even if they didn\'t resolve. This means it still counts spells that were countered."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Captain Ripley Vance need not be on the battlefield to witness the first two spells being cast. As long as it\'s already on the battlefield when you cast the third spell of a turn, its ability triggers."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Copying a spell is not the same as casting a spell.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If a permanent has +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it, they\'re removed in pairs as a state-based action so that the permanent has only one of those kinds of counters (or none of either kind of counters) on it."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If you cast this spell by paying its entwine cost, you will be able to proliferate the counters that you placed with the first mode.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Players can respond to a spell or ability whose effect includes proliferating. Once that spell or ability starts to resolve, however, and its controller chooses which permanents and players will get new counters, it\'s too late for anyone to respond."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "To proliferate, you can choose any permanent that has a counter, including ones controlled by opponents, and you can choose any player who has a counter, including opponents. You can\'t choose cards in any zone other than the battlefield, even if they have counters on them."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'While proliferating, if you choose a permanent or player with multiple kinds of counters, the permanent or player gets another counter of each kind, not just one kind. This change from the original proliferate rules was introduced in a previous set.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to choose every permanent or player that has a counter, only the ones you want to add another counter to. Since “any number” includes zero, you don\'t have to choose any permanents at all, and you don\'t have to choose any players at all."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Sanctum Weaver\'s ability is a mana ability and does not use the stack. This means that no player can respond to the ability by taking an action that would reduce the number of enchantments you have."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Sythis, Harvest Hand\'s ability doesn\'t trigger when it is cast."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "The ability is independent from the spell that caused it to trigger. Notably, if the enchantment spell is countered or doesn\'t resolve for any other reason, you\'ll still draw a card (unless something specifically counters the triggered ability)."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability will resolve before the spell that caused it to trigger.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Filigree Attendant\'s power works in all zones, not just the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If a creature somehow loses all of its +1/+1 counters, it can adapt again and get more +1/+1 counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "You can always activate an ability that will cause a creature to adapt. As that ability resolves, if the creature has a +1/+1 counter on it for any reason, you simply won\'t put any +1/+1 counters on it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If the equipped creature isn\'t on the battlefield as the triggered ability resolves but it had lifelink when it left the battlefield, you will gain life."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Use the equipped creature\'s power as the triggered ability resolves to determine how much damage is dealt. If the equipped creature is no longer on the battlefield at that time, use its power as it last existed on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Gorex\'s first ability can\'t reduce its cost below {B}{B}. You can exile any number of creature cards from your graveyard, even if they won\'t reduce Gorex\'s cost any further."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Include any additional costs to cast Gorex before applying its own cost reduction. For example, if Gorex is your commander and an additional cost of {6} applies from the “commander tax,” you may cast Gorex by exiling four creature cards from your graveyard and paying {4}{B}{B}.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-11-19\', \'text\': "Crawling Infestation must be on the battlefield for its ability to trigger. If it\'s destroyed at the same time as one or more creatures you own, its ability won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-11-19\', \'text\': "You don\'t choose an opponent to determine how many suspect counters are placed on Investigator\'s Journal as it enters the battlefield. You always use the greatest number possible."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-02-18\', \'text\': "If Secluded Courtyard is somehow on the battlefield without a chosen type, mana from its second mana ability can\'t be spent on anything."}]', "[{'date': '2022-02-18', 'text': 'Discarding the card is part of the cost to activate a channel ability.'}, {'date': '2022-02-18', 'text': 'If a channel ability requires a target, you may not activate it without a target just to discard the card.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'A copy of a permanent spell enters the battlefield as a token. This is not the same as an effect that creates a token, and any effect that refers to creating a token does not apply to copies of permanent spells.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'Multiple instances of double strike do not increase the number of strikes. That creature still only gets to deal combat damage twice.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-09-09', 'text': 'As a Saga with read ahead enters the battlefield, its controller chooses a number from one to that Saga’s greatest chapter number. The Saga enters the battlefield with the chosen number of lore counters. Neither choosing the number nor putting the counters on the Saga use the stack, and neither can be responded to.'}, {'date': '2022-09-09', 'text': 'If Love Song of Night and Day’s first chapter ability can’t legally target an opponent, or if the ability’s target becomes illegal while the ability is on the stack, you don’t draw any cards.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "Effects that modify an affected creature\'s power and/or toughness without setting them to specific values will apply no matter when those effects began. The same is true for counters that change the creature\'s power and/or toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "Jolrael\'s last ability overwrites all previous effects that set the affected creatures\' power and/or toughness to specific values. If other effects that set these characteristics to specific values start to apply after Jolrael\'s ability resolves, they will overwrite that part of the effect."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "The triggered ability can trigger only once each turn. It doesn\'t matter if Jolrael was on the battlefield when the first card was drawn: if it\'s not on the battlefield when the second card is drawn, the ability can\'t trigger at all that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined only as Jolrael\'s last ability resolves. Once that happens, the value of X won\'t change later in the turn even if the number of cards in your hand changes."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "The cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. If the triggered ability doesn\'t resolve (because, for example, it has been countered, or all of its targets have become illegal), the cycling ability will still resolve, and you\'ll draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'When you cycle this card, first the cycling ability goes on the stack, then the triggered ability goes on the stack on top of it. The triggered ability will resolve before you draw a card from the cycling ability.\'}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Enchantments put onto the battlefield without being cast won’t cause Mesa Enchantress’s ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If the enchantment spell is countered, Mesa Enchantress’s ability still resolves and causes you to draw a card.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Mesa Enchantress’s ability will resolve before the spell that caused it to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If Valduk leaves the battlefield after its ability has resolved, the tokens are still exiled at the beginning of the next end step.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If Valduk leaves the battlefield after its ability has triggered but before it resolves, use the number of Auras and Equipment that were last attached to it before it left the battlefield to determine how many tokens to create.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Valduk counts all Auras and Equipment attached to it, not only Auras and Equipment you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If you don’t play the card exiled with Urza’s last ability, it remains in exile.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'The token created by Urza’s first ability will count itself, so it’ll be at least 1/1.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Urza’s last ability doesn’t change when you can play the exiled card. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty. If you exile a land card, you can play it only during your main phase and only if you have an available land play remaining.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'You can tap any untapped artifact you control to pay the cost of the mana ability, including an artifact creature you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn. Tapping an Equipment this way won’t affect its abilities or the equipped creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Piles may be empty.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'The creature put onto the battlefield by Chainer’s activated ability is black only, not black in addition to its other colors. It is, however, a Nightmare in addition to its other creature types. As it enters the battlefield, it is already a black Nightmare (and perhaps some other creature types); it doesn’t enter and then become a black Nightmare.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'The cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. If the triggered ability doesn’t resolve (because, for example, it has been countered, or all of its targets have become illegal), the cycling ability will still resolve and you’ll draw a card.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'When you cycle this card, first the cycling ability goes on the stack, then the triggered ability goes on the stack on top of it. The triggered ability will resolve before you draw a card from the cycling ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Use the power of the creature from when it was last on the battlefield to determine how much life is gained.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'You may find a basic Forest or any land card with the land type Forest.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'You must choose a legal target for each target required by Decimate. However, if a permanent has multiple card types, it may be chosen as the target for more than one instance of the word "target." For example, you could cast Decimate targeting an artifact creature, an enchantment, and a land.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers "Whenever you proliferate" triggers even if you chose no permanents or players while doing so.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If a permanent ever has both +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it at the same time, they\'re removed in pairs as a state-based action so that the permanent has only one of those kinds of counters on it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If a player or permanent has more than one kind of counter on it, and you choose for it to get additional counters, it must get one of each kind of counter it already has. You can\'t have it get just one kind of counter it already has and not the others."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Players can respond to a spell or ability whose effect includes proliferating. Once that spell or ability starts to resolve, however, and its controller chooses which permanents and players will get new counters, it\'s too late for anyone to respond."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "To proliferate, you can choose any permanent that has a counter, including ones controlled by opponents. You can choose any player who has a counter, including opponents. You can\'t choose cards in any zone other than the battlefield, even if they have counters on them."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t have to choose every permanent or player that has a counter, only the ones you want to add another counter to. Since "any number" includes zero, you don\\\'t have to choose any permanents at all, and you don\\\'t have to choose any players at all.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren\'t affected."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "Any time you have priority, you may turn a manifested creature face up by revealing that it\'s a creature card (ignoring any copy effects or type-changing effects that might be applying to it) and paying its mana cost. This is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "Because face-down creatures don\'t have names, they can\'t have the same name as any other creature, even another face-down creature."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it\'s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn\'t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "If a double-faced\\xa0card is manifested, it will be put onto the battlefield face down. While face down, a transforming double-faced card can\'t transform or convert. If the front face of a face down double-faced card is a creature card, you can turn it face up by paying its mana cost. If you do, its front face will be up."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': \'If a face-down permanent you control leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': \'If a manifested creature would have morph if it were face up, you may also turn it face up by paying its morph cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "If something tries to turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, reveal that card to show all players it\'s an instant or sorcery card. The permanent remains on the battlefield face down. Abilities that trigger when a permanent turns face up won\'t trigger, because even though you revealed the card, it never turned face up."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "The face-down permanent is a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It\'s colorless and has a mana value of 0. Other effects that apply to the permanent can still grant or change any of these characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "Turning a permanent face up or face down doesn\'t change whether that permanent is tapped or untapped."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "Unlike a face-down creature that was cast using the morph ability, a manifested creature may still be turned face up after it loses its abilities if it\'s a creature card."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "You can look at a face-down permanent you control any time. You can\'t look at face-down permanents you don\'t control unless an effect allows you to or instructs you to."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You\'re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for indicating this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield. You must also track how each became face down (manifested, cast face down using the morph ability, and so on)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': \'Abstruse Archaic\\\'s ability can copy activated and triggered abilities of dungeons, emblems, planes, and phenomenons. It can\\\'t copy the Planechase-specific "planeswalking ability" or the triggered abilities associated with the monarch or initiative designations, as those abilities have no source.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "Abstruse Archaic\'s ability targets an ability that is on the stack and creates another instance of that ability on the stack. It doesn\'t cause any object to gain an ability."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities contain a colon. They\\\'re generally written "[Cost]: [Effect]." Some keyword abilities (such as equip) are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text. An activated mana ability is one that produces mana as it resolves, not one that costs mana to activate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "Any choices made when the ability resolves won\'t have been made yet when it\'s copied. Any such choices will be made separately when the copy resolves. If a triggered ability asks you to pay a cost, you pay that cost for the copy separately."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': \'If an ability is linked to a second ability, copies of that ability are also linked to that second ability. If the second ability refers to "the exiled card," it refers to all cards exiled by the ability and the copy. For example, if Tidehollow Sculler\\\'s enters-the-battlefield ability is copied and two cards are exiled, they both return when Tidehollow Sculler leaves the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "If the ability divides damage or distributes counters among a number of targets, the division and number of targets can\'t be changed. If you choose new targets, you must choose the same number of targets."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': \'If the ability is modal (that is, if it says, "Choose one —" or similar), the mode is copied and can\\\'t be changed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "If the activated ability\'s cost contains a choice, such as a creature to sacrifice or a number of counters to remove, the copy uses that same information. You can\'t pay the cost again, even if you want to."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': \'In some cases involving linked abilities, an ability requires information about "the exiled card." When this happens, the ability gets multiple answers. If these answers are being used to determine the value of a variable, the sum is used. If an ability attempts to create a token that is a copy of "the exiled card," it creates a token for each card exiled this way that is a copy of that card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': \'The source of the copy is the same as the source of the original ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': \'Triggered abilities use the word "when," "whenever," or "at." They\\\'re often written as "[Trigger condition], [effect]." Some keyword abilities are triggered abilities and will have "when," "whenever," or "at the beginning of" in their reminder text.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Because a spell with overload doesn\'t target when its overload cost is paid, it may affect permanents with hexproof or with protection from the appropriate color."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'If you are instructed to cast a spell with overload "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to pay its overload cost instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "If you don\'t pay the overload cost of a spell with overload, that spell will have a single target. If you pay the overload cost, the spell won\'t have any targets."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as an overload cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]']
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': "Sek\'Kuar, der Todesbewahrer", \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Nichtspielsteinkreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, erzeuge einen 3/1 schwarzen und roten Leiche-Kreaturenspielstein mit Eile.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Ork, Schamane\', \'flavor\': "Die Orks glauben, dass Sek\'Kuar immer noch im karplusanischen Gebirge lebt, wo er eine untote Armee aufstellt, um Rache zu nehmen.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626616&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'325d7dec-5c21-4e93-9ff9-ae135c469c11\', \'multiverseId\': 626616}, \'multiverseid\': 626616}, {\'name\': "Sek\'Kuar, gardemort", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature non-jeton que vous contrôlez meurt, créez un jeton de créature 3/1 noire et rouge Désencavé avec la célérité.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : orque et shamane\', \'flavor\': "Les orques croient que Sek\'Kuar vit encore dans les montagnes de Karpluse, rassemblant son armée de morts, déterminé à prendre sa revanche.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626956&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0145096c-da86-461d-939d-504b6caa766a\', \'multiverseId\': 626956}, \'multiverseid\': 626956}, {\'name\': \'死の守り手、セックァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていてトークンでもこれでもないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、速攻を持つ黒赤の３/１の墓生まれ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — オーク・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'オークたちは、セックァーがいまだにカープルーザンの山で生き続けており、死者の軍団を集めて復讐を遂げようとしていると信じている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f2128f5-027d-4cb3-aadb-4b0da33cb68d\', \'multiverseId\': 627296}, \'multiverseid\': 627296}, {\'name\': \'死亡守卫赛夸\', \'text\': \'每当另一个由你操控且非衍生物的生物死去时，派出一个3/1，黑红双色，具敏捷异能的墓生衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～半兽人／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'半兽人相信，赛夸依然存活在卡普路桑山脉中，集结亡者大军，密谋一雪前耻。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1b2a5f9-5f00-4718-ac77-953b07eb8bf5\', \'multiverseId\': 627636}, \'multiverseid\': 627636}]', '[{\'name\': "Sek\'Kuar, der Todesbewahrer", \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Nichtspielsteinkreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, erzeuge einen 3/1 schwarzen und roten Leiche-Kreaturenspielstein mit Eile.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Ork, Schamane\', \'flavor\': "Die Orks glauben, dass Sek\'Kuar immer noch im karplusanischen Gebirge lebt, wo er eine untote Armee aufstellt, um Rache zu nehmen.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628052&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b52acde8-9305-4923-9547-6cdd84fd700b\', \'multiverseId\': 628052}, \'multiverseid\': 628052}, {\'name\': "Sek\'Kuar, guardián de la muerte", \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura que no sea ficha que controlas muera, crea una ficha de criatura Cadáver negra y roja 3/1 con la habilidad de prisa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Chamán orco\', \'flavor\': "Los orcos creen que Sek\'Kuar vive todavía en las montañas karplusianas, reuniendo a su ejército muerto con la intención de vengarse.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76a8e116-f545-4518-a914-3769bac3ed74\', \'multiverseId\': 628286}, \'multiverseid\': 628286}, {\'name\': \'死の守り手、セックァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていてトークンでもこれでもないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、速攻を持つ黒赤の３/１の墓生まれ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — オーク・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'オークたちは、セックァーがいまだにカープルーザンの山で生き続けており、死者の軍団を集めて復讐を遂げようとしていると信じている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31eb5e61-fdb0-45fe-b146-4a44c17233f3\', \'multiverseId\': 628754}, \'multiverseid\': 628754}, {\'name\': \'死亡守卫赛夸\', \'text\': \'每当另一个由你操控且非衍生物的生物死去时，派出一个3/1，黑红双色，具敏捷异能的墓生衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～半兽人／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'半兽人相信，赛夸依然存活在卡普路桑山脉中，集结亡者大军，密谋一雪前耻。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62d7bf9c-3a8d-49c2-990a-8c5be99a8639\', \'multiverseId\': 629222}, \'multiverseid\': 629222}]', "[{'name': 'Aasmade', 'text': 'Die Aasmade erhält +X/+0, wobei X gleich der höchsten Stärke unter den Kreaturenkarten in deinem Friedhof ist.\\nWenn die Aasmade ins Spiel kommt, millst du vier Karten. (Lege die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Insekt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622952&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a361692e-dcc3-411e-b4f1-e282c28afafa', 'multiverseId': 622952}, 'multiverseid': 622952}, {'name': 'Larva carroñera', 'text': 'La Larva carroñera obtiene +X/+0, donde X es la mayor fuerza entre las cartas de criatura en tu cementerio.\\nCuando la Larva carroñera entre al campo de batalla, muele cuatro cartas. (Pon las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Insecto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623153&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '81d486b1-471d-47b3-9543-afda0f43914a', 'multiverseId': 623153}, 'multiverseid': 623153}, {'name': 'Larve charognarde', 'text': 'La Larve charognarde gagne +X/+0, X étant la force la plus élevée parmi les cartes de créature de votre cimetière.\\nQuand la Larve charognarde arrive sur le champ de bataille, meulez quatre cartes. (Mettez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.)', 'type': 'Créature : insecte', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623354&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '47ee0cda-a88c-4f80-bf7c-c4e37d400ae7', 'multiverseId': 623354}, 'multiverseid': 623354}, {'name': '屍肉地虫', 'text': '屍肉地虫は＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードの中で最大のパワーに等しい。\\n屍肉地虫が戦場に出たとき、カード４枚を切削する。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード４枚をあなたの墓地に置く。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 昆虫', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623756&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '64156e00-f6cc-495a-a710-6199ef2ac88d', 'multiverseId': 623756}, 'multiverseid': 623756}, {'name': '腐肉幼虫', 'text': '腐肉幼虫得+X/+0，X为你坟墓场内生物牌中的最大力量。\\n当腐肉幼虫进战场时，磨四张牌。（将你牌库顶的四张牌置入你的坟墓场。）', 'type': '生物 ～昆虫', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624158&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8b7e3e49-901f-408f-8073-02aa11b4ccae', 'multiverseId': 624158}, 'multiverseid': 624158}]", '[{\'name\': \'Abbild der Ahnen\', \'text\': \'Sowie das Abbild der Ahnen ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Kreaturentyp.\\nKreaturen des bestimmten Typs, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\n{3}, {T}: Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine Kreaturenkarte des bestimmten Typs offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625617&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d761936a-7043-4e87-a0fa-5b90a5edd9a4\', \'multiverseId\': 625617}, \'multiverseid\': 625617}, {\'name\': "Icône de l\'Ascendance", \'text\': "Au moment où l\'Icône de l\'Ascendance arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un type de créature.\\nLes créatures du type choisi que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\n{3}, {T} : Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler une carte de créature du type choisi parmi elles et la mettre dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625874&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65a27bf6-04ac-439f-b961-f9965cf124a3\', \'multiverseId\': 625874}, \'multiverseid\': 625874}, {\'name\': \'祖先の象徴\', \'text\': \'祖先の象徴が戦場に出るに際し、クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてその選ばれたタイプであるすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n{3}, {T}：あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚を見る。あなたは「その中から、その選ばれたタイプのクリーチャー・カード１枚を公開してあなたの手札に加える。」を選んでもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38e14f65-ebdb-4640-898e-6c4ebeb2d40f\', \'multiverseId\': 626131}, \'multiverseid\': 626131}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abgenutzter Kraftstein\', \'text\': \'Der Abgenutzte Kraftstein kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Selbst der Splitter eines Kraftsteins enthält nicht nur Energie, sondern Raum — gewaltige Dimensionen gefangen in zerbrechlichem Kristall.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625646&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd47e428-06b9-453d-b195-b10edaa27fba\', \'multiverseId\': 625646}, \'multiverseid\': 625646}, {\'name\': \'Lithoforce usée\', \'text\': \'La Lithoforce usée arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Même à l\'état de fragment, les lithoforces ne renferment pas que de l\'énergie, mais aussi de l\'espace : de vastes dimensions piégées dans un cristal fragile.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625903&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f63eee90-435c-4632-ac57-8941c2820b7c\', \'multiverseId\': 625903}, \'multiverseid\': 625903}, {\'name\': \'摩滅したパワーストーン\', \'text\': \'摩滅したパワーストーンはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{C}{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'パワーストーンの欠片ですら、その中に力だけでなく空間を持つ。脆い水晶の中に閉じ込められた広大な空間だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2977dbb-457d-415e-a14e-623edb6c3053\', \'multiverseId\': 626160}, \'multiverseid\': 626160}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abgott der Vergessenheit\', \'text\': \'{T}: Ziehe eine Karte. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du in diesem Zug einen Spielstein erzeugt hast.\\n{8}, {T}, opfere den Abgott der Vergessenheit: Erzeuge einen 10/10 farblosen Eldrazi-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Erwache, Großartiger, und säubere die Welt von unseren Feinden!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626632&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8786ebd9-b273-4f4e-9e2b-cac4c286a93b\', \'multiverseId\': 626632}, \'multiverseid\': 626632}, {\'name\': "Idole de l\'oubli", \'text\': "{T} : Piochez une carte. N\'activez cette capacité que si vous avez créé un jeton ce tour-ci.\\n{8}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Idole de l\'oubli : Créez un jeton de créature 10/10 incolore Eldrazi.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Lève-toi, glorieux élu, et purifie le monde de nos ennemis ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626972&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'819ad8c1-7cb3-4280-98ab-b8d9bea4988d\', \'multiverseId\': 626972}, \'multiverseid\': 626972}, {\'name\': \'忘却の偶像\', \'text\': \'{T}：カード１枚を引く。このターンにあなたがトークンを生成していなければ起動できない。\\n{8}, {T}, 忘却の偶像を生け贄に捧げる：無色の10/10のエルドラージ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「偉大なるものよ、立ち上がり、そして我らの敵たるこの世界を浄化したまえ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4cf7336-a1e9-4c14-8b1d-4ca4732bf5e2\', \'multiverseId\': 627312}, \'multiverseid\': 627312}, {\'name\': \'佚界雕像\', \'text\': \'{T}：抓一张牌。只能于你派出过衍生物的回合中起动。\\n{8}，{T}，牺牲佚界雕像：派出一个10/10无色奥札奇衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「苏醒吧，巨物，再次将敌人从世上彻底涤净！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a369202-b30b-4520-aa38-db49e0c8b33c\', \'multiverseId\': 627652}, \'multiverseid\': 627652}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abgott der Vergessenheit\', \'text\': \'{T}: Ziehe eine Karte. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du in diesem Zug einen Spielstein erzeugt hast.\\n{8}, {T}, opfere den Abgott der Vergessenheit: Erzeuge einen 10/10 farblosen Eldrazi-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Erwache, Großartiger, und säubere die Welt von unseren Feinden!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628090&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11893305-240b-44e9-a78d-1f17e0d83219\', \'multiverseId\': 628090}, \'multiverseid\': 628090}, {\'name\': \'Ídolo del olvido\', \'text\': \'{T}: Roba una carta. Activa esto solo si creaste una ficha este turno.\\n{8}, {T}, sacrificar el Ídolo del olvido: Crea una ficha de criatura Eldrazi incolora 10/10.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Álzate, ser inmenso, y libra al mundo de nuestros enemigos!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37b90b40-ed13-4296-aa9f-b80e29fe2726\', \'multiverseId\': 628324}, \'multiverseid\': 628324}, {\'name\': \'忘却の偶像\', \'text\': \'{T}：カード１枚を引く。このターンにあなたがトークンを生成していなければ起動できない。\\n{8}, {T}, 忘却の偶像を生け贄に捧げる：無色の10/10のエルドラージ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「偉大なるものよ、立ち上がり、そして我らの敵たるこの世界を浄化したまえ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecdcc3c9-fabf-4ccc-9824-923dbdec6607\', \'multiverseId\': 628792}, \'multiverseid\': 628792}, {\'name\': \'佚界雕像\', \'text\': \'{T}：抓一张牌。只能于你派出过衍生物的回合中起动。\\n{8}，{T}，牺牲佚界雕像：派出一个10/10无色奥札奇衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「苏醒吧，巨物，再次将敌人从世上彻底涤净！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'628d17a0-1171-4c65-8f6f-ea83168646a5\', \'multiverseId\': 629260}, \'multiverseid\': 629260}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abstruses Urzeitwesen\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\n{1}, {T}: Kopiere eine aktivierte oder ausgelöste Fähigkeit deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst und die eine farblose Quelle hat. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen. (Manafähigkeiten können nicht als Ziel gewählt werden.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Avatar\', \'flavor\': \'Von der Last der Sterblichkeit befreit streifen die Urzeitwesen durch die Fernländer, auf der Suche nach Wissen, das nur sie begreifen können.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625109&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57a6cb7f-c443-4d87-9221-b3b9f479b940\', \'multiverseId\': 625109}, \'multiverseid\': 625109}, {\'name\': \'Archaïque abscons\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\n{1}, {T} : Copiez une capacité activée ou déclenchée ciblée que vous contrôlez d\'une source incolore. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie. (Les capacités de mana ne peuvent pas être ciblées.)", \'type\': \'Créature : avatar\', \'flavor\': "Libérés de la mortalité, les archaïques errent dans les Vasteterres à la recherche de connaissances qu\'eux seuls peuvent comprendre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625141&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e44dec2-6a5b-422e-8a81-8d6490692334\', \'multiverseId\': 625141}, \'multiverseid\': 625141}, {\'name\': \'難解なアルカイック\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n{1}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしていて発生源が無色であり起動型や誘発型である能力１つを対象とする。それをコピーする。そのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。（マナ能力は対象にできない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アバター\', \'flavor\': \'定命から開放されたアルカイックは、自らのみ理解できる知識を求めて大界を彷徨う。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbcc3b2f-ff13-42fa-b9d9-364ff361c7ed\', \'multiverseId\': 625173}, \'multiverseid\': 625173}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abstruses Urzeitwesen\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\n{1}, {T}: Kopiere eine aktivierte oder ausgelöste Fähigkeit deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst und die eine farblose Quelle hat. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624905&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d3adcb0-1cdb-4f8b-a84e-e06d3d3a0008\', \'multiverseId\': 624905}, \'multiverseid\': 624905}, {\'name\': \'Archaïque abscons\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\n{1}, {T} : Copiez une capacité activée ou déclenchée ciblée que vous contrôlez d\'une source incolore. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.", \'type\': \'Créature : avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624940&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95f6c13b-949c-44a4-a3f7-9e3cc4eae667\', \'multiverseId\': 624940}, \'multiverseid\': 624940}, {\'name\': \'難解なアルカイック\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n{1}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしていて発生源が無色であり起動型や誘発型である能力１つを対象とする。それをコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アバター\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9bfd06d-7f00-45f7-871f-3bf1bd906fd9\', \'multiverseId\': 624975}, \'multiverseid\': 624975}, {\'name\': \'究奥古旅人\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n{1}，{T}：复制目标由你操控且来源为无色的起动式或触发式异能。你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～圣者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4d7d556-dae2-46d9-8e3b-75e3822dd938\', \'multiverseId\': 625010}, \'multiverseid\': 625010}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abwehrender Schlag\', \'text\': \'Falls du einen Kommandeur kontrollierst, kannst du diesen Zauberspruch wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\nDu kannst neue Ziele für einen Zauberspruch oder eine Fähigkeit deiner Wahl bestimmen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Angriffe der Erzmagier waren für Kalamax nichts weiter als kleine Ärgernisse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626557&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64931590-8936-42b8-9bae-f1ad649f904d\', \'multiverseId\': 626557}, \'multiverseid\': 626557}, {\'name\': \'Claque déflectrice\', \'text\': \'Si vous contrôlez un commandant, vous pouvez lancer ce sort sans payer son coût de mana.\\nVous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour une cible, sort ou capacité.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Pour Kalamax, les attaques des archimages ne sont tout au plus qu\'un léger agacement.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626897&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8dbe68df-fdeb-45fb-8ea7-e4af47c7cee0\', \'multiverseId\': 626897}, \'multiverseid\': 626897}, {\'name\': \'偏向はたき\', \'text\': \'あなたが統率者をコントロールしているなら、この呪文をマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\\n呪文や能力のうち１つを対象とする。それの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'大魔導師の攻撃は、カラマックスにとっては鬱陶しい程度のものだった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'467f769b-11a7-4d3a-8d1e-b12851088708\', \'multiverseId\': 627237}, \'multiverseid\': 627237}, {\'name\': \'偏转击\', \'text\': \'如果你操控指挥官，则你可以施放此咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\\n你可以为目标咒语或异能选择新的目标。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'在卡勒麦眼中，大法师的攻击也不过只是烦人的雕虫小技。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'298e1fd3-65e1-408d-afc6-b5750825cb60\', \'multiverseId\': 627577}, \'multiverseid\': 627577}]', "[{'name': 'Abwehrender Schlag', 'text': 'Falls du einen Kommandeur kontrollierst, kannst du diesen Zauberspruch wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\nDu kannst neue Ziele für einen Zauberspruch oder eine Fähigkeit deiner Wahl bestimmen.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Die Angriffe der Erzmagier waren für Kalamax nichts weiter als kleine Ärgernisse.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627912&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f446950-ac71-4bf2-ac32-3878a83d6f90', 'multiverseId': 627912}, 'multiverseid': 627912}, {'name': 'Golpe desviador', 'text': 'Si controlas un comandante, puedes lanzar este hechizo sin pagar su coste de maná.\\nPuedes elegir nuevos objetivos para el hechizo o la habilidad objetivo.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Los ataques de los archimagos no son más que molestias para Kálamax.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628146&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8e0f4c2a-b8a3-4848-82d8-50585af7d641', 'multiverseId': 628146}, 'multiverseid': 628146}, {'name': '偏向はたき', 'text': 'あなたが統率者をコントロールしているなら、この呪文をマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\\n呪文や能力のうち１つを対象とする。それの新しい対象を選んでもよい。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '大魔導師の攻撃は、カラマックスにとっては鬱陶しい程度のものだった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628614&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '03d1f378-a617-46a1-9b4b-fdba2c3c802e', 'multiverseId': 628614}, 'multiverseid': 628614}, {'name': '偏转击', 'text': '如果你操控指挥官，则你可以施放此咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\\n你可以为目标咒语或异能选择新的目标。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '在卡勒麦眼中，大法师的攻击也不过只是烦人的雕虫小技。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629082&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a413bfaa-f8bf-47b1-b521-2ea38aa06b2f', 'multiverseId': 629082}, 'multiverseid': 629082}]", '[{\'name\': \'Abwehrender Schlag\', \'text\': \'Falls du einen Kommandeur kontrollierst, kannst du diesen Zauberspruch wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\nDu kannst neue Ziele für einen Zauberspruch oder eine Fähigkeit deiner Wahl bestimmen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Gekommen, um den Drachen zum Wohle des Königreichs zu erschlagen? Wie schrecklich vorhersehbar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624792&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cb97b45-11ea-4bc2-bd76-221689f8817b\', \'multiverseId\': 624792}, \'multiverseid\': 624792}, {\'name\': \'Golpe desviador\', \'text\': \'Si controlas un comandante, puedes lanzar este hechizo sin pagar su coste de maná.\\nPuedes elegir nuevos objetivos para el hechizo o la habilidad objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Vienen a acabar con el dragón en nombre del reino? Qué predecible...".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd8a4af9-a182-4c8e-b12f-b0fca674f6b8\', \'multiverseId\': 624804}, \'multiverseid\': 624804}, {\'name\': \'Claque déflectrice\', \'text\': \'Si vous contrôlez un commandant, vous pouvez lancer ce sort sans payer son coût de mana.\\nVous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour une cible, sort ou capacité.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« On vient pourfendre le dragon pour le bien du royaume ? Comme c\'est prévisible. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624816&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cc9a088-4c31-4208-825d-25bd4a4e8a2e\', \'multiverseId\': 624816}, \'multiverseid\': 624816}, {\'name\': \'偏向はたき\', \'text\': \'あなたが統率者をコントロールしているなら、この呪文をマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\\n呪文や能力のうち１つを対象とする。それの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「王国のために竜を討伐しに来ただと？なんともわかりやすい奴だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c453d6b0-0dd9-415b-bf76-6bebed5d96af\', \'multiverseId\': 624840}, \'multiverseid\': 624840}, {\'name\': \'偏转击\', \'text\': \'如果你操控指挥官，则你可以施放此咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\\n你可以为目标咒语或异能选择新的目标。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「你也是因为心系王国安危而来屠龙的吧？毫无新意。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dcc20e2-0b7b-4713-9129-e592987ec17b\', \'multiverseId\': 624864}, \'multiverseid\': 624864}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abweichende Transformationen\', \'text\': \'Unverzagt (Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jeden Gegner {1} weniger.)\\nSchicke zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl ins Exil. Für jede jener Kreaturen deckt ihr Beherrscher Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek auf, bis er eine Kreaturenkarte aufdeckt. Er bringt die Karte ins Spiel und mischt dann den Rest in seine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626559&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'973ec678-0eb8-4354-810e-e772653366dd\', \'multiverseId\': 626559}, \'multiverseid\': 626559}, {\'name\': \'Transformations divergentes\', \'text\': "Témérité (Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque adversaire.)\\nExilez deux créatures ciblées. Pour chacune de ces créatures, son contrôleur révèle les cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce qu\'il révèle une carte de créature, met cette carte sur le champ de bataille, puis mélange le reste dans sa bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626899&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7973b9ff-b31d-474d-afd2-ae85f7039ddb\', \'multiverseId\': 626899}, \'multiverseid\': 626899}, {\'name\': \'分岐変容\', \'text\': \'不抜（この呪文を唱えるためのコストは対戦相手１人につき{1}少なくなる。）\\nクリーチャー２体を対象とする。それらを追放する。それらのクリーチャー１体につきそれぞれ、それのコントローラーは、クリーチャー・カード１枚が公開されるまで自分のライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ公開していき、そのカードを戦場に出し、その後、残りを自分のライブラリーに加えて切り直す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b64bdbcc-ce39-433a-b2d6-59f4bdb0851a\', \'multiverseId\': 627239}, \'multiverseid\': 627239}, {\'name\': \'趋异转化\', \'text\': \'不屈（每有一位对手，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。）\\n放逐两个目标生物。对每个这类生物而言，其操控者从其牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出一张生物牌为止，将该牌放进战场，然后将其余的牌洗入其牌库。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'087dafc0-a2ac-45fe-b9c4-95e304e100c9\', \'multiverseId\': 627579}, \'multiverseid\': 627579}]', "[{'name': 'Abweichende Transformationen', 'text': 'Unverzagt (Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jeden Gegner {1} weniger.)\\nSchicke zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl ins Exil. Für jede jener Kreaturen deckt ihr Beherrscher Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek auf, bis er eine Kreaturenkarte aufdeckt. Er bringt die Karte ins Spiel und mischt dann den Rest in seine Bibliothek.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627914&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b72730eb-6691-428e-9b01-3ddf22600c6f', 'multiverseId': 627914}, 'multiverseid': 627914}, {'name': 'Transformaciones divergentes', 'text': 'Audacia. (Cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada oponente.)\\nExilia dos criaturas objetivo. Por cada una de esas criaturas, su controlador muestra cartas de la parte superior de su biblioteca hasta que muestre una carta de criatura. Pone esa carta en el campo de batalla y luego baraja el resto en su biblioteca.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628148&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'da602ac1-4a2a-4ada-9071-183ae9a92b62', 'multiverseId': 628148}, 'multiverseid': 628148}, {'name': '分岐変容', 'text': '不抜（この呪文を唱えるためのコストは対戦相手１人につき{1}少なくなる。）\\nクリーチャー２体を対象とする。それらを追放する。それらのクリーチャー１体につきそれぞれ、それのコントローラーは、クリーチャー・カード１枚が公開されるまで自分のライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ公開していき、そのカードを戦場に出し、その後、残りを自分のライブラリーに加えて切り直す。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628616&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b782f673-49dc-44d1-9efc-3deeab933de2', 'multiverseId': 628616}, 'multiverseid': 628616}, {'name': '趋异转化', 'text': '不屈（每有一位对手，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。）\\n放逐两个目标生物。对每个这类生物而言，其操控者从其牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出一张生物牌为止，将该牌放进战场，然后将其余的牌洗入其牌库。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629084&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f403844f-9be1-45e8-93eb-51a3a4dbf0c5', 'multiverseId': 629084}, 'multiverseid': 629084}]", '[{\'name\': \'Ahnenklinge\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Ahnenklinge ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein und lege die Ahnenklinge dann an ihn an.\\nDie ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+1.\\nAusrüsten {1} ({1}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622821&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bbda291-ff44-40e5-bc4f-d34f978e6723\', \'multiverseId\': 622821}, \'multiverseid\': 622821}, {\'name\': \'Filo ancestral\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Filo ancestral entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Soldado blanca 1/1 y luego anéxale el Filo ancestral.\\nLa criatura equipada obtiene +1/+1.\\nEquipar {1}. ({1}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e180ee6-9447-42bb-90fb-ff3412489d8f\', \'multiverseId\': 623022}, \'multiverseid\': 623022}, {\'name\': \'Lame ancestrale\', \'text\': "Quand la Lame ancestrale arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat, puis attachez-lui la Lame ancestrale.\\nLa créature équipée gagne +1/+1.\\nÉquipement {1} ({1} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623223&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1341afb0-651b-47b1-9e6b-fb3768b85c78\', \'multiverseId\': 623223}, \'multiverseid\': 623223}, {\'name\': \'祖先の刃\', \'text\': \'祖先の刃が戦場に出たとき、白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。その後、祖先の刃をそれにつける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n装備{1}（{1}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1326d09-98a0-4f9e-b9b9-5e529c6b142e\', \'multiverseId\': 623625}, \'multiverseid\': 623625}, {\'name\': \'祖传宝刃\', \'text\': \'当祖传宝刃进战场时，派出一个1/1白色士兵衍生生物，然后将祖传宝刃贴附于其上。\\n佩带此武具的生物得+1/+1。\\n佩带{1}（{1}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51787358-7b61-419e-a548-9a63d34c3ef1\', \'multiverseId\': 624027}, \'multiverseid\': 624027}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ainok-Schwurbruder\', \'text\': \'Standhaft {1}{W} ({1}{W}, {T}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf diese Kreatur. Spiele Standhaft wie eine Hexerei.)\\nJede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und auf der eine +1/+1-Marke liegt, hat Erstschlag.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hund, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Haltet die Stellung, für die Familie und die Gefallenen!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622816&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ddd2018-ba52-40d9-932f-8a3c0e9f269d\', \'multiverseId\': 622816}, \'multiverseid\': 622816}, {\'name\': \'Ainok unido por la fe\', \'text\': \'Supervivencia {1}{W}. ({1}{W}, {T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre esta criatura. Activa la habilidad de supervivencia solo como un conjuro.)\\nCada criatura que controlas con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella tiene la habilidad de dañar primero.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado perro\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Mantengan la formación, por la familia y los caídos!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da4303dd-0d39-4089-9f6c-e24c57dcf20c\', \'multiverseId\': 623017}, \'multiverseid\': 623017}, {\'name\': "Frère d\'armes aïnok", \'text\': "Résilience {1}{W} ({1}{W}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur cette créature. N\'utilisez la résilience que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)\\nChaque créature que vous contrôlez avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle a l\'initiative.", \'type\': \'Créature : chien et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Tenez la position, au nom de la famille et de ceux qui ont péri ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623218&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38c76d37-dad7-4ff3-a9d2-b569b52a6170\', \'multiverseId\': 623218}, \'multiverseid\': 623218}, {\'name\': \'アイノクの盟族\', \'text\': \'長久{1}{W}（{1}{W}, {T}：このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。長久はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\\nあなたがコントロールしていて＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているすべてのクリーチャーは先制攻撃を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 犬 ・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「家族や倒れた者たちのため、この戦線を維持せよ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee3eb269-cd3a-4e2d-81f2-359edc3e805d\', \'multiverseId\': 623620}, \'multiverseid\': 623620}, {\'name\': \'义缘犬人\', \'text\': \'延生{1}{W}（{1}{W}，{T}：在此生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。只能于法术时机延生。）\\n每个由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物均具有先攻异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～狗／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「坚守战线，为了家族和逝者！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16a1ffb3-53a1-422d-a66c-b40e67a09e7b\', \'multiverseId\': 624022}, \'multiverseid\': 624022}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ajani der Standhafte\', \'text\': \'+1: Bis zum Ende des Zuges erhält bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +1/+1, Erstschlag, Wachsamkeit und Lebensverknüpfung.\\n−2: Lege auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke und auf jeden anderen Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst, eine Loyalitätsmarke.\\n−7: Du erhältst ein Emblem mit „Falls eine Quelle dir oder einem Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst, Schaden zufügen würde, verhindere alle bis auf 1 dieser Schadenspunkte."\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625475&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee95fa41-030e-4d1e-8c44-8394307ad354\', \'multiverseId\': 625475}, \'multiverseid\': 625475}, {\'name\': "Ajani l\'inébranlable", \'text\': "+1 : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, jusqu\'à une créature ciblée gagne +1/+1 et acquiert l\'initiative, la vigilance et le lien de vie.\\n−2 : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez et un marqueur « loyauté » sur chaque autre planeswalker que vous contrôlez.\\n−7 : Vous gagnez un emblème avec « Si une source devait infliger des blessures à vous ou à un planeswalker que vous contrôlez, prévenez toutes ces blessures sauf 1. »", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625732&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25d3e595-8a14-41be-8072-1d8c14b4679b\', \'multiverseId\': 625732}, \'multiverseid\': 625732}, {\'name\': \'不動のアジャニ\', \'text\': \'+1：クリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋１の修整を受け先制攻撃と警戒と絆魂を得る。\\n-2：あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個と、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでない各プレインズウォーカーの上にそれぞれ忠誠カウンター１個を置く。\\n-7：あなたは「発生源１つがあなたやあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカー１体にダメージを与えるなら、そのダメージを１点を残してすべて軽減する。」を持つ紋章を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — アジャニ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c04b7f64-60a9-4e24-94e6-0b83aa35df77\', \'multiverseId\': 625989}, \'multiverseid\': 625989}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akiri, kühne Reisende\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Spieler mit einer oder mehreren ausgerüsteten Kreaturen angreifst, ziehe eine Karte.\\n{W}: Du kannst eine Ausrüstung von einer Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, lösen. Falls du dies tust, tappe die Kreatur, und sie erhält Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Kor, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Kein Engel versperrt uns den Aufstieg. Oben erwartet uns Emeria!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628033&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e8d6f68-36e9-48d2-aeab-1c66934beab0\', \'multiverseId\': 628033}, \'multiverseid\': 628033}, {\'name\': \'Akiri, viajera valerosa\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ataques a un jugador con una o más criaturas equipadas, roba una carta.\\n{W}: Puedes desanexar un Equipo de una criatura que controlas. Si lo haces, gira esa criatura y gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero kor\', \'flavor\': \'"Ningún ángel nos bloquea la subida. ¡Emeria nos espera allí arriba!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97d17395-68de-4a13-85ca-ab3844e793cd\', \'multiverseId\': 628267}, \'multiverseid\': 628267}, {\'name\': \'恐れなき探査者、アキリ\', \'text\': \'あなたが、装備品がついている１体以上のクリーチャーでプレイヤー１人を攻撃するたび、カード１枚を引く。\\n{W}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体から装備品１つをはずしてもよい。そうしたなら、そのクリーチャーをタップする。ターン終了時まで、それは破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — コー・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「私たちの上昇を阻む天使はいません。上にはエメリアが待っています！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68e023e4-fcfc-4eb1-9b78-9da55785c230\', \'multiverseId\': 628735}, \'multiverseid\': 628735}, {\'name\': \'无惧旅人娅奇丽\', \'text\': \'每当你以一个或数个佩带武具的生物攻击一位牌手时，抓一张牌。\\n{W}：你可以将任一由你操控的生物上之一个武具卸装。如果你如此作，则横置该生物且它获得不灭异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～寇族／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「天使也不能阻挡我们的攀爬脚步。伊美黎在上面等着我们！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b86b915e-cd7b-47ca-baf5-ada27188ddd3\', \'multiverseId\': 629203}, \'multiverseid\': 629203}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alharu, Ehrwürdiger der Rituale\', \'text\': \'Wenn Alharu, Ehrwürdiger der Rituale, ins Spiel kommt, lege je eine +1/+1-Marke auf bis zu zwei andere Kreaturen deiner Wahl.\\nImmer wenn eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur, die du kontrollierst und auf der eine +1/+1-Marke liegt, stirbt, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Geist-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nPartner (Du kannst zwei Kommandeure haben, falls beide Partner haben.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Mönch\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622817&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99804bbd-e23d-4744-9be0-1b47635a3ab7\', \'multiverseId\': 622817}, \'multiverseid\': 622817}, {\'name\': \'Alharu, ritualista solemne\', \'text\': \'Cuando Alharu, ritualista solemne entre al campo de batalla, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada una de hasta otras dos criaturas objetivo.\\nSiempre que una criatura que no sea ficha que controlas con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella muera, crea una ficha de criatura Espíritu blanca 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\nCamarada. (Puedes tener dos comandantes si ambos tienen camarada.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Monje humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4868b58-32eb-4e0f-b206-642fd9abdd63\', \'multiverseId\': 623018}, \'multiverseid\': 623018}, {\'name\': \'Alharu, ritualiste solennel\', \'text\': "Quand Alharu, ritualiste solennel arrive sur le champ de bataille, ciblez jusqu\'à deux autres créatures. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chacune d\'elles.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature non-jeton que vous contrôlez avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle meurt, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Esprit avec le vol.\\nPartenariat (Vous pouvez avoir deux commandants si les deux ont le partenariat.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et moine\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623219&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74809aa4-06f4-4b8e-b86a-8df858362b52\', \'multiverseId\': 623219}, \'multiverseid\': 623219}, {\'name\': \'真面目な祭儀師、アルハール\', \'text\': \'真面目な祭儀師、アルハールが戦場に出たとき、これでないクリーチャー最大２体を対象とする。それらの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\nあなたがコントロールしていて＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれていてトークンでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n共闘（両方が共闘を持つなら、あなたは２体の統率者を使用できる。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・モンク\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcb95e08-fbb0-4c0d-8373-72c765171c6e\', \'multiverseId\': 623621}, \'multiverseid\': 623621}, {\'name\': \'肃穆仪式师阿哈卢\', \'text\': \'当肃穆仪式师阿哈卢进战场时，在至多两个其他目标生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n每当一个由你操控、其上有+1/+1指示物且非衍生物的生物死去时，派出一个1/1白色，具飞行异能的精怪衍生生物。\\n拍档（你可将两个具有拍档异能的生物共同用作指挥官。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／修行僧\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72e16c00-b857-43f2-a203-218bbb9695f7\', \'multiverseId\': 624023}, \'multiverseid\': 624023}]', "[{'name': 'Alle Hoffnung auslöschen', 'text': 'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen, die keine Verzauberungen sind.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Phenax, Gott der Täuschung, bot den Soldaten Schutz vor jedem Gift auf Theros. Er ließ unerwähnt, dass Pharikas Gifte von Nyx stammten.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622966&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d6c05a1-8048-4fca-bcef-c6efab2000ce', 'multiverseId': 622966}, 'multiverseid': 622966}, {'name': 'Extinguir toda esperanza', 'text': 'Destruye todas las criaturas que no sean encantamiento.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'Fenax, el dios del engaño, ofreció a los soldados protección contra todo veneno de Theros. No vio necesario mencionar que los venenos de Farika eran de Nyx.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623167&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f0531e8f-6f12-43a8-a9b5-9275d4f86904', 'multiverseId': 623167}, 'multiverseid': 623167}, {'name': 'Détruire toute espérance', 'text': 'Détruisez toutes les créatures non-enchantements.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Phénax, dieu de la Fourberie, offrit aux soldats la protection contre tous les poisons sur Theros. Il trouva inutile de préciser que les poisons de Pharika provenaient de Nyx.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623368&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '291e2994-5981-4075-b4af-d7fcb05824d9', 'multiverseId': 623368}, 'multiverseid': 623368}, {'name': '全希望の消滅', 'text': 'エンチャントでないすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '欺瞞の神、フィナックスはテーロスのあらゆる毒への耐性を兵に授けた。ファリカの毒がニクス由来のものであると伝える必要は感じなかった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623770&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e3eb1dfd-eaf4-4b44-860e-3f7136e5b2b5', 'multiverseId': 623770}, 'multiverseid': 623770}, {'name': '浇熄希望', 'text': '消灭所有非结界生物。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '欺瞒神斐纳克保佑士兵免受塞洛斯百毒侵袭。他觉得无需提醒芳瑞卡手中乃是尼兹之毒。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624172&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '22bbf76c-069a-499b-999b-e4ff9b6835f7', 'multiverseId': 624172}, 'multiverseid': 624172}]", '[{\'name\': \'Alles zu Staub\', \'text\': \'Jeder Spieler opfert alle bleibenden Karten, die er kontrolliert und die eine oder mehrere Farben haben.\', \'type\': \'Stammes-Hexerei — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Wiedererscheinen der Eldrazi ist nicht unbedingt eine schlechte Sache, zumindest wenn man bereits ein erfülltes Leben ohne Reue hinter sich hat."\\n—Javad Nasrin, Reliktsammler aus Ondu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625462&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00e638d7-72e3-4d6b-9ae4-20bb2e7bf3d5\', \'multiverseId\': 625462}, \'multiverseid\': 625462}, {\'name\': "Tout n\'est que poussière", \'text\': "Chaque joueur sacrifie tous les permanents qu\'il contrôle qui ont au moins une couleur.", \'type\': \'Rituel tribal : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': "« L\'apparition des Eldrazi n\'est pas nécessairement une mauvaise chose, tant que vous avez déjà eu une vie bien remplie, satisfaisante et sans regrets. »\\n—Javad Nasrin, chasseuse de reliques du Ondou", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625719&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6187ddcb-e9b2-4280-ab23-51953a2d58fb\', \'multiverseId\': 625719}, \'multiverseid\': 625719}, {\'name\': \'全ては塵\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分がコントロールしていて１色以上の色を持つすべてのパーマネントを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'部族・ソーサリー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': \'「エルドラージが目覚めたからって悪いことばかりじゃないさ。お前さんの人生が後悔の無い完璧に満たされたやつだったんならな。」\\n――オンドゥの遺物狩り、ジャヴァド・ナスリン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e937bbd-eb3c-48ae-bdd0-5a645fed3636\', \'multiverseId\': 625976}, \'multiverseid\': 625976}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alles, was glänzt\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jedes Artefakt und/oder jede Verzauberung, das bzw. die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Die Freude einer Fee über ihren Schatz verblasst schnell zu Zufriedenheit, dann zu Langeweile. Schließlich wird daraus der Drang, etwas Neues zu stehlen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622818&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cf95320-c383-43e1-b18e-0d427065d9c4\', \'multiverseId\': 622818}, \'multiverseid\': 622818}, {\'name\': \'Todo lo que reluce\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 por cada artefacto y/o encantamiento que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'La alegría de un hada al conseguir su tesoro se desvanece rápidamente para convertirse en satisfacción, después aburrimiento y por último en la necesidad de robar otro poquito más.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11184e2f-d5b2-46d4-beae-572680bc2eac\', \'multiverseId\': 623019}, \'multiverseid\': 623019}, {\'name\': \'Tout ce qui brille\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 pour chaque artefact et/ou enchantement que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Une færie se délecte de son trésor avant de s\'en contenter, de s\'en lasser, puis de ressentir le besoin d\'en voler davantage.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623220&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'653342a2-661f-4d84-a4af-9bfd45aee6e1\', \'multiverseId\': 623220}, \'multiverseid\': 623220}, {\'name\': \'きらきらするすべて\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは、アーティファクトやエンチャントのうちあなたがコントロールしている１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'宝に埋もれたフェアリーの興奮はすぐに満足へと変わり、そして退屈となり、やがて更なる盗みへの原動力となった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67424173-2c8b-4e84-b1cd-161bc343545a\', \'multiverseId\': 623622}, \'multiverseid\': 623622}, {\'name\': \'闪光宝物\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n你每操控一个神器和／或结界，所结附的生物便得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'新有收获，仙灵都会笑逐颜开，但这种心情很快平复，继而生厌，接着就又打起再度行窃的念头。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50ddd6e8-4e46-4d3c-8eb5-b2a6285d1553\', \'multiverseId\': 624024}, \'multiverseid\': 624024}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alles, was glänzt\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jedes Artefakt und/oder jede Verzauberung, das bzw. die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Wer sagt, Liebe sei das größte Geschenk, hat noch nie einen Rubin von dieser Größe bekommen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624452&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4f5637b-109e-470c-8913-3e66ec7442d9\', \'multiverseId\': 624452}, \'multiverseid\': 624452}, {\'name\': \'Todo lo que reluce\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 por cada artefacto y/o encantamiento que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Quien diga que el amor es el mayor regalo de todos nunca tuvo en sus manos un rubí del tamaño de su cabeza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d54a7363-0e0e-4f88-8a00-a087dad838b6\', \'multiverseId\': 624498}, \'multiverseid\': 624498}, {\'name\': \'Tout ce qui brille\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 pour chaque artefact et/ou enchantement que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Ceux qui disent que l\'amour est le plus beau cadeau qui soit n\'ont jamais reçu un rubis gros comme leur tête.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624544&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b296734c-fce0-4e8c-a1a2-7ffd41ed48dd\', \'multiverseId\': 624544}, \'multiverseid\': 624544}, {\'name\': \'きらきらするすべて\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは、アーティファクトやエンチャントのうちあなたがコントロールしている１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'愛こそ最高の贈り物とのたまう連中は、その連中の顔ほどの大きさもあるルビーを手にしたことがない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d86dc15-81fb-453d-89df-38f499774978\', \'multiverseId\': 624636}, \'multiverseid\': 624636}, {\'name\': \'闪光宝物\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n你每操控一个神器和／或结界，所结附的生物便得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'那些日夜宣扬爱情才是最佳馈赠的人，一定从没收到过跟脸孔一般大小的红宝石。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09c22ac3-6072-4071-82d6-ac5bfb49ee26\', \'multiverseId\': 624728}, \'multiverseid\': 624728}]', '[{\'name\': \'Almosensammler\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFalls ein Gegner zwei oder mehr Karten ziehen würde, zieht stattdessen du und er jeweils eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist ungerecht, wenn manche profitieren und andere leer ausgehen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622819&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba48dfd6-205c-46dd-b857-206cb88f25b5\', \'multiverseId\': 622819}, \'multiverseid\': 622819}, {\'name\': \'Recaudador de dádivas\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nSi un oponente fuera a robar dos o más cartas, en vez de eso, ese jugador y tú roban una carta cada uno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo felino\', \'flavor\': \'"No es justicia cuando solo unos se benefician".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fedee63d-2866-4de2-a99e-561d0d9e2aac\', \'multiverseId\': 623020}, \'multiverseid\': 623020}, {\'name\': \'Collecteur de charité\', \'text\': \'Flash\\nSi un adversaire devait piocher au moins deux cartes, à la place vous et ce joueur piochez chacun une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : chat et clerc\', \'flavor\': "« Il n\'y a pas de justice quand certains se gavent tandis que d\'autres dépérissent. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623221&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c34e190-060a-463d-803a-4d9428a4c752\', \'multiverseId\': 623221}, \'multiverseid\': 623221}, {\'name\': \'托鉢する者\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n対戦相手１人が２枚以上のカードを引くなら、代わりにあなたとそのプレイヤーはそれぞれカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「特定の者のみが恩恵にあずかるのでは正義とは言えない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e1e06a4-87bc-412b-bc03-50d852bc5a1c\', \'multiverseId\': 623623}, \'multiverseid\': 623623}, {\'name\': \'劫济僧\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n如果某对手将抓两张或更多牌，则改为你和该牌手各抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「苦乐不均仍存，世间公义不在。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad2663fd-31c7-4853-8d37-5d131134641d\', \'multiverseId\': 624025}, \'multiverseid\': 624025}]', '[{\'name\': \'Almosensammler\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFalls ein Gegner zwei oder mehr Karten ziehen würde, zieht stattdessen du und er jeweils eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist ungerecht, wenn manche profitieren und andere leer ausgehen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626480&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99993fd7-3da0-4cdf-90e3-92795a8c30f8\', \'multiverseId\': 626480}, \'multiverseid\': 626480}, {\'name\': \'Collecteur de charité\', \'text\': \'Flash\\nSi un adversaire devait piocher au moins deux cartes, à la place vous et ce joueur piochez chacun une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : chat et clerc\', \'flavor\': "« Il n\'y a pas de justice quand certains se gavent tandis que d\'autres dépérissent. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626820&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c3d05b6-87df-4162-b4ad-ebe9e9d7b998\', \'multiverseId\': 626820}, \'multiverseid\': 626820}, {\'name\': \'托鉢する者\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n対戦相手１人が２枚以上のカードを引くなら、代わりにあなたとそのプレイヤーはそれぞれカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「特定の者のみが恩恵にあずかるのでは正義とは言えない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f7508ca-79c9-4867-861d-7fe306009ffe\', \'multiverseId\': 627160}, \'multiverseid\': 627160}, {\'name\': \'劫济僧\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n如果某对手将抓两张或更多牌，则改为你和该牌手各抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「苦乐不均仍存，世间公义不在。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22566970-4ad8-4907-8463-0a92e253e4ce\', \'multiverseId\': 627500}, \'multiverseid\': 627500}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aminatous Weissagung\', \'text\': \'Schicke die obersten acht Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst davon eine Länderkarte ins Spiel bringen. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du für jeden Kartentyp außer Land von den ins Exil geschickten Karten einen Zauberspruch jenes Typs wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622882&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'430e7577-00ec-46bd-8f6d-40400f629a0c\', \'multiverseId\': 622882}, \'multiverseid\': 622882}, {\'name\': \'Augurio de Aminatou\', \'text\': \'Exilia las ocho primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner en el campo de batalla una carta de tierra de entre ellas. Hasta el final del turno, por cada tipo de carta que no sea tierra, puedes lanzar un hechizo de ese tipo de entre las cartas exiliadas sin pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24fb9dfe-d09d-433e-92ad-12a0416485a8\', \'multiverseId\': 623083}, \'multiverseid\': 623083}, {\'name\': "Augure d\'Aminatou", \'text\': "Exilez les huit cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de terrain parmi elles. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, pour chaque type de carte non-terrain, vous pouvez lancer un sort de ce type parmi les cartes exilées sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623284&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19e15c9e-2d88-4408-9491-a40223ee4318\', \'multiverseId\': 623284}, \'multiverseid\': 623284}, {\'name\': \'アミナトゥの占い\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード８枚を追放する。その中から土地・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。ターン終了時まで、土地でない各カード・タイプにつきそれぞれ、その追放されているカードの中からそのタイプである呪文１つを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e64b88d6-da50-42d7-a257-225161bd1bba\', \'multiverseId\': 623686}, \'multiverseid\': 623686}, {\'name\': \'阿米娜图的卜算\', \'text\': \'放逐你牌库顶的八张牌。你可以将其中一张地牌放进战场。直到回合结束，对每种非地之牌张类别而言，你可以从所放逐的牌之中施放一个该类别的咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7fb6f85-2798-49ec-86b5-bcd09d71492a\', \'multiverseId\': 624088}, \'multiverseid\': 624088}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aminatous Weissagung\', \'text\': \'Schicke die obersten acht Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst davon eine Länderkarte ins Spiel bringen. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du für jeden Kartentyp außer Land von den ins Exil geschickten Karten einen Zauberspruch jenes Typs wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626504&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1fa9525-66e3-4b20-bedc-0681d016bd58\', \'multiverseId\': 626504}, \'multiverseid\': 626504}, {\'name\': "Augure d\'Aminatou", \'text\': "Exilez les huit cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de terrain parmi elles. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, pour chaque type de carte non-terrain, vous pouvez lancer un sort de ce type parmi les cartes exilées sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626844&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9d37d02-ade8-4797-b290-740b0a421954\', \'multiverseId\': 626844}, \'multiverseid\': 626844}, {\'name\': \'アミナトゥの占い\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード８枚を追放する。その中から土地・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。ターン終了時まで、土地でない各カード・タイプにつきそれぞれ、その追放されているカードの中からそのタイプである呪文１つを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94771d76-376b-43c3-bfe6-90b9bf662515\', \'multiverseId\': 627184}, \'multiverseid\': 627184}, {\'name\': \'阿米娜图的卜算\', \'text\': \'放逐你牌库顶的八张牌。你可以将其中一张地牌放进战场。直到回合结束，对每种非地之牌张类别而言，你可以从所放逐的牌之中施放一个该类别的咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04ec257e-a548-4a55-a7d8-a4305d812a47\', \'multiverseId\': 627524}, \'multiverseid\': 627524}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anafenza, Geist des Sippenbaums\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Nichtspielsteinkreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, wende Kräftigung 1 an. (Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur mit der niedrigsten Widerstandskraft unter den Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Geist, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Sie starb den Märtyrertod, da sie ihre Ahnen anbetete, und wandelt nun unter ihnen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622820&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'507b520e-c072-4a52-9d08-14aab6462d19\', \'multiverseId\': 622820}, \'multiverseid\': 622820}, {\'name\': \'Anafenza, espíritu del árbol familiar\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura que no sea ficha entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, fortalece 1. (Elige una criatura con la menor resistencia entre las criaturas que controlas y pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Soldado espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'La torturaron por honrar a sus ancestros; ahora camina entre ellos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45ce4506-3c58-4edd-aa41-f18b4351a1e1\', \'multiverseId\': 623021}, \'multiverseid\': 623021}, {\'name\': "Anafenza, esprit de l\'arbre-parent", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature non-jeton arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, renforcement 1. (Choisissez une créature avec l\'endurance la plus faible parmi les créatures que vous contrôlez et mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : esprit et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Martyrisée pour avoir vénéré ses ancêtres, elle marche aujourd\'hui parmi eux.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623222&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'994d55cb-d2c2-4665-99fd-f1d97ae16277\', \'multiverseId\': 623222}, \'multiverseid\': 623222}, {\'name\': \'族樹の精霊、アナフェンザ\', \'text\': \'トークンでもこれでもないクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、鼓舞１を行う。（あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの中で最も小さいタフネスを持つクリーチャー１体を選び、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — スピリット・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'祖先への崇拝に殉じた彼女は、今は祖先と共に歩んでいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf3a2e86-f14c-49a2-91a2-4b0b9a70e267\', \'multiverseId\': 623624}, \'multiverseid\': 623624}, {\'name\': \'族树之灵阿娜芬札\', \'text\': \'每当另一个非衍生物的生物在你操控下进战场时，振励1。（于由你操控的生物中选择一个防御力最小的生物，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～精怪／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'她因尊崇先祖而遭难，如今和先祖一道庇佑人民。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'744d060d-acc3-4468-8c02-b9149cb73374\', \'multiverseId\': 624026}, \'multiverseid\': 624026}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anax der Schmiedegestählte\', \'text\': \'Anax\\\' Stärke ist gleich deiner Hingabe zu Rot. (Jedes {R} in den Manakosten von bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst, erhöht deine Hingabe zu Rot um eins.)\\nImmer wenn Anax oder eine andere Nichtspielsteinkreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, erzeuge einen 1/1 roten Satyr-Kreaturenspielstein mit „Diese Kreatur kann nicht blocken." Falls die Kreatur Stärke 4 oder mehr hatte, erzeuge stattdessen zwei solcher Spielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberungskreatur — Halbgott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627902&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64112c2d-30f0-45de-bfcc-a0315e20cc97\', \'multiverseId\': 627902}, \'multiverseid\': 627902}, {\'name\': \'Anax, endurecido en la forja\', \'text\': \'La fuerza de Anax es igual a tu devoción al rojo. (Cada {R} en los costes de maná de los permanentes que controlas cuenta para tu devoción al rojo.)\\nSiempre que Anax u otra criatura que no sea ficha que controlas muera, crea una ficha de criatura Sátiro roja 1/1 con "Esta criatura no puede bloquear". Si la fuerza de la criatura era de 4 o más, en vez de eso, crea dos de esas fichas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento legendaria — Semidiós\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d738e0a-7980-4c8c-8666-5bfecad48099\', \'multiverseId\': 628136}, \'multiverseid\': 628136}, {\'name\': \'鍛冶で鍛えられしアナックス\', \'text\': \'鍛冶で鍛えられしアナックスのパワーは、あなたの赤への信心に等しい。（あなたの赤への信心とは、あなたがコントロールしているパーマネントのマナ・コストに含まれる{R}の総数である。）\\n鍛冶で鍛えられしアナックスや、あなたがコントロールしていてトークンでもこれでもないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、「このクリーチャーではブロックできない。」を持つ赤の１/１のサテュロス・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。そのクリーチャーのパワーが４以上であったなら、代わりにそのトークン２体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー・エンチャント — 亜神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed530533-f1d5-48a4-817d-fac3d5c0bac8\', \'multiverseId\': 628604}, \'multiverseid\': 628604}, {\'name\': \'熔锻锤炼的阿那克斯\', \'text\': \'阿那克斯的力量等同于你的红色献力。（由你操控之永久物的法术力费用当中每含有一个{R}，你的红色献力就加一。）\\n每当阿那克斯或另一个由你操控且非衍生物的生物死去时，派出一个1/1红色羊蹄人衍生生物，且具有「此生物不能进行阻挡。」若该生物的力量等于或大于4，则改为派出两个此类衍生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇结界生物 ～半神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ead7d512-456b-46bd-bb11-4c7105e6e4da\', \'multiverseId\': 629072}, \'multiverseid\': 629072}]', '[{\'name\': \'Angesehener Waffenschmied\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}. Gib dieses Mana nur aus, um Artefaktzauber zu wirken oder Fähigkeiten von Artefakten zu aktivieren.\\n{U}, {T}: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Karte namens Herzstecherbogen oder Phiole mit Drachenfeuer, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622923&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7830e9fc-a13b-4482-a8df-4c800ad85685\', \'multiverseId\': 622923}, \'multiverseid\': 622923}, {\'name\': \'Armero insigne\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}{C}. Usa este maná solo para lanzar hechizos de artefacto o activar habilidades de artefactos.\\n{U}, {T}: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta llamada Arco perforacorazones o Frasco de fuegodragón, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d08cac3b-8503-4b31-ad21-4d0bfd11a58b\', \'multiverseId\': 623124}, \'multiverseid\': 623124}, {\'name\': "Forgeur d\'armes réputé", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer des sorts d\'artefact ou activer des capacités d\'artefact.\\n{U}, {T} : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte appelée Arc du perce-cœur ou Fiole de feu des dragons, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623325&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'399c5456-39a5-4bb0-b45b-c5936fa50c37\', \'multiverseId\': 623325}, \'multiverseid\': 623325}, {\'name\': \'名高い武器職人\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}{C}を加える。このマナは、アーティファクト・呪文を唱えるためか、アーティファクトの能力を起動するためにしか支払えない。\\n{U}, {T}：あなたのライブラリーから「心臓貫きの弓」や「龍火の薬瓶」という名前のカード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa4236f0-8d87-4af6-af2d-ba1a0504391b\', \'multiverseId\': 623727}, \'multiverseid\': 623727}, {\'name\': \'享誉兵匠\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}{C}。此法术力只能用来施放神器咒语，或是起动神器的异能。\\n{U}，{T}：从你牌库中搜寻一张名称为穿心弓或龙炎瓶的牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2411b5ef-d17d-430e-bcfa-cc16fefbbfb9\', \'multiverseId\': 624129}, \'multiverseid\': 624129}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anikthea, Gehilfin von Erebos\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\nAndere Verzauberungskreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Bedrohlichkeit.\\nImmer wenn Anikthea ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, schicke bis zu eine Nicht-Aura-Verzauberungskarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil. Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie jener Karte ist, außer dass er zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Typen eine 3/3 schwarze Zombie-Kreatur ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberungskreatur — Halbgott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624934&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'699c1310-481a-487f-aac1-4c8dc2c9c1cd\', \'multiverseId\': 624934}, \'multiverseid\': 624934}, {\'name\': "Anikthéa, main d\'Érébos", \'text\': "Menace\\nLes autres créatures-enchantements que vous contrôlez ont la menace.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'Anikthéa arrive sur le champ de bataille ou qu\'elle attaque, exilez jusqu\'à une carte d\'enchantement non-Aura ciblée depuis votre cimetière. Créez un jeton qui est une copie de cette carte, excepté que c\'est une créature 3/3 noire Zombie en plus de ses autres types.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement légendaire : demi-dieu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624969&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46ae67b8-5bca-484b-8044-2d5180fafacc\', \'multiverseId\': 624969}, \'multiverseid\': 624969}, {\'name\': \'エレボスの手、アニクテア\', \'text\': \'威迫\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャー・エンチャントは威迫を持つ。\\nエレボスの手、アニクテアが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、あなたの墓地にありオーラでないエンチャント・カード最大１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。黒の３/３で他のタイプに加えてゾンビ・クリーチャーであることを除きそのカードのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー・エンチャント — 亜神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a1f1829-9a2b-4208-b6a1-a76aca81efdf\', \'multiverseId\': 625004}, \'multiverseid\': 625004}, {\'name\': \'厄睿柏斯之手阿尼克霞\', \'text\': \'威慑\\n由你操控的其他结界生物具有威慑异能。\\n每当阿尼克霞进战场或攻击时，将至多一张目标非灵气结界牌从你的坟墓场放逐。派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为该牌的复制品，但它是3/3黑色灵俑生物，且仍具有原本类别。\', \'type\': \'传奇结界生物 ～半神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7741722-014a-4191-8562-174c8b0d7b35\', \'multiverseId\': 625039}, \'multiverseid\': 625039}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anikthea, Gehilfin von Erebos\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\nAndere Verzauberungskreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Bedrohlichkeit.\\nImmer wenn Anikthea ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, schicke bis zu eine Nicht-Aura-Verzauberungskarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil. Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie jener Karte ist, außer dass er zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Typen eine 3/3 schwarze Zombie-Kreatur ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberungskreatur — Halbgott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625050&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8d5c307-809f-40ef-9a26-2bba98484770\', \'multiverseId\': 625050}, \'multiverseid\': 625050}, {\'name\': "Anikthéa, main d\'Érébos", \'text\': "Menace\\nLes autres créatures-enchantements que vous contrôlez ont la menace.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'Anikthéa arrive sur le champ de bataille ou qu\'elle attaque, exilez jusqu\'à une carte d\'enchantement non-Aura ciblée depuis votre cimetière. Créez un jeton qui est une copie de cette carte, excepté que c\'est une créature 3/3 noire Zombie en plus de ses autres types.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement légendaire : demi-dieu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625054&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb8eefec-70d7-4751-b593-1242ab43d035\', \'multiverseId\': 625054}, \'multiverseid\': 625054}, {\'name\': \'エレボスの手、アニクテア\', \'text\': \'威迫\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャー・エンチャントは威迫を持つ。\\nエレボスの手、アニクテアが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、あなたの墓地にありオーラでないエンチャント・カード最大１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。黒の３/３で他のタイプに加えてゾンビ・クリーチャーであることを除きそのカードのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー・エンチャント — 亜神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df0fe649-737f-4492-a0ca-e666e5907e3e\', \'multiverseId\': 625058}, \'multiverseid\': 625058}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anikthea, Gehilfin von Erebos\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\nAndere Verzauberungskreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Bedrohlichkeit.\\nImmer wenn Anikthea ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, schicke bis zu eine Nicht-Aura-Verzauberungskarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil. Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie jener Karte ist, außer dass er zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Typen eine 3/3 schwarze Zombie-Kreatur ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberungskreatur — Halbgott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626238&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd34010c-74f5-4bcc-b9bf-a996e76dfd64\', \'multiverseId\': 626238}, \'multiverseid\': 626238}, {\'name\': "Anikthéa, main d\'Érébos", \'text\': "Menace\\nLes autres créatures-enchantements que vous contrôlez ont la menace.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'Anikthéa arrive sur le champ de bataille ou qu\'elle attaque, exilez jusqu\'à une carte d\'enchantement non-Aura ciblée depuis votre cimetière. Créez un jeton qui est une copie de cette carte, excepté que c\'est une créature 3/3 noire Zombie en plus de ses autres types.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement légendaire : demi-dieu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626242&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff2e8b6c-e230-4f69-a32a-ed96286b7b10\', \'multiverseId\': 626242}, \'multiverseid\': 626242}, {\'name\': \'エレボスの手、アニクテア\', \'text\': \'威迫\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャー・エンチャントは威迫を持つ。\\nエレボスの手、アニクテアが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、あなたの墓地にありオーラでないエンチャント・カード最大１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。黒の３/３で他のタイプに加えてゾンビ・クリーチャーであることを除きそのカードのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー・エンチャント — 亜神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d3c7c8b-a430-40c8-8019-02d086c0d9fa\', \'multiverseId\': 626246}, \'multiverseid\': 626246}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anspruch des Wolkenwaldes\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Wald-Karten, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Schmelzstein breitet sich aus, aber nicht so schnell wie neues Leben."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628019&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af790cdb-2b4b-40dd-b13c-d6beb16e2a94\', \'multiverseId\': 628019}, \'multiverseid\': 628019}, {\'name\': \'Reclamo de Veloceleste\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de Bosque, ponlas en el campo de batalla y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"La piedra variable se multiplica, pero las nuevas vidas lo hacen más rápido".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ad8d071-dc55-4753-9eca-04f9488c0435\', \'multiverseId\': 628253}, \'multiverseid\': 628253}, {\'name\': \'スカイシュラウドの要求\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから森・カード最大２枚を探し、戦場に出し、その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「流動石は広がりやすいが新たな生命はもっと早く広がる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25f8f1a1-585d-4a2d-9a63-5c670ba8d467\', \'multiverseId\': 628721}, \'multiverseid\': 628721}, {\'name\': \'天帷宣言\', \'text\': \'从你牌库中搜寻至多两张树林牌，将它们放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「液石虽在扩张，但新生命长得更快。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'701d1ffc-273d-4ab6-92cc-9409a8613123\', \'multiverseId\': 629189}, \'multiverseid\': 629189}]', "[{'name': 'Anthrazitmedaillon', 'text': 'Schwarze Zaubersprüche, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626635&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ae4978b7-86eb-448c-9e9d-19b6e257fbe6', 'multiverseId': 626635}, 'multiverseid': 626635}, {'name': 'Médaillon de jais', 'text': 'Les sorts noirs que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626975&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6225d291-3b0a-4655-82b6-1a9acb0a0dd5', 'multiverseId': 626975}, 'multiverseid': 626975}, {'name': '黒玉の大メダル', 'text': 'あなたが黒の呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627315&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a83eb13a-d3f6-41b8-96ee-ed2af957aae9', 'multiverseId': 627315}, 'multiverseid': 627315}, {'name': '黑玉徽章', 'text': '你施放的黑色咒语减少{1}来施放。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627655&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f5608bfa-271f-4279-bcce-82c445a6a55f', 'multiverseId': 627655}, 'multiverseid': 627655}]", "[{'name': 'Anthrazitmedaillon', 'text': 'Schwarze Zaubersprüche, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628093&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'af2ed835-f126-47cc-8f53-7f4556449da9', 'multiverseId': 628093}, 'multiverseid': 628093}, {'name': 'Medallón de azabache', 'text': 'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar los hechizos negros.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628327&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6ae0bd04-73eb-472a-adef-2902dd707e81', 'multiverseId': 628327}, 'multiverseid': 628327}, {'name': '黒玉の大メダル', 'text': 'あなたが黒の呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628795&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2bc04d65-870a-4787-b642-8b6f679a083d', 'multiverseId': 628795}, 'multiverseid': 628795}, {'name': '黑玉徽章', 'text': '你施放的黑色咒语减少{1}来施放。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629263&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1101f4ef-5ced-4fb7-963d-dc45d53cb554', 'multiverseId': 629263}, 'multiverseid': 629263}]", '[{\'name\': \'Anwesenheit der Blütenzauberin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Verzauberungszauber wirkst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Weisen lernen sowohl aus ihren Fehlern wie aus ihren Erfolgen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625555&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'386ce944-c720-4544-a830-30d82cc10e12\', \'multiverseId\': 625555}, \'multiverseid\': 625555}, {\'name\': "Présence de l\'enchanteresse", \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'enchantement, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Le sage apprend de ses réussites autant que de ses erreurs. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625812&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dac31e4-6262-4a78-b97b-4a58563c8dfe\', \'multiverseId\': 625812}, \'multiverseid\': 625812}, {\'name\': \'女魔術師の存在\', \'text\': \'あなたがエンチャント・呪文１つを唱えるたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「賢者は失敗だけでなく成功からも学ぶものですわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f71fb49f-d533-4ccd-be30-e0b306beba7c\', \'multiverseId\': 626069}, \'multiverseid\': 626069}]', "[{'name': 'Arachnogenese', 'text': 'Erzeuge X 1/2 grüne Spinne-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Reichweite, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturen ist, die dich angreifen. Verhindere allen Kampfschaden, der in diesem Zug von Nicht-Spinne-Kreaturen zugefügt würde.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Jedes Geräusch ruft sie herbei — besonders deine Schreie.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626578&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '749af84c-4a19-4d04-a02d-be9174a5a7de', 'multiverseId': 626578}, 'multiverseid': 626578}, {'name': 'Arachnogénèse', 'text': 'Créez X jetons de créature 1/2 verte Araignée avec la portée, X étant le nombre de créatures qui vous attaquent. Prévenez toutes les blessures de combat qui devraient être infligées ce tour-ci par des créatures non-Araignée.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Le moindre mouvement est une invocation, même vos hurlements.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626918&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ddd45739-ab42-4717-91e3-2989cb857a3d', 'multiverseId': 626918}, 'multiverseid': 626918}, {'name': '蜘蛛の襲来', 'text': '到達を持つ緑の１/２の蜘蛛・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。Ｘはあなたを攻撃しているクリーチャーの数に等しい。このターン、蜘蛛でないクリーチャーが与えるすべての戦闘ダメージを軽減する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'すべての動きは呼び子となる。お前の悲鳴でさえも。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627258&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e70cde24-ff03-4f62-b85f-b07e2883eb77', 'multiverseId': 627258}, 'multiverseid': 627258}, {'name': '蜘蛛创生', 'text': '派出X个1/2绿色，具延势异能的蜘蛛衍生生物，X为正向你进行攻击的生物数量。于本回合中，防止非蜘蛛生物将造成之所有战斗伤害。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '一举一动都是召唤～你的尖叫也是。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627598&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '474f8b73-50b5-4614-896c-063a000c086e', 'multiverseId': 627598}, 'multiverseid': 627598}]", "[{'name': 'Arachnogenese', 'text': 'Erzeuge X 1/2 grüne Spinne-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Reichweite, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturen ist, die dich angreifen. Verhindere allen Kampfschaden, der in diesem Zug von Nicht-Spinne-Kreaturen zugefügt würde.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Jedes Geräusch ruft sie herbei — besonders deine Schreie.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627970&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a04e456a-d062-4b37-9a6b-f2d4d84b0bb7', 'multiverseId': 627970}, 'multiverseid': 627970}, {'name': 'Aracnogénesis', 'text': 'Crea X fichas de criatura Araña verdes 1/2 con la habilidad de alcance, donde X es la cantidad de criaturas que te están atacando. Prevén todo el daño de combate que fueran a hacer este turno las criaturas que no sean Araña.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Cada gesto es una llamada..., incluso tus gritos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628204&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c5859ff-9f13-4b91-8961-6e1be4494a5c', 'multiverseId': 628204}, 'multiverseid': 628204}, {'name': '蜘蛛の襲来', 'text': '到達を持つ緑の１/２の蜘蛛・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。Ｘはあなたを攻撃しているクリーチャーの数に等しい。このターン、蜘蛛でないクリーチャーが与えるすべての戦闘ダメージを軽減する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'すべての動きは呼び子となる。お前の悲鳴でさえも。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628672&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '713f6dae-9c16-406a-bb48-737a9ec401e6', 'multiverseId': 628672}, 'multiverseid': 628672}, {'name': '蜘蛛创生', 'text': '派出X个1/2绿色，具延势异能的蜘蛛衍生生物，X为正向你进行攻击的生物数量。于本回合中，防止非蜘蛛生物将造成之所有战斗伤害。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '一举一动都是召唤～你的尖叫也是。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629140&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7db23177-dfef-4898-9885-10288d7a7430', 'multiverseId': 629140}, 'multiverseid': 629140}]", '[{\'name\': \'Arachnogenese\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge X 1/2 grüne Spinne-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Reichweite, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturen ist, die dich angreifen. Verhindere allen Kampfschaden, der in diesem Zug von Nicht-Spinne-Kreaturen zugefügt würde.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Hauptmann, ist jetzt ein guter Zeitpunkt, um zu erwähnen, dass ich gegen Spinnen allergisch bin?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624477&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae6618b8-ab37-4b74-b008-c3f8e75a8ed0\', \'multiverseId\': 624477}, \'multiverseid\': 624477}, {\'name\': \'Aracnogénesis\', \'text\': \'Crea X fichas de criatura Araña verdes 1/2 con la habilidad de alcance, donde X es la cantidad de criaturas que te están atacando. Prevén todo el daño de combate que fueran a hacer este turno las criaturas que no sean Araña.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Capitán, ¿es mal momento para decirle que le tengo alergia a las arañas?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7077bbf-2f55-48cd-abb2-3667cd749f97\', \'multiverseId\': 624523}, \'multiverseid\': 624523}, {\'name\': \'Arachnogénèse\', \'text\': \'Créez X jetons de créature 1/2 verte Araignée avec la portée, X étant le nombre de créatures qui vous attaquent. Prévenez toutes les blessures de combat qui devraient être infligées ce tour-ci par des créatures non-Araignée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Capitaine, c\'est le bon moment pour préciser que je suis allergique aux araignées ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624569&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7bf0211-eb96-4c46-a61b-77d3109b5ea4\', \'multiverseId\': 624569}, \'multiverseid\': 624569}, {\'name\': \'蜘蛛の襲来\', \'text\': \'到達を持つ緑の１/２の蜘蛛・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。Ｘはあなたを攻撃しているクリーチャーの数に等しい。このターン、蜘蛛でないクリーチャーが与えるすべての戦闘ダメージを軽減する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「隊長、私が蜘蛛アレルギー持ちであることを今切り出しても良いでしょうか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4881f774-a522-462d-8fec-59035c835e73\', \'multiverseId\': 624661}, \'multiverseid\': 624661}, {\'name\': \'蜘蛛创生\', \'text\': \'派出X个1/2绿色，具延势异能的蜘蛛衍生生物，X为正向你进行攻击的生物数量。于本回合中，防止非蜘蛛生物将造成之所有战斗伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「队长，我现在说我对蜘蛛过敏还来得及吗？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a3a5016-121e-4de4-a9fd-0be4a9a5f217\', \'multiverseId\': 624753}, \'multiverseid\': 624753}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arasta die Endlos-Weberin\', \'text\': \'Reichweite\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkt, erzeuge einen 1/2 grünen Spinne-Kreaturenspielstein mit Reichweite.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberungskreatur — Spinne\', \'flavor\': \'Ihr Netz spannt sich von Nyx zur Welt der Sterblichen und darüber hinaus bis in die Unterwelt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625547&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04a90ef6-63ba-486c-913c-487e24689ca1\', \'multiverseId\': 625547}, \'multiverseid\': 625547}, {\'name\': \'Arasta de la Toile sans fin\', \'text\': "Portée\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire lance un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, créez un jeton de créature 1/2 verte Araignée avec la portée.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement légendaire : araignée\', \'flavor\': "Ses toiles, tissées à partir de ses propres cheveux, s\'étendent de Nyx jusqu\'au monde des mortels en passant par le Monde souterrain.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625804&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb305826-b573-42e2-91e1-9726702d983c\', \'multiverseId\': 625804}, \'multiverseid\': 625804}, {\'name\': \'終わりなき巣網のアラスタ\', \'text\': \'到達\\n対戦相手がインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つを唱えるたび、到達を持つ緑の１/２の蜘蛛・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー・エンチャント — 蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'彼女は自分の髪で巣網を紡ぐ。それはニクスから定命の世界へ、さらには死の国までも到達する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'114c1482-c35e-447f-ace8-343d44ad478a\', \'multiverseId\': 626061}, \'multiverseid\': 626061}]', '[{\'name\': \'Archon der Sonnengnade\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Lebensverknüpfung\\nPegasus-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Lebensverknüpfung.\\nKonstellation — Immer wenn eine Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 2/2 weißen Pegasus-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Archon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625476&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1a78138-8d4d-4fac-b831-4575bc7e6134\', \'multiverseId\': 625476}, \'multiverseid\': 625476}, {\'name\': \'Archonte de la grâce solaire\', \'text\': "Vol, lien de vie\\nLes créatures Pégase que vous contrôlez ont le lien de vie.\\nConstellation — À chaque fois qu\'un enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Pégase avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature : archonte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625733&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90e1a46a-69c7-420a-a526-7fc4f1bee253\', \'multiverseId\': 625733}, \'multiverseid\': 625733}, {\'name\': \'太陽の恵みの執政官\', \'text\': \'飛行、絆魂\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべてのペガサス・クリーチャーは絆魂を持つ。\\n星座 ― エンチャント１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、飛行を持つ白の２/２のペガサス・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 執政官\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c216de4-9df7-4449-876b-091e65f5a202\', \'multiverseId\': 625990}, \'multiverseid\': 625990}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arkaner Leuchtturm\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Bis zum Ende des Zuges verlieren Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, Fluchsicherheit und Verhülltheit und können Fluchsicherheit und Verhülltheit weder haben noch erhalten.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625647&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa68d28e-d729-4205-8405-aaf8c397776e\', \'multiverseId\': 625647}, \'multiverseid\': 625647}, {\'name\': \'Phare hermétique\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T} : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent perdent la défense talismanique et le linceul et ne peuvent pas avoir la défense talismanique ou le linceul.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625904&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5622f0bf-9d27-443e-b9ed-f0aff09d8c37\', \'multiverseId\': 625904}, \'multiverseid\': 625904}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の灯台\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}：ターン終了時まで、あなたの対戦相手がコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは呪禁や被覆を失い、呪禁や被覆を持つことができない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c95664c-5ad9-4e50-aa9f-fc86f55a8d60\', \'multiverseId\': 626161}, \'multiverseid\': 626161}]', "[{'name': 'Arkanes Petschaft', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': 'Am Anfang war es nur ein Wassertropfen. Der Zauberspiegel ließ es zu viel mehr kristallisieren.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628065&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2de52964-2322-4bf8-a8fd-9a9483460b0c', 'multiverseId': 628065}, 'multiverseid': 628065}, {'name': 'Sello arcano', 'text': '{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': 'Comenzó como una simple gota de agua, pero el Espejo Mágico hizo que cristalizara en algo mucho más poderoso.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628299&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cea1b393-6010-4bf4-bfdb-f145ec7be066', 'multiverseId': 628299}, 'multiverseid': 628299}, {'name': '秘儀の印鑑', 'text': '{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色１色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': '初めはほんの一滴だが、魔法の鏡がそれ以上のものを形にする。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628767&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '84a59ae9-72b4-47b6-8005-d8b6fb854fe6', 'multiverseId': 628767}, 'multiverseid': 628767}, {'name': '秘法印记', 'text': '{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为你指挥官标识色中的任一颜色。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '它起初就只是水滴。魔法明镜将之晶化为更有用的事物。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629235&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '894819f0-2cbe-41db-8aa0-bcd93ef6d203', 'multiverseId': 629235}, 'multiverseid': 629235}]", '[{\'name\': \'Arkanes Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Matic hatte den Ring nur genommen, um seine Großmutter zu besänftigen, als sie ihn drängend in seine Handfläche gedrückt hatte. Als die Ratten von seinem Licht wegwuselten, verstand er, warum es ihr so dringlich gewesen war.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624483&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fea1f9ba-9e7a-40bf-9b7e-4b0da4e37538\', \'multiverseId\': 624483}, \'multiverseid\': 624483}, {\'name\': \'Sello arcano\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Matic solo se llevó el anillo para contentar a su abuela, que acostumbraba a presionarlo insistentemente contra su mano. Cuando vio que las ratas huían de su luz, lo entendió todo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4a54d27-25e4-4aa8-8067-4831e720053c\', \'multiverseId\': 624529}, \'multiverseid\': 624529}, {\'name\': "Cachet d\'ésotérisme", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Matic ne prit l\'anneau que pour apaiser sa grand-mère quand elle le pressa dans sa paume avec insistance. Quand les rats se mirent à fuir sa lueur, il comprit son importance.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624575&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ed13d97-720a-4988-b1ad-ed95b80658f8\', \'multiverseId\': 624575}, \'multiverseid\': 624575}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の印鑑\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'マティックは、指輪をしつこく手の中に押し込んできた祖母をなだめるため、それを受け取ったに過ぎなかった。ネズミたちがちょこまかと光から遠ざかり、彼は一刻を争う事態を自覚した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0152621-cd24-4f6a-a85b-3113b378ff5e\', \'multiverseId\': 624667}, \'multiverseid\': 624667}, {\'name\': \'秘法印记\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为你指挥官标识色中的任一颜色。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'马提奇才刚取下戒指想要让祖母安心，就被对方一把攥紧握在掌中。直到察觉迸发光芒下老鼠四处逃窜，他才明白祖母为何会有如此反应。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b388a6eb-4a54-47cc-9b75-b2c263ed83ce\', \'multiverseId\': 624759}, \'multiverseid\': 624759}]', "[{'name': 'Aryel, Ritterin von Windgrace', 'text': 'Wachsamkeit\\n{2}{W}, {T}: Erzeuge einen 2/2 weißen Ritter-Kreaturenspielstein mit Wachsamkeit.\\n{B}, {T}, tappe X ungetappte Ritter, die du kontrollierst: Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke X oder weniger.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628034&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '86421fb9-275f-418c-a958-54659acfcd83', 'multiverseId': 628034}, 'multiverseid': 628034}, {'name': 'Aryel, caballero de Windgrace', 'text': 'Vigilancia.\\n{2}{W}, {T}: Crea una ficha de criatura Caballero blanca 2/2 con la habilidad de vigilancia.\\n{B}, {T}, girar X Caballeros enderezados que controlas: Destruye la criatura objetivo con fuerza de X o menos.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Caballero humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628268&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c18d5a84-a78c-4809-9104-859b97e3c071', 'multiverseId': 628268}, 'multiverseid': 628268}, {'name': 'ウィンドグレイスの騎士、アルイェール', 'text': '警戒\\n{2}{W}, {T}：警戒を持つ白の２/２の騎士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{B}, {T}, あなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態である騎士Ｘ体をタップする：パワーがＸ以下であるクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・騎士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628736&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '901bcde9-9cc1-4c95-ad51-904438afe27e', 'multiverseId': 628736}, 'multiverseid': 628736}, {'name': '风华骑士娅耶尔', 'text': '警戒\\n{2}{W}，{T}：派出一个2/2白色，具警戒异能的骑士衍生生物。\\n{B}，{T}，横置X个由你操控且未横置的骑士：消灭目标力量等于或小于X的生物。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～人类／骑士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629204&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3b78078b-fe60-4ddd-8233-68ce73253ee6', 'multiverseId': 629204}, 'multiverseid': 629204}]", '[{\'name\': \'Ascheline die Pilgerin\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Ascheline die Pilgerin. Falls dies das dritte Mal ist, dass diese Fähigkeit in diesem Zug verrechnet wird, entferne alle +1/+1-Marken von Ascheline der Pilgerin und sie fügt jeder Kreatur und jedem Spieler entsprechend viele Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Schamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626553&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec337f3b-7881-4a8d-a3be-6c1e3159a569\', \'multiverseId\': 626553}, \'multiverseid\': 626553}, {\'name\': \'Cendreline la pèlerine\', \'text\': "{1}{R} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Cendreline la pèlerine. Si c\'est la troisième fois que cette capacité s\'est résolue ce tour-ci, retirez tous les marqueurs +1/+1 de Cendreline la pèlerine, et elle inflige autant de blessures à chaque créature et à chaque joueur.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : élémental et shamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626893&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8243fca1-dc66-4b9b-85b3-b7b2e09d417d\', \'multiverseId\': 626893}, \'multiverseid\': 626893}, {\'name\': \'巡礼者アシュリング\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}：巡礼者アシュリングの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。このターンにこの能力が解決されたのが３回目であるなら、巡礼者アシュリングの上からすべての＋１/＋１カウンターを取り除く。これは各クリーチャーと各プレイヤーにそれぞれその取り除かれた個数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エレメンタル・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4868b12-4376-49ad-9c20-48a5744b8816\', \'multiverseId\': 627233}, \'multiverseid\': 627233}, {\'name\': \'朝圣客灰儿\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}：在朝圣客灰儿上放置一个+1/+1指示物。如果这是此异能在本回合第三次的结算，则从朝圣客灰儿上移去所有+1/+1指示物，且它对每个生物和每位牌手各造成该数量的伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～元素／祭师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd366fc2-88a8-4d04-913a-b8889c3c6f72\', \'multiverseId\': 627573}, \'multiverseid\': 627573}]', "[{'name': 'Ascheline die Pilgerin', 'text': '{1}{R}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Ascheline die Pilgerin. Falls dies das dritte Mal ist, dass diese Fähigkeit in diesem Zug verrechnet wird, entferne alle +1/+1-Marken von Ascheline der Pilgerin und sie fügt jeder Kreatur und jedem Spieler entsprechend viele Schadenspunkte zu.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Schamane', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627903&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd35c7b55-b2dd-41ce-8dac-edc3f6d8262c', 'multiverseId': 627903}, 'multiverseid': 627903}, {'name': 'Cenizeida la peregrina', 'text': '{1}{R}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre Cenizeida la peregrina. Si esta es la tercera vez que esta habilidad se resuelve este turno, remueve todos los contadores +1/+1 de Cenizeida la peregrina y ella hace esa misma cantidad de daño a cada criatura y a cada jugador.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Chamán elemental', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628137&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8b4c2a7d-f364-437c-8c48-2462c15b7c41', 'multiverseId': 628137}, 'multiverseid': 628137}, {'name': '巡礼者アシュリング', 'text': '{1}{R}：巡礼者アシュリングの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。このターンにこの能力が解決されたのが３回目であるなら、巡礼者アシュリングの上からすべての＋１/＋１カウンターを取り除く。これは各クリーチャーと各プレイヤーにそれぞれその取り除かれた個数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — エレメンタル・シャーマン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628605&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '86e18a91-4014-43e0-a1ba-63a8250714d5', 'multiverseId': 628605}, 'multiverseid': 628605}, {'name': '朝圣客灰儿', 'text': '{1}{R}：在朝圣客灰儿上放置一个+1/+1指示物。如果这是此异能在本回合第三次的结算，则从朝圣客灰儿上移去所有+1/+1指示物，且它对每个生物和每位牌手各造成该数量的伤害。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～元素／祭师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629073&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8130d3aa-30ae-49bf-8f8b-2562fd0e9d80', 'multiverseId': 629073}, 'multiverseid': 629073}]", "[{'name': 'Aschenödnis', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\nStandardlandumwandlung {1} ({1}, wirf diese Karte ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628117&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f76b74ff-b93a-4bf9-9f29-d91a23e89e5e', 'multiverseId': 628117}, 'multiverseid': 628117}, {'name': 'Yermos humeantes', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\nCiclo de tierras básicas {1}. ({1}, descartar esta carta: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja.)', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628351&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3f745fae-559a-46a4-8521-140e29acc0ba', 'multiverseId': 628351}, 'multiverseid': 628351}, {'name': '灰のやせ地', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n基本土地サイクリング{1}（{1}, このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628819&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '28590ec2-32cd-4f9d-a347-7684ccac62f6', 'multiverseId': 628819}, 'multiverseid': 628819}, {'name': '灰烬瘠地', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n循环基本地{1}（{1}，弃掉此牌：从你牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。）', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629287&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c83de1e4-5428-45ae-a176-8814c1508375', 'multiverseId': 629287}, 'multiverseid': 629287}]", '[{\'name\': \'Ashnods Altar\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur: Erzeuge {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn du Leichen zusammennähst, merkst du, wie die Gelenke zusammenpassen, wie die Nerven angeordnet sind und wie sich die Haut ablöst."\\n—Ashnod, zu Tawnos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628066&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac15d843-7a73-491a-9f21-fc92ce8efdd8\', \'multiverseId\': 628066}, \'multiverseid\': 628066}, {\'name\': \'Altar de Ashnod\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar una criatura: Agrega {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Si tu trabajo consiste en serrar cadáveres, te fijas en las junturas de las articulaciones, la disposición de los nervios y en cómo se desprende la piel".\\n—Ashnod, a Tawnos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ed6eb9c-cc24-450f-8fe8-078b39d42b1c\', \'multiverseId\': 628300}, \'multiverseid\': 628300}, {\'name\': \'アシュノッドの供犠台\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：{C}{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「亡骸を解体してみれば、関節の繋がり方も、神経の配置も、皮膚の剥ぎ取り方も理解できるでしょう。」\\n――アシュノッドからタウノスへ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d73add0-f55f-4833-8a7d-6e9937a1435f\', \'multiverseId\': 628768}, \'multiverseid\': 628768}, {\'name\': \'阿士诺的祭坛\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物：加{C}{C}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你要去锯解尸首，留意关节如何结合，神经如何排列，皮肤如何剥离。」\\n～阿士诺嘱咐达硌士\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1cee72a-7d3a-4242-aa01-381f6fc896dd\', \'multiverseId\': 629236}, \'multiverseid\': 629236}]', "[{'name': 'Aufnahmeschreiben', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere das Aufnahmeschreiben: Ziehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': 'Der Brief entfaltete sich und lud die Zwillinge nach Strixhaven ein. Will sah eine Chance auf arkane Studien. Rowan sah eine Chance auf Macht.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628095&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b7325b8b-3105-479b-af82-58d00a2d9c18', 'multiverseId': 628095}, 'multiverseid': 628095}, {'name': 'Carta de admisión', 'text': '{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar la Carta de admisión: Roba una carta.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': 'Al abrirse la carta, los gemelos encontraron una invitación proveniente de Strixhaven. Will lo vio como una oportunidad para tantear el estudio arcano; Rowan, como una oportunidad para tantear el poder.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628329&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b65ff1e-47a7-484f-b3d9-33bdde8ebabb', 'multiverseId': 628329}, 'multiverseid': 628329}, {'name': '合格通知', 'text': '{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, 合格通知を生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': '手紙が開き、双子をストリクスヘイヴンへと招いた。ウィルは秘儀を研究する機会を期待し、ローアンは力を得る機会を期待した。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628797&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '771eb174-ef84-4e37-b21c-daa268186577', 'multiverseId': 628797}, 'multiverseid': 628797}, {'name': '入学通知书', 'text': '{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\\n{2}，{T}，牺牲入学通知书：抓一张牌。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '信封自动打开，邀请冰火双子就读斯翠海文。威尔将其视为研习秘法的良机。萝婉将其视作增强力量的际遇。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629265&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b98094d-0972-45fc-b87a-4cdde5f67ffa', 'multiverseId': 629265}, 'multiverseid': 629265}]", '[{\'name\': \'Aufruhr\', \'text\': \'Enttappe alle Kreaturen und übernimm bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über sie. Sie erhalten Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wahrscheinlich wollen sie auch einmal auf der Gewinnerseite sein."\\n—Matoc, Magmamagier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626567&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'580ceaa3-6c7e-4005-80df-ee7273fbc292\', \'multiverseId\': 626567}, \'multiverseid\': 626567}, {\'name\': \'Insurrection\', \'text\': "Dégagez toutes les créatures et acquérez-en le contrôle jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Elles acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Peut-être voulaient-ils tous, pour une fois, être du côté des vainqueurs. »\\n—Matoc, lavamancien\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626907&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d341cf27-103f-4298-b617-f4fc495ce78a\', \'multiverseId\': 626907}, \'multiverseid\': 626907}, {\'name\': \'暴動\', \'text\': \'すべてのクリーチャーをアンタップし、ターン終了時まで、それらのコントロールを得る。ターン終了時まで、それらは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「やつらだって一度くらい勝ってる側につきたいと思っただろうさ。」\\n――溶岩使いマトック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3dee1c6-86f7-44db-b954-53de5b5c2ce5\', \'multiverseId\': 627247}, \'multiverseid\': 627247}, {\'name\': \'造反\', \'text\': \'重置所有生物并获得它们的操控权直到回合结束。它们获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「他们或许只想尝一次打胜仗的滋味。」\\n～熔岩术士马佗克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc159082-2a9b-405c-8c8c-3497ede4932b\', \'multiverseId\': 627587}, \'multiverseid\': 627587}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufruhr\', \'text\': \'Enttappe alle Kreaturen und übernimm bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über sie. Sie erhalten Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wahrscheinlich wollen sie auch einmal auf der Gewinnerseite sein."\\n—Matoc, Magmamagier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627934&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b670a137-1883-4bbc-b471-f073348a79b4\', \'multiverseId\': 627934}, \'multiverseid\': 627934}, {\'name\': \'Insurrección\', \'text\': \'Endereza todas las criaturas y gana el control de ellas hasta el final del turno. Ganan la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Quizá querían pertenecer al bando ganador para variar".\\n—Mátoc, lavamante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0019f69-33cf-4af2-bc16-8575f65cb21c\', \'multiverseId\': 628168}, \'multiverseid\': 628168}, {\'name\': \'暴動\', \'text\': \'すべてのクリーチャーをアンタップし、ターン終了時まで、それらのコントロールを得る。ターン終了時まで、それらは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「やつらだって一度くらい勝ってる側につきたいと思っただろうさ。」\\n――溶岩使いマトック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb2ebd79-384b-4d52-87e5-941453ba27df\', \'multiverseId\': 628636}, \'multiverseid\': 628636}, {\'name\': \'造反\', \'text\': \'重置所有生物并获得它们的操控权直到回合结束。它们获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「他们或许只想尝一次打胜仗的滋味。」\\n～熔岩术士马佗克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbf31f92-0004-4deb-8aef-63af010ec96d\', \'multiverseId\': 629104}, \'multiverseid\': 629104}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufruhr\', \'text\': \'Enttappe alle Kreaturen und übernimm bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über sie. Sie erhalten Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Warum sollte unser Schicksal durch schwülstige Dekrete von einem leeren Thron entschieden werden? Kämpft an meiner Seite und nehmt die Zügel eures eigenen Schicksals in die Hand!"\\n—Risona, Anführerin der Asari-Aufständischen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624793&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cee01db-ebb8-4c97-b7c0-232830fc610b\', \'multiverseId\': 624793}, \'multiverseid\': 624793}, {\'name\': \'Insurrección\', \'text\': \'Endereza todas las criaturas y gana el control de ellas hasta el final del turno. Ganan la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Por qué debería estar nuestro futuro en manos de decretos pretenciosos provenientes de un trono vacío? ¡Luchemos juntos y tomemos las riendas de nuestros destinos!".\\n—Risona, líder de los rebeldes asari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a869f549-8770-402c-94d5-786578c2dd44\', \'multiverseId\': 624805}, \'multiverseid\': 624805}, {\'name\': \'Insurrection\', \'text\': "Dégagez toutes les créatures et acquérez-en le contrôle jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Elles acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Pourquoi nos destins seraient-ils régis par les pompeux décrets d\'un trône vide ? Combats à mes côtés et prends ta destinée en main ! »\\n—Risona, cheffe des Insurrectionnaires Asari", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624817&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'262cbf66-2e4b-4d26-a597-7f63e753c220\', \'multiverseId\': 624817}, \'multiverseid\': 624817}, {\'name\': \'暴動\', \'text\': \'すべてのクリーチャーをアンタップし、ターン終了時まで、それらのコントロールを得る。ターン終了時まで、それらは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「皇なき玉座の驕り高ぶった命によって運命が決められてたまるか！自らの運命を切り拓きたい者は私と戦え！」\\n――浅利の蜂起軍の隊長、理想那\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1386ab5b-8f63-4307-a36a-12b8fd36c465\', \'multiverseId\': 624841}, \'multiverseid\': 624841}, {\'name\': \'造反\', \'text\': \'重置所有生物并获得它们的操控权直到回合结束。它们获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「为何王位无人，却能下诏决定吾人生死？随我一同战斗，把命运缰绳握在手中！」\\n～浅利起事军首领理想那\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'515ac718-e8b6-42c4-bbe8-dafacc2a3ee1\', \'multiverseId\': 624865}, \'multiverseid\': 624865}]', "[{'name': 'Aufscheuern', 'text': 'Bestimme eines —\\n• Aufscheuern fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Die Wüste ist eine hungrige Bestie, die sowohl Fleisch als auch Knochen verschlingt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627901&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0385f10c-816e-4f56-8cec-4de391959680', 'multiverseId': 627901}, 'multiverseid': 627901}, {'name': 'Erosionar', 'text': 'Elige uno:\\n• Erosionar hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\\n• Destruye el artefacto objetivo.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'El desierto es una bestia voraz que devora tanto carne como roca.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628135&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0aa76e4e-5241-4c0d-b07c-c28b06feff12', 'multiverseId': 628135}, 'multiverseid': 628135}, {'name': '削剥', 'text': '以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。削剥はそれに３点のダメージを与える。\\n・アーティファクト１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '砂漠の食欲は底無しで、肉も石も貪り尽くす。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628603&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8414cd3b-45c1-4c9d-9e28-ad0e61a20537', 'multiverseId': 628603}, 'multiverseid': 628603}, {'name': '风化侵蚀', 'text': '选择一项～\\n•风化侵蚀对目标生物造成3点伤害。\\n•消灭目标神器。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '沙漠是一头贪餍的野兽，能将骨肉砂石悉数吞没。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629071&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7686a8d2-ee24-416e-b3e7-4d2871c8dcb5', 'multiverseId': 629071}, 'multiverseid': 629071}]", '[{\'name\': \'Aufstieg der Eldrazi\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kann nicht neutralisiert werden.\\nZerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl. Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zieht vier Karten. Du erhältst nach diesem Zug einen zusätzlichen Zug.\\nSchicke den Aufstieg der Eldrazi ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Titanen waren immer noch hungrig.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625113&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4091db6a-5252-45f0-b98e-e6882ccc19aa\', \'multiverseId\': 625113}, \'multiverseid\': 625113}, {\'name\': "L\'ascension des Eldrazi", \'text\': "Ce sort ne peut pas être contrecarré.\\nDétruisez un permanent ciblé. Un joueur ciblé pioche quatre cartes. Jouez un tour supplémentaire après celui-ci.\\nExilez L\'ascension des Eldrazi.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Et pourtant, les titans n\'étaient toujours pas rassasiés.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625145&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94c107e5-eb7d-43a1-b24a-b140eb39b3fd\', \'multiverseId\': 625145}, \'multiverseid\': 625145}, {\'name\': \'エルドラージ覚醒\', \'text\': \'この呪文は打ち消されない。\\nパーマネント１つを対象とし、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。その前者を破壊する。その後者のプレイヤーはカード４枚を引く。あなたはこのターンに続いて追加の１ターンを行う。\\nエルドラージ覚醒を追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'それでもなお、巨人どもは満足しなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dcc5cfe-0bf4-4f55-8e53-8071073afbbb\', \'multiverseId\': 625177}, \'multiverseid\': 625177}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufstieg der Eldrazi\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kann nicht neutralisiert werden.\\nZerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl. Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zieht vier Karten. Du erhältst nach diesem Zug einen zusätzlichen Zug.\\nSchicke den Aufstieg der Eldrazi ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624910&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfbc8473-d0d9-47ff-b6f9-cecf6132df85\', \'multiverseId\': 624910}, \'multiverseid\': 624910}, {\'name\': "L\'ascension des Eldrazi", \'text\': "Ce sort ne peut pas être contrecarré.\\nDétruisez un permanent ciblé. Un joueur ciblé pioche quatre cartes. Jouez un tour supplémentaire après celui-ci.\\nExilez L\'ascension des Eldrazi.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624945&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49477262-ee61-424e-b23c-61a2017a974e\', \'multiverseId\': 624945}, \'multiverseid\': 624945}, {\'name\': \'エルドラージ覚醒\', \'text\': \'この呪文は打ち消されない。\\nパーマネント１つを対象とし、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。その前者を破壊する。その後者のプレイヤーはカード４枚を引く。あなたはこのターンに続いて追加の１ターンを行う。\\nエルドラージ覚醒を追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6f179cf-8975-4c83-aa4a-83154a41b300\', \'multiverseId\': 624980}, \'multiverseid\': 624980}, {\'name\': \'奥札奇再起\', \'text\': \'此咒语不能被反击。\\n消灭目标永久物。目标牌手抓四张牌。于本回合后进行额外的一个回合。\\n放逐奥札奇再起。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'399ee433-1fd3-4e78-b896-ea36361c522d\', \'multiverseId\': 625015}, \'multiverseid\': 625015}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufstieg des Bluthäuptlings\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn jedes Endsegments und falls ein Gegner in diesem Zug 2 oder mehr Lebenspunkte verloren hat, kannst du eine Quest-Marke auf den Aufstieg des Bluthäuptlings legen. (Schaden verursacht den Verlust von Lebenspunkten.)\\nImmer wenn eine Karte von irgendwoher auf den Friedhof eines Gegners gelegt wird und falls auf dem Aufstieg des Bluthäuptlings drei oder mehr Quest-Marken liegen, kannst du jenen Spieler 2 Lebenspunkte verlieren lassen. Falls du dies tust, erhältst du 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622948&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'202b89b1-d608-4f32-9589-49254ac5fcbe\', \'multiverseId\': 622948}, \'multiverseid\': 622948}, {\'name\': \'Ascenso del jefe de sangre\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de cada paso final, si un oponente perdió 2 o más vidas este turno, puedes poner un contador de búsqueda sobre el Ascenso del jefe de sangre. (El daño causa pérdida de vidas.)\\nSiempre que una carta vaya al cementerio de un oponente desde cualquier parte, si el Ascenso del jefe de sangre tiene tres o más contadores de búsqueda sobre él, puedes hacer que ese jugador pierda 2 vidas. Si lo haces, ganas 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'847ca2f1-5d84-4961-a226-a9d570ed5aec\', \'multiverseId\': 623149}, \'multiverseid\': 623149}, {\'name\': \'Ascension du chef de sang\', \'text\': "Au début de chaque étape de fin, si un adversaire a perdu au moins 2 points de vie ce tour-ci, vous pouvez mettre un marqueur « quête » sur l\'Ascension du chef de sang. (Les blessures provoquent la perte de points de vie.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une carte est mise dans le cimetière d\'un adversaire d\'où qu\'elle vienne, si l\'Ascension du chef de sang a au moins trois marqueurs « quête » sur elle, vous pouvez faire que ce joueur perde 2 points de vie. Si vous faites ainsi, vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623350&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36a3b606-624c-42ee-b255-5267da9cb35b\', \'multiverseId\': 623350}, \'multiverseid\': 623350}, {\'name\': \'血の長の昇天\', \'text\': \'各終了ステップの開始時に、このターンに対戦相手１人が２点以上のライフを失っていた場合、血の長の昇天の上に探索カウンター１個を置いてもよい。（ダメージによりライフは失われる。）\\nカード１枚がいずこかから対戦相手の墓地に置かれるたび、血の長の昇天の上に３個以上の探索カウンターがある場合、「そのプレイヤーは２点のライフを失う。」を選んでもよい。そうしたなら、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e73eb97f-b3e3-43e1-be27-8dd2b91d7e35\', \'multiverseId\': 623752}, \'multiverseid\': 623752}, {\'name\': \'血侯腾扬\', \'text\': \'在每个结束步骤开始时，若有对手本回合失去过2点或更多生命，则你可以在血侯腾扬上放置一个探索指示物。（伤害会导致失去生命。）\\n每当一张牌从任何区域进入对手的坟墓场时，若血侯腾扬上有三个或更多探索指示物，则你可以令该牌手失去2点生命。若你如此作，则你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8d8bc11-9104-472b-8a5c-4d0c9f2da2b5\', \'multiverseId\': 624154}, \'multiverseid\': 624154}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufstieg des Bluthäuptlings\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn jedes Endsegments und falls ein Gegner in diesem Zug 2 oder mehr Lebenspunkte verloren hat, kannst du eine Quest-Marke auf den Aufstieg des Bluthäuptlings legen. (Schaden verursacht den Verlust von Lebenspunkten.)\\nImmer wenn eine Karte von irgendwoher auf den Friedhof eines Gegners gelegt wird und falls auf dem Aufstieg des Bluthäuptlings drei oder mehr Quest-Marken liegen, kannst du jenen Spieler 2 Lebenspunkte verlieren lassen. Falls du dies tust, erhältst du 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626529&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9af6917-bb2e-4fbf-9c9f-507ea0f52a0b\', \'multiverseId\': 626529}, \'multiverseid\': 626529}, {\'name\': \'Ascension du chef de sang\', \'text\': "Au début de chaque étape de fin, si un adversaire a perdu au moins 2 points de vie ce tour-ci, vous pouvez mettre un marqueur « quête » sur l\'Ascension du chef de sang. (Les blessures provoquent la perte de points de vie.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une carte est mise dans le cimetière d\'un adversaire d\'où qu\'elle vienne, si l\'Ascension du chef de sang a au moins trois marqueurs « quête » sur elle, vous pouvez faire que ce joueur perde 2 points de vie. Si vous faites ainsi, vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626869&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eacaa7b1-1df6-440c-8c97-5bf25a1e3a4d\', \'multiverseId\': 626869}, \'multiverseid\': 626869}, {\'name\': \'血の長の昇天\', \'text\': \'各終了ステップの開始時に、このターンに対戦相手１人が２点以上のライフを失っていた場合、血の長の昇天の上に探索カウンター１個を置いてもよい。（ダメージによりライフは失われる。）\\nカード１枚がいずこかから対戦相手の墓地に置かれるたび、血の長の昇天の上に３個以上の探索カウンターがある場合、「そのプレイヤーは２点のライフを失う。」を選んでもよい。そうしたなら、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3ef688e-56e2-41c0-87ba-54ec976a2d3a\', \'multiverseId\': 627209}, \'multiverseid\': 627209}, {\'name\': \'血侯腾扬\', \'text\': \'在每个结束步骤开始时，若有对手本回合失去过2点或更多生命，则你可以在血侯腾扬上放置一个探索指示物。（伤害会导致失去生命。）\\n每当一张牌从任何区域进入对手的坟墓场时，若血侯腾扬上有三个或更多探索指示物，则你可以令该牌手失去2点生命。若你如此作，则你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37012814-77ca-4dbb-8e7e-db68462a4d50\', \'multiverseId\': 627549}, \'multiverseid\': 627549}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufstieg des Bluthäuptlings\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn jedes Endsegments und falls ein Gegner in diesem Zug 2 oder mehr Lebenspunkte verloren hat, kannst du eine Quest-Marke auf den Aufstieg des Bluthäuptlings legen.\\nImmer wenn eine Karte von irgendwoher auf den Friedhof eines Gegners gelegt wird und falls auf dem Aufstieg des Bluthäuptlings drei oder mehr Quest-Marken liegen, kannst du jenen Spieler 2 Lebenspunkte verlieren lassen. Falls du dies tust, erhältst du 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624466&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad47b89d-579c-4f3d-a678-33c70e0a8dc2\', \'multiverseId\': 624466}, \'multiverseid\': 624466}, {\'name\': \'Ascenso del jefe de sangre\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de cada paso final, si un oponente perdió 2 o más vidas este turno, puedes poner un contador de búsqueda sobre el Ascenso del jefe de sangre.\\nSiempre que una carta vaya al cementerio de un oponente desde cualquier parte, si el Ascenso del jefe de sangre tiene tres o más contadores de búsqueda sobre él, puedes hacer que ese jugador pierda 2 vidas. Si lo haces, ganas 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4ad0c46-025f-43c0-86f8-dbc556314bb9\', \'multiverseId\': 624512}, \'multiverseid\': 624512}, {\'name\': \'Ascension du chef de sang\', \'text\': "Au début de chaque étape de fin, si un adversaire a perdu au moins 2 points de vie ce tour-ci, vous pouvez mettre un marqueur « quête » sur l\'Ascension du chef de sang.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une carte est mise dans le cimetière d\'un adversaire d\'où qu\'elle vienne, si l\'Ascension du chef de sang a au moins trois marqueurs « quête » sur elle, vous pouvez faire que ce joueur perde 2 points de vie. Si vous faites ainsi, vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624558&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0900987-f7e6-4e97-9e80-924e6f47c6ed\', \'multiverseId\': 624558}, \'multiverseid\': 624558}, {\'name\': \'血の長の昇天\', \'text\': \'各終了ステップの開始時に、このターンに対戦相手１人が２点以上のライフを失っていた場合、血の長の昇天の上に探索カウンター１個を置いてもよい。\\nカード１枚がいずこかから対戦相手の墓地に置かれるたび、血の長の昇天の上に３個以上の探索カウンターがある場合、「そのプレイヤーは２点のライフを失う。」を選んでもよい。そうしたなら、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21f15927-fb46-49ec-82fb-3654b9144b8d\', \'multiverseId\': 624650}, \'multiverseid\': 624650}, {\'name\': \'血侯腾扬\', \'text\': \'在每个结束步骤开始时，若有对手本回合失去过2点或更多生命，则你可以在血侯腾扬上放置一个探索指示物。\\n每当一张牌从任何区域进入对手的坟墓场时，若血侯腾扬上有三个或更多探索指示物，则你可以令该牌手失去2点生命。若你如此作，则你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84c85de6-6684-41a2-84ed-27c370feba75\', \'multiverseId\': 624742}, \'multiverseid\': 624742}]', "[{'name': 'Auge der Pilger', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nWenn das Auge der Pilger ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf deine Hand nehmen und danach mischen.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Thopter', 'flavor': 'Die Kor schicken ihre Thopter vor, um zu schauen, ob das Land gerade gute Laune hat.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628100&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d41d793-688f-4f63-9b0b-684755bf9c61', 'multiverseId': 628100}, 'multiverseid': 628100}, {'name': 'Ojo del peregrino', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nCuando el Ojo del peregrino entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, mostrarla, ponerla en tu mano y luego barajar.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Tóptero', 'flavor': 'Los kor envían a sus tópteros cometa para ver si la tierra está de humor para una visita.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628334&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f102add-adfa-48c6-b9bd-339334b2890d', 'multiverseId': 628334}, 'multiverseid': 628334}, {'name': '巡礼者の目', 'text': '飛行\\n巡礼者の目が戦場に出たとき、「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 飛行機械', 'flavor': 'コーは飛行凧を送り込んで、地が歓迎しているかどうかを見る。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628802&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b253c5f3-4d14-4ead-b68f-b0c6ce4d3e97', 'multiverseId': 628802}, 'multiverseid': 628802}, {'name': '朝圣客之眼', 'text': '飞行\\n当朝圣客之眼进战场时，你可以从你牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。', 'type': '神器生物 ～振翼机', 'flavor': '寇族派出振翼机升空，打量这块大地是否有意愿接纳他们。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629270&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37fa47f9-8500-4951-8ec2-645c29000f60', 'multiverseId': 629270}, 'multiverseid': 629270}]", '[{\'name\': \'Aus den Knochen lesen\', \'text\': \'Hellsicht 2, ziehe dann zwei Karten. Du verlierst 2 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Der Tod kennt ein paar Tricks, die die Lebenden noch nicht gelernt haben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622991&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccb6640f-4602-4d12-94de-8ec1373b8a56\', \'multiverseId\': 622991}, \'multiverseid\': 622991}, {\'name\': \'Lectura de huesos\', \'text\': \'Adivina 2, luego roba dos cartas. Pierdes 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los muertos saben lecciones que los vivos no han aprendido.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75b868ac-d33f-49b4-bfb3-fafd8caa114d\', \'multiverseId\': 623192}, \'multiverseid\': 623192}, {\'name\': \'Lire dans les os\', \'text\': \'Regard 2, puis piochez deux cartes. Vous perdez 2 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les morts connaissent les leçons que les vivants n\'ont jamais apprises.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623393&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f82caf6-2796-494d-8269-42e76e6cdb35\', \'multiverseId\': 623393}, \'multiverseid\': 623393}, {\'name\': \'骨読み\', \'text\': \'占術２を行う。その後、カード２枚を引く。２点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'死んだことでしか学べないこともある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28dabe63-23b6-4e68-b2e6-a03daa6f6ae4\', \'multiverseId\': 623795}, \'multiverseid\': 623795}, {\'name\': \'解读骨卦\', \'text\': \'占卜2，然后抓两张牌。你失去2点生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'逝者晓得生者尚未领悟的教训。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f16a9cb3-1fdb-4146-95d6-ef0e81ba19bf\', \'multiverseId\': 624197}, \'multiverseid\': 624197}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausmerzungsritual\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre jede bleibende Karte mit Manabetrag 2 oder weniger, die kein Land ist. Erzeuge {B} oder {G} für jede auf diese Weise zerstörte bleibende Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Deine eigene Zerbrechlichkeit ist dein Untergang. Ich mache sie nur offenbar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625583&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2804072f-c2ac-40d5-afef-c1e8988f4628\', \'multiverseId\': 625583}, \'multiverseid\': 625583}, {\'name\': \'Rituel sacrificiel\', \'text\': \'Détruisez chaque permanent non-terrain ayant une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 2. Ajoutez {B} ou {G} pour chaque permanent détruit de cette manière.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Ta propre fragilité est ta faiblesse. Je ne fais que l\'exposer. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625840&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f912a083-76b5-4aad-9712-43e272c174aa\', \'multiverseId\': 625840}, \'multiverseid\': 625840}, {\'name\': \'選別の儀式\', \'text\': \'マナ総量が２以下であり土地でないすべてのパーマネントを破壊する。これにより破壊されたパーマネント１つにつき、{B}か{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「あなたは自分自身の弱点で破滅したのよ。私はそれを利用しただけ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa0743e0-5c1f-4e71-941a-9f6104f69d7f\', \'multiverseId\': 626097}, \'multiverseid\': 626097}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aussaugender Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Lebensverknüpfung.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'Der Schwarm kennt weder Angst noch Gnade, sondern nur Hunger.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625532&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'929c5b39-34d3-4cb9-a002-d5084430a869\', \'multiverseId\': 625532}, \'multiverseid\': 625532}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde aspireur\', \'text\': \'Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont le lien de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "L\'essaim ne connaît ni la peur ni la miséricorde. Seulement la faim.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625789&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8972597-ee34-41cf-beb5-c99c4440672b\', \'multiverseId\': 625789}, \'multiverseid\': 625789}, {\'name\': \'吸管スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのスリヴァー・クリーチャーは絆魂を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'巣は恐れや慈悲を知らず、餓えのみを覚える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'769e9df3-3808-464e-80a2-8a2d2401c4bc\', \'multiverseId\': 626046}, \'multiverseid\': 626046}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausschlachten\', \'text\': \'Bestimme zwei Kreaturenkarten deiner Wahl in deinem Friedhof. Opfere eine Kreatur. Falls du dies tust, bringe die bestimmten Karten getappt ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Stirb. Und wisse, dass dein erbärmliches Leben mir zu großem Vorteil gereicht."\\n—Zul Ashur, Lichfürst\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623004&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7029fa9e-01fa-4e7e-bef3-7e4447a4e975\', \'multiverseId\': 623004}, \'multiverseid\': 623004}, {\'name\': \'Victimar\', \'text\': \'Elige dos cartas de criatura objetivo en tu cementerio. Sacrifica una criatura. Si lo haces, regresa al campo de batalla las cartas elegidas giradas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Muere. Pero muere sabiendo que tu patética vida supondrá un gran botín para mí".\\n—Zul Ashur, señor liche\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f632cfdc-78a9-491f-af82-fe949edd8e2a\', \'multiverseId\': 623205}, \'multiverseid\': 623205}, {\'name\': \'Brimades\', \'text\': \'Choisissez deux cartes de créature ciblées dans votre cimetière. Sacrifiez une créature. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez, engagées, les cartes choisies sur le champ de bataille.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Meurs. Mais meurs en sachant que ta misérable existence me rapportera une belle récompense. »\\n—Zul Ashur, seigneur liche\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623406&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4990648f-1c2d-4443-a1a5-0eba11a68fa7\', \'multiverseId\': 623406}, \'multiverseid\': 623406}, {\'name\': \'犠牲\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード２枚を対象とする。クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。そうしたなら、対象としたそれらのカードをタップ状態で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「死ぬがいい。お前の惨めな命でも、私に大いなる恵みを与えることを知りながらな。」\\n――死者の王、ザル・アシュール\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b9fe1e7-f5b3-42d6-b609-7f849499b4da\', \'multiverseId\': 623808}, \'multiverseid\': 623808}, {\'name\': \'生体活祭\', \'text\': \'选择两张目标在你坟墓场中的生物牌。牺牲一个生物。如果你如此作，则将所选之牌横置移回战场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「去死吧。知道你这悲惨的一生能为我换回莫大回报，你也死得明白。」\\n～巫妖领主祝亚许\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f459639e-2f93-4930-828d-5382c8f8b22e\', \'multiverseId\': 624210}, \'multiverseid\': 624210}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausschließen\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Kreaturenzauber deiner Wahl.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe gerade keine Zeit für dich."\\n—Teferi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622899&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2969e806-68a5-4299-8036-7b9342b25c29\', \'multiverseId\': 622899}, \'multiverseid\': 622899}, {\'name\': \'Excluir\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo de criatura objetivo.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ahora no tengo tiempo para ti".\\n—Teferi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fd52774-8f2f-4999-9e56-f5bcd1afc238\', \'multiverseId\': 623100}, \'multiverseid\': 623100}, {\'name\': \'Exclusion\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez un sort de créature ciblé.\\nPiochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Je n\'ai pas de temps à te consacrer. »\\n—Téfeiri", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623301&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c323666e-7473-45f3-83fd-1787521a82ff\', \'multiverseId\': 623301}, \'multiverseid\': 623301}, {\'name\': \'除外\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー・呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。\\nカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「今忙しいんだ。」\\n――テフェリー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06e9cbb3-9aaa-4ce6-b786-f18435b37050\', \'multiverseId\': 623703}, \'multiverseid\': 623703}, {\'name\': \'排拒\', \'text\': \'反击目标生物咒语。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「现在没空和你闲耗。」\\n～泰菲力\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82b8208f-1efb-4114-af83-6e88a8310428\', \'multiverseId\': 624105}, \'multiverseid\': 624105}]', '[{\'name\': \'Außerweltliche Linse\', \'text\': \'Einprägen — Wenn die Außerweltliche Linse ins Spiel kommt, kannst du ein Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst, ins Exil schicken.\\nImmer wenn ein Land mit demselben Namen wie die ins Exil geschickte Karte für Mana getappt wird, erzeugt sein Beherrscher ein Mana eines beliebigen Typs, den das Land erzeugt hat.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624486&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dbd94b5-2891-4c62-83b5-4d226a43c191\', \'multiverseId\': 624486}, \'multiverseid\': 624486}, {\'name\': \'Lente extraplanar\', \'text\': \'Estampa — Cuando la Lente extraplanar entre al campo de batalla, puedes exiliar la tierra objetivo que controlas.\\nSiempre que una tierra con el mismo nombre que la carta exiliada se gire para obtener maná, su controlador agrega un maná de cualquier tipo que produzca esa tierra.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c35b95a3-e17a-4d2f-9155-e5eb5896836f\', \'multiverseId\': 624532}, \'multiverseid\': 624532}, {\'name\': \'Lentille extraplanaire\', \'text\': "Empreinte — Quand la Lentille extraplanaire arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez exiler un terrain ciblé que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un terrain portant le même nom que la carte exilée est engagé pour du mana, son contrôleur ajoute à un mana de n\'importe quel type que ce terrain produisait.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624578&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ced8b070-faa1-4faf-ae37-e196d50d1661\', \'multiverseId\': 624578}, \'multiverseid\': 624578}, {\'name\': \'超次元レンズ\', \'text\': \'刻印 ― 超次元レンズが戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つを対象とする。それを追放してもよい。\\nその追放されているカードと同じ名前の土地がマナを引き出す目的でタップされるたび、それのコントローラーは、その土地が生み出したいずれかのタイプのマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1206e7bb-02fc-4ca1-b10f-1e525bfe2eed\', \'multiverseId\': 624670}, \'multiverseid\': 624670}, {\'name\': \'外时空透镜\', \'text\': \'压印～当外时空透镜进战场时，你可以放逐目标由你操控的地。\\n每当横置一个与所放逐之牌同名的地以产生法术力时，其操控者加一点该地已产生的类别之法术力。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d45fc6c-470b-41af-81bb-5ab400f8e405\', \'multiverseId\': 624762}, \'multiverseid\': 624762}]', '[{\'name\': \'Außerweltliche Linse\', \'text\': \'Einprägen — Wenn die Außerweltliche Linse ins Spiel kommt, kannst du ein Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst, ins Exil schicken.\\nImmer wenn ein Land mit demselben Namen wie die ins Exil geschickte Karte für Mana getappt wird, erzeugt sein Beherrscher ein Mana eines beliebigen Typs, den das Land erzeugt hat.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626629&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fde6268-e23a-4614-8a73-6670c4ab82bd\', \'multiverseId\': 626629}, \'multiverseid\': 626629}, {\'name\': \'Lentille extraplanaire\', \'text\': "Empreinte — Quand la Lentille extraplanaire arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez exiler un terrain ciblé que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un terrain portant le même nom que la carte exilée est engagé pour du mana, son contrôleur ajoute à un mana de n\'importe quel type que ce terrain produisait.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626969&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e46ec4db-aab7-48c5-ac0f-3efb095b6ab7\', \'multiverseId\': 626969}, \'multiverseid\': 626969}, {\'name\': \'超次元レンズ\', \'text\': \'刻印 ― 超次元レンズが戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つを対象とする。それを追放してもよい。\\nその追放されているカードと同じ名前の土地がマナを引き出す目的でタップされるたび、それのコントローラーは、その土地が生み出したいずれかのタイプのマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09ed0127-1c7a-49f9-93fd-632f9119d89c\', \'multiverseId\': 627309}, \'multiverseid\': 627309}, {\'name\': \'外时空透镜\', \'text\': \'压印～当外时空透镜进战场时，你可以放逐目标由你操控的地。\\n每当横置一个与所放逐之牌同名的地以产生法术力时，其操控者加一点该地已产生的类别之法术力。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb35a23c-c3b7-43fd-80eb-ed2044421863\', \'multiverseId\': 627649}, \'multiverseid\': 627649}]', "[{'name': 'Außerweltliche Linse', 'text': 'Einprägen — Wenn die Außerweltliche Linse ins Spiel kommt, kannst du ein Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst, ins Exil schicken.\\nImmer wenn ein Land mit demselben Namen wie die ins Exil geschickte Karte für Mana getappt wird, erzeugt sein Beherrscher ein Mana eines beliebigen Typs, den das Land erzeugt hat.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628079&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a9db93ff-0b75-4af1-92ec-43af80133ee0', 'multiverseId': 628079}, 'multiverseid': 628079}, {'name': 'Lente extraplanar', 'text': 'Estampa — Cuando la Lente extraplanar entre al campo de batalla, puedes exiliar la tierra objetivo que controlas.\\nSiempre que una tierra con el mismo nombre que la carta exiliada se gire para obtener maná, su controlador agrega un maná de cualquier tipo que produzca esa tierra.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628313&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd8a41e5-aa60-4c7e-b0c9-c9a6cd9bd2bc', 'multiverseId': 628313}, 'multiverseid': 628313}, {'name': '超次元レンズ', 'text': '刻印 ― 超次元レンズが戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つを対象とする。それを追放してもよい。\\n追放されているカードと同じ名前の土地がマナを引き出す目的でタップされるたび、それのコントローラーは、その土地が生み出したいずれかのタイプのマナ１点を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628781&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f5f066fc-cba0-405c-85cc-4f982214605d', 'multiverseId': 628781}, 'multiverseid': 628781}, {'name': '外时空透镜', 'text': '压印～当外时空透镜进战场时，你可以放逐目标由你操控的地。\\n每当横置一个与所放逐之牌同名的地以产生法术力时，其操控者加一点该地已产生的类别之法术力。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629249&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b7df3772-4170-4da1-a63b-a74e95ed406f', 'multiverseId': 629249}, 'multiverseid': 629249}]", '[{\'name\': \'Avacyn, Engel der Hoffnung\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit, Unzerstörbar\\nAndere bleibende Karten, die du kontrollierst, haben Unzerstörbarkeit.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'Ein goldener Wirbel wand sich vom Höllenkerker gen Himmel. Unter einer donnernden Explosion zerbarst der silberne Monolith, und Avacyn erschien — endlich aus ihrem Gefängnis befreit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622823&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eeba13ab-0571-4b41-b9a8-e672b2bbd83f\', \'multiverseId\': 622823}, \'multiverseid\': 622823}, {\'name\': \'Avacyn, ángel de la esperanza\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vigilancia, indestructible.\\nLos otros permanentes que controlas tienen la habilidad de indestructible.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Ángel\', \'flavor\': \'Una hélice dorada se proyectó hacia el cielo desde Helvault. Una explosión atronadora resquebrajó el monolito plateado y Avacyn surgió, libre al fin de su prisión.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e1339d4-1119-4d81-a4d8-5c793728ea96\', \'multiverseId\': 623024}, \'multiverseid\': 623024}, {\'name\': "Avacyn, ange de l\'espoir", \'text\': "Vol, vigilance, indestructible\\nLes autres permanents que vous contrôlez ont l\'indestructible.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ange\', \'flavor\': "Une volute dorée jaillit du Helgruft vers le ciel. Une formidable explosion pulvérisa le monolithe d\'argent, libérant enfin Avacyn de sa prison.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623225&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60cad580-22d1-4dcb-a5a2-93c1a043b8a2\', \'multiverseId\': 623225}, \'multiverseid\': 623225}, {\'name\': \'希望の天使アヴァシン\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒、破壊不能\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのパーマネントは破壊不能を持つ。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': \'黄金の光が獄庫から天空へとらせん状に伸びていった。巨石のごとき銀塊が轟音とともに砕け散り、囚われのアヴァシンはついに解放された。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d38e0f5-b2f0-44af-9cb6-27e8ca6422d6\', \'multiverseId\': 623627}, \'multiverseid\': 623627}, {\'name\': \'希望天使艾维欣\', \'text\': \'飞行，警戒，不灭\\n由你操控的其他永久物具有不灭异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': \'金色螺旋自狱窖疾升入空。巨大银体在惊雷爆炸中碎裂，艾维欣终于自牢狱中脱困。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fc3c41c-0ef9-48db-a29e-8d62a502538f\', \'multiverseId\': 624029}, \'multiverseid\': 624029}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avacyn, Engel der Hoffnung\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit, Unzerstörbar\\nAndere bleibende Karten, die du kontrollierst, haben Unzerstörbarkeit.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'Ein goldener Wirbel wand sich vom Höllenkerker gen Himmel. Unter einer donnernden Explosion zerbarst der silberne Monolith, und Avacyn erschien — endlich aus ihrem Gefängnis befreit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626482&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca7dae9e-9d0a-4b9f-88db-e9403714eae1\', \'multiverseId\': 626482}, \'multiverseid\': 626482}, {\'name\': "Avacyn, ange de l\'espoir", \'text\': "Vol, vigilance, indestructible\\nLes autres permanents que vous contrôlez ont l\'indestructible.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ange\', \'flavor\': "Une volute dorée jaillit du Helgruft vers le ciel. Une formidable explosion pulvérisa le monolithe d\'argent, libérant enfin Avacyn de sa prison.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626822&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a6cac3b-cbb2-44fb-a761-f5c02c168c6c\', \'multiverseId\': 626822}, \'multiverseid\': 626822}, {\'name\': \'希望の天使アヴァシン\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒、破壊不能\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのパーマネントは破壊不能を持つ。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': \'黄金の光が獄庫から天空へとらせん状に伸びていった。巨石のごとき銀塊が轟音とともに砕け散り、囚われのアヴァシンはついに解放された。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46ecafc5-a549-44ae-b778-f5951d7a8b3b\', \'multiverseId\': 627162}, \'multiverseid\': 627162}, {\'name\': \'希望天使艾维欣\', \'text\': \'飞行，警戒，不灭\\n由你操控的其他永久物具有不灭异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': \'金色螺旋自狱窖疾升入空。巨大银体在惊雷爆炸中碎裂，艾维欣终于自牢狱中脱困。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e63f4a5-be1c-47cd-8ca9-bc4a9db1727b\', \'multiverseId\': 627502}, \'multiverseid\': 627502}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avatar der Erwachenden Sonne\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Avatar der Erwachenden Sonne ins Spiel kommt und falls du ihn aus deiner Hand gewirkt hast, zerstöre alle Nicht-Dinosaurier-Kreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dinosaurier, Avatar\', \'flavor\': \'„Kinjallis allumfassende Sonnenstrahlen kündigen bereits im ersten Moment des Sonnenaufgangs neues Leben an."\\n—Chitlati, Blitzreiterin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622877&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26940009-266f-4a07-b485-d223a32d98db\', \'multiverseId\': 622877}, \'multiverseid\': 622877}, {\'name\': \'Avatar del Sol Albo\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Avatar del Sol Albo entre al campo de batalla, si lo lanzaste desde tu mano, destruye todas las criaturas que no sean Dinosaurio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Avatar dinosaurio\', \'flavor\': \'"Los rayos de Kinjalli celebran la vida nueva en el momento de la aurora".\\n—Chitlati, Jinete del Rayo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d28c6fd-6b72-4c44-a738-cb8b93db38c4\', \'multiverseId\': 623078}, \'multiverseid\': 623078}, {\'name\': \'Avatar du Soleil levant\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Avatar du Soleil levant arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous l\'avez lancé depuis votre main, détruisez toutes les créatures non-Dinosaure.", \'type\': \'Créature : dinosaure et avatar\', \'flavor\': "« Les rayons enveloppant de Kinjalli annoncent une nouvelle vie au moment de la naissance du soleil. »\\n—Chitlati, chevaucheuse d\'éclair", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623279&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'033a53a4-45f1-4e7b-a374-f04499169341\', \'multiverseId\': 623279}, \'multiverseid\': 623279}, {\'name\': \'覚醒の太陽の化身\', \'text\': \'覚醒の太陽の化身が戦場に出たとき、あなたがあなたの手札からこれを唱えていた場合、恐竜でないすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 恐竜・アバター\', \'flavor\': \'「キンジャーリの包み込む陽光は、太陽が昇る瞬間の新たな生命の前触れよ。」\\n――稲妻騎手、チトラーティ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47a2be51-bc69-45c6-8ebb-a386bbbb2c17\', \'multiverseId\': 623681}, \'multiverseid\': 623681}, {\'name\': \'晓阳化身\', \'text\': \'当晓阳化身进战场时，若你从你手上施放之，则消灭所有非恐龙生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恐龙／圣者\', \'flavor\': \'「太阳破晓时，津加理光芒笼罩万物，召引新生。」\\n～迅雷龙骑奇拉蒂\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1f27e5c-df60-49d7-b03d-4eb6380effa1\', \'multiverseId\': 624083}, \'multiverseid\': 624083}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avatar der Erwachenden Sonne\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Avatar der Erwachenden Sonne ins Spiel kommt und falls du ihn aus deiner Hand gewirkt hast, zerstöre alle Nicht-Dinosaurier-Kreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dinosaurier, Avatar\', \'flavor\': \'„Kinjallis allumfassende Sonnenstrahlen kündigen bereits im ersten Moment des Sonnenaufgangs neues Leben an."\\n—Chitlati, Blitzreiterin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626501&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6604d8ab-2cd5-497a-864a-864999762e85\', \'multiverseId\': 626501}, \'multiverseid\': 626501}, {\'name\': \'Avatar du Soleil levant\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Avatar du Soleil levant arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous l\'avez lancé depuis votre main, détruisez toutes les créatures non-Dinosaure.", \'type\': \'Créature : dinosaure et avatar\', \'flavor\': "« Les rayons enveloppant de Kinjalli annoncent une nouvelle vie au moment de la naissance du soleil. »\\n—Chitlati, chevaucheuse d\'éclair", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626841&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b65b287-bf31-47e5-b320-27212be1f19b\', \'multiverseId\': 626841}, \'multiverseid\': 626841}, {\'name\': \'覚醒の太陽の化身\', \'text\': \'覚醒の太陽の化身が戦場に出たとき、あなたがあなたの手札からこれを唱えていた場合、恐竜でないすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 恐竜・アバター\', \'flavor\': \'「キンジャーリの包み込む陽光は、太陽が昇る瞬間の新たな生命の前触れよ。」\\n――稲妻騎手、チトラーティ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75e21125-6acf-4852-921e-0bc0403acb57\', \'multiverseId\': 627181}, \'multiverseid\': 627181}, {\'name\': \'晓阳化身\', \'text\': \'当晓阳化身进战场时，若你从你手上施放之，则消灭所有非恐龙生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恐龙／圣者\', \'flavor\': \'「太阳破晓时，津加理光芒笼罩万物，召引新生。」\\n～迅雷龙骑奇拉蒂\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4df0d4a-2899-4fd1-a8e0-b7f25b1c42d8\', \'multiverseId\': 627521}, \'multiverseid\': 627521}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avatar des Gemetzels\', \'text\': \'Alle Kreaturen haben Doppelschlag und greifen in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Avatar\', \'flavor\': \'„Diplomatie hat nichts erreicht. Nur durch Blutvergießen können wir dies beenden. Ruft die Kriegstreiber herbei!"\\n—Basandra, Kampf-Seraph\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626554&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e89ce1e5-529c-47a2-b89f-ea6747fa51e8\', \'multiverseId\': 626554}, \'multiverseid\': 626554}, {\'name\': \'Avatar du massacre\', \'text\': \'Toutes les créatures ont la double initiative et elles attaquent à chaque combat si possible.\', \'type\': \'Créature : avatar\', \'flavor\': "« La diplomatie n\'a rien résolu. Il ne reste plus qu\'à verser le sang. Appelez le meneur de guerre. »\\n—Basandra, séraphine de combat", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626894&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47e7e236-10c7-44b0-a927-97c33743287a\', \'multiverseId\': 626894}, \'multiverseid\': 626894}, {\'name\': \'殺戮の化身\', \'text\': \'すべてのクリーチャーは二段攻撃を持ち、各戦闘で可能なら攻撃する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アバター\', \'flavor\': \'「交渉では何も解決はせぬ。流血のみがこれを終わらせられるのだ。戦いをもたらす者を呼び起こせ。」\\n――戦いの熾天使、バサンドラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad153c5e-c7da-413c-b0df-ed4688b15b7b\', \'multiverseId\': 627234}, \'multiverseid\': 627234}, {\'name\': \'屠杀化身\', \'text\': \'所有生物具有连击异能，且每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～圣者\', \'flavor\': \'「外交一事无成，如今唯有溅血一途。召唤战神吧。」\\n～战斗炽天使芭珊卓\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e799323-7aa2-4ce0-a9d4-0b56c2b45771\', \'multiverseId\': 627574}, \'multiverseid\': 627574}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avatar des Gemetzels\', \'text\': \'Alle Kreaturen haben Doppelschlag und greifen in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Avatar\', \'flavor\': \'„Diplomatie hat nichts erreicht. Nur durch Blutvergießen können wir dies beenden. Ruft die Kriegstreiber herbei!"\\n—Basandra, Kampf-Seraph\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627904&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8957e8c-0c97-4854-b8dd-fba11f1e1377\', \'multiverseId\': 627904}, \'multiverseid\': 627904}, {\'name\': \'Avatar de la masacre\', \'text\': \'Todas las criaturas tienen la habilidad de dañar dos veces y atacan cada combate si pueden.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': \'"La diplomacia no ha solucionado nada. Solo derramar sangre puede terminar con esto. Llama al adalid de la guerra".\\n—Basandra, Serafín de Batalla\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82ded109-189f-4d32-bac2-6178f86fc9d0\', \'multiverseId\': 628138}, \'multiverseid\': 628138}, {\'name\': \'殺戮の化身\', \'text\': \'すべてのクリーチャーは二段攻撃を持ち、各戦闘で可能なら攻撃する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アバター\', \'flavor\': \'「交渉では何も解決はせぬ。流血のみがこれを終わらせられるのだ。戦いをもたらす者を呼び起こせ。」\\n――戦いの熾天使、バサンドラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d642789d-e401-4f17-9ba8-5f249ca51708\', \'multiverseId\': 628606}, \'multiverseid\': 628606}, {\'name\': \'屠杀化身\', \'text\': \'所有生物具有连击异能，且每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～圣者\', \'flavor\': \'「外交一事无成，如今唯有溅血一途。召唤战神吧。」\\n～战斗炽天使芭珊卓\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2273863-062d-49f7-b082-f244a8fe18e8\', \'multiverseId\': 629074}, \'multiverseid\': 629074}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azami, Herrin der Spruchrollen\', \'text\': \'Tappe einen ungetappten Zauberer, den du kontrollierst: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Körper hat Grenzen. Der Geist nicht."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629338&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db3c4a23-e3fd-482e-910f-b45ed71eaab8\', \'multiverseId\': 629338}, \'multiverseid\': 629338}, {\'name\': \'Azami, señora de los pergaminos\', \'text\': \'Girar un Hechicero enderezado que controlas: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"El cuerpo tiene límites. La mente, no".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97210ee4-98e1-44e5-ac1e-52f86019d88d\', \'multiverseId\': 629362}, \'multiverseid\': 629362}, {\'name\': \'Azami, dame des parchemins\', \'text\': \'Engagez un sorcier dégagé que vous contrôlez : Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Le corps a ses limites. Pas l\'esprit. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629386&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dba42bed-92d1-4894-a95e-f117500d20bd\', \'multiverseId\': 629386}, \'multiverseid\': 629386}, {\'name\': \'巻物の君、あざみ\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態であるウィザード１体をタップする：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「肉体には限界があります。心にはありません。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c49813bc-6242-425f-8e27-3ab94d22b803\', \'multiverseId\': 629434}, \'multiverseid\': 629434}, {\'name\': \'万卷蓟夫人\', \'text\': \'横置一个由你操控且未横置的法术师：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「肉身有限，心灵无羁。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d36cf8be-1829-45ff-8fd8-4d9607ecfd74\', \'multiverseId\': 629482}, \'multiverseid\': 629482}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azami, Herrin der Spruchrollen\', \'text\': \'Tappe einen ungetappten Zauberer, den du kontrollierst: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Wahl hat nur, wer den Luxus von Zeit und Abstand hat. Wir haben beides nicht. Ich empfehle, dass wir mit dem Plan, alle Schreine der Kami zu zerstören, fortfahren."\\n—Herrin Azami, Brief an Sensei Hisoka\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622883&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2124201-18b8-48a8-9103-390ff0987ad0\', \'multiverseId\': 622883}, \'multiverseid\': 622883}, {\'name\': \'Azami, señora de los pergaminos\', \'text\': \'Girar un Hechicero enderezado que controlas: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Aquellos que poseen los lujos del tiempo y la distancia pueden elegir. Nosotros no los poseemos. Recomiendo que procedamos con el plan de destruir todos los altares de los kami".\\n—Señora Azami, carta al sensei Hisoka\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81c6cff4-a1d3-4da7-b958-3b09702122f8\', \'multiverseId\': 623084}, \'multiverseid\': 623084}, {\'name\': \'Azami, dame des parchemins\', \'text\': \'Engagez un sorcier dégagé que vous contrôlez : Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Nous n\'avons ni le luxe du temps, ni celui de l\'éloignement. Je recommande l\'exécution de ce plan visant à détruire tous les reliquaires des kami. »\\n—Dame Azami, lettre au sensei Hisoka", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623285&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5f2f700-2b06-45d9-9bd5-91bea40fdadd\', \'multiverseId\': 623285}, \'multiverseid\': 623285}, {\'name\': \'巻物の君、あざみ\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態であるウィザード１体をタップする：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「選ぶことができるのは、時間も空間も贅を尽くせる者ばかり。我らにはいずれもありませぬ。神の社をすべて破壊する計を進めてはいかがかと存じます。」\\n――あざみより密師範への書簡\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be784a10-bf62-41b9-9991-0fd5366cd964\', \'multiverseId\': 623687}, \'multiverseid\': 623687}, {\'name\': \'万卷蓟夫人\', \'text\': \'横置一个由你操控且未横置的法术师：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「选择这东西，是享有充分时间与距离者的特权；可惜这两者吾等均付之匮如。我建议采用的计划，就是消灭所有神明的祭祠。」\\n～蓟夫人致密师范\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8b38ca9-dcbe-4b01-805a-dc0e5879dd3e\', \'multiverseId\': 624089}, \'multiverseid\': 624089}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azami, Herrin der Spruchrollen\', \'text\': \'Tappe einen ungetappten Zauberer, den du kontrollierst: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Wahl hat nur, wer den Luxus von Zeit und Abstand hat. Wir haben beides nicht. Ich empfehle, dass wir mit dem Plan, alle Schreine der Kami zu zerstören, fortfahren."\\n—Herrin Azami, Brief an Sensei Hisoka\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626505&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18426650-70f3-402e-80ab-4e313c2da6da\', \'multiverseId\': 626505}, \'multiverseid\': 626505}, {\'name\': \'Azami, dame des parchemins\', \'text\': \'Engagez un sorcier dégagé que vous contrôlez : Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Nous n\'avons ni le luxe du temps, ni celui de l\'éloignement. Je recommande l\'exécution de ce plan visant à détruire tous les reliquaires des kami. »\\n—Dame Azami, lettre au sensei Hisoka", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626845&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc400c7c-145f-4c32-ad7a-10e6d412a85d\', \'multiverseId\': 626845}, \'multiverseid\': 626845}, {\'name\': \'巻物の君、あざみ\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするアンタップ状態のウィザード１体をタップする：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「選ぶことができるのは、時間も空間も贅を尽くせる者ばかり。我らにはいずれもありませぬ。神の社をすべて破壊する計を進めてはいかがかと存じます。」\\n――あざみより密師範への書簡\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac855b61-f029-4471-b3e2-dc49d73abd4b\', \'multiverseId\': 627185}, \'multiverseid\': 627185}, {\'name\': \'万卷蓟夫人\', \'text\': \'横置一个由你操控且未横置的法术师：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「选择这东西，是享有充分时间与距离者的特权；可惜这两者吾等均付之匮如。我建议采用的计划，就是消灭所有神明的祭祠。」\\n～蓟夫人致密师范\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83116980-6aa6-4d8f-a442-87e85c3bda9b\', \'multiverseId\': 627525}, \'multiverseid\': 627525}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azorius-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Es ist wie ein Labyrinth gestaltet und verkörpert damit die Rechtsprechung der Azorius — eine feste Struktur, die viel aushalten kann und Veränderungen verhindern soll.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625603&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abbf67f1-acd8-4599-b6fe-12c29cdda9de\', \'multiverseId\': 625603}, \'multiverseid\': 625603}, {\'name\': "Cachet d\'Azorius", \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Le motif labyrinthique représente la base de la loi d\'Azorius — une structure stricte conçue pour briser les volontés et nuire à l\'évolution.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625860&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8547c6ba-879d-4cb0-bd58-21b812ba701b\', \'multiverseId\': 625860}, \'multiverseid\': 625860}, {\'name\': \'アゾリウスの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{W}{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'迷路のような文様は、アゾリウスの法の中核を具現化している。意志を試し、変化を止める厳格な構造だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4489a138-27cb-43ae-bb55-1a4315ece207\', \'multiverseId\': 626117}, \'multiverseid\': 626117}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azusa die Suchende\', \'text\': \'Du darfst in jedem deiner Züge zwei zusätzliche Länder spielen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Mönch\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich vermisse den Jukai-Wald nicht. Er ist nicht meine Heimat. Meine Heimat ist Kamigawa, seine Bewohner meine Familie. Wo auch immer ich mein Bündel absetze und mich ausruhe, bin ich zu Hause."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626579&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87716381-5a41-4b65-8330-1a1cbf60a126\', \'multiverseId\': 626579}, \'multiverseid\': 626579}, {\'name\': \'Azusa, égarée mais en quête\', \'text\': \'Vous pouvez jouer deux terrains supplémentaires pendant chacun de vos tours.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et moine\', \'flavor\': "« La forêt de Jukai ne me manque pas. Ce n\'est pas mon foyer. Kamigawa est mon foyer, et son peuple est ma famille. Peu importe où je pose mes affaires et où je me repose, je suis chez moi. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626919&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3598316-6ef3-4f63-a598-122a488c8b45\', \'multiverseId\': 626919}, \'multiverseid\': 626919}, {\'name\': \'迷える探求者、梓\', \'text\': \'あなたの各ターンに、あなたは追加で土地２つをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・モンク\', \'flavor\': \'「樹海が恋しくなどない。あれはわが故郷にあらず。わが故郷は神河であり、そこに住む者こそ家族。荷を解いて頭を横たえた場所こそわが故郷。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6fb47a9-ecc3-493f-b4ac-ef6bcd0961d4\', \'multiverseId\': 627259}, \'multiverseid\': 627259}, {\'name\': \'云游者梓纱\', \'text\': \'你在自己的每个回合中可以额外使用两个地。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／修行僧\', \'flavor\': \'「我并不怀念树海。我的家乡不是树海，而是整个神河；神河子民都是我的家人。不论我栖身何处，都像是回到了家。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad8a7504-d725-4163-91f5-e5a38c86c240\', \'multiverseId\': 627599}, \'multiverseid\': 627599}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azusa die Suchende\', \'text\': \'Du darfst in jedem deiner Züge zwei zusätzliche Länder spielen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Mönch\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich vermisse den Jukai-Wald nicht. Er ist nicht meine Heimat. Meine Heimat ist Kamigawa, seine Bewohner meine Familie. Wo auch immer ich mein Bündel absetze und mich ausruhe, bin ich zu Hause."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627972&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0a10581-1a43-416d-976c-f76d00b76350\', \'multiverseId\': 627972}, \'multiverseid\': 627972}, {\'name\': \'Azusa, perdida pero buscando\', \'text\': \'Puedes jugar dos tierras adicionales en cada uno de tus turnos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Monje humano\', \'flavor\': \'"No echo de menos el bosque Jukai; no es mi hogar. Mi hogar es Kamigawa; su gente es mi familia. Mi hogar es allí donde dejo mis cosas para descansar".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3587f4ae-8488-442e-9e3d-c67615bb1e96\', \'multiverseId\': 628206}, \'multiverseid\': 628206}, {\'name\': \'迷える探求者、梓\', \'text\': \'あなたの各ターンに、あなたは追加で土地２つをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・モンク\', \'flavor\': \'「樹海が恋しくなどない。あれはわが故郷にあらず。わが故郷は神河であり、そこに住む者こそ家族。荷を解いて頭を横たえた場所こそわが故郷。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8854bf7-bd37-4076-bcc3-92376a0fa226\', \'multiverseId\': 628674}, \'multiverseid\': 628674}, {\'name\': \'云游者梓纱\', \'text\': \'你在自己的每个回合中可以额外使用两个地。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／修行僧\', \'flavor\': \'「我并不怀念树海。我的家乡不是树海，而是整个神河；神河子民都是我的家人。不论我栖身何处，都像是回到了家。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c5c0917-48ae-4c44-9160-defebd561d17\', \'multiverseId\': 629142}, \'multiverseid\': 629142}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azusa die Suchende\', \'text\': \'Du darfst in jedem deiner Züge zwei zusätzliche Länder spielen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Mönch\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn man nur reist, um ein Ziel zu erreichen, versäumt man den Sinn der Reise."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629345&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cf74326-9f80-451f-9aa4-6360d4f23012\', \'multiverseId\': 629345}, \'multiverseid\': 629345}, {\'name\': \'Azusa, perdida pero buscando\', \'text\': \'Puedes jugar dos tierras adicionales en cada uno de tus turnos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Monje humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Si viajas únicamente para llegar a un destino, te perderás el propósito del viaje".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb3c070a-06d5-4bc8-9fc3-97e527263f8f\', \'multiverseId\': 629369}, \'multiverseid\': 629369}, {\'name\': \'Azusa, égarée mais en quête\', \'text\': \'Vous pouvez jouer deux terrains supplémentaires pendant chacun de vos tours.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et moine\', \'flavor\': "« Qui voyage dans le seul but d\'arriver à destination se fourvoie sur le sens du voyage. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629393&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c739e38-7d25-4b82-b723-59a6b8b7fa6c\', \'multiverseId\': 629393}, \'multiverseid\': 629393}, {\'name\': \'迷える探求者、梓\', \'text\': \'あなたの各ターンに、あなたは追加で土地２つをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・モンク\', \'flavor\': \'「旅というものをただ目的地へたどり着くためのものだと考えるのは、その本質を見失っています。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9c70870-5aa7-4789-b732-16634e4a43b8\', \'multiverseId\': 629441}, \'multiverseid\': 629441}, {\'name\': \'云游者梓纱\', \'text\': \'你在自己的每个回合中可以额外使用两个地。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／修行僧\', \'flavor\': \'「如果仅为朝着终点移动，就已错失旅行的意义。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c51cbc3-c2d3-402f-a6ae-4e7bdd7be912\', \'multiverseId\': 629489}, \'multiverseid\': 629489}]', '[{\'name\': \'Baird, Vogt von Argivia\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nKreaturen können weder dich noch Planeswalker, die du kontrollierst, angreifen, es sei denn, ihr Beherrscher bezahlt {1} für jede jener Kreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Mauern von Argivia wurden von einer friedlichen und vereinten Dynastie errichtet, die uns fünfzehn Jahrhunderte lang vor Krieg beschützt hat. Ihre Botschaft ist unmissverständlich."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622824&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c19d9695-d23c-4463-bfda-772c267c749f\', \'multiverseId\': 622824}, \'multiverseid\': 622824}, {\'name\': \'Baird, custodio de Argivia\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nLas criaturas no pueden atacarte a ti o a los planeswalkers que controlas a menos que su controlador pague {1} por cada una de esas criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Los muros de Argivia los construyó una pacífica unión dinástica que nos protegió de la guerra durante quince siglos. La lección está clara".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3f7299a-c5c5-4264-a4e1-dcf2c916c35e\', \'multiverseId\': 623025}, \'multiverseid\': 623025}, {\'name\': "Baird, intendant d\'Argive", \'text\': \'Vigilance\\nLes créatures ne peuvent pas vous attaquer ou attaquer des planeswalkers que vous contrôlez à moins que leur contrôleur ne paie {1} pour chacune de ces créatures.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« L\'enceinte d\'Argive a été construite par une union dynastique pacifique qui nous préserve de la guerre depuis quinze siècles. La leçon est claire. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623226&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'479d9e66-dc1d-466d-9ab1-07863b458a44\', \'multiverseId\': 623226}, \'multiverseid\': 623226}, {\'name\': \'アルガイヴ国家執事、ベイルド\', \'text\': \'警戒\\nプレイヤーは、自分がコントロールしていてあなたやあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃するクリーチャー１体につき {1}を支払わないかぎり、攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「アルガイヴの壁は平和的な国家同盟によって建設され、その後十五世紀もの間戦争を防ぎ続けている。この教訓は明白だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d60c3aeb-c680-40ec-89c6-a75ce78e78d7\', \'multiverseId\': 623628}, \'multiverseid\': 623628}, {\'name\': \'阿基夫监管人贝尔德\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n对每个生物而言，除非其操控者为其支付{1}，否则它不能攻击你或由你操控的鹏洛客。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「爱好和平的统治联盟为了免受战事侵扰而修建阿基夫高墙，让子孙尽享一千五百年太平岁月。结论不言自明。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf1e4207-33a2-4333-8fb5-c4215aaae332\', \'multiverseId\': 624030}, \'multiverseid\': 624030}]', '[{\'name\': \'Balan, wandernde Ritterin\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nBalan, wandernde Ritterin, hat Doppelschlag, solange zwei oder mehr Ausrüstungen an sie angelegt sind.\\n{1}{W}: Lege alle Ausrüstungen, die du kontrollierst, an Balan an.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Katze, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Mit welcher Waffe bekämpft man jemanden, der sie alle gemeistert hat?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622825&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acb23ee8-380d-4be7-b315-3d8c58b70afe\', \'multiverseId\': 622825}, \'multiverseid\': 622825}, {\'name\': \'Balan, caballero nómada\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nBalan, caballero nómada tiene la habilidad de dañar dos veces mientras haya dos o más Equipos anexados a ella.\\n{1}{W}: Anexa todos los Equipos que controlas a Balan.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Caballero felino\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Qué arma empuñarás contra alguien que las domina todas?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c3936f7-0818-4980-86b9-b3986946f4cc\', \'multiverseId\': 623026}, \'multiverseid\': 623026}, {\'name\': \'Balan, chevalière errante\', \'text\': "Initiative\\nBalan, chevalière errante a la double initiative tant qu\'au moins deux équipements lui sont attachés.\\n{1}{W} : Attachez tous les équipements que vous contrôlez à Balan.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : chat et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "« Quelle arme brandirez-vous face à quelqu\'un qui les maîtrise toutes ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623227&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4636266-1841-4aa9-9cca-3dbcde5c7a5f\', \'multiverseId\': 623227}, \'multiverseid\': 623227}, {\'name\': \'放浪の騎士、バーラン\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n放浪の騎士、バーランに２つ以上の装備品がついているかぎり、これは二段攻撃を持つ。\\n{1}{W}：あなたがコントロールしているすべての装備品を放浪の騎士、バーランにつける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 猫・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「あらゆる武器に熟練した相手に対抗するのに、何を使うつもりだ？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0d999d0-183e-4725-b7c2-401e375a8024\', \'multiverseId\': 623629}, \'multiverseid\': 623629}, {\'name\': \'漂浪骑士芭澜\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n只要漂浪骑士芭澜上贴附有两个或更多武具，它便具有连击异能。\\n{1}{W}：将所有由你操控的武具贴附在芭澜上。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～猫／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「若你的对手万般兵器皆通，你会选哪一种来应战？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8457d9e8-66b0-4029-8c2e-4e52bbc44b34\', \'multiverseId\': 624031}, \'multiverseid\': 624031}]', '[{\'name\': \'Balan, wandernde Ritterin\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nBalan, wandernde Ritterin, hat Doppelschlag, solange zwei oder mehr Ausrüstungen an sie angelegt sind.\\n{1}{W}: Lege alle Ausrüstungen, die du kontrollierst, an Balan an.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Katze, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Mit welcher Waffe bekämpft man jemanden, der sie alle gemeistert hat?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626483&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce85d77e-0296-4ce3-be6d-bbfa0beda1f5\', \'multiverseId\': 626483}, \'multiverseid\': 626483}, {\'name\': \'Balan, chevalière errante\', \'text\': "Initiative\\nBalan, chevalière errante a la double initiative tant qu\'au moins deux équipements lui sont attachés.\\n{1}{W} : Attachez tous les équipements que vous contrôlez à Balan.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : chat et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "« Quelle arme brandirez-vous face à quelqu\'un qui les maîtrise toutes ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626823&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df784970-6e61-4b1d-ac00-4979ea64da3c\', \'multiverseId\': 626823}, \'multiverseid\': 626823}, {\'name\': \'放浪の騎士、バーラン\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n放浪の騎士、バーランに２つ以上の装備品がついているかぎり、これは二段攻撃を持つ。\\n{1}{W}：あなたがコントロールしているすべての装備品を放浪の騎士、バーランにつける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 猫・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「あらゆる武器に熟練した相手に対抗するのに、何を使うつもりだ？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5897c0eb-a2d7-44be-828d-9e42ef051873\', \'multiverseId\': 627163}, \'multiverseid\': 627163}, {\'name\': \'漂浪骑士芭澜\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n只要漂浪骑士芭澜上贴附有两个或更多武具，它便具有连击异能。\\n{1}{W}：将所有由你操控的武具贴附在芭澜上。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～猫／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「若你的对手万般兵器皆通，你会选哪一种来应战？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92e4b430-7d8e-40e3-aace-2d7a3a77bba7\', \'multiverseId\': 627503}, \'multiverseid\': 627503}]', "[{'name': 'Banner der Siegreichen', 'text': 'Sowie das Banner der Siegreichen ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Kreaturentyp.\\nKreaturen des bestimmten Typs, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\nImmer wenn du einen Kreaturenzauber des bestimmten Typs wirkst, ziehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625644&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '49b73711-eb63-4c66-97eb-f115b40c435d', 'multiverseId': 625644}, 'multiverseid': 625644}, {'name': 'Bannière du vainqueur', 'text': 'Au moment où la Bannière du vainqueur arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un type de créature.\\nLes créatures du type choisi que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de créature du type choisi, piochez une carte.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625901&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c6fab0fd-1873-4c43-8cc2-d0b44e886fa6', 'multiverseId': 625901}, 'multiverseid': 625901}, {'name': '勝者の戦旗', 'text': '勝者の戦旗が戦場に出るに際し、クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてその選ばれたタイプを持つすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\nあなたがその選ばれたタイプのクリーチャー・呪文１つを唱えるたび、カード１枚を引く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626158&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1a1e25fb-b71d-41a7-befb-ba007c1b4851', 'multiverseId': 626158}, 'multiverseid': 626158}]", '[{\'name\': \'Bastion der Erinnerung\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Bastion der Erinnerung ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Mensch-Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Genommene Leben sind Leben, die nicht leicht zu vergessen sind.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622947&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f8c7ecd-5bee-4058-a8d6-0027656a1e1b\', \'multiverseId\': 622947}, \'multiverseid\': 622947}, {\'name\': \'Bastión de los recuerdos\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Bastión de los recuerdos entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Soldado Humano blanca 1/1.\\nSiempre que una criatura que controlas muera, cada oponente pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Las vidas arrebatadas no son fáciles de olvidar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af09702f-134c-41bc-b1a0-149443412d75\', \'multiverseId\': 623148}, \'multiverseid\': 623148}, {\'name\': \'Bastion du souvenir\', \'text\': "Quand le Bastion du souvenir arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Humain et Soldat.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez meurt, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Les vies ôtées ne sont pas vite oubliées.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623349&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c8dec86-1e2f-4fd2-b704-9bdc815fe0e5\', \'multiverseId\': 623349}, \'multiverseid\': 623349}, {\'name\': \'想起の拠点\', \'text\': \'想起の拠点が戦場に出たとき、白の１/１の人間・兵士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'奪われた命を軽々しく忘れるわけにはいかない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623751&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13d617c3-029a-456f-894a-b37fbb98f887\', \'multiverseId\': 623751}, \'multiverseid\': 623751}, {\'name\': \'记忆壁垒\', \'text\': \'当记忆壁垒进战场时，派出一个1/1白色人类／士兵衍生生物。\\n每当一个由你操控的生物死去时，每位对手各失去1点生命且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'殒落的生命绝不会被轻易遗忘。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1cb1a30-ba06-4550-80d3-d2464af4d280\', \'multiverseId\': 624153}, \'multiverseid\': 624153}]', "[{'name': 'Beanstalk Giant // Blühender Schritt', 'text': 'Stärke und Widerstandskraft des Bohnenranken-Riesen sind gleich der Anzahl an Ländern, die du kontrollierst.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Riese', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Beanstalk Giant', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627973&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c5dd48e-f7d1-4a50-8854-8758954f3f2d', 'multiverseId': 627973}, 'multiverseid': 627973}, {'name': 'Beanstalk Giant // Pasos fértiles', 'text': 'Tanto la fuerza como la resistencia del Gigante tallo de habichuelas son iguales a la cantidad de tierras que controlas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Gigante', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Beanstalk Giant', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628207&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55b1b923-7bac-4d17-b659-dad3feb1c8cf', 'multiverseId': 628207}, 'multiverseid': 628207}, {'name': 'Beanstalk Giant // 肥（ひ）沃（よく）な足（あし）跡（あと）', 'text': '豆の木の巨人のパワーとタフネスは、それぞれあなたがコントロールしている土地の数に等しい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 巨人', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Beanstalk Giant', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628675&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '827de6b5-1a2f-41c4-9429-724cf32e6c4c', 'multiverseId': 628675}, 'multiverseid': 628675}, {'name': 'Beanstalk Giant // 丰沃脚步', 'text': '豆茎巨人的力量和防御力各等同于由你操控的地数量。', 'type': '生物 ～巨人', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Beanstalk Giant', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629143&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'abab6087-3c8d-468a-bbc1-c3796a48d82e', 'multiverseId': 629143}, 'multiverseid': 629143}]", "[{'name': 'Befehlsturm', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Wenn die Niederlage nah und die Anführer verschwunden sind, schauen alle Augen in eine Richtung.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628118&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a5f16c9-74d4-4e73-b73e-9443e6cd4e6b', 'multiverseId': 628118}, 'multiverseid': 628118}, {'name': 'Torre de mando', 'text': '{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Cuando se acerca la derrota y escasea el liderazgo, todos los ojos miran en una misma dirección.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628352&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '17edbaff-f9ae-4e4d-b317-39cd9f197fe2', 'multiverseId': 628352}, 'multiverseid': 628352}, {'name': '統率の塔', 'text': '{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色１色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '敗北が間近で指揮も不十分になったとき、すべての目は一つの方向に向けられる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628820&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a665522c-b4e5-4a98-be0c-d4c983bc827b', 'multiverseId': 628820}, 'multiverseid': 628820}, {'name': '指挥塔', 'text': '{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为你指挥官标识色中的任一颜色。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '当落败已成定局，当指引无处可寻，全军目光便会聚集一处。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629288&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '44b7c684-e280-4a8c-8468-99dc5c939c4b', 'multiverseId': 629288}, 'multiverseid': 629288}]", '[{\'name\': \'Befehlsturm\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich bin nicht sicher, wer hier das Sagen hat, aber ich bin ziemlich sicher zu wissen, wo ich hingehen muss, um es herauszufinden."\\n—Corliss der Reisende\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624489&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'142bb1fe-d5d4-448c-92f3-630640dcbdd8\', \'multiverseId\': 624489}, \'multiverseid\': 624489}, {\'name\': \'Torre de mando\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"No sé quién está a cargo aquí, pero no tengo dudas de adónde ir para descubrirlo".\\n—Corliss, el Viajero\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9227a51-b91a-45b2-aebf-19237c99e39f\', \'multiverseId\': 624535}, \'multiverseid\': 624535}, {\'name\': \'Tour de commandement\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Je ne sais pas trop qui est le chef ici, mais je pense savoir où aller pour le découvrir. »\\n—Corliss le vagabond\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624581&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29ef4055-9a4d-4f4c-b855-a620ac829538\', \'multiverseId\': 624581}, \'multiverseid\': 624581}, {\'name\': \'統率の塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「この辺りの責任者が一体誰なのかは定かではないが、どこに行けば見つかるかはかなり自信がある。」\\n――放浪者コルリス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17cae7b3-7731-4522-9631-8546a8d29f1f\', \'multiverseId\': 624673}, \'multiverseid\': 624673}, {\'name\': \'指挥塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为你指挥官标识色中的任一颜色。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「虽然我不知道这里是谁的地盘，但我很确定去哪里能搞清楚。」\\n～云游者柯力斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1de1eae1-e372-4b80-a39c-91df938ecccf\', \'multiverseId\': 624765}, \'multiverseid\': 624765}]', "[{'name': 'Befestigtes Dorf', 'text': 'Sowie das Befestigte Dorf ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Wald- oder Ebene-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt das Befestigte Dorf getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {W}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625658&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '29c52d7d-9917-4da0-afe9-2a12928fd5d9', 'multiverseId': 625658}, 'multiverseid': 625658}, {'name': 'Village fortifié', 'text': 'Au moment où le Village fortifié arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte de forêt ou de plaine de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, le Village fortifié arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625915&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f8371c6a-d53c-476e-92d2-ad340843fc5e', 'multiverseId': 625915}, 'multiverseid': 625915}, {'name': '要塞化した村', 'text': '要塞化した村が戦場に出るに際し、あなたはあなたの手札にあり森や平地であるカード１枚を公開してもよい。そうしないなら、要塞化した村はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626172&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e9f7eeee-b20d-42c7-8b90-3e6f41015dd2', 'multiverseId': 626172}, 'multiverseid': 626172}]", '[{\'name\': \'Begehrter Pfau\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Begehrte Pfau angreift, kannst du eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die der verteidigende Spieler kontrolliert, anstacheln. (Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug greift die Kreatur in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greift einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622891&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ded312c-b31d-4801-b923-e00fd9e9e1fa\', \'multiverseId\': 622891}, \'multiverseid\': 622891}, {\'name\': \'Pavo real codiciado\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Pavo real codiciado ataque, puedes incitar a la criatura objetivo que controla el jugador defensor. (Hasta tu próximo turno, esa criatura ataca cada combate si puede y ataca a un jugador que no seas tú si puede.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf9c4589-d24f-40c8-83f1-be2192605af3\', \'multiverseId\': 623092}, \'multiverseid\': 623092}, {\'name\': \'Paon convoité\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Paon convoité attaque, vous pouvez inciter une créature ciblée que le joueur défenseur contrôle. (Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, cette créature attaque à chaque combat si possible et attaque un joueur autre que vous si possible.)", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623293&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ebb2ed2-be99-47b6-af38-666e35a22375\', \'multiverseId\': 623293}, \'multiverseid\': 623293}, {\'name\': \'切望の孔雀\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n切望の孔雀が攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを使嗾してもよい。（次のあなたのターンまで、そのクリーチャーは、各戦闘で可能なら攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed00824d-9c1f-4095-896a-2dd4dd5879a1\', \'multiverseId\': 623695}, \'multiverseid\': 623695}, {\'name\': \'簇捧孔雀\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当簇捧孔雀攻击时，你可以煽惑目标由防御牌手操控的生物。（直到你的下一个回合，该生物每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击，且若能攻击除你以外的牌手，则必须如此作。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鸟\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0378faee-01ee-45a0-84b5-e2aff7a9776e\', \'multiverseId\': 624097}, \'multiverseid\': 624097}]', '[{\'name\': \'Behelfsmunition\', \'text\': \'{1}, opfere ein Artefakt oder eine Kreatur: Die Behelfsmunition fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Schmiere eine Feuerkanone gründlich mit Öl aus Dinosaurierleber ein und sie feuert so ziemlich alles ab."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627940&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b3e7e33-c389-4248-9d3c-ba5548017b89\', \'multiverseId\': 627940}, \'multiverseid\': 627940}, {\'name\': \'Municiones improvisadas\', \'text\': \'{1}, sacrificar un artefacto o una criatura: Las Municiones improvisadas hacen 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Engrasa bien un cañón ígneo con aceite de hígado de dinosaurio y disparará casi cualquier cosa".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'244487d8-5f3f-400e-a276-d87c921ab480\', \'multiverseId\': 628174}, \'multiverseid\': 628174}, {\'name\': \'間に合わせの砲弾\', \'text\': \'{1}, アーティファクトやクリーチャーのうち１つを生け贄に捧げる：１つを対象とする。間に合わせの砲弾はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「火炎砲に恐竜肝油たっぷりくれてやりゃあ、何だって撃ち出せるってよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb7f3655-6992-4aeb-ac58-c2dd3bf72c84\', \'multiverseId\': 628642}, \'multiverseid\': 628642}, {\'name\': \'代用军火\', \'text\': \'{1}，牺牲一个神器或生物：代用军火对任意一个目标造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「只要用恐龙肝油给火炎炮妥善润滑，基本上什么东西都打得出去。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8f9a135-f44c-4486-b673-8cf551953837\', \'multiverseId\': 629110}, \'multiverseid\': 629110}]', "[{'name': 'Beinschienen des Blitzes', 'text': 'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Eile und Verhülltheit. (Sie kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein.)\\nAusrüsten {0}', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': 'Als der Blitz in die Klippen einschlug, wurde Erz zu Eisen, Eisen zu Stahl und Stahl zu Beinschienen. Der Blitz blieb für immer.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628096&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4cbae4ae-644c-4d04-83e8-ad6b818329a0', 'multiverseId': 628096}, 'multiverseid': 628096}, {'name': 'Grebas relámpago', 'text': 'La criatura equipada tiene las habilidades de prisa y velo. (No puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades.)\\nEquipar {0}.', 'type': 'Artefacto — Equipo', 'flavor': 'Después de que el relámpago golpeó los acantilados, el mineral se transformó en hierro, el hierro se convirtió en acero y el acero se convirtió en grebas. El relámpago nunca se fue.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628330&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a3a36a8e-e293-48c0-abee-90dabb48fb2c', 'multiverseId': 628330}, 'multiverseid': 628330}, {'name': '稲妻のすね当て', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーは速攻と被覆を持つ。（それは呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\\n装備{0}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': '稲妻が崖を打った後、鉱石は鉄となり、鉄は鋼となり、鋼はすね当てとなった。稲妻はそこに残ったままだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628798&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '666cc483-aaef-4d80-9f1c-bfda96102856', 'multiverseId': 628798}, 'multiverseid': 628798}, {'name': '迅雷护胫', 'text': '佩带此武具的生物具有敏捷与帷幕异能。（它不能成为咒语或异能的目标。）\\n佩带{0}', 'type': '神器 ～武具', 'flavor': '闪电击中山崖后，矿石成铁，铁成钢，钢成护胫。迅雷长存其间。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629266&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '75e5ad9e-da24-450e-8bd2-e5e2699f237b', 'multiverseId': 629266}, 'multiverseid': 629266}]", '[{\'name\': \'Beispielloses Manöver\', \'text\': \'Falls du einen Kommandeur kontrollierst, kannst du diesen Zauberspruch wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\nKreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Hauptmann, Eure Einheiten sind die Speerspitze. Sie können sich keine Fehler erlauben."\\n—Jirina Kudro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622833&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e1e7e15-f413-46e1-baa4-d85cfee0a0aa\', \'multiverseId\': 622833}, \'multiverseid\': 622833}, {\'name\': \'Maniobra sin igual\', \'text\': \'Si controlas un comandante, puedes lanzar este hechizo sin pagar su coste de maná.\\nLas criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Capitán, sus unidades son la punta de nuestra lanza. El fracaso no tiene cabida".\\n—Jirina Kudro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d034c41-1a99-4de6-b30f-8f8bb18236b6\', \'multiverseId\': 623034}, \'multiverseid\': 623034}, {\'name\': \'Manœuvre irréprochable\', \'text\': "Si vous contrôlez un commandant, vous pouvez lancer ce sort sans payer son coût de mana.\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Capitaine, vos unités sont notre fer de lance. Vous n\'avez pas droit à l\'erreur. »\\n—Jirina Koudro", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623235&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d76abbe8-a3d8-40bf-9343-9866fd40a445\', \'multiverseId\': 623235}, \'multiverseid\': 623235}, {\'name\': \'完璧な策略\', \'text\': \'あなたが統率者をコントロールしているなら、この呪文をマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\\nターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「隊長、あなたの部隊は私たちの槍の穂先よ。失敗の余地はないわ。」\\n――ジリーナ・クードロ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa79128d-c34d-4513-9f81-6130d7b92832\', \'multiverseId\': 623637}, \'multiverseid\': 623637}, {\'name\': \'无懈计略\', \'text\': \'如果你操控指挥官，则你可以施放此咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\\n由你操控的生物获得不灭异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「队长，你的部队就是我们的矛尖；顶端容不下任何失误空间。」\\n～杰琳娜寇卓\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5810e8fc-5ed8-4caf-aaf0-ce87091bf63d\', \'multiverseId\': 624039}, \'multiverseid\': 624039}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beispielloses Manöver\', \'text\': \'Falls du einen Kommandeur kontrollierst, kannst du diesen Zauberspruch wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\nKreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Hauptmann, Eure Einheiten sind die Speerspitze. Sie können sich keine Fehler erlauben."\\n—Jirina Kudro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626484&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18c3e975-8143-4c4c-b192-3cce4cd100d6\', \'multiverseId\': 626484}, \'multiverseid\': 626484}, {\'name\': \'Manœuvre irréprochable\', \'text\': "Si vous contrôlez un commandant, vous pouvez lancer ce sort sans payer son coût de mana.\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Capitaine, vos unités sont notre fer de lance. Vous n\'avez pas droit à l\'erreur. »\\n—Jirina Koudro", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626824&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9712ebf-9076-47ce-8337-0d678c1a513c\', \'multiverseId\': 626824}, \'multiverseid\': 626824}, {\'name\': \'完璧な策略\', \'text\': \'あなたが統率者をコントロールしているなら、この呪文をマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\\nターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「隊長、あなたの部隊は私たちの槍の穂先よ。失敗の余地はないわ。」\\n――ジリーナ・クードロ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4870ab8-21c0-4793-89b8-4a3cad4700ef\', \'multiverseId\': 627164}, \'multiverseid\': 627164}, {\'name\': \'无懈计略\', \'text\': \'如果你操控指挥官，则你可以施放此咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\\n由你操控的生物获得不灭异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「队长，你的部队就是我们的矛尖；顶端容不下任何失误空间。」\\n～杰琳娜寇卓\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89057c01-e81d-45f3-8682-277c80739119\', \'multiverseId\': 627504}, \'multiverseid\': 627504}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beispielloses Manöver\', \'text\': \'Falls du einen Kommandeur kontrollierst, kannst du diesen Zauberspruch wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\nKreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe schon viele Attentatsversuche überlebt, aber das hier ist wohl der erbärmlichste von allen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624786&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d74690cf-c5d3-456a-881f-8944bcfe0217\', \'multiverseId\': 624786}, \'multiverseid\': 624786}, {\'name\': \'Maniobra sin igual\', \'text\': \'Si controlas un comandante, puedes lanzar este hechizo sin pagar su coste de maná.\\nLas criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sobreviví a un siglo de intentos de asesinato, pero probablemente este sea el más patético de todos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'533151ef-450c-4c35-8156-789e85f6cc9c\', \'multiverseId\': 624798}, \'multiverseid\': 624798}, {\'name\': \'Manœuvre irréprochable\', \'text\': "Si vous contrôlez un commandant, vous pouvez lancer ce sort sans payer son coût de mana.\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai survécu à d\'innombrables tentatives d\'assassinat, mais celle-ci est sans doute la plus pathétique de toutes. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624810&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9287cb6a-0cc2-45a7-9aa8-fe424b6c9488\', \'multiverseId\': 624810}, \'multiverseid\': 624810}, {\'name\': \'完璧な策略\', \'text\': \'あなたが統率者をコントロールしているなら、この呪文をマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\\nターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「一世紀分の暗殺未遂を生き抜いてきたわけだけど、これほど情けないものはなかったわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8c19cf2-450b-42a1-ba47-fb95a3f0dccd\', \'multiverseId\': 624834}, \'multiverseid\': 624834}, {\'name\': \'无懈计略\', \'text\': \'如果你操控指挥官，则你可以施放此咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\\n由你操控的生物获得不灭异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「一百多年来我躲过了无数针对我的暗杀行动，各式手法早就屡见不鲜，但这次最乏善可陈。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'744c42cd-5b0d-49ff-b768-767411d7f62a\', \'multiverseId\': 624858}, \'multiverseid\': 624858}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bestechung\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche die Bibliothek eines Gegners deiner Wahl nach einer Kreaturenkarte und bringe sie unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel. Danach mischt jener Spieler.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Es scheint, dass Euer Ticket doch in Ordnung ist, gnädige Frau."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622886&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59de63e6-c374-49d2-beb0-17a8b31b7d39\', \'multiverseId\': 622886}, \'multiverseid\': 622886}, {\'name\': \'Soborno\', \'text\': \'Busca en la biblioteca del oponente objetivo una carta de criatura y ponla en el campo de batalla bajo tu control. Luego ese jugador baraja.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Parece ser que su entrada sí es válida, señora".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd5c71e1-a028-4012-b92c-5be38a25b740\', \'multiverseId\': 623087}, \'multiverseid\': 623087}, {\'name\': \'Subornation\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans la bibliothèque d\'un adversaire ciblé une carte de créature et mettez cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle. Puis ce joueur mélange.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« En fin de compte, on dirait bien que votre ticket est en règle, madame. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623288&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f34087f4-aa8e-4b7d-adb7-be9076d65a4d\', \'multiverseId\': 623288}, \'multiverseid\': 623288}, {\'name\': \'袖の下\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーのライブラリーからクリーチャー・カード１枚を探し、あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。その後、そのプレイヤーはライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「どうやら切符はお持ちのようですね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5cdfeaa-8b6b-4d6e-85ac-2b91500958d1\', \'multiverseId\': 623690}, \'multiverseid\': 623690}, {\'name\': \'贿赂\', \'text\': \'从目标对手的牌库中搜寻一张生物牌，并将该牌在你的操控下放进战场。然后该牌手洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「女士，您的票看起来都没问题。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08d2b94b-240d-4383-9e2c-42f8c001fc81\', \'multiverseId\': 624092}, \'multiverseid\': 624092}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bestechung\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche die Bibliothek eines Gegners deiner Wahl nach einer Kreaturenkarte und bringe sie unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel. Danach mischt jener Spieler.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Es scheint, dass Euer Ticket doch in Ordnung ist, gnädige Frau."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626507&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5f3d77e-2549-426d-a5aa-44c2fe087398\', \'multiverseId\': 626507}, \'multiverseid\': 626507}, {\'name\': \'Subornation\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans la bibliothèque d\'un adversaire ciblé une carte de créature et mettez cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle. Puis ce joueur mélange.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« En fin de compte, on dirait bien que votre ticket est en règle, madame. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626847&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'832d46c7-a23c-4ab2-acd3-fb0d99facf9d\', \'multiverseId\': 626847}, \'multiverseid\': 626847}, {\'name\': \'袖の下\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーのライブラリーからクリーチャー・カード１枚を探し、あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。その後、そのプレイヤーはライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「どうやら切符はお持ちのようですね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9d56252-e4ce-4fb1-b141-cdb1789fa2ee\', \'multiverseId\': 627187}, \'multiverseid\': 627187}, {\'name\': \'贿赂\', \'text\': \'从目标对手的牌库中搜寻一张生物牌，并将该牌在你的操控下放进战场。然后该牌手洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「女士，您的票看起来都没问题。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a06d2ea-ef77-4ea2-9c89-2a4613dd41e2\', \'multiverseId\': 627527}, \'multiverseid\': 627527}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beutejäger il-Kor\', \'text\': \'Irrealität (Diese Kreatur kann nur Kreaturen mit Irrealität blocken und nur von solchen geblockt werden.)\\nImmer wenn der Beutejäger il-Kor einem Gegner Schaden zufügt, ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kor, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Da er Gegenstände von Wert nicht berühren kann, stiehlt er stattdessen Geheimnisse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622911&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfd61ac3-bd56-41b3-ad0e-0b82f3bacd80\', \'multiverseId\': 622911}, \'multiverseid\': 622911}, {\'name\': \'Saqueador il-Kor\', \'text\': \'Se desvanece. (Esta criatura solo puede bloquear o ser bloqueada por criaturas con la habilidad de desvanecerse.)\\nSiempre que el Saqueador il-Kor haga daño a un oponente, roba una carta, luego descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón kor\', \'flavor\': \'Imposibilitado de tocar objetos de valor, se dedicó a robar secretos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42463f32-71c2-40ca-9db1-40e045af7e5f\', \'multiverseId\': 623112}, \'multiverseid\': 623112}, {\'name\': \'Détrousseur il-Kor\', \'text\': "Distorsion (Cette créature ne peut bloquer ou être bloquée que par des créatures avec la distorsion.)\\nÀ chaque fois que le Détrousseur il-Kor inflige des blessures à un adversaire, piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : kor et gredin\', \'flavor\': "Incapable de toucher un objet de valeur, il s\'évertue à voler les secrets.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623313&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a79a9d55-3a77-4c1e-9db2-12564cb2df07\', \'multiverseId\': 623313}, \'multiverseid\': 623313}, {\'name\': \'コー追われの物あさり\', \'text\': \'シャドー（このクリーチャーは、シャドーを持つクリーチャーしかブロックできず、シャドーを持つクリーチャーにしかブロックされない。）\\nコー追われの物あさりが対戦相手１人にダメージを与えるたび、カード１枚を引き、その後、カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — コー・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'彼は金目のものには触れられないので、代わりに秘密を盗み出すことにしている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1ed525e-9378-4eab-90d2-73f6e11d767f\', \'multiverseId\': 623715}, \'multiverseid\': 623715}, {\'name\': \'寇族黜人掠夺者\', \'text\': \'次元幽影（此生物只能阻挡具次元幽影异能的生物，亦只能被具此异能的生物阻挡。）\\n每当寇族黜人掠夺者向任一对手造成伤害时，抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～寇族／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'既然贵重品无从得手，他转而窃取秘密。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3723caa2-9fc5-4ba7-8398-4aa3cbdbb98d\', \'multiverseId\': 624117}, \'multiverseid\': 624117}]', "[{'name': 'Bewässertes Ackerland', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}.)\\nDas Bewässerte Ackerland kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land — Ebene, Insel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625667&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '47287b92-1ff6-43d8-a02a-db648fac5402', 'multiverseId': 625667}, 'multiverseid': 625667}, {'name': 'Terres arables irriguées', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}.)\\nLes Terres arables irriguées arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain : plaine et île', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625924&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '445c07d4-e2c9-4525-afb3-479b5444228e', 'multiverseId': 625924}, 'multiverseid': 625924}, {'name': '灌漑農地', 'text': '（{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。）\\n灌漑農地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）', 'type': '土地 — 平地・島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626181&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b0500d5e-e351-49df-977e-2e1aac8a2306', 'multiverseId': 626181}, 'multiverseid': 626181}]", '[{\'name\': \'Blasphemische Tat\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede Kreatur im Spiel {1} weniger.\\nDie Blasphemische Tat fügt jeder Kreatur 13 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Heilige Orte schützen nicht mehr vor dem Tod, und der Tod schützt auch nicht mehr vor allem."\\n—Thalia, Katharerritterin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625534&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3248cec1-c2e3-43bf-a2eb-77083fe7520a\', \'multiverseId\': 625534}, \'multiverseid\': 625534}, {\'name\': \'Acte blasphématoire\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque créature sur le champ de bataille.\\nL\'Acte blasphématoire inflige 13 blessures à chaque créature.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Les lieux sacrés ne sont plus un sanctuaire contre la mort, et la mort n\'est plus un sanctuaire du tout. »\\n—Thalia, chevalière cathare", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625791&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b1165d4-14fd-467f-881a-16977135531b\', \'multiverseId\': 625791}, \'multiverseid\': 625791}, {\'name\': \'冒涜の行動\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、戦場にあるクリーチャー１体につき{1}少なくなる。\\n冒涜の行動は各クリーチャーにそれぞれ13点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「聖なる地は、すでに死からの安住の地ではありません。そして死は、すでに安住の地ではありません。」\\n――聖戦騎士、サリア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3896998c-9981-4cc7-90d6-766e1289033c\', \'multiverseId\': 626048}, \'multiverseid\': 626048}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutaussaugen\', \'text\': \'Jeder Gegner verliert X Lebenspunkte. Du erhältst so viele Lebenspunkte dazu, wie auf diese Weise Lebenspunkte verloren wurden.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein kleiner Schluck hier, ein kleiner Schluck da, und plötzlich brauche ich einen neuen Tanzpartner."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624468&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19c82186-9d16-48ac-8e16-b799c4d76b4e\', \'multiverseId\': 624468}, \'multiverseid\': 624468}, {\'name\': \'Desangrar\', \'text\': \'Cada oponente pierde X vidas. Ganas una cantidad de vidas igual a la cantidad de vidas perdidas de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Un mordisquito por aquí, otro por allá y de repente necesito un nuevo compañero de baile".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e42821d-5870-4a76-bd0a-9d8a490ee998\', \'multiverseId\': 624514}, \'multiverseid\': 624514}, {\'name\': \'Exsanguination\', \'text\': \'Chaque adversaire perd X points de vie. Vous gagnez autant de points de vie que ceux perdus de cette manière.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Une petite gorgée par-ci et une autre par-là, puis tout à coup, j\'ai besoin d\'un nouveau partenaire de danse. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624560&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03adcb23-d9e4-4490-876c-13505b5396c7\', \'multiverseId\': 624560}, \'multiverseid\': 624560}, {\'name\': \'瀉血\', \'text\': \'各対戦相手はそれぞれＸ点のライフを失う。あなたはこれにより失われたライフの合計に等しい点数のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「こっちを少し吸って、こっちを少し吸う。そして出し抜けに新しい踊りの相手が欲しくなる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b1c3f8a-b6d1-4928-bc3b-0762f227d530\', \'multiverseId\': 624652}, \'multiverseid\': 624652}, {\'name\': \'放干鲜血\', \'text\': \'每位对手各失去X点生命。你获得若干生命，其数量等同于以此法失去的生命总和。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「这边亲一下，那边吸一口，转眼便需新人来搭手。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'255ceee5-6d02-490d-a87d-9b4dc4adc6d7\', \'multiverseId\': 624744}, \'multiverseid\': 624744}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutaussaugen\', \'text\': \'Jeder Gegner verliert X Lebenspunkte. Du erhältst so viele Lebenspunkte dazu, wie auf diese Weise Lebenspunkte verloren wurden.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe nicht gesagt, dass ich dir helfen würde, nach Hause zu finden. Ich sagte, ich würde dir helfen, dein Abenteuer zu beenden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622965&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ea5c78a-0e88-4e5f-8fa5-f41bc84b5d16\', \'multiverseId\': 622965}, \'multiverseid\': 622965}, {\'name\': \'Desangrar\', \'text\': \'Cada oponente pierde X vidas. Ganas una cantidad de vidas igual a la cantidad de vidas perdidas de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"No dije que te ayudaría a volver a casa, sino que te ayudaría a acabar tu aventura".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc884e97-de09-458b-ab45-57efaa3d0be2\', \'multiverseId\': 623166}, \'multiverseid\': 623166}, {\'name\': \'Exsanguination\', \'text\': \'Chaque adversaire perd X points de vie. Vous gagnez autant de points de vie que ceux perdus de cette manière.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Je n\'ai pas dit que je t\'aiderais à retrouver ton chemin pour rentrer. J\'ai dit que je t\'aiderais à terminer ton aventure. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623367&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6044313c-2516-434d-b5d5-041c8daa4d40\', \'multiverseId\': 623367}, \'multiverseid\': 623367}, {\'name\': \'瀉血\', \'text\': \'各対戦相手はそれぞれＸ点のライフを失う。あなたはこれにより失われたライフの合計に等しい点数のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「家まで連れて行ってやるとは言っていない。その旅を終わらせる手伝いをしてやると言ったんだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcc0e23c-f571-4f0f-8625-43c497bf0eda\', \'multiverseId\': 623769}, \'multiverseid\': 623769}, {\'name\': \'放干鲜血\', \'text\': \'每位对手各失去X点生命。你获得若干生命，其数量等同于以此法失去的生命总和。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我没说会帮你找路回家。而是说会助你结束冒险。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c598300f-d4cf-48ee-9b6d-0a6ab788df72\', \'multiverseId\': 624171}, \'multiverseid\': 624171}]', "[{'name': 'Blutpranke, Schrecken von Qal Sisma', 'text': 'Kreaturenzauber mit Stärke 4 oder mehr, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {2} weniger.\\nImmer wenn Blutpranke, Schrecken von Qal Sisma, angreift, erhält jede Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 und verursacht Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Bär', 'flavor': 'Du willst nicht wissen, wie sie zu ihrem Namen gekommen ist.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627991&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '87a744b0-1898-4f4f-a48d-ba1738e7e542', 'multiverseId': 627991}, 'multiverseid': 627991}, {'name': 'Zarpasangrienta, Terror de Qal Sisma', 'text': 'Te cuesta {2} menos lanzar los hechizos de criatura con fuerza de 4 o más.\\nSiempre que Zarpasangrienta, Terror de Qal Sisma ataque, cada criatura que controlas con fuerza de 4 o más obtiene +1/+1 y gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Oso', 'flavor': 'No quieres saber por qué le pusieron ese nombre.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628225&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e08514b-3047-4c00-95f1-3ae700eeb9d7', 'multiverseId': 628225}, 'multiverseid': 628225}, {'name': 'カル・シスマの恐怖、殺し爪', 'text': 'あなたがパワーが４以上であるクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{2}少なくなる。\\nカル・シスマの恐怖、殺し爪が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていてパワーが４以上であるすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受けトランプルを得る。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 熊', 'flavor': '彼女の名前の由来は知らない方がいいでしょう。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628693&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '93216801-5073-4a67-8324-1d0ffd64e85b', 'multiverseId': 628693}, 'multiverseid': 628693}, {'name': '黑山之威血爪', 'text': '你施放之力量等于或大于4的生物咒语减少{2}来施放。\\n每当黑山之威血爪攻击时，直到回合结束，每个由你操控且力量等于或大于4的生物均得+1/+1且获得践踏异能。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～熊', 'flavor': '你不会想知道她因何得名。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629161&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ce24d9a4-d9c2-4989-b006-21e7d09c1056', 'multiverseId': 629161}, 'multiverseid': 629161}]", "[{'name': 'Blutrausch-Aspirant', 'text': 'Immer wenn du eine bleibende Karte opferst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Blutrausch-Aspiranten.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, opfere eine Kreatur oder eine Verzauberung: Der Blutrausch-Aspirant fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu. Die Kreatur kann in diesem Zug nicht blocken.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Satyr, Berserker', 'flavor': 'Vom Fest zum Blutbad ist es nur ein kleiner Schritt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627906&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'febf3520-0cb3-4df8-99e0-0b5a84644a84', 'multiverseId': 627906}, 'multiverseid': 627906}, {'name': 'Aspirante a la sangre', 'text': 'Siempre que sacrifiques un permanente, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Aspirante a la sangre.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, sacrificar una criatura o un encantamiento: El Aspirante a la sangre hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura objetivo. Esa criatura no puede bloquear este turno.', 'type': 'Criatura — Berserker sátiro', 'flavor': 'De la juerga al baño de sangre solo hay un paso.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628140&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0d679f2c-5aa1-496e-985b-d636b8d23e2b', 'multiverseId': 628140}, 'multiverseid': 628140}, {'name': '血の野心家', 'text': 'あなたがパーマネント１つを生け贄に捧げるたび、血の野心家の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n{1}{R}, {T}, クリーチャーやエンチャントのうち１つを生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。血の野心家はそれに１点のダメージを与える。このターン、そのクリーチャーではブロックできない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — サテュロス・狂戦士', 'flavor': '悪ふざけと大虐殺は紙一重。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628608&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6081764f-bedf-4f3d-8f38-41448af6a170', 'multiverseId': 628608}, 'multiverseid': 628608}, {'name': '鲜血求索客', 'text': '每当你牺牲一个永久物时，在鲜血求索客上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n{1}{R}，{T}，牺牲一个生物或结界：鲜血求索客对目标生物造成1点伤害。该生物本回合不能进行阻挡。', 'type': '生物 ～羊蹄人／狂战士', 'flavor': '从狂欢盛宴到血色浸染不过一步之遥。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629076&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ec9eb04a-d5a0-4aaa-8996-73819696070f', 'multiverseId': 629076}, 'multiverseid': 629076}]", '[{\'name\': \'Blutschlemmer\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nFliegend, verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn der Blutschlemmer ins Spiel kommt, opfert jeder Gegner eine Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622972&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18a2260c-980b-4749-9f5c-b81298a0ffd0\', \'multiverseId\': 622972}, \'multiverseid\': 622972}, {\'name\': \'Goremet\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, sacrifica una criatura.\\nVuela, arrolla.\\nCuando el Goremet entre al campo de batalla, cada oponente sacrifica una criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb9ed137-bda4-47f8-8571-1d8298274edd\', \'multiverseId\': 623173}, \'multiverseid\': 623173}, {\'name\': "Gourmet d\'entrailles", \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, sacrifiez une créature.\\nVol, piétinement\\nQuand le Gourmet d\'entrailles arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque adversaire sacrifie une créature.", \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623374&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e69b84c8-2bbd-4c9a-b649-95f547088237\', \'multiverseId\': 623374}, \'multiverseid\': 623374}, {\'name\': \'大殺漢\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\\n飛行、トランプル\\n大殺漢が戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手はそれぞれクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4836a1d8-a183-4544-983e-162ac0ec6d9c\', \'multiverseId\': 623776}, \'multiverseid\': 623776}, {\'name\': \'嗜血餮魔\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n飞行，践踏\\n当嗜血餮魔进战场时，每位对手各牺牲一个生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31773ebd-e84c-41e7-8f4e-a0ac5e86cfb1\', \'multiverseId\': 624178}, \'multiverseid\': 624178}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutsporen-Thrinax\', \'text\': \'Verschlingen 1 (Sowie diese Karte ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen opfern. Diese Kreatur kommt mit entsprechend vielen +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.)\\nJede andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, kommt mit X zusätzlichen +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an +1/+1-Marken auf dem Blutsporen-Thrinax ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eidechse\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626580&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8c177b5-a5a3-412a-92bb-47588fe913dc\', \'multiverseId\': 626580}, \'multiverseid\': 626580}, {\'name\': \'Thrinax hématospore\', \'text\': "Dévorement 1 (Au moment où cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez sacrifier n\'importe quel nombre de créatures. Cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec ce nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.)\\nChaque autre créature que vous contrôlez arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 supplémentaires sur elle, X étant le nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 sur le Thrinax hématospore.", \'type\': \'Créature : lézard\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626920&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6267f605-31ec-40ed-bf21-f2026583322e\', \'multiverseId\': 626920}, \'multiverseid\': 626920}, {\'name\': \'血胞子のトリナクス\', \'text\': \'貪食１（これが戦場に出るに際し、望む数のクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げてもよい。このクリーチャーは、その数に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。）\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでない各クリーチャーはそれぞれ、追加で＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘは血胞子のトリナクスの上にある＋１/＋１カウンターの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — トカゲ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e671d49-9b80-45e9-8c83-133b61325947\', \'multiverseId\': 627260}, \'multiverseid\': 627260}, {\'name\': \'血孢叉齿蜥\', \'text\': \'吞噬1（于它进战场时，你可以牺牲任意数量的生物。此生物进战场时上面有该数量的+1/+1指示物。）\\n由你操控的其他生物进战场时上面额外有X个+1/+1指示物，X为血孢叉齿蜥上的+1/+1指示物数量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蜥蜴\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abb357b3-420a-4171-871c-8b8253988bb8\', \'multiverseId\': 627600}, \'multiverseid\': 627600}]', "[{'name': 'Blutsporen-Thrinax', 'text': 'Verschlingen 1 (Sowie diese Karte ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen opfern. Diese Kreatur kommt mit entsprechend vielen +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.)\\nJede andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, kommt mit X zusätzlichen +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an +1/+1-Marken auf dem Blutsporen-Thrinax ist.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Eidechse', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627974&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51f99b8c-2958-475d-8756-e59637caa651', 'multiverseId': 627974}, 'multiverseid': 627974}, {'name': 'Thrinax esporas sangrientas', 'text': 'Devorar 1. (En cuanto esta carta entre al campo de batalla, puedes sacrificar cualquier cantidad de criaturas. Esta criatura entra al campo de batalla con esa cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.)\\nCada otra criatura que controlas entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 adicionales sobre ella, donde X es la cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre el Thrinax esporas sangrientas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Lagarto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628208&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '05e3fa1d-1f7d-4cb9-9ce0-11d29baf8d0b', 'multiverseId': 628208}, 'multiverseid': 628208}, {'name': '血胞子のトリナクス', 'text': '貪食１（これが戦場に出るに際し、望む数のクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げてもよい。このクリーチャーは、その数に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。）\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでない各クリーチャーはそれぞれ、追加で＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘは血胞子のトリナクスの上にある＋１/＋１カウンターの数に等しい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — トカゲ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628676&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'edadbd51-05fc-408a-abb9-331b8b41aa7c', 'multiverseId': 628676}, 'multiverseid': 628676}, {'name': '血孢叉齿蜥', 'text': '吞噬1（于它进战场时，你可以牺牲任意数量的生物。此生物进战场时上面有该数量的+1/+1指示物。）\\n由你操控的其他生物进战场时上面额外有X个+1/+1指示物，X为血孢叉齿蜥上的+1/+1指示物数量。', 'type': '生物 ～蜥蜴', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629144&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6c00fa94-9546-4746-ad15-dcc166844467', 'multiverseId': 629144}, 'multiverseid': 629144}]", '[{\'name\': \'Blätterdach-Panorama\', \'text\': \'({T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {W}.)\\nDas Blätterdach-Panorama kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder mehr Standardländer.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wald, Ebene\', \'flavor\': \'Der Kontinent Murasa liegt unter einem dichten Blätterdach verborgen, die Vegetation so verwachsen, dass seine Einwohner niemals den Boden erblicken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625651&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c963a564-f048-4a0b-89d5-d5972645a1a0\', \'multiverseId\': 625651}, \'multiverseid\': 625651}, {\'name\': \'Vue de la canopée\', \'text\': \'({T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W}.)\\nLa Vue de la canopée arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.\', \'type\': \'Terrain : forêt et plaine\', \'flavor\': "Le continent de Murasa est protégé par une épaisse couche de végétation, dont les énormes branches s\'enchevêtrent si étroitement que certains habitants ne voient jamais le sol.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625908&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ba98d39-2470-4de5-bd0d-9d448bd5f258\', \'multiverseId\': 625908}, \'multiverseid\': 625908}, {\'name\': \'梢の眺望\', \'text\': \'（{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。）\\nあなたが２つ以上の基本土地をコントロールしていないかぎり、梢の眺望はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 森・平地\', \'flavor\': \'ムラーサ大陸は密生する植生に覆われている。巨大な木々の曲がりくねった枝が稠密に重なっており、ここに住む人々の中には、地面を見たことのない者もいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'522ccf68-c76f-4202-8318-80698c2170d8\', \'multiverseId\': 626165}, \'multiverseid\': 626165}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blütenzauberin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Verzauberungszauber wirkst, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Anmutig? Ja. Wunderschön? Absolut. Harmlos? Auf gar keinen Fall."\\n—Fyndhornältester\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625577&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d18150ec-d3d5-499d-800e-3b87a54bfd29\', \'multiverseId\': 625577}, \'multiverseid\': 625577}, {\'name\': \'Enchanteresse verduralde\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'enchantement, vous pouvez piocher une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et druide\', \'flavor\': \'« Gracieuse ? Oui. Belle ? Tout à fait. Inoffensive ? Ne le croyez surtout pas. »\\n—Un ancêtre cordellien\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625834&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2846bc04-0cf4-42fe-aeab-a916f8e7a9df\', \'multiverseId\': 625834}, \'multiverseid\': 625834}, {\'name\': \'新緑の女魔術師\', \'text\': \'あなたがエンチャント・呪文１つを唱えるたび、カード１枚を引いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「優雅かと？確かに。美しいかと？まったくもって。無害かと？全然そんなことはないな。」\\n――フィンドホーンの古老\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85cb12a2-bd9d-4a83-869a-0ca23cfc83a7\', \'multiverseId\': 626091}, \'multiverseid\': 626091}]', '[{\'name\': \'Boros-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {R}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Hattest du schon einmal ein Boros-Petschaft in der Hand? Man wundert sich, dass es bei seiner Größe so schwer sein kann — ein Gewicht von Stolz und Stärke."\\n—Agrus Kos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625604&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c72d14f-8474-4ecc-a19f-60a094e0b9de\', \'multiverseId\': 625604}, \'multiverseid\': 625604}, {\'name\': \'Cachet de Boros\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {R}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Avez-vous déjà eu en main le cachet de Boros ? Il est bien plus lourd qu\'on pourrait le croire — il a le pesant de la force et de la fierté. »\\n—Agrus Kos", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625861&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'809235a6-81dd-41d3-9fdd-dd60356814f1\', \'multiverseId\': 625861}, \'multiverseid\': 625861}, {\'name\': \'ボロスの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{R}{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「ボロスの印鑑を手にしたことがあるか？その重さは見た目以上だ。力と誇りの重みなのだ。」\\n――アグルス・コス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df5bae8f-95c2-4916-b175-0a477c2db2a0\', \'multiverseId\': 626118}, \'multiverseid\': 626118}]', '[{\'name\': \'Boshafter Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben „Immer wenn dieser Kreatur Schaden zugefügt wird, fügt sie einem Spieler oder Planeswalker deiner Wahl entsprechend viele Schadenspunkte zu."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Schlüssel dazu, Remasuris sicher erforschen zu können, besteht darin, herauszufinden, was sie reizt, und das um jeden Preis zu vermeiden."\\n—Rukarumel, Tagebucheintrag\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625543&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fd24f3e-819c-4bef-a1ce-ebcece62d6a0\', \'multiverseId\': 625543}, \'multiverseid\': 625543}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde malveillant\', \'text\': \'Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont « À chaque fois que cette créature subit des blessures, elle inflige autant de blessures à une cible, joueur ou planeswalker. »\', \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': \'« Le secret pour étudier les slivoïdes en toute sécurité est de savoir ce qui les énerve, puis de ne jamais le faire. »\\n—Rukarumel, journal de recherches\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625800&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26dbf564-bcbe-4b7f-90b5-d40d8acab84c\', \'multiverseId\': 625800}, \'multiverseid\': 625800}, {\'name\': \'悪意スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのスリヴァー・クリーチャーは「このクリーチャーがダメージを受けるたび、プレイヤーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１つを対象とする。これはそれにそのダメージに等しい点数のダメージを与える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'「スリヴァーを安全に観察する秘訣は、それらを刺激する要素を特定し、何としてもそれを避けることだ。」\\n――ルカルメルの観察日誌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'112edb57-9228-42fd-88b3-c09adb326820\', \'multiverseId\': 626057}, \'multiverseid\': 626057}]', '[{\'name\': \'Braids, Beschwörungsadeptin\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Versorgungssegments jedes Spielers kann jener Spieler eine Artefakt-, Kreaturen- oder Länderkarte aus seiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Das zerspaltene Multiversum wurde zu einem Meer aus miteinander streitenden Realitäten, auf denen man alle möglichen Versionen aller lebendigen Wesen finden konnte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622885&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81f070eb-64a3-4242-9267-4535b7be2d11\', \'multiverseId\': 622885}, \'multiverseid\': 622885}, {\'name\': \'Trenzas, conjuradora experta\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del mantenimiento de cada jugador, ese jugador puede poner en el campo de batalla una carta de artefacto, de criatura o de tierra de su mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'El agrietado Multiverso se convirtió en un mar de realidades en conflicto, cada una habitada por versiones posibles de cada criatura viviente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e7b50da-1e59-4d10-a7d1-c664ad1063a7\', \'multiverseId\': 623086}, \'multiverseid\': 623086}, {\'name\': \'Nattes, experte en conjuration\', \'text\': "Au début de l\'entretien de chaque joueur, ce joueur peut mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte d\'artefact, de créature ou de terrain de sa main.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'Le multivers fracturé devint un véritable océan de réalités conflictuelles peuplées de versions possibles de tous les êtres vivants.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623287&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12ea9de3-4789-497e-8d98-f6f037ea85e8\', \'multiverseId\': 623287}, \'multiverseid\': 623287}, {\'name\': \'妖術の達人ブレイズ\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーのアップキープの開始時に、そのプレイヤーは自分の手札にありアーティファクトやクリーチャーや土地であるカード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'裂け目を負った多元宇宙は矛盾した現実の大海となり、可能なかぎりのあらゆる生命で埋め尽くされていった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8de0943c-2666-4389-a7b3-6a0d5fe9c58f\', \'multiverseId\': 623689}, \'multiverseid\': 623689}, {\'name\': \'咒法专家布蕾德\', \'text\': \'在每位牌手的维持开始时，该牌手可以将一张神器，生物或地牌从其手上放进战场。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'受时缝影响的多重宇宙里，现实彼此冲突，挤满了每个生灵各种可能成为的样貌。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae5c2eab-8d88-415e-8ab4-6207142a2e94\', \'multiverseId\': 624091}, \'multiverseid\': 624091}]', '[{\'name\': \'Braids, Beschwörungsadeptin\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Versorgungssegments jedes Spielers kann jener Spieler eine Artefakt-, Kreaturen- oder Länderkarte aus seiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Das zerspaltene Multiversum wurde zu einem Meer aus miteinander streitenden Realitäten, auf denen man alle möglichen Versionen aller lebendigen Wesen finden konnte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626506&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a03d9b59-eb79-4ab0-addb-ee185478a92e\', \'multiverseId\': 626506}, \'multiverseid\': 626506}, {\'name\': \'Nattes, experte en conjuration\', \'text\': "Au début de l\'entretien de chaque joueur, ce joueur peut mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte d\'artefact, de créature ou de terrain de sa main.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'Le multivers fracturé devint un véritable océan de réalités conflictuelles peuplées de versions possibles de tous les êtres vivants.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626846&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3a5fec9-9fb9-4e8a-9930-dc6dffa191b4\', \'multiverseId\': 626846}, \'multiverseid\': 626846}, {\'name\': \'妖術の達人ブレイズ\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーのアップキープの開始時に、そのプレイヤーは自分の手札にありアーティファクトやクリーチャーや土地であるカード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'裂け目を負った多元宇宙は矛盾した現実の大海となり、可能なかぎりのあらゆる生命で埋め尽くされていった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3b687de-187b-4bd4-9ca0-168ab66c05f5\', \'multiverseId\': 627186}, \'multiverseid\': 627186}, {\'name\': \'咒法专家布蕾德\', \'text\': \'在每位牌手的维持开始时，该牌手可以将一张神器，生物或地牌从其手上放进战场。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'受时缝影响的多重宇宙里，现实彼此冲突，挤满了每个生灵各种可能成为的样貌。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2534adb-a28f-4b88-ad0a-35dc9d845e08\', \'multiverseId\': 627526}, \'multiverseid\': 627526}]', "[{'name': 'Brinelin der Mondkrake', 'text': 'Wenn Brinelin der Mondkrake ins Spiel kommt und immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch mit Manabetrag 6 oder mehr wirkst, kannst du eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurückbringen.\\nPartner (Du kannst zwei Kommandeure haben, falls beide Partner haben.)', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Krake', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622887&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e2a0bb38-b3bb-4663-8f55-9c14c17e56fa', 'multiverseId': 622887}, 'multiverseid': 622887}, {'name': 'Brinelin, el kraken lunar', 'text': 'Cuando Brinelin, el kraken lunar entre al campo de batalla y siempre que lances un hechizo con valor de maná de 6 o más, puedes regresar el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra a la mano de su propietario.\\nCamarada. (Puedes tener dos comandantes si ambos tienen camarada.)', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Kraken', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623088&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7e75fc5c-8295-4e05-9b42-259e3a801ce6', 'multiverseId': 623088}, 'multiverseid': 623088}, {'name': 'Brinelin, le kraken lunaire', 'text': 'Quand Brinelin, le kraken lunaire arrive sur le champ de bataille et à chaque fois que vous lancez un sort avec une valeur de mana supérieure ou égale à 6, vous pouvez renvoyer un permanent non-terrain ciblé dans la main de son propriétaire.\\nPartenariat (Vous pouvez avoir deux commandants si les deux ont le partenariat.)', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : kraken', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623289&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f0fa4bcb-7ea9-4d56-8e61-1fcb5aa8636c', 'multiverseId': 623289}, 'multiverseid': 623289}, {'name': '月のクラーケン、ブリネリン', 'text': '月のクラーケン、ブリネリンが戦場に出たとき、ならびに、あなたがマナ総量が６以上である呪文１つを唱えるたび、土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。あなたはそれをオーナーの手札に戻してもよい。\\n共闘（両方が共闘を持つなら、あなたは統率者２体を使用できる。）', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — クラーケン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623691&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c878a61d-2a8c-45fd-a1b6-72f90ccbf48a', 'multiverseId': 623691}, 'multiverseid': 623691}, {'name': '明月巨海兽碧鳞', 'text': '当明月巨海兽碧鳞进战场和每当你施放法术力值等于或大于6的咒语时，你可以将目标非地永久物移回其拥有者手上。\\n拍档（你可将两个具有拍档异能的生物共同用作指挥官。）', 'type': '传奇生物 ～巨海兽', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624093&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8339ecc3-cbdc-4bc4-9663-66aa14d073f6', 'multiverseId': 624093}, 'multiverseid': 624093}]", '[{\'name\': \'Brosche des Wandersmanns\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, opfere die Brosche des Wandersmanns: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Sie ist wie der Wald hinterm Horizont, wie der Berg, der noch bezwungen werden will, wie das neue Land hinter dem endlosen Meer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625645&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e7e4066-f1f8-4ab1-bc5a-08ea7d390142\', \'multiverseId\': 625645}, \'multiverseid\': 625645}, {\'name\': \'Babiole du voyageur\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, sacrifiez la Babiole du voyageur : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez cette carte sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "C\'est la forêt au-delà de l\'horizon, la montagne encore vierge, la nouvelle terre au-delà de la mer éternelle.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625902&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'774009fa-cb5f-47a1-b809-078db6daa880\', \'multiverseId\': 625902}, \'multiverseid\': 625902}, {\'name\': \'旅人のガラクタ\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, 旅人のガラクタを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'それは地平線の彼方の森であり、登るものを待つ山であり、終わりなき海の向こうの見果てぬ地である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fbd3c5d-ada2-4ee3-9e2d-1f5c634b3486\', \'multiverseId\': 626159}, \'multiverseid\': 626159}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brutale Prügel\', \'text\': \'Wirke diesen Zauberspruch nur während deines Zuges und nur während des Kampfes.\\nBestimme eines —\\n• Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Enttappe alle Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst. Nach dieser Phase gibt es eine zusätzliche Kampfphase.\\nVerflechtung {1}{R}\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626573&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6d5929e-d581-41c1-845c-6a3a3a7e25a3\', \'multiverseId\': 626573}, \'multiverseid\': 626573}, {\'name\': \'Attaque sauvage\', \'text\': "Ne lancez ce sort que pendant votre tour et pendant le combat.\\nChoisissez l\'un —\\n• Les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Dégagez toutes les créatures que vous contrôlez. Cette phase est suivie d\'une phase de combat supplémentaire.\\nUnion {1}{R}", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626913&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a071615f-f935-4026-a85d-a330018f5d94\', \'multiverseId\': 626913}, \'multiverseid\': 626913}, {\'name\': \'凶暴な打撃\', \'text\': \'この呪文はあなたのターンの戦闘中にしか唱えられない。\\n以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは二段攻撃を得る。\\n・あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーをアンタップする。このフェイズに続いて、追加の戦闘フェイズ１つを加える。\\n双呪{1}{R}\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8720d099-d5e2-4822-b552-dc418e1a12db\', \'multiverseId\': 627253}, \'multiverseid\': 627253}, {\'name\': \'凶蛮打击\', \'text\': \'只能于你的回合中施放此咒语，且仅限战斗中。\\n选择一项～\\n•由你操控的生物获得连击异能直到回合结束。\\n•重置所有由你操控的生物。在此阶段后，额外多出一个战斗阶段。\\n打包{1}{R}\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed957f00-bdc4-4b35-85d9-078f9d90757c\', \'multiverseId\': 627593}, \'multiverseid\': 627593}]', "[{'name': 'Brutale Prügel', 'text': 'Wirke diesen Zauberspruch nur während deines Zuges und nur während des Kampfes.\\nBestimme eines —\\n• Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Enttappe alle Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst. Nach dieser Phase gibt es eine zusätzliche Kampfphase.\\nVerflechtung {1}{R}', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627950&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6478672b-2e5d-4e58-82be-c261b6dcdff4', 'multiverseId': 627950}, 'multiverseid': 627950}, {'name': 'Paliza salvaje', 'text': 'Lanza este hechizo solo durante tu turno y solo durante el combate.\\nElige uno:\\n• Las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno.\\n• Endereza todas las criaturas que controlas. Después de esta fase, hay una fase de combate adicional.\\nEntrelazar {1}{R}.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628184&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b5e9fb4f-858b-49ae-8ef0-df61b8362352', 'multiverseId': 628184}, 'multiverseid': 628184}, {'name': '凶暴な打撃', 'text': 'この呪文はあなたのターンの戦闘中にしか唱えられない。\\n以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは二段攻撃を得る。\\n・あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーをアンタップする。このフェイズに続いて、追加の戦闘フェイズ１つを加える。\\n双呪{1}{R}', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628652&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b2c48ac-51d9-4b13-8509-c177b03ef290', 'multiverseId': 628652}, 'multiverseid': 628652}, {'name': '凶蛮打击', 'text': '只能于你的回合中施放此咒语，且仅限战斗中。\\n选择一项～\\n•由你操控的生物获得连击异能直到回合结束。\\n•重置所有由你操控的生物。在此阶段后，额外多出一个战斗阶段。\\n打包{1}{R}', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629120&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b574196f-8501-44e9-b36e-2cba07c7e9b5', 'multiverseId': 629120}, 'multiverseid': 629120}]", '[{\'name\': \'Brutkammer-Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Reproduktion {1}{G} (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kopiere ihn so oft, wie du seine Reproduktionskosten bezahlst.)\\nJeder Remasuri-Zauberspruch, den du wirkst, hat Reproduktion. Die Reproduktionskosten sind gleich seinen Manakosten. (Eine Kopie eines Bleibende-Karte-Zauberspruchs wird zu einem Spielstein.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'Ein einziges überlebendes Exemplar kann ein verwüstetes Nest in nur einer Woche neu bevölkern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625138&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74be3856-4132-44b6-9066-819c7d2114a0\', \'multiverseId\': 625138}, \'multiverseid\': 625138}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde du couvoir\', \'text\': "Duplication {1}{G} (Quand vous lancez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque fois que vous avez payé son coût de duplication.)\\nChaque sort de slivoïde que vous lancez a la duplication. Le coût de duplication est égal à son coût de mana. (Une copie d\'un sort de permanent devient un jeton.)", \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "Il suffit d\'un survivant pour repeupler un essaim dévasté en une semaine.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625170&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f285457e-c7f3-4150-a461-9054405105e7\', \'multiverseId\': 625170}, \'multiverseid\': 625170}, {\'name\': \'孵卵スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'複製 {1}{G} （あなたがこの呪文を唱えるとき、あなたが複製コストを支払った回数と同じ回数、これをコピーする。）\\nあなたが唱えるすべてのスリヴァー・呪文は複製を持つ。その複製コストは、それのマナ・コストに等しい。（パーマネント・呪文のコピーはトークンになる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'一匹でも生き残りがいたら、一週間もあれば巣は再生する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4de65938-67b2-45dd-8844-12d3c85c7f03\', \'multiverseId\': 625202}, \'multiverseid\': 625202}]', "[{'name': 'Brutkammer-Remasuri', 'text': 'Reproduktion {1}{G}\\nJeder Remasuri-Zauberspruch, den du wirkst, hat Reproduktion. Die Reproduktionskosten sind gleich den Manakosten des Zauberspruchs.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Remasuri', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624932&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0242b4ad-9401-4e63-8411-1f4d0a3426d8', 'multiverseId': 624932}, 'multiverseid': 624932}, {'name': 'Slivoïde du couvoir', 'text': 'Duplication {1}{G}\\nChaque sort de slivoïde que vous lancez a la duplication. Le coût de duplication est égal à son coût de mana.', 'type': 'Créature : slivoïde', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624967&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '386b9496-e615-401e-8ae0-8f10659d0f36', 'multiverseId': 624967}, 'multiverseid': 624967}, {'name': '孵卵スリヴァー', 'text': '複製 {1}{G}\\nあなたが唱えるすべてのスリヴァー・呪文は複製を持つ。その複製コストは、それのマナ・コストに等しい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スリヴァー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625002&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2a1a7bd1-4ab5-46cc-b75e-e6db25bbdc92', 'multiverseId': 625002}, 'multiverseid': 625002}, {'name': '孵卵裂片妖', 'text': '覆诵{1}{G}\\n每个你施放的裂片妖咒语均具有覆诵异能。其覆诵费用等同于该牌的法术力费用。', 'type': '生物 ～裂片妖', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625037&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '262b7f76-9e4a-49ea-b400-b52db36871f4', 'multiverseId': 625037}, 'multiverseid': 625037}]", '[{\'name\': \'Brutknecht\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Brutknecht stirbt, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Eldrazi-Brut-Kreaturenspielstein. Er hat „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erzeuge {C}."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': \'„Später können wir um die trauern, die wir verloren haben. Zuerst müssen wir sie jedoch von ihrem Leid erlösen."\\n—Drana, Bluthäuptling der Kalastria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622951&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c61b03dc-5991-4984-8469-43133f3e8058\', \'multiverseId\': 622951}, \'multiverseid\': 622951}, {\'name\': \'Esclavo portador\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Esclavo portador muera, crea una ficha de criatura Vástago Eldrazi incolora 1/1. Tiene "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {C}".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Lloraremos después por los que hemos perdido. Primero tenemos que acabar con su sufrimiento".\\n—Drana, jefe de sangre Kalastria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14876927-ef82-4790-bb7c-6beedfa2e0d9\', \'multiverseId\': 623152}, \'multiverseid\': 623152}, {\'name\': \'Serviteur propagateur\', \'text\': \'Quand le Serviteur propagateur meurt, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 incolore Eldrazi et Scion. Il a « Sacrifiez cette créature : Ajoutez {C}. »\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': "« Nous ferons le deuil de nos morts plus tard. Nous devons d\'abord abréger leurs souffrances. »\\n—Drana, chef de sang des Kalastria", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623353&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'722298e5-d6be-42a8-aa12-bff24ddcb7b6\', \'multiverseId\': 623353}, \'multiverseid\': 623353}, {\'name\': \'捕らわれの宿主\', \'text\': \'捕らわれの宿主が死亡したとき、無色の１/１のエルドラージ・末裔・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。それは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：{C}を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「亡くした者を嘆くのは後。彼らの苦痛を終わらせるのが先です。」\\n――カラストリアの血の長、ドラーナ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fce3197-02a5-430d-beed-9e4dfc3edae5\', \'multiverseId\': 623755}, \'multiverseid\': 623755}, {\'name\': \'带原鬼卒\', \'text\': \'当带原鬼卒死去时，派出一个1/1无色奥札奇／孽裔衍生生物。它具有「牺牲此生物：加{C}。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「日后我们会悼念逝去的同胞。现在的要务是结束他们的痛苦。」\\n～卡列奇血侯哲娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66469206-1477-4092-b421-9cc1ddbbfe2a\', \'multiverseId\': 624157}, \'multiverseid\': 624157}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bruttyrannin Sidisi\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Bruttyrannin Sidisi ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, millst du drei Karten.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturenkarten von deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof gelegt werden, erzeuge einen 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Naga, Schamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626617&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37687c9f-960a-497e-8d96-16a51d587260\', \'multiverseId\': 626617}, \'multiverseid\': 626617}, {\'name\': \'Sidisi, tyran de la Couvée\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que Sidisi, tyran de la Couvée arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, meulez trois cartes.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une carte de créature est mise dans votre cimetière depuis votre bibliothèque, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : naga et shamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626957&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5709ca1e-844c-46ff-a38f-e9bb709d656e\', \'multiverseId\': 626957}, \'multiverseid\': 626957}, {\'name\': \'血の暴君、シディシ\', \'text\': \'血の暴君、シディシが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、カード３枚を切削する。\\n１枚以上のクリーチャー・カードがあなたのライブラリーからあなたの墓地に置かれるたび、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ナーガ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d8f3f46-64d6-49d5-8c42-c8711f69d149\', \'multiverseId\': 627297}, \'multiverseid\': 627297}, {\'name\': \'族群暴君谢迪西\', \'text\': \'每当族群暴君谢迪西进战场或攻击时，磨三张牌。\\n每当一张或数张生物牌从你的牌库进入你坟墓场时，派出一个2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～那伽／祭师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'765d1c03-06ee-45f7-aa90-47f2cad619f5\', \'multiverseId\': 627637}, \'multiverseid\': 627637}]', "[{'name': 'Bruttyrannin Sidisi', 'text': 'Immer wenn die Bruttyrannin Sidisi ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, millst du drei Karten.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturenkarten von deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof gelegt werden, erzeuge einen 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Naga, Schamane', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628053&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2323bca9-1189-42f5-94b9-4470b64639a7', 'multiverseId': 628053}, 'multiverseid': 628053}, {'name': 'Sidisi, tirana de la progenie', 'text': 'Siempre que Sidisi, tirana de la progenie entre al campo de batalla o ataque, muele tres cartas.\\nSiempre que una o más cartas de criatura vayan a tu cementerio desde tu biblioteca, crea una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Chamán naga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628287&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c518f99-db08-48c9-85a2-9d48b3d33d66', 'multiverseId': 628287}, 'multiverseid': 628287}, {'name': '血の暴君、シディシ', 'text': '血の暴君、シディシが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、カード３枚を切削する。\\n１枚以上のクリーチャー・カードがあなたのライブラリーからあなたの墓地に置かれるたび、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — ナーガ・シャーマン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628755&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4dc0562f-f9d4-4650-8f75-4ebf08f55f69', 'multiverseId': 628755}, 'multiverseid': 628755}, {'name': '族群暴君谢迪西', 'text': '每当族群暴君谢迪西进战场或攻击时，磨三张牌。\\n每当一张或数张生物牌从你的牌库进入你坟墓场时，派出一个2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～那伽／祭师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629223&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f841ca55-d561-4677-91df-ce6f034439d7', 'multiverseId': 629223}, 'multiverseid': 629223}]", '[{\'name\': \'Brütende Drachenmutter\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 0/2 roten Drache-Ei-Kreaturenspielstein mit Verteidiger und „Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt, erzeuge einen 2/2 roten Drache-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit und ‚{R}: Diese Kreatur erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\\'"\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626571&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'887fb16e-6207-49cc-88bd-7b455c96da57\', \'multiverseId\': 626571}, \'multiverseid\': 626571}, {\'name\': \'Dragonne nidifiante\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nToucheterre — À chaque fois qu\\\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, créez un jeton de créature 0/2 rouge Dragon et Œuf avec le défenseur et « Quand cette créature meurt, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 rouge Dragon avec le vol et "{R} : Cette créature gagne +1/+0 jusqu\\\'à la fin du tour" ».\', \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626911&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94e56beb-3633-42c7-a925-ecabe0f999bd\', \'multiverseId\': 626911}, \'multiverseid\': 626911}, {\'name\': \'巣ごもりドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n上陸 ― 土地１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、防衛と「このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、飛行と『{R}：ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。』を持つ赤の２/２のドラゴン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。」を持つ赤の０/２のドラゴン・卵・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10559fc6-bbdf-4656-a0d9-0c919ca63f2b\', \'multiverseId\': 627251}, \'multiverseid\': 627251}, {\'name\': \'筑巢巨龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，派出一个0/2红色龙／蛋衍生生物，且具有守军与「当此生物死去时，派出一个2/2红色的龙衍生生物，且具有飞行与『{R}：此生物得+1/+0直到回合结束。』」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9734ae2d-9c4e-40da-a442-bfefa8c88c97\', \'multiverseId\': 627591}, \'multiverseid\': 627591}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brütende Drachenmutter\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 0/2 roten Drache-Ei-Kreaturenspielstein mit Verteidiger und „Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt, erzeuge einen 2/2 roten Drache-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit und ‚{R}: Diese Kreatur erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\\'"\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627943&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2da6312-5aec-4e26-8099-f582588eb9da\', \'multiverseId\': 627943}, \'multiverseid\': 627943}, {\'name\': \'Dragona en anidación\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, crea una ficha de criatura Huevo Dragón roja 0/2 con la habilidad de defensor y "Cuando esta criatura muera, crea una ficha de criatura Dragón roja 2/2 con la habilidad de volar y \\\'{R}: Esta criatura obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno\\\'".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd5ea1b5-c42b-453b-a440-666bdddb7d20\', \'multiverseId\': 628177}, \'multiverseid\': 628177}, {\'name\': \'巣ごもりドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n上陸 ― 土地１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、防衛と「このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、飛行と『{R}：ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。』を持つ赤の２/２のドラゴン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。」を持つ赤の０/２のドラゴン・卵・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dcd2c56-8bb7-459e-85a2-aa2034fc6d3a\', \'multiverseId\': 628645}, \'multiverseid\': 628645}, {\'name\': \'筑巢巨龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，派出一个0/2红色龙／蛋衍生生物，且具有守军与「当此生物死去时，派出一个2/2红色的龙衍生生物，且具有飞行与『{R}：此生物得+1/+0直到回合结束。』」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95c2335c-9a73-4fc3-ad98-587a2e86584d\', \'multiverseId\': 629113}, \'multiverseid\': 629113}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brütender Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Remasuri einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kann sein Beherrscher einen 1/1 farblosen Remasuri-Kreaturenspielstein erzeugen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'Innerhalb von Wochen nisteten mehr Remasuris auf Otaria, als es je auf Rath gab.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625549&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'638e77d1-2340-45b3-b583-34862107d805\', \'multiverseId\': 625549}, \'multiverseid\': 625549}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde géniteur\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un slivoïde inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, son contrôleur peut créer un jeton de créature 1/1 incolore Slivoïde.", \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "En quelques semaines, il y eut plus de slivoïdes en Otaria qu\'il n\'y en avait jamais eu sur Rajh.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625806&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65792fa9-fa34-49ee-88f7-69da3e0a00a6\', \'multiverseId\': 625806}, \'multiverseid\': 625806}, {\'name\': \'繁殖スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'スリヴァー１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、それのコントローラーは無色の１/１のスリヴァー・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'オタリアに住まうスリヴァーの個体数は、ものの数週間でラースを上回った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daf9752f-d38e-402a-8104-81242a5addb8\', \'multiverseId\': 626063}, \'multiverseid\': 626063}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bynder-Ornament\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\n{4}, {T}: Jeder Spieler, der eine bleibende Karte namens Bynder-Ornament kontrolliert, zieht eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Neu gegründete Familien verdienen auch ein Familienwappen."\\n—Kinnan, Bynder-Naturtalent\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628068&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'396ad862-c7a3-4cd2-8af3-204c34a07c28\', \'multiverseId\': 628068}, \'multiverseid\': 628068}, {\'name\': \'Adorno de vinculador\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\\n{4}, {T}: Cada jugador que controla un permanente llamado Adorno de vinculador roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Las familias no consanguíneas también se merecen un blasón familiar".\\n—Kinnan, el Vinculador Prodigioso\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d73b1da-d994-4dda-afe8-5c52322f640c\', \'multiverseId\': 628302}, \'multiverseid\': 628302}, {\'name\': \'眷者の装飾品\', \'text\': \'{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n{4}, {T}：「眷者の装飾品」という名前のパーマネントをコントロールしている各プレイヤーはそれぞれカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「選んだ家族にだって紋章があっていい。」\\n――眷者の神童、キナン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfd54f5d-ef05-48dd-9c0e-43a0eb3fdee9\', \'multiverseId\': 628770}, \'multiverseid\': 628770}, {\'name\': \'持绊人饰物\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\\n{4}，{T}：每位操控名称为持绊人饰物之永久物的牌手各抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「后成渊源也该有家徽。」\\n～持绊逸才季宁\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1cb3963-e33d-450d-8348-9298a07e3693\', \'multiverseId\': 629238}, \'multiverseid\': 629238}]', '[{\'name\': \'Calix, Hand des Schicksals\', \'text\': \'+1: Schaue dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine Verzauberungskarte offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\\n−3: Schicke eine Kreatur oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst, ins Exil, bis eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, das Spiel verlässt.\\n−7: Bringe alle Verzauberungskarten aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Calix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625580&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b124d402-7e85-4ff7-a94d-f123efb0b6fb\', \'multiverseId\': 625580}, \'multiverseid\': 625580}, {\'name\': \'Calix, main de la destinée\', \'text\': "+1 : Regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler une carte d\'enchantement parmi elles et mettre cette carte dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.\\n-3 : Exilez une cible, créature ou enchantement, que vous ne contrôlez pas jusqu\'à ce qu\'un enchantement ciblé que vous contrôlez quitte le champ de bataille.\\n-7 : Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille toutes les cartes d\'enchantement de votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Calix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625837&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'600a6d67-c51c-454b-9d2c-9f4604a57f13\', \'multiverseId\': 625837}, \'multiverseid\': 625837}, {\'name\': \'運命の手、ケイリクス\', \'text\': \'+1：あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード４枚を見る。「その中からエンチャント・カード１枚を公開し、あなたの手札に加える。」を選んでもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\\n-3：クリーチャーやエンチャントのうちあなたがコントロールしていない１つを対象とし、あなたがコントロールしているエンチャント１つを対象とする。その後者が戦場を離れるまで、その前者を追放する。\\n-7：あなたの墓地にあるすべてのエンチャント・カードを戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ケイリクス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da4f43cd-fe1b-4090-8e63-c13de2197f74\', \'multiverseId\': 626094}, \'multiverseid\': 626094}]', "[{'name': 'Chainer, Meister des Wahnwitzes', 'text': 'Alle Nachtmahre erhalten +1/+1.\\n{B}{B}{B}, bezahle 3 Lebenspunkte: Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel. Die Kreatur ist schwarz und zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Kreaturentypen ein Nachtmahr.\\nWenn Chainer, Meister des Wahnwitzes, das Spiel verlässt, schicke alle Nachtmahre ins Exil.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Diener', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622953&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa0e65dd-0167-48f5-8f72-5f5bc9273db9', 'multiverseId': 622953}, 'multiverseid': 622953}, {'name': 'Cadenero, maestro de demencia', 'text': 'Todas las Pesadillas obtienen +1/+1.\\n{B}{B}{B}, pagar 3 vidas: Pon en el campo de batalla bajo tu control la carta de criatura objetivo de un cementerio. Esa criatura es negra y es una Pesadilla además de sus otros tipos de criatura.\\nCuando Cadenero, maestro de demencia deje el campo de batalla, exilia todas las Pesadillas.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Sicario humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623154&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a0a97340-1b22-4b48-b742-56665a015822', 'multiverseId': 623154}, 'multiverseid': 623154}, {'name': 'Chaînes, maître des démences', 'text': 'Tous les cauchemars gagnent +1/+1.\\n{B}{B}{B}, payez 3 points de vie : Mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature ciblée depuis un cimetière. Cette créature est noire et est un cauchemar en plus de ses autres types de créature.\\nQuand Chaînes, maître des démences quitte le champ de bataille, exilez tous les cauchemars.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : humain et mignon', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623355&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3983a735-b299-4015-b79c-a9c558f5c714', 'multiverseId': 623355}, 'multiverseid': 623355}, {'name': '狂気を操る者チェイナー', 'text': 'すべてのナイトメアは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n{B}{B}{B}, ３点のライフを支払う：墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。そのクリーチャーは、黒であり他のクリーチャー・タイプに加えてナイトメアでもある。\\n狂気を操る者チェイナーが戦場を離れたとき、すべてのナイトメアを追放する。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ミニオン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623757&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b75c8e25-27e5-4d66-895c-ec60d804abb8', 'multiverseId': 623757}, 'multiverseid': 623757}, {'name': '惧像大师崔纳', 'text': '所有梦魇得+1/+1。\\n{B}{B}{B}，支付3点生命：将目标生物牌在你的操控下从坟墓场放进战场。该生物是黑色，且额外具有梦魇此生物类别。\\n当惧像大师崔纳离开战场时，放逐所有梦魇。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～人类／奴仆', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624159&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd25f7909-8430-4411-98a4-aa1e98b6a8fe', 'multiverseId': 624159}, 'multiverseid': 624159}]", "[{'name': 'Chainer, Meister des Wahnwitzes', 'text': 'Alle Nachtmahre erhalten +1/+1.\\n{B}{B}{B}, bezahle 3 Lebenspunkte: Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel. Die Kreatur ist schwarz und zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Kreaturentypen ein Nachtmahr.\\nWenn Chainer, Meister des Wahnwitzes, das Spiel verlässt, schicke alle Nachtmahre ins Exil.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Diener', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626530&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ea50256-eef3-47fc-a647-1c9540f06a09', 'multiverseId': 626530}, 'multiverseid': 626530}, {'name': 'Chaînes, maître des démences', 'text': 'Tous les cauchemars gagnent +1/+1.\\n{B}{B}{B}, payez 3 points de vie : Mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature ciblée depuis un cimetière. Cette créature est noire et est un cauchemar en plus de ses autres types de créature.\\nQuand Chaînes, maître des démences quitte le champ de bataille, exilez tous les cauchemars.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : humain et mignon', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626870&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1a5d4ea-69e3-4381-9729-6570b649303d', 'multiverseId': 626870}, 'multiverseid': 626870}, {'name': '狂気を操る者チェイナー', 'text': 'すべてのナイトメアは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n{B}{B}{B}, ３点のライフを支払う：墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。そのクリーチャーは、黒であり他のクリーチャー・タイプに加えてナイトメアでもある。\\n狂気を操る者チェイナーが戦場を離れたとき、すべてのナイトメアを追放する。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ミニオン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627210&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '53a2a23f-c1fc-4f47-be50-692c4f3cd08d', 'multiverseId': 627210}, 'multiverseid': 627210}, {'name': '惧像大师崔纳', 'text': '所有梦魇得+1/+1。\\n{B}{B}{B}，支付3点生命：将目标生物牌在你的操控下从坟墓场放进战场。该生物是黑色，且额外具有梦魇此生物类别。\\n当惧像大师崔纳离开战场时，放逐所有梦魇。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～人类／奴仆', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627550&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ad84f2dc-1af6-4d64-8b7c-abaf80748147', 'multiverseId': 627550}, 'multiverseid': 627550}]", "[{'name': 'Champion der Flamme', 'text': 'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nDer Champion der Flamme erhält +2/+2 für jede Aura und jede Ausrüstung, die an ihn angelegt ist.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger', 'flavor': 'Die Herausforderer der Obersten Kriegsfürstin Radha verlieren immer, aber sie belohnt die leidenschaftlichsten unter ihnen mit der Flamme von Keld. Danach sind sie alle Feuer und Flamme für sie.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627908&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd20df02b-af51-4467-8997-13fe96fd7489', 'multiverseId': 627908}, 'multiverseid': 627908}, {'name': 'Campeón de la Llama', 'text': 'Arrolla.\\nEl Campeón de la Llama obtiene +2/+2 por cada Aura y Equipo anexados a él.', 'type': 'Criatura — Guerrero humano', 'flavor': 'Quienes desafían a la Gran Señora Guerrera Radha siempre acaban derrotados; aun así, ella recompensa a los más osados con la Llama de Keld. Después de eso, se consumen de fervor por ella.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628142&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c5d71b11-e29c-465c-b610-49c8c5f4a649', 'multiverseId': 628142}, 'multiverseid': 628142}, {'name': '炎のチャンピオン', 'text': 'トランプル\\n炎のチャンピオンは、これについているオーラや装備品１つにつき＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士', 'flavor': '総将軍ラーダに立ち向かった者たちはみな打ち負かされたが、彼女はそのうち最も熱心であった者にケルドの炎を下賜した。それ以来、その者たちは彼女の炎となった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628610&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c688bc36-b05f-49be-8b5f-cf279a666fb2', 'multiverseId': 628610}, 'multiverseid': 628610}, {'name': '源火斗士', 'text': '践踏\\n源火斗士上每贴附一个灵气或武具，便得+2/+2。', 'type': '生物 ～人类／战士', 'flavor': '挑战大军阀拉妲的人悉数落败，但她会以凯尔顿源火奖励表现最激昂者。此后，他们便为她而燃烧。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629078&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dd64db42-a3e8-4480-92a9-83fe95ae7f69', 'multiverseId': 629078}, 'multiverseid': 629078}]", '[{\'name\': \'Champion der Setesser\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn eine Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Champion der Setesser und ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein Segen ist kein Geschenk, sondern eine Pflicht."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625574&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a02846a-3de4-4fc5-a079-a10cddee2b2c\', \'multiverseId\': 625574}, \'multiverseid\': 625574}, {\'name\': \'Championne setessienne\', \'text\': "Constellation — À chaque fois qu\'un enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la Championne setessienne et piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Une bénédiction n\'est pas un cadeau. C\'est un devoir. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625831&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50066de1-086d-4196-af11-dc8ce36dd4cd\', \'multiverseId\': 625831}, \'multiverseid\': 625831}, {\'name\': \'セテッサの勇者\', \'text\': \'星座 ― エンチャント１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、セテッサの勇者の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置き、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「恩寵は贈り物ではありません。これは義務なのです。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27113dd0-9863-4ed2-9462-2f4f15065bba\', \'multiverseId\': 626088}, \'multiverseid\': 626088}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandra, Erbin des Feuers\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments fügt Chandra, Erbin des Feuers, jedem Gegner X Schadenspunkte zu, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Planeswalkern ist, die du kontrollierst.\\n+1: Erzeuge {R} für jeden Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst.\\n0: Entferne je eine Loyalitätsmarke von einer beliebigen Anzahl an bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst. Schicke entsprechend viele Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug spielen.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625132&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d5be90e-bc26-42f3-afe0-0aec1f84f9c1\', \'multiverseId\': 625132}, \'multiverseid\': 625132}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, héritage de feu\', \'text\': "Au début de votre étape de fin, Chandra, héritage de feu inflige X blessures à chaque adversaire, X étant le nombre de planeswalkers que vous contrôlez.\\n+1: Ajoutez {R} pour chaque planeswalker que vous contrôlez.\\n0: Choisissez n\'importe quel nombre de permanents que vous contrôlez. Retirez un marqueur « loyauté » de chacun d\'eux. Exilez autant de cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez les jouer ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625164&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4306c36c-8ae2-4ae6-a6fb-1079664e6c6e\', \'multiverseId\': 625164}, \'multiverseid\': 625164}, {\'name\': \'火の後裔、チャンドラ\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、火の後裔、チャンドラは各対戦相手にそれぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。Ｘは、あなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーの数に等しい。\\n+1：あなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカー１体につき{R}を加える。\\n0：あなたがコントロールしている望む数のパーマネントの上からそれぞれ忠誠カウンター１個を取り除く。あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるその数に等しい枚数のカードを追放する。このターン、それらをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — チャンドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b366d6d-91ea-4308-89eb-856fcee0825c\', \'multiverseId\': 625196}, \'multiverseid\': 625196}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandra, Fackel des Widerstands\', \'text\': \'+1: Schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst die Karte wirken. Falls du dies nicht tust, fügt Chandra, Fackel des Widerstands, jedem Gegner 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n+1: Erzeuge {R}{R}.\\n−3: Chandra, Fackel des Widerstands, fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n−7: Du erhältst ein Emblem mit „Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, fügt dieses Emblem einem Ziel deiner Wahl 5 Schadenspunkte zu."\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625538&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'074ec6dd-bf34-423f-8fd9-f540f0b2454f\', \'multiverseId\': 625538}, \'multiverseid\': 625538}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, torche de la défiance\', \'text\': "+1 : Exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez lancer cette carte. Si vous ne le faites pas, Chandra, torche de la défiance inflige 2 blessures à chaque adversaire.\\n+1 : Ajoutez {R}{R}.\\n-3 : Chandra, torche de la défiance inflige 4 blessures à une créature ciblée.\\n-7 : Vous gagnez un emblème avec « À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort, cet emblème inflige 5 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible. »", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625795&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b54f465-702f-4497-bf3b-0c4642e5dd66\', \'multiverseId\': 625795}, \'multiverseid\': 625795}, {\'name\': \'反逆の先導者、チャンドラ\', \'text\': \'+1：あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。あなたはそのカードを唱えてもよい。そうしないなら、反逆の先導者、チャンドラは各対戦相手にそれぞれ２点のダメージを与える。\\n+1：{R}{R}を加える。\\n-3：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。反逆の先導者、チャンドラはそれに４点のダメージを与える。\\n-7：あなたは「あなたが呪文１つを唱えるたび、１つを対象とする。この紋章はそれに５点のダメージを与える。」を持つ紋章を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — チャンドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'536f2bab-9580-4f31-a641-babfce9f3d15\', \'multiverseId\': 626052}, \'multiverseid\': 626052}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandra, erwachtes Inferno\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kann nicht neutralisiert werden.\\n+2: Jeder Gegner erhält ein Emblem mit „Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments fügt dir dieses Emblem 1 Schadenspunkt zu."\\n−3: Chandra, erwachtes Inferno, fügt jeder Nicht-Elementarwesen-Kreatur 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n−X: Chandra, erwachtes Inferno, fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu. Falls eine bleibende Karte, der auf diese Weise Schaden zugefügt wurde, in diesem Zug sterben würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625537&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'709dd250-0c0d-4256-bd0d-27d4a9dbaacd\', \'multiverseId\': 625537}, \'multiverseid\': 625537}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, fournaise éveillée\', \'text\': \'Ce sort ne peut pas être contrecarré.\\n+2 : Chaque adversaire gagne un emblème avec « Au début de votre entretien, cet emblème vous inflige 1 blessure ».\\n-3 : Chandra, fournaise éveillée inflige 3 blessures à chaque créature non-Élémental.\\n-X : Chandra, fournaise éveillée inflige X blessures à une cible, créature ou planeswalker. Si un permanent ayant subi des blessures de cette manière devait mourir ce tour-ci, exilez-le à la place.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625794&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83ac2c78-04dd-4814-b4f1-ba2bf7ae4ac1\', \'multiverseId\': 625794}, \'multiverseid\': 625794}, {\'name\': \'目覚めた猛火、チャンドラ\', \'text\': \'この呪文は打ち消されない。\\n+2：各対戦相手はそれぞれ「あなたのアップキープの開始時に、この紋章はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。」を持つ紋章を得る。\\n-3：目覚めた猛火、チャンドラはエレメンタルでない各クリーチャーにそれぞれ３点のダメージを与える。\\n-X：クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１体を対象とする。目覚めた猛火、チャンドラはそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。このターン、これによりダメージを受けたパーマネントが死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — チャンドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c406aa0-c51d-4890-b67d-5889bb7c5846\', \'multiverseId\': 626051}, \'multiverseid\': 626051}]', "[{'name': 'Chaos-Narr', 'text': 'Immer wenn du eine bleibende Karte opferst, fügt der Chaos-Narr einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Teufel', 'flavor': 'Für die Rakdos sind Freudengeschrei und Angstgeschrei ein und dasselbe.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627928&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '624167ac-0a03-4e6b-9c20-177e4e603dd6', 'multiverseId': 627928}, 'multiverseid': 627928}, {'name': 'Bufón agitador', 'text': 'Siempre que sacrifiques un permanente, el Bufón agitador hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Diablo', 'flavor': 'Para los rakdos, los gritos de alegría y los de miedo son iguales.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628162&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a33c236-db67-4aef-a364-20330a216d3b', 'multiverseId': 628162}, 'multiverseid': 628162}, {'name': '騒乱の道化', 'text': 'あなたがパーマネント１つを生け贄に捧げるたび、１つを対象とする。騒乱の道化はそれに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — デビル', 'flavor': 'ラクドスにとって、嬉しい悲鳴と恐怖の悲鳴はまったく同じものだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628630&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0e094ec6-ad49-4b28-94ce-0c6be344636b', 'multiverseId': 628630}, 'multiverseid': 628630}, {'name': '浩劫小丑', 'text': '每当你牺牲一个永久物时，浩劫小丑对任意一个目标造成1点伤害。', 'type': '生物 ～魔鬼', 'flavor': '对拉铎司人而言，兴奋呼喊与恐惧尖叫是一回事。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629098&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5e12a863-0ce3-49b0-962e-8566b94c3f74', 'multiverseId': 629098}, 'multiverseid': 629098}]", '[{\'name\': \'Chromatische Laterne\', \'text\': \'Länder, die du kontrollierst, haben „{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe."\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Nach Gildentradition kann jeder Fleck mehrfarbigen Lichts auf Kopfsteinpflaster als neutraler Boden dienen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626627&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59f3d8dc-6b6c-4bfd-b058-507a26b89d5f\', \'multiverseId\': 626627}, \'multiverseid\': 626627}, {\'name\': \'Lanterne chromatique\', \'text\': \'Les terrains que vous contrôlez ont : « {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Selon la tradition de la guilde, toute flaque de lumière multicolore sur les pavés peut faire office de terrain neutre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626967&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78f5263c-45b3-426a-ae65-5baedf8d852f\', \'multiverseId\': 626967}, \'multiverseid\': 626967}, {\'name\': \'彩色の灯籠\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべての土地は「{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つ。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ギルドの伝統により、多色の光が落ちる石畳は中立地域とされる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4ee0fd9-e799-407c-a8da-a4b3614feef7\', \'multiverseId\': 627307}, \'multiverseid\': 627307}, {\'name\': \'五彩宫灯\', \'text\': \'由你操控的地具有「{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。」\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'按照公会传统，凡是多彩混色灯光照亮的鹅卵石地面，都可当作中立地带。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1ce1749-0ded-48ac-a76e-600f74ba85cb\', \'multiverseId\': 627647}, \'multiverseid\': 627647}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chromatische Laterne\', \'text\': \'Länder, die du kontrollierst, haben „{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe."\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Nach Gildentradition kann jeder Fleck mehrfarbigen Lichts auf Kopfsteinpflaster als neutraler Boden dienen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628074&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50baeda1-e2e5-4231-b487-23cdf37a8c1a\', \'multiverseId\': 628074}, \'multiverseid\': 628074}, {\'name\': \'Linterna cromática\', \'text\': \'Las tierras que controlas tienen "{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Por tradición gremial, cualquier cerco de luz multicolor que haya sobre los adoquines puede usarse como terreno neutral.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c43369bb-b2ca-46b8-926a-ea101b3a2164\', \'multiverseId\': 628308}, \'multiverseid\': 628308}, {\'name\': \'彩色の灯籠\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべての土地は「{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つ。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ギルドの伝統により、多色の光が落ちる石畳は中立地域とされる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'402d4f2e-f112-4e55-a174-e0c5e97c20d8\', \'multiverseId\': 628776}, \'multiverseid\': 628776}, {\'name\': \'五彩宫灯\', \'text\': \'由你操控的地具有「{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。」\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'按照公会传统，凡是多彩混色灯光照亮的鹅卵石地面，都可当作中立地带。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f73796ab-b64a-484d-9605-f751cf71005f\', \'multiverseId\': 629244}, \'multiverseid\': 629244}]', '[{\'name\': \'Custodi-Junkerin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWille des Konzils — Wenn die Custodi-Junkerin ins Spiel kommt, stimmt jeder Spieler, beginnend mit dir, für eine Artefakt-, Kreaturen- oder Verzauberungskarte in deinem Friedhof. Bringe die Karte(n) mit den meisten Stimmen auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622828&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b60f4ff7-2c4e-4027-ac9e-5fc27070431c\', \'multiverseId\': 622828}, \'multiverseid\': 622828}, {\'name\': \'Custodi escudera\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nVoluntad del consejo — Cuando la Custodi escudera entre al campo de batalla, comenzando contigo, cada jugador vota por una carta de artefacto, criatura o encantamiento de tu cementerio. Regresa a tu mano la carta con más votos o las que empaten por la mayor cantidad.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo espíritu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70e03c30-78ee-441f-bb55-16c11cb89272\', \'multiverseId\': 623029}, \'multiverseid\': 623029}, {\'name\': \'Écuyère des Custodi\', \'text\': "Vol\\nVolonté du conseil — Quand l\'Écuyère des Custodi arrive sur le champ de bataille, en commençant par vous, chaque joueur vote pour une carte d\'artefact, de créature ou d\'enchantement dans votre cimetière. Renvoyez dans votre main chaque carte avec le plus de votes ou qui partage le plus de votes.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit et clerc\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623230&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'661dedc0-1305-40aa-afad-72a886f0fb65\', \'multiverseId\': 623230}, \'multiverseid\': 623230}, {\'name\': \'カストーディの従者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n議決 ― カストーディの従者が戦場に出たとき、あなたから始めて各プレイヤーは、あなたの墓地にありアーティファクトやクリーチャーやエンチャントであるカード１枚に投票する。最多あるいは最多と同数の票を獲得した各カードをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット・クレリック\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f425bbf7-b8ff-425c-8906-d345e8dcf1b8\', \'multiverseId\': 623632}, \'multiverseid\': 623632}, {\'name\': \'柩护扈从\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n议定～当柩护扈从进战场时，由你开始，每位牌手各投票选择一张在你坟墓场中的神器，生物或结界牌。将所有票数最多或与他者同为最多的牌移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精怪／僧侣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d704d674-6be5-451f-933b-bf83c9dcda80\', \'multiverseId\': 624034}, \'multiverseid\': 624034}]', '[{\'name\': \'Danitha Capashen, die Vorbildliche\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag, Wachsamkeit, Lebensverknüpfung\\nAura- und Ausrüstung-Zaubersprüche, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich werde die Schwachen beschützen. Ich werde inbrünstig lieben. Ich werde mich der Verzweiflung stellen und weiterkämpfen. Als eine Capashen ist dies meine Pflicht."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622829&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec40ad91-27c5-496e-a9a8-ed278d3efc72\', \'multiverseId\': 622829}, \'multiverseid\': 622829}, {\'name\': \'Danitha Capashen, la ejemplar\', \'text\': \'Daña primero, vigilancia, vínculo vital.\\nTe cuesta {1} menos lanzar hechizos de Aura o de Equipo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Protegeré a los menos afortunados, amaré con valentía, me enfrentaré a la desesperanza y seguiré luchando. Como Capashen, no puedo hacer menos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10d16d70-604e-4cdb-a92a-8f4880f3f463\', \'multiverseId\': 623030}, \'multiverseid\': 623030}, {\'name\': \'Danitha Capashen, parangon\', \'text\': "Initiative, vigilance, lien de vie\\nLes sorts d\'aura et d\'équipement que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "« Je protégerai les malheureux. J\'aimerai courageusement. J\'affronterai le désespoir et continuerai à me battre. Je suis une Capashen, c\'est le moins que je puisse faire. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623231&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'488101b5-ea3f-469e-8fbd-dbd3f9f6ac49\', \'multiverseId\': 623231}, \'multiverseid\': 623231}, {\'name\': \'模範となる者、ダニサ・キャパシェン\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃、警戒、絆魂\\nあなたがオーラや装備品である呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「不運な者を守り、勇敢に愛する。絶望に向き合い、闘い続ける。キャパシェンとして、為すべきことを為す。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd9c9ced-db0a-4b2a-8a29-35f42806761a\', \'multiverseId\': 623633}, \'multiverseid\': 623633}, {\'name\': \'典范达妮莎卡帕轩\', \'text\': \'先攻，警戒，系命\\n你施放的灵气与武具咒语减少{1}来施放。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「我将保护不幸者。我愿勇敢去爱。我会面对困厄，奋战不懈。卡帕轩家训必不或忘。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01d0e6bc-6c3f-47ba-b0ea-4edf59b27c03\', \'multiverseId\': 624035}, \'multiverseid\': 624035}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dankbare Erscheinung\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn die Dankbare Erscheinung einem Spieler oder Planeswalker Kampfschaden zufügt, führe Wucherung durch. (Bestimme eine beliebige Anzahl an bleibenden Karten und/oder Spielern und gib ihnen dann von jeder Sorte Marke, die dort bereits liegt, eine weitere Marke.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625486&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f55f94b-380f-443c-b01a-e4bb6a1ed2ee\', \'multiverseId\': 625486}, \'multiverseid\': 625486}, {\'name\': \'Apparition reconnaissante\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Apparition reconnaissante inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur ou à un planeswalker, proliférez. (Choisissez n\'importe quel nombre de permanents et/ou de joueurs, puis donnez-leur à chacun un autre marqueur de chaque sorte déjà présente.)", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625743&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c56c22f2-6ac5-483c-9f76-7ef2013aa143\', \'multiverseId\': 625743}, \'multiverseid\': 625743}, {\'name\': \'奉謝の亡霊\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n奉謝の亡霊がプレイヤーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１つに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、増殖を行う。（望む数のパーマネントやプレイヤーを選び、すでにそこにあるカウンター１種類につき、そのカウンターをもう１個与える。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f121f80b-fc96-42f4-baa8-720f9485c3f1\', \'multiverseId\': 626000}, \'multiverseid\': 626000}]', '[{\'name\': \'Daretti der Schrottkundige\', \'text\': \'+2: Wirf bis zu zwei Karten ab und ziehe dann entsprechend viele Karten.\\n−2: Opfere ein Artefakt. Falls du dies tust, bringe eine Artefaktkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\\n−10: Du erhältst ein Emblem mit „Immer wenn ein Artefakt aus dem Spiel auf deinen Friedhof gelegt wird, bringe es zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments ins Spiel zurück."\\nDaretti der Schrottkundige kann dein Kommandeur sein.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Daretti\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626556&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'028d4e69-b1b3-4ca0-ba8d-9533bd24cb37\', \'multiverseId\': 626556}, \'multiverseid\': 626556}, {\'name\': \'Daretti, savant ferrailleur\', \'text\': "+2: Défaussez-vous de jusqu\'à deux cartes, puis piochez autant de cartes.\\n−2: Sacrifiez un artefact. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte d\'artefact ciblée depuis votre cimetière.\\n−10: Vous gagnez un emblème avec « À chaque fois qu\'un artefact est mis dans votre cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille au début de la prochaine étape de fin. »\\nDaretti, savant ferrailleur peut être votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Daretti\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626896&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37f7b796-88c1-4083-953b-d1f8f9911270\', \'multiverseId\': 626896}, \'multiverseid\': 626896}, {\'name\': \'屑鉄の学者、ダレッティ\', \'text\': \'+2：カード最大２枚を捨て、その後、その枚数に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\\n-2：あなたの墓地にあるアーティファクト・カード１枚を対象とする。アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる。そうしたなら、その対象としたカードを戦場に戻す。\\n-10：「アーティファクト１つが戦場からあなたの墓地に置かれるたび、次の終了ステップの開始時に、そのカードを戦場に戻す。」を持つ紋章を得る。\\n屑鉄の学者、ダレッティは統率者として使用できる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ダレッティ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14171266-2afd-4cd0-b157-36f0cf12f54d\', \'multiverseId\': 627236}, \'multiverseid\': 627236}, {\'name\': \'拆解学究达雷迪\', \'text\': \'+2：弃至多两张牌，然后抓等量的牌。\\n−2：牺牲一个神器。如果你如此作，则将目标神器牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\\n−10：你获得具有以下异能的徽记～「每当一个神器从战场进入你的坟墓场，在下一个结束步骤开始时，将该牌移回战场。」\\n拆解学究达雷迪可用作指挥官。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～达雷迪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df9294b9-d39d-48c7-9b36-0563b515e423\', \'multiverseId\': 627576}, \'multiverseid\': 627576}]', '[{\'name\': \'Daretti der Schrottkundige\', \'text\': \'+2: Wirf bis zu zwei Karten ab und ziehe dann entsprechend viele Karten.\\n−2: Opfere ein Artefakt. Falls du dies tust, bringe eine Artefaktkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\\n−10: Du erhältst ein Emblem mit „Immer wenn ein Artefakt aus dem Spiel auf deinen Friedhof gelegt wird, bringe es zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments ins Spiel zurück."\\nDaretti der Schrottkundige kann dein Kommandeur sein.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Daretti\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627911&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'321d0cad-14ed-4ef1-97e7-057a306a4a64\', \'multiverseId\': 627911}, \'multiverseid\': 627911}, {\'name\': \'Daretti, sabio de la chatarra\', \'text\': \'+2: Descarta hasta dos cartas, luego roba esa misma cantidad de cartas.\\n−2: Sacrifica un artefacto. Si lo haces, regresa la carta de artefacto objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\\n−10: Obtienes un emblema con "Siempre que un artefacto vaya a tu cementerio desde el campo de batalla, regresa esa carta al campo de batalla al comienzo del próximo paso final".\\nDaretti, sabio de la chatarra puede ser tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Daretti\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e935b98-e837-4098-be5f-d668388e42a7\', \'multiverseId\': 628145}, \'multiverseid\': 628145}, {\'name\': \'屑鉄の学者、ダレッティ\', \'text\': \'+2：カード最大２枚を捨て、その後、その枚数に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\\n-2：あなたの墓地にあるアーティファクト・カード１枚を対象とする。アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる。そうしたなら、その対象としたカードを戦場に戻す。\\n-10：「アーティファクト１つが戦場からあなたの墓地に置かれるたび、次の終了ステップの開始時に、そのカードを戦場に戻す。」を持つ紋章を得る。\\n屑鉄の学者、ダレッティは統率者として使用できる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ダレッティ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1310357c-6a85-490e-91df-8e6dbd1a506f\', \'multiverseId\': 628613}, \'multiverseid\': 628613}, {\'name\': \'拆解学究达雷迪\', \'text\': \'+2：弃至多两张牌，然后抓等量的牌。\\n−2：牺牲一个神器。如果你如此作，则将目标神器牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\\n−10：你获得具有以下异能的徽记～「每当一个神器从战场进入你的坟墓场，在下一个结束步骤开始时，将该牌移回战场。」\\n拆解学究达雷迪可用作指挥官。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～达雷迪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dd4bbfb-273c-48d2-8c26-d1c2cfb1cd00\', \'multiverseId\': 629081}, \'multiverseid\': 629081}]', '[{\'name\': \'Das Räuberische\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn Das Räuberische einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, erzeuge entsprechend viele 0/1 farblose Eldrazi-Ausgeburt-Kreaturenspielsteine. Sie haben „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erzeuge {C}."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627947&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6649b5b-0788-41d5-aee0-3069556a7db6\', \'multiverseId\': 627947}, \'multiverseid\': 627947}, {\'name\': \'El rapaz\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nSiempre que El rapaz haga daño de combate a un jugador, crea esa misma cantidad de fichas de criatura Engendro Eldrazi incoloras 0/1. Tienen "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {C}".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'902d4b7e-2cb5-498d-bb97-91126bbaba64\', \'multiverseId\': 628181}, \'multiverseid\': 628181}, {\'name\': \'肉喰らうもの\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n肉喰らうものがプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、その点数に等しい数の無色の０/１のエルドラージ・落とし子・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。それらは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：{C}を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce488dcd-eb2c-4a11-a9bd-49b57bda4ea3\', \'multiverseId\': 628649}, \'multiverseid\': 628649}, {\'name\': \'捕食恶兽\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n每当捕食恶兽对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，派出等量的0/1无色奥札奇／后裔衍生生物。它们具有「牺牲此生物：加{C}。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'941f3039-7759-48a9-ad1c-c299ba2709aa\', \'multiverseId\': 629117}, \'multiverseid\': 629117}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dekret des Schmerzes\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen. Sie können nicht regeneriert werden. Ziehe für jede Kreatur, die auf diese Weise zerstört wurde, eine Karte.\\nUmwandlung {3}{B}{B} ({3}{B}{B}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du das Dekret des Schmerzes umwandelst, erhalten alle Kreaturen -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622957&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd06a9d5-c6fb-4dff-86eb-5f092119c569\', \'multiverseId\': 622957}, \'multiverseid\': 622957}, {\'name\': \'Decreto de dolor\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas. No pueden ser regeneradas. Roba una carta por cada criatura destruida de esta manera.\\nCiclo {3}{B}{B}. ({3}{B}{B}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando actives la habilidad de ciclo del Decreto de dolor, todas las criaturas obtienen -2/-2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2987c298-4566-4c65-bbff-b1977992737b\', \'multiverseId\': 623158}, \'multiverseid\': 623158}, {\'name\': \'Décret de souffrance\', \'text\': "Détruisez toutes les créatures. Elles ne peuvent pas être régénérées. Piochez une carte pour chaque créature détruite de cette manière.\\nRecyclage {3}{B}{B} ({3}{B}{B}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand vous recyclez le Décret de souffrance, toutes les créatures gagnent -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623359&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c30df8db-4181-4157-b4ce-5983cb6f3294\', \'multiverseId\': 623359}, \'multiverseid\': 623359}, {\'name\': \'苦痛の命令\', \'text\': \'すべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。それらは再生できない。これにより破壊されたクリーチャー１体につき１枚のカードを引く。\\nサイクリング {3}{B}{B} （{3}{B}{B}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）\\nあなたが苦痛の命令をサイクリングしたとき、ターン終了時まで、すべてのクリーチャーは－２/－２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57e9ee02-0461-4d0c-8422-097831d457b6\', \'multiverseId\': 623761}, \'multiverseid\': 623761}, {\'name\': \'苦痛的宣判\', \'text\': \'消灭所有生物。它们不能重生。每以此法消灭一个生物，便抓一张牌。\\n循环{3}{B}{B}（{3}{B}{B}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\\n当你循环苦痛的宣判时，所有生物得-2/-2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fea03835-e8a6-4416-ad35-77d64db2777b\', \'multiverseId\': 624163}, \'multiverseid\': 624163}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dekret des Schmerzes\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen. Sie können nicht regeneriert werden. Ziehe für jede Kreatur, die auf diese Weise zerstört wurde, eine Karte.\\nUmwandlung {3}{B}{B} ({3}{B}{B}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du das Dekret des Schmerzes umwandelst, erhalten alle Kreaturen -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626533&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03d1764a-b74e-40b0-9740-0ec0916fbb3b\', \'multiverseId\': 626533}, \'multiverseid\': 626533}, {\'name\': \'Décret de souffrance\', \'text\': "Détruisez toutes les créatures. Elles ne peuvent pas être régénérées. Piochez une carte pour chaque créature détruite de cette manière.\\nRecyclage {3}{B}{B} ({3}{B}{B}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand vous recyclez le Décret de souffrance, toutes les créatures gagnent -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626873&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae9a74e0-9d18-4259-9c4c-bfa846504eb1\', \'multiverseId\': 626873}, \'multiverseid\': 626873}, {\'name\': \'苦痛の命令\', \'text\': \'すべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。それらは再生できない。これにより破壊されたクリーチャー１体につき１枚のカードを引く。\\nサイクリング {3}{B}{B} （{3}{B}{B}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）\\nあなたが苦痛の命令をサイクリングしたとき、ターン終了時まで、すべてのクリーチャーは－２/－２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82aaacdb-ad5b-458d-acbc-391cf5b3b06c\', \'multiverseId\': 627213}, \'multiverseid\': 627213}, {\'name\': \'苦痛的宣判\', \'text\': \'消灭所有生物。它们不能重生。每以此法消灭一个生物，便抓一张牌。\\n循环{3}{B}{B}（{3}{B}{B}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\\n当你循环苦痛的宣判时，所有生物得-2/-2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0113b0ca-9c66-48fe-84f2-c68fc92d8f39\', \'multiverseId\': 627553}, \'multiverseid\': 627553}]', '[{\'name\': \'Den Fluten entsteigen\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge für jede Spontanzauber- und Hexereikarte in deinem Friedhof einen getappten 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Liebster Bruder, es ist nett, dass du dein Spielzeug mit Ludevic teilen willst, aber auch ich habe neue Spielkameraden gefunden."\\n—Gisa die Ghulruferin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622926&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7575a474-6ecb-44f8-81f1-4a2adacf33f5\', \'multiverseId\': 622926}, \'multiverseid\': 622926}, {\'name\': \'Alzarse de entre las mareas\', \'text\': \'Crea una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2 girada por cada carta de instantáneo y de conjuro en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Querido hermano, es un detalle que hayas compartido tus juguetes con Ludevic, pero yo también encontré nuevos compañeros de juego".\\n—Gisa, la llamamuertos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05fe04a9-d371-4055-8ce6-4c93f070fba2\', \'multiverseId\': 623127}, \'multiverseid\': 623127}, {\'name\': \'Émergence des vagues\', \'text\': "Créez un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie engagé pour chaque carte d\'éphémère et de rituel dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Mon cher frère, je me réjouis que tu aies décidé de partager tes jouets avec Ludevic, car j\'ai moi aussi trouvé de nouveaux compagnons de jeu. »\\n—Gisa, meneuse de goule", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623328&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99a6e1d5-dbc7-4bf1-8a1b-d96bb45c8909\', \'multiverseId\': 623328}, \'multiverseid\': 623328}, {\'name\': \'潮からの蘇生\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚につき１体の、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンをタップ状態で生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「愛する弟へ。貴方の玩具をルーデヴィックと分け合うことにしたのはさぞ楽しかろうと思います。そうそう、私も新しい遊び相手を見つけたところなのですよ。」\\n――グール呼びのギサ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'254c3f66-a0f5-4553-a380-395e73cb671b\', \'multiverseId\': 623730}, \'multiverseid\': 623730}, {\'name\': \'浪潮复生\', \'text\': \'你坟墓场中每有一张瞬间与法术牌，便派出一个已横置的2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「亲爱的弟弟，你把自己的玩具和卢德维一起分享真是好心，不过我也找到了一些新玩伴。」\\n～尸鬼牧者基沙\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13965088-6994-4543-a858-f6535baca1e6\', \'multiverseId\': 624132}, \'multiverseid\': 624132}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Endlose\', \'text\': \'Der Endlose kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Er verkörpert alle möglichen Bedeutungen des Wortes „endlos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625466&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cc6b1b0-517b-4312-aa1c-2aa2d76f8dcc\', \'multiverseId\': 625466}, \'multiverseid\': 625466}, {\'name\': \'Interminable\', \'text\': "L\'Interminable arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Il incarne tous les sens possibles du mot « infini ».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625723&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acb5e436-4173-4194-842f-2f8fcd449518\', \'multiverseId\': 625723}, \'multiverseid\': 625723}, {\'name\': \'果てしなきもの\', \'text\': \'果てしなきものは、＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': \'それは「無限」の持つあらゆる意味を体現している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6af66a9-dc20-4908-9c56-871eca7e0400\', \'multiverseId\': 625980}, \'multiverseid\': 625980}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Große Steinkreis\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {X} weniger, wobei X gleich der höchsten Stärke unter den Kreaturen ist, die du kontrollierst.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}{G}. Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nImmer wenn eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie und ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626587&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06aba089-4bf8-4df6-89b8-7b58c48b784e\', \'multiverseId\': 626587}, \'multiverseid\': 626587}, {\'name\': \'Le Grand Cromlech\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {X} de moins à lancer, X étant la force la plus élevée parmi les créatures que vous contrôlez.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}{G}. Vous gagnez 2 points de vie.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature non-jeton arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle et piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626927&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02971a09-6092-465a-8c81-67ad1a2585ba\', \'multiverseId\': 626927}, \'multiverseid\': 626927}, {\'name\': \'グレートヘンジ\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{X}少なくなる。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの中のパワーの最大値に等しい。\\n{T}：{G}{G}を加える。あなたは２点のライフを得る。\\nトークンでないクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置き、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'037bb827-3633-4cb4-817a-f3cc7a298169\', \'multiverseId\': 627267}, \'multiverseid\': 627267}, {\'name\': \'巨石圆阵\', \'text\': \'此咒语减少{X}来施放，X为由你操控之生物中的最大力量。\\n{T}：加{G}{G}。你获得2点生命。\\n每当一个非衍生物的生物在你的操控下进战场时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物且抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d2ec23f-affd-4794-b5e3-83ceba349e9d\', \'multiverseId\': 627607}, \'multiverseid\': 627607}]', "[{'name': 'Der Große Steinkreis', 'text': 'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {X} weniger, wobei X gleich der höchsten Stärke unter den Kreaturen ist, die du kontrollierst.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}{G}. Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nImmer wenn eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie und ziehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Legendäres Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627992&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '45a60f4b-b75e-45d3-8c43-bc3741d0944d', 'multiverseId': 627992}, 'multiverseid': 627992}, {'name': 'El Gran Crómlech', 'text': 'Te cuesta {X} menos lanzar este hechizo, donde X es la mayor fuerza entre las criaturas que controlas.\\n{T}: Agrega {G}{G}. Ganas 2 vidas.\\nSiempre que una criatura que no sea ficha entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella y roba una carta.', 'type': 'Artefacto legendario', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628226&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '01718a36-af26-4789-a962-f48d0b3d58c5', 'multiverseId': 628226}, 'multiverseid': 628226}, {'name': 'グレートヘンジ', 'text': 'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{X}少なくなる。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの中のパワーの最大値に等しい。\\n{T}：{G}{G}を加える。あなたは２点のライフを得る。\\nトークンでないクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置き、カード１枚を引く。', 'type': '伝説のアーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628694&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c849f340-10dc-4250-814a-39434b9097fe', 'multiverseId': 628694}, 'multiverseid': 628694}, {'name': '巨石圆阵', 'text': '此咒语减少{X}来施放，X为由你操控之生物中的最大力量。\\n{T}：加{G}{G}。你获得2点生命。\\n每当一个非衍生物的生物在你的操控下进战场时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物且抓一张牌。', 'type': '传奇神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629162&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1e9f7e7-d0a7-4d44-801b-1eb69f25b688', 'multiverseId': 629162}, 'multiverseid': 629162}]", '[{\'name\': \'Der Kettenschleier\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls du in diesem Zug keine Loyalitätsfähigkeit eines Planeswalkers aktiviert hast, verlierst du 2 Lebenspunkte.\\n{4}, {T}: Für jeden Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst, kannst du einmal in diesem Zug eine seiner Loyalitätsfähigkeiten aktivieren, als ob in diesem Zug keine seiner Loyalitätsfähigkeiten aktiviert worden wären.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625605&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3926ed5-7ada-47f1-9fba-cf640fb09540\', \'multiverseId\': 625605}, \'multiverseid\': 625605}, {\'name\': \'Le Voile de Chaîne\', \'text\': "Au début de votre étape de fin, si vous n\'avez activé aucune capacité de loyauté de planeswalker ce tour-ci, vous perdez 2 points de vie.\\n{4}, {T} : Pour chaque planeswalker que vous contrôlez, vous pouvez activer une de ses capacités de loyauté une fois ce tour-ci comme si aucune de ses capacités de loyauté n\'avait été activée ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625862&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f18ed1ec-c41e-4c98-b045-8fa2b4ab8445\', \'multiverseId\': 625862}, \'multiverseid\': 625862}, {\'name\': \'鎖のヴェール\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターン、あなたがプレインズウォーカーの忠誠度能力を起動していなかった場合、あなたは２点のライフを失う。\\n{4}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしている各プレインズウォーカーにつきそれぞれ、このターン、あなたはそれの忠誠度能力が起動されていなかったかのようにそれの忠誠度能力１つを１回起動してもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e0a7c47-78a4-4f5c-a185-ca1c6c5deeaf\', \'multiverseId\': 626119}, \'multiverseid\': 626119}]', "[{'name': 'Der Prismatische Flöter', 'text': 'Falls Der Prismatische Flöter dein Kommandeur ist, bestimme vor Beginn der Partie eine Farbe. Der Prismatische Flöter hat die bestimmte Farbe.\\nPartner (Du kannst zwei Kommandeure haben, falls beide Partner haben.)', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Gestaltwandler', 'flavor': 'Er ist alles und nichts.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629306&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b2c21111-8241-4ce9-87ae-1c510b2ea844', 'multiverseId': 629306}, 'multiverseid': 629306}, {'name': 'Le Joueur de Flûte prismatique', 'text': 'Si Le Joueur de Flûte prismatique est votre commandant, choisissez une couleur avant le début de la partie. Le Joueur de Flûte prismatique est de la couleur choisie.\\nPartenariat (Vous pouvez avoir deux commandants si les deux ont le partenariat.)', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : changeforme', 'flavor': 'Il est tout et rien à la fois.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629307&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f0109765-0e43-4a73-a1e3-8fff5568d838', 'multiverseId': 629307}, 'multiverseid': 629307}, {'name': '虹色の笛吹き', 'text': '虹色の笛吹きがあなたの統率者であるなら、ゲーム開始前に色１色を選ぶ。虹色の笛吹きはその色である。\\n共闘（両方が共闘を持つなら、あなたは２体の統率者を使用できる。）', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 多相の戦士', 'flavor': '全にして無。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629308&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '95bd1368-48a7-4fdf-87ed-422b68493663', 'multiverseId': 629308}, 'multiverseid': 629308}, {'name': '虹彩魔笛手', 'text': '如果虹彩魔笛手是你的指挥官，则在游戏开始前选择一种颜色。虹彩魔笛手是该色。\\n拍档（你可将两个具有拍档异能的生物共同用作指挥官。）', 'type': '传奇生物 ～变形兽', 'flavor': '万物皆是，万物皆非。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629309&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '10dbc603-bd18-4260-8c3d-cfdbcfc380a9', 'multiverseId': 629309}, 'multiverseid': 629309}]", '[{\'name\': \'Der Ur-Drache\', \'text\': \'Eminenz — Solange Der Ur-Drache in der Kommandozone oder im Spiel ist, kosten andere Drache-Zaubersprüche, die du wirkst, beim Wirken {1} weniger.\\nFliegend\\nImmer wenn ein oder mehrere Drachen, die du kontrollierst, angreifen, ziehe entsprechend viele Karten. Dann kannst du eine bleibende Karte aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Drache, Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626267&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31eb671d-9cf0-4d17-9bb2-56c835063801\', \'multiverseId\': 626267}, \'multiverseid\': 626267}, {\'name\': "L\'Ur-Dragon", \'text\': "Éminence — Tant que L\'Ur-Dragon est dans la zone de commandement ou sur le champ de bataille, les autres sorts de dragon que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.\\nVol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins un dragon que vous contrôlez attaque, piochez autant de cartes, puis vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de permanent de votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dragon et avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626277&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1548c8ca-eb60-48b0-98f7-9257941b21dc\', \'multiverseId\': 626277}, \'multiverseid\': 626277}, {\'name\': \'始祖ドラゴン\', \'text\': \'威光 ― 始祖ドラゴンが統率領域か戦場にあるかぎり、あなたがこれでないドラゴン・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\n飛行\\nあなたがコントロールしている１体以上のドラゴンが攻撃するたび、その数に等しい枚数のカードを引く。その後、あなたの手札にあるパーマネント・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドラゴン・アバター\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5839dbd0-b046-42cf-8a25-7ee30a4ecc37\', \'multiverseId\': 626287}, \'multiverseid\': 626287}, {\'name\': \'太初龙\', \'text\': \'威仪～只要太初龙在统帅区中或战场上，你施放的其他龙咒语便减少{1}来施放。\\n飞行\\n每当一个或数个由你操控的龙攻击时，抓等量的牌，然后你可以将一张永久物牌从你手上放进战场。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～龙／圣者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c28b5026-bbbc-43c3-931b-342b10e31295\', \'multiverseId\': 626297}, \'multiverseid\': 626297}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Ur-Drache\', \'text\': \'Eminenz — Solange Der Ur-Drache in der Kommandozone oder im Spiel ist, kosten andere Drache-Zaubersprüche, die du wirkst, beim Wirken {1} weniger.\\nFliegend\\nImmer wenn ein oder mehrere Drachen, die du kontrollierst, angreifen, ziehe entsprechend viele Karten. Dann kannst du eine bleibende Karte aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Drache, Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626619&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5574f57-6aae-4e30-9b41-e981a59dd880\', \'multiverseId\': 626619}, \'multiverseid\': 626619}, {\'name\': "L\'Ur-Dragon", \'text\': "Éminence — Tant que L\'Ur-Dragon est dans la zone de commandement ou sur le champ de bataille, les autres sorts de dragon que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.\\nVol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins un dragon que vous contrôlez attaque, piochez autant de cartes, puis vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de permanent de votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dragon et avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626959&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'841894ba-85da-4e9c-89ba-65403592b5e6\', \'multiverseId\': 626959}, \'multiverseid\': 626959}, {\'name\': \'始祖ドラゴン\', \'text\': \'威光 ― 始祖ドラゴンが統率領域か戦場にあるかぎり、あなたがこれでないドラゴン・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\n飛行\\nあなたがコントロールしている１体以上のドラゴンが攻撃するたび、その数に等しい枚数のカードを引く。その後、あなたの手札にあるパーマネント・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドラゴン・アバター\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47e1d66c-05e7-4ac6-b9a6-0ace0dd859e6\', \'multiverseId\': 627299}, \'multiverseid\': 627299}, {\'name\': \'太初龙\', \'text\': \'威仪～只要太初龙在统帅区中或战场上，你施放的其他龙咒语便减少{1}来施放。\\n飞行\\n每当一个或数个由你操控的龙攻击时，抓等量的牌，然后你可以将一张永久物牌从你手上放进战场。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～龙／圣者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4572760c-b2d5-4d96-b8be-0c96b15be972\', \'multiverseId\': 627639}, \'multiverseid\': 627639}]', "[{'name': 'Der Ur-Drache', 'text': 'Eminenz — Solange Der Ur-Drache in der Kommandozone oder im Spiel ist, kosten andere Drache-Zaubersprüche, die du wirkst, beim Wirken {1} weniger.\\nFliegend\\nImmer wenn ein oder mehrere Drachen, die du kontrollierst, angreifen, ziehe entsprechend viele Karten. Dann kannst du eine bleibende Karte aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Drache, Avatar', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628059&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '29d22555-c381-430a-9b51-84d80748c056', 'multiverseId': 628059}, 'multiverseid': 628059}, {'name': 'El ur-dragón', 'text': 'Eminencia — Mientras El ur-dragón esté en la zona de mando o en el campo de batalla, te cuesta {1} menos lanzar otros hechizos de Dragón.\\nVuela.\\nSiempre que uno o más Dragones que controlas ataquen, roba esa misma cantidad de cartas, luego puedes poner una carta de permanente de tu mano en el campo de batalla.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Avatar dragón', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628293&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '87aff45d-d7f6-4e96-aad8-767fcbd7c1c0', 'multiverseId': 628293}, 'multiverseid': 628293}, {'name': '始祖ドラゴン', 'text': '威光 ― 始祖ドラゴンが統率領域か戦場にあるかぎり、あなたがこれでないドラゴン・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\n飛行\\nあなたがコントロールしている１体以上のドラゴンが攻撃するたび、その数に等しい枚数のカードを引く。その後、あなたの手札にあるパーマネント・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — ドラゴン・アバター', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628761&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '27c571f9-90c3-4335-8938-5c5d673e7ce3', 'multiverseId': 628761}, 'multiverseid': 628761}, {'name': '太初龙', 'text': '威仪～只要太初龙在统帅区中或战场上，你施放的其他龙咒语便减少{1}来施放。\\n飞行\\n每当一个或数个由你操控的龙攻击时，抓等量的牌，然后你可以将一张永久物牌从你手上放进战场。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～龙／圣者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629229&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa996bbf-c2ba-4274-8bad-bc37bc486973', 'multiverseId': 629229}, 'multiverseid': 629229}]", '[{\'name\': \'Der Ur-Drache\', \'text\': \'Eminenz — Solange Der Ur-Drache in der Kommandozone oder im Spiel ist, kosten andere Drache-Zaubersprüche, die du wirkst, beim Wirken {1} weniger.\\nFliegend\\nImmer wenn ein oder mehrere Drachen, die du kontrollierst, angreifen, ziehe entsprechend viele Karten. Dann kannst du eine bleibende Karte aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Drache, Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629355&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ca71a6c-82e2-4f05-9b91-84eb783e8de0\', \'multiverseId\': 629355}, \'multiverseid\': 629355}, {\'name\': \'El ur-dragón\', \'text\': \'Eminencia — Mientras El ur-dragón esté en la zona de mando o en el campo de batalla, te cuesta {1} menos lanzar otros hechizos de Dragón.\\nVuela.\\nSiempre que uno o más Dragones que controlas ataquen, roba esa misma cantidad de cartas, luego puedes poner una carta de permanente de tu mano en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Avatar dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2d8e75c-d649-4dcc-bebe-d9fdd36f2702\', \'multiverseId\': 629379}, \'multiverseid\': 629379}, {\'name\': "L\'Ur-Dragon", \'text\': "Éminence — Tant que L\'Ur-Dragon est dans la zone de commandement ou sur le champ de bataille, les autres sorts de dragon que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.\\nVol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins un dragon que vous contrôlez attaque, piochez autant de cartes, puis vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de permanent de votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dragon et avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629403&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9d45568-e04a-4418-b418-504275a9b394\', \'multiverseId\': 629403}, \'multiverseid\': 629403}, {\'name\': \'始祖ドラゴン\', \'text\': \'威光 ― 始祖ドラゴンが統率領域か戦場にあるかぎり、あなたがこれでないドラゴン・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\n飛行\\nあなたがコントロールしている１体以上のドラゴンが攻撃するたび、その数に等しい枚数のカードを引く。その後、あなたの手札にあるパーマネント・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドラゴン・アバター\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86228855-2546-4583-8406-e10e3ba326e7\', \'multiverseId\': 629451}, \'multiverseid\': 629451}, {\'name\': \'太初龙\', \'text\': \'威仪～只要太初龙在统帅区中或战场上，你施放的其他龙咒语便减少{1}来施放。\\n飞行\\n每当一个或数个由你操控的龙攻击时，抓等量的牌，然后你可以将一张永久物牌从你手上放进战场。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～龙／圣者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e8dbad0-af4a-4f87-9f74-e0f927ec7078\', \'multiverseId\': 629499}, \'multiverseid\': 629499}]', "[{'name': 'Despot des Himmels', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nWenn der Despot des Himmels ins Spiel kommt, wirst du zum Monarchen.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls du der Monarch bist, erzeuge einen 5/5 roten Drache-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Drache', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627952&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'affeae32-f823-4da7-80b9-0e943f6dd721', 'multiverseId': 627952}, 'multiverseid': 627952}, {'name': 'Déspota del horizonte', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nCuando el Déspota del horizonte entre al campo de batalla, te conviertes en el monarca.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si eres el monarca, crea una ficha de criatura Dragón roja 5/5 con la habilidad de volar.', 'type': 'Criatura — Dragón', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628186&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02a4cc0f-52cd-43e9-97b2-93595dc3382f', 'multiverseId': 628186}, 'multiverseid': 628186}, {'name': '天空の独裁者', 'text': '飛行\\n天空の独裁者が戦場に出たとき、あなたが統治者になる。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたが統治者である場合、飛行を持つ赤の５/５のドラゴン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドラゴン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628654&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5284f330-d04a-4a04-adfe-4da0a99184a3', 'multiverseId': 628654}, 'multiverseid': 628654}, {'name': '天际霸王', 'text': '飞行\\n当天际霸王进战场时，你成为君主。\\n在你的维持开始时，若你是君主，则派出一个5/5红色，具飞行异能的龙衍生生物。', 'type': '生物 ～龙', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629122&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '639104eb-921c-449f-8618-083d7f3720d8', 'multiverseId': 629122}, 'multiverseid': 629122}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dezimieren\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl, eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl und ein Land deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Es gibt viele Arten von Anarchie: sozial, individuell, Gruul …\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625584&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea79e171-e00e-47dd-aa19-8aa8ee8a610f\', \'multiverseId\': 625584}, \'multiverseid\': 625584}, {\'name\': \'Décimation\', \'text\': \'Détruisez un artefact ciblé, une créature ciblée, un enchantement ciblé et un terrain ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "L\'anarchie se présente sous bien des formes : sociale, individuelle, Gruul...", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625841&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1811fb91-6529-49dc-9e43-70155db847cc\', \'multiverseId\': 625841}, \'multiverseid\': 625841}, {\'name\': \'大量破壊\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つを対象とし、クリーチャー１体を対象とし、エンチャント１つを対象とし、土地１つを対象とする。それらを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'無秩序はさまざまな形態で存在する――社会、個人、グルール……。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c98e484-c1a8-47b3-aecb-1696ee64e56e\', \'multiverseId\': 626098}, \'multiverseid\': 626098}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Fesselung der Titanen\', \'text\': \'(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI — Jeder Spieler millt drei Karten.\\nII — Schicke bis zu zwei Karten deiner Wahl aus Friedhöfen ins Exil. Für jede Kreaturenkarte, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt wird, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\nIII — Bringe eine Kreaturen- oder Länderkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Sage\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625548&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ce89756-fcda-4983-9277-c43320ccef68\', \'multiverseId\': 625548}, \'multiverseid\': 625548}, {\'name\': "L\'emprisonnement des Titans", \'text\': "(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI — Chaque joueur meule trois cartes.\\nII — Exilez jusqu\'à deux cartes ciblées depuis des cimetières. Pour chaque carte de créature exilée de cette manière, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\nIII — Renvoyez une carte de créature ou de terrain ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625805&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e46b139b-bb70-43af-8ae6-bb39ccebb429\', \'multiverseId\': 625805}, \'multiverseid\': 625805}, {\'name\': \'タイタンたちの軛\', \'text\': \'（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンター１個を加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI ― 各プレイヤーはそれぞれカード３枚を切削する。\\nII ― 墓地にあるカード最大２枚を対象とする。それらを追放する。あなたは、これにより追放されたクリーチャー・カード１枚につき１点のライフを得る。\\nIII ― あなたの墓地にありクリーチャーや土地であるカード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — 英雄譚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f52fd88-0952-4a61-8e68-c2205858e84e\', \'multiverseId\': 626062}, \'multiverseid\': 626062}]', "[{'name': 'Die Immerwährende Sonne', 'text': 'Spieler können keine Loyalitätsfähigkeiten von Planeswalkern aktivieren.\\nZu Beginn deines Ziehsegments ziehst du eine zusätzliche Karte.\\nZaubersprüche, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\\nKreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.', 'type': 'Legendäres Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626633&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'feae2abf-6763-4b94-97c1-d9feaa831976', 'multiverseId': 626633}, 'multiverseid': 626633}, {'name': 'Le Soleil immortel', 'text': 'Les joueurs ne peuvent pas activer les capacités de loyauté des planeswalkers.\\nAu début de votre étape de pioche, piochez une carte supplémentaire.\\nLes sorts que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.', 'type': 'Artefact légendaire', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626973&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '05fb78c8-2c98-42d0-a34f-0e816bc6c46c', 'multiverseId': 626973}, 'multiverseid': 626973}, {'name': '不滅の太陽', 'text': 'プレイヤーはプレインズウォーカーの忠誠度能力を起動できない。\\nあなたのドロー・ステップの開始時に、追加でカード１枚を引く。\\nあなたが呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。', 'type': '伝説のアーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627313&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6199630f-329d-4b48-849c-1cd621db6603', 'multiverseId': 627313}, 'multiverseid': 627313}, {'name': '永生圣阳', 'text': '牌手不能起动鹏洛客的忠诚异能。\\n在你的抓牌步骤开始时，额外抓一张牌。\\n你施放的咒语减少{1}来施放。\\n由你操控的生物得+1/+1。', 'type': '传奇神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627653&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '65181930-ba5d-445d-8071-69181d7a1770', 'multiverseId': 627653}, 'multiverseid': 627653}]", "[{'name': 'Die Immerwährende Sonne', 'text': 'Spieler können keine Loyalitätsfähigkeiten von Planeswalkern aktivieren.\\nZu Beginn deines Ziehsegments ziehst du eine zusätzliche Karte.\\nZaubersprüche, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\\nKreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.', 'type': 'Legendäres Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628091&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cfcefbe7-58e0-4051-8941-416ec97bd0e4', 'multiverseId': 628091}, 'multiverseid': 628091}, {'name': 'El Sol Inmortal', 'text': 'Los jugadores no pueden activar las habilidades de lealtad de los planeswalkers.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso de robar, roba una carta adicional.\\nTe cuesta {1} menos lanzar los hechizos.\\nLas criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1.', 'type': 'Artefacto legendario', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628325&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6a369efd-dd88-45e5-b540-45dc3a5e7ffe', 'multiverseId': 628325}, 'multiverseid': 628325}, {'name': '不滅の太陽', 'text': 'プレイヤーはプレインズウォーカーの忠誠度能力を起動できない。\\nあなたのドロー・ステップの開始時に、追加でカード１枚を引く。\\nあなたが呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。', 'type': '伝説のアーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628793&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7e41c16f-760c-4cf0-9ceb-e06f11ac52c3', 'multiverseId': 628793}, 'multiverseid': 628793}, {'name': '永生圣阳', 'text': '牌手不能起动鹏洛客的忠诚异能。\\n在你的抓牌步骤开始时，额外抓一张牌。\\n你施放的咒语减少{1}来施放。\\n由你操控的生物得+1/+1。', 'type': '传奇神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629261&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '32c2d946-73f3-4445-ae3d-aa6dd91c9416', 'multiverseId': 629261}, 'multiverseid': 629261}]", '[{\'name\': \'Die Skarabäen-Gottheit\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments verliert jeder Gegner X Lebenspunkte und du wendest Hellsicht X an, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Zombies ist, die du kontrollierst.\\n{2}{U}{B}: Schicke eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof ins Exil. Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie von ihr ist, außer dass er ein 4/4 schwarzer Zombie ist.\\nWenn Die Skarabäen-Gottheit stirbt, bringe sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Gott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626615&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e8508ed-9ab3-4c98-9509-05d772e267ef\', \'multiverseId\': 626615}, \'multiverseid\': 626615}, {\'name\': \'Le Dieu-Scarabée\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, chaque adversaire perd X points de vie et vous appliquez regard X, X étant le nombre de zombies que vous contrôlez.\\n{2}{U}{B} : Exilez une carte de créature ciblée depuis un cimetière. Créez un jeton qui en est une copie, excepté que c\'est un zombie 4/4 noir.\\nQuand Le Dieu-Scarabée meurt, renvoyez-le dans la main de son propriétaire au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dieu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626955&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ac8ef4b-5dfb-457f-807a-ba937e921dfc\', \'multiverseId\': 626955}, \'multiverseid\': 626955}, {\'name\': \'スカラベの神\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、各対戦相手はそれぞれＸ点のライフを失い、あなたは占術Ｘを行う。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているゾンビの数に等しい。\\n{2}{U}{B}：墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。黒の４/４のゾンビであることを除きそれのコピーであるトークン１体を生成する。\\nスカラベの神が死亡したとき、次の終了ステップの開始時に、これをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3af83717-c6a8-4518-ad11-94da5460146b\', \'multiverseId\': 627295}, \'multiverseid\': 627295}, {\'name\': \'甲虫神\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，每位对手各失去X点生命且你占卜X，X为由你操控的灵俑数量。\\n{2}{U}{B}：将目标生物牌从坟墓场放逐。派出一个为该牌复制品的衍生物，但它是4/4黑色灵俑。\\n当甲虫神死去，在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0efaab44-dfae-4bc5-aa01-535588d241e0\', \'multiverseId\': 627635}, \'multiverseid\': 627635}]', "[{'name': 'Die Skarabäen-Gottheit', 'text': 'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments verliert jeder Gegner X Lebenspunkte und du wendest Hellsicht X an, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Zombies ist, die du kontrollierst.\\n{2}{U}{B}: Schicke eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof ins Exil. Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie von ihr ist, außer dass er ein 4/4 schwarzer Zombie ist.\\nWenn Die Skarabäen-Gottheit stirbt, bringe sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Gott', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628051&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '15aca620-2bb7-4c51-ac99-3cecdc416e36', 'multiverseId': 628051}, 'multiverseid': 628051}, {'name': 'El Dios Escarabajo', 'text': 'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, cada oponente pierde X vidas y tú adivinas X, donde X es la cantidad de Zombies que controlas.\\n{2}{U}{B}: Exilia la carta de criatura objetivo de un cementerio. Crea una ficha que es una copia de esa criatura, excepto que es un Zombie negro 4/4.\\nCuando El Dios Escarabajo muera, regrésalo a la mano de su propietario al comienzo del próximo paso final.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Deidad', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628285&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3b05b8cc-f7d4-4638-b1b3-5d32ab3c2db1', 'multiverseId': 628285}, 'multiverseid': 628285}, {'name': 'スカラベの神', 'text': 'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、各対戦相手はそれぞれＸ点のライフを失い、あなたは占術Ｘを行う。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているゾンビの数に等しい。\\n{2}{U}{B}：墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。黒の４/４のゾンビであることを除きそれのコピーであるトークン１体を生成する。\\nスカラベの神が死亡したとき、次の終了ステップの開始時に、これをオーナーの手札に戻す。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 神', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628753&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a0f9d20d-e924-4e61-92c2-a5a7afa8c83d', 'multiverseId': 628753}, 'multiverseid': 628753}, {'name': '甲虫神', 'text': '在你的维持开始时，每位对手各失去X点生命且你占卜X，X为由你操控的灵俑数量。\\n{2}{U}{B}：将目标生物牌从坟墓场放逐。派出一个为该牌复制品的衍生物，但它是4/4黑色灵俑。\\n当甲虫神死去，在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它移回其拥有者手上。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～神', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629221&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '44935a50-82d2-4378-9374-b85030af4ff2', 'multiverseId': 629221}, 'multiverseid': 629221}]", '[{\'name\': \'Die Toten erwecken\', \'text\': \'Wirke diesen Zauberspruch nur während des Kampfes im Zug eines Gegners.\\nBringe X Kreaturenkarten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Opfere jene Kreaturen zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623006&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efbc450c-0498-4ae3-b7e3-bd6c60ccfc7d\', \'multiverseId\': 623006}, \'multiverseid\': 623006}, {\'name\': \'Despertar a los muertos\', \'text\': \'Lanza este hechizo solo durante el combate del turno de un oponente.\\nRegresa X cartas de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Sacrifica esas criaturas al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7cea01a-4d9d-4c1c-acb9-43a415e3abdf\', \'multiverseId\': 623207}, \'multiverseid\': 623207}, {\'name\': \'Éveil des morts\', \'text\': "Ne lancez ce sort que pendant le combat pendant le tour d\'un adversaire.\\nRenvoyez sur le champ de bataille X cartes de créature ciblées depuis votre cimetière. Sacrifiez ces créatures au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623408&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e37ff94-dd3b-48e4-80ad-b8b23fd35b2c\', \'multiverseId\': 623408}, \'multiverseid\': 623408}, {\'name\': \'死者起こし\', \'text\': \'この呪文は対戦相手のターンの戦闘中にしか唱えられない。\\nあなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードＸ枚を対象とする。それらを戦場に戻す。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それらのクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3c2a591-12eb-429c-97bb-44c090f9ec8b\', \'multiverseId\': 623810}, \'multiverseid\': 623810}, {\'name\': \'唤醒亡者\', \'text\': \'只能于对手回合的战斗中施放此咒语。\\n将X张目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。在下一个结束步骤开始时牺牲这些生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03a5b605-a410-4245-8c45-60d10e082b5e\', \'multiverseId\': 624212}, \'multiverseid\': 624212}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Toten erwecken\', \'text\': \'Wirke diesen Zauberspruch nur während des Kampfes im Zug eines Gegners.\\nBringe X Kreaturenkarten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Opfere jene Kreaturen zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626551&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'417f6547-0ab0-4254-bda5-688c6dfc1d9d\', \'multiverseId\': 626551}, \'multiverseid\': 626551}, {\'name\': \'Éveil des morts\', \'text\': "Ne lancez ce sort que pendant le combat pendant le tour d\'un adversaire.\\nRenvoyez sur le champ de bataille X cartes de créature ciblées depuis votre cimetière. Sacrifiez ces créatures au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626891&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66c84bf7-003c-4ccd-9f0d-ce33d49e8837\', \'multiverseId\': 626891}, \'multiverseid\': 626891}, {\'name\': \'死者起こし\', \'text\': \'この呪文は対戦相手のターンの戦闘中にしか唱えられない。\\nあなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードＸ枚を対象とする。それらを戦場に戻す。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それらのクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd5bbaf8-d575-4347-b73d-e0a3152de72a\', \'multiverseId\': 627231}, \'multiverseid\': 627231}, {\'name\': \'唤醒亡者\', \'text\': \'只能于对手回合的战斗中施放此咒语。\\n将X张目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。在下一个结束步骤开始时牺牲这些生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c59a4395-acac-40fc-b799-29a0fd756b84\', \'multiverseId\': 627571}, \'multiverseid\': 627571}]', "[{'name': 'Die Wanderin', 'text': 'Verhindere allen Nicht-Kampfschaden, der dir und anderen bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst, zugefügt würde.\\n−2: Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke 4 oder mehr ins Exil.', 'type': 'Legendärer Planeswalker', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625505&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '316e387f-4732-4d2b-be43-098b0b8c7ddf', 'multiverseId': 625505}, 'multiverseid': 625505}, {'name': 'La Vagabonde', 'text': 'Prévenez toutes les blessures non-combat qui devraient être infligées à vous et aux autres permanents que vous contrôlez.\\n-2 : Exilez une créature ciblée de force supérieure ou égale à 4.', 'type': 'Planeswalker légendaire', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625762&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f9cf2613-f511-43b0-ab9a-aec2cfe0b092', 'multiverseId': 625762}, 'multiverseid': 625762}, {'name': '放浪者', 'text': 'あなたやあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないパーマネントが受けて戦闘ダメージでないすべてのダメージを軽減する。\\n-2：パワーが４以上であるクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放する。', 'type': '伝説のプレインズウォーカー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626019&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0627ea92-477b-4168-8567-e6d1aad75555', 'multiverseId': 626019}, 'multiverseid': 626019}]", '[{\'name\': \'Die Wiedergeburt des Ältesten\', \'text\': \'(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI — Jeder Gegner opfert eine Kreatur oder einen Planeswalker.\\nII — Jeder Gegner wirft eine Karte ab.\\nIII — Bringe eine Kreaturen- oder Planeswalkerkarte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Sage\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625529&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c318f65f-56ec-48c5-ad70-c64ef494f4e4\', \'multiverseId\': 625529}, \'multiverseid\': 625529}, {\'name\': "La Renaissance de l\'aîné", \'text\': "(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI — Chaque adversaire sacrifie une créature ou un planeswalker.\\nII — Chaque adversaire se défausse d\'une carte.\\nIII — Mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature ou de planeswalker ciblée depuis un cimetière.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625786&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13da667e-c0c4-4c9c-a852-974e7064ccf2\', \'multiverseId\': 625786}, \'multiverseid\': 625786}, {\'name\': \'最古再誕\', \'text\': \'（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンター１個を加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI ― 各対戦相手はそれぞれ、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１体を生け贄に捧げる。\\nII ― 各対戦相手はそれぞれ、カード１枚を捨てる。\\nIII ― 墓地にありクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーであるカード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — 英雄譚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0ba668b-908f-43ef-ad57-0b7f424f1b31\', \'multiverseId\': 626043}, \'multiverseid\': 626043}]', "[{'name': 'Die Wiederherstellung Dominarias', 'text': '(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI, II, — Du millst zwei Karten, dann kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückbringen.\\nIII — Bringe alle Länderkarten aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück und mische dann deinen Friedhof in deine Bibliothek.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Sage', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625564&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea7c64f1-c168-4e54-aa73-019f21808a31', 'multiverseId': 625564}, 'multiverseid': 625564}, {'name': 'La Restauration de Dominaria', 'text': '(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI, II — Meulez deux cartes, puis vous pouvez renvoyer une carte de créature depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\\nIII — Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille toutes les cartes de terrain depuis votre cimetière, puis mélangez votre cimetière dans votre bibliothèque.', 'type': 'Enchantement : saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625821&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a2057b84-e7d1-45bd-896c-dc7a08c51a0e', 'multiverseId': 625821}, 'multiverseid': 625821}, {'name': 'ドミナリアの大修復', 'text': '（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンター１個を加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI, II ― カード２枚を切削する。その後、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚をあなたの手札に戻してもよい。\\nIII ― あなたの墓地にあるすべての土地・カードを戦場に戻す。その後、あなたの墓地をあなたのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。', 'type': 'エンチャント — 英雄譚', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626078&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4aa8933a-9143-4205-94ae-93b7ad703b1e', 'multiverseId': 626078}, 'multiverseid': 626078}]", '[{\'name\': \'Die Wächter ausschicken\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten sieben Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Bringe davon bis zu zwei Planeswalker-Karten ins Spiel. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Gideon und Liliana mögen nicht einer Meinung gewesen sein, aber das hielt sie nicht davon ab, Seite an Seite zu kämpfen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625481&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'194a3dbe-7414-4812-b557-e1441b25ae23\', \'multiverseId\': 625481}, \'multiverseid\': 625481}, {\'name\': \'Déploiement des Sentinelles\', \'text\': "Regardez les sept cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez sur le champ de bataille jusqu\'à deux cartes de planeswalker parmi elles. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Gideon et Liliana ne partageaient peut-être pas le même point de vue, mais cela ne les empêcha pas de combattre côte à côte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625738&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c3f2459-8d91-43eb-a886-5eed5d3b9664\', \'multiverseId\': 625738}, \'multiverseid\': 625738}, {\'name\': \'ゲートウォッチ配備\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード７枚を見る。その中からプレインズウォーカー・カード最大２枚を戦場に出す。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ギデオンとリリアナが共感したわけではなかったが、そのことは共闘する妨げにはならなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cda4281a-a338-49f8-b9e6-e1b4740ee074\', \'multiverseId\': 625995}, \'multiverseid\': 625995}]', '[{\'name\': \'Diener des Filigranen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDie Stärke des Dieners des Filigranen ist gleich der Anzahl an Artefakten, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Homunkulus\', \'flavor\': \'„Der perfekte Helfer ist ein reaktionsschneller und geschickter Assistent, der in der Lage ist, alle hohen Regale zu erreichen."\\n—Coruk, Esper-Handwerker\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622904&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc4e8395-bdcf-4641-9c2a-a15260b57dc5\', \'multiverseId\': 622904}, \'multiverseid\': 622904}, {\'name\': \'Ayudante de filigrana\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nLa fuerza del Ayudante de filigrana es igual a la cantidad de artefactos que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Homúnculo\', \'flavor\': \'"El ayudante ideal es el que está atento, es hábil y puede llegar a las estanterías altas".\\n—Córuk, artífice de Esper\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c569dbee-b103-458b-a086-37c03948ac1d\', \'multiverseId\': 623105}, \'multiverseid\': 623105}, {\'name\': \'Suivant de filigrane\', \'text\': "Vol\\nLa force du Suivant de filigrane est égale au nombre d\'artefacts que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : homoncule\', \'flavor\': "« Le parfait assistant doit être réactif, adroit et capable d\'atteindre les étagères les plus hautes. »\\n—Coruk, artificier d\'Esper", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623306&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'955cafc3-fe3b-4f4e-8636-208289b28657\', \'multiverseId\': 623306}, \'multiverseid\': 623306}, {\'name\': \'金線の従者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n金線の従者のパワーは、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ホムンクルス\', \'flavor\': \'「完璧な助手の条件は、責任感があり、器用で、高い棚にも手が届くことだ。」\\n――エスパーの工匠、コルーク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1c7bc23-1bbe-499a-aa95-001361f8120a\', \'multiverseId\': 623708}, \'multiverseid\': 623708}, {\'name\': \'丝金随员\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n丝金随员的力量等同于由你操控之神器数量。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～造妖\', \'flavor\': \'「最完美的助理要反应快，手工巧，还能摸到架子最高处。」\\n～艾斯波神器师寇路\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93e38f1b-d95c-4b1e-a5cf-44a68b961074\', \'multiverseId\': 624110}, \'multiverseid\': 624110}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dorn der Schwarzen Rose\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nWenn der Dorn der Schwarzen Rose ins Spiel kommt, wirst du zum Monarchen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Assassine\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn Bestechung und Einschüchterung scheitern, wendet sich Marchesa ihrer bevorzugten Form der Überredung zu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622999&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12f4e33c-86c0-411f-a393-336f80ccc75b\', \'multiverseId\': 622999}, \'multiverseid\': 622999}, {\'name\': \'Espina de la Rosa Negra\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\nCuando la Espina de la Rosa Negra entre al campo de batalla, te conviertes en el monarca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Asesino humano\', \'flavor\': \'Si el soborno y la intimidación no funcionan, Marquesa recurre a su forma de persuasión favorita.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e6ba8c1-d201-4b9a-8188-54992990f0bd\', \'multiverseId\': 623200}, \'multiverseid\': 623200}, {\'name\': \'Épine de la Rose Noire\', \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nQuand l\'Épine de la Rose Noire arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous devenez le monarque.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et assassin\', \'flavor\': "Quand la corruption et l\'intimidation ne marchent pas, Marchesa a recours à sa forme de persuasion préférée.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623401&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'146148fd-def1-4591-9fbf-98f56c355c57\', \'multiverseId\': 623401}, \'multiverseid\': 623401}, {\'name\': \'黒薔薇の棘\', \'text\': \'接死\\n黒薔薇の棘が戦場に出たとき、あなたが統治者になる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・暗殺者\', \'flavor\': \'賄賂や威嚇で効果がなければ、マルチェッサは自分好みのやり方で説得する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fe83c5a-d1b8-4dc3-aa68-bb9560dc4862\', \'multiverseId\': 623803}, \'multiverseid\': 623803}, {\'name\': \'黑蔷薇之棘\', \'text\': \'死触\\n当黑蔷薇之棘进战场时，你成为君主。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／杀手\', \'flavor\': \'如果贿赂和恫吓均告失败，玛切莎便会采用她最喜欢的说服手段。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a0d73c9-2114-4142-8c4d-ea6a559a7cfd\', \'multiverseId\': 624205}, \'multiverseid\': 624205}]', "[{'name': 'Drachenfutter', 'text': 'Erzeuge zwei 1/1 rote Goblin-Kreaturenspielsteine.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Atarka-Goblins geben ihr Leben so bereitwillig hin wie ihre Artgenossen bei den Temur … allerdings unter großen, geflügelten Schatten.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627915&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '257868df-ef7d-4dbb-9410-281d12cdeb26', 'multiverseId': 627915}, 'multiverseid': 627915}, {'name': 'Carnada para dragones', 'text': 'Crea dos fichas de criatura Trasgo rojas 1/1.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'Los trasgos de Atarka caminan hacia su destino con tanto entusiasmo como sus homólogos temur, pero normalmente bajo gigantescas sombras aladas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628149&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d055400-6c68-4a60-8981-59dd26e0ecaf', 'multiverseId': 628149}, 'multiverseid': 628149}, {'name': 'ドラゴンの餌', 'text': '赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'ティムールの同胞たちと同じように、アタルカのゴブリン達も積極的にその最期を迎えている。ただし、通常は大きな翼の影に覆い尽くされてからとなる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628617&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5854fadb-6321-4367-b01e-54dee64d9d12', 'multiverseId': 628617}, 'multiverseid': 628617}, {'name': '巨龙食粮', 'text': '派出两个1/1红色鬼怪衍生生物。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '安塔卡族的鬼怪和他们铁木尔的同胞一样随时准备赴死，但他们通常死在大型的有翼阴影之下。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629085&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '703fcabe-8218-4c92-81f2-90d3d7e9e33e', 'multiverseId': 629085}, 'multiverseid': 629085}]", '[{\'name\': \'Drakuseth, Schlund der Flammen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn Drakuseth, Schlund der Flammen, angreift, fügt er einem Ziel deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte und bis zu zwei anderen Zielen deiner Wahl je 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'„Lauft auseinander, ihr Idioten! Los, verteilt euch!"\\n—Marsden, Truppenführer, letzte Worte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626560&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ede2312a-638f-402d-a876-d4b2567fb331\', \'multiverseId\': 626560}, \'multiverseid\': 626560}, {\'name\': \'Drakuseth, gueule de flammes\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que Drakuseth, gueule de flammes attaque, il inflige 4 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible et 3 blessures à jusqu\'à deux autres cibles chacune.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dragon\', \'flavor\': "« Dispersez-vous, bande d\'idiots ! Dispersez-vous ! »\\n—Marsden, chef de groupe, derniers mots", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626900&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a758f59-9c2b-4833-8553-3ec8a62ebfd8\', \'multiverseId\': 626900}, \'multiverseid\': 626900}, {\'name\': \'炎の大口、ドラクセス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n炎の大口、ドラクセスが攻撃するたび、１つを対象とし、それでない最大２つを対象とする。これはその前者に４点のダメージ、それらの後者にそれぞれ３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'「広がれ、マヌケ、広がるんだ！」\\n――パーティーのリーダーだったマルスデンの最後の言葉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2db897a-a318-43f7-bc85-62c1d284c6ec\', \'multiverseId\': 627240}, \'multiverseid\': 627240}, {\'name\': \'烈焰巨口卓库瑟\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当烈焰巨口卓库瑟攻击时，它对任意一个目标造成4点伤害，且对至多两个其他目标各造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': \'「快散开，你们这帮蠢货！快散开！」\\n～队长马登的遗言\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52e3c94f-f17c-4fea-92a6-c08b523b5a79\', \'multiverseId\': 627580}, \'multiverseid\': 627580}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drakuseth, Schlund der Flammen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn Drakuseth, Schlund der Flammen, angreift, fügt er einem Ziel deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte und bis zu zwei anderen Zielen deiner Wahl je 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'„Lauft auseinander, ihr Idioten! Los, verteilt euch!"\\n—Marsden, Truppenführer, letzte Worte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627916&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee86e1d8-d3ec-425a-8a8e-73a6628543db\', \'multiverseId\': 627916}, \'multiverseid\': 627916}, {\'name\': \'Drakuseth, fauces de fuego\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que Drakuseth, fauces de fuego ataque, hace 4 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo y 3 puntos de daño a cada uno de hasta otros dos objetivos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Dispérsense, idiotas! ¡Dispérsense!".\\n—Marsden, líder de expedición, últimas palabras\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f8bbf88-690a-4f54-8a63-cb69f274f853\', \'multiverseId\': 628150}, \'multiverseid\': 628150}, {\'name\': \'炎の大口、ドラクセス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n炎の大口、ドラクセスが攻撃するたび、１つを対象とし、それでない最大２つを対象とする。これはその前者に４点のダメージ、それらの後者にそれぞれ３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'「広がれ、マヌケ、広がるんだ！」\\n――パーティーのリーダーだったマルスデンの最後の言葉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbd15b40-5ced-451a-86eb-59f3f06fa806\', \'multiverseId\': 628618}, \'multiverseid\': 628618}, {\'name\': \'烈焰巨口卓库瑟\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当烈焰巨口卓库瑟攻击时，它对任意一个目标造成4点伤害，且对至多两个其他目标各造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': \'「快散开，你们这帮蠢货！快散开！」\\n～队长马登的遗言\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90f948be-8baa-47f2-8708-daf144da4ddf\', \'multiverseId\': 629086}, \'multiverseid\': 629086}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drei Besuche\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Wald-Karte, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Diejenigen, die den Wald lieben, wollen nur seine majestätische Schönheit vergrößern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625575&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f19a6ba0-d76d-48a9-9b9c-cb1efa4ec931\', \'multiverseId\': 625575}, \'multiverseid\': 625575}, {\'name\': \'Trois visites\', \'text\': \'Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de forêt, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille, puis mélangez.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Ceux qui aiment la forêt ne souhaitent qu\'étendre sa majesté.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625832&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fa5ca25-ade3-461d-8d43-5f38bb2f5683\', \'multiverseId\': 625832}, \'multiverseid\': 625832}, {\'name\': \'三顧の礼\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから森・カード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'木々を愛する者たちは、単にその威厳を広めたいのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'999367b4-12dc-4ef1-a3ab-53bbae167fa0\', \'multiverseId\': 626089}, \'multiverseid\': 626089}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drohne des Grauens\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Drohne des Grauens ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei 0/1 farblose Eldrazi-Ausgeburt-Kreaturenspielsteine. Sie haben „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erzeuge {C}."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': \'Jeder der uralten Eldrazi gebar Schrecken in unvorstellbaren Gestalten als seine Nachkommen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622961&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a25875c0-3f58-4208-b87b-f103eb4d8503\', \'multiverseId\': 622961}, \'multiverseid\': 622961}, {\'name\': \'Zángano pavoroso\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Zángano pavoroso entre al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de criatura Engendro Eldrazi incoloras 0/1. Tienen "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {C}".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Cada antiguo Eldrazi engendró su propio linaje de horrores con formas incomprensibles.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abeaf74b-0304-4c45-9bce-f63570a0020f\', \'multiverseId\': 623162}, \'multiverseid\': 623162}, {\'name\': "Drone de l\'effroi", \'text\': "Quand le Drone de l\'effroi arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature 0/1 incolore Eldrazi et Engeance. Ils ont « Sacrifiez cette créature : Ajoutez {C}. »", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': "Chaque ancêtre eldrazi donna naissance à une lignée d\'indescriptibles horreurs informes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623363&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91e63380-d08b-4d70-95de-dd900aaf7094\', \'multiverseId\': 623363}, \'multiverseid\': 623363}, {\'name\': \'戦慄の徒食者\', \'text\': \'戦慄の徒食者が戦場に出たとき、無色の０/１のエルドラージ・落とし子・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。それらは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：{C}を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': \'古きエルドラージはそれぞれ、理解できない形の怪物の血族を生み出していった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68392038-0167-4f80-842e-a2727486e5ea\', \'multiverseId\': 623765}, \'multiverseid\': 623765}, {\'name\': \'可怖奴兽\', \'text\': \'当可怖奴兽进战场时，派出两个0/1无色奥札奇／后裔衍生生物。它们具有「牺牲此生物：加{C}。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': \'每个奥札奇先祖所繁衍的惊惧兽，都各有难以想像的外貌。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c0ce20b-3b12-40b7-8fa7-dc88207908de\', \'multiverseId\': 624167}, \'multiverseid\': 624167}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dryade des Ilysischen Hains\', \'text\': \'Du darfst in jedem deiner Züge ein zusätzliches Land spielen.\\nLänder, die du kontrollierst, haben zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen alle Standardlandtypen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Nymphe, Dryade\', \'flavor\': \'„Mit Ranken bekränzt, nährt er das Leben unter den Toten."\\n—Psemilla, meletische Poetin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625553&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d1d5f0d-0a15-4b16-8bad-d0287efd7c68\', \'multiverseId\': 625553}, \'multiverseid\': 625553}, {\'name\': \'Dryade du bosquet ilyséen\', \'text\': \'Vous pouvez jouer un terrain supplémentaire pendant chacun de vos tours.\\nLes terrains que vous contrôlez ont chaque type de terrain de base en plus de leurs autres types.\', \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : nymphe et dryade\', \'flavor\': \'« Couronné de lierre, il cultive la vie chez les morts. »\\n—Psémilla, poétesse mélétisienne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625810&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'469511ff-06ba-4853-9374-a5399160d3fc\', \'multiverseId\': 625810}, \'multiverseid\': 625810}, {\'name\': \'イリーシア木立のドライアド\', \'text\': \'あなたの各ターンに、あなたは追加の土地１つをプレイしてもよい。\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべての土地は、他のタイプに加えてすべての基本土地タイプである。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — ニンフ・ドライアド\', \'flavor\': \'「蔓で飾りし者、彼は死者の中から命を育む。」\\n――メレティスの詩人、プセミラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd4983c0-839b-4367-b53d-14fc93e2f2b9\', \'multiverseId\': 626067}, \'multiverseid\': 626067}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dschungelschrein\', \'text\': \'Der Dschungelschrein kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R}, {G} oder {W}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Auf Naya sind Ehrgeiz und Verrat selten geworden, fast ausgerottet von der Ehrfurcht, die dort den irdischen Göttern entgegengebracht wird.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625668&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74d75a49-6697-4ecf-9de4-bf30e182fa6f\', \'multiverseId\': 625668}, \'multiverseid\': 625668}, {\'name\': \'Reliquaire de la jungle\', \'text\': \'Le Reliquaire de la jungle arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}, {G} ou {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Sur Naya, l\'ambition et la traîtrise sont rares. La dévotion aux divinités terrestres les a presque portées à l\'extinction.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625925&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b20d56a-0e1b-468f-9646-ac9930a54ae1\', \'multiverseId\': 625925}, \'multiverseid\': 625925}, {\'name\': \'ジャングルの祭殿\', \'text\': \'ジャングルの祭殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}か{G}か{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'ナヤでは、地上の神への畏怖から、野心や裏切りは絶滅に近いほど狩りつくされている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce976da2-5d08-4907-86f1-6c554813e551\', \'multiverseId\': 626182}, \'multiverseid\': 626182}]', '[{\'name\': \'Duplikant\', \'text\': \'Einprägen — Wenn der Duplikant ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil schicken.\\nSolange eine Karte, die vom Duplikanten ins Exil geschickt wurde, eine Kreaturenkarte ist, hat der Duplikant Stärke, Widerstandskraft und Kreaturentypen der letzten Kreaturenkarte, die vom Duplikanten ins Exil geschickt wurde. Er ist immer noch ein Gestaltwandler.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625608&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc54b35a-28fa-4408-be7d-943c4ac726cb\', \'multiverseId\': 625608}, \'multiverseid\': 625608}, {\'name\': \'Répliquant\', \'text\': "Empreinte — Quand le Répliquant arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez exiler une créature non-jeton ciblée.\\nTant qu\'une carte exilée par le Répliquant est une carte de créature, le Répliquant a la force, l\'endurance et les types de créature de la dernière carte de créature exilée par le Répliquant. C\'est toujours un changeforme.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : changeforme\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625865&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dc727f7-3b48-4e70-be4b-28e35a2fcbdd\', \'multiverseId\': 625865}, \'multiverseid\': 625865}, {\'name\': \'映し身人形\', \'text\': \'刻印 ― 映し身人形が戦場に出たとき、トークンでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれを追放してもよい。\\nクリーチャー・カードが映し身人形によって追放されているかぎり、映し身人形は、映し身人形によって最後に追放されたクリーチャー・カードのパワーとタフネスとクリーチャー・タイプを持つ。これは多相の戦士でもある。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e38f2a9-e872-46d5-9514-7085812bc4a8\', \'multiverseId\': 626122}, \'multiverseid\': 626122}]', '[{\'name\': \'Durchrammen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst, Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu. Falls die Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, Trampelschaden verursacht, wird überschüssiger Schaden stattdessen dem Beherrscher der Kreatur zugefügt.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich brauche einen Sanitäter! Und ein paar Maurer!"\\n—Wyllon, Drannithischer Händler\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628012&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1744a29b-c968-45e8-927b-c7b7d8d357f2\', \'multiverseId\': 628012}, \'multiverseid\': 628012}, {\'name\': \'Arremeter\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo que controlas hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a la criatura objetivo que no controlas. Si la criatura que controlas tiene la habilidad de arrollar, en vez de eso, el daño sobrante se hace al controlador de esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Necesito un médico! ¡Y algunos albañiles!".\\n—Wyllon, mercader de Drannith\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c80e5653-5cb6-40b7-bc8f-46564f4cf451\', \'multiverseId\': 628246}, \'multiverseid\': 628246}, {\'name\': \'強行突破\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者に、自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。その前者がトランプルを持っているなら、代わりに、余剰のダメージはそのクリーチャーのコントローラーが受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「衛生兵を呼んでくれ！石工もだ！」\\n――ドラニスの商人、ウィロン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c27802b1-f021-4750-98bf-6af22d337305\', \'multiverseId\': 628714}, \'multiverseid\': 628714}, {\'name\': \'轰然撞倒\', \'text\': \'目标由你操控的生物对目标不由你操控的生物造成伤害，其数量等同于前者的力量。如果该由你操控的生物具有践踏异能，则过量伤害改为对后者生物的操控者造成之。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「医生快来！还有石匠！」\\n～卓尼斯商人沃伦\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'558d9aa0-85ac-4194-857d-827158509e69\', \'multiverseId\': 629182}, \'multiverseid\': 629182}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämon des Schicksals\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, verursacht Trampelschaden\\nEinmal während jedes deiner Züge kannst du einen Verzauberungszauber wirken, indem du Lebenspunkte in Höhe seines Manabetrags bezahlst, anstatt seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\n{2}{B}, opfere eine andere Verzauberung: Der Dämon des Schicksals erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+0, wobei X gleich dem Manabetrag der geopferten Verzauberung ist.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624923&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ccd967b-f445-43e2-aece-cfa46d1f84dd\', \'multiverseId\': 624923}, \'multiverseid\': 624923}, {\'name\': "Démon de l\'œuvre du destin", \'text\': "Vol, piétinement\\nUne fois pendant chacun de vos tours, vous pouvez lancer un sort d\'enchantement en payant un nombre de points de vie égal à sa valeur de mana à la place de payer son coût de mana.\\n{2}{B}, sacrifiez un autre enchantement : Le Démon de l\'œuvre du destin gagne +X/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant la valeur de mana de l\'enchantement sacrifié.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624958&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba90e983-dcbe-4b20-b76a-ad561102d78f\', \'multiverseId\': 624958}, \'multiverseid\': 624958}, {\'name\': \'破滅企図の悪魔\', \'text\': \'飛行、トランプル\\nあなたの各ターン中に１回、マナ・コストを支払うのではなくマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを支払ってエンチャント・呪文１つを唱えてもよい。\\n{2}{B}, これでないエンチャント１つを生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、破滅企図の悪魔は＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。Ｘはその生け贄に捧げられたエンチャントのマナ総量に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c6d2dec-12e0-4b68-937c-bb1389edafab\', \'multiverseId\': 624993}, \'multiverseid\': 624993}, {\'name\': \'定命恶魔\', \'text\': \'飞行，践踏\\n仅于你的每个回合中且限一次，你可以藉由「支付等同于其法术力值数量的生命，而不支付其法术力费用」之方式施放结界咒语。\\n{2}{B}，牺牲另一个结界：定命恶魔得+X/+0直到回合结束，X为所牺牲结界的法术力值。\', \'type\': \'结界生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad0c2917-0f59-4a5d-99fd-69e19e8792af\', \'multiverseId\': 625028}, \'multiverseid\': 625028}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämon des Schicksals\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, verursacht Trampelschaden\\nEinmal während jedes deiner Züge kannst du einen Verzauberungszauber wirken, indem du Lebenspunkte in Höhe seines Manabetrags bezahlst, anstatt seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\n{2}{B}, opfere eine andere Verzauberung: Der Dämon des Schicksals erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+0, wobei X gleich dem Manabetrag der geopferten Verzauberung ist.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625128&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ad73fa1-0596-4367-b15e-372370774a60\', \'multiverseId\': 625128}, \'multiverseid\': 625128}, {\'name\': "Démon de l\'œuvre du destin", \'text\': "Vol, piétinement\\nUne fois pendant chacun de vos tours, vous pouvez lancer un sort d\'enchantement en payant un nombre de points de vie égal à sa valeur de mana à la place de payer son coût de mana.\\n{2}{B}, sacrifiez un autre enchantement : Le Démon de l\'œuvre du destin gagne +X/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant la valeur de mana de l\'enchantement sacrifié.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625160&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c43c0016-e01a-436e-9357-f73a72e4c3fb\', \'multiverseId\': 625160}, \'multiverseid\': 625160}, {\'name\': \'破滅企図の悪魔\', \'text\': \'飛行、トランプル\\nあなたの各ターン中に１回、マナ・コストを支払うのではなくマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを支払ってエンチャント・呪文１つを唱えてもよい。\\n{2}{B}, これでないエンチャント１つを生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、破滅企図の悪魔は＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。Ｘはその生け贄に捧げられたエンチャントのマナ総量に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3f6b02d-dc7c-4810-a63f-b66332e030e2\', \'multiverseId\': 625192}, \'multiverseid\': 625192}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämonenfürst Belzenlok\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn Dämonenfürst Belzenlok ins Spiel kommt, schicke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Nichtland-Karte ins Exil schickst, und nimm jene Karte auf deine Hand. Falls ihr Manabetrag 4 oder mehr ist, wiederhole diesen Vorgang. Dämonenfürst Belzenlok fügt dir für jede Karte, die du auf diese Weise auf deine Hand genommen hast, 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Ältester, Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622960&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05a0dfcc-aefd-44d2-867a-98a6da8ebe96\', \'multiverseId\': 622960}, \'multiverseid\': 622960}, {\'name\': \'Belzenlok, señor demonio\', \'text\': \'Vuela, arrolla.\\nCuando Belzenlok, señor demonio entre al campo de batalla, exilia cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra. Luego, pon esa carta en tu mano. Si el valor de maná de la carta es de 4 o más, repite este proceso. Belzenlok, señor demonio te hace 1 punto de daño por cada carta puesta en tu mano de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Demonio anciano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70933923-ec78-45e1-ad32-48b5a4ffa754\', \'multiverseId\': 623161}, \'multiverseid\': 623161}, {\'name\': \'Seigneur démon Belzenlok\', \'text\': "Vol, piétinement\\nQuand le Seigneur démon Belzenlok arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain, puis mettez cette carte dans votre main. Si la valeur de mana de la carte est supérieure ou égale à 4, répétez ce processus. Le Seigneur démon Belzenlok vous inflige 1 blessure pour chaque carte mise dans votre main de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ancêtre et démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623362&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81d925e1-151c-458c-96af-1a805f69777b\', \'multiverseId\': 623362}, \'multiverseid\': 623362}, {\'name\': \'悪魔王ベルゼンロック\', \'text\': \'飛行、トランプル\\n悪魔王ベルゼンロックが戦場に出たとき、土地でないカード１枚が追放されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。その後、そのカードをあなたの手札に加える。そのカードのマナ総量が４以上なら、この手順を繰り返す。悪魔王ベルゼンロックはあなたに、これによりあなたの手札に加えられたカード１枚につき１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルダー・デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48d78d1b-7e57-4c56-af1f-088b01619a50\', \'multiverseId\': 623764}, \'multiverseid\': 623764}, {\'name\': \'恶魔领主贝赞洛\', \'text\': \'飞行，践踏\\n当恶魔领主贝赞洛进战场时，从你的牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张非地牌为止，然后将该牌置于你手上。若该牌的法术力值等于或大于4，则重复此流程。每以此法将一张牌置于你手上，恶魔领主贝赞洛便对你造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～长老／恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf3651e5-c33a-4cd2-b810-bb422a7a005c\', \'multiverseId\': 624166}, \'multiverseid\': 624166}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämonenfürst Belzenlok\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn Dämonenfürst Belzenlok ins Spiel kommt, schicke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Nichtland-Karte ins Exil schickst, und nimm jene Karte auf deine Hand. Falls ihr Manabetrag 4 oder mehr ist, wiederhole diesen Vorgang. Dämonenfürst Belzenlok fügt dir für jede Karte, die du auf diese Weise auf deine Hand genommen hast, 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Ältester, Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626535&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbd35a8d-216a-41ea-8dcf-6fee5a30ee84\', \'multiverseId\': 626535}, \'multiverseid\': 626535}, {\'name\': \'Seigneur démon Belzenlok\', \'text\': "Vol, piétinement\\nQuand le Seigneur démon Belzenlok arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain, puis mettez cette carte dans votre main. Si la valeur de mana de la carte est supérieure ou égale à 4, répétez ce processus. Le Seigneur démon Belzenlok vous inflige 1 blessure pour chaque carte mise dans votre main de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ancêtre et démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626875&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c0c2e6f-42b6-4243-abc2-c050578f0231\', \'multiverseId\': 626875}, \'multiverseid\': 626875}, {\'name\': \'悪魔王ベルゼンロック\', \'text\': \'飛行、トランプル\\n悪魔王ベルゼンロックが戦場に出たとき、土地でないカード１枚が追放されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。その後、そのカードをあなたの手札に加える。そのカードのマナ総量が４以上なら、この手順を繰り返す。悪魔王ベルゼンロックはあなたに、これによりあなたの手札に加えられたカード１枚につき１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルダー・デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21419ce4-07b7-4c4b-aea4-25ab5612a02c\', \'multiverseId\': 627215}, \'multiverseid\': 627215}, {\'name\': \'恶魔领主贝赞洛\', \'text\': \'飞行，践踏\\n当恶魔领主贝赞洛进战场时，从你的牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张非地牌为止，然后将该牌置于你手上。若该牌的法术力值等于或大于4，则重复此流程。每以此法将一张牌置于你手上，恶魔领主贝赞洛便对你造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～长老／恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9f672d2-0f1c-407b-a031-aea618493806\', \'multiverseId\': 627555}, \'multiverseid\': 627555}]', "[{'name': 'Dämonischer Lehrmeister', 'text': 'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Karte, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Hüte dich vor der Großzügigkeit der Dämonen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622959&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0aeb2100-2c5e-4ead-a550-2019078cb788', 'multiverseId': 622959}, 'multiverseid': 622959}, {'name': 'Tutor demoníaco', 'text': 'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta, pon esa carta en tu mano y luego baraja.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'Cuidado con la generosidad de los demonios.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623160&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '022d0755-c82d-48d3-a2bb-bc5d2c168adb', 'multiverseId': 623160}, 'multiverseid': 623160}, {'name': 'Précepteur diabolique', 'text': 'Cherchez une carte dans votre bibliothèque, mettez cette carte dans votre main, puis mélangez.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Méfiez-vous de la générosité des démons.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623361&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a9d2fb69-ed9b-4d72-9803-c7037b3a5a91', 'multiverseId': 623361}, 'multiverseid': 623361}, {'name': '悪魔の教示者', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーからカード１枚を探し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '悪魔の気前の良さには裏がある。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623763&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '17a6b77a-878d-4679-b503-f0adb6b018af', 'multiverseId': 623763}, 'multiverseid': 623763}, {'name': '邪魔导师', 'text': '从你牌库中搜寻一张牌，将该牌置于你手上，然后洗牌。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '当恶魔慷慨时，你可要当心。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624165&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '66437db8-5d58-45b1-8683-9a71abc2c53c', 'multiverseId': 624165}, 'multiverseid': 624165}]", "[{'name': 'Dämonischer Lehrmeister', 'text': 'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Karte, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Hüte dich vor der Großzügigkeit der Dämonen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626534&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f8b998f0-569f-475b-a99a-a7fa9c902386', 'multiverseId': 626534}, 'multiverseid': 626534}, {'name': 'Précepteur diabolique', 'text': 'Cherchez une carte dans votre bibliothèque, mettez cette carte dans votre main, puis mélangez.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Méfiez-vous de la générosité des démons.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626874&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8a646934-9d72-4899-a13c-ef10ce02a9fa', 'multiverseId': 626874}, 'multiverseid': 626874}, {'name': '悪魔の教示者', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーからカード１枚を探し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '悪魔の気前の良さには裏がある。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627214&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6884fbbc-d808-4cb9-b9b0-07fdf4d76f8a', 'multiverseId': 627214}, 'multiverseid': 627214}, {'name': '邪魔导师', 'text': '从你牌库中搜寻一张牌，将该牌置于你手上，然后洗牌。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '当恶魔慷慨时，你可要当心。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627554&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eae804e0-e68a-4779-a1b1-8d903abd2858', 'multiverseId': 627554}, 'multiverseid': 627554}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dämonischer Lehrmeister\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Karte, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ist das Wissen wirklich verboten, weil es für dich gefährlich ist? Oder vielleicht, weil es für diejenigen gefährlich ist, die versuchen, dich zu kontrollieren?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624790&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c8e6505-1824-4ebe-bf8b-3dcbe5c9b87f\', \'multiverseId\': 624790}, \'multiverseid\': 624790}, {\'name\': \'Tutor demoníaco\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta, pon esa carta en tu mano y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Está prohibido el conocimiento realmente porque es peligroso para ti? ¿O acaso se debe a que es peligroso para aquellos que intentan controlarte?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b360e4ae-e0a5-41e4-a4c4-9880d93f3c1b\', \'multiverseId\': 624802}, \'multiverseid\': 624802}, {\'name\': \'Précepteur diabolique\', \'text\': \'Cherchez une carte dans votre bibliothèque, mettez cette carte dans votre main, puis mélangez.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Ce savoir t\'est-il interdit parce qu\'il est dangereux pour toi ? Ou parce qu\'il est dangereux pour ceux qui veulent te contrôler ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624814&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c6f5acc-a809-46ca-b802-63127fd25ebc\', \'multiverseId\': 624814}, \'multiverseid\': 624814}, {\'name\': \'悪魔の教示者\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーからカード１枚を探し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「その叡智が禁忌とされるのは、自分にとって危険だから？それとも、自分を支配する者にとって危険だから？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d7ad94e-1993-45fc-96d4-4506a61144a0\', \'multiverseId\': 624838}, \'multiverseid\': 624838}, {\'name\': \'邪魔导师\', \'text\': \'从你牌库中搜寻一张牌，将该牌置于你手上，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「所谓的禁忌知识，到底是因为它会危害到你而被禁，还是因为它会危害到想要掌控你的人而如此？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c074e173-2df8-433a-89c0-31e3491cf1e4\', \'multiverseId\': 624862}, \'multiverseid\': 624862}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624355&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '22031bfd-6a1d-410e-8fa3-e01a3de72626', 'multiverseId': 624355}, 'multiverseid': 624355}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624372&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '686989db-ca53-4ff7-92f2-afec42207010', 'multiverseId': 624372}, 'multiverseid': 624372}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624389&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6cc7f066-0cb1-41f4-bd46-32efd1b8fd61', 'multiverseId': 624389}, 'multiverseid': 624389}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624356&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7450105f-02e5-469e-acec-94d48aadba44', 'multiverseId': 624356}, 'multiverseid': 624356}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624373&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f8693fe8-524f-40cd-9563-7d6951344c9b', 'multiverseId': 624373}, 'multiverseid': 624373}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624390&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b2938a84-bb4a-44a1-b9df-38ce217ea52a', 'multiverseId': 624390}, 'multiverseid': 624390}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624357&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '70a3ba57-dfe8-4347-abde-17db5269f77a', 'multiverseId': 624357}, 'multiverseid': 624357}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624374&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b3dd1ca6-7bbe-4e74-95bd-dace7926a744', 'multiverseId': 624374}, 'multiverseid': 624374}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624391&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4009033e-d4b6-490d-be44-dddd10c2f09d', 'multiverseId': 624391}, 'multiverseid': 624391}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624358&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9663bfe9-194e-4111-a296-e3a15d616ce6', 'multiverseId': 624358}, 'multiverseid': 624358}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624375&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '426ae0da-bb9e-45ea-a3b7-51700df1e176', 'multiverseId': 624375}, 'multiverseid': 624375}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624392&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '798da19a-b286-45e0-bfee-643ba4b42648', 'multiverseId': 624392}, 'multiverseid': 624392}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624359&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '639ffce3-589a-4934-99c9-89e1a260f8d1', 'multiverseId': 624359}, 'multiverseid': 624359}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624376&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6623d33a-f672-4a7b-b568-93d7b8e35754', 'multiverseId': 624376}, 'multiverseid': 624376}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624393&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8defe529-3491-440a-b741-aac01d098305', 'multiverseId': 624393}, 'multiverseid': 624393}]", '[{\'name\': \'Effiziente Konstruktion\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Artefaktzauber wirkst, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Für einige von Ghirapurs Luftschiffkonstrukteuren gehört das Herstellen von Thoptern bei größeren Bauvorhaben einfach dazu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622897&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95ad1270-4409-4b12-a96d-d8dc75a3fec1\', \'multiverseId\': 622897}, \'multiverseid\': 622897}, {\'name\': \'Construcción eficiente\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de artefacto, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Tóptero incolora 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Para algunos aerocreadores de Ghirapur, la construcción de tópteros es un subproducto de proyectos más grandes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60bf2a63-ae43-40a8-aff1-fa5c3ee419c5\', \'multiverseId\': 623098}, \'multiverseid\': 623098}, {\'name\': \'Construction efficace\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'artefact, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Pour certains aéro-artisans de Ghirapur, la fabrication de mécanoptères est inévitable à la réalisation de plus grandes constructions.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623299&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e709479f-9026-44ea-91e5-3870a9874b8b\', \'multiverseId\': 623299}, \'multiverseid\': 623299}, {\'name\': \'効率的構築\', \'text\': \'あなたがアーティファクト・呪文１つを唱えるたび、飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'ギラプールの一部の空大工にとって、飛行機械は大規模構築作業の副産物にすぎない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ac644a2-8976-4144-8576-01685927a347\', \'multiverseId\': 623701}, \'multiverseid\': 623701}, {\'name\': \'高效建造\', \'text\': \'每当你施放神器咒语时，派出一个1/1无色，具飞行异能的振翼机衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'对吉拉波部分煅空匠而言，振翼机不过是建设大型工程时顺手造出来的东西而已。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da94616d-37e5-4335-aa0b-807c5d1c215f\', \'multiverseId\': 624103}, \'multiverseid\': 624103}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ehrenbeladenes Shaku\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\nTappe eine ungetappte legendäre bleibende Karte, die du kontrollierst: Enttappe das Ehrenbeladene Shaku.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Bevor es dem Fürsten überreicht wird, wird jedes Shaku von jedem Helden jeder Region im Gebiet dieses Fürsten gesegnet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625616&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'592edb18-4f4c-4b51-aab9-a9900bc300d2\', \'multiverseId\': 625616}, \'multiverseid\': 625616}, {\'name\': "Shaku usé par l\'honneur", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\nEngagez un permanent légendaire dégagé que vous contrôlez : Dégagez le Shaku usé par l\'honneur.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Avant d\'être présenté à son seigneur, chaque shaku est béni par tous les héros de chaque région appartenant au daimyo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625873&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e629705a-d381-4755-b22a-b79f1c8cf5d8\', \'multiverseId\': 625873}, \'multiverseid\': 625873}, {\'name\': \'名誉に磨り減った笏\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態である伝説のパーマネント１つをタップする：名誉に磨り減った笏をアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'笏はすべて、その君主の領地内のすべての英雄により祝福されてから君主に捧げられる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c108d81-b322-4f26-aad6-cd32e7f87532\', \'multiverseId\': 626130}, \'multiverseid\': 626130}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eidolon der Blüten\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn das Eidolon der Blüten oder eine andere Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'Verlorene Seelen werden vom emotionalen Widerhall der Dryaden-Versammlungen magisch angezogen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625554&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a78e9358-f40d-468b-ab27-a53ba58d12df\', \'multiverseId\': 625554}, \'multiverseid\': 625554}, {\'name\': \'Eidôlon des fleurs\', \'text\': "Constellation — À chaque fois que l\'Eidôlon des fleurs ou un autre enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : esprit\', \'flavor\': "L\'écho émotionnel des rassemblements de dryades attire les âmes perdues.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625811&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87c3e29c-659a-4786-a8aa-f400945c9f92\', \'multiverseId\': 625811}, \'multiverseid\': 625811}, {\'name\': \'開花の幻霊\', \'text\': \'星座 ― 開花の幻霊やこれでないエンチャント１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'ドライアドの集会から発せられる叙情的な残響が、迷いし魂たちを引き寄せる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75978d2b-802b-4b97-bb5c-26e4e8910652\', \'multiverseId\': 626068}, \'multiverseid\': 626068}]', '[{\'name\': \'Einblicke des Jägers\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. Immer wenn die Kreatur in diesem Zug einem Spieler oder Planeswalker Kampfschaden zufügt, ziehe entsprechend viele Karten.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Raubtier weiß, wie die Welt funktioniert. Leben bedeutet Konflikt. Nur die Starken überleben."\\n—Garruk Wildsprecher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627994&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dae8de5a-bd3d-48ad-bde7-40574ffeb888\', \'multiverseId\': 627994}, \'multiverseid\': 627994}, {\'name\': \'Perspicacia del cazador\', \'text\': \'Elige la criatura objetivo que controlas. Siempre que esa criatura haga daño de combate a un jugador o planeswalker este turno, roba esa misma cantidad de cartas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"El depredador conoce el verdadero rostro del mundo. La vida es un conflicto. Solo los fuertes sobreviven".\\n—Garruk Portavoz Salvaje\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f12250d2-3726-48ed-a34f-b97fd37b9a4c\', \'multiverseId\': 628228}, \'multiverseid\': 628228}, {\'name\': \'狩人の眼識\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、そのクリーチャーがプレイヤーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１つに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはその点数に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「捕食者は世界の真のあり方を知っている。生命とは戦いだ。強いものだけが生き残る。」\\n――野生語りのガラク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cecd4f9-e8f6-407b-bdf5-6b3bf64e8832\', \'multiverseId\': 628696}, \'multiverseid\': 628696}, {\'name\': \'猎人眼光\', \'text\': \'选择目标由你操控的生物。本回合中，每当该生物对任一牌手或鹏洛客造成战斗伤害时，抓等量的牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「掠食者了解这世界的真正道理。生命就是争斗，强者才能生存。」\\n～召兽使贾路\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11f92e3b-dc90-4159-829f-99187ffe9d62\', \'multiverseId\': 629164}, \'multiverseid\': 629164}]', '[{\'name\': \'Einziehen\', \'text\': \'Du kannst zwei blaue Karten aus deiner Hand ins Exil schicken, anstatt die Manakosten dieses Zauberspruchs zu bezahlen.\\nÜbernimm die Kontrolle über einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch deiner Wahl. Du kannst neue Ziele für ihn bestimmen. (Falls jener Zauberspruch ein Artefakt, eine Verzauberung oder ein Planeswalker ist, kommt die bleibende Karte unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622889&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c845242e-2cd1-404f-be5c-36fa8f1daa61\', \'multiverseId\': 622889}, \'multiverseid\': 622889}, {\'name\': \'Requisar\', \'text\': \'Puedes exiliar dos cartas azules de tu mano en vez de pagar el coste de maná de este hechizo.\\nGana el control del hechizo objetivo que no sea de criatura. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para él. (Si ese hechizo es un artefacto, encantamiento o planeswalker, el permanente entra al campo de batalla bajo tu control.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a902472-213d-4486-9489-61f548ab5364\', \'multiverseId\': 623090}, \'multiverseid\': 623090}, {\'name\': \'Réquisition\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez exiler deux cartes bleues de votre main à la place de payer le coût de mana de ce sort.\\nAcquérez le contrôle d\'un sort non-créature ciblé. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour celui-ci. (Si ce sort est un artefact, un enchantement ou un planeswalker, le permanent arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623291&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b027b923-0917-4058-8119-920af3acc594\', \'multiverseId\': 623291}, \'multiverseid\': 623291}, {\'name\': \'徴用\', \'text\': \'あなたはこの呪文のマナ・コストを支払うのではなく、あなたの手札にある青のカード２枚を追放してもよい。\\nクリーチャーでない呪文１つを対象とする。それのコントロールを得る。それの新たな対象を選んでもよい。（その呪文がアーティファクトやエンチャントやプレインズウォーカーなら、そのパーマネントはあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出る。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd5e9e76-a27c-4ee5-a7b9-0cb05b6c4590\', \'multiverseId\': 623693}, \'multiverseid\': 623693}, {\'name\': \'霸占\', \'text\': \'你可以从你手上放逐两张蓝色牌，而不支付此咒语的法术力费用。\\n获得目标非生物咒语的操控权。你可以为它选择新的目标。（如果该咒语是神器，结界或鹏洛客，则所成之永久物是在你的操控下进战场。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a16c0952-528c-4dc8-b1e8-335690022353\', \'multiverseId\': 624095}, \'multiverseid\': 624095}]', '[{\'name\': \'Einziehen\', \'text\': \'Du kannst zwei blaue Karten aus deiner Hand ins Exil schicken, anstatt die Manakosten dieses Zauberspruchs zu bezahlen.\\nÜbernimm die Kontrolle über einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch deiner Wahl. Du kannst neue Ziele für ihn bestimmen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626509&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47ee9e1c-2662-44c8-85cd-3700258f1ec2\', \'multiverseId\': 626509}, \'multiverseid\': 626509}, {\'name\': \'Réquisition\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez exiler deux cartes bleues de votre main à la place de payer le coût de mana de ce sort.\\nAcquérez le contrôle d\'un sort non-créature ciblé. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour celui-ci.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626849&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c932f60a-77f4-450d-bd9d-5ee77693b189\', \'multiverseId\': 626849}, \'multiverseid\': 626849}, {\'name\': \'徴用\', \'text\': \'あなたはこの呪文のマナ・コストを支払うのではなく、あなたの手札にある青のカード２枚を追放してもよい。\\nクリーチャーでない呪文１つを対象とする。それのコントロールを得る。あなたはそれの新たな対象を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'312d665f-074b-4e62-ab68-c2f56aa70361\', \'multiverseId\': 627189}, \'multiverseid\': 627189}, {\'name\': \'霸占\', \'text\': \'你可以从你手上放逐两张蓝色牌，而不支付此咒语的法术力费用。\\n获得目标非生物咒语的操控权。你可以为它选择新的目标。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dedd279-4940-4e6b-8cc6-392074243fa3\', \'multiverseId\': 627529}, \'multiverseid\': 627529}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eldrazi-Tempel\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}. Gib dieses Mana nur aus, um farblose Eldrazi-Zaubersprüche zu wirken oder Fähigkeiten von farblosen Eldrazi zu aktivieren.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Jeder Tempel ist ein Durchgang in eine schreckliche Zukunft.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625654&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9593a825-1220-4d2f-a26a-55fffc604bbf\', \'multiverseId\': 625654}, \'multiverseid\': 625654}, {\'name\': \'Temple eldrazi\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer des sorts d\'eldrazi incolores ou activer des capacités d\'eldrazi incolores.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Chaque temple est une porte s\'ouvrant sur un avenir horrible.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625911&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bce66e58-5c71-4a4a-8f85-e983ceb2bea6\', \'multiverseId\': 625911}, \'multiverseid\': 625911}, {\'name\': \'エルドラージの寺院\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{C}{C}を加える。このマナは、無色のエルドラージ・呪文を唱えるためか、無色のエルドラージの能力を起動するためにしか支払えない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'寺院はどれも恐怖の未来への扉だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4d20a93-59a0-40ea-941d-9cb67919b5c3\', \'multiverseId\': 626168}, \'multiverseid\': 626168}]', "[{'name': 'Elesh Norns Annex', 'text': '({W/P} kann entweder mit {W} oder 2 Lebenspunkten bezahlt werden.)\\nKreaturen können weder dich noch Planeswalker, die du kontrollierst, angreifen, es sei denn, ihr Beherrscher bezahlt {W/P} für jede der Kreaturen.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625491&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'be3a2fa1-1eae-4847-920f-f8892d5661d2', 'multiverseId': 625491}, 'multiverseid': 625491}, {'name': 'Annexe de Norn', 'text': '({W/P} peut être payé au choix avec {W} ou 2 points de vie.)\\nLes créatures ne peuvent pas vous attaquer ou attaquer des planeswalkers que vous contrôlez à moins que leur contrôleur ne paie {W/P} pour chacune de ces créatures.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625748&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd2f9821a-78f7-494a-9df5-e34a17112263', 'multiverseId': 625748}, 'multiverseid': 625748}, {'name': 'ノーンの別館', 'text': '（{W/P}は{W}でも２点のライフでも支払うことができる。）\\nプレイヤーは、自分がコントロールしていて、あなたやあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃するクリーチャー１体につき{W/P}を支払わないかぎり、攻撃できない。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626005&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c0ac05da-c1d3-4ef1-b87b-070455244970', 'multiverseId': 626005}, 'multiverseid': 626005}]", '[{\'name\': \'Elfen-Mystiker\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {G}.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Leben wächst überall. Mein Volk findet nur die Stellen, an denen es am stärksten wächst."\\n—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627982&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2407dfd8-70ad-4372-8532-df06878301e4\', \'multiverseId\': 627982}, \'multiverseid\': 627982}, {\'name\': \'Místico élfico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {G}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"La vida crece en todas partes. Mi gente solamente encuentra aquellos lugares en los que crece con más fuerza".\\n—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8345cbc-094d-417e-806a-509d646232ab\', \'multiverseId\': 628216}, \'multiverseid\': 628216}, {\'name\': \'エルフの神秘家\', \'text\': \'{T}：{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「生命はどこにでも栄える。私の一族はただそれが最も力強く育つ場所を見つけるだけよ。」\\n――ニッサ・レヴェイン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91ddebda-a4e5-4d5b-9bba-5d13fc9379a9\', \'multiverseId\': 628684}, \'multiverseid\': 628684}, {\'name\': \'妖精秘教徒\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{G}。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「生命在各处成长。我的族人只是在寻找成长最旺的地方。」\\n～妮莎瑞文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7683e112-d010-428b-b9f6-165efcac1445\', \'multiverseId\': 629152}, \'multiverseid\': 629152}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elfen-Mystiker\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {G}.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Wie Schösslinge sich aus dem Schlummer des Winters erheben, so wird auch mein Volk wieder zu neuer Größe aufsteigen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624478&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b065efdc-27d2-42b9-9264-a1c405c571a7\', \'multiverseId\': 624478}, \'multiverseid\': 624478}, {\'name\': \'Místico élfico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {G}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Del mismo modo que nacen nuevos brotes tras el invierno, mi pueblo se alzará para alcanzar la gloria de nuevo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfdb40c9-3b64-40a8-b972-c0e238cc1cc4\', \'multiverseId\': 624524}, \'multiverseid\': 624524}, {\'name\': \'Mystique elfe\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {G}.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': \'« Comme de nouvelles pousses qui sortent de leur sommeil hivernal, mon peuple retrouvera sa gloire. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624570&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91faffa9-ea7f-456a-980f-3c0a0472599d\', \'multiverseId\': 624570}, \'multiverseid\': 624570}, {\'name\': \'エルフの神秘家\', \'text\': \'{T}：{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「新しい芽が冬の眠りから起き上がるように、我が民も再び立ち上がり偉大になるだろう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'111ef0cd-7268-49c3-b452-d4ce857beea8\', \'multiverseId\': 624662}, \'multiverseid\': 624662}, {\'name\': \'妖精秘教徒\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{G}。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「正如寒冬过后新芽萌生，我的人民也定会再度壮大。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df21c362-dee4-4bc6-b15f-d9310179d186\', \'multiverseId\': 624754}, \'multiverseid\': 624754}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elspeth, Auserwählte der Sonne\', \'text\': \'+1: Erzeuge drei 1/1 weiße Soldat-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\n−3: Zerstöre alle Kreaturen mit Stärke 4 oder mehr.\\n−7: Du erhältst ein Emblem mit „Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+2 und haben Flugfähigkeit."\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Elspeth\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625482&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f3d6fc5-7d15-44e6-aff4-17876c082949\', \'multiverseId\': 625482}, \'multiverseid\': 625482}, {\'name\': \'Elspeth, championne du Soleil\', \'text\': \'+1: Créez trois jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat.\\n-3: Détruisez toutes les créatures de force supérieure ou égale à 4.\\n-7: Vous gagnez un emblème avec « Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+2 et ont le vol. »\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Elspeth\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625739&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'324dcd1a-8952-4a4d-a951-a7055a8b96ae\', \'multiverseId\': 625739}, \'multiverseid\': 625739}, {\'name\': \'太陽の勇者、エルズペス\', \'text\': \'+1：白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークン３体を生成する。\\n-3：パワーが４以上であるすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。\\n-7：あなたは「あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け飛行を持つ。」を持つ紋章を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — エルズペス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d841dc52-f0c6-4118-ab0c-e3502d20e260\', \'multiverseId\': 625996}, \'multiverseid\': 625996}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ende des Semesters\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen und/oder Planeswalkern deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil. Bringe sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück. Jede Kreatur davon kommt mit einer zusätzlichen +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel. Jeder Planeswalker davon kommt mit einer zusätzlichen Loyalitätsmarke ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625496&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94b64e62-7d21-4d4f-8206-7140092904f1\', \'multiverseId\': 625496}, \'multiverseid\': 625496}, {\'name\': \'Fin de semestre\', \'text\': "Exilez n\'importe quel nombre de cibles, créatures et/ou planeswalkers, que vous contrôlez. Au début de la prochaine étape de fin, renvoyez chacune d\'elles sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire. Chacune d\'elles arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 supplémentaire sur elle si c\'est une créature et un marqueur « loyauté » sur lui si c\'est un planeswalker.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625753&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65125969-2cab-46c7-ab3b-31c372ac062b\', \'multiverseId\': 625753}, \'multiverseid\': 625753}, {\'name\': \'学期の終わり\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうちあなたがコントロールしている望む数を対象とする。それらを追放する。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それらをそれぞれオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。それらはそれぞれ、それがクリーチャーなら追加で＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態で、それがプレインズウォーカーなら追加で忠誠カウンター１個が置かれた状態で、戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'567760e7-d918-4bdb-b968-9cd39c6eac6e\', \'multiverseId\': 626010}, \'multiverseid\': 626010}]', '[{\'name\': \'Endloser Atlas\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Ziehe eine Karte. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du drei oder mehr Länder mit demselben Namen kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Behütet von Kartografen, verachtet von Kriegsfürsten, begehrt von Abenteurern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625609&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81576f4f-b0cf-4263-95dd-f9e135fdcff4\', \'multiverseId\': 625609}, \'multiverseid\': 625609}, {\'name\': \'Atlas infini\', \'text\': "{2}, {T} : Piochez une carte. N\'activez que si vous contrôlez au moins trois terrains du même nom.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Jalousement gardé par les cartographes, dédaigné par les seigneurs de guerre, convoité par les aventuriers.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625866&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77237dc5-5500-465d-8be6-d686b3d4fc68\', \'multiverseId\': 625866}, \'multiverseid\': 625866}, {\'name\': \'終わりなき地図帳\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}：カード１枚を引く。あなたが同じ名前の３つ以上の土地をコントロールしていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'地図作りは護持し、大将軍は軽蔑し、冒険者は切望する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'388ae186-ed34-4ef9-83f3-ed21531c1215\', \'multiverseId\': 626123}, \'multiverseid\': 626123}]', "[{'name': 'Endrek Sahr, Meisterzüchter', 'text': 'Immer wenn du einen Kreaturenzauber wirkst, erzeuge X 1/1 schwarze Thrull-Kreaturenspielsteine, wobei X gleich dem Manabetrag jenes Zauberspruchs ist.\\nWenn du sieben oder mehr Thrulls kontrollierst, opfere Endrek Sahr, Meisterzüchter.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer', 'flavor': 'Schöpfer des Lebens, Bringer des Todes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622964&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '36ffd050-4b1a-4b1e-9f36-2a8710b50129', 'multiverseId': 622964}, 'multiverseid': 622964}, {'name': 'Éndrek Sahr, criador experto', 'text': 'Siempre que lances un hechizo de criatura, crea X fichas de criatura Thrull negras 1/1, donde X es el valor de maná de ese hechizo.\\nCuando controles siete o más Thrulls, sacrifica a Éndrek Sahr, criador experto.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano', 'flavor': 'Crea vida y trae muerte.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623165&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02da1b84-b5c3-4e6e-83df-cc79429100d6', 'multiverseId': 623165}, 'multiverseid': 623165}, {'name': 'Endrek Sahr, maître reproducteur', 'text': 'À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de créature, créez X jetons de créature 1/1 noire Srâne, X étant la valeur de mana de ce sort.\\nQuand vous contrôlez au moins sept srânes, sacrifiez Endrek Sahr, maître reproducteur.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier', 'flavor': 'Créateur de vie, porteur de mort.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623366&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '74d47a5b-2999-4192-bbf2-70f95eb06a4e', 'multiverseId': 623366}, 'multiverseid': 623366}, {'name': '練達の育種師、エンドレク・サール', 'text': 'あなたがクリーチャー・呪文１つを唱えるたび、黒の１/１のスラル・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。Ｘはその呪文のマナ総量に等しい。\\nあなたが７体以上のスラルをコントロールしているとき、練達の育種師、エンドレク・サールを生け贄に捧げる。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': '命を作りし者にして、死をもたらす者でもある。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623768&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd18de0c1-74b7-4687-a0c9-70e2ff2eb57c', 'multiverseId': 623768}, 'multiverseid': 623768}, {'name': '培育师恩德瑞克萨尔', 'text': '每当你施放生物咒语时，派出X个1/1黑色索尔兽衍生生物，X为该咒语的法术力值。\\n当你操控七个或更多索尔兽时，牺牲培育师恩德瑞克萨尔。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～人类／法术师', 'flavor': '创造新生，引致死亡。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624170&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '09662302-85e1-4a49-ab1d-d6491a9fdf40', 'multiverseId': 624170}, 'multiverseid': 624170}]", "[{'name': 'Endrek Sahr, Meisterzüchter', 'text': 'Immer wenn du einen Kreaturenzauber wirkst, erzeuge X 1/1 schwarze Thrull-Kreaturenspielsteine, wobei X gleich dem Manabetrag jenes Zauberspruchs ist.\\nWenn du sieben oder mehr Thrulls kontrollierst, opfere Endrek Sahr, Meisterzüchter.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer', 'flavor': 'Schöpfer des Lebens, Bringer des Todes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626536&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1b69020-1877-4809-a85c-747a32a8e178', 'multiverseId': 626536}, 'multiverseid': 626536}, {'name': 'Endrek Sahr, maître reproducteur', 'text': 'À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de créature, créez X jetons de créature 1/1 noire Srâne, X étant la valeur de mana de ce sort.\\nQuand vous contrôlez au moins sept srânes, sacrifiez Endrek Sahr, maître reproducteur.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier', 'flavor': 'Créateur de vie, porteur de mort.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626876&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '157fab20-4177-4976-b873-02c7afe3d2de', 'multiverseId': 626876}, 'multiverseid': 626876}, {'name': '練達の育種師、エンドレク・サール', 'text': 'あなたがクリーチャー・呪文１つを唱えるたび、黒の１/１のスラル・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。Ｘはその呪文のマナ総量に等しい。\\nあなたが７体以上のスラルをコントロールしているとき、練達の育種師、エンドレク・サールを生け贄に捧げる。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': '命を作りし者にして、死をもたらす者でもある。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627216&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb264733-4fd4-49f3-86a3-2179990d1c1e', 'multiverseId': 627216}, 'multiverseid': 627216}, {'name': '培育师恩德瑞克萨尔', 'text': '每当你施放生物咒语时，派出X个1/1黑色索尔兽衍生生物，X为该咒语的法术力值。\\n当你操控七个或更多索尔兽时，牺牲培育师恩德瑞克萨尔。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～人类／法术师', 'flavor': '创造新生，引致死亡。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627556&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ecf9963d-3c2c-488c-8cb2-565e199ece18', 'multiverseId': 627556}, 'multiverseid': 627556}]", '[{\'name\': \'Enklave der Bynder\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{3}, {T}: Ziehe eine Karte. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du eine Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Es gibt einen Zufluchtsort, der sich nur denjenigen offenbart, die von *Eludha* gesegnet wurden — der mystischen Verbindung zwischen Bynder und Monster.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625650&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af506ff2-6bd9-432e-91cc-c602293db293\', \'multiverseId\': 625650}, \'multiverseid\': 625650}, {\'name\': \'Enclave des brideurs\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{3}, {T} : Piochez une carte. N\'activez que si vous contrôlez une créature de force supérieure ou égale à 4.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Il existe un sanctuaire qui ne se dévoile qu\'à ceux touchés par la grâce de l\'*éludha* : la connexion mystique entre un brideur et un monstre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625907&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4ac328e-4e63-4c59-9923-f1a0d7588348\', \'multiverseId\': 625907}, \'multiverseid\': 625907}, {\'name\': \'眷者の居留地\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{3}, {T}：カード１枚を引く。あなたがパワーが４以上のクリーチャーをコントロールしていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'*エルーダ*に恵まれた者の前にのみ現れる聖域がある。怪物と不思議な絆を結んだ者たちの聖域だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c58cd9ef-3cb0-408a-a3d0-4cbf55f5655c\', \'multiverseId\': 626164}, \'multiverseid\': 626164}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entfesselter Missklang\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Entfesselte Missklang ins Spiel kommt und falls du ihn gewirkt hast, zerstöre alle Kreaturen, die keine Verzauberungen sind.\\nImmer wenn der Entfesselte Missklang oder eine andere Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, wird der Entfesselte Missklang bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer legendären 6/6 Nachtmahr-Gott-Kreatur mit Bedrohlichkeit und Todesberührung. Er ist immer noch eine Verzauberung.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624922&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db7c1e3a-0525-494a-b5d6-f02c4d9f3243\', \'multiverseId\': 624922}, \'multiverseid\': 624922}, {\'name\': \'Cacophonie déchaînée\', \'text\': "Quand la Cacophonie déchaînée arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous l\'avez lancée, détruisez toutes les créatures non-enchantement.\\nÀ chaque fois que la Cacophonie déchaînée ou un autre enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, jusqu\'à la fin du tour, la Cacophonie déchaînée devient une créature légendaire 6/6 Cauchemar et Dieu avec la menace et le contact mortel. C\'est toujours un enchantement.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624957&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4293018-d342-411c-95fb-7e04310875dd\', \'multiverseId\': 624957}, \'multiverseid\': 624957}, {\'name\': \'解放された騒音\', \'text\': \'解放された騒音が戦場に出たとき、あなたがこれを唱えていた場合、エンチャントでないすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。\\n解放された騒音やこれでないエンチャント１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、解放された騒音は威迫と接死を持つ６/６の伝説のナイトメア・神・クリーチャーになる。これはエンチャントでもある。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec6bd476-2f5d-466e-bca2-f0cdbd6fda70\', \'multiverseId\': 624992}, \'multiverseid\': 624992}, {\'name\': \'邪调现世\', \'text\': \'当邪调现世进战场时，若它经你施放，则消灭所有非结界生物。\\n每当邪调现世或另一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，直到回合结束，邪调现世成为传奇的6/6梦魇／神生物，且具有威慑与死触异能。它仍然是结界。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'126685b8-4182-4559-8192-8cdc3cf2b7b1\', \'multiverseId\': 625027}, \'multiverseid\': 625027}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entfesselter Missklang\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Entfesselte Missklang ins Spiel kommt und falls du ihn gewirkt hast, zerstöre alle Kreaturen, die keine Verzauberungen sind.\\nImmer wenn der Entfesselte Missklang oder eine andere Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, wird der Entfesselte Missklang bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer legendären 6/6 Nachtmahr-Gott-Kreatur mit Bedrohlichkeit und Todesberührung. Er ist immer noch eine Verzauberung.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625127&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da51c8ef-e155-40c4-9724-fb125fd33cd8\', \'multiverseId\': 625127}, \'multiverseid\': 625127}, {\'name\': \'Cacophonie déchaînée\', \'text\': "Quand la Cacophonie déchaînée arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous l\'avez lancée, détruisez toutes les créatures non-enchantement.\\nÀ chaque fois que la Cacophonie déchaînée ou un autre enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, jusqu\'à la fin du tour, la Cacophonie déchaînée devient une créature légendaire 6/6 Cauchemar et Dieu avec la menace et le contact mortel. C\'est toujours un enchantement.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625159&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1e1ba64-4495-48c8-b6c3-40377fc46fe7\', \'multiverseId\': 625159}, \'multiverseid\': 625159}, {\'name\': \'解放された騒音\', \'text\': \'解放された騒音が戦場に出たとき、あなたがこれを唱えていた場合、エンチャントでないすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。\\n解放された騒音やこれでないエンチャント１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、解放された騒音は威迫と接死を持つ６/６の伝説のナイトメア・神・クリーチャーになる。これはエンチャントでもある。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e6fefd3-4ea8-4df2-bee6-874c6d1253ef\', \'multiverseId\': 625191}, \'multiverseid\': 625191}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entfesseltes Potenzial\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Lege je eine +1/+1-Marke auf bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl.\\n• Führe Wucherung durch. (Bestimme eine beliebige Anzahl an bleibenden Karten und/oder Spielern und gib ihnen dann von jeder Sorte Marke, die dort bereits liegt, eine weitere Marke.)\\nVerflechtung {3}{W} (Bestimme beides, falls du die Verflechtungskosten bezahlst.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622876&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b811630-5fae-4239-9c08-617556f03049\', \'multiverseId\': 622876}, \'multiverseid\': 622876}, {\'name\': \'Potencial sin límites\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada una de hasta dos criaturas objetivo.\\n• Prolifera. (Elige cualquier cantidad de permanentes y/o jugadores, luego pon sobre cada uno un contador de cada tipo que ya tenga.)\\nEntrelazar {3}{W}. (Si pagas el coste de entrelazar, elige ambas opciones.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7a0305d-eeee-409b-9790-61cf7349be13\', \'multiverseId\': 623077}, \'multiverseid\': 623077}, {\'name\': \'Potentiel illimité\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Ciblez jusqu\'à deux créatures. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chacune d\'elles.\\n• Proliférez. (Choisissez n\'importe quel nombre de permanents et/ou de joueurs, puis donnez-leur à chacun un autre marqueur de chaque sorte déjà présente.)\\nUnion {3}{W} (Choisissez les deux si vous payez le coût d\'union.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623278&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7d8b937-196e-4223-8dc9-c5a58d14eaa4\', \'multiverseId\': 623278}, \'multiverseid\': 623278}, {\'name\': \'開放された潜在力\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・クリーチャー最大２体を対象とする。それらの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n・増殖を行う。（望む数のパーマネントやプレイヤーを選び、その後、すでにそこにあるカウンター１種類につき、そのカウンターをもう１個与える。）\\n双呪{3}{W}（双呪コストを支払ったなら、両方を選ぶ。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc0c8fe9-4cab-4ae3-9663-810745733ca0\', \'multiverseId\': 623680}, \'multiverseid\': 623680}, {\'name\': \'无拘潜能\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•在至多两个目标生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n•增殖。（选择任意数量的永久物和／或牌手，然后为其已有之每种指示物各多放置一个同类的指示物。）\\n打包{3}{W}（如果你支付打包费用，则两项都选。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ac97414-b551-4811-abbc-63e80ff894e4\', \'multiverseId\': 624082}, \'multiverseid\': 624082}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entweihung der Realität\', \'text\': \'Schicke für jeden Gegner bis zu eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl mit geradem Manabetrag, die jener Spieler kontrolliert, ins Exil. (Null zählt als gerade.)\\nAdamant — Falls drei oder mehr farblose Mana ausgegeben wurden, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, bringe eine bleibende Karte mit ungeradem Manabetrag aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624907&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41ff326e-a6fc-46c4-9f8a-78206bd67657\', \'multiverseId\': 624907}, \'multiverseid\': 624907}, {\'name\': \'Profanation de réalité\', \'text\': "Pour chaque adversaire, exilez jusqu\'à un permanent ciblé que ce joueur contrôle avec une valeur de mana paire. (Zéro est pair.)\\nInflexible — Si au moins trois manas incolores ont été dépensés pour lancer ce sort, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte de permanent avec une valeur de mana impaire depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624942&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4c337c8-348e-489a-8bef-ab75109ad708\', \'multiverseId\': 624942}, \'multiverseid\': 624942}, {\'name\': \'現実の冒涜\', \'text\': \'各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしていてマナ総量が偶数であるパーマネント最大１つを対象とする。それらを追放する。（０は偶数である。）\\n一徹 ― この呪文を唱えるために３点以上の無色マナが支払われていたなら、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が奇数であるパーマネント・カード１枚を戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4c93cda-de70-4d20-bffe-a5af0e1a10d7\', \'multiverseId\': 624977}, \'multiverseid\': 624977}, {\'name\': \'亵渎实界\', \'text\': \'为每位对手各进行以下流程～放逐至多一个目标由该牌手操控且法术力值为偶数的永久物。（零是偶数。）\\n固色～如果施放此咒语时支付过至少三点无色法术力，则将一张法术力值为奇数的永久物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60d59cf9-006f-45a3-8707-66fb3a14b2cd\', \'multiverseId\': 625012}, \'multiverseid\': 625012}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entweihung der Realität\', \'text\': \'Schicke für jeden Gegner bis zu eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl mit geradem Manabetrag, die jener Spieler kontrolliert, ins Exil. (Null zählt als gerade.)\\nAdamant — Falls drei oder mehr farblose Mana ausgegeben wurden, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, bringe eine bleibende Karte mit ungeradem Manabetrag aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625111&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56087660-d4a3-4e43-8eec-29fe253e3b21\', \'multiverseId\': 625111}, \'multiverseid\': 625111}, {\'name\': \'Profanation de réalité\', \'text\': "Pour chaque adversaire, exilez jusqu\'à un permanent ciblé que ce joueur contrôle avec une valeur de mana paire. (Zéro est pair.)\\nInflexible — Si au moins trois manas incolores ont été dépensés pour lancer ce sort, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte de permanent avec une valeur de mana impaire depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625143&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5e320f0-f86f-4d54-89fe-db82c2667caf\', \'multiverseId\': 625143}, \'multiverseid\': 625143}, {\'name\': \'現実の冒涜\', \'text\': \'各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしていてマナ総量が偶数であるパーマネント最大１つを対象とする。それらを追放する。（０は偶数である。）\\n一徹 ― この呪文を唱えるために３点以上の無色マナが支払われていたなら、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が奇数であるパーマネント・カード１枚を戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1790e9c9-34e5-4399-8b87-4a181f2101ff\', \'multiverseId\': 625175}, \'multiverseid\': 625175}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erbfolge-Bankett\', \'text\': \'Alle Kreaturen erhalten -4/-4 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Du wirst zum Monarchen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Hüte dich vor dem eifrigen Gastgeber."\\n—Eligeth, Augur des Scheidewegs\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622967&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d77c249c-6778-4ed7-a93d-3a51c21a31fe\', \'multiverseId\': 622967}, \'multiverseid\': 622967}, {\'name\': \'Banquete de la sucesión\', \'text\': \'Todas las criaturas obtienen -4/-4 hasta el final del turno. Te conviertes en el monarca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuidado con el anfitrión entusiasta".\\n—Éligeth, augur de la encrucijada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84625c1a-8b05-414c-aea9-a18481c8936d\', \'multiverseId\': 623168}, \'multiverseid\': 623168}, {\'name\': \'Festin de succession\', \'text\': "Toutes les créatures gagnent -4/-4 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Vous devenez le monarque.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Méfiez-vous de l\'hôte zélé. »\\n—Éligeth, augure de la croisée", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623369&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ae0a5b4-d14b-4238-9507-37b48ea64645\', \'multiverseId\': 623369}, \'multiverseid\': 623369}, {\'name\': \'継承の饗宴\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、すべてのクリーチャーは－４/－４の修整を受ける。あなたが統治者になる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「熱心な誘いには気をつけたまえ。」\\n――岐路の占い師、エリゲス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a866eeff-e94d-4677-a4fa-ed5de69475e8\', \'multiverseId\': 623771}, \'multiverseid\': 623771}, {\'name\': \'继位盛宴\', \'text\': \'所有生物得-4/-4直到回合结束。你成为君主。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「当心急不可耐的主人。」\\n～歧路卜算师艾力思\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2aa94e12-fb68-42ae-b701-34347455bddc\', \'multiverseId\': 624173}, \'multiverseid\': 624173}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erdrückender Zehnt\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Gegner eine Karte zieht, kann er {2} bezahlen. Falls er dies nicht tut, erzeugst du einen Schatz-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich erwarte deine Spende."\\n—Dasha, Orzhov-Priesterin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622866&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ce13203-2166-4da2-804c-a42f9d1befeb\', \'multiverseId\': 622866}, \'multiverseid\': 622866}, {\'name\': \'Diezmo asfixiante\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un oponente robe una carta, ese jugador puede pagar {2}. Si el jugador no lo hace, creas una ficha de Tesoro. (Es un artefacto con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Estoy esperando tu donación".\\n—Dasha, sacerdotisa orzhov\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9dbfca1-d744-4796-9e96-012e5e26f650\', \'multiverseId\': 623067}, \'multiverseid\': 623067}, {\'name\': \'Dîme étouffante\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire pioche une carte, ce joueur peut payer {2}. S\'il ne le fait pas, vous créez un jeton Trésor. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« J\'attends votre donation. »\\n—Dasha, prêtresse d\'Orzhov", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623268&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ba30985-4202-4cfa-86ab-c85e9eb9e089\', \'multiverseId\': 623268}, \'multiverseid\': 623268}, {\'name\': \'息詰まる徴税\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がカード１枚を引くたび、そのプレイヤーは{2}を支払ってもよい。そうしないなら、あなたは宝物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「寄付をお待ちしています。」\\n――オルゾフの僧侶、ダーシャ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'097d36c5-4861-4137-8679-4b147e66480f\', \'multiverseId\': 623670}, \'multiverseid\': 623670}, {\'name\': \'税赋压身\', \'text\': \'每当任一对手抓一张牌时，该牌手可以支付{2}。若该牌手未如此作，则你派出一个珍宝衍生物。（它是具有「{T}，牺牲此神器：加一点任意颜色的法术力」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「我在等你的馈赠。」\\n～欧佐夫僧侣达莎\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca64b439-1c3e-436c-a55c-2aacc457b2f1\', \'multiverseId\': 624072}, \'multiverseid\': 624072}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erdrückender Zehnt\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Gegner eine Karte zieht, kann er {2} bezahlen. Falls er dies nicht tut, erzeugst du einen Schatz-Spielstein.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Alles, was glänzt, gehört dir.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624787&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db8dd141-856f-45fa-bbed-a41bd3988c66\', \'multiverseId\': 624787}, \'multiverseid\': 624787}, {\'name\': \'Diezmo asfixiante\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un oponente robe una carta, ese jugador puede pagar {2}. Si el jugador no lo hace, creas una ficha de Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Todo lo que reluce es tuyo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02daebb5-f4cc-462c-8900-9a00bbb59730\', \'multiverseId\': 624799}, \'multiverseid\': 624799}, {\'name\': \'Dîme étouffante\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire pioche une carte, ce joueur peut payer {2}. S\'il ne le fait pas, vous créez un jeton Trésor.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Tout ce qui brille est à toi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624811&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6662decb-9320-4adc-80af-e8d2ac5c7271\', \'multiverseId\': 624811}, \'multiverseid\': 624811}, {\'name\': \'息詰まる徴税\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人がカード１枚を引くたび、そのプレイヤーは{2}を支払ってもよい。そのプレイヤーがそうしないなら、あなたは宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'煌めくものはすべてお前のもの。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'debf63c0-96b0-476b-b9fd-e1c1b2d5e863\', \'multiverseId\': 624835}, \'multiverseid\': 624835}, {\'name\': \'税赋压身\', \'text\': \'每当任一对手抓一张牌时，该牌手可以支付{2}。若该牌手未如此作，则你派出一个珍宝衍生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'闪闪发亮都归你。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1cfdce7-b3fb-4416-b6ab-9149278e18e4\', \'multiverseId\': 624859}, \'multiverseid\': 624859}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erdrückender Zehnt\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Gegner eine Karte zieht, kann er {2} bezahlen. Falls er dies nicht tut, erzeugst du einen Schatz-Spielstein.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich erwarte deine Spende."\\n—Dasha, Orzhov-Priesterin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626498&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'793de681-9f14-418f-9e9b-909a2dae2460\', \'multiverseId\': 626498}, \'multiverseid\': 626498}, {\'name\': \'Dîme étouffante\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire pioche une carte, ce joueur peut payer {2}. S\'il ne le fait pas, vous créez un jeton Trésor.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« J\'attends votre donation. »\\n—Dasha, prêtresse d\'Orzhov", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626838&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4a961ac-258f-4fd4-bde0-9ab658cace71\', \'multiverseId\': 626838}, \'multiverseid\': 626838}, {\'name\': \'息詰まる徴税\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人がカード１枚を引くたび、そのプレイヤーは{2}を支払ってもよい。そのプレイヤーがそうしないなら、あなたは宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「寄付をお待ちしています。」\\n――オルゾフの僧侶、ダーシャ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc7cf6f5-a42f-4d62-be18-b99f2fcf0f58\', \'multiverseId\': 627178}, \'multiverseid\': 627178}, {\'name\': \'税赋压身\', \'text\': \'每当任一对手抓一张牌时，该牌手可以支付{2}。若该牌手未如此作，则你派出一个珍宝衍生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「我在等你的馈赠。」\\n～欧佐夫僧侣达莎\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bce5b404-2a99-45a5-bbba-b0fa8785db49\', \'multiverseId\': 627518}, \'multiverseid\': 627518}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erebos der Trostlose\', \'text\': \'Unzerstörbar\\nSolange deine Hingabe zu Schwarz weniger als fünf beträgt, ist Erebos keine Kreatur.\\nImmer wenn eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, kannst du 2 Lebenspunkte bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\\n{1}{B}, opfere eine andere Kreatur: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -2/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberungskreatur — Gott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625530&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c664bce-3086-44dd-9438-a2c623a4c8fd\', \'multiverseId\': 625530}, \'multiverseid\': 625530}, {\'name\': \'Érébos, Cœur lugubre\', \'text\': "Indestructible\\nTant que votre dévotion au noir est inférieure à cinq, Érébos n\'est pas une créature.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une autre créature que vous contrôlez meurt, vous pouvez payer 2 points de vie. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.\\n{1}{B}, sacrifiez une autre créature : Une créature ciblée gagne -2/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement légendaire : dieu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625787&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7ec1fb7-c8b8-41f6-b24e-9b48bb89eb6b\', \'multiverseId\': 625787}, \'multiverseid\': 625787}, {\'name\': \'荒涼とした心のエレボス\', \'text\': \'破壊不能\\nあなたの黒への信心が５未満であるかぎり、荒涼とした心のエレボスはクリーチャーではない。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、あなたは２点のライフを支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、カード１枚を引く。\\n{1}{B}, これでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－２/－１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー・エンチャント — 神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9326ec4-f109-410b-a824-9a70fcdd663a\', \'multiverseId\': 626044}, \'multiverseid\': 626044}]', "[{'name': 'Erhabenes Scheinbild', 'text': 'Wenn das Erhabene Scheinbild ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie getappt ins Spiel bringen und danach mischen.\\nWenn das Erhabene Scheinbild stirbt, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625635&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9de36423-5e4a-4117-b3db-2a0dd9d56fa8', 'multiverseId': 625635}, 'multiverseid': 625635}, {'name': 'Simulacre solennel', 'text': 'Quand le Simulacre solennel arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher une carte de terrain de base dans votre bibliothèque, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélanger.\\nQuand le Simulacre solennel meurt, vous pouvez piocher une carte.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625892&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b3369583-d7e3-458c-a4b2-eb0288cd475c', 'multiverseId': 625892}, 'multiverseid': 625892}, {'name': '真面目な身代わり', 'text': '真面目な身代わりが戦場に出たとき、「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\\n真面目な身代わりが死亡したとき、カード１枚を引いてもよい。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626149&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '65b8ddb1-4789-4a91-95cd-925027c080c6', 'multiverseId': 626149}, 'multiverseid': 626149}]", '[{\'name\': \'Eroberung von Jingzhou\', \'text\': \'Du erhältst nach diesem Zug einen zusätzlichen Zug.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Provinz Jingzhou war der Dreh- und Angelpunkt der drei Reiche. Zu verschiedenen Zeiten wurde sie von den Wu, den Shu und den Wei begehrt und kontrolliert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622888&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91647f29-76a4-4e92-a38d-cab97de26f14\', \'multiverseId\': 622888}, \'multiverseid\': 622888}, {\'name\': \'Conquista de Jingzhou\', \'text\': \'Juega un turno adicional después de este.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La provincia de Jingzhou era el pilar de los tres reinos. En tiempos distintos, fue codiciada y controlada por Wu, Shu y Wei.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d23c0279-e278-46b0-9089-f93b36eeba74\', \'multiverseId\': 623089}, \'multiverseid\': 623089}, {\'name\': \'Prise de Jingzhou\', \'text\': \'Jouez un tour supplémentaire après celui-ci.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "La province de Jingzhou était l\'axe des trois royaumes. Elle fut convoitée et contrôlée à différentes périodes par les Wu, les Shu et les Wei.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623290&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c71de87-7747-465b-9442-7af0eb2d0d08\', \'multiverseId\': 623290}, \'multiverseid\': 623290}, {\'name\': \'荊州占拠\', \'text\': \'このターンに続いて追加の１ターンを行う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'荊州は三国の係争の地であった。それぞれ異なる時代に、呉、蜀、魏のいずれもがここを渇望し、あるいは支配した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8702b558-4c6f-4af5-93f1-783c2810eecf\', \'multiverseId\': 623692}, \'multiverseid\': 623692}, {\'name\': \'收复荆州\', \'text\': \'于本回合后进行额外的一个回合。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'荆州在三国时期中是兵家必争之地，屡屡被魏国、蜀国及吴国垂涎。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3346cb70-2f47-4dec-82a3-8f63e46c9ac7\', \'multiverseId\': 624094}, \'multiverseid\': 624094}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eroberung von Jingzhou\', \'text\': \'Du erhältst nach diesem Zug einen zusätzlichen Zug.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Provinz Jingzhou war der Dreh- und Angelpunkt der drei Reiche. Zu verschiedenen Zeiten wurde sie von den Wu, den Shu und den Wei begehrt und kontrolliert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626508&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cea985be-2620-4632-89d6-2a092a72a84e\', \'multiverseId\': 626508}, \'multiverseid\': 626508}, {\'name\': \'Prise de Jingzhou\', \'text\': \'Jouez un tour supplémentaire après celui-ci.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "La province de Jingzhou était l\'axe des trois royaumes. Elle fut convoitée et contrôlée à différentes périodes par les Wu, les Shu et les Wei.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626848&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'574be8ad-30c1-4a32-a350-eb108802217f\', \'multiverseId\': 626848}, \'multiverseid\': 626848}, {\'name\': \'荊州占拠\', \'text\': \'このターンに続いて追加の１ターンを行う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'荊州は三国の係争の地であった。それぞれ異なる時代に、呉、蜀、魏のいずれもがここを渇望し、あるいは支配した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8a37d48-861e-4c8d-b6f6-8b5da569e9ea\', \'multiverseId\': 627188}, \'multiverseid\': 627188}, {\'name\': \'收复荆州\', \'text\': \'于本回合后进行额外的一个回合。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'荆州在三国时期中是兵家必争之地，屡屡被魏国、蜀国及吴国垂涎。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5197c834-6e14-4c44-b405-1da1de5537b4\', \'multiverseId\': 627528}, \'multiverseid\': 627528}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erstickender Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben „Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, ins Exil schicken, bis diese Kreatur das Spiel verlässt."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'Neugeborene Remasuris winden sich manchmal spielerisch um den Finger eines Menschen. Aus dem „spielerischen" Teil wachsen sie schnell heraus.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625480&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c6109ca-497d-45c4-b40c-56886c12b6db\', \'multiverseId\': 625480}, \'multiverseid\': 625480}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde constricteur\', \'text\': "Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont « Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez exiler une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle jusqu\'à ce que cette créature quitte le champ de bataille. »", \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "Les jeunes slivoïdes s\'enroulent parfois autour du doigt d\'un humain pour jouer. Ils finissent par ne plus jouer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625737&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6aa351a2-2634-4985-896d-942efcdea9fa\', \'multiverseId\': 625737}, \'multiverseid\': 625737}, {\'name\': \'束縛スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのスリヴァー・クリーチャーは「このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。このクリーチャーが戦場を離れるまで、それを追放してもよい。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'生まれたてのスリヴァーは人の指にじゃれついて絡みつく事がある。こんな可愛げも成長とともに恐怖へ変わる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f1510d9-1787-4a78-b383-5e10df7436bc\', \'multiverseId\': 625994}, \'multiverseid\': 625994}]', "[{'name': 'Erzdämon der Verzweiflung', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nDeine Gegner können keine Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten.\\nZu Beginn jedes Endsegments verliert jeder Gegner so viele Lebenspunkte, wie er in diesem Zug Lebenspunkte verloren hat. (Schaden verursacht den Verlust von Lebenspunkten.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Dämon', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622946&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9d575fe6-54b9-4c6e-913b-334a4c9fefe5', 'multiverseId': 622946}, 'multiverseid': 622946}, {'name': 'Archidemonio de la desesperación', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nTus oponentes no pueden ganar vidas.\\nAl comienzo de cada paso final, cada oponente pierde una cantidad de vidas igual a la cantidad de vidas que ese jugador perdió este turno. (El daño causa pérdida de vidas.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Demonio', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623147&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '841ad99c-33c9-4565-af86-3c43084ecd5c', 'multiverseId': 623147}, 'multiverseid': 623147}, {'name': 'Archifielleux du désespoir', 'text': 'Vol\\nVos adversaires ne peuvent pas gagner de points de vie.\\nAu début de chaque étape de fin, chaque adversaire perd un nombre de points de vie égal au nombre de points de vie que ce joueur a perdus ce tour-ci. (Les blessures provoquent la perte de points de vie.)', 'type': 'Créature : démon', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623348&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b9eb42c9-861a-440a-b104-3cb513d449cb', 'multiverseId': 623348}, 'multiverseid': 623348}, {'name': '絶望の魔神', 'text': '飛行\\n対戦相手はライフを得られない。\\n各終了ステップの開始時に、各対戦相手はこのターンにそのプレイヤーが失ったライフの点数に等しい点数のライフを失う。（ダメージによりライフは失われる。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — デーモン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623750&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e74af0ef-5861-4edc-bb51-3be18f1b1840', 'multiverseId': 623750}, 'multiverseid': 623750}, {'name': '绝望翼邪鬼', 'text': '飞行\\n所有对手都不能获得生命。\\n在每个结束步骤开始时，每位对手各失去等同于该牌手本回合中曾失去之数量的生命。（伤害会导致失去生命。）', 'type': '生物 ～恶魔', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624152&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '12d29836-21f7-4ca4-b22a-441db3342920', 'multiverseId': 624152}, 'multiverseid': 624152}]", "[{'name': 'Erzdämon der Verzweiflung', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nDeine Gegner können keine Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten.\\nZu Beginn jedes Endsegments verliert jeder Gegner so viele Lebenspunkte, wie er in diesem Zug Lebenspunkte verloren hat. (Schaden verursacht den Verlust von Lebenspunkten.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Dämon', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626528&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '36b31c80-4645-445f-a55a-da7cc193ab27', 'multiverseId': 626528}, 'multiverseid': 626528}, {'name': 'Archifielleux du désespoir', 'text': 'Vol\\nVos adversaires ne peuvent pas gagner de points de vie.\\nAu début de chaque étape de fin, chaque adversaire perd un nombre de points de vie égal au nombre de points de vie que ce joueur a perdus ce tour-ci. (Les blessures provoquent la perte de points de vie.)', 'type': 'Créature : démon', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626868&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'adf17492-c57c-4b01-8c1c-5f08ad3df007', 'multiverseId': 626868}, 'multiverseid': 626868}, {'name': '絶望の魔神', 'text': '飛行\\n対戦相手はライフを得られない。\\n各終了ステップの開始時に、各対戦相手はこのターンにそのプレイヤーが失ったライフの点数に等しい点数のライフを失う。（ダメージによりライフは失われる。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — デーモン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627208&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ebdccf3b-9be4-4189-a141-ea19d74cdb83', 'multiverseId': 627208}, 'multiverseid': 627208}, {'name': '绝望翼邪鬼', 'text': '飞行\\n所有对手都不能获得生命。\\n在每个结束步骤开始时，每位对手各失去等同于该牌手本回合中曾失去之数量的生命。（伤害会导致失去生命。）', 'type': '生物 ～恶魔', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627548&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '655f5336-a907-4606-aec5-6b8fb0877a71', 'multiverseId': 627548}, 'multiverseid': 627548}]", '[{\'name\': \'Es, das betrügt\', \'text\': \'Vernichter 2 (Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift, opfert der verteidigende Spieler zwei bleibende Karten.)\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner eine bleibende Karte, die kein Spielstein ist, opfert, bringe sie unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Alles wird geerntet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625467&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa73ac7b-f33c-49e6-a6e8-6f8e1ce833e4\', \'multiverseId\': 625467}, \'multiverseid\': 625467}, {\'name\': \'Lui-qui-trahit\', \'text\': "Annihilateur 2 (À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, le joueur défenseur sacrifie deux permanents.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire sacrifie un permanent non-jeton, mettez cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Tout sera récolté.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625724&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc66c0f4-6e01-471c-8d9b-5d22fbb3c31e\', \'multiverseId\': 625724}, \'multiverseid\': 625724}, {\'name\': \'背くもの\', \'text\': \'滅殺２（このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーはパーマネント２つを生け贄に捧げる。）\\n対戦相手がトークンでないパーマネント１つを生け贄に捧げるたび、そのカードをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': \'全ては刈り取られる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f386ae2e-3001-4b96-8aff-e0d6f22f6898\', \'multiverseId\': 625981}, \'multiverseid\': 625981}]', '[{\'name\': \'Evakuierung\', \'text\': \'Bringe alle Kreaturen auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Sobald ich euch eine Brise schicke, werdet ihr sehen, dass eure Krieger in Wirklichkeit nur heiße Luft sind."\\n—Alexi die Westwindzauberin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622898&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dbccb79-d72c-4a03-80b7-576b841aeb83\', \'multiverseId\': 622898}, \'multiverseid\': 622898}, {\'name\': \'Evacuación\', \'text\': \'Regresa todas las criaturas a las manos de sus propietarios.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Una vez que tenga la brisa, verás que tus soldados no son más que humo".\\n—Alexi, maga céfira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cacd4450-8588-4646-b6ab-478c382780af\', \'multiverseId\': 623099}, \'multiverseid\': 623099}, {\'name\': \'Évacuation\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez toutes les créatures dans les mains de leurs propriétaires.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Une fois que j\'aurai invoqué la brise, vous verrez comment vos guerriers partiront en fumée. »\\n—Alexie, mage du zéphyr", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623300&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88070f08-30b3-44d5-97e7-307e0e55b044\', \'multiverseId\': 623300}, \'multiverseid\': 623300}, {\'name\': \'脱出\', \'text\': \'すべてのクリーチャーをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「私がそよ風を吹かせたら、あなたの兵士なんか煙みたいなものよ。」\\n――西風の魔道士アレクシー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78492e95-7efe-4223-95fb-bfc0cbc5d964\', \'multiverseId\': 623702}, \'multiverseid\': 623702}, {\'name\': \'逃难\', \'text\': \'将所有生物移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「一旦我让风吹起，你会看到手下兵士如烟散去。」\\n～西风法师阿蕾克丝\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfbedffe-ae8b-4db2-b7d6-a7cf49cf3840\', \'multiverseId\': 624104}, \'multiverseid\': 624104}]', '[{\'name\': \'Evakuierung\', \'text\': \'Bringe alle Kreaturen auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Sobald ich euch eine Brise schicke, werdet ihr sehen, dass eure Krieger in Wirklichkeit nur heiße Luft sind."\\n—Alexi die Westwindzauberin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626512&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fba493ec-11a5-40b0-a88c-19c92fed9bd2\', \'multiverseId\': 626512}, \'multiverseid\': 626512}, {\'name\': \'Évacuation\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez toutes les créatures dans les mains de leurs propriétaires.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Une fois que j\'aurai invoqué la brise, vous verrez comment vos guerriers partiront en fumée. »\\n—Alexie, mage du zéphyr", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626852&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0abd1fa-cf30-4d71-9f1b-64c330f6d226\', \'multiverseId\': 626852}, \'multiverseid\': 626852}, {\'name\': \'脱出\', \'text\': \'すべてのクリーチャーをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「私がそよ風を吹かせたら、あなたの兵士なんか煙みたいなものよ。」\\n――西風の魔道士アレクシー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05300b59-4b44-4401-8f7d-4d9e64b76525\', \'multiverseId\': 627192}, \'multiverseid\': 627192}, {\'name\': \'逃难\', \'text\': \'将所有生物移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「一旦我让风吹起，你会看到手下兵士如烟散去。」\\n～西风法师阿蕾克丝\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a6b685e-dcac-41a8-b88e-27f7a4acc719\', \'multiverseId\': 627532}, \'multiverseid\': 627532}]', "[{'name': 'Ewige Zeugin', 'text': 'Wenn die Ewige Zeugin ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückbringen.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane', 'flavor': 'Sie erinnert sich an jedes gesprochene Wort, vom Eid des Helden bis zum Schrei des Säuglings.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627984&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa99063e-984c-464e-9890-27b600bfe9ec', 'multiverseId': 627984}, 'multiverseid': 627984}, {'name': 'Testigo eterna', 'text': 'Cuando la Testigo eterna entre al campo de batalla, puedes regresar la carta objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.', 'type': 'Criatura — Chamán humano', 'flavor': 'Recuerda cada palabra mencionada, desde el juramento del héroe al llanto del bebé.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628218&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dc3b2434-06eb-4c14-be04-5e8ed6905dde', 'multiverseId': 628218}, 'multiverseid': 628218}, {'name': '永遠の証人', 'text': '永遠の証人が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にあるカード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン', 'flavor': '彼女は語られたすべての言葉を覚えている。それは英雄の誓いから、赤ん坊の泣き声にまで至る。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628686&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fec38a8e-3142-4a58-9f1c-893a796c1654', 'multiverseId': 628686}, 'multiverseid': 628686}, {'name': '不朽见证人', 'text': '当不朽见证人进战场时，你可以将目标牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。', 'type': '生物 ～人类／祭师', 'flavor': '从英雄誓词以至婴儿哭啼，曾被言说的每字每句均永志其心。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629154&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '520efb67-2438-4682-a521-afc41d85efb1', 'multiverseId': 629154}, 'multiverseid': 629154}]", '[{\'name\': \'Exotischer Obstgarten\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe, das ein Land, das ein Gegner kontrolliert, produzieren könnte.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Das war ein seltsamer Morgen. Als wir aufwachten, hatten sich unsere Bäume verwandelt. Wir wussten nicht, ob wir sie gießen oder polieren sollten."\\n—Pulan, Hainpfleger aus Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625655&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11822578-98ae-47e5-8f4f-88187c273188\', \'multiverseId\': 625655}, \'multiverseid\': 625655}, {\'name\': \'Verger exotique\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix qu\'un terrain qu\'un adversaire contrôle pourrait produire.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« C\'était une étrange matinée. Quand nous nous sommes réveillés, nos arbres avaient été transformés. Nous ne savions plus si nous devions les arroser ou les polir. »\\n—Pulan, arboriste de Bant", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625912&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'beb7dc98-1d1a-4819-a7dd-50107ad99b20\', \'multiverseId\': 625912}, \'multiverseid\': 625912}, {\'name\': \'風変わりな果樹園\', \'text\': \'{T}：対戦相手がコントロールしている土地が生み出すことのできる色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「変な朝だったよ。起きたら、俺らの樹が変わっちまってたんだ。水やったらいいのか磨いたらいいのかわかんなくってな。」\\n――バントの果樹園主、プーラン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'500c09bf-e46f-40fd-867d-ccf2d4b2ce08\', \'multiverseId\': 626169}, \'multiverseid\': 626169}]', '[{\'name\': \'Expedition zum Khalni-Herzen\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Quest-Marke auf die Expedition zum Khalni-Herzen legen.\\nEntferne drei Quest-Marken von der Expedition zum Khalni-Herzen und opfere sie: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625561&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1254dbd8-f6ef-4b6f-9551-85973a63f8e1\', \'multiverseId\': 625561}, \'multiverseid\': 625561}, {\'name\': \'Expédition du Cœur de Khalni\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez mettre un marqueur « quête » sur l\'Expédition du Cœur de Khalni.\\nRetirez trois marqueurs « quête » de l\'Expédition du Cœur de Khalni et sacrifiez-la : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625818&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54fd551e-8e47-4fea-967d-53f32535576a\', \'multiverseId\': 625818}, \'multiverseid\': 625818}, {\'name\': \'カルニの心臓の探検\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたはカルニの心臓の探検の上に探索カウンター１個を置いてもよい。\\nカルニの心臓の探検の上から探索カウンター３個を取り除き、これを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d549ba81-5869-4f24-8ca3-89a150a4c337\', \'multiverseId\': 626075}, \'multiverseid\': 626075}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ezuris Hetzjagd\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge für jede Kreatur, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, einen 4/4 grünen Phyrexianer-Bestie-Kreaturenspielstein. Jeder der Spielsteine kämpft gegen eine unterschiedliche jener Kreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Schlachtet die Schwachen ab. Sie sind des Geschenks der *Vollendung* unwürdig."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626583&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daa6d23f-75c7-4732-8d21-cc30a9aa6215\', \'multiverseId\': 626583}, \'multiverseid\': 626583}, {\'name\': "Cycle alimentaire d\'Ezuri", \'text\': \'Pour chaque créature que vos adversaires contrôlent, créez un jeton de créature 4/4 verte Phyrexian et Bête. Chacun de ces jetons se bat contre une créature différente parmi ces créatures.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Massacrez les faibles. Massacrez les faibles. Ils ne sont pas dignes du don de *parachèvement*. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626923&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5548bdd-1d16-4b60-a7d5-2cc6c9884295\', \'multiverseId\': 626923}, \'multiverseid\': 626923}, {\'name\': \'エズーリの捕食\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体につき１体の、緑の４/４のファイレクシアン・ビースト・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。それらの各トークンはそれぞれ、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャーのうち別々の１体と格闘を行う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「弱いものは殺してしまえ。*完成化*という名の贈り物に相応しくない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'368816e5-ed11-4b9a-9eee-8b8e7c3a6add\', \'multiverseId\': 627263}, \'multiverseid\': 627263}, {\'name\': \'伊祖黎的猎捕\', \'text\': \'所有对手每操控一个生物，你便派出一个4/4绿色非瑞人／野兽衍生生物。这些衍生物各与该些生物之一互斗，且不能重复选择。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「杀掉弱者。他们不配*完化*赋礼。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cca4338-21f7-43a9-a094-901a767d118d\', \'multiverseId\': 627603}, \'multiverseid\': 627603}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ezuris Hetzjagd\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge für jede Kreatur, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, einen 4/4 grünen Phyrexianer-Bestie-Kreaturenspielstein. Jeder der Spielsteine kämpft gegen eine unterschiedliche jener Kreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Schlachtet die Schwachen ab. Sie sind des Geschenks der *Vollendung* unwürdig."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627985&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1501aca4-cc8d-4def-b726-ca5e32510253\', \'multiverseId\': 627985}, \'multiverseid\': 627985}, {\'name\': \'Depredación de Ezuri\', \'text\': \'Por cada criatura que controlan tus oponentes, crea una ficha de criatura Bestia Pirexiano verde 4/4. Cada una de esas fichas lucha contra una criatura distinta entre esas criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Masacren a los débiles. No se merecen el don del *perfeccionamiento*".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66d42440-e87b-41e9-8004-12a3c0fb5db7\', \'multiverseId\': 628219}, \'multiverseid\': 628219}, {\'name\': \'エズーリの捕食\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体につき１体の、緑の４/４のファイレクシアン・ビースト・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。それらの各トークンはそれぞれ、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャーのうち別々の１体と格闘を行う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「弱いものは殺してしまえ。完成化という名の贈り物に相応しくない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2af6a9bc-669e-481d-935a-e3e32a035536\', \'multiverseId\': 628687}, \'multiverseid\': 628687}, {\'name\': \'伊祖黎的猎捕\', \'text\': \'所有对手每操控一个生物，你便派出一个4/4绿色非瑞人／野兽衍生生物。这些衍生物各与该些生物之一互斗，且不能重复选择。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「杀掉弱者。他们不配完化赋礼。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'502df221-7dd5-45c5-b845-6baab5848dae\', \'multiverseId\': 629155}, \'multiverseid\': 629155}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fakt oder Fiktion\', \'text\': \'Decke die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Ein Gegner teilt jene Karten auf zwei Haufen auf. Nimm einen Haufen auf deine Hand und lege den anderen auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Erscheint diese Entscheidung wirklich so einfach, Syr Ritter?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624461&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'286f0723-9aa4-4467-8d9b-d1535a898d46\', \'multiverseId\': 624461}, \'multiverseid\': 624461}, {\'name\': \'Realidad o ficción\', \'text\': \'Muestra las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Un oponente separa esas cartas en dos montones. Pon un montón en tu mano y el otro en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Acaso esta elección parece tan sencilla, syr caballero?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64f26a66-ee79-4c12-a741-21298503b6a5\', \'multiverseId\': 624507}, \'multiverseid\': 624507}, {\'name\': \'Fait ou fiction\', \'text\': "Révélez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Un adversaire sépare ces cartes en deux tas. Mettez un tas dans votre main et l\'autre dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Est-ce que ce choix est vraiment si simple, syr chevalier ? »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624553&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b053bb2a-4f86-4830-81a7-b99934a7a121\', \'multiverseId\': 624553}, \'multiverseid\': 624553}, {\'name\': \'嘘か真か\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード５枚を公開する。対戦相手１人はそれらのカードを２つの束に分ける。あなたは一方の束をあなたの手札に、もう一方の束をあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「いたって簡単な選択ではないか、騎士卿よ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09a7c2ca-c639-419f-85a1-c3541e2ac936\', \'multiverseId\': 624645}, \'multiverseid\': 624645}, {\'name\': \'真伪莫辨\', \'text\': \'展示你牌库顶的五张牌。由任一对手将它们分成两堆。将其中一堆置于你手上，另一堆则置入你的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「这选择真的就跟看起来一样简单吗，爵士大人？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0436b051-34fd-46f6-8c2f-5d4906416ec2\', \'multiverseId\': 624737}, \'multiverseid\': 624737}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fakt oder Fiktion\', \'text\': \'Decke die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Ein Gegner teilt jene Karten auf zwei Haufen auf. Nimm einen Haufen auf deine Hand und lege den anderen auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ja, Schleimfuß, ich habe gesagt, ich möchte unseren Wissensvorrat anwachsen lassen, aber so hatte ich das nicht gemeint."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622900&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dba04274-3d1d-4dea-b434-afea5e6f7acf\', \'multiverseId\': 622900}, \'multiverseid\': 622900}, {\'name\': \'Realidad o ficción\', \'text\': \'Muestra las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Un oponente separa esas cartas en dos montones. Pon un montón en tu mano y el otro en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Pies de Fango, sé que dije que quería cultivar nuestro repositorio de conocimiento, pero no me refería a esto".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e540316-008c-4bd0-875d-c7a3ed1589f5\', \'multiverseId\': 623101}, \'multiverseid\': 623101}, {\'name\': \'Fait ou fiction\', \'text\': "Révélez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Un adversaire sépare ces cartes en deux tas. Mettez un tas dans votre main et l\'autre dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Fongepied, je sais que j\'ai dit que je souhaitais que nous nous cultivions, mais ce n\'est pas ce que j\'avais en tête. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623302&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ceff3c7-d49b-49b4-8bbc-599d4cfd7dc9\', \'multiverseId\': 623302}, \'multiverseid\': 623302}, {\'name\': \'嘘か真か\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード５枚を公開する。対戦相手１人はそれらのカードを２つの束に分ける。あなたは一方の束をあなたの手札に、もう一方の束をあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「スライムフット、確かに知識の保管庫を拡大したいとは言ったけど、私が考えていたのはこれじゃないわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf57ebdf-6656-4775-9947-724eb2305b38\', \'multiverseId\': 623704}, \'multiverseid\': 623704}, {\'name\': \'真伪莫辨\', \'text\': \'展示你牌库顶的五张牌。由任一对手将它们分成两堆。将其中一堆置于你手上，另一堆则置入你的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「黏足，我是说过要丰富我们的知识储备，但我想的不是这种方式。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c68cd7c-ee07-45bc-9251-29a4a0f0bdca\', \'multiverseId\': 624106}, \'multiverseid\': 624106}]', "[{'name': 'Falke des Kartenzeichners', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nWenn der Falke des Kartenzeichners einem Spieler, der mehr Länder kontrolliert als du, Kampfschaden zufügt, bringe ihn auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück. Falls du dies tust, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene-Karte durchsuchen, sie getappt ins Spiel bringen und danach mischen.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Vogel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622827&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9db94c07-82f2-4fed-9d49-73ab81320f4a', 'multiverseId': 622827}, 'multiverseid': 622827}, {'name': 'Halcón de cartógrafo', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nCuando el Halcón de cartógrafo haga daño de combate a un jugador que controla más tierras que tú, regrésalo a la mano de su propietario. Si lo haces, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de Llanura, ponerla en el campo de batalla girada y luego barajar.', 'type': 'Criatura — Ave', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623028&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b0c1446-bb29-4336-85d7-f3889d130ec3', 'multiverseId': 623028}, 'multiverseid': 623028}, {'name': 'Faucon de cartographe', 'text': 'Vol\\nQuand le Faucon de cartographe inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur qui contrôle plus de terrains que vous, renvoyez-le dans la main de son propriétaire. Si vous faites ainsi, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélanger.', 'type': 'Créature : oiseau', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623229&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c2dda4bd-2541-42c5-b959-d9b5025dc450', 'multiverseId': 623229}, 'multiverseid': 623229}, {'name': '地図作りの鷹', 'text': '飛行\\n地図作りの鷹が、土地をあなたよりも多くコントロールしているプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えたとき、これをオーナーの手札に戻す。そうしたなら、「あなたのライブラリーから平地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 鳥', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623631&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9f7abbc3-477f-4f69-8e60-16f18a92b1aa', 'multiverseId': 623631}, 'multiverseid': 623631}, {'name': '制图师翔鹰', 'text': '飞行\\n当制图师翔鹰对任一操控之地比你多的牌手造成战斗伤害时，将它移回其拥有者手上。若你如此作，则你可以从你牌库中搜寻一张平原牌，将之横置放进战场，然后洗牌。', 'type': '生物 ～鸟', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624033&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '73cca305-ae7e-4242-b7bd-e45bf5d52d1e', 'multiverseId': 624033}, 'multiverseid': 624033}]", '[{\'name\': \'Feen-Handwerker\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur unter der Kontrolle eines Gegners ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie jener Kreatur ist, außer dass er zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Typen ein Artefakt ist. Schicke dann alle anderen von den Feen-Handwerkern erzeugten Spielsteine ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622901&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3770626c-d33b-469d-bec1-470a04c656f3\', \'multiverseId\': 622901}, \'multiverseid\': 622901}, {\'name\': \'Hadas artesanas\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que una criatura que no sea ficha entre al campo de batalla bajo el control de un oponente, crea una ficha que es una copia de esa criatura, excepto que es un artefacto además de sus otros tipos. Luego exilia todas las demás fichas creadas con las Hadas artesanas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice hada\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cc45bf3-9b5d-4290-9e7e-0da59af9521d\', \'multiverseId\': 623102}, \'multiverseid\': 623102}, {\'name\': \'Artisans faeries\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature non-jeton arrive sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle d\'un adversaire, créez un jeton qui est une copie de cette créature, excepté que c\'est un artefact en plus de ses autres types. Exilez ensuite tous les autres jetons créés par les Artisans faeries.", \'type\': \'Créature : peuple fée et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623303&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d9e6e05-eeab-4dc6-864c-81485305171e\', \'multiverseId\': 623303}, \'multiverseid\': 623303}, {\'name\': \'フェアリーの職工\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nトークンでないクリーチャー１体が対戦相手のコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、他のタイプに加えてアーティファクトでもあることを除きそれのコピーであるトークン１体を生成する。その後、フェアリーの職工が生成してそれでないすべてのトークンを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be68be3b-d68b-45d2-8fd3-f1f7907336fe\', \'multiverseId\': 623705}, \'multiverseid\': 623705}, {\'name\': \'仙灵工匠\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当一个非衍生物的生物在对手操控下进战场时，派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为该生物的复制品，但额外具有神器此类别。然后放逐所有以仙灵工匠派出的其他衍生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～仙灵／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02ab2fdf-9f09-402a-aaec-71e82f88a18d\', \'multiverseId\': 624107}, \'multiverseid\': 624107}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feen-Handwerker\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur unter der Kontrolle eines Gegners ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie jener Kreatur ist, außer dass er zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Typen ein Artefakt ist. Schicke dann alle anderen von den Feen-Handwerkern erzeugten Spielsteine ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626513&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0703b247-eed0-48a0-b132-80f8c6a1e952\', \'multiverseId\': 626513}, \'multiverseid\': 626513}, {\'name\': \'Artisans faeries\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature non-jeton arrive sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle d\'un adversaire, créez un jeton qui est une copie de cette créature, excepté que c\'est un artefact en plus de ses autres types. Exilez ensuite tous les autres jetons créés par les Artisans faeries.", \'type\': \'Créature : peuple fée et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626853&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'948d0301-f0b9-425c-8c6a-0c6c0e014a42\', \'multiverseId\': 626853}, \'multiverseid\': 626853}, {\'name\': \'フェアリーの職工\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nトークンでないクリーチャー１体が対戦相手のコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、他のタイプに加えてアーティファクトでもあることを除きそれのコピーであるトークン１体を生成する。その後、フェアリーの職工が生成してそれでないすべてのトークンを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4487bb90-0e07-4e2b-b318-385b250f6fe6\', \'multiverseId\': 627193}, \'multiverseid\': 627193}, {\'name\': \'仙灵工匠\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当一个非衍生物的生物在对手操控下进战场时，派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为该生物的复制品，但额外具有神器此类别。然后放逐所有以仙灵工匠派出的其他衍生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～仙灵／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cc59e50-9c79-4c9a-8863-d624e8274174\', \'multiverseId\': 627533}, \'multiverseid\': 627533}]', '[{\'name\': \'Felidar-Zuflucht\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eines —\\n• Erzeuge einen 2/2 weißen Katze-Bestie-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n• Lege auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke. Die Kreaturen erhalten Wachsamkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625483&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6fb1fa2-39ad-4a5a-ae02-57c481485cab\', \'multiverseId\': 625483}, \'multiverseid\': 625483}, {\'name\': \'Refuge félidar\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Créez un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Chat et Bête.\\n• Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez. Ces créatures acquièrent la vigilance jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625740&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c7ed347-45f9-45d0-8516-4199ce686734\', \'multiverseId\': 625740}, \'multiverseid\': 625740}, {\'name\': \'フェリダーの撤退\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・白の２/２の猫・ビースト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n・あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上に、それぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。ターン終了時まで、それらのクリーチャーは警戒を得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'647316bd-a83e-4355-a068-c5b671f4fbc0\', \'multiverseId\': 625997}, \'multiverseid\': 625997}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fellwarstein\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe, das ein Land, das ein Gegner kontrolliert, produzieren könnte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Nichts zerstört ein friedliches Leben so gründlich wie neu erlangter Reichtum.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624487&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84aec19a-13b7-481b-81f3-5211d1c57380\', \'multiverseId\': 624487}, \'multiverseid\': 624487}, {\'name\': \'Piedra de Fellwar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color que pueda producir una tierra que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Nada acaba con una vida tranquila como unas riquezas recién descubiertas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a135d34a-96fd-497c-940a-b129aab795a6\', \'multiverseId\': 624533}, \'multiverseid\': 624533}, {\'name\': \'Pierre de Guermont\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix qu\'un terrain qu\'un adversaire contrôle pourrait produire.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Rien ne bouscule une vie tranquille aussi bien que l\'acquisition de nouvelles richesses.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624579&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62ecae77-d835-49eb-827d-c65cbbffc23d\', \'multiverseId\': 624579}, \'multiverseid\': 624579}, {\'name\': \'友なる石\', \'text\': \'{T}：対戦相手がコントロールしている土地が生み出すことのできる色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'新たに見つかった富ほど平和な生活を砕くものもない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624671&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8368fe05-4983-41cf-865b-054eb2b82a3d\', \'multiverseId\': 624671}, \'multiverseid\': 624671}, {\'name\': \'战野之石\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为由对手操控的地能产生之任一颜色。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'新现财富，乃是平静生活的最大克星。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b20776ff-6c9b-4486-a687-1de53ee32cb6\', \'multiverseId\': 624763}, \'multiverseid\': 624763}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fellwarstein\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe, das ein Land, das ein Gegner kontrolliert, produzieren könnte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Was besitzt du, das ich nicht erlangen kann?"\\n—Mairsil der Täuscher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628080&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca079bb6-bb5a-4cb8-83dc-e514747574cc\', \'multiverseId\': 628080}, \'multiverseid\': 628080}, {\'name\': \'Piedra de Fellwar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color que pueda producir una tierra que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Qué tienes que yo no pueda obtener?".\\n—Mairsil, el Usurpador\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95f63b97-b86a-4f35-9d5e-986533b0c76f\', \'multiverseId\': 628314}, \'multiverseid\': 628314}, {\'name\': \'友なる石\', \'text\': \'{T}：対戦相手がコントロールしている土地が生み出すことのできる色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「お前は、私が手に入れられない何を持っているのだ？」\\n――偽善者、メアシル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bd35d5b-d3db-4626-88e8-b5a5f4f0b301\', \'multiverseId\': 628782}, \'multiverseid\': 628782}, {\'name\': \'战野之石\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为由对手操控的地能产生之任一颜色。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「你有的东西，哪一样我得不到？」\\n～伪装者梅西尔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ba35a3f-d79c-474f-8e0c-f6d83d70892f\', \'multiverseId\': 629250}, \'multiverseid\': 629250}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ferne Melodie\', \'text\': \'Bestimme einen Kreaturentyp. Ziehe für jede bleibende Karte des bestimmten Typs, die du kontrollierst, eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Oonas Gesang klingt wie ein pervertierter Essensgong. Alle Feen kehren heim, doch nur Oona schlemmt — sie genießt die gestohlenen Träume und Gerüchte, die ihr aufgetischt werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625508&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'deb79a55-c5dc-4e2a-82f0-8a5681a893cc\', \'multiverseId\': 625508}, \'multiverseid\': 625508}, {\'name\': \'Mélodie lointaine\', \'text\': \'Choisissez un type de créature. Piochez une carte pour chaque permanent de ce type que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Le chant d\'Oona invite au dîner. Toutes les færies rentrent au bercail, mais c\'est Oona qui festoie des rêves et des rumeurs qu\'elles lui rapportent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625765&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09f71a29-04ad-49fd-a524-5063cf1f1e78\', \'multiverseId\': 625765}, \'multiverseid\': 625765}, {\'name\': \'遠くの旋律\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。あなたがコントロールしていてそのタイプを持つパーマネント１つにつき１枚のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ウーナの歌は、奇妙な夕食のベルのようだ。妖精はすべて住処に帰るが、ご馳走にあずかるのはウーナ自身だ。彼らが持ってきた盗まれた夢や噂話をいただくのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d8645bf-ab19-4a21-99a5-1c79ac0f72f2\', \'multiverseId\': 626022}, \'multiverseid\': 626022}]', "[{'name': 'Fernglas des Erforschers', 'text': 'Immer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur angreift, schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Falls es eine Länderkarte ist, kannst du sie getappt ins Spiel bringen.\\nAusrüsten {1} ({1}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628078&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4986e025-89ff-46f3-8a05-d07cab9c3b42', 'multiverseId': 628078}, 'multiverseid': 628078}, {'name': 'Telescopio del explorador', 'text': 'Siempre que la criatura equipada ataque, mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Si es una carta de tierra, puedes ponerla en el campo de batalla girada.\\nEquipar {1}. ({1}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)', 'type': 'Artefacto — Equipo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628312&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0c0ae75c-573f-45a4-b007-0ce467612a55', 'multiverseId': 628312}, 'multiverseid': 628312}, {'name': '探検者の望遠鏡', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。それが土地・カードなら、それをタップ状態で戦場に出してもよい。\\n装備{1}（{1}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628780&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e5f0866c-c1f9-464b-b348-e3af11d221ce', 'multiverseId': 628780}, 'multiverseid': 628780}, {'name': '探险家望远镜', 'text': '每当佩带此武具的生物攻击时，检视你的牌库顶牌。若它是地牌，则你可以将之横置放进战场。\\n佩带{1}（{1}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）', 'type': '神器 ～武具', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629248&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd3203331-e241-4cd6-b657-299ff70d07d2', 'multiverseId': 629248}, 'multiverseid': 629248}]", '[{\'name\': \'Fernsuche\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene-, Insel-, Sumpf- oder Gebirge-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Diese Stadt muss wirklich riesig sein, denn ich bin weit gereist und habe doch noch keinen Ort gefunden, wo die Gebäude aufhören."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625556&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af5f8db6-5881-4161-907b-8fd6cebc2c53\', \'multiverseId\': 625556}, \'multiverseid\': 625556}, {\'name\': \'Cherchauloin\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine, d\'île, de marais ou de montagne, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Que cette cité est vaste... J\'ai tant voyagé, j\'ai vu tant de choses, et pourtant, jamais je n\'ai trouvé un lieu où les constructions s\'arrêtent. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625813&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57963f41-ebf4-4477-8d94-f70bbbaf287a\', \'multiverseId\': 625813}, \'multiverseid\': 625813}, {\'name\': \'遥か見\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから平地や島や沼や山であるカード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「この都市は本当になんて巨大なんだろう。あちこちを旅して様々な物を見てきたけれど、どこを見ても建物が続いているよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cad33489-7a7e-4a68-ae55-45d44bb9e5cf\', \'multiverseId\': 626070}, \'multiverseid\': 626070}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fesselung der alten Götter\', \'text\': \'(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI — Zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist und die ein Gegner kontrolliert.\\nII — Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Wald-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\\nIII — Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Todesberührung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Sage\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625579&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60d6796b-1131-4d65-9a21-965a667fd238\', \'multiverseId\': 625579}, \'multiverseid\': 625579}, {\'name\': \'Emprisonnement des dieux anciens\', \'text\': "(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI — Détruisez un permanent non-terrain ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle.\\nII — Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de forêt, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.\\nIII — Les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent le contact mortel jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625836&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'525960bb-9603-42b5-9c13-b350af8bb577\', \'multiverseId\': 625836}, \'multiverseid\': 625836}, {\'name\': \'古き神々への拘束\', \'text\': \'（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンター１個を加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI ― 対戦相手がコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\nII ― あなたのライブラリーから森・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\\nIII ― ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは接死を得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — 英雄譚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d421971-fd54-4259-b718-45120a9e3330\', \'multiverseId\': 626093}, \'multiverseid\': 626093}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feuerspurremasuri\', \'text\': \'Alle Remasuri-Kreaturen haben Eile.\\nAlle Remasuris haben „{1}, opfere diese bleibende Karte: Eine Remasuri-Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn ein neues Nest in feindseligem Territorium gebaut werden soll, lassen Remasuris ihren Selbsterhaltungstrieb ganz und gar hinter sich, um das Überleben der Königin zu garantieren."\\n—Rukarumel, Tagebucheintrag\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625585&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4d1e9a7-9d99-4790-b521-0dfd86f262c6\', \'multiverseId\': 625585}, \'multiverseid\': 625585}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde houachefeu\', \'text\': "Toutes les créatures Slivoïde ont la célérité.\\nTous les slivoïdes ont « {1}, sacrifiez ce permanent : Une créature Slivoïde ciblée gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. »", \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': \'« Quand ils établissent un nouvel essaim dans un territoire hostile, les slivoïdes abandonnent tout instinct de survie individuelle pour assurer la survie de la reine. »\\n—Rukarumel, journal de recherches\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625842&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6ffa804-ded5-4bc0-a90c-6b8d4382d200\', \'multiverseId\': 625842}, \'multiverseid\': 625842}, {\'name\': \'火跡スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'すべてのスリヴァー・クリーチャーは速攻を持つ。\\nすべてのスリヴァーは「{1}, このパーマネントを生け贄に捧げる：スリヴァー・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'「敵地にて新たな巣を作るとき、スリヴァーは女王を守るために個々の自衛本能を捨てるようだ。」\\n――ルカルメルの観察日誌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1addda6-1634-4906-846d-642d4514b442\', \'multiverseId\': 626099}, \'multiverseid\': 626099}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feuerstecken\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Doppelschlag.\\nAusrüsten {2} ({2}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625611&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8115082d-14ea-4535-84de-c243df8cd8a8\', \'multiverseId\': 625611}, \'multiverseid\': 625611}, {\'name\': \'Hurlefeu\', \'text\': "La créature équipée a la double initiative.\\nÉquipement {2} ({2} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625868&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c76029c1-3957-4828-839e-69badeb4dc2a\', \'multiverseId\': 625868}, \'multiverseid\': 625868}, {\'name\': \'炎叫びの杖\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは二段攻撃を持つ。\\n装備{2}（{2}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be4dc2c7-e0e0-4cb7-86d1-e89682bac4d3\', \'multiverseId\': 626125}, \'multiverseid\': 626125}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feurige Konfluenz\', \'text\': \'Bestimme drei. Du kannst denselben Modus mehr als einmal bestimmen.\\n• Die Feurige Konfluenz fügt jeder Kreatur 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\n• Die Feurige Konfluenz fügt jedem Gegner 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626561&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdb01f2b-5544-455c-b687-3505d5bb5f76\', \'multiverseId\': 626561}, \'multiverseid\': 626561}, {\'name\': \'Confluence ardente\', \'text\': "Choisissez trois. Vous pouvez choisir le même mode plus d\'une fois.\\n• La Confluence ardente inflige 1 blessure à chaque créature.\\n• La Confluence ardente inflige 2 blessures à chaque adversaire.\\n• Détruisez un artefact ciblé.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626901&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e04a2d12-27ad-47bc-934d-639f543194d8\', \'multiverseId\': 626901}, \'multiverseid\': 626901}, {\'name\': \'焦熱の合流点\', \'text\': \'以下から３つを選ぶ。同じモードを２回以上選んでもよい。\\n・焦熱の合流点は各クリーチャーにそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\\n・焦熱の合流点は各対戦相手にそれぞれ２点のダメージを与える。\\n・アーティファクト１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d4ff2cc-e8a8-4eff-b12c-b52788eaa18d\', \'multiverseId\': 627241}, \'multiverseid\': 627241}, {\'name\': \'焰流交汇\', \'text\': \'选择三项。你可以多次选择同一项。\\n•焰流交汇对每个生物各造成1点伤害。\\n•焰流交汇向每位对手各造成2点伤害。\\n•消灭目标神器。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13f85596-d104-4b9c-b2e5-6e65bc7f59d6\', \'multiverseId\': 627581}, \'multiverseid\': 627581}]', "[{'name': 'Feurige Konfluenz', 'text': 'Bestimme drei. Du kannst denselben Modus mehr als einmal bestimmen.\\n• Die Feurige Konfluenz fügt jeder Kreatur 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\n• Die Feurige Konfluenz fügt jedem Gegner 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627920&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '146c72bb-2bc5-4e93-82d0-ec41629fd5d0', 'multiverseId': 627920}, 'multiverseid': 627920}, {'name': 'Confluencia ardiente', 'text': 'Elige tres. Puedes elegir el mismo modo más de una vez.\\n• La Confluencia ardiente hace 1 punto de daño a cada criatura.\\n• La Confluencia ardiente hace 2 puntos de daño a cada oponente.\\n• Destruye el artefacto objetivo.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628154&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6bbce4d3-8956-41e6-ac61-76b0f241cb41', 'multiverseId': 628154}, 'multiverseid': 628154}, {'name': '焦熱の合流点', 'text': '以下から３つを選ぶ。同じモードを２回以上選んでもよい。\\n・焦熱の合流点は各クリーチャーにそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\\n・焦熱の合流点は各対戦相手にそれぞれ２点のダメージを与える。\\n・アーティファクト１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628622&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bab807d6-2251-4aaf-8d88-66f4f070079f', 'multiverseId': 628622}, 'multiverseid': 628622}, {'name': '焰流交汇', 'text': '选择三项。你可以多次选择同一项。\\n•焰流交汇对每个生物各造成1点伤害。\\n•焰流交汇向每位对手各造成2点伤害。\\n•消灭目标神器。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629090&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '01ca1971-427b-410f-b1d2-454dbd218c88', 'multiverseId': 629090}, 'multiverseid': 629090}]", '[{\'name\': \'Finale der Vernichtung\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek und/oder deinen Friedhof nach einer Kreaturenkarte mit Manabetrag X oder weniger und bringe sie ins Spiel. Falls du auf diese Weise deine Bibliothek durchsuchst, mische danach. Falls X gleich 10 oder mehr ist, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +X/+X und Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Manche Zauber sind ein leises Säuseln. Andere ein lautes Brüllen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626584&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b54f8e49-6bca-4468-b084-bb5b315b0ced\', \'multiverseId\': 626584}, \'multiverseid\': 626584}, {\'name\': \'Summum de la destruction\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque et/ou votre cimetière une carte de créature avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à X et mettez-la sur le champ de bataille. Si vous cherchez dans votre bibliothèque de cette manière, mélangez. Si X est supérieur ou égal à 10, les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +X/+X et acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Certains sorts chantent une douce mélodie. D\'autres rugissent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626924&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36d0eac2-cc23-4c2b-9dcc-2d28c0feb635\', \'multiverseId\': 626924}, \'multiverseid\': 626924}, {\'name\': \'破滅の終焉\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーや墓地から、マナ総量がＸ以下であるクリーチャー・カード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。これによりあなたのライブラリーからカードを探したなら、ライブラリーを切り直す。Ｘが10以上なら、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受け速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'静寂を奏でる呪文もあるが、咆哮する呪文もある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b20961f9-4fdd-4837-bcc5-ee336bcfa160\', \'multiverseId\': 627264}, \'multiverseid\': 627264}, {\'name\': \'幻灭终时\', \'text\': \'从你牌库和／或你坟墓场中搜寻一张法术力值等于或小于X的生物牌，并将之放进战场。如果你以此法搜寻你的牌库，则洗牌。如果X等于或大于10，则直到回合结束，由你操控的生物得+X/+X且获得敏捷异能。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'有些咒语低吟浅唱，有些则放声咆哮。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9a8462e-e4a1-4768-9ced-da2503ea668b\', \'multiverseId\': 627604}, \'multiverseid\': 627604}]', "[{'name': 'Finale der Vernichtung', 'text': 'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek und/oder deinen Friedhof nach einer Kreaturenkarte mit Manabetrag X oder weniger und bringe sie ins Spiel. Falls du auf diese Weise deine Bibliothek durchsuchst, mische danach. Falls X gleich 10 oder mehr ist, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +X/+X und Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Manche Zauber sind ein leises Säuseln. Andere ein lautes Brüllen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627987&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1fdd139a-64d9-40a4-9138-b87c59609eb5', 'multiverseId': 627987}, 'multiverseid': 627987}, {'name': 'Final de devastación', 'text': 'Busca en tu biblioteca y/o cementerio una carta de criatura con valor de maná de X o menos y ponla en el campo de batalla. Si buscas en tu biblioteca de esta manera, baraja. Si X es 10 o más, las criaturas que controlas obtienen +X/+X y ganan la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'Algunos hechizos resuenan con una suave melodía. Otros rugen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628221&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd2fe320-869b-471c-8388-a0b45e3762f3', 'multiverseId': 628221}, 'multiverseid': 628221}, {'name': '破滅の終焉', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーや墓地から、マナ総量がＸ以下であるクリーチャー・カード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。これによりあなたのライブラリーからカードを探したなら、ライブラリーを切り直す。Ｘが10以上なら、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受け速攻を得る。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '静寂を奏でる呪文もあるが、咆哮する呪文もある。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628689&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '071f5939-c164-4aee-bac4-2ce422ed79ab', 'multiverseId': 628689}, 'multiverseid': 628689}, {'name': '幻灭终时', 'text': '从你牌库和／或你坟墓场中搜寻一张法术力值等于或小于X的生物牌，并将之放进战场。如果你以此法搜寻你的牌库，则洗牌。如果X等于或大于10，则直到回合结束，由你操控的生物得+X/+X且获得敏捷异能。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '有些咒语低吟浅唱，有些则放声咆哮。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629157&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '79d87a48-c1d7-4934-9d0d-4aa91acb1efe', 'multiverseId': 629157}, 'multiverseid': 629157}]", '[{\'name\': \'Finale der Vernichtung\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek und/oder deinen Friedhof nach einer Kreaturenkarte mit Manabetrag X oder weniger und bringe sie ins Spiel. Falls du auf diese Weise deine Bibliothek durchsuchst, mische danach. Falls X gleich 10 oder mehr ist, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +X/+X und Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Mit einem Brüllen wurde der Wald lebendig.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624794&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a8e1eb5-0134-44b5-9e98-af1b1b9dd289\', \'multiverseId\': 624794}, \'multiverseid\': 624794}, {\'name\': \'Final de devastación\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca y/o cementerio una carta de criatura con valor de maná de X o menos y ponla en el campo de batalla. Si buscas en tu biblioteca de esta manera, baraja. Si X es 10 o más, las criaturas que controlas obtienen +X/+X y ganan la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Con un rugido, el bosque cobró vida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'191eccf2-59f2-47d9-88d8-0e8678ad84c3\', \'multiverseId\': 624806}, \'multiverseid\': 624806}, {\'name\': \'Summum de la destruction\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque et/ou votre cimetière une carte de créature avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à X et mettez-la sur le champ de bataille. Si vous cherchez dans votre bibliothèque de cette manière, mélangez. Si X est supérieur ou égal à 10, les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +X/+X et acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Avec un rugissement, la forêt prit vie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624818&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6daa0886-d4ef-4c9c-9fdd-5ac13dfee7c3\', \'multiverseId\': 624818}, \'multiverseid\': 624818}, {\'name\': \'破滅の終焉\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーや墓地から、マナ総量がＸ以下であるクリーチャー・カード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。これによりあなたのライブラリーからカードを探したなら、ライブラリーを切り直す。Ｘが10以上なら、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受け速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'雄叫びとともに、森が暴れ出した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f978117-cced-4764-9ed6-8199eb5986c3\', \'multiverseId\': 624842}, \'multiverseid\': 624842}, {\'name\': \'幻灭终时\', \'text\': \'从你牌库和／或你坟墓场中搜寻一张法术力值等于或小于X的生物牌，并将之放进战场。如果你以此法搜寻你的牌库，则洗牌。如果X等于或大于10，则直到回合结束，由你操控的生物得+X/+X且获得敏捷异能。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'吼声过后，树林沸腾。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81e865c1-4d1d-497f-8fc1-8dc99845bdf5\', \'multiverseId\': 624866}, \'multiverseid\': 624866}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flammende Fäuste\', \'text\': \'Ziehe eine Karte. Bis zum Ende des Zuges verursacht eine Kreatur deiner Wahl Trampelschaden und erhält +1/+0 für jede Karte, die du in diesem Zug gezogen hast.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Feuer ist schon immer mein treuester Gefährte."\\n—Jared Carthalion\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627921&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31df1daa-9821-465c-a841-687ed9b71142\', \'multiverseId\': 627921}, \'multiverseid\': 627921}, {\'name\': \'Puños de llamas\', \'text\': \'Roba una carta. Hasta el final del turno, la criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de arrollar y obtiene +1/+0 por cada carta que robaste este turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"El fuego siempre fue mi más fiel compañero".\\n—Jared Carthalion\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c649459f-3859-4de4-b176-207aff6a01a0\', \'multiverseId\': 628155}, \'multiverseid\': 628155}, {\'name\': \'炎の拳\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。カード１枚を引く。ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーはトランプルを得、このターンにあなたが引いたカード１枚につき＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「炎はずっと、私の頼れる相棒だ。」\\n――ジャレッド・カルサリオン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2187b6a2-6be1-4065-835c-142e2ec79009\', \'multiverseId\': 628623}, \'multiverseid\': 628623}, {\'name\': \'火焰冲拳\', \'text\': \'抓一张牌。直到回合结束，目标生物获得践踏异能，且你本回合中每抓过一张牌，便得+1/+0。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「火焰一直是我最忠实的伙伴。」\\n～贾瑞卡萨隆\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39e16557-f53a-4334-a2b9-337c38455bed\', \'multiverseId\': 629091}, \'multiverseid\': 629091}]', "[{'name': 'Flitzender Remasuri', 'text': 'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Eile.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Remasuri', 'flavor': 'Wenn du allein durch die Wüste reist, nimmst du vielleicht an, dass du sie kommen sehen würdest, aber das wäre bereits dein dritter Fehler.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625535&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '19deb166-830c-441a-8195-f6f9cb2292be', 'multiverseId': 625535}, 'multiverseid': 625535}, {'name': 'Slivoïde flou', 'text': 'Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont la célérité.', 'type': 'Créature : slivoïde', 'flavor': 'En traversant le désert en solitaire, on penserait pouvoir les voir venir, mais ce serait commettre une troisième erreur.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625792&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6cbedf6d-7cdf-4385-9498-330e436b6d4a', 'multiverseId': 625792}, 'multiverseid': 625792}, {'name': '収差スリヴァー', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのスリヴァー・クリーチャーは速攻を持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スリヴァー', 'flavor': 'ひとりで砂漠を渡っていると、奴らが向こうから迫ってくるように見えるかもしれないが、それこそがあなたの三つ目の間違いである。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626049&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f26fc4c2-5371-4d70-a06e-38a7e920b249', 'multiverseId': 626049}, 'multiverseid': 626049}]", '[{\'name\': \'Flux-Kanalisatorin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkst, führe Wucherung durch. (Bestimme eine beliebige Anzahl an bleibenden Karten und/oder Spielern und gib ihnen dann von jeder Sorte Marke, die dort bereits liegt, eine weitere Marke.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Informiert unsere Freunde im Zehnten und schließt den Kreis. Jetzt wird es interessant."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625509&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f18e3bd-39d9-4c54-8298-708cf045d533\', \'multiverseId\': 625509}, \'multiverseid\': 625509}, {\'name\': \'Canaliseuse de flux\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort non-créature, proliférez. (Choisissez n\'importe quel nombre de permanents et/ou de joueurs, puis donnez-leur à chacun un autre marqueur de chaque sorte déjà présente.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Informez nos alliés dans la Dixième et activez le circuit. Il va se passer des choses bizarres. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625766&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba4ee3fb-b160-47ac-9ac2-62352e59a28c\', \'multiverseId\': 625766}, \'multiverseid\': 625766}, {\'name\': \'流束の媒介者\', \'text\': \'あなたがクリーチャーでない呪文１つを唱えるたび、増殖を行う。（望む数のパーマネントやプレイヤーを選び、その後すでにそこにあるカウンター１種類につき、そのカウンターをもう１個与える。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「第10管区の仲間に連絡して回路を切り替えて。様子が変よ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6c30226-6b93-43ec-84f5-c2b64975257e\', \'multiverseId\': 626023}, \'multiverseid\': 626023}]', "[{'name': 'Forest', 'text': '({T}: Add {G}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Forest', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624245&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '06450ae2-7960-4f85-b18a-eaf8a1b3c19b', 'multiverseId': 624245}, 'multiverseid': 624245}, {'name': 'Forest', 'text': '({T}: Add {G}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Forest', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624260&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8917c0cc-01d7-4fcb-8bda-3704f692bc35', 'multiverseId': 624260}, 'multiverseid': 624260}, {'name': 'Forest', 'text': '({T}: Add {G}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Forest', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624275&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0835d092-2a03-46bf-8bf5-28deedc8cdaa', 'multiverseId': 624275}, 'multiverseid': 624275}, {'name': 'Forest', 'text': '({T}: Add {G}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Forest', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624305&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '89d72d68-f826-45dc-a6a3-504a07261628', 'multiverseId': 624305}, 'multiverseid': 624305}, {'name': 'Forest', 'text': '({T}: Add {G}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Forest', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624335&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b3236130-77be-46c3-a821-0c68991908e4', 'multiverseId': 624335}, 'multiverseid': 624335}]", "[{'name': 'Forest', 'text': '({T}: Add {G}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Forest', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624246&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5786f0b4-9156-426a-9587-107abebeae83', 'multiverseId': 624246}, 'multiverseid': 624246}, {'name': 'Forest', 'text': '({T}: Add {G}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Forest', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624261&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2444162f-07bb-4c15-ae5b-c63d90de3750', 'multiverseId': 624261}, 'multiverseid': 624261}, {'name': 'Forest', 'text': '({T}: Add {G}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Forest', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624276&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2b193eb5-7e0d-4ada-b752-aa4ba9614e04', 'multiverseId': 624276}, 'multiverseid': 624276}, {'name': 'Forest', 'text': '({T}: Add {G}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Forest', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624306&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9dee7cdf-3102-40ed-aa97-52a6b27cc522', 'multiverseId': 624306}, 'multiverseid': 624306}, {'name': 'Forest', 'text': '({T}: Add {G}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Forest', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624336&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '426354c2-03fc-4a88-822d-b541c6ae69f5', 'multiverseId': 624336}, 'multiverseid': 624336}]", "[{'name': 'Forest', 'text': '({T}: Add {G}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Forest', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624247&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '603a4bd2-8641-4f56-8200-9cc96bd0eda8', 'multiverseId': 624247}, 'multiverseid': 624247}, {'name': 'Forest', 'text': '({T}: Add {G}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Forest', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624262&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5eb63018-18bd-4acb-97fe-db975a891125', 'multiverseId': 624262}, 'multiverseid': 624262}, {'name': 'Forest', 'text': '({T}: Add {G}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Forest', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624277&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3545f1ac-90f5-4103-991e-56304f11eda9', 'multiverseId': 624277}, 'multiverseid': 624277}, {'name': 'Forest', 'text': '({T}: Add {G}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Forest', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624307&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '422bf7ad-ed66-471d-a4a8-aa881162373c', 'multiverseId': 624307}, 'multiverseid': 624307}, {'name': 'Forest', 'text': '({T}: Add {G}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Forest', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624337&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b6d5fdcf-84d4-4cfb-8270-888690581ce3', 'multiverseId': 624337}, 'multiverseid': 624337}]", '[{\'name\': \'Freyalise, Llanowars Zorn\', \'text\': \'+2: Erzeuge einen 1/1 grünen Elf-Druide-Kreaturenspielstein mit „{T}: Erzeuge {G}."\\n−2: Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\\n−6: Ziehe für jede grüne Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine Karte.\\nFreyalise, Llanowars Zorn, kann dein Kommandeur sein.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Freyalise\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626585&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6344edc-0264-47c6-9d6d-6da2c85a0199\', \'multiverseId\': 626585}, \'multiverseid\': 626585}, {\'name\': \'Freyalise, Fureur de Llanowar\', \'text\': \'+2: Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Elfe et Druide avec « {T} : Ajoutez {G}. »\\n-2: Détruisez une cible, artefact ou enchantement.\\n−6: Piochez une carte pour chaque créature verte que vous contrôlez.\\nFreyalise, Fureur de Llanowar peut être votre commandant.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Freyalise\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626925&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1da5d4ce-3ad1-4ab3-80d3-7514f6d36729\', \'multiverseId\': 626925}, \'multiverseid\': 626925}, {\'name\': \'ラノワールの憤激、フレイアリーズ\', \'text\': \'+2：「{T}：{G}を加える。」を持つ緑の１/１のエルフ・ドルイド・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n-2：アーティファクトやエンチャントのうち１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n-6：あなたがコントロールしている緑のクリーチャー１体につきカード１枚を引く。\\nラノワールの憤激、フレイアリーズは統率者として使用できる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — フレイアリーズ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0ac4997-b987-4437-b68e-4613014dedce\', \'multiverseId\': 627265}, \'multiverseid\': 627265}, {\'name\': \'罗堰之怒妃雅丽兹\', \'text\': \'+2：派出一个1/1绿色妖精／德鲁伊衍生生物，且具有「{T}：加{G}。」\\n-2：消灭目标神器或结界。\\n−6：你每操控一个绿色生物，便抓一张牌。\\n罗堰之怒妃雅丽兹可用作指挥官。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～妃雅丽兹\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60768ea9-20a9-4f9f-a78c-84d0b7846e7e\', \'multiverseId\': 627605}, \'multiverseid\': 627605}]', '[{\'name\': \'Freyalise, Llanowars Zorn\', \'text\': \'+2: Erzeuge einen 1/1 grünen Elf-Druide-Kreaturenspielstein mit „{T}: Erzeuge {G}."\\n−2: Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\\n−6: Ziehe für jede grüne Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine Karte.\\nFreyalise, Llanowars Zorn, kann dein Kommandeur sein.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Freyalise\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627988&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'466dcc36-a236-4567-8abc-03560c2fd988\', \'multiverseId\': 627988}, \'multiverseid\': 627988}, {\'name\': \'Freyalise, furia de Llanowar\', \'text\': \'+2: Crea una ficha de criatura Druida Elfo verde 1/1 con "{T}: Agrega {G}".\\n−2: Destruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo.\\n−6: Roba una carta por cada criatura verde que controlas.\\nFreyalise, furia de Llanowar puede ser tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Freyalise\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e39ca0d-fd0e-43dd-a0f2-52f9349f0677\', \'multiverseId\': 628222}, \'multiverseid\': 628222}, {\'name\': \'ラノワールの憤激、フレイアリーズ\', \'text\': \'+2：「{T}：{G}を加える。」を持つ緑の１/１のエルフ・ドルイド・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n-2：アーティファクトやエンチャントのうち１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n-6：あなたがコントロールしている緑のクリーチャー１体につきカード１枚を引く。\\nラノワールの憤激、フレイアリーズは統率者として使用できる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — フレイアリーズ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08fe4b71-e7ef-4611-9c27-555c9781bdf6\', \'multiverseId\': 628690}, \'multiverseid\': 628690}, {\'name\': \'罗堰之怒妃雅丽兹\', \'text\': \'+2：派出一个1/1绿色妖精／德鲁伊衍生生物，且具有「{T}：加{G}。」\\n-2：消灭目标神器或结界。\\n−6：你每操控一个绿色生物，便抓一张牌。\\n罗堰之怒妃雅丽兹可用作指挥官。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～妃雅丽兹\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c614038-5683-44e7-a54e-8b0a8908ccc4\', \'multiverseId\': 629158}, \'multiverseid\': 629158}]', '[{\'name\': \'Funken-Doppelgänger\', \'text\': \'Du kannst den Funken-Doppelgänger als Kopie einer Kreatur oder eines Planeswalkers, die bzw. den du kontrollierst, ins Spiel kommen lassen, außer dass er mit einer zusätzlichen +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel kommt, falls er eine Kreatur ist, mit einer zusätzlichen Loyalitätsmarke ins Spiel kommt, falls er ein Planeswalker ist, und nicht legendär ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Illusion\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625518&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f67c8701-e022-47ba-b6a3-b0460e5f9fea\', \'multiverseId\': 625518}, \'multiverseid\': 625518}, {\'name\': "Doublure d\'étincelles", \'text\': "Vous pouvez faire que la Doublure d\'étincelles arrive sur le champ de bataille comme une copie d\'une créature ou d\'un planeswalker que vous contrôlez, excepté qu\'elle arrive avec, sur elle, un marqueur +1/+1 supplémentaire si c\'est une créature, un marqueur « loyauté » supplémentaire si c\'est un planeswalker, et qu\'elle n\'est pas légendaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : illusion\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625775&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9291fa3-c1d2-45df-9f18-7d957aa1ad2a\', \'multiverseId\': 625775}, \'multiverseid\': 625775}, {\'name\': \'灯の分身\', \'text\': \'あなたは灯の分身を、これがクリーチャーなら＋１/＋１カウンターが追加で１個置かれた状態で戦場に出ることと、これがプレインズウォーカーなら忠誠カウンターが追加で１個置かれた状態で戦場に出ることと、伝説でないことを除き、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうちあなたがコントロールしている１体のコピーとして戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — イリュージョン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce4d670a-639c-490d-bc73-57fda558ecba\', \'multiverseId\': 626032}, \'multiverseid\': 626032}]', '[{\'name\': \'Furchteinflößende Rückkehr\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\\nRückblende — Opfere drei Kreaturen. (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Wer die Schrecken der Vergangenheit vergisst, ist verdammt, ihnen eines Tages wieder zu begegnen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622962&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5e60ad9-6e91-4b98-bb69-4d7d0d3b12be\', \'multiverseId\': 622962}, \'multiverseid\': 622962}, {\'name\': \'Regreso pavoroso\', \'text\': \'Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\\nRetrospectiva—Sacrificar tres criaturas. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Aquellos que olvidan los horrores del pasado están condenados a reencontrarlos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62f5e336-a0ef-4bf0-a3ee-090d308a6f58\', \'multiverseId\': 623163}, \'multiverseid\': 623163}, {\'name\': "Retour de l\'effroi", \'text\': \'Renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière.\\nFlashback — Sacrifiez trois créatures. (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Ceux qui oublient les horreurs du passé sont condamnés à les rencontrer à nouveau.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623364&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13046009-1d81-4157-8580-c548ef55d366\', \'multiverseId\': 623364}, \'multiverseid\': 623364}, {\'name\': \'戦慄の復活\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。\\nフラッシュバック―クリーチャー３体を生け贄に捧げる。（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'過去の邪霊を忘れた者は、それと再び出会う運命にある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acf8d14a-3b25-45e5-839b-e90c7de1a2e7\', \'multiverseId\': 623766}, \'multiverseid\': 623766}, {\'name\': \'颤栗再现\', \'text\': \'将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\\n返照～牺牲三个生物。（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'忘却过往梦魇的人，注定倒霉要再度碰上。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25f82020-e9ce-4bbe-a4bb-3004dda257b4\', \'multiverseId\': 624168}, \'multiverseid\': 624168}]', '[{\'name\': \'Furchteinflößende Rückkehr\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\\nRückblende — Opfere drei Kreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Das meiste Glück hatten die Tempeldiener, die nicht lang genug überlebten, um die Rückkehr des Erzdämons mitzuerleben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624467&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2fd6ffa-c534-4aa8-b1f4-92c35f344542\', \'multiverseId\': 624467}, \'multiverseid\': 624467}, {\'name\': \'Regreso pavoroso\', \'text\': \'Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\\nRetrospectiva—Sacrificar tres criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los acólitos más afortunados fueron aquellos que no sobrevivieron para presenciar el regreso del archidemonio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce8dcfa4-5768-4083-82bc-c596b3a80a38\', \'multiverseId\': 624513}, \'multiverseid\': 624513}, {\'name\': "Retour de l\'effroi", \'text\': \'Renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière.\\nFlashback — Sacrifiez trois créatures.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les acolytes les plus chanceux furent ceux qui ne survécurent pas assez longtemps pour assister au retour de l\'archifielleux.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624559&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9de7adcd-6faa-46e9-9dd7-55341290358e\', \'multiverseId\': 624559}, \'multiverseid\': 624559}, {\'name\': \'戦慄の復活\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。\\nフラッシュバック ― クリーチャー３体を生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'最も幸運な侍祭とは、魔神の復活を拝めるほど長生きしなかった者たちである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cc40b85-dfe5-4510-8b72-cbefc38869e9\', \'multiverseId\': 624651}, \'multiverseid\': 624651}, {\'name\': \'颤栗再现\', \'text\': \'将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\\n返照～牺牲三个生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'最幸运的侍僧，是那些未能活到亲眼见证翼邪魔复生者。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d88028d-a175-4c08-9a63-9b9065669dec\', \'multiverseId\': 624743}, \'multiverseid\': 624743}]', "[{'name': 'Furioser Aufstieg', 'text': 'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls du eine Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr kontrollierst, schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst die Karte spielen, bis du eine andere Karte mit dem Furiosen Aufstieg ins Exil schickst.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': 'Klothys zog aus, das Schicksal von Theros zu flicken, ihre Nadel von Zorn geführt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627923&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dc3e266d-ac4e-442e-9d56-4b3cc68c506f', 'multiverseId': 627923}, 'multiverseid': 627923}, {'name': 'Alzamiento furioso', 'text': 'Al comienzo de tu paso final, si controlas una criatura con fuerza de 4 o más, exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugar esa carta hasta que exilies otra carta con el Alzamiento furioso.', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': 'Klothys comenzó a tejer de nuevo el destino de Theros, y la furia dirigía todas y cada una de sus puntadas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628157&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7939cbad-25d2-4f3f-b191-afef49af4f1e', 'multiverseId': 628157}, 'multiverseid': 628157}, {'name': '猛然たる顕現', 'text': 'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたがパワーが４以上であるクリーチャーをコントロールしている場合、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。あなたが猛然たる顕現によってそれでないカード１枚を追放するまで、そのカードをプレイしてもよい。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': 'クローティスはテーロスの運命を繕い始めた。その縫い目は怒りに導かれていた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628625&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '304f323f-3531-4753-9ef6-98b2e6a72a71', 'multiverseId': 628625}, 'multiverseid': 628625}, {'name': '怒火昂扬', 'text': '在你的结束步骤开始时，若你操控力量等于或大于4的生物，则放逐你的牌库顶牌。你可以使用该牌，直到你以怒火昂扬放逐另一张牌为止。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': '克洛缇丝着手修补塞洛斯的命运，每针都由怒火引线。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629093&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e624999-9f00-4491-9799-b967c46ff335', 'multiverseId': 629093}, 'multiverseid': 629093}]", '[{\'name\': \'Futter für den Schwarm\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. Du verlierst Lebenspunkte in Höhe des Manabetrags jener bleibenden Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Auf abscheulichen Schwingen und blutigem Wind wird sich der Schwarm erheben."\\n—Inschrift einer Himmelsfestung\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622968&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68ef5aac-c0c2-42dd-a5ff-465c42e4f757\', \'multiverseId\': 622968}, \'multiverseid\': 622968}, {\'name\': \'Alimentar al enjambre\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura o encantamiento objetivo que controla un oponente. Pierdes una cantidad de vidas igual al valor de maná de ese permanente.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"El enjambre se alzará con alas repugnantes y viento ensangrentado".\\n—Inscripción de aerorruina\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d97da2d4-6f59-408d-963d-a5344f899366\', \'multiverseId\': 623169}, \'multiverseid\': 623169}, {\'name\': "Nourrir l\'essaim", \'text\': "Détruisez une cible, créature ou enchantement, qu\'un adversaire contrôle. Vous perdez un nombre de points de vie égal à la valeur de mana de ce permanent.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« L\'essaim s\'envolera sur ses ailes infâmes, porté par un vent sanglant. »\\n—Inscription sur un fort céleste", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623370&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7a2f44e-0d02-44d5-835b-b81db4b3e58a\', \'multiverseId\': 623370}, \'multiverseid\': 623370}, {\'name\': \'大群への給餌\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやエンチャントのうち対戦相手がコントロールしている１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。あなたは、そのパーマネントのマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「不快な翼と血の風により大群が起きるだろう。」\\n――スカイクレイブの碑文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ceab124-86ee-493b-a4aa-1158bf136880\', \'multiverseId\': 623772}, \'multiverseid\': 623772}, {\'name\': \'喂饱虫群\', \'text\': \'消灭目标由对手操控的生物或结界。你失去等同于该永久物之法术力值的生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「邪翼蔽日，血雨腥风，虫群必将崛起。」\\n～空境铭文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdf81ba8-3d38-4a3c-85e4-977a4a19fb9c\', \'multiverseId\': 624174}, \'multiverseid\': 624174}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fäulnisschlurfer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Fäulnisschlurfer.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pilzwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Falls ich sterbe, verfüttert mich an einen Schlurfer. Dann tue ich wenigstens noch etwas Gutes."\\n—Ryza, Oran-Rief-Späher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628016&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c5e3ce1-39bf-4352-a995-6e25c865670c\', \'multiverseId\': 628016}, \'multiverseid\': 628016}, {\'name\': \'Reptador pútrido\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura que controlas muera, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Reptador pútrido.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hongo\', \'flavor\': \'"Si muero, echadme de comer a un reptador. Así al menos haré algún bien".\\n—Ryza, exploradora de Oran-Rief\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f17d7735-82fe-45c9-bd0a-647483acfbbd\', \'multiverseId\': 628250}, \'multiverseid\': 628250}, {\'name\': \'腐敗のシャンブラー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、腐敗のシャンブラーの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファンガス\', \'flavor\': \'「私が死んだら、シャンブラーに食わせてやって。そうすれば私も少しは役に立つでしょう。」\\n――オラン＝リーフの斥候、ライザ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42097f66-2e8f-4e78-ad94-fd9ef7db4da4\', \'multiverseId\': 628718}, \'multiverseid\': 628718}, {\'name\': \'腐臭跛行兽\', \'text\': \'每当另一个由你操控的生物死去时，在腐臭跛行兽上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～真菌\', \'flavor\': \'「如果我死了，就把我喂给跛行兽吧。至少那样，我还算是做了件有用的事。」\\n～欧兰黎斥候莱莎\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68d6b65b-359b-4c08-9aa6-77c1e32f1ed1\', \'multiverseId\': 629186}, \'multiverseid\': 629186}]', '[{\'name\': \'Für die Ahnen\', \'text\': \'Bestimme einen Kreaturentyp. Schaue dir die obersten sechs Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine beliebige Anzahl an Karten des bestimmten Typs offen vorzeigen und die vorgezeigten Karten auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\\nRückblende {3}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625137&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e257ddf9-60e0-4b59-8a6c-66e633bb8558\', \'multiverseId\': 625137}, \'multiverseid\': 625137}, {\'name\': \'Pour les ancêtres\', \'text\': "Choisissez un type de créature. Regardez les six cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler n\'importe quel nombre de cartes du type choisi parmi elles et mettre les cartes révélées dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.\\nFlashback {3}{G} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625169&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c54199c5-2bd1-4010-baad-932e9b524c10\', \'multiverseId\': 625169}, \'multiverseid\': 625169}, {\'name\': \'祖先のために\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード６枚を見る。「その中から望む枚数のその選ばれたタイプのカードを公開し、あなたの手札に加える。」を選んでもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\\nフラッシュバック{3}{G}（あなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eac21c91-4e2f-45f1-bb02-7b994519ebfc\', \'multiverseId\': 625201}, \'multiverseid\': 625201}]', '[{\'name\': \'Für die Ahnen\', \'text\': \'Bestimme einen Kreaturentyp. Schaue dir die obersten sechs Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine beliebige Anzahl an Karten des bestimmten Typs offen vorzeigen und die vorgezeigten Karten auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\\nRückblende {3}{G}\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624931&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47ad27c1-2cf6-4bda-a4cf-8653256d182b\', \'multiverseId\': 624931}, \'multiverseid\': 624931}, {\'name\': \'Pour les ancêtres\', \'text\': "Choisissez un type de créature. Regardez les six cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler n\'importe quel nombre de cartes du type choisi parmi elles et mettre les cartes révélées dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.\\nFlashback {3}{G}", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624966&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8342e778-ce5b-4392-bde5-3c702a90ba90\', \'multiverseId\': 624966}, \'multiverseid\': 624966}, {\'name\': \'祖先のために\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード６枚を見る。「その中から望む枚数のその選ばれたタイプのカードを公開し、あなたの手札に加える。」を選んでもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\\nフラッシュバック{3}{G}\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be718d3e-54ad-4847-a9a0-ecf98c69c669\', \'multiverseId\': 625001}, \'multiverseid\': 625001}, {\'name\': \'为了先祖\', \'text\': \'选择一种生物类别。检视你牌库顶的六张牌。你可以展示其中任意数量为该类别的牌，并将所展示的牌置于你手上。将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你牌库底。\\n返照{3}{G}\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2619a5d-b3d8-4e9b-9ea6-346e67a8baeb\', \'multiverseId\': 625036}, \'multiverseid\': 625036}]', "[{'name': 'Gargadon', 'text': 'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nAussetzen 4 — {1}{R} (Statt diese Karte aus deiner Hand zu wirken, kannst du {1}{R} bezahlen und sie mit vier Zeitmarken ins Exil schicken. Entferne zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine Zeitmarke von ihr. Wenn die letzte Zeitmarke entfernt wird, wirke sie, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Sie hat Eile.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Bestie', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627924&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca3d19a9-1294-4b14-a2dd-4634bb4d7ca6', 'multiverseId': 627924}, 'multiverseid': 627924}, {'name': 'Gigantodón', 'text': 'Arrolla.\\nSuspender 4—{1}{R}. (En lugar de lanzar esta carta desde tu mano, puedes pagar {1}{R} y exiliarla con cuatro contadores de tiempo sobre ella. Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, remueve un contador de tiempo. Cuando remuevas el último, lánzala sin pagar su coste de maná. Tiene la habilidad de prisa.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Bestia', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628158&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a66f075e-7538-41d0-8eb2-2e73b50aca58', 'multiverseId': 628158}, 'multiverseid': 628158}, {'name': 'ガルガドン', 'text': 'トランプル\\n待機４―{1}{R}（このカードをあなたの手札から唱えるのではなく、{1}{R}を支払って時間カウンター４個を置いた状態で追放してもよい。あなたのアップキープの開始時に、時間カウンター１個を取り除く。最後の１個が取り除かれたとき、これをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱える。これは速攻を持つ。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ビースト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628626&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '62771ca5-8e13-41a6-9355-11017afe5cb6', 'multiverseId': 628626}, 'multiverseid': 628626}, {'name': '乳齿巨象', 'text': '践踏\\n延缓4～{1}{R}（除了从你手上施放此牌，你可以支付{1}{R}并将它放逐，且上面有四个计时指示物。在你的维持开始时，从其上移去一个计时指示物。当移去最后一个时，施放它且不需支付其法术力费用。它具有敏捷。）', 'type': '生物 ～野兽', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629094&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b1b77693-00e5-4ed6-bdaf-1a72cc0b9359', 'multiverseId': 629094}, 'multiverseid': 629094}]", "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624366&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9cf4f072-4757-45f1-99f7-de87dd0c3bef', 'multiverseId': 624366}, 'multiverseid': 624366}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624383&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb46c553-5093-4c66-9a71-2e7d691b5785', 'multiverseId': 624383}, 'multiverseid': 624383}, {'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624400&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'db21cf78-d3da-4f17-922e-9cc8f86faef1', 'multiverseId': 624400}, 'multiverseid': 624400}]", "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624367&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb332408-1476-4957-9851-07e287d3a121', 'multiverseId': 624367}, 'multiverseid': 624367}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624384&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '011534ec-6671-4a7b-8441-0145eeaaf6cf', 'multiverseId': 624384}, 'multiverseid': 624384}, {'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624401&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '50e2d6d5-f50c-4874-aadd-7130920e4356', 'multiverseId': 624401}, 'multiverseid': 624401}]", "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624368&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'af6efe28-3694-4455-b7b2-48cf435d2023', 'multiverseId': 624368}, 'multiverseid': 624368}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624385&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c875e9c6-c8de-4e96-a186-70942b53a540', 'multiverseId': 624385}, 'multiverseid': 624385}, {'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624402&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5a58e573-5e3d-499b-9d0a-ffa3817114c1', 'multiverseId': 624402}, 'multiverseid': 624402}]", "[{'name': 'Gebirgstal', 'text': 'Das Gebirgstal kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}, opfere das Gebirgstal: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Gebirge- oder Wald-Karte, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische danach.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625674&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a5cf6837-f1e1-415c-8f9e-05363ad89d65', 'multiverseId': 625674}, 'multiverseid': 625674}, {'name': 'Vallée forestière', 'text': 'La Vallée forestière arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T}, sacrifiez la Vallée forestière : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de montagne ou de forêt, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille, puis mélangez.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625931&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '655e4ddb-c70c-4925-a75b-1dd4ea063d2b', 'multiverseId': 625931}, 'multiverseid': 625931}, {'name': '山峡', 'text': '山峡はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}, 山峡を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから山や森であるカード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626188&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37ce6c77-abc7-4c80-806e-2da1f0749109', 'multiverseId': 626188}, 'multiverseid': 626188}]", "[{'name': 'Gebrochene Flügel', 'text': 'Zerstöre ein Artefakt, eine Verzauberung oder eine fliegende Kreatur deiner Wahl.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Es ist einfach, mit einem Lenkdrachen in die Luft zu kommen. Erst was danach kommt, erfordert Konzentration, Geschick und Glück.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627975&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f22ad31-bf08-4c53-9428-6e9fc1722fe9', 'multiverseId': 627975}, 'multiverseid': 627975}, {'name': 'Alas rotas', 'text': 'Destruye el artefacto, encantamiento o criatura con la habilidad de volar objetivo.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Despegar con una velacometa es una tarea sencilla. Todo lo demás requiere concentración, destreza y suerte.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628209&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0fa4a497-e098-41b9-a33c-c8b5fa24d032', 'multiverseId': 628209}, 'multiverseid': 628209}, {'name': '壊れた翼', 'text': 'アーティファクトやエンチャントや、飛行を持つクリーチャーのうち１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '帆凧で飛ぶこと自体は容易だ。重要なのはその後である。集中力や技量、そして運が必要だ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628677&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c810f99a-0f45-4c9e-9cf0-45846d784368', 'multiverseId': 628677}, 'multiverseid': 628677}, {'name': '翅翼断裂', 'text': '消灭目标神器，结界或具飞行异能的生物。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '驾驭航筝起飞升空并不难。之后的事情才需要专注、技巧和运气来应对。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629145&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'da1583dd-cd06-48b3-ab65-b410d4688405', 'multiverseId': 629145}, 'multiverseid': 629145}]", "[{'name': 'Gedankengefäß', 'text': 'Du hast keine maximale Handkartenzahl.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': 'Unendliche Möglichkeiten in einem endlichen Raum.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628112&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3b441422-552e-4ed4-8bea-13c617cb3a84', 'multiverseId': 628112}, 'multiverseid': 628112}, {'name': 'Vasija de pensamientos', 'text': 'Tu mano no tiene tamaño máximo.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': 'Posibilidades infinitas en un espacio finito.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628346&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a33912a9-a907-4c1a-ab46-0e0811d33918', 'multiverseId': 628346}, 'multiverseid': 628346}, {'name': '思考の器', 'text': 'あなたの手札の上限はなくなる。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': '有限の空間に封じ込まれた無限の可能性。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628814&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa9b5336-3f39-475f-bf9a-287b51776553', 'multiverseId': 628814}, 'multiverseid': 628814}, {'name': '思想容器', 'text': '你的手牌数量没有上限。\\n{T}：加{C}。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '有限空间内的无限可能。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629282&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e7921c5-be73-43a6-a5cd-0e942cab7453', 'multiverseId': 629282}, 'multiverseid': 629282}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gedankenlabyrinth-Zauberbuch\', \'text\': \'{T}, lege eine Seitenmarke auf das Gedankenlabyrinth-Zauberbuch: Hellsicht 1.\\n{2}, {T}, lege eine Seitenmarke auf das Gedankenlabyrinth-Zauberbuch: Ziehe eine Karte.\\nWenn vier oder mehr Seitenmarken auf dem Gedankenlabyrinth-Zauberbuch liegen, schicke es ins Exil. Falls du dies tust, erhältst du 4 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625621&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'319479c0-8ba2-4344-be43-930386145068\', \'multiverseId\': 625621}, \'multiverseid\': 625621}, {\'name\': "Grimoire du dédale de l\'esprit", \'text\': "{T}, mettez un marqueur « page » sur le Grimoire du dédale de l\'esprit : Regard 1.\\n{2},{T}, mettez un marqueur « page » sur le Grimoire du dédale de l\'esprit : Piochez une carte.\\nQuand il y a au moins quatre marqueurs « page » sur le Grimoire du dédale de l\'esprit, exilez-le. Si vous faites ainsi, vous gagnez 4 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625878&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edd510f2-9700-4a0a-8d59-15b985f0cb66\', \'multiverseId\': 625878}, \'multiverseid\': 625878}, {\'name\': \'精神迷わせの秘本\', \'text\': \'{T}, 精神迷わせの秘本の上にページ・カウンター１個を置く：占術１を行う。\\n{2}, {T}, 精神迷わせの秘本の上にページ・カウンター１個を置く：カード１枚を引く。\\n精神迷わせの秘本の上に４個以上のページ・カウンターがあるとき、これを追放する。そうしたなら、あなたは４点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f19ce706-5016-452d-9ed3-e1cd8d0298fb\', \'multiverseId\': 626135}, \'multiverseid\': 626135}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedankenstein\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere den Gedankenstein: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Was ist Mana anderes als Möglichkeit, eine Idee, der noch nicht Gestalt gegeben wurde?"\\n—Jhoira, Meisterbastlerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625623&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f9bf47e-d666-4784-828c-3b57e05dc782\', \'multiverseId\': 625623}, \'multiverseid\': 625623}, {\'name\': "Pierre de l\'esprit", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez la Pierre de l\'esprit : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Qu\'est-ce que le mana sinon une possibilité, une idée qui n\'a pas encore pris forme ? »\\n—Djoïra, maîtresse artificière", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625880&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d349798a-6dc6-4640-a9ad-26598ec76435\', \'multiverseId\': 625880}, \'multiverseid\': 625880}, {\'name\': \'精神石\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}, 精神石を生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「マナはまだ形を成していない発想よ。それが可能性でなければ何だというの？」\\n――練達の工匠、ジョイラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59e06148-db79-4077-907b-c7dc12a8e89a\', \'multiverseId\': 626137}, \'multiverseid\': 626137}]', "[{'name': 'Gedeihende Felsklippe', 'text': 'Die Gedeihende Felsklippe kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nSowie die Gedeihende Felsklippe ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eine Farbe außer Rot.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder ein Mana der bestimmten Farbe.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Im Laufe der Äonen wurde der Fels abgetragen, sodass die satten Farben im Herzen des Gebirges sichtbar wurden.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628127&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eea46642-0de1-4ed5-80cb-c0a683023da5', 'multiverseId': 628127}, 'multiverseid': 628127}, {'name': 'Risco floreciente', 'text': 'El Risco floreciente entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nEn cuanto el Risco floreciente entre al campo de batalla, elige un color que no sea rojo.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o un maná del color elegido.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'A medida que pasaban los siglos, la roca se iba erosionando, revelando así los bellos colores del corazón de la montaña.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628361&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a938e9e2-9c95-45b7-aba3-3d4a9cd94623', 'multiverseId': 628361}, 'multiverseid': 628361}, {'name': '興隆する絶壁', 'text': '興隆する絶壁はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n興隆する絶壁が戦場に出るに際し、赤でない色１色を選ぶ。\\n{T}：{R} か、その選ばれた色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '悠久の時を経て岩肌は削られ、山の中心の豊かな色彩が露わになった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628829&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd7c0a4bf-396f-43c4-bf31-7efedfa82dee', 'multiverseId': 628829}, 'multiverseid': 628829}, {'name': '兴旺绝壁', 'text': '兴旺绝壁须横置进战场。\\n于兴旺绝壁进战场时，选择一种红色以外的颜色。\\n{T}：加{R}或一点所选颜色的法术力。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '无数世代过去，石头磨损，显露出高山核心处的丰富颜色。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629297&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f3ab9492-7624-4453-a1ef-408798fc5c7c', 'multiverseId': 629297}, 'multiverseid': 629297}]", "[{'name': 'Gedeihende Heide', 'text': 'Die Gedeihende Heide kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nSowie die Gedeihende Heide ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eine Farbe außer Weiß.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder ein Mana der bestimmten Farbe.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Die Blüte der Wildblumen richtet sich hier nicht nach den Jahreszeiten, sondern nach den Gezeiten der Magie.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628129&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48c66f12-44eb-4419-93a2-9621ff462ab2', 'multiverseId': 628129}, 'multiverseid': 628129}, {'name': 'Brezal floreciente', 'text': 'El Brezal floreciente entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nEn cuanto el Brezal floreciente entre al campo de batalla, elige un color que no sea blanco.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o un maná del color elegido.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Las flores salvajes de aquí no florecen según las estaciones, sino según los altibajos y el flujo de la magia.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628363&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '289945ac-2cfe-4999-98d0-37cf3162d801', 'multiverseId': 628363}, 'multiverseid': 628363}, {'name': '興隆する荒野', 'text': '興隆する荒野はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n興隆する荒野が戦場に出るに際し、白でない色１色を選ぶ。\\n{T}：{W}か、その選ばれた色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '季節ではなく魔法の干満に従って野生の花が咲く。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628831&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a06f237f-eec3-445c-9182-4998d9bafc30', 'multiverseId': 628831}, 'multiverseid': 628831}, {'name': '兴旺荒地', 'text': '兴旺荒地须横置进战场。\\n于兴旺荒地进战场时，选择一种白色以外的颜色。\\n{T}：加{W}或一点所选颜色的法术力。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '驱使这片野花绽放的，并非季节更替，而是魔力起伏。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629299&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d30e0db-bdb0-44ed-ad86-a4a01752a7f0', 'multiverseId': 629299}, 'multiverseid': 629299}]", "[{'name': 'Gedeihende Insel', 'text': 'Die Gedeihende Insel kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nSowie die Gedeihende Insel ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eine Farbe außer Blau.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder ein Mana der bestimmten Farbe.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Alle Wunder der natürlichen Welt in einem einzigen atemberaubenden Mikrokosmos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628130&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b454ec7-96c9-47dc-825a-7dc8fd908d82', 'multiverseId': 628130}, 'multiverseid': 628130}, {'name': 'Islote floreciente', 'text': 'El Islote floreciente entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nEn cuanto el Islote floreciente entre al campo de batalla, elige un color que no sea azul.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o un maná del color elegido.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Todas las maravillas del mundo natural en un microcosmos asombroso.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628364&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '63cf5554-0fb8-4d43-82ed-0240fe478d5e', 'multiverseId': 628364}, 'multiverseid': 628364}, {'name': '興隆する島嶼', 'text': '興隆する島嶼はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n興隆する島嶼が戦場に出るに際し、青でない色１色を選ぶ。\\n{T}：{U}か、その選ばれた色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '自然界のあらゆる驚異がこの美しく小さな世界に詰まっている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628832&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e1e4cba-b570-49b9-85bb-2534c317bbc1', 'multiverseId': 628832}, 'multiverseid': 628832}, {'name': '兴旺岛屿', 'text': '兴旺岛屿须横置进战场。\\n于兴旺岛屿进战场时，选择一种蓝色以外的颜色。\\n{T}：加{U}或一点所选颜色的法术力。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '于精妙微观世界中，尽览自然伟大奇迹。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629300&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a7d48b8e-c62c-4881-9035-30a45ac44a09', 'multiverseId': 629300}, 'multiverseid': 629300}]", "[{'name': 'Gedeihender Hain', 'text': 'Der Gedeihende Hain kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nSowie der Gedeihende Hain ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eine Farbe außer Grün.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder ein Mana der bestimmten Farbe.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Menschlichen Blicken entzogen, schwirren Vögel in einem verborgenen Paradies zwischen farbenfrohen Blüten umher.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628128&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c4e438e4-4464-4b26-952d-ca038090b9df', 'multiverseId': 628128}, 'multiverseid': 628128}, {'name': 'Arboleda floreciente', 'text': 'La Arboleda floreciente entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nEn cuanto la Arboleda floreciente entre al campo de batalla, elige un color que no sea verde.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o un maná del color elegido.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Lejos de la mirada de los humanos, los pájaros revolotean entre flores en un paraíso oculto.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628362&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f3fae60a-8a36-4257-a653-ae8ecb1b1360', 'multiverseId': 628362}, 'multiverseid': 628362}, {'name': '興隆する木立', 'text': '興隆する木立はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n興隆する木立が戦場に出るに際し、緑でない色１色を選ぶ。\\n{T}：{G}か、その選ばれた色１色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '人の目に触れないこの知られざる楽園で、鳥たちは鮮やかな花々の間を飛び交っている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628830&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8f5587b8-cf75-4a3d-8ae6-6324a80d094c', 'multiverseId': 628830}, 'multiverseid': 628830}, {'name': '兴旺树丛', 'text': '兴旺树丛须横置进战场。\\n于兴旺树丛进战场时，选择一种绿色以外的颜色。\\n{T}：加{G}或一点所选颜色的法术力。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '人类视界之外还有一片隐蔽乐土，此处鸟语花香，绿意盎然。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629298&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c634ce60-c2d6-4627-b9b0-4dde8a25a7d5', 'multiverseId': 629298}, 'multiverseid': 629298}]", "[{'name': 'Gedeihendes Moor', 'text': 'Das Gedeihende Moor kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nSowie das Gedeihende Moor ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eine Farbe außer Schwarz.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder ein Mana der bestimmten Farbe.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Schönheit zeigt sich denen, die sie erkennen können, an merkwürdigen Orten.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628131&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e3a235e-cdbe-4253-aca5-d8bd04ead52d', 'multiverseId': 628131}, 'multiverseid': 628131}, {'name': 'Páramo floreciente', 'text': 'El Páramo floreciente entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nEn cuanto el Páramo floreciente entre al campo de batalla, elige un color que no sea negro.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o un maná del color elegido.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Los que ven la belleza son capaces de vislumbrarla en lugares extraños.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628365&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9f625205-8ff7-45e1-8912-ce16e69f287f', 'multiverseId': 628365}, 'multiverseid': 628365}, {'name': '興隆する湿地帯', 'text': '興隆する湿地帯はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n興隆する湿地帯が戦場に出るに際し、黒でない色１色を選ぶ。\\n{T}：{B}か、その選ばれた色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '奇妙な場所にも美は存在し、見る目を持つものを楽しませる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628833&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '52ea6972-e9bf-4f83-94cb-6371a8bdce85', 'multiverseId': 628833}, 'multiverseid': 628833}, {'name': '兴旺湿地', 'text': '兴旺湿地须横置进战场。\\n于兴旺湿地进战场时，选择一种黑色以外的颜色。\\n{T}：加{B}或一点所选颜色的法术力。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '此地美景尽藏奇异之处，唯眼光独到者方能得见。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629301&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dd86e2bf-a86c-4b8a-be7b-abd6a06d962b', 'multiverseId': 629301}, 'multiverseid': 629301}]", '[{\'name\': \'Geflutete Ebene\', \'text\': \'Die Geflutete Ebene kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}, opfere die Geflutete Ebene: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene- oder Insel-Karte, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625656&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'483d83e7-d98f-445b-af7d-d2e1b35992e2\', \'multiverseId\': 625656}, \'multiverseid\': 625656}, {\'name\': \'Plaine inondée\', \'text\': "La Plaine inondée arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T}, sacrifiez la Plaine inondée : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine ou d\'île, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625913&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'727d7435-beaa-4f02-a6b0-bf855752e92f\', \'multiverseId\': 625913}, \'multiverseid\': 625913}, {\'name\': \'氾濫原\', \'text\': \'氾濫原はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}, 氾濫原を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから平地や島であるカード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f81c857-0ee3-4c9c-a7da-9ed31c8f75ba\', \'multiverseId\': 626170}, \'multiverseid\': 626170}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geflügelter Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Alle Remasuri-Kreaturen haben Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe das Gefühl, dass für die hier andere Schwerkraftregeln gelten."\\n—Gerrard von der *Wetterlicht*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625522&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7472cecb-f4c8-4648-b4ee-2ad19c4a9700\', \'multiverseId\': 625522}, \'multiverseid\': 625522}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde ailé\', \'text\': \'Toutes les créatures Slivoïde ont le vol.\', \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "« Ici, tout le monde semble avoir signé quelque pacte ambigu avec la gravité. »\\n—Gerrard, de l\'*Aquilon*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625779&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a765eb69-63d6-4ab0-92cd-16aadd991c39\', \'multiverseId\': 625779}, \'multiverseid\': 625779}, {\'name\': \'有翼スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'すべてのスリヴァー・クリーチャーは飛行を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'「ここらの奴らは全部、重力から解放されちまってるらしい。」\\n——*ウェザーライト*の館長代行、ジェラード\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c1a010d-1268-4809-a87b-421569e65f1e\', \'multiverseId\': 626036}, \'multiverseid\': 626036}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gefolge von Trest\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Gefolge von Trest ins Spiel kommt, wirst du zum Monarchen.\\nSolange du der Monarch bist, kann das Gefolge von Trest in jedem Kampf eine zusätzliche Kreatur blocken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Dummen greifen zur Gewalt, auf die sich die Intelligenten vorbereiten."\\n—Leovold, Abgesandter von Trest\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627983&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af951442-2a0a-483c-90a2-9d9a7c42f5a0\', \'multiverseId\': 627983}, \'multiverseid\': 627983}, {\'name\': \'Séquito de Trest\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Séquito de Trest entre al campo de batalla, te conviertes en el monarca.\\nEl Séquito de Trest puede bloquear una criatura adicional cada combate mientras seas el monarca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Los débiles recurren a la violencia, y los astutos se preparan para ella".\\n—Leovold, emisario de Trest\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'520c7119-1e93-4f26-baa3-7147cc93e132\', \'multiverseId\': 628217}, \'multiverseid\': 628217}, {\'name\': \'トレストの随員\', \'text\': \'トレストの随員が戦場に出たとき、あなたが統治者になる。\\nあなたが統治者であるかぎり、各戦闘で、トレストの随員は追加でクリーチャー１体をブロックできる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「愚か者は暴力に訴えるが、賢い者は暴力に備える。」\\n――トレストの使者、レオヴォルド\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffd07c2c-24f2-4e75-b050-4a817fe2da58\', \'multiverseId\': 628685}, \'multiverseid\': 628685}, {\'name\': \'崔斯特随从\', \'text\': \'当崔斯特随从进战场时，你成为君主。\\n只要你是君主，崔斯特随从每次战斗便可以额外多阻挡一个生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「愚笨的人会诉诸暴力，而聪明的人会为之准备。」\\n～崔斯特密使列沃德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dba167b-0ae0-48e3-8bbc-6f0241a831c4\', \'multiverseId\': 629153}, \'multiverseid\': 629153}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gefährliches Behältnis\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T}, schicke das Gefährliche Behältnis ins Exil: Schicke alle bleibenden Karten, die keine Länder sind, ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Der Geisterdrache Ugin ordnete die Polyeder von Zendikar an, um Energieströme in Ley-Linien zu bündeln. Eine davon zu unterbrechen bedeutet, Vernichtung und Chaos zu entfesseln.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625630&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'135ac89c-6826-479f-8d9d-1b1f39d28895\', \'multiverseId\': 625630}, \'multiverseid\': 625630}, {\'name\': \'Caveau du péril\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T}, exilez le Caveau du péril : Exilez tous les permanents non-terrain.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Ugin le dragon-esprit orienta les hèdrons de Zendikar pour canaliser les lignes ley d\'énergie. En perturber un déclencherait dévastation et chaos.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625887&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'258a5a66-e945-4007-b32a-69ebf4960ab3\', \'multiverseId\': 625887}, \'multiverseid\': 625887}, {\'name\': \'危険な櫃\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T}, 危険な櫃を追放する：土地でないすべてのパーマネントを追放する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'精霊龍ウギンはエネルギーの力線を誘導させるためにゼンディカーの面晶体を編成した。それを乱すことは、破壊と混乱を解き放つことを意味する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'097cbb6c-e050-4310-982a-07ff10feda86\', \'multiverseId\': 626144}, \'multiverseid\': 626144}]', "[{'name': 'Gefäß des Feuerhirns', 'text': 'Das Gefäß des Feuerhirns kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge zwei Mana in unterschiedlichen Farben.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': 'Die Stadt trauerte um Niv-Mizzet, doch er hinterließ die Komponenten für seine Wiedergeburt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628081&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '91577617-04c3-4515-b50b-ba06d8767652', 'multiverseId': 628081}, 'multiverseid': 628081}, {'name': 'Recipiente de la Mente Ardiente', 'text': 'El Recipiente de la Mente Ardiente entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega dos manás de colores distintos.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': 'La ciudad lloraba la muerte de Niv-Mízzet, pero él había dejado atrás los componentes para su renacer.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628315&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a2de6256-d47c-45a5-a8cf-ff947a6db552', 'multiverseId': 628315}, 'multiverseid': 628315}, {'name': '火想者の器', 'text': '火想者の器はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：異なる色のマナ２点を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': 'ニヴ＝ミゼットの死を都市全体が嘆いたが、彼は再誕に必要な要素を残していた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628783&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd4725c98-ac9d-4d9f-bc27-ef55c03c7e82', 'multiverseId': 628783}, 'multiverseid': 628783}, {'name': '炎灵皿', 'text': '炎灵皿须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加两点不同颜色的法术力。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '虽然尼米捷离故让全城陷入悲痛，但他已为新生做好万全准备。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629251&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e86d71a3-92a0-4756-8203-658afb32a338', 'multiverseId': 629251}, 'multiverseid': 629251}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gegenzauber\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Pyromagierin beschwor ihren mächtigsten Sturm aus Zorn und Feuer. Jace täuschte Interesse vor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622890&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff59891b-a309-4b10-bec6-f63bfe281d85\', \'multiverseId\': 622890}, \'multiverseid\': 622890}, {\'name\': \'Contrahechizo\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'La piromante invocó su más poderosa embestida de fuego y rabia. Jace fingió interés.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a09b020-1286-418c-a03e-5f8205b3a808\', \'multiverseId\': 623091}, \'multiverseid\': 623091}, {\'name\': \'Contresort\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez un sort ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "La pyromancienne invoqua sa plus puissante création de feu et de rage. Jace fit semblant de s\'y intéresser.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623292&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46a469f7-8d49-43cb-a6c4-3bbe871ac0fa\', \'multiverseId\': 623292}, \'multiverseid\': 623292}, {\'name\': \'対抗呪文\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'紅蓮術師は彼女の最強の炎と怒りを召喚した。ジェイスは興味を示すふりをした。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1992ab0a-6850-4e24-ae61-115484719775\', \'multiverseId\': 623694}, \'multiverseid\': 623694}, {\'name\': \'反击咒语\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'烈焰术士唤出愤怒火焰展开猛攻。杰斯假装很感兴趣。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11177811-6b5f-476b-8c3f-26501716c1f9\', \'multiverseId\': 624096}, \'multiverseid\': 624096}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gegenzauber\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Einen schönen Zauberspruch hast du da. Wäre doch schade, wenn ihm etwas passieren würde."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624460&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'403e8328-16cf-4894-8424-44879ebc63db\', \'multiverseId\': 624460}, \'multiverseid\': 624460}, {\'name\': \'Contrahechizo\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Qué hechizo más bonito! Sería una pena que le pasara algo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e831901-fc15-481f-96cf-55731ec1bd7b\', \'multiverseId\': 624506}, \'multiverseid\': 624506}, {\'name\': \'Contresort\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez un sort ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« En voilà un joli sort. Ce serait dommage s\'il lui arrivait quelque chose. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624552&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e0db194-c516-4f0e-9e25-a2ad7cc93dfb\', \'multiverseId\': 624552}, \'multiverseid\': 624552}, {\'name\': \'対抗呪文\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「良い呪文を持ってるじゃないの。それに何かがあったら大変ね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dceb5ac9-e3c6-4150-9784-366b959baa3d\', \'multiverseId\': 624644}, \'multiverseid\': 624644}, {\'name\': \'反击咒语\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「这咒语可真好。出什么事就糟了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3861e3d-cb2a-4b84-9421-e5342e86aa3d\', \'multiverseId\': 624736}, \'multiverseid\': 624736}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geierberg-Sanatorium\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Jeder Spieler zieht eine Karte und wirft dann eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Land\', \'flavor\': \'Jeder ist willkommen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625662&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3f942e8-aac9-4aec-9ed6-b522f97e97ca\', \'multiverseId\': 625662}, \'multiverseid\': 625662}, {\'name\': \'Asile de la Chaîne de Geier\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T} : Chaque joueur pioche une carte et se défausse ensuite d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Terrain légendaire\', \'flavor\': \'Tout le monde y est le bienvenu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625919&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bdf35d4-6b78-493a-ac8d-6e674ccabbaf\', \'multiverseId\': 625919}, \'multiverseid\': 625919}, {\'name\': \'ガイアー岬の療養所\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}：各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、カード１枚を引き、その後、カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'伝説の土地\', \'flavor\': \'どなたでも大歓迎。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f7d4329-d85d-49d3-b384-8662133db259\', \'multiverseId\': 626176}, \'multiverseid\': 626176}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geist von Ramirez DePietro\', \'text\': \'Der Geist von Ramirez DePietro kann von Kreaturen mit Widerstandskraft 3 oder mehr nicht geblockt werden.\\nImmer wenn der Geist von Ramirez DePietro einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, bestimme bis zu eine Karte deiner Wahl in einem Friedhof, die in diesem Zug abgeworfen oder aus einer Bibliothek dorthin gelegt wurde. Bringe die bestimmte Karte auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\\nPartner (Du kannst zwei Kommandeure haben, falls beide Partner haben.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Geist, Pirat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622906&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'707e60aa-5567-462c-bf67-511c39e25ca4\', \'multiverseId\': 622906}, \'multiverseid\': 622906}, {\'name\': \'Fantasma de Ramírez DePietro\', \'text\': \'El Fantasma de Ramírez DePietro no puede ser bloqueado por criaturas con resistencia de 3 o más.\\nSiempre que el Fantasma de Ramírez DePietro haga daño de combate a un jugador, elige hasta una carta objetivo en un cementerio que fue descartada o puesta ahí desde una biblioteca este turno. Pon esa carta en la mano de su propietario.\\nCamarada. (Puedes tener dos comandantes si ambos tienen camarada.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Pirata espíritu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2680a28e-9546-41cb-8ac9-5e41e7591e53\', \'multiverseId\': 623107}, \'multiverseid\': 623107}, {\'name\': \'Fantôme de Ramirez DePietro\', \'text\': "Le Fantôme de Ramirez DePietro ne peut pas être bloqué par des créatures d\'endurance supérieure ou égale à 3.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Fantôme de Ramirez DePietro inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, choisissez dans un cimetière jusqu\'à une carte ciblée qui a été défaussée ou qui y a été mise depuis une bibliothèque ce tour-ci. Mettez cette carte dans la main de son propriétaire.\\nPartenariat (Vous pouvez avoir deux commandants si les deux ont le partenariat.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : esprit et pirate\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623308&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92c1b5cd-8214-432a-972b-a640383503a6\', \'multiverseId\': 623308}, \'multiverseid\': 623308}, {\'name\': \'ラミレス・ディピエトロの幽霊\', \'text\': \'ラミレス・ディピエトロの幽霊は、タフネスが３以上であるクリーチャーにはブロックされない。\\nラミレス・ディピエトロの幽霊がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、墓地にあり、このターンに捨てられたかライブラリーからそこに置かれたカード最大１枚を対象とする。そのカードをオーナーの手札に加える。\\n共闘（両方が共闘を持つなら、あなたは２体の統率者を使用できる。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — スピリット・海賊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4da276c-5422-4ef2-a595-2dd1d8d177cd\', \'multiverseId\': 623710}, \'multiverseid\': 623710}, {\'name\': \'拉米雷迪皮托的鬼魂\', \'text\': \'拉米雷迪皮托的鬼魂不能被防御力等于或大于3的生物阻挡。\\n每当拉米雷迪皮托的鬼魂对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，选择至多一张目标在坟墓场中的牌，且须为本回合中弃掉或从牌库进入该处者。将该牌置于其拥有者手上。\\n拍档（你可将两个具有拍档异能的生物共同用作指挥官。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～精怪／海盗\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7da3667-55ae-45f7-a093-08f3f6741048\', \'multiverseId\': 624112}, \'multiverseid\': 624112}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geißel des Throns\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nEntthronen (Immer wenn diese Kreatur einen Spieler mit den meisten Lebenspunkten angreift, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie.)\\nImmer wenn die Geißel des Throns zum ersten Mal in einem Zug angreift und falls sie einen Spieler mit den meisten Lebenspunkten angreift, enttappe alle angreifenden Kreaturen. Nach dieser Phase gibt es eine zusätzliche Kampfphase.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626574&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fe03c3d-42cf-4371-9745-b4dc1f0c743c\', \'multiverseId\': 626574}, \'multiverseid\': 626574}, {\'name\': \'Fléau du trône\', \'text\': "Vol\\nDétrônement (À chaque fois que cette créature attaque le joueur qui a le total de points de vie le plus élevé ou qui partage le total de points de vie le plus élevé, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)\\nÀ chaque fois que le Fléau du trône attaque pour la première fois à chaque tour, s\'il attaque le joueur qui a le total de points de vie le plus élevé ou qui partage le total de points de vie le plus élevé, dégagez toutes les créatures attaquantes. Cette phase est suivie d\'une phase de combat supplémentaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626914&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fff10e9-7472-4524-aa5f-03db206eaeeb\', \'multiverseId\': 626914}, \'multiverseid\': 626914}, {\'name\': \'玉座の災い魔\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n廃位（このクリーチャーが最多あるいは最多と同点のライフを持つプレイヤーを攻撃するたび、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。）\\n玉座の災い魔が各ターン最初に攻撃するたび、これが最多あるいは最多と同点のライフを持つプレイヤーを攻撃している場合、すべての攻撃クリーチャーをアンタップする。このフェイズに続いて、追加の戦闘フェイズ１つを加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74a1f674-07b0-456d-b8df-d47ec22c99e8\', \'multiverseId\': 627254}, \'multiverseid\': 627254}, {\'name\': \'王座祸害\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n义勇（每当此生物攻击生命最多或与他者同为最多的牌手时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。）\\n每当王座祸害每回合首度攻击时，若其正向生命最多或与他者同为最多的牌手进行攻击，则重置所有进行攻击的生物。在此阶段后，额外多出一个战斗阶段。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddfd04c3-120f-431b-b905-dba91539bfe1\', \'multiverseId\': 627594}, \'multiverseid\': 627594}]', "[{'name': 'Geißel des Throns', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nEntthronen (Immer wenn diese Kreatur einen Spieler mit den meisten Lebenspunkten angreift, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie.)\\nImmer wenn die Geißel des Throns zum ersten Mal in einem Zug angreift und falls sie einen Spieler mit den meisten Lebenspunkten angreift, enttappe alle angreifenden Kreaturen. Nach dieser Phase gibt es eine zusätzliche Kampfphase.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Drache', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627951&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '09b5681d-faed-412d-a111-58990a6e2d1f', 'multiverseId': 627951}, 'multiverseid': 627951}, {'name': 'Flagelo del trono', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nDestronar. (Siempre que esta criatura ataque al jugador con mayor cantidad de vidas o empatado con la mayor cantidad de vidas, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.)\\nSiempre que el Flagelo del trono ataque por primera vez cada turno, si está atacando al jugador con mayor cantidad de vidas o empatado con la mayor cantidad de vidas, endereza todas las criaturas atacantes. Después de esta fase, hay una fase de combate adicional.', 'type': 'Criatura — Dragón', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628185&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a913a357-9786-4981-8c0a-50cd0e6be2b6', 'multiverseId': 628185}, 'multiverseid': 628185}, {'name': '玉座の災い魔', 'text': '飛行\\n廃位（このクリーチャーが最多あるいは最多と同点のライフを持つプレイヤーを攻撃するたび、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。）\\n玉座の災い魔が各ターン最初に攻撃するたび、これが最多あるいは最多と同点のライフを持つプレイヤーを攻撃している場合、すべての攻撃クリーチャーをアンタップする。このフェイズに続いて、追加の戦闘フェイズ１つを加える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドラゴン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628653&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1b5ed19e-7c09-47df-b639-d12d1e551dd7', 'multiverseId': 628653}, 'multiverseid': 628653}, {'name': '王座祸害', 'text': '飞行\\n义勇（每当此生物攻击生命最多或与他者同为最多的牌手时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。）\\n每当王座祸害每回合首度攻击时，若其正向生命最多或与他者同为最多的牌手进行攻击，则重置所有进行攻击的生物。在此阶段后，额外多出一个战斗阶段。', 'type': '生物 ～龙', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629121&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7f608f34-defa-4813-aa59-68394260fef6', 'multiverseId': 629121}, 'multiverseid': 629121}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gemmenhautremasuri\', \'text\': \'Alle Remasuris haben „{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'Squee war schon viele Male ausgeweidet worden, allerdings noch nie von einem derart schönen Wesen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625558&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78b29748-e39e-4256-99a6-378ebcae1037\', \'multiverseId\': 625558}, \'multiverseid\': 625558}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde cuirgemme\', \'text\': \'Tous les slivoïdes ont « {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »\', \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "Skwi avait déjà été éventré bien des fois, mais jamais par un être d\'une beauté si saisissante.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625815&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fa2973c-ae21-47e1-bcca-4aac54f0e9f0\', \'multiverseId\': 625815}, \'multiverseid\': 625815}, {\'name\': \'宝革スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'すべてのスリヴァーは「{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'スクイーはこれまで何度も腹を割かれてきたが、これほどまでに美しいものに斬られたことは初めてだった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c4c8d02-3646-4785-8b50-bd6c492b0bb1\', \'multiverseId\': 626072}, \'multiverseid\': 626072}]', '[{\'name\': \'Genaue Analyse\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zieht zwei Karten.\\nRückblende — {1}{U}, bezahle 3 Lebenspunkte. (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Exemplar ist anscheinend defekt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622895&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b0262db-cc8e-4527-b9f1-b5c71bc41c02\', \'multiverseId\': 622895}, \'multiverseid\': 622895}, {\'name\': \'Análisis profundo\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo roba dos cartas.\\nRetrospectiva—{1}{U}, pagar 3 vidas. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"El espécimen parece dañado".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95ae9497-133e-44e5-b091-0c738db5df35\', \'multiverseId\': 623096}, \'multiverseid\': 623096}, {\'name\': \'Analyse en profondeur\', \'text\': \'Un joueur ciblé pioche deux cartes.\\nFlashback — {1}{U}, payez 3 points de vie. (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Ce spécimen semble cassé. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623297&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0631f138-b14c-4c29-bf13-61ee6eab98c6\', \'multiverseId\': 623297}, \'multiverseid\': 623297}, {\'name\': \'綿密な分析\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード２枚を引く。\\nフラッシュバック―{1}{U}, ３点のライフを支払う。（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「この標本は壊れているようだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df284cf7-e8c6-431c-afb8-2cb8bda3f5e0\', \'multiverseId\': 623699}, \'multiverseid\': 623699}, {\'name\': \'深入分析\', \'text\': \'目标牌手抓两张牌。\\n返照～{1}{U}，支付3点生命。（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「这样本似乎有点坏。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8ee7263-42b1-431d-9685-9ed41a1af0f4\', \'multiverseId\': 624101}, \'multiverseid\': 624101}]', "[{'name': 'Geoden-Golem', 'text': 'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn der Geoden-Golem einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du deinen Kommandeur aus der Kommandozone wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen. (Du bezahlst weiterhin alle zusätzlichen Kosten.)', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628084&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '65453fd7-0d36-4135-b873-e2909c8bd42a', 'multiverseId': 628084}, 'multiverseid': 628084}, {'name': 'Gólem de geoda', 'text': 'Arrolla.\\nSiempre que el Gólem de geoda haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes lanzar a tu comandante desde la zona de mando sin pagar su coste de maná. (Sigues pagando los costes adicionales.)', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Gólem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628318&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '198ce4b6-4de5-4f2b-8028-8564f7dfff96', 'multiverseId': 628318}, 'multiverseid': 628318}, {'name': '晶洞ゴーレム', 'text': 'トランプル\\n晶洞ゴーレムがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたは統率領域にあるあなたの統率者をマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。（追加コストは支払う必要がある。）', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628786&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8d6829ed-e2db-48ad-8e27-bf9c17da2cdc', 'multiverseId': 628786}, 'multiverseid': 628786}, {'name': '晶岩魔像', 'text': '践踏\\n每当晶岩魔像对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，你可以从统帅区施放你的指挥官，且不需支付其法术力费用。（你依旧要支付额外费用。）', 'type': '神器生物 ～魔像', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629254&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '788be35b-9362-4df4-ae94-24655b54963c', 'multiverseId': 629254}, 'multiverseid': 629254}]", '[{\'name\': \'Geralf der Leichenflicker\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}, {T}: Jeder Spieler millt drei Karten. Schicke bis zu zwei Kreaturenkarten, die auf diese Weise auf einen Friedhof gelegt wurden, ins Exil. Erzeuge einen X/X blauen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein, wobei X gleich der Gesamtstärke der Karten ist, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622930&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'902e7a7b-292d-41ec-9850-9e557b6c7390\', \'multiverseId\': 622930}, \'multiverseid\': 622930}, {\'name\': \'Suturador Geralf\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}, {T}: Cada jugador muele tres cartas. Exilia hasta dos cartas de criatura puestas en los cementerios de esta manera. Crea una ficha de criatura Zombie azul X/X, donde X es la fuerza total de las cartas exiliadas de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13973e2f-3c84-4d7c-963a-2d488ec0ae97\', \'multiverseId\': 623131}, \'multiverseid\': 623131}, {\'name\': \'Geralf, raccommodeur\', \'text\': "{2}{U}, {T} : Chaque joueur meule trois cartes. Exilez jusqu\'à deux cartes de créature mises dans des cimetières de cette manière. Créez un jeton de créature X/X bleue Zombie, X étant la force totale des cartes exilées de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623332&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bec953e-e536-4e1f-9b76-1f6298f406cf\', \'multiverseId\': 623332}, \'multiverseid\': 623332}, {\'name\': \'縫い師、ゲラルフ\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}, {T}：各プレイヤーはそれぞれカード３枚を切削する。これにより墓地に置かれたクリーチャー・カード最大２体を追放する。青のＸ/Ｘのゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。Ｘはこれにより追放されたすべてのカードのパワーの合計に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bd4db65-332d-4215-881a-ef59fc1961cd\', \'multiverseId\': 623734}, \'multiverseid\': 623734}, {\'name\': \'拼接师基拉夫\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}，{T}：每位牌手各磨三张牌。放逐至多两张以此法进入坟墓场的生物牌。派出一个X/X蓝色灵俑衍生生物，X为以此法放逐各牌的力量总和。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d866f52-31fd-4edd-8eae-e4edeef5f9aa\', \'multiverseId\': 624136}, \'multiverseid\': 624136}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geralf der Leichenflicker\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}, {T}: Jeder Spieler millt drei Karten. Schicke bis zu zwei Kreaturenkarten, die auf diese Weise auf einen Friedhof gelegt wurden, ins Exil. Erzeuge einen X/X blauen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein, wobei X gleich der Gesamtstärke der Karten ist, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626521&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa0ebace-537a-4c04-b821-5b82e425fd4b\', \'multiverseId\': 626521}, \'multiverseid\': 626521}, {\'name\': \'Geralf, raccommodeur\', \'text\': "{2}{U}, {T} : Chaque joueur meule trois cartes. Exilez jusqu\'à deux cartes de créature mises dans des cimetières de cette manière. Créez un jeton de créature X/X bleue Zombie, X étant la force totale des cartes exilées de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626861&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fab791e1-5e80-4fa0-81e6-33a64f3445dd\', \'multiverseId\': 626861}, \'multiverseid\': 626861}, {\'name\': \'縫い師、ゲラルフ\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}, {T}：各プレイヤーはそれぞれカード３枚を切削する。これにより墓地に置かれたクリーチャー・カード最大２体を追放する。青のＸ/Ｘのゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。Ｘはこれにより追放されたすべてのカードのパワーの合計に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84574957-872f-4d4b-938b-009893e50d34\', \'multiverseId\': 627201}, \'multiverseid\': 627201}, {\'name\': \'拼接师基拉夫\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}，{T}：每位牌手各磨三张牌。放逐至多两张以此法进入坟墓场的生物牌。派出一个X/X蓝色灵俑衍生生物，X为以此法放逐各牌的力量总和。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97121a79-b1ca-4e02-8e84-854d877a45c5\', \'multiverseId\': 627541}, \'multiverseid\': 627541}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geschenk des Stahlformers\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Ausrüstung-Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Ein guter Schmied stellt die Waffe her, um die du ihn bittest. Ein Meister stellt die Waffe her, von der du träumst.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624459&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8653a31c-5c14-43f2-9e27-f333f2ba2d78\', \'multiverseId\': 624459}, \'multiverseid\': 624459}, {\'name\': \'Regalo del moldea acero\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Equipo, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Quien sepa de herrería forjará el arma que le pidas. Quien la domine forjará el arma con la que sueñas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33644e68-ed1f-4856-9bac-0bace671474d\', \'multiverseId\': 624505}, \'multiverseid\': 624505}, {\'name\': \'Don du forge-acier\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte d\'équipement, révélez cette carte, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Un bon forgeron fabriquera l\'arme que vous lui demandez. Un maître fabriquera l\'arme dont vous rêvez.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624551&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f36ebd63-9e88-4c35-bcd6-b5fca7856896\', \'multiverseId\': 624551}, \'multiverseid\': 624551}, {\'name\': \'鋼打ちの贈り物\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから装備品・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「腕のいい鍛治屋はあなたが頼んだ武器をつくる。熟練の鍛治屋はあなたが夢見る武器をつくる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85ffb330-9508-42df-9c31-5967c3bbfe4f\', \'multiverseId\': 624643}, \'multiverseid\': 624643}, {\'name\': \'塑铁军之天赋\', \'text\': \'从你牌库中搜寻一张武具牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'好铁匠能依你要求打造趁手良兵。优异者则能应你想象铸就梦幻神器。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29d23a0a-83a1-4dea-81f3-3a4653d508d0\', \'multiverseId\': 624735}, \'multiverseid\': 624735}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geschenk des Stahlformers\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Ausrüstung-Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Manche Klingen entscheiden selbst, wer sie zückt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622868&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'611252cb-e186-4890-b748-b70e949656ab\', \'multiverseId\': 622868}, \'multiverseid\': 622868}, {\'name\': \'Regalo del moldea acero\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Equipo, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Algunas hojas buscan sus propios dueños.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd06d4b9-c3d1-4734-b98e-99eab8c63b36\', \'multiverseId\': 623069}, \'multiverseid\': 623069}, {\'name\': \'Don du forge-acier\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte d\'équipement, révélez cette carte, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Certaines lames cherchent leur porteur.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623270&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ca0d197-86c1-4b54-9fb4-b2a3fc135248\', \'multiverseId\': 623270}, \'multiverseid\': 623270}, {\'name\': \'鋼打ちの贈り物\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから装備品・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'持ち主を求める刃もある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ebc3c97-c58b-455b-a8e4-1f77b630baad\', \'multiverseId\': 623672}, \'multiverseid\': 623672}, {\'name\': \'塑铁军之天赋\', \'text\': \'从你牌库中搜寻一张武具牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'有些刀剑就是会认主人。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54e55409-961e-494b-8e51-18ad98a3f822\', \'multiverseId\': 624074}, \'multiverseid\': 624074}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geschenk des Stahlformers\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Ausrüstung-Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Manche Klingen entscheiden selbst, wer sie zückt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626499&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db93aa65-7997-45d2-aecc-afb23e7da1e9\', \'multiverseId\': 626499}, \'multiverseid\': 626499}, {\'name\': \'Don du forge-acier\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte d\'équipement, révélez cette carte, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Certaines lames cherchent leur porteur.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626839&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c52168b6-9da5-40c4-830d-161348dbc8a2\', \'multiverseId\': 626839}, \'multiverseid\': 626839}, {\'name\': \'鋼打ちの贈り物\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから装備品・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'持ち主を求める刃もある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acfade5f-5e21-4fcb-93ea-cad27ce81659\', \'multiverseId\': 627179}, \'multiverseid\': 627179}, {\'name\': \'塑铁军之天赋\', \'text\': \'从你牌库中搜寻一张武具牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'有些刀剑就是会认主人。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36731c6f-a4c9-407a-b326-1dffbf9575ec\', \'multiverseId\': 627519}, \'multiverseid\': 627519}]', "[{'name': 'Geschütztes Gestrüpp', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {G}.)\\nDas Geschützte Gestrüpp kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land — Gebirge, Wald', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625694&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd65094fe-ac12-4de1-b44f-2c6c9294e562', 'multiverseId': 625694}, 'multiverseid': 625694}, {'name': 'Halliers protégés', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {G}.)\\nLes Halliers protégés arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagés.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain : montagne et forêt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625951&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37519bd0-69db-4986-b170-ecace9b36f24', 'multiverseId': 625951}, 'multiverseid': 625951}, {'name': '隠れた茂み', 'text': '（{T}：{R}か{G}を加える。）\\n隠れた茂みはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）', 'type': '土地 — 山・森', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626208&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '96a14b05-c660-41b2-a6f6-3e1e537aa4f5', 'multiverseId': 626208}, 'multiverseid': 626208}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gespenstisches Flimmern\', \'text\': \'Schicke zwei Artefakte, Kreaturen und/oder Länder deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil und bringe sie dann unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Manchmal lohnt es sich, eine Auszeit von der Existenz zu nehmen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622907&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a95a86fb-2a2c-4f50-9baf-42717552a37e\', \'multiverseId\': 622907}, \'multiverseid\': 622907}, {\'name\': \'Fluctuación fantasmal\', \'text\': \'Exilia dos artefactos, criaturas y/o tierras objetivo que controlas, luego regresa esas cartas al campo de batalla bajo tu control.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'A veces resulta útil tomarse un descanso de la existencia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e8a4ac1-c60c-440d-a233-0e7401069954\', \'multiverseId\': 623108}, \'multiverseid\': 623108}, {\'name\': \'Éclipse fantomale\', \'text\': \'Exilez deux cibles, artefacts, créatures et/ou terrains que vous contrôlez, puis renvoyez ces cartes sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Il est parfois utile de faire une pause dans l\'existence.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623309&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e61ec1bb-792e-4edc-bcba-6f085c3100ad\', \'multiverseId\': 623309}, \'multiverseid\': 623309}, {\'name\': \'幽霊のゆらめき\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトやクリーチャーや土地のうちあなたがコントロールしている２つを対象とする。それらを追放する。その後、それらのカードをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'時には実存から距離を置くのも悪くない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'195f93fc-9889-459e-bddb-7a0c0ae5fb68\', \'multiverseId\': 623711}, \'multiverseid\': 623711}, {\'name\': \'鬼影闪烁\', \'text\': \'放逐两个目标由你操控的神器，生物和／或地，然后将这些牌在你的操控下移回战场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'有时暂且消失也不错。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11fc8807-9e81-4ef0-9d88-4d0ce2e19dca\', \'multiverseId\': 624113}, \'multiverseid\': 624113}]', "[{'name': 'Ghalta der Urhunger', 'text': 'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {X} weniger, wobei X gleich der Gesamtstärke der Kreaturen ist, die du kontrollierst.\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Ältester, Dinosaurier', 'flavor': 'Jeder seiner Schritte lässt Ixalan erzittern.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626586&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aad067fd-0ea7-441d-a77c-eafdbbc363a7', 'multiverseId': 626586}, 'multiverseid': 626586}, {'name': 'Ghalta, Faim primordiale', 'text': 'Ce sort coûte {X} de moins à lancer, X étant la force totale des créatures que vous contrôlez.\\nPiétinement', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : ancêtre et dinosaure', 'flavor': 'La terre est en marche, plus puissante que tout.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626926&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e91ebdf1-b250-454a-920e-546f05f5fe7a', 'multiverseId': 626926}, 'multiverseid': 626926}, {'name': '原初の飢え、ガルタ', 'text': 'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{X}少なくなる。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーのパワーの合計に等しい。\\nトランプル', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — エルダー・恐竜', 'flavor': '最強なる大地の歩行。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627266&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a1c827eb-baf0-49a9-b0a5-4226e117660e', 'multiverseId': 627266}, 'multiverseid': 627266}, {'name': '始饥戈厄塔', 'text': '此咒语减少{X}来施放，X为由你操控之生物的力量总和。\\n践踏', 'type': '传奇生物 ～长老／恐龙', 'flavor': '大地行走，力冠众生。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627606&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd044f3e1-0d49-4302-bc25-14fbbbc4fb76', 'multiverseId': 627606}, 'multiverseid': 627606}]", "[{'name': 'Ghalta der Urhunger', 'text': 'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {X} weniger, wobei X gleich der Gesamtstärke der Kreaturen ist, die du kontrollierst.\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Ältester, Dinosaurier', 'flavor': 'Jeder seiner Schritte lässt Ixalan erzittern.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627990&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bbd1e587-b856-49a3-8331-437ffc32adf6', 'multiverseId': 627990}, 'multiverseid': 627990}, {'name': 'Ghalta, el Hambre Primigenia', 'text': 'Te cuesta {X} menos lanzar este hechizo, donde X es la fuerza total de las criaturas que controlas.\\nArrolla.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Dinosaurio anciano', 'flavor': 'La tierra en movimiento, más fuerte que nadie.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628224&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1c82f185-4635-4338-91f4-6e16ef42be39', 'multiverseId': 628224}, 'multiverseid': 628224}, {'name': '原初の飢え、ガルタ', 'text': 'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{X}少なくなる。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーのパワーの合計に等しい。\\nトランプル', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — エルダー・恐竜', 'flavor': '最強なる大地の歩行。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628692&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '00a2c532-1db7-4b9e-8ae5-5dbac96c9997', 'multiverseId': 628692}, 'multiverseid': 628692}, {'name': '始饥戈厄塔', 'text': '此咒语减少{X}来施放，X为由你操控之生物的力量总和。\\n践踏', 'type': '传奇生物 ～长老／恐龙', 'flavor': '大地行走，力冠众生。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629160&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f41b1d22-91b2-4157-9996-7e5c66d2b022', 'multiverseId': 629160}, 'multiverseid': 629160}]", '[{\'name\': \'Ghulischer Impuls\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 und Todesberührung und ist angestachelt.\\nWenn die verzauberte Kreatur stirbt, bringe den Ghulischen Impuls zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624924&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6eb139cc-e464-4a52-b49f-3061a57cde12\', \'multiverseId\': 624924}, \'multiverseid\': 624924}, {\'name\': \'Impetus morbide\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1, a le contact mortel et est incitée.\\nQuand la créature enchantée meurt, renvoyez l\'Impetus morbide sur le champ de bataille au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624959&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5755b8b3-a2d2-41b1-9c3a-5617b5ac9107\', \'multiverseId\': 624959}, \'multiverseid\': 624959}, {\'name\': \'グールの推進力\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは、＋１/＋１の修整を受け接死を持ち、使嗾される。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーが死亡したとき、次の終了ステップの開始時に、グールの推進力を戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39d37326-7dff-41ca-892c-149490699882\', \'multiverseId\': 624994}, \'multiverseid\': 624994}, {\'name\': \'尸鬼促动\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+1/+1，具有死触异能，且已煽惑。\\n当所结附的生物死去，在下一个结束步骤开始时将尸鬼促动移回战场。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12c6e682-b315-4480-9c3f-caaf1f6e9b49\', \'multiverseId\': 625029}, \'multiverseid\': 625029}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ghulischer Impuls\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 und Todesberührung und ist angestachelt.\\nWenn die verzauberte Kreatur stirbt, bringe den Ghulischen Impuls zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625129&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b80d2a87-63f0-4ec5-a710-e998ecbd270f\', \'multiverseId\': 625129}, \'multiverseid\': 625129}, {\'name\': \'Impetus morbide\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1, a le contact mortel et est incitée.\\nQuand la créature enchantée meurt, renvoyez l\'Impetus morbide sur le champ de bataille au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625161&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef2c7117-cc53-40a0-a5c9-d5adbc66ba1a\', \'multiverseId\': 625161}, \'multiverseid\': 625161}, {\'name\': \'グールの推進力\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは、＋１/＋１の修整を受け接死を持ち、使嗾される。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーが死亡したとき、次の終了ステップの開始時に、グールの推進力を戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16daa93f-7f67-4717-8424-0a4d54a8c63b\', \'multiverseId\': 625193}, \'multiverseid\': 625193}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gideon Jura\', \'text\': \'+2: Während des nächsten Zuges eines Gegners deiner Wahl greifen alle Kreaturen, die jener Spieler kontrolliert, Gideon Jura an, falls möglich.\\n−2: Zerstöre eine getappte Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\n0: Bis zum Ende des Zuges wird Gideon Jura zu einer 6/6 Mensch-Soldat-Kreatur, die immer noch ein Planeswalker ist. Verhindere allen Schaden, der ihm in diesem Zug zugefügt würde.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Gideon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625484&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0fd9709-7958-4871-b093-9f7cde81ade0\', \'multiverseId\': 625484}, \'multiverseid\': 625484}, {\'name\': \'Gideon Jura\', \'text\': "+2: Pendant le prochain tour d\'un adversaire ciblé, les créatures que ce joueur contrôle attaquent Gideon Jura si possible.\\n-2: Détruisez une créature engagée ciblée.\\n0: Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, Gideon Jura devient une créature 6/6 Humain et Soldat qui est toujours un planeswalker. Prévenez toutes les blessures qui devraient lui être infligées ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Gideon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625741&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74a6a179-a0c0-4663-b4eb-b5029a854e11\', \'multiverseId\': 625741}, \'multiverseid\': 625741}, {\'name\': \'ギデオン・ジュラ\', \'text\': \'+2：対戦相手１人を対象とする。次のそのプレイヤーのターンの間、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは可能ならギデオン・ジュラを攻撃する。\\n-2：タップ状態のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n0：ターン終了時まで、ギデオン・ジュラは６/６の人間・兵士・クリーチャーになる。これはプレインズウォーカーでもある。このターン、これが受けるすべてのダメージを軽減する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ギデオン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'003b2aa7-c443-4fb7-a5d9-d19275a3286a\', \'multiverseId\': 625998}, \'multiverseid\': 625998}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gideons Eid\', \'text\': \'Wenn Gideons Eid ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei 1/1 weiße Kor-Verbündeter-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\nJeder Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst, kommt mit einer zusätzlichen Loyalitätsmarke ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Für Gerechtigkeit und Frieden werde ich Wache halten."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625492&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc457fa3-8f2c-4da2-9365-2c3130d107b0\', \'multiverseId\': 625492}, \'multiverseid\': 625492}, {\'name\': \'Serment de Gideon\', \'text\': \'Quand le Serment de Gideon arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Kor et Allié.\\nChaque planeswalker que vous contrôlez arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur « loyauté » supplémentaire sur lui.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement légendaire\', \'flavor\': \'« Pour la justice et la paix, je me ferai sentinelle. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625749&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'effce196-bcb0-4570-9c84-eb4a2caea688\', \'multiverseId\': 625749}, \'multiverseid\': 625749}, {\'name\': \'ギデオンの誓い\', \'text\': \'ギデオンの誓いが戦場に出たとき、白の１/１のコー・同盟者・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\\nあなたがコントロールしている各プレインズウォーカーはそれぞれ、追加で忠誠カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のエンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「正義と平和のため、私はゲートウォッチとなる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4bed9a5-400a-4f0f-93f1-e6413121ddc7\', \'multiverseId\': 626006}, \'multiverseid\': 626006}]', "[{'name': 'Gießerei-Inspektor', 'text': 'Artefaktzauber, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt', 'flavor': 'Die Maschineninspektoren sorgen dafür, dass die strengen Vorschriften des Konsulats für die Massenproduktion eingehalten werden.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628083&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f612c0f8-b079-49c9-82df-09ea34950573', 'multiverseId': 628083}, 'multiverseid': 628083}, {'name': 'Inspector de la fundición', 'text': 'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar los hechizos de artefacto.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Constructo', 'flavor': 'Los inspectores de autómatas garantizan el cumplimiento de las rígidas normas de producción en masa del Consulado.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628317&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9ca43be2-0f93-4670-837d-fbc0ccfcc3af', 'multiverseId': 628317}, 'multiverseid': 628317}, {'name': '鋳造所の検査官', 'text': 'あなたがアーティファクト・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': '自動機械の検査官が、領事府の定めた大量生産の厳格な基準を満たしていることを確認する。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628785&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c15c8365-7e20-4efe-bdf7-7574a45b7786', 'multiverseId': 628785}, 'multiverseid': 628785}, {'name': '铸造厂监工', 'text': '你施放的神器咒语减少{1}来施放。', 'type': '神器生物 ～组构体', 'flavor': '执政院为大量生产制定了苛刻标准，自动机械监工确保此标准得以严格执行。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629253&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '71e7f950-9bf1-492d-b90d-93b09ae1db68', 'multiverseId': 629253}, 'multiverseid': 629253}]", "[{'name': 'Gift-Remasuri', 'text': 'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Todesberührung.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Remasuri', 'flavor': 'Das Gift weicht Gewebe auf und schmilzt innere Organe, sodass die Remasuris ungehindert fressen können, ohne Zeit mit Kauen verschwenden zu müssen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625576&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '999c6dfa-4118-4436-81d8-60a124be5ab1', 'multiverseId': 625576}, 'multiverseid': 625576}, {'name': 'Slivoïde venimeux', 'text': 'Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont le contact mortel.', 'type': 'Créature : slivoïde', 'flavor': 'Le venin ramollit les tissus et liquéfie les organes internes, permettant aux slivoïdes de se nourrir sans perdre de temps à mâcher.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625833&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ce0e2d7b-3317-485c-98b8-0fe52b88dc65', 'multiverseId': 625833}, 'multiverseid': 625833}, {'name': '毒牙スリヴァー', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのスリヴァー・クリーチャーは接死を持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スリヴァー', 'flavor': 'その毒は筋組織を軟化させ、内蔵を溶かし、食にありついたスリヴァーの噛む手間を省く。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626090&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '01931344-09ec-42de-a2ff-5a0ed5efa268', 'multiverseId': 626090}, 'multiverseid': 626090}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gigant der Verdammnis\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn der Gigant der Verdammnis oder eine andere Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhalten Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': \'Lähmende Furcht kündigt ihn an. Ein fauler Gestank begleitet ihn. Der Tod erinnert an sein Kommen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625527&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'425c0f82-068d-463a-a659-33df2d1c9bfe\', \'multiverseId\': 625527}, \'multiverseid\': 625527}, {\'name\': \'Géant au sillage funeste\', \'text\': "Constellation — À chaque fois que le Géant au sillage funeste ou un autre enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent gagnent -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : géant\', \'flavor\': "Une peur paralysante le précède. Une puanteur âcre l\'accompagne. La mort suit dans son sillage.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625784&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe36476b-1a15-495c-a91b-fd6cf3f80710\', \'multiverseId\': 625784}, \'multiverseid\': 625784}, {\'name\': \'破滅喚起の巨人\', \'text\': \'星座 ― 破滅喚起の巨人やこれでないエンチャント１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、対戦相手がコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは－１/－１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — 巨人\', \'flavor\': \'凍り付く様な恐怖がそれに先行し、不快な臭気がそれに伴い、その後に続くのは死である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'675c3bff-534f-4810-89d9-c970d3ab0e8d\', \'multiverseId\': 626041}, \'multiverseid\': 626041}]', "[{'name': 'Gildenloses Gemeingut', 'text': 'Das Gildenlose Gemeingut kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Gildenlose Gemeingut ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625665&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7177bca9-199a-40b9-85b8-5141d9a22ab3', 'multiverseId': 625665}, 'multiverseid': 625665}, {'name': 'Commune des sans guilde', 'text': 'La Commune des sans guilde arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Commune des sans guilde arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625922&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dfa1cc81-0d81-49b4-a4f3-4a14f26e362d', 'multiverseId': 625922}, 'multiverseid': 625922}, {'name': 'ギルド無しの公共地', 'text': 'ギルド無しの公共地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nギルド無しの公共地が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{C}{C}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626179&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '65d1ee4d-a1f7-4369-9194-805e19086cc4', 'multiverseId': 626179}, 'multiverseid': 626179}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gisa die Ghulruferin\', \'text\': \'{B}, {T}, opfere eine andere Kreatur: Erzeuge X 2/2 schwarze Zombie-Kreaturenspielsteine, wobei X gleich der Stärke der geopferten Kreatur ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Musst du immer jammern, Geralf? Ich habe gar nichts versprochen. Ich werde Ghule auferwecken, wann immer es mir beliebt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622970&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a48b79e-9bdc-4e44-ac23-dd3b7ad1a051\', \'multiverseId\': 622970}, \'multiverseid\': 622970}, {\'name\': \'Gisa, la llamamuertos\', \'text\': \'{B}, {T}, sacrificar otra criatura: Crea X fichas de criatura Zombie negras 2/2, donde X es la fuerza de la criatura sacrificada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Geralf, ¿tienes que quejarte siempre? No te prometí nada. Alzaré necrófagos cuando yo quiera".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'435f483e-f933-4c6c-9772-56f36cb05e8c\', \'multiverseId\': 623171}, \'multiverseid\': 623171}, {\'name\': \'Gisa, meneuse de goule\', \'text\': \'{B}, {T}, sacrifiez une autre créature : Créez X jetons de créature 2/2 noire Zombie, X étant la force de la créature sacrifiée.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Geralf, vas-tu cesser de te plaindre ? Je ne t\'ai rien promis. Je lèverai des goules quand il me plaira. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623372&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1f54153-c92c-4962-8b16-f25a931520b8\', \'multiverseId\': 623372}, \'multiverseid\': 623372}, {\'name\': \'グール呼びのギサ\', \'text\': \'{B}, {T}, これでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。Ｘはその生け贄に捧げられたクリーチャーのパワーに等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「ゲラルフ、あなたはいつも泣き言ばかりね？私は何も約束した覚えはないわよ。私は、私の望む時にグールを蘇らせるだけよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79a84d2c-78ec-4841-9093-41d6c6c341f8\', \'multiverseId\': 623774}, \'multiverseid\': 623774}, {\'name\': \'尸鬼牧者基沙\', \'text\': \'{B}，{T}，牺牲另一个生物：派出X个2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物，X为所牺牲生物的力量。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「基拉夫，你非得喋喋不休吗？我什么都不同意。我要什么时候召唤食尸鬼，就什么时候召唤。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0708878-6f41-4e5c-aace-8890d2b224ab\', \'multiverseId\': 624176}, \'multiverseid\': 624176}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gisa die Ghulruferin\', \'text\': \'{B}, {T}, opfere eine andere Kreatur: Erzeuge X 2/2 schwarze Zombie-Kreaturenspielsteine, wobei X gleich der Stärke der geopferten Kreatur ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Musst du immer jammern, Geralf? Ich habe gar nichts versprochen. Ich werde Ghule auferwecken, wann immer es mir beliebt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626537&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30e2c3e8-a2b2-4885-b233-675612f8add0\', \'multiverseId\': 626537}, \'multiverseid\': 626537}, {\'name\': \'Gisa, meneuse de goule\', \'text\': \'{B}, {T}, sacrifiez une autre créature : Créez X jetons de créature 2/2 noire Zombie, X étant la force de la créature sacrifiée.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Geralf, vas-tu cesser de te plaindre ? Je ne t\'ai rien promis. Je lèverai des goules quand il me plaira. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626877&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c771bc53-1b5b-48b4-a3f4-3206d0997d0c\', \'multiverseId\': 626877}, \'multiverseid\': 626877}, {\'name\': \'グール呼びのギサ\', \'text\': \'{B}, {T}, これでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。Ｘはその生け贄に捧げられたクリーチャーのパワーに等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「ゲラルフ、あなたはいつも泣き言ばかりね？私は何も約束した覚えはないわよ。私は、私の望む時にグールを蘇らせるだけよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37a42451-11d0-4600-9062-2f6beb8ac9b1\', \'multiverseId\': 627217}, \'multiverseid\': 627217}, {\'name\': \'尸鬼牧者基沙\', \'text\': \'{B}，{T}，牺牲另一个生物：派出X个2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物，X为所牺牲生物的力量。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「基拉夫，你非得喋喋不休吗？我什么都不同意。我要什么时候召唤食尸鬼，就什么时候召唤。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be62de38-3137-47d2-aec0-ea084c3343b2\', \'multiverseId\': 627557}, \'multiverseid\': 627557}]', "[{'name': 'Glanzgeschliffener Hirsch', 'text': '{3}, opfere den Glanzgeschliffenen Hirsch: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Hirsch', 'flavor': 'Von Göttern geschmiedet, um unter Sterblichen zu wandeln.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628071&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d6120a9-13f6-4985-8822-ec330258d048', 'multiverseId': 628071}, 'multiverseid': 628071}, {'name': 'Venado bruñido', 'text': '{3}, sacrificar el Venado bruñido: Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Alce', 'flavor': 'Forjado por manos divinas para deambular por los reinos mortales.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628305&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c8f2fa3f-7061-4ea6-9d93-36c031622c31', 'multiverseId': 628305}, 'multiverseid': 628305}, {'name': 'つややかな雄鹿', 'text': '{3}, つややかな雄鹿を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 大鹿', 'flavor': '定命の者の世界をさまようため、天界の者の手により創られた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628773&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ec2871b-334e-453d-a345-42aed13667ba', 'multiverseId': 628773}, 'multiverseid': 628773}, {'name': '光洁雄鹿', 'text': '{3}，牺牲光洁雄鹿：从你牌库中搜寻至多两张基本地牌，将它们横置放进战场，然后洗牌。', 'type': '神器生物 ～麋鹿', 'flavor': '由神明之手铸造，在凡人领域游荡。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629241&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b660036-75a8-4390-a265-c8a01563f57e', 'multiverseId': 629241}, 'multiverseid': 629241}]", '[{\'name\': \'Glimmender Rochen\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Glimmende Rochen ins Spiel kommt, verdopple die Anzahl an Marken jeder Sorte auf einer beliebigen Anzahl an bleibenden Karten deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Fisch\', \'flavor\': \'Grazil gleitet er über den Meeresboden und zeichnet ein Nachleuchten darauf.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625506&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26849bbf-4a6e-4129-b1d2-3a21fa3a6c93\', \'multiverseId\': 625506}, \'multiverseid\': 625506}, {\'name\': \'Raie bioluminescente\', \'text\': "Quand la Raie bioluminescente arrive sur le champ de bataille, doublez le nombre de chaque sorte de marqueur sur n\'importe quel nombre de permanents ciblés.", \'type\': \'Créature : poisson\', \'flavor\': \'Son déplacement gracieux peint les fonds marins de traits luminescents.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625763&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27ffbea7-0798-4f33-9dc5-a21f37e703a8\', \'multiverseId\': 625763}, \'multiverseid\': 625763}, {\'name\': \'深輝エイ\', \'text\': \'深輝エイが戦場に出たとき、望む数のパーマネントを対象とする。それらの上にある各種類のカウンターの個数をそれぞれ２倍にする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 魚\', \'flavor\': \'その優美な泳ぎは海底に鮮やかな輝跡を描く。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25f537d8-dfde-406a-9e74-6b74e9442d65\', \'multiverseId\': 626020}, \'multiverseid\': 626020}]', '[{\'name\': \'Glücksfall\', \'text\': \'Jeder Spieler wirft seine Hand ab und zieht dann so viele Karten, wie der Spieler, der auf diese Weise die meisten Karten abgeworfen hat, abgeworfen hat.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Reich" ist ein relativer Begriff.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625521&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6c16be8-8186-4b8c-ad96-18637e13aa0b\', \'multiverseId\': 625521}, \'multiverseid\': 625521}, {\'name\': \'Aubaine\', \'text\': "Chaque joueur se défausse de sa main, puis il pioche un nombre de cartes égal au plus grand nombre de cartes dont un joueur s\'est défaussé de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'La « richesse » est toute relative.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625778&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0360a0e2-70c0-4ab5-abe3-a2298f874b9e\', \'multiverseId\': 625778}, \'multiverseid\': 625778}, {\'name\': \'意外な授かり物\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分の手札を捨て、その後、これによりプレイヤー１人が捨てたカードの枚数の中の最大値に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「富」とは相対的な言葉だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'398475ac-8d90-4415-bb71-e9942da9ff79\', \'multiverseId\': 626035}, \'multiverseid\': 626035}]', '[{\'name\': \'Godo, Fürst der Banditen\', \'text\': \'Wenn Godo, Fürst der Banditen, ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Ausrüstung-Karte durchsuchen, sie ins Spiel bringen und danach mischen.\\nImmer wenn Godo zum ersten Mal in einem Zug angreift, enttappe ihn und alle Samurai, die du kontrollierst. Nach dieser Phase gibt es eine zusätzliche Kampfphase.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Barbar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626562&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e20038ce-a443-4ace-8ba9-2e1d1740b171\', \'multiverseId\': 626562}, \'multiverseid\': 626562}, {\'name\': \'Godo, seigneur de guerre bandit\', \'text\': "Quand Godo, seigneur de guerre bandit arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte d\'équipement, la mettre sur le champ de bataille, puis mélanger.\\nÀ chaque fois que Godo attaque pour la première fois à chaque tour, dégagez-le, ainsi que tous les samouraïs que vous contrôlez. Cette phase est suivie d\'une phase de combat supplémentaire.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et barbare\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626902&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9a61375-6cf4-4be6-bb7e-381ee0aada6f\', \'multiverseId\': 626902}, \'multiverseid\': 626902}, {\'name\': \'山賊の頭、伍堂\', \'text\': \'山賊の頭、伍堂が戦場に出たとき、「あなたのライブラリーから装備品・カード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\\n山賊の頭、伍堂が各ターン最初に攻撃するたび、これとあなたがコントロールしているすべての侍をアンタップする。このフェイズの後に、追加の戦闘フェイズ１つを加える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・バーバリアン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25d441ac-f627-4109-88b6-3f353ddf4f1e\', \'multiverseId\': 627242}, \'multiverseid\': 627242}, {\'name\': \'山贼王伍堂\', \'text\': \'当山贼王伍堂进战场时，你可以从你牌库中搜寻一张武具牌，将之放进战场，然后洗牌。\\n每当伍堂每回合首度攻击时，重置它和所有由你操控的武士。在此阶段后，额外多出一个战斗阶段。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／野蛮人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb6bb9d8-09c3-4702-a0e3-944fc0337615\', \'multiverseId\': 627582}, \'multiverseid\': 627582}]', "[{'name': 'Godo, Fürst der Banditen', 'text': 'Wenn Godo, Fürst der Banditen, ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Ausrüstung-Karte durchsuchen, sie ins Spiel bringen und danach mischen.\\nImmer wenn Godo zum ersten Mal in einem Zug angreift, enttappe ihn und alle Samurai, die du kontrollierst. Nach dieser Phase gibt es eine zusätzliche Kampfphase.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Barbar', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627925&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd41f9a58-a92d-424f-a339-ff037136813d', 'multiverseId': 627925}, 'multiverseid': 627925}, {'name': 'Godo, señor de la guerra de los bandidos', 'text': 'Cuando Godo, señor de la guerra de los bandidos entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de Equipo, ponerla en el campo de batalla y luego barajar.\\nSiempre que Godo ataque por primera vez cada turno, enderézalo a él y a todos los Samuráis que controlas. Después de esta fase, hay una fase de combate adicional.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Bárbaro humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628159&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '63e986f2-6edc-40eb-b8df-b844975724ea', 'multiverseId': 628159}, 'multiverseid': 628159}, {'name': '山賊の頭、伍堂', 'text': '山賊の頭、伍堂が戦場に出たとき、「あなたのライブラリーから装備品・カード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\\n山賊の頭、伍堂が各ターン最初に攻撃するたび、これとあなたがコントロールしているすべての侍をアンタップする。このフェイズの後に、追加の戦闘フェイズ１つを加える。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・バーバリアン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628627&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '68f0ce1a-bc61-4398-889d-0571c717af20', 'multiverseId': 628627}, 'multiverseid': 628627}, {'name': '山贼王伍堂', 'text': '当山贼王伍堂进战场时，你可以从你牌库中搜寻一张武具牌，将之放进战场，然后洗牌。\\n每当伍堂每回合首度攻击时，重置它和所有由你操控的武士。在此阶段后，额外多出一个战斗阶段。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～人类／野蛮人', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629095&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1dc06d31-ef5a-41d7-b130-5abb98b2549e', 'multiverseId': 629095}, 'multiverseid': 629095}]", "[{'name': 'Golgari-Verrottungsfarm', 'text': 'Die Golgari-Verrottungsfarm kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Golgari-Verrottungsfarm ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625663&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9499b8e6-50ce-437b-af46-da2df659763d', 'multiverseId': 625663}, 'multiverseid': 625663}, {'name': 'Ferme à putréfaction des Golgari', 'text': 'La Ferme à putréfaction des Golgari arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Ferme à putréfaction des Golgari arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625920&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '54ccaca6-92d2-4de0-af0f-d448951c58c8', 'multiverseId': 625920}, 'multiverseid': 625920}, {'name': 'ゴルガリの腐敗農場', 'text': 'ゴルガリの腐敗農場はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nゴルガリの腐敗農場が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{B}{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626177&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7dc24e3c-3a23-4054-9a6d-7318ba3a5940', 'multiverseId': 626177}, 'multiverseid': 626177}]", '[{\'name\': \'Goliath-Sphinx\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sphinx\', \'flavor\': \'Sie nennt die höchsten Berge von Sejiri ihre Heimat, wo der Ausblick so unendlich ist wie ihre Geduld.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622908&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2069480-dc6b-4c63-bc21-1844f30274da\', \'multiverseId\': 622908}, \'multiverseid\': 622908}, {\'name\': \'Esfinge goliat\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': \'Vive en la montaña más alta de Sejiri, donde la vista es interminable como su paciencia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dde1d243-1684-4bf6-a9d5-bf3c3a2a33ca\', \'multiverseId\': 623109}, \'multiverseid\': 623109}, {\'name\': \'Sphinx goliath\', \'text\': \'Vol\', \'type\': \'Créature : sphinx\', \'flavor\': "Il fait son nid sur la montagne la plus haute de Seijiri, où l\'horizon est aussi illimité que sa patience.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623310&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e887c9e-13f5-4b48-8a45-4427a9736950\', \'multiverseId\': 623310}, \'multiverseid\': 623310}, {\'name\': \'大巨人のスフィンクス\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': \'彼が住処とするのは、その忍耐と同じぐらい果てしない眺望の望めるセジーリの最も高い山だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b4afabb-3146-4833-9b36-a110c21841c9\', \'multiverseId\': 623712}, \'multiverseid\': 623712}, {\'name\': \'巨硕史芬斯\', \'text\': \'飞行\', \'type\': \'生物 ～史芬斯\', \'flavor\': \'他在塞基黎最高的山上歇息翅翼；此处的远景无限宽广，一如其耐心。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6853269-119e-4526-a1e3-76e70e6411c8\', \'multiverseId\': 624114}, \'multiverseid\': 624114}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gonti, Fürst der Opulenz\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nWenn Gonti, Fürst der Opulenz, ins Spiel kommt, schaue dir die obersten vier Karten der Bibliothek eines Gegners deiner Wahl an, schicke eine davon verdeckt ins Exil und lege dann den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter seine Bibliothek. Solange die Karte im Exil bleibt, kannst du sie wirken, und Mana beliebigen Typs kann ausgegeben werden, um sie zu wirken.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Äthergeborener, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622971&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7dfd3b1-458f-40ec-83d7-37b230522b2b\', \'multiverseId\': 622971}, \'multiverseid\': 622971}, {\'name\': \'Gonti, señor de la opulencia\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\nCuando Gonti, señor de la opulencia entre al campo de batalla, mira las cuatro primeras cartas de la biblioteca del oponente objetivo y exilia una de ellas boca abajo. Luego, pon el resto en el fondo de esa biblioteca en un orden aleatorio. Puedes lanzar esa carta mientras permanezca exiliada y puedes usar maná de cualquier tipo para lanzarla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bribón etergénito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1acdc40c-3883-4eba-8565-45d2d13afe4f\', \'multiverseId\': 623172}, \'multiverseid\': 623172}, {\'name\': "Gonti, seigneur de l\'opulence", \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nQuand Gonti, seigneur de l\'opulence arrive sur le champ de bataille, regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de la bibliothèque d\'un adversaire ciblé, exilez l\'une d\'elles face cachée, puis mettez le reste au-dessous de cette bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire. Vous pouvez lancer cette carte tant qu\'elle reste exilée, et du mana de n\'importe quel type peut être dépensé pour la lancer.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : éthérien et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623373&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6871065-0c3e-4918-a34d-a0625e965470\', \'multiverseId\': 623373}, \'multiverseid\': 623373}, {\'name\': \'豪華の王、ゴンティ\', \'text\': \'接死\\n豪華の王、ゴンティが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード４枚を見、そのうち１枚を裏向きに追放する。その後、残りをそのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。そのカードが追放され続けているかぎり、あなたはそれを唱えてもよく、それを唱えるために任意のタイプのマナを支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 霊基体・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1f6b3c1-e69a-4d73-936a-59b04b04d77b\', \'multiverseId\': 623775}, \'multiverseid\': 623775}, {\'name\': \'奢华领主贡提\', \'text\': \'死触\\n当奢华领主贡提进战场时，检视目标对手牌库顶的四张牌，将其中一张牌面朝下地放逐，然后将其余的牌以随机顺序置于该牌库底。于该牌持续放逐的时段内，你可以施放该牌，且能用任意种类的法术力来施放。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～乙太种／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'875b3bbb-9272-4f30-859c-6fae09e3d399\', \'multiverseId\': 624177}, \'multiverseid\': 624177}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gorex die Gruftschildkröte\', \'text\': \'Als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, kannst du eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturenkarten aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil schicken. Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickte Karte {2} weniger.\\nTodesberührung\\nImmer wenn Gorex die Gruftschildkröte angreift oder stirbt, bestimme per Zufall eine Karte, die von Gorex ins Exil geschickt wurde, und bringe die Karte auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Zombie, Schildkröte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622973&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75032354-f0b5-4dec-be3a-b7c6f1f3cf52\', \'multiverseId\': 622973}, \'multiverseid\': 622973}, {\'name\': \'Górex, el Caparatúmulo\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, puedes exiliar cualquier cantidad de cartas de criatura de tu cementerio. Te cuesta {2} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada carta exiliada de esta manera.\\nToque mortal.\\nSiempre que Górex, el Caparatúmulo ataque o muera, elige una carta al azar exiliada con Górex y pon esa carta en la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Tortuga zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f7c554f-0495-4f8e-b1cf-b543b396ecd6\', \'multiverseId\': 623174}, \'multiverseid\': 623174}, {\'name\': \'Gorex, la carapace-tombe\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, vous pouvez exiler n\'importe quel nombre de cartes de créature depuis votre cimetière. Ce sort coûte {2} de moins à lancer pour chaque carte exilée de cette manière.\\nContact mortel\\nÀ chaque fois que Gorex, la carapace-tombe attaque ou meurt, choisissez une carte exilée par Gorex au hasard et mettez cette carte dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : zombie et tortue terrestre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623375&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58aa8b5c-15ac-4433-981a-4f5801f423fb\', \'multiverseId\': 623375}, \'multiverseid\': 623375}, {\'name\': \'墓甲羅、ゴーレックス\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、あなたの墓地にある望む枚数のクリーチャー・カードを追放してもよい。この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、これにより追放されたカード１枚につき{2}少なくなる。\\n接死\\n墓甲羅、ゴーレックスが攻撃するか死亡するたび、墓甲羅、ゴーレックスによって追放されているカード１枚を無作為に選び、それのオーナーの手札に加える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゾンビ・海亀\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d9c9b7b-0746-4188-8280-9ca07a229fa7\', \'multiverseId\': 623777}, \'multiverseid\': 623777}, {\'name\': \'驮墓龟高雷兹\', \'text\': \'你可以从你坟墓场放逐任意数量的生物牌，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。每以此法放逐一张牌，此咒语便减少{2}来施放。\\n死触\\n每当驮墓龟高雷兹攻击或死去时，随机选择一张以高雷兹放逐的牌，并将该牌置于其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～灵俑／龟\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d80443e-b942-450c-877f-10e3d7af8db9\', \'multiverseId\': 624179}, \'multiverseid\': 624179}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gossenschütze\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, fügt der Gossenschütze jedem Gegner 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich hab ein neues Spielzeug. Willst du\\\'s mal sehen?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627927&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2e69cdb-c880-4353-a481-95c0a22b1366\', \'multiverseId\': 627927}, \'multiverseid\': 627927}, {\'name\': \'Disparacuneta\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, el Disparacuneta hace 2 puntos de daño a cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'"He encontrado un juguete nuevo. ¿Quieres jugar?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5084dfd6-f127-45d0-a40d-aea43797439a\', \'multiverseId\': 628161}, \'multiverseid\': 628161}, {\'name\': \'どぶ潜み\', \'text\': \'あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つを唱えるたび、どぶ潜みは各対戦相手にそれぞれ２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「新しいオモチャを見つけたのさ。遊んでみるか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6897b537-d011-4cb0-9e66-7fceb716252d\', \'multiverseId\': 628629}, \'multiverseid\': 628629}, {\'name\': \'贫窟伏击客\', \'text\': \'每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，贫窟伏击客向每位对手各造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「我发现一件新玩具。一起玩吗？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ab4ce33-7dda-468b-a7b5-254c7375aabe\', \'multiverseId\': 629097}, \'multiverseid\': 629097}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grab des Geisterdrachen\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Du erhältst für jede farblose Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Stimme ruft mich an diesen Ort, doch sehe ich nur Knochen. Ist das wieder eine Drachenlist?"\\n—Sarkhan Vol\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625710&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef4678b8-2323-4139-baeb-74215cc77925\', \'multiverseId\': 625710}, \'multiverseid\': 625710}, {\'name\': \'Tombeau du dragon-esprit\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T} : Vous gagnez 1 point de vie pour chaque créature incolore que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« La voix m\'appelle ici, mais je ne vois pourtant que des os. Serait-ce encore une ruse de dragon ? »\\n—Sarkhan Vol", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625967&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'761be0a5-d25f-4eae-a2af-1353a2f4510e\', \'multiverseId\': 625967}, \'multiverseid\': 625967}, {\'name\': \'精霊龍の墓\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}：あなたはあなたがコントロールしている無色のクリーチャー１体につき１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「声が私をここまで導いてきたが、ここには骨しかない。これは龍たちによる何かの策略なのか？」\\n――サルカン・ヴォル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d98981f-349a-4825-88fd-1cb36fad4a35\', \'multiverseId\': 626224}, \'multiverseid\': 626224}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grabgewölbe der Champions\', \'text\': \'Das Grabgewölbe der Champions kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du hast zwei oder mehr Gegner.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Wo man der Sieger gedenkt und Momente des Ruhmes verewigt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626646&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e74d0fd3-f66f-4e0d-840d-a9299a6efd9c\', \'multiverseId\': 626646}, \'multiverseid\': 626646}, {\'name\': \'Caveau des champions\', \'text\': "Le Caveau des champions arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous n\'ayez au moins deux adversaires.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Où les vainqueurs sont commémorés et les moments de gloire immortalisés.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626986&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d01120dc-7402-4e09-b5e1-459082fcbb99\', \'multiverseId\': 626986}, \'multiverseid\': 626986}, {\'name\': \'勝者の大霊堂\', \'text\': \'対戦相手が２人以上いないかぎり、勝者の大霊堂はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'勝者を記念し栄光の瞬間を不滅のものとする場所である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66c31890-9257-4e38-951c-555f6ddeb1f6\', \'multiverseId\': 627326}, \'multiverseid\': 627326}, {\'name\': \'冠军拱廊\', \'text\': \'除非你有两位或更多对手，否则冠军拱廊须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{W}或{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'比赛胜者在此名垂青史，光辉瞬间凝华永存于斯。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b425a4b6-ff13-487d-b83c-147007f95d8e\', \'multiverseId\': 627666}, \'multiverseid\': 627666}]', "[{'name': 'Grabgewölbe der Champions', 'text': 'Das Grabgewölbe der Champions kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du hast zwei oder mehr Gegner.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {B}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Wo man der Sieger gedenkt und Momente des Ruhmes verewigt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628134&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1092e4d6-55f3-4ffe-8ab9-e5559982c15c', 'multiverseId': 628134}, 'multiverseid': 628134}, {'name': 'Cripta de los campeones', 'text': 'La Cripta de los campeones entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que tengas dos o más oponentes.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {B}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Donde se homenajea a los campeones y se inmortalizan los momentos de gloria.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628368&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f403921-3d85-40c5-8c66-39efc9486db3', 'multiverseId': 628368}, 'multiverseid': 628368}, {'name': '勝者の大霊堂', 'text': '対戦相手が２人以上いないかぎり、勝者の大霊堂はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{B}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '勝者を記念し栄光の瞬間を不滅のものとする場所である。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628836&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e0691c40-e2ca-4a8c-a409-081b6e0857de', 'multiverseId': 628836}, 'multiverseid': 628836}, {'name': '冠军拱廊', 'text': '除非你有两位或更多对手，否则冠军拱廊须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{W}或{B}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '比赛胜者在此名垂青史，光辉瞬间凝华永存于斯。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629304&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd22dba6b-33ac-4cea-a807-1afb130ca2df', 'multiverseId': 629304}, 'multiverseid': 629304}]", '[{\'name\': \'Grabgewölbe der Champions\', \'text\': \'Das Grabgewölbe der Champions kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du hast zwei oder mehr Gegner.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Sicher, wahrer Selbstwert muss von innen kommen, aber Trophäen sind auch schön."\\n—Kilian, Silberkiel-Magiestudent\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624497&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c77ec03d-b6ca-46a6-a04b-d681c2498f87\', \'multiverseId\': 624497}, \'multiverseid\': 624497}, {\'name\': \'Cripta de los campeones\', \'text\': \'La Cripta de los campeones entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que tengas dos o más oponentes.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Claro, la autoestima de verdad tiene que salir de dentro. Pero los trofeos tampoco están mal".\\n—Killian, estudiante de magia de Plumargéntum\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7d1ce75-c2d8-462e-8af6-0a8fe780ae41\', \'multiverseId\': 624543}, \'multiverseid\': 624543}, {\'name\': \'Caveau des champions\', \'text\': "Le Caveau des champions arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous n\'ayez au moins deux adversaires.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« Bien sûr, la véritable estime de soi doit venir de l\'intérieur, mais les trophées, ce n\'est pas mal non plus. »\\n—Killian, mage-étudiant de Plumargent", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624589&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dcee9f3-d299-4dad-80c8-9b6fbc0bc930\', \'multiverseId\': 624589}, \'multiverseid\': 624589}, {\'name\': \'勝者の大霊堂\', \'text\': \'対戦相手が２人以上いないかぎり、勝者の大霊堂はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「もちろん、真の自尊心は内面からもたらされるものだけど、トロフィーも良いよね。」\\n――シルバークイルの魔道生徒、キリアン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76599a66-e501-4e09-82c0-b935de0dd73f\', \'multiverseId\': 624681}, \'multiverseid\': 624681}, {\'name\': \'冠军拱廊\', \'text\': \'除非你有两位或更多对手，否则冠军拱廊须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{W}或{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「虽然自我价值源自内心认同，但外在奖杯也颇有助益。」\\n～银毫修习法师齐力安\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b187e146-ac27-44bc-89d4-25acf0d0f229\', \'multiverseId\': 624773}, \'multiverseid\': 624773}]', "[{'name': 'Grasland', 'text': 'Das Grasland kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}, opfere das Grasland: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Wald- oder Ebene-Karte, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische danach.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625664&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f6171f90-5d8b-46d3-81c7-e53df9045ccb', 'multiverseId': 625664}, 'multiverseid': 625664}, {'name': 'Herbages', 'text': 'Les Herbages arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagés.\\n{T}, sacrifiez les Herbages : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de forêt ou de plaine, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille, puis mélangez.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625921&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '359c252c-6c23-4f0d-a40f-158b6d61f4c9', 'multiverseId': 625921}, 'multiverseid': 625921}, {'name': '草原', 'text': '草原はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}, 草原を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから森や平地であるカード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626178&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11df7858-7cd4-4f29-9373-f5734a5e6111', 'multiverseId': 626178}, 'multiverseid': 626178}]", "[{'name': 'Grenzland-Kriegstreiberin', 'text': 'Immer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen einen deiner Gegner oder einen Planeswalker, den ein Gegner kontrolliert, angreifen, erhalten sie Bedrohlichkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger', 'flavor': 'Sie kümmert sich nicht um Anführer oder Loyalitäten, solange der Kampf weiter tobt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627922&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '24f92ae5-2a87-4d74-b9da-b171dad1f6c8', 'multiverseId': 627922}, 'multiverseid': 627922}, {'name': 'Belicista de la frontera', 'text': 'Siempre que una o más criaturas ataquen a uno de tus oponentes o a un planeswalker que controlan, esas criaturas ganan la habilidad de amenaza hasta el final del turno.', 'type': 'Criatura — Guerrero humano', 'flavor': 'Mientras la batalla continúe, a ella le importan bien poco los líderes o las lealtades.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628156&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92f28d10-05dc-4094-9ad8-264554ea9bda', 'multiverseId': 628156}, 'multiverseid': 628156}, {'name': '開拓地の戦争屋', 'text': '１体以上のクリーチャーが、対戦相手や、対戦相手がコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーのうち１つを攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、それらのクリーチャーは威迫を得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士', 'flavor': '戦いの勢いが続きさえすれば、指導者とか忠誠心とかは彼女にとってどうでもいい。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628624&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2861a6ec-c5bf-499b-aeda-af4c479347b6', 'multiverseId': 628624}, 'multiverseid': 628624}, {'name': '前线好战者', 'text': '每当一个或数个生物攻击你的一位对手或一个由其操控的鹏洛客时，这些生物获得威慑异能直到回合结束。', 'type': '生物 ～人类／战士', 'flavor': '只要战争能继续，她不在乎听命于谁，也不在乎效忠于谁。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629092&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6688f7a2-6d9c-46b1-91a6-84ae2e34b58b', 'multiverseId': 629092}, 'multiverseid': 629092}]", '[{\'name\': \'Grenzlandbiwak\', \'text\': \'Das Grenzlandbiwak kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}, {U} oder {R}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Die mächtigsten Träume kommen zu denen, die Unterschlupf im Schädel eines Drachen finden."\\n—Chianul, Zweifach-Flüsterer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625659&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1af6e33-878b-4b12-95e3-bdf45b2239d4\', \'multiverseId\': 625659}, \'multiverseid\': 625659}, {\'name\': \'Bivouac de frontière\', \'text\': \'Le Bivouac de frontière arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}, {U} ou {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« De puissants rêves apparaissent à ceux qui s\'abritent dans le crâne d\'un dragon. »\\n—Chëanul, le Passeur de murmures", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625916&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9d466d9-91af-4c33-8e00-b8bad67123e1\', \'multiverseId\': 625916}, \'multiverseid\': 625916}, {\'name\': \'開拓地の野営地\', \'text\': \'開拓地の野営地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}か{U}か{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「龍の髑髏の中を住処とする者には、最も鮮明な夢が訪れるだろう。」\\n――二度囁く者、チアヌル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3beb1309-805b-4758-88b5-50f44bf2c45b\', \'multiverseId\': 626173}, \'multiverseid\': 626173}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grenzo der Verheerer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, bestimme eines —\\n• Stachle eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die jener Spieler kontrolliert.\\n• Schicke die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jenes Spielers ins Exil. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du die Karte wirken, und um sie zu wirken kannst du Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Goblin, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Legt ihr das Feuer. Ich übernehme das Plündern."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626563&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbde8969-bd6f-4e59-b4de-71e9a6cfa91d\', \'multiverseId\': 626563}, \'multiverseid\': 626563}, {\'name\': \'Grenzo, fauteur de ravages\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Incitez une créature ciblée que ce joueur contrôle.\\n• Exilez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de ce joueur. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez lancer cette carte et vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme s\'il s\'agissait de mana de n\'importe quelle couleur pour lancer ce sort.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : gobelin et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'« Toi tu brûles. Et moi je pille. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626903&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af7b4154-5b64-4e82-91f5-f5a36a130109\', \'multiverseId\': 626903}, \'multiverseid\': 626903}, {\'name\': \'騒乱の発端、グレンゾ\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを使嗾する。\\n・そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。ターン終了時まで、あなたはそのカードを唱えてもよく、その呪文を唱えるためにマナを望む色のマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゴブリン・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「お前らは火をつけろ。わしはお宝を頂戴してくる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1be6280-826b-45c1-85a6-9cc3baea7148\', \'multiverseId\': 627243}, \'multiverseid\': 627243}, {\'name\': \'滋事头格伦佐\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，选择一项～\\n•煽惑目标由该牌手操控的生物。\\n•放逐该牌手的牌库顶牌。直到回合结束，你可以施放该牌，且你可以将法术力视同任意颜色的法术力来支付施放该咒语的费用。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～鬼怪／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「你来烧。我来抢。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627583&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87c5f3ed-cf34-4284-8437-b8a5a41ccbee\', \'multiverseId\': 627583}, \'multiverseid\': 627583}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grenzo der Verheerer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, bestimme eines —\\n• Stachle eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die jener Spieler kontrolliert.\\n• Schicke die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jenes Spielers ins Exil. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du die Karte wirken, und um sie zu wirken kannst du Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Goblin, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Legt ihr das Feuer. Ich übernehme das Plündern."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627926&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e4d8394-dcb5-47e1-bfef-70bbe25f67b4\', \'multiverseId\': 627926}, \'multiverseid\': 627926}, {\'name\': \'Grenzo, creador de estragos\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que controlas haga daño de combate a un jugador, elige uno:\\n• Incita la criatura objetivo que controla ese jugador.\\n• Exilia la primera carta de la biblioteca de ese jugador. Hasta el final del turno, puedes lanzar esa carta y puedes usar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier color para lanzarla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bribón trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'"Tú quemas y yo saqueo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fa6532b-1e3f-498a-9071-1a7d0c5efa51\', \'multiverseId\': 628160}, \'multiverseid\': 628160}, {\'name\': \'騒乱の発端、グレンゾ\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを使嗾する。\\n・そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。ターン終了時まで、あなたはそのカードを唱えてもよく、その呪文を唱えるためにマナを望む色のマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゴブリン・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「お前らは火をつけろ。わしはお宝を頂戴してくる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'769dedf5-26c1-44f9-b203-becca1003821\', \'multiverseId\': 628628}, \'multiverseid\': 628628}, {\'name\': \'滋事头格伦佐\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，选择一项～\\n•煽惑目标由该牌手操控的生物。\\n•放逐该牌手的牌库顶牌。直到回合结束，你可以施放该牌，且你可以将法术力视同任意颜色的法术力来支付施放该咒语的费用。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～鬼怪／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「你来烧。我来抢。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3a1bf5b-e812-4390-ad43-11e3ebc81333\', \'multiverseId\': 629096}, \'multiverseid\': 629096}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grenzo der Verheerer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, bestimme eines —\\n• Stachle eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die jener Spieler kontrolliert.\\n• Schicke die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jenes Spielers ins Exil. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du die Karte wirken, und um sie zu wirken kannst du Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Goblin, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629343&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25c2f3f2-1d80-4d14-aa45-ff1edd56e479\', \'multiverseId\': 629343}, \'multiverseid\': 629343}, {\'name\': \'Grenzo, creador de estragos\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que controlas haga daño de combate a un jugador, elige uno:\\n• Incita la criatura objetivo que controla ese jugador.\\n• Exilia la primera carta de la biblioteca de ese jugador. Hasta el final del turno, puedes lanzar esa carta y puedes usar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier color para lanzarla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bribón trasgo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69f4cf7f-350f-4dd8-82a8-6494b9a955f8\', \'multiverseId\': 629367}, \'multiverseid\': 629367}, {\'name\': \'Grenzo, fauteur de ravages\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Incitez une créature ciblée que ce joueur contrôle.\\n• Exilez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de ce joueur. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez lancer cette carte et vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme s\'il s\'agissait de mana de n\'importe quelle couleur pour lancer ce sort.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : gobelin et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629391&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7294a74f-bf3d-4c6d-9073-f7727d1983af\', \'multiverseId\': 629391}, \'multiverseid\': 629391}, {\'name\': \'騒乱の発端、グレンゾ\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを使嗾する。\\n・そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。ターン終了時まで、あなたはそのカードを唱えてもよく、その呪文を唱えるためにマナを望む色のマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゴブリン・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4a6323a-b8ee-4900-a59e-166a73bda7b7\', \'multiverseId\': 629439}, \'multiverseid\': 629439}, {\'name\': \'滋事头格伦佐\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，选择一项～\\n•煽惑目标由该牌手操控的生物。\\n•放逐该牌手的牌库顶牌。直到回合结束，你可以施放该牌，且你可以将法术力视同任意颜色的法术力来支付施放该咒语的费用。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～鬼怪／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59497de1-305b-4fd4-bea1-4525abb389b0\', \'multiverseId\': 629487}, \'multiverseid\': 629487}]', '[{\'name\': \'Griff des Schicksals\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Griff des Schicksals ins Spiel kommt, schicke für jeden Gegner bis zu eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist und die jener Spieler kontrolliert, ins Exil, bis der Griff des Schicksals das Spiel verlässt. (Jene bleibenden Karten kehren unter der Kontrolle ihrer Besitzer ins Spiel zurück.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Nur wenige entkommen aus der Unterwelt. Noch weniger entkommen dem Schicksal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625485&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46f6c0de-bff9-4877-81fc-ebecc8581eab\', \'multiverseId\': 625485}, \'multiverseid\': 625485}, {\'name\': \'Emprise du destin\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Emprise du destin arrive sur le champ de bataille, pour chaque adversaire, exilez jusqu\'à un permanent non-terrain ciblé que ce joueur contrôle jusqu\'à ce que l\'Emprise du destin quitte le champ de bataille. (Ces permanents sont renvoyés sous le contrôle de leurs propriétaires.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Peu de gens peuvent se targuer d\'avoir échappé au Monde souterrain. Encore moins peuvent se targuer d\'avoir échappé au destin.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625742&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e377bec6-85dc-4640-ac1f-10a121241508\', \'multiverseId\': 625742}, \'multiverseid\': 625742}, {\'name\': \'命運の掌握\', \'text\': \'命運の掌握が戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネント最大１つを対象とする。命運の掌握が戦場を離れるまで、それらを追放する。（それらのパーマネントはオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻る。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'死の国から逃れるものは数少ない。運命から逃れるものはさらに少ない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2abf6c41-1bcc-4679-a25d-aea5e42120e4\', \'multiverseId\': 625999}, \'multiverseid\': 625999}]', "[{'name': 'Grimmiger Empath', 'text': 'Wenn der Grimmige Empath ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Kreaturenkarte mit Manabetrag 6 oder mehr durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf deine Hand nehmen und danach mischen.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elf', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627986&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ca0f7ce-1910-411f-93dc-44527e1ba70a', 'multiverseId': 627986}, 'multiverseid': 627986}, {'name': 'Émpata fiero', 'text': 'Cuando el Émpata fiero entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de criatura con valor de maná de 6 o más, mostrarla, ponerla en tu mano y luego barajar.', 'type': 'Criatura — Elfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628220&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '381f20f9-205a-438a-b384-30c50c100863', 'multiverseId': 628220}, 'multiverseid': 628220}, {'name': '激情の共感者', 'text': '激情の共感者が戦場に出たとき、「あなたのライブラリーからマナ総量が６以上のクリーチャー・カード１枚を探し、公開してあなたの手札に加え、その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルフ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628688&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de8d66e8-4fe0-4d6a-80ee-60bc9d2d6648', 'multiverseId': 628688}, 'multiverseid': 628688}, {'name': '好斗共感者', 'text': '当好斗共感者进战场时，你可以从你牌库中搜寻一张法术力值等于或大于6的生物牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。', 'type': '生物 ～妖精', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629156&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '290c767b-b3df-4411-ae77-119a144e3c58', 'multiverseId': 629156}, 'multiverseid': 629156}]", "[{'name': 'Grollgröhler', 'text': 'Wenn der Grollgröhler das Spiel verlässt, fügt er einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 6 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nHerbeirufen {1}{R}{R} (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch für seine Herbeirufungskosten wirken. Falls du dies tust, wird die Kreatur geopfert, wenn sie ins Spiel kommt.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elementarwesen', 'flavor': 'Sein Zorn hat ihn in der Hand. Du hingegen solltest die Beine in die Hand nehmen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627955&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3fa299df-91fc-445d-a18c-480063d8759f', 'multiverseId': 627955}, 'multiverseid': 627955}, {'name': 'Bramador malicioso', 'text': 'Cuando el Bramador malicioso deje el campo de batalla, hace 6 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\\nEvocar {1}{R}{R}. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo por su coste de evocar. Si lo haces, sacrifícalo cuando entre al campo de batalla.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Elemental', 'flavor': 'De matarte es capaz. Tú deberías escapar.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628189&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa825034-4326-489f-aeba-13cc1ca9df4f', 'multiverseId': 628189}, 'multiverseid': 628189}, {'name': '恨み唸り', 'text': '恨み唸りが戦場を離れたとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。恨み唸りはそれに６点のダメージを与える。\\n想起{1}{R}{R}（この呪文を想起コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、これが戦場に出たとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': 'それはすぐにアツくなる。もう逃げた方がいいだろう。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628657&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2792eb5f-58ae-4e5d-bed1-0074ce7b79fd', 'multiverseId': 628657}, 'multiverseid': 628657}, {'name': '怨吼灵', 'text': '当怨吼灵离开战场时，它对目标生物造成6点伤害。\\n呼魂{1}{R}{R}（你可以支付此咒语的呼魂费用来施放它。若你如此作，当它进战场时便牺牲之。）', 'type': '生物 ～元素', 'flavor': '它情绪不断爬高。你最好快往高爬。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629125&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '63f31560-72cd-4dbe-9ef7-eb76ad2c65cd', 'multiverseId': 629125}, 'multiverseid': 629125}]", '[{\'name\': \'Großer Abschaffer\', \'text\': \'Während deines Zuges können deine Gegner keine Zaubersprüche wirken und keine Fähigkeiten von Artefakten, Kreaturen oder Verzauberungen aktivieren.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Dein Aberglauben und dein Gemurmel halten meiner Rechtschaffenheit nicht stand."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622836&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'045b5bab-8acd-42dd-998d-12b733e51c0b\', \'multiverseId\': 622836}, \'multiverseid\': 622836}, {\'name\': \'Gran abolidor\', \'text\': \'Durante tu turno, tus oponentes no pueden lanzar hechizos ni activar habilidades de artefactos, criaturas o encantamientos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Tus supersticiones y balbuceos no servirán de nada frente a mi rectitud".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d8a6958-46e8-4c99-ab82-e8305027ff0f\', \'multiverseId\': 623037}, \'multiverseid\': 623037}, {\'name\': \'Grand abolisseur\', \'text\': "Pendant votre tour, vos adversaires ne peuvent pas lancer de sorts ou activer des capacités d\'artefacts, de créatures ou d\'enchantements.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': \'« Vos superstitions et vos grommellements sont impuissants face à ma droiture. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623238&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15ff3ad1-4b7a-48c0-b70f-609b94504964\', \'multiverseId\': 623238}, \'multiverseid\': 623238}, {\'name\': \'堂々たる撤廃者\', \'text\': \'あなたのターン中、各対戦相手は呪文を唱えることも、アーティファクトやクリーチャーやエンチャントの能力を起動することもできない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「お前の迷信や戯言は、私の正義の前には無用の屑だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b22b336-9b84-4a69-9ac1-f7fc8bb6f006\', \'multiverseId\': 623640}, \'multiverseid\': 623640}, {\'name\': \'止咒高僧\', \'text\': \'于你的回合中，所有对手都不能施放咒语或起动神器，生物或结界的异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「在我正气当前，你那些迷信与呓语都是无用长物。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54f53d7a-b95d-42f4-816b-81cdbe6baf91\', \'multiverseId\': 624042}, \'multiverseid\': 624042}]', '[{\'name\': \'Großer Abschaffer\', \'text\': \'Während deines Zuges können deine Gegner keine Zaubersprüche wirken und keine Fähigkeiten von Artefakten, Kreaturen oder Verzauberungen aktivieren.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Dein Aberglauben und dein Gemurmel halten meiner Rechtschaffenheit nicht stand."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626485&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9a453a9-54d9-43ae-9efd-aa5099409b44\', \'multiverseId\': 626485}, \'multiverseid\': 626485}, {\'name\': \'Grand abolisseur\', \'text\': "Pendant votre tour, vos adversaires ne peuvent pas lancer de sorts ou activer des capacités d\'artefacts, de créatures ou d\'enchantements.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': \'« Vos superstitions et vos grommellements sont impuissants face à ma droiture. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626825&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b22472dd-99ea-436a-9c27-61f67af25c1d\', \'multiverseId\': 626825}, \'multiverseid\': 626825}, {\'name\': \'堂々たる撤廃者\', \'text\': \'あなたのターン中、各対戦相手は呪文を唱えることも、アーティファクトやクリーチャーやエンチャントの能力を起動することもできない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「お前の迷信や戯言は、私の正義の前には無用の屑だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22b9bb65-ba56-4943-b963-1e1352cd10e4\', \'multiverseId\': 627165}, \'multiverseid\': 627165}, {\'name\': \'止咒高僧\', \'text\': \'于你的回合中，所有对手都不能施放咒语或起动神器，生物或结界的异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「在我正气当前，你那些迷信与呓语都是无用长物。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc9a7539-ef9e-402f-8ef5-1210ffdc4bd3\', \'multiverseId\': 627505}, \'multiverseid\': 627505}]', '[{\'name\': \'Großer Abschaffer\', \'text\': \'Während deines Zuges können deine Gegner keine Zaubersprüche wirken und keine Fähigkeiten von Artefakten, Kreaturen oder Verzauberungen aktivieren.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe genug von dir gehört, Ketzer."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624455&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f10fc766-6acd-4b55-b130-7b51ebc5c67a\', \'multiverseId\': 624455}, \'multiverseid\': 624455}, {\'name\': \'Gran abolidor\', \'text\': \'Durante tu turno, tus oponentes no pueden lanzar hechizos ni activar habilidades de artefactos, criaturas o encantamientos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"No necesito escucharte más, hereje".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aad3f005-f3be-4ee8-8f31-a75cfb4530bb\', \'multiverseId\': 624501}, \'multiverseid\': 624501}, {\'name\': \'Grand abolisseur\', \'text\': "Pendant votre tour, vos adversaires ne peuvent pas lancer de sorts ou activer des capacités d\'artefacts, de créatures ou d\'enchantements.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': "« Je t\'ai suffisamment entendu comme ça, hérétique. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624547&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d899bb8a-87e2-47a5-8831-533dcc6d0f4f\', \'multiverseId\': 624547}, \'multiverseid\': 624547}, {\'name\': \'堂々たる撤廃者\', \'text\': \'あなたのターン中、各対戦相手は呪文を唱えることも、アーティファクトやクリーチャーやエンチャントの能力を起動することもできない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「異端者よ、お前の言葉はもう聞き飽きた。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73a01258-1236-4da3-8e54-b9a3015cf699\', \'multiverseId\': 624639}, \'multiverseid\': 624639}, {\'name\': \'止咒高僧\', \'text\': \'于你的回合中，所有对手都不能施放咒语或起动神器，生物或结界的异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「异说惑众的逆贼，我听够了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d87f0cb-1242-45ce-bab6-1c8d5281d0b1\', \'multiverseId\': 624731}, \'multiverseid\': 624731}]', '[{\'name\': \'Großer Tanuki\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nBlutzoll — {2}{G}, wirf den Großen Tanuki ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Hund\', \'flavor\': \'Die Kami erlauben nur wenigen Sterblichen, im Jukai-Wald zu wohnen, aber die klugen, verspielten Tanuki sind als Freunde und Wächter willkommen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625559&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab7bdf2a-7519-4d59-a7ff-feaaa7f89c01\', \'multiverseId\': 625559}, \'multiverseid\': 625559}, {\'name\': \'Grand tanuki\', \'text\': \'Piétinement\\nTransfert — {2}{G}, défaussez-vous du Grand tanuki : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.\', \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : chien\', \'flavor\': "Les kami n\'autorisent que peu de mortels à résider dans la Forêt de Jukai, mais les tanuki rusés et enjoués sont accueillis comme amis et gardiens.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625816&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b789bc3f-7eca-4324-b6db-2dc30ab7ea6b\', \'multiverseId\': 625816}, \'multiverseid\': 625816}, {\'name\': \'大狸\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n魂力 — {2}{G}, 大狸を捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — 犬\', \'flavor\': \'神が樹海の森に暮らすことを許す定命の者は数限られるが、賢くて陽気な狸は友人や守り手として歓迎されている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b34156d5-e44f-4d8c-8309-3227308febd2\', \'multiverseId\': 626073}, \'multiverseid\': 626073}]', "[{'name': 'Großzügiges Geschenk', 'text': 'Zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl. Ihr Beherrscher erzeugt einen 3/3 grünen Elefant-Kreaturenspielstein.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Die besten Geschenke können unmöglich weiterverschenkt werden.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622835&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa9570ee-59c8-47c0-b3ad-f851a22437c5', 'multiverseId': 622835}, 'multiverseid': 622835}, {'name': 'Regalo paquidérmico', 'text': 'Destruye el permanente objetivo. Su controlador crea una ficha de criatura Elefante verde 3/3.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Los mejores regalos son los que no pueden volverse a ofrecer a nadie.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623036&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '17f57fe5-2a19-4a84-98fd-2332496c5e40', 'multiverseId': 623036}, 'multiverseid': 623036}, {'name': 'Cadeau généreux', 'text': 'Détruisez un permanent ciblé. Son contrôleur crée un jeton de créature 3/3 verte Éléphant.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Les meilleurs cadeaux sont impossibles à rétrocéder.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623237&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8deb6aad-81b2-4e2a-903f-4730a844875c', 'multiverseId': 623237}, 'multiverseid': 623237}, {'name': '過大な贈り物', 'text': 'パーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。それのコントローラーは緑の３/３の象・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '最高の贈り物は他人に渡せない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623639&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3663128c-09de-4961-bc6b-1413999aea8a', 'multiverseId': 623639}, 'multiverseid': 623639}, {'name': '慷慨赠礼', 'text': '消灭目标永久物。其操控者派出一个3/3绿色的象衍生生物。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '最好的礼物都无法转送。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624041&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '79e82577-c05d-42b7-b690-dd9425ee9e13', 'multiverseId': 624041}, 'multiverseid': 624041}]", '[{\'name\': \'Großzügiges Geschenk\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl. Ihr Beherrscher erzeugt einen 3/3 grünen Elefant-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Kalt serviert? Unsinn! Die beste Art, Rache zu servieren, ist mit einem nervös veranlagten Elefanten! Das weiß man doch."\\n—Avenir der Kleinliche\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624454&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38e0a563-ad54-4d65-8de7-e463a1730c77\', \'multiverseId\': 624454}, \'multiverseid\': 624454}, {\'name\': \'Regalo paquidérmico\', \'text\': \'Destruye el permanente objetivo. Su controlador crea una ficha de criatura Elefante verde 3/3.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Un plato que se sirve frío? ¡Tonterías! ¡La mejor manera de vengarse es con un elefante intranquilo! Lo sabe todo el mundo".\\n—Avenir el Ruin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a6297e2-1076-4386-8005-262798a256ed\', \'multiverseId\': 624500}, \'multiverseid\': 624500}, {\'name\': \'Cadeau généreux\', \'text\': \'Détruisez un permanent ciblé. Son contrôleur crée un jeton de créature 3/3 verte Éléphant.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Qui se mange froid ? N\'importe quoi ! La vengeance est un plat qui se mange avec un éléphant nerveux ! Tout le monde le sait. »\\n—Avénir le mesquin", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624546&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0efc033a-bc35-4890-897c-63785c556cc6\', \'multiverseId\': 624546}, \'multiverseid\': 624546}, {\'name\': \'過大な贈り物\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。それのコントローラーは緑の３/３の象・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「忘れたころに復讐する？とんでもない！虫の居所が悪い象を使った復讐が一番堪えますよ！そんなこと誰だって知ってます！」\\n——つまらなきものアヴニール\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b134635b-01d8-423d-83ec-625239d4cbdc\', \'multiverseId\': 624638}, \'multiverseid\': 624638}, {\'name\': \'慷慨赠礼\', \'text\': \'消灭目标永久物。其操控者派出一个3/3绿色的象衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「冷血无情？胡说八道！大象明明是温血动物，利用热情活跃的个体来复仇效果更佳！人人都知道这点。」\\n～小心眼艾维尼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8965a05-19a8-4395-83e5-e934ea935201\', \'multiverseId\': 624730}, \'multiverseid\': 624730}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gruftremasuri\', \'text\': \'Alle Remasuris haben „{T}: Regeneriere einen Remasuri deiner Wahl." (Das nächste Mal, dass er zerstört würde, tappe ihn stattdessen, entferne ihn aus dem Kampf und heile allen auf ihm vermerkten Schaden.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'„Jemand hat sich schon wieder an den Gräbern zu schaffen gemacht. Aber welcher Grabräuber benutzt bitte schön eine Spitzhacke?"\\n—Morgan, Friedhofswärter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625525&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2a8fa56-ba1f-4e28-8bd6-6a3cb310f23d\', \'multiverseId\': 625525}, \'multiverseid\': 625525}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde des cryptes\', \'text\': "Tous les slivoïdes ont « {T} : Régénérez un slivoïde ciblé. » (La prochaine fois qu\'elle devrait être détruite, à la place, engagez-la, retirez-la du combat et retirez-lui toutes ses blessures.)", \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "« Quelqu\'un a encore profané les tombes. Mais quel genre de pilleur de tombe travaille à la pioche ? »\\n—Morgan, gardien du cimetière", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625782&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fae7ae1e-50fc-42de-97eb-34a0a395bd59\', \'multiverseId\': 625782}, \'multiverseid\': 625782}, {\'name\': \'墓所スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'すべてのスリヴァーは「{T}：スリヴァー１体を対象とする。それを再生する。」を持つ。（それが次に破壊されるなら、代わりにそれをタップし、戦闘から取り除き、それが負っているすべてのダメージを回復する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'「誰かがまた墓を荒らしていたようだ。だが墓荒らしにつるはしを使う奴なんて聞いたことがない。」\\n――墓守、モーガン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'773307fa-5bf5-4473-a145-912a274654a7\', \'multiverseId\': 626039}, \'multiverseid\': 626039}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grundsteuer\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls ein Gegner mehr Länder kontrolliert als du, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach bis zu drei Standardland-Karten durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf deine Hand nehmen und danach mischen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622846&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46421816-2b3f-47f6-82b5-19c782050ac2\', \'multiverseId\': 622846}, \'multiverseid\': 622846}, {\'name\': \'Impuesto sobre las tierras\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si un oponente controla más tierras que tú, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca hasta tres cartas de tierra básica, mostrarlas, ponerlas en tu mano y luego barajar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c68cb83-ff41-46fe-a7ec-634f8b5e4631\', \'multiverseId\': 623047}, \'multiverseid\': 623047}, {\'name\': \'Contribution foncière\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, si un adversaire contrôle plus de terrains que vous, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à trois cartes de terrain de base, les révéler, les mettre dans votre main, puis mélanger.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623248&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7784451c-c81b-4264-861d-026411cbe437\', \'multiverseId\': 623248}, \'multiverseid\': 623248}, {\'name\': \'土地税\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、対戦相手１人があなたよりも多くの土地をコントロールしている場合、「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大３枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a466e411-d8cd-493e-a920-f45c52f7ffce\', \'multiverseId\': 623650}, \'multiverseid\': 623650}, {\'name\': \'抽地税\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，若某对手操控的地比你多，则你可以从你牌库中搜寻至多三张基本地牌，展示这些牌，将它们置于你手上，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4efa5890-d884-46fd-8963-4a4c951fef58\', \'multiverseId\': 624052}, \'multiverseid\': 624052}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grundsteuer\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls ein Gegner mehr Länder kontrolliert als du, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach bis zu drei Standardland-Karten durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf deine Hand nehmen und danach mischen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626489&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d7eebbc-5309-4576-bad4-a8eb4ba1f8b5\', \'multiverseId\': 626489}, \'multiverseid\': 626489}, {\'name\': \'Contribution foncière\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, si un adversaire contrôle plus de terrains que vous, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à trois cartes de terrain de base, les révéler, les mettre dans votre main, puis mélanger.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626829&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'247251fa-19d4-4a7a-87df-14112ee7c40d\', \'multiverseId\': 626829}, \'multiverseid\': 626829}, {\'name\': \'土地税\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、対戦相手１人があなたよりも多くの土地をコントロールしている場合、「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大３枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e015aa82-4469-4db4-9c6c-fa3dff1218d7\', \'multiverseId\': 627169}, \'multiverseid\': 627169}, {\'name\': \'抽地税\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，若某对手操控的地比你多，则你可以从你牌库中搜寻至多三张基本地牌，展示这些牌，将它们置于你手上，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45d07667-2a38-460e-9c73-80a675f10aee\', \'multiverseId\': 627509}, \'multiverseid\': 627509}]', '[{\'name\': \'Guff schreibt die Geschichte neu\', \'text\': \'Bestimme für jeden Spieler eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die weder eine Verzauberung noch ein Land ist und die jener Spieler kontrolliert. Die Besitzer jener bleibenden Karten mischen sie in ihre Bibliothek. Jeder Spieler, der eine jener bleibenden Karten kontrolliert hat, schickt Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis er eine Nichtland-Karte ins Exil schickt und legt dann den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter seine Bibliothek. Jeder Spieler kann die Nichtland-Karte, die er ins Exil geschickt hat, wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624928&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2340782d-db9e-4338-bc17-ad3f0f07fb99\', \'multiverseId\': 624928}, \'multiverseid\': 624928}, {\'name\': "Calembredaine réécrit l\'histoire", \'text\': "Pour chaque joueur, choisissez un permanent non-enchantement, non-terrain ciblé que ce joueur contrôle. Les propriétaires de ces permanents les mélangent dans leurs bibliothèques. Chaque joueur qui contrôlait un de ces permanents exile les cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce qu\'il exile une carte non-terrain, puis met le reste au-dessous de sa bibliothèque, dans un ordre aléatoire. Chaque joueur peut lancer la carte non-terrain qu\'il a exilée sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624963&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04a6b02f-4be8-4be5-829a-c3cdd955b9ca\', \'multiverseId\': 624963}, \'multiverseid\': 624963}, {\'name\': \'ガフが歴史を書き換える\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーにつきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしていてエンチャントでも土地でもないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それらのパーマネントのオーナーはそれを自分のライブラリーに加えて切り直す。それらのパーマネント１つ以上をコントロールしていた各プレイヤーは、土地でないカード１枚が追放されるまで、自分のライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していき、その後、残りをライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、これにより自分が追放していて土地でないカード１枚をマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a5657fd-fba2-4f37-a835-eb166aa7c891\', \'multiverseId\': 624998}, \'multiverseid\': 624998}, {\'name\': \'古夫修史\', \'text\': \'为每位牌手各选择一个由其操控、既非结界也非地的永久物。这些永久物的拥有者各将它们洗入其牌库。对每位操控过前述永久物之一的牌手而言，该牌手从其牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张非地牌为止，然后将其余的牌以随机顺序置于其牌库底。每位牌手各可以施放其放逐的非地牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5afc976-990a-41eb-959b-71c1ed6322be\', \'multiverseId\': 625033}, \'multiverseid\': 625033}]', '[{\'name\': \'Guff schreibt die Geschichte neu\', \'text\': \'Bestimme für jeden Spieler eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die weder eine Verzauberung noch ein Land ist und die jener Spieler kontrolliert. Die Besitzer jener bleibenden Karten mischen sie in ihre Bibliothek. Jeder Spieler, der eine jener bleibenden Karten kontrolliert hat, schickt Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis er eine Nichtland-Karte ins Exil schickt und legt dann den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter seine Bibliothek. Jeder Spieler kann die Nichtland-Karte, die er ins Exil geschickt hat, wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625134&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6aab2f02-a365-453c-a883-119528ec9a47\', \'multiverseId\': 625134}, \'multiverseid\': 625134}, {\'name\': "Calembredaine réécrit l\'histoire", \'text\': "Pour chaque joueur, choisissez un permanent non-enchantement, non-terrain ciblé que ce joueur contrôle. Les propriétaires de ces permanents les mélangent dans leurs bibliothèques. Chaque joueur qui contrôlait un de ces permanents exile les cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce qu\'il exile une carte non-terrain, puis met le reste au-dessous de sa bibliothèque, dans un ordre aléatoire. Chaque joueur peut lancer la carte non-terrain qu\'il a exilée sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625166&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba5b62bf-1e9a-4280-8ccf-61376040b799\', \'multiverseId\': 625166}, \'multiverseid\': 625166}, {\'name\': \'ガフが歴史を書き換える\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーにつきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしていてエンチャントでも土地でもないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それらのパーマネントのオーナーはそれを自分のライブラリーに加えて切り直す。それらのパーマネント１つ以上をコントロールしていた各プレイヤーは、土地でないカード１枚が追放されるまで、自分のライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していき、その後、残りをライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、これにより自分が追放していて土地でないカード１枚をマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52e92895-7bbc-4824-b4fd-4c141576709a\', \'multiverseId\': 625198}, \'multiverseid\': 625198}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hackender Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Erstschlag.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'Remasuris kann man nicht überraschen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625544&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ef05ccc-9f90-413c-b3dd-3b4854aa0ec4\', \'multiverseId\': 625544}, \'multiverseid\': 625544}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde frappeur\', \'text\': "Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont l\'initiative.", \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': \'Il est impossible de surprendre un slivoïde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625801&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'691275c1-1c55-42a1-9714-81f0838faf73\', \'multiverseId\': 625801}, \'multiverseid\': 625801}, {\'name\': \'先制スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのスリヴァー・クリーチャーは先制攻撃を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'スリヴァーの不意をつくことなど不可能だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8119b8e1-9ad9-4a45-918f-65f88f575f3a\', \'multiverseId\': 626058}, \'multiverseid\': 626058}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hafenstadt\', \'text\': \'Sowie die Hafenstadt ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Ebene- oder Insel-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt die Hafenstadt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625681&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70dde593-4e72-4833-ac63-2c9a638fc5a8\', \'multiverseId\': 625681}, \'multiverseid\': 625681}, {\'name\': \'Ville portuaire\', \'text\': "Au moment où la Ville portuaire arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte de plaine ou d\'île de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, la Ville portuaire arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625938&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f12a324d-643f-42ea-913f-91a53186200b\', \'multiverseId\': 625938}, \'multiverseid\': 625938}, {\'name\': \'港町\', \'text\': \'港町が戦場に出るに際し、あなたはあなたの手札にあり平地や島であるカード１枚を公開してもよい。そうしないなら、港町はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87d0d62b-2fa2-4fed-8a87-6ac1f9039903\', \'multiverseId\': 626195}, \'multiverseid\': 626195}]', '[{\'name\': \'Halsstarriger Schwertzahn\', \'text\': \'Aufstieg (Falls du zehn oder mehr bleibende Karten kontrollierst, erhältst du für den Rest der Partie den Segen der Stadt.)\\nDu darfst in jedem deiner Züge ein zusätzliches Land spielen.\\nDer Halsstarrige Schwertzahn kann nicht angreifen oder blocken, es sei denn, du hast den Segen der Stadt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dinosaurier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626601&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'710e9b05-6755-453f-bc51-f0e5e23c6edc\', \'multiverseId\': 626601}, \'multiverseid\': 626601}, {\'name\': \'Crocs-de-sabre rétif\', \'text\': "Ascension (Si vous contrôlez au moins dix permanents, vous gagnez l\'agrément de la cité pour le reste de la partie.)\\nVous pouvez jouer un terrain supplémentaire pendant chacun de vos tours.\\nLe Crocs-de-sabre rétif ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer à moins que vous n\'ayez l\'agrément de la cité.", \'type\': \'Créature : dinosaure\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626941&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5a1f4d5-7c65-4061-b610-ab82f8e71c00\', \'multiverseId\': 626941}, \'multiverseid\': 626941}, {\'name\': \'むら気な長剣歯\', \'text\': \'昇殿（あなたが10個以上のパーマネントをコントロールしているなら、このゲームの間、あなたは都市の承認を得る。）\\nあなたの各ターンに、あなたは追加の土地１つをプレイしてもよい。\\nあなたが都市の承認を持っていないかぎり、むら気な長剣歯では攻撃もブロックもできない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 恐竜\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'929843b7-035b-4f64-8ef1-80f70035d78f\', \'multiverseId\': 627281}, \'multiverseid\': 627281}, {\'name\': \'刚愎剑齿龙\', \'text\': \'登殿（如果你操控十个或更多永久物，则于这盘游戏接下来的时段中，你得到黄金城祝福。）\\n你在自己的每个回合中可以额外使用一个地。\\n除非你有黄金城祝福，否则刚愎剑齿龙不能进行攻击或阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恐龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'804d0227-25d0-43a4-8287-00e333edfa6c\', \'multiverseId\': 627621}, \'multiverseid\': 627621}]', "[{'name': 'Halsstarriger Schwertzahn', 'text': 'Aufstieg (Falls du zehn oder mehr bleibende Karten kontrollierst, erhältst du für den Rest der Partie den Segen der Stadt.)\\nDu darfst in jedem deiner Züge ein zusätzliches Land spielen.\\nDer Halsstarrige Schwertzahn kann nicht angreifen oder blocken, es sei denn, du hast den Segen der Stadt.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Dinosaurier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628029&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e5d92f0c-fea7-4a52-958a-79a9a8be7177', 'multiverseId': 628029}, 'multiverseid': 628029}, {'name': 'Colmilloespada descontrolado', 'text': 'Ascender. (Si controlas diez o más permanentes, obtienes la bendición de la ciudad durante el resto del juego.)\\nPuedes jugar una tierra adicional en cada uno de tus turnos.\\nEl Colmilloespada descontrolado no puede atacar ni bloquear a menos que tengas la bendición de la ciudad.', 'type': 'Criatura — Dinosaurio', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628263&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '29230535-15e1-4101-aee7-435ac1f06370', 'multiverseId': 628263}, 'multiverseid': 628263}, {'name': 'むら気な長剣歯', 'text': '昇殿（あなたが10個以上のパーマネントをコントロールしているなら、このゲームの間、あなたは都市の承認を得る。）\\nあなたの各ターンに、あなたは追加の土地１つをプレイしてもよい。\\nあなたが都市の承認を持っていないかぎり、むら気な長剣歯では攻撃もブロックもできない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 恐竜', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628731&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4a862148-a3af-440d-9e48-42c9a84f85e0', 'multiverseId': 628731}, 'multiverseid': 628731}, {'name': '刚愎剑齿龙', 'text': '登殿（如果你操控十个或更多永久物，则于这盘游戏接下来的时段中，你得到黄金城祝福。）\\n你在自己的每个回合中可以额外使用一个地。\\n除非你有黄金城祝福，否则刚愎剑齿龙不能进行攻击或阻挡。', 'type': '生物 ～恐龙', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629199&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '72d9191d-6203-4a06-9893-61f463a4e51b', 'multiverseId': 629199}, 'multiverseid': 629199}]", '[{\'name\': \'Hamza, Wächter von Arashin\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und auf der eine +1/+1-Marke liegt, {1} weniger.\\nKreaturenzauber, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und auf der eine +1/+1-Marke liegt, {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elefant, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich stehe zu jedem Mitglied meines Klans, und sie stehen zu mir."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628037&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05b31918-259e-451d-af1b-8a7c67887092\', \'multiverseId\': 628037}, \'multiverseid\': 628037}, {\'name\': \'Hamza, guardián de Arashin\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada criatura que controlas con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.\\nTe cuesta {1} menos lanzar hechizos de criatura por cada criatura que controlas con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero elefante\', \'flavor\': \'"Apoyo a todos los miembros de mi clan, y ellos me apoyan a mí".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'111ca04d-7c6e-4e37-8496-d2008f802f24\', \'multiverseId\': 628271}, \'multiverseid\': 628271}, {\'name\': \'アラシンの守護者、ハムザ\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたがコントロールしていて＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているクリーチャー１体につき{1}少なくなる。\\nあなたがクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたがコントロールしていて＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているクリーチャー１体につき{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 象・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「我が身は氏族の全員とともに。氏族は我が身とともに。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00c359ac-e0f3-4b0f-b5bb-e41af9054c10\', \'multiverseId\': 628739}, \'multiverseid\': 628739}, {\'name\': \'阿拉辛守护者哈姆札\', \'text\': \'你每操控一个其上有+1/+1指示物的生物，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。\\n你每操控一个其上有+1/+1指示物的生物，你施放的生物咒语便减少{1}来施放。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～象／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「我与部落每位成员并肩，他们也时刻与我同在。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1683fb24-9234-473c-a278-2223aad627ab\', \'multiverseId\': 629207}, \'multiverseid\': 629207}]', "[{'name': 'Hangar-Schreiter', 'text': 'Der Hangar-Schreiter kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Hangar-Schreiter stirbt, erzeuge für jede +1/+1-Marke auf dem Hangar-Schreiter einen 1/1 farblosen Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\n{1}, {T}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Hangar-Schreiter.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625613&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3cd6b433-56e3-42ba-95d9-f8d46268e532', 'multiverseId': 625613}, 'multiverseid': 625613}, {'name': 'Marcheur porte-hangars', 'text': 'Le Marcheur porte-hangars arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.\\nQuand le Marcheur porte-hangars meurt, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol pour chaque marqueur +1/+1 sur le Marcheur porte-hangars.\\n{1}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Marcheur porte-hangars.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : construction', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625870&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6cc7777a-e751-4076-a44f-7009d5ad75ef', 'multiverseId': 625870}, 'multiverseid': 625870}, {'name': '搭載歩行機械', 'text': '搭載歩行機械は、＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n搭載歩行機械が死亡したとき、これの上にある＋１/＋１カウンター１個につき１体の、飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\\n{1}, {T}：搭載歩行機械の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626127&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '504d0d53-604a-4ecb-8329-7eaead09f848', 'multiverseId': 626127}, 'multiverseid': 626127}]", '[{\'name\': \'Hanna die Navigatorin\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}{U}, {T}: Bringe eine Artefakt- oder Verzauberungskarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich hätte nie gedacht, dass ich mein Leben mit Kämpfen verbringe. Ich bin eine Schafferin, keine Zerstörerin."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626605&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27fb80e4-0354-4de9-a918-23fd78c52e7b\', \'multiverseId\': 626605}, \'multiverseid\': 626605}, {\'name\': \'Hanna la navigatrice\', \'text\': "{1}{W}{U}, {T} : Renvoyez une carte d\'artefact ou d\'enchantement ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': "« Je n\'avais jamais pensé que je passerais ma vie à me battre. J\'étais faite pour bâtir, non pour détruire. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626945&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b11b1b46-ef63-4e24-84d3-de47ac15883c\', \'multiverseId\': 626945}, \'multiverseid\': 626945}, {\'name\': \'航行長ハナ\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}{U}, {T}：あなたの墓地にありアーティファクトやエンチャントであるカード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'「わたし、戦いの人生を過ごすなんて思ってもいなかったわ。わたしは創造者なのよ、破壊者じゃなくてね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6731de2e-0fd0-4490-9548-c2df4a89e28a\', \'multiverseId\': 627285}, \'multiverseid\': 627285}, {\'name\': \'领航员哈娜\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}{U}，{T}：将目标神器或结界牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'「我竟会将生命虚掷于战斗中。我该作的是创造，而不是破坏。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88ce9c36-8be7-4734-8b35-20c1c06e264a\', \'multiverseId\': 627625}, \'multiverseid\': 627625}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hanna die Navigatorin\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}{U}, {T}: Bringe eine Artefakt- oder Verzauberungskarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich hätte nie gedacht, dass ich mein Leben mit Kämpfen verbringe. Ich bin eine Schafferin, keine Zerstörerin."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628038&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76a47315-7e9d-4102-853b-17792a163015\', \'multiverseId\': 628038}, \'multiverseid\': 628038}, {\'name\': \'Hanna, navegante del barco\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}{U}, {T}: Regresa la carta de artefacto o de encantamiento objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Nunca pensé que pasaría toda mi vida luchando. Soy una creadora, no una destructora".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1867b6b2-b52f-498a-8b6c-54911a0bc69a\', \'multiverseId\': 628272}, \'multiverseid\': 628272}, {\'name\': \'航行長ハナ\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}{U}, {T}：あなたの墓地にありアーティファクトやエンチャントであるカード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'「わたし、戦いの人生を過ごすなんて思ってもいなかったわ。わたしは創造者なのよ、破壊者じゃなくてね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5caacff-8c75-425c-b3bc-597cd82a0b39\', \'multiverseId\': 628740}, \'multiverseid\': 628740}, {\'name\': \'领航员哈娜\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}{U}，{T}：将目标神器或结界牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'「我竟会将生命虚掷于战斗中。我该作的是创造，而不是破坏。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c81ea0cb-4c84-448c-974f-d63507af2775\', \'multiverseId\': 629208}, \'multiverseid\': 629208}]', '[{\'name\': \'Harmonieremasuri\', \'text\': \'Alle Remasuris haben „Wenn diese bleibende Karte ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'„Seitdem der neue Remasuri zum Schwarm dazugestoßen ist, zerfallen auch unsere mächtigsten Artefakte in Stücke, wenn wir sie gegen den Schwarm anwenden."\\n—Llanach, Wolkenwaldläufer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625586&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'741d5ba6-482f-4ba6-88eb-25c177e57ad9\', \'multiverseId\': 625586}, \'multiverseid\': 625586}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde harmonique\', \'text\': \'Tous les slivoïdes ont « Quand ce permanent arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez une cible, artefact ou enchantement. »\', \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "« Depuis l\'arrivée du dernier slivoïde, même nos reliques les plus puissantes éclatent dès qu\'on les approche de l\'essaim. »\\n—Llanach, ranger de Linciel", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625843&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc77910b-3fa4-4c4b-aecf-35dccd0fd8b3\', \'multiverseId\': 625843}, \'multiverseid\': 625843}, {\'name\': \'調和スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'すべてのスリヴァーは「このパーマネントが戦場に出たとき、アーティファクトやエンチャントのうち１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'「一番新しいスリヴァーが現れてから、どんな最強の遺物を巣にもっていっても、すぐに粉々に砕かれちまうんだ。」\\n――スカイシュラウドのレインジャー、ラナック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b94d24bd-5381-424c-bb39-c5d8eb8e9d41\', \'multiverseId\': 626100}, \'multiverseid\': 626100}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hastige Suche\', \'text\': \'Ziehe zwei Karten und wirf dann zwei Karten ab. Enttappe bis zu drei Länder.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Einen halb geschriebenen Roman, ein Jahr in Vorlesungsnotizen und mehrere Einkaufszettel später begann Shiori sich zu fragen, ob sie das falsche Terminal gehackt hatte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624462&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39caedb6-8d02-4851-9228-cb6becf51108\', \'multiverseId\': 624462}, \'multiverseid\': 624462}, {\'name\': \'Búsqueda frenética\', \'text\': \'Roba dos cartas, luego descarta dos cartas. Endereza hasta tres tierras.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Después de pasar por una novela a medio escribir, notas de un año de clases y varias listas de la compra, Shiori empezó a pensar que quizás accedió al terminal equivocado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2dd44f9-0f2f-4a3a-be27-06116cc600c6\', \'multiverseId\': 624508}, \'multiverseid\': 624508}, {\'name\': \'Recherche effrénée\', \'text\': "Piochez deux cartes, puis défaussez-vous de deux cartes. Dégagez jusqu\'à trois terrains.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Après avoir trouvé un roman à moitié écrit, l\'équivalent d\'un an de notes de cours, et quelques listes de courses, Shiori commença à se demander si elle avait piraté le bon terminal.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624554&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7157f03-1d0c-4e77-9892-d9ecc4bdeb73\', \'multiverseId\': 624554}, \'multiverseid\': 624554}, {\'name\': \'大あわての捜索\', \'text\': \'カード２枚を引く。その後、カード２枚を捨てる。土地最大３つをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'書きかけの小説、一年分の講義ノート、さらにはいくつかの買い物リスト。間違ったターミナルをハックしたのではないかと史織は首を傾げた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d00b828a-bd83-4129-b4e3-bd28e0787c95\', \'multiverseId\': 624646}, \'multiverseid\': 624646}, {\'name\': \'狂搜乱寻\', \'text\': \'抓两张牌，然后弃两张牌。重置至多三个地。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'在浏览过一部未写完的小说、一整年的课堂笔记和几份购物清单之后，史织开始怀疑自己是不是骇错了终端。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'319b4a91-3923-461f-899b-b16a8f490352\', \'multiverseId\': 624738}, \'multiverseid\': 624738}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hastige Suche\', \'text\': \'Ziehe zwei Karten und wirf dann zwei Karten ab. Enttappe bis zu drei Länder.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Es bedurfte des Verbots der Zeitmanipulation in Westtolaria, um seinen Schülern den Wert der Zeit zu vermitteln.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622905&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0e13de8-dc53-4712-a3ae-510c20c90de8\', \'multiverseId\': 622905}, \'multiverseid\': 622905}, {\'name\': \'Búsqueda frenética\', \'text\': \'Roba dos cartas, luego descarta dos cartas. Endereza hasta tres tierras.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Hubo que prohibir la manipulación temporal en Tolaria Oeste para que los estudiantes aprendiesen a valorar el tiempo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fd7f319-51e6-446c-b679-468a434c6871\', \'multiverseId\': 623106}, \'multiverseid\': 623106}, {\'name\': \'Recherche effrénée\', \'text\': "Piochez deux cartes, puis défaussez-vous de deux cartes. Dégagez jusqu\'à trois terrains.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "À l\'Ouest de Tolaria, il aura fallu interdire la manipulation temporelle pour inculquer aux élèves la valeur du temps.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623307&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37fb9dbd-cba1-4cb4-998d-c2ce7686ea05\', \'multiverseId\': 623307}, \'multiverseid\': 623307}, {\'name\': \'大あわての捜索\', \'text\': \'カード２枚を引く。その後、カード２枚を捨てる。土地最大３つをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'トレイリア西部では時間操作が禁止された。学生たちに時間の大切さを教えるためである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'495915ef-6d77-405a-b958-d3ec1b281f59\', \'multiverseId\': 623709}, \'multiverseid\': 623709}, {\'name\': \'狂搜乱寻\', \'text\': \'抓两张牌，然后弃两张牌。重置至多三个地。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'待陶拉里亚西境学院禁止时间操纵课程之后，学生才真正晓得时间的价值。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52f15ac0-99d4-4635-ad96-dceded357adc\', \'multiverseId\': 624111}, \'multiverseid\': 624111}]', "[{'name': 'Hauptmann der Stoßzahnwache', 'text': 'Standhaft {G} ({G}, {T}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf diese Kreatur. Spiele Standhaft wie eine Hexerei.)\\nJede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und auf der eine +1/+1-Marke liegt, verursacht Trampelschaden.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger', 'flavor': 'Ein einziges leises Wort löst die Stampede aus.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628026&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f75f830f-aaf7-433b-b870-add06161ea21', 'multiverseId': 628026}, 'multiverseid': 628026}, {'name': 'Capitana del cargadermo', 'text': 'Supervivencia {G}. ({G}, {T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre esta criatura. Activa la habilidad de supervivencia solo como un conjuro.)\\nCada criatura que controlas con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella tiene la habilidad de arrollar.', 'type': 'Criatura — Guerrero humano', 'flavor': 'Una sola palabra da comienzo a la estampida.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628260&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b5791f54-a0c7-4a77-ae6f-5b768a2a7e19', 'multiverseId': 628260}, 'multiverseid': 628260}, {'name': '牙守りの隊長', 'text': '長久{G}（{G}, {T}：このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。長久はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\\nあなたがコントロールしていて＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているすべてのクリーチャーはトランプルを持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士', 'flavor': '一つの静かな言葉が暴走を引き起こした。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628728&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f53731a4-e220-48a7-a301-d2c47acd5419', 'multiverseId': 628728}, 'multiverseid': 628728}, {'name': '牙卫队长', 'text': '延生{G}（{G}，{T}：在此生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。只能于法术时机延生。）\\n每个由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物均具有践踏异能。', 'type': '生物 ～人类／战士', 'flavor': '低声轻语便能引领狂奔。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629196&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '464bf004-ec65-425e-a704-bdd809bfff9e', 'multiverseId': 629196}, 'multiverseid': 629196}]", '[{\'name\': \'Hehres Aushauchen\', \'text\': \'Unverzagt (Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jeden Gegner {1} weniger.)\\nZerstöre alle Kreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Atme aus und lass deine Seele von den Winden in die Ewigkeit tragen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622869&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0ed5444-9f25-4a58-8785-012402dfbfe6\', \'multiverseId\': 622869}, \'multiverseid\': 622869}, {\'name\': \'Exhalación sublime\', \'text\': \'Audacia. (Cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada oponente.)\\nDestruye todas las criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Exhala y deja que los vientos mezan tu alma por toda la eternidad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'334db204-f7d7-4b58-bd1c-1a0a1ce0c849\', \'multiverseId\': 623070}, \'multiverseid\': 623070}, {\'name\': \'Expiration sublime\', \'text\': \'Témérité (Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque adversaire.)\\nDétruisez toutes les créatures.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Expirez, et laissez le vent emporter votre âme pour l\'éternité.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623271&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'152465c1-5d5a-414e-b65f-0f0b937c40b2\', \'multiverseId\': 623271}, \'multiverseid\': 623271}, {\'name\': \'崇高な吐露\', \'text\': \'不抜（この呪文を唱えるためのコストは対戦相手１人につき{1}少なくなる。）\\nすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ゆっくり吐いて、魂が風に流れるに任せなさい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13947e5c-da6e-4853-a955-55c92dd86171\', \'multiverseId\': 623673}, \'multiverseid\': 623673}, {\'name\': \'升灵吐息\', \'text\': \'不屈（每有一位对手，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。）\\n消灭所有生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'深呼吸，令清风承灵魂往永生。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e20784da-7155-41d5-857b-6679b5210ebb\', \'multiverseId\': 624075}, \'multiverseid\': 624075}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hehres Aushauchen\', \'text\': \'Unverzagt (Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jeden Gegner {1} weniger.)\\nZerstöre alle Kreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Atme aus und lass deine Seele von den Winden in die Ewigkeit tragen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626500&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7879ac38-2ab5-4c3d-96c2-c030cd845126\', \'multiverseId\': 626500}, \'multiverseid\': 626500}, {\'name\': \'Expiration sublime\', \'text\': \'Témérité (Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque adversaire.)\\nDétruisez toutes les créatures.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Expirez, et laissez le vent emporter votre âme pour l\'éternité.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626840&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f68e059-a593-485c-b057-3b7d3da64bf6\', \'multiverseId\': 626840}, \'multiverseid\': 626840}, {\'name\': \'崇高な吐露\', \'text\': \'不抜（この呪文を唱えるためのコストは対戦相手１人につき{1}少なくなる。）\\nすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ゆっくり吐いて、魂が風に流れるに任せなさい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a87bcbf-4b0c-472b-a7a2-2c728679773d\', \'multiverseId\': 627180}, \'multiverseid\': 627180}, {\'name\': \'升灵吐息\', \'text\': \'不屈（每有一位对手，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。）\\n消灭所有生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'深呼吸，令清风承灵魂往永生。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ab57823-02c5-40d6-bb58-67d08cfaa7e4\', \'multiverseId\': 627520}, \'multiverseid\': 627520}]', '[{\'name\': \'Heliod der Sonnengekrönte\', \'text\': \'Unzerstörbar\\nSolange deine Hingabe zu Weiß weniger als fünf beträgt, ist Heliod keine Kreatur.\\nImmer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\\n{1}{W}: Eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Lebensverknüpfung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberungskreatur — Gott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622838&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'193d5361-e0f7-4a25-98e1-3f7e88d4bf47\', \'multiverseId\': 622838}, \'multiverseid\': 622838}, {\'name\': \'Heliod, Corona Solar\', \'text\': \'Indestructible.\\nMientras tu devoción al blanco sea menor que cinco, Heliod no es una criatura.\\nSiempre que ganes vidas, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura o encantamiento objetivo que controlas.\\n{1}{W}: Otra criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de vínculo vital hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento legendaria — Deidad\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54f2cf55-84c7-4896-8625-5bacfd3df19b\', \'multiverseId\': 623039}, \'multiverseid\': 623039}, {\'name\': \'Héliode, Souverain du soleil\', \'text\': "Indestructible\\nTant que votre dévotion au blanc est inférieure à cinq, Héliode n\'est pas une créature.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une cible, créature ou enchantement, que vous contrôlez.\\n{1}{W} : Une autre créature ciblée acquiert le lien de vie jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement légendaire : dieu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623240&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e58cc1f4-493e-4081-a3ed-d06a83218ece\', \'multiverseId\': 623240}, \'multiverseid\': 623240}, {\'name\': \'太陽冠のヘリオッド\', \'text\': \'破壊不能\\nあなたの白への信心が５未満であるかぎり、太陽冠のヘリオッドはクリーチャーではない。\\nあなたがライフを得るたび、クリーチャーやエンチャントのうちあなたがコントロールしている１つを対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n{1}{W}：これでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは絆魂を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー・エンチャント — 神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9276f1d2-77d4-4d41-b2a5-7ce9f026f91c\', \'multiverseId\': 623642}, \'multiverseid\': 623642}, {\'name\': \'日冠赫利欧德\', \'text\': \'不灭\\n只要你的白色献力小于五，赫利欧德便不是生物。\\n每当你获得生命时，在目标由你操控的生物或结界上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n{1}{W}：另一个目标生物获得系命异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇结界生物 ～神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29c77313-8e8d-4db0-9c96-ef4cc142f29d\', \'multiverseId\': 624044}, \'multiverseid\': 624044}]', '[{\'name\': \'Heliod der Sonnengekrönte\', \'text\': \'Unzerstörbar\\nSolange deine Hingabe zu Weiß weniger als fünf beträgt, ist Heliod keine Kreatur.\\nImmer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\\n{1}{W}: Eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Lebensverknüpfung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberungskreatur — Gott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626487&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09b26538-517e-4a21-b6a8-e7dc2bea191f\', \'multiverseId\': 626487}, \'multiverseid\': 626487}, {\'name\': \'Héliode, Souverain du soleil\', \'text\': "Indestructible\\nTant que votre dévotion au blanc est inférieure à cinq, Héliode n\'est pas une créature.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une cible, créature ou enchantement, que vous contrôlez.\\n{1}{W} : Une autre créature ciblée acquiert le lien de vie jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement légendaire : dieu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626827&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39532ab7-855e-427e-9ebd-18d10b306b97\', \'multiverseId\': 626827}, \'multiverseid\': 626827}, {\'name\': \'太陽冠のヘリオッド\', \'text\': \'破壊不能\\nあなたの白への信心が５未満であるかぎり、太陽冠のヘリオッドはクリーチャーではない。\\nあなたがライフを得るたび、クリーチャーやエンチャントのうちあなたがコントロールしている１つを対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n{1}{W}：これでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは絆魂を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー・エンチャント — 神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5623f026-afda-4286-9eed-6f73ac350e9d\', \'multiverseId\': 627167}, \'multiverseid\': 627167}, {\'name\': \'日冠赫利欧德\', \'text\': \'不灭\\n只要你的白色献力小于五，赫利欧德便不是生物。\\n每当你获得生命时，在目标由你操控的生物或结界上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n{1}{W}：另一个目标生物获得系命异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇结界生物 ～神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'601aea7f-defc-494f-8bf0-a7ee43486c5f\', \'multiverseId\': 627507}, \'multiverseid\': 627507}]', '[{\'name\': \'Heliod, Gott der Sonne\', \'text\': \'Unzerstörbar\\nSolange deine Hingabe zu Weiß weniger als fünf beträgt, ist Heliod keine Kreatur.\\nAndere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Wachsamkeit.\\n{2}{W}{W}: Erzeuge einen 2/1 weißen Kleriker-Verzauberungskreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberungskreatur — Gott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625488&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d9fc447-c070-47d2-adb8-e16d8f9d1ad5\', \'multiverseId\': 625488}, \'multiverseid\': 625488}, {\'name\': \'Héliode, dieu du Soleil\', \'text\': "Indestructible\\nTant que votre dévotion au blanc est inférieure à cinq, Héliode n\'est pas une créature.\\nLes autres créatures que vous contrôlez ont la vigilance.\\n{2}{W}{W} : Créez un jeton de créature-enchantement 2/1 blanche Clerc.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement légendaire : dieu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625745&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c31c2ac4-3799-4018-8ec9-640d0d01ba27\', \'multiverseId\': 625745}, \'multiverseid\': 625745}, {\'name\': \'太陽の神、ヘリオッド\', \'text\': \'破壊不能\\nあなたの白への信心が５未満であるかぎり、太陽の神、ヘリオッドはクリーチャーではない。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは警戒を持つ。\\n{2}{W}{W}：白の２/１のクレリック・クリーチャー・エンチャント・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー・エンチャント — 神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b5db47f-55cc-4c49-a5bf-de644ff5d0ab\', \'multiverseId\': 626002}, \'multiverseid\': 626002}]', "[{'name': 'Helm des Champions', 'text': 'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+2.\\nSolange die ausgerüstete Kreatur legendär ist, hat sie Fluchsicherheit.\\nAusrüsten {1}', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624484&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3cb4b0fa-7401-450e-a242-ebfc50c3256c', 'multiverseId': 624484}, 'multiverseid': 624484}, {'name': 'Casco del campeón', 'text': 'La criatura equipada obtiene +2/+2.\\nMientras la criatura equipada sea legendaria, tiene la habilidad de antimaleficio.\\nEquipar {1}.', 'type': 'Artefacto — Equipo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624530&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9c5e481c-066b-4084-ba0a-bfdf628473f5', 'multiverseId': 624530}, 'multiverseid': 624530}, {'name': 'Heaume du champion', 'text': 'La créature équipée gagne +2/+2.\\nTant que la créature équipée est légendaire, elle a la défense talismanique.\\nÉquipement {1}', 'type': 'Artefact : équipement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624576&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '16ee942e-5bc8-4a4d-90ca-0121712e00bf', 'multiverseId': 624576}, 'multiverseid': 624576}, {'name': '勇者の兜', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが伝説のクリーチャーであるかぎり、それは呪禁を持つ。\\n装備{1}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624668&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '883c881c-3cbd-416c-b6f8-09fe76e52841', 'multiverseId': 624668}, 'multiverseid': 624668}, {'name': '斗士头盔', 'text': '佩带此武具的生物得+2/+2。\\n只要佩带此武具的生物是传奇，它便具有辟邪异能。\\n佩带{1}', 'type': '神器 ～武具', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624760&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f11c395b-d971-47a8-81e9-735567cdd259', 'multiverseId': 624760}, 'multiverseid': 624760}]", "[{'name': 'Helm des Champions', 'text': 'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+2.\\nSolange die ausgerüstete Kreatur legendär ist, hat sie Fluchsicherheit.\\nAusrüsten {1}', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626626&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8448416-ccfc-4ec3-ae5a-94a4b2d44d31', 'multiverseId': 626626}, 'multiverseid': 626626}, {'name': 'Heaume du champion', 'text': 'La créature équipée gagne +2/+2.\\nTant que la créature équipée est légendaire, elle a la défense talismanique.\\nÉquipement {1}', 'type': 'Artefact : équipement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626966&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7afc2fc8-96de-4058-b53b-e00ef15e4a2e', 'multiverseId': 626966}, 'multiverseid': 626966}, {'name': '勇者の兜', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが伝説のクリーチャーであるかぎり、それは呪禁を持つ。\\n装備{1}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627306&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '70356cdb-5cde-4960-ae3c-853ac80f829e', 'multiverseId': 627306}, 'multiverseid': 627306}, {'name': '斗士头盔', 'text': '佩带此武具的生物得+2/+2。\\n只要佩带此武具的生物是传奇，它便具有辟邪异能。\\n佩带{1}', 'type': '神器 ～武具', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627646&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '83b39b40-51f1-4d36-9457-a27853a70826', 'multiverseId': 627646}, 'multiverseid': 627646}]", "[{'name': 'Helm des Champions', 'text': 'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+2.\\nSolange die ausgerüstete Kreatur legendär ist, hat sie Fluchsicherheit.\\nAusrüsten {1}', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628073&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd243b534-3eaf-4964-a0d6-a8bf9ae94cfb', 'multiverseId': 628073}, 'multiverseid': 628073}, {'name': 'Casco del campeón', 'text': 'La criatura equipada obtiene +2/+2.\\nMientras la criatura equipada sea legendaria, tiene la habilidad de antimaleficio.\\nEquipar {1}.', 'type': 'Artefacto — Equipo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628307&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f3bd171f-3ec1-42fb-82e0-8c951d33c131', 'multiverseId': 628307}, 'multiverseid': 628307}, {'name': '勇者の兜', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが伝説のクリーチャーであるかぎり、それは呪禁を持つ。\\n装備{1}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628775&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b6eba938-1cc9-4460-8b1b-78bb6d5a2077', 'multiverseId': 628775}, 'multiverseid': 628775}, {'name': '斗士头盔', 'text': '佩带此武具的生物得+2/+2。\\n只要佩带此武具的生物是传奇，它便具有辟邪异能。\\n佩带{1}', 'type': '神器 ～武具', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629243&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0c9e1809-9aef-42e0-abba-a1d8d81f8f7b', 'multiverseId': 629243}, 'multiverseid': 629243}]", '[{\'name\': \'Heranbrausender Höllendrache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Eile\\nImmer wenn der Heranbrausende Höllendrache angreift, kannst du {5}{R}{R} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, enttappe alle angreifenden Kreaturen, und es gibt nach dieser Phase eine zusätzliche Kampfphase.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626565&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88ae7540-c3c1-49a7-8136-9ddd28f0ac68\', \'multiverseId\': 626565}, \'multiverseid\': 626565}, {\'name\': \'Batailleur escouflenfer\', \'text\': "Vol, célérité\\nÀ chaque fois que le Batailleur escouflenfer attaque, vous pouvez payer {5}{R}{R}. Si vous faites ainsi, dégagez toutes les créatures attaquantes et cette phase est suivie d\'une phase de combat supplémentaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626905&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0162b9e-c586-45f0-870c-aadc4eccbc1a\', \'multiverseId\': 626905}, \'multiverseid\': 626905}, {\'name\': \'ヘルカイトの突撃者\', \'text\': \'飛行、速攻\\nヘルカイトの突撃者が攻撃するたび、{5}{R}{R}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、すべての攻撃クリーチャーをアンタップし、このフェイズの後に追加の戦闘フェイズ１つを加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4c5c705-7460-46d2-81d7-5559c10d53b6\', \'multiverseId\': 627245}, \'multiverseid\': 627245}, {\'name\': \'冲锋残虐者\', \'text\': \'飞行，敏捷\\n每当冲锋残虐者攻击时，你可以支付{5}{R}{R}。若你如此作，则重置所有进行攻击的生物，且在此阶段后，额外多出一个战斗阶段。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a909da2d-a082-41b0-aef0-68a538b52a8e\', \'multiverseId\': 627585}, \'multiverseid\': 627585}]', "[{'name': 'Heranbrausender Höllendrache', 'text': 'Fliegend, Eile\\nImmer wenn der Heranbrausende Höllendrache angreift, kannst du {5}{R}{R} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, enttappe alle angreifenden Kreaturen, und es gibt nach dieser Phase eine zusätzliche Kampfphase.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Drache', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627930&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b171e0b-b2fd-4c19-83e5-84f26d0fcb39', 'multiverseId': 627930}, 'multiverseid': 627930}, {'name': 'Engendro cargador', 'text': 'Vuela, prisa.\\nSiempre que el Engendro cargador ataque, puedes pagar {5}{R}{R}. Si lo haces, endereza todas las criaturas atacantes y después de esta fase hay una fase de combate adicional.', 'type': 'Criatura — Dragón', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628164&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d0d390a-24d7-4039-ab7d-6e4eae63ec60', 'multiverseId': 628164}, 'multiverseid': 628164}, {'name': 'ヘルカイトの突撃者', 'text': '飛行、速攻\\nヘルカイトの突撃者が攻撃するたび、{5}{R}{R}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、すべての攻撃クリーチャーをアンタップし、このフェイズの後に追加の戦闘フェイズ１つを加える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドラゴン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628632&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '16acf0d8-cd0d-4680-81f8-c130afa98353', 'multiverseId': 628632}, 'multiverseid': 628632}, {'name': '冲锋残虐者', 'text': '飞行，敏捷\\n每当冲锋残虐者攻击时，你可以支付{5}{R}{R}。若你如此作，则重置所有进行攻击的生物，且在此阶段后，额外多出一个战斗阶段。', 'type': '生物 ～龙', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629100&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2f2dcd41-b1ab-4f94-8212-ad181b721542', 'multiverseId': 629100}, 'multiverseid': 629100}]", '[{\'name\': \'Heroische Intervention\', \'text\': \'Bleibende Karten, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Fluchsicherheit und Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wo immer ein Stärkerer einem Schwächeren etwas zuleide tun will — ich werde dort sein."\\n—Ajani Goldmähne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626588&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11b6a1ff-afa7-4b77-91b8-5cf2f1e05d5f\', \'multiverseId\': 626588}, \'multiverseid\': 626588}, {\'name\': \'Intervention héroïque\', \'text\': "Les permanents que vous contrôlez acquièrent la défense talismanique et l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Je me rendrai partout où les forts oppriment les faibles. »\\n—Ajani Crinièredor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626928&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3c38819-845c-4a1a-a046-054f421b4662\', \'multiverseId\': 626928}, \'multiverseid\': 626928}, {\'name\': \'英雄的介入\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのパーマネントは呪禁と破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「強者が弱者を蹂躙しようとするとき、そこに私がいるだろう。」\\n――黄金のたてがみのアジャニ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0885292-208f-4d18-8bd1-42a9589d48d1\', \'multiverseId\': 627268}, \'multiverseid\': 627268}, {\'name\': \'英勇干预\', \'text\': \'由你操控的永久物获得辟邪与不灭异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「任何有倚强凌弱的地方，我必现身。」\\n～金鬃阿耶尼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d07ebfb6-b975-4698-95e1-14adbf07e566\', \'multiverseId\': 627608}, \'multiverseid\': 627608}]', '[{\'name\': \'Heroische Intervention\', \'text\': \'Bleibende Karten, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Fluchsicherheit und Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wo immer ein Stärkerer einem Schwächeren etwas zuleide tun will — ich werde dort sein."\\n—Ajani Goldmähne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627993&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ef3894f-9369-480f-bc67-33dd4ba01a30\', \'multiverseId\': 627993}, \'multiverseid\': 627993}, {\'name\': \'Intervención heroica\', \'text\': \'Los permanentes que controlas ganan las habilidades de antimaleficio e indestructible hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Siempre que los fuertes intenten dañar a los débiles, se toparán conmigo".\\n—Ajani Melena Dorada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcd39b03-7675-4d38-91e1-1bcf79315d09\', \'multiverseId\': 628227}, \'multiverseid\': 628227}, {\'name\': \'英雄的介入\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのパーマネントは呪禁と破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「強者が弱者を蹂躙しようとするとき、そこに私がいるだろう。」\\n――黄金のたてがみのアジャニ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46c79a43-ce9a-41c5-b868-0eaf93cb2412\', \'multiverseId\': 628695}, \'multiverseid\': 628695}, {\'name\': \'英勇干预\', \'text\': \'由你操控的永久物获得辟邪与不灭异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「任何有倚强凌弱的地方，我必现身。」\\n～金鬃阿耶尼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e89190f-938a-4fb3-90f2-be530f5f54c1\', \'multiverseId\': 629163}, \'multiverseid\': 629163}]', '[{\'name\': \'Heroldin der Engelsschar\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit\\nMyriade (Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift, kannst du für jeden Gegner außer dem verteidigenden Spieler einen Spielstein erzeugen, der eine Kopie dieser Kreatur ist. Er kommt getappt und jenen Gegner oder einen Planeswalker, den er kontrolliert, angreifend ins Spiel. Schicke die Spielsteine am Ende des Kampfes ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622839&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8155139a-f568-4b15-8769-f048132e3bc1\', \'multiverseId\': 622839}, \'multiverseid\': 622839}, {\'name\': \'Heraldo de la milicia celeste\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vigilancia.\\nMiríada. (Siempre que esta criatura ataque, por cada oponente que no sea el jugador defensor, puedes crear una ficha que es una copia de esta criatura que está girada y atacando a ese jugador o a un planeswalker que controla. Exilia las fichas al final del combate.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fc0b28e-3b2f-4a00-a054-a6e93286dcf0\', \'multiverseId\': 623040}, \'multiverseid\': 623040}, {\'name\': \'Héraut de la milice\', \'text\': "Vol, vigilance\\nMyriade (À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, pour chaque adversaire autre que le joueur défenseur, vous pouvez créer un jeton qui est une copie de cette créature, engagé et attaquant ce joueur ou un planeswalker qu\'il contrôle. Exilez ces jetons à la fin du combat.)", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623241&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a46a3954-09a5-4e15-9a59-ae83a40db852\', \'multiverseId\': 623241}, \'multiverseid\': 623241}, {\'name\': \'天軍の伝令\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒\\n無尽（このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤー以外の各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、このクリーチャーのコピーであるトークン１体をタップ状態かつそのプレイヤーかそのプレイヤーがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカー１体を攻撃している状態で生成してもよい。戦闘終了時に、それらのトークンを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b984bcb9-a092-4963-b6a1-777292f75a77\', \'multiverseId\': 623643}, \'multiverseid\': 623643}, {\'name\': \'军兆天使\', \'text\': \'飞行，警戒\\n繁影（每当此生物攻击时，对防御牌手之外的每位对手而言，你可以派出一个为此生物复制品的衍生物，其为横置且正向该牌手或某个由他操控的鹏洛客进行攻击。在战斗结束时，放逐这些衍生物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'580ab18d-5535-405a-ada2-292eec196273\', \'multiverseId\': 624045}, \'multiverseid\': 624045}]', '[{\'name\': \'Heroldin des Pantheons\', \'text\': \'Verzauberungszauber, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\\nImmer wenn du einen Verzauberungszauber wirkst, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zentaur, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Die Auszeichnung, zum Bannerträger der Götter auserkoren zu werden, ist nichts verglichen mit der Ehre, Nyx näher sein zu dürfen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625560&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f1956c8-d851-401f-ae5e-4c96b415a0c7\', \'multiverseId\': 625560}, \'multiverseid\': 625560}, {\'name\': \'Héraut du panthéon\', \'text\': "Les sorts d\'enchantement que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'enchantement, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : centaure et shamane\', \'flavor\': "Porter l\'étendard des dieux n\'est rien comparé à la gloire d\'être plus proche de Nyx.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625817&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4c892c8-7b4a-4713-b4f7-8afa6669b86d\', \'multiverseId\': 625817}, \'multiverseid\': 625817}, {\'name\': \'万神殿の伝令\', \'text\': \'あなたがエンチャント・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\nあなたがエンチャント・呪文１つを唱えるたび、１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ケンタウルス・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'神々の戦旗を掲げることができる栄誉など、ニクスに近づくことの栄光と比べたら何でもない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05529802-1607-4349-ae17-574291fe93ca\', \'multiverseId\': 626074}, \'multiverseid\': 626074}]', '[{\'name\': \'Herzloser Akt\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, auf der keine Marke liegt.\\n• Entferne bis zu drei Marken von einer Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Entweder wir oder sie."\\n—General Kudro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622975&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00ce2402-a6d5-479c-889d-251e8dd5b2bb\', \'multiverseId\': 622975}, \'multiverseid\': 622975}, {\'name\': \'Acto desalmado\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Destruye la criatura objetivo que no tenga contadores sobre ella.\\n• Remueve hasta tres contadores de la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Son ellos o nosotros".\\n—El general Kudro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'314af5a6-889c-4f84-98e2-9810e17080ab\', \'multiverseId\': 623176}, \'multiverseid\': 623176}, {\'name\': \'Acte cruel\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Détruisez une créature ciblée sans marqueur sur elle.\\n• Retirez jusqu\'à trois marqueurs d\'une créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est eux ou nous. »\\n—Général Koudro", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623377&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8450467d-a484-4731-84b1-bb37ac1df9b8\', \'multiverseId\': 623377}, \'multiverseid\': 623377}, {\'name\': \'無情な行動\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• カウンターが置かれていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上からカウンター最大３個を取り除く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「やるかやられるかだ。」\\n――クードロ将軍\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51eec69a-ccab-4aa3-aa70-1c08e2ce0bc6\', \'multiverseId\': 623779}, \'multiverseid\': 623779}, {\'name\': \'无情手段\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•消灭目标其上没有指示物的生物。\\n•从目标生物上移去至多三个指示物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「不是它们死，就是我们亡。」\\n～寇卓将军\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9325185b-5212-46d4-93fc-b619722d43b1\', \'multiverseId\': 624181}, \'multiverseid\': 624181}]', "[{'name': 'Herzstecherbogen', 'text': 'Immer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur angreift, fügt der Herzstecherbogen einer Kreatur deiner Wahl, die der verteidigende Spieler kontrolliert, 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\nAusrüsten {1} ({1}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628088&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '196d75f8-d221-4660-8e38-14ebecedb5ac', 'multiverseId': 628088}, 'multiverseid': 628088}, {'name': 'Arco perforacorazones', 'text': 'Siempre que la criatura equipada ataque, el Arco perforacorazones hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura objetivo que controla el jugador defensor.\\nEquipar {1}. ({1}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)', 'type': 'Artefacto — Equipo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628322&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c63419c1-86f8-4ad0-8b7d-1685fd2322bf', 'multiverseId': 628322}, 'multiverseid': 628322}, {'name': '心臓貫きの弓', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。心臓貫きの弓はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\\n装備{1}（{1}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628790&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '884287fc-8a36-4731-9118-487933388e84', 'multiverseId': 628790}, 'multiverseid': 628790}, {'name': '穿心弓', 'text': '每当佩带此武具的生物攻击时，穿心弓对目标由防御牌手操控的生物造成1点伤害。\\n佩带{1}（{1}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）', 'type': '神器 ～武具', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629258&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f2518136-4705-422f-bbfb-c6a086a2f67a', 'multiverseId': 629258}, 'multiverseid': 629258}]", '[{\'name\': \'Hexenkessel\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, {T}, opfere eine Kreatur: Du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu und ziehst eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die besten Rezepte erfordern verlässliches Kochgeschirr.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623008&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e585994e-8934-4742-8754-49f2d0a791f7\', \'multiverseId\': 623008}, \'multiverseid\': 623008}, {\'name\': \'Caldero de la bruja\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, {T}, sacrificar una criatura: Ganas 1 vida y robas una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Las mejores recetas se empiezan con buenos utensilios de cocina.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d254e78-79a5-4c77-9f6e-988bc6443f2a\', \'multiverseId\': 623209}, \'multiverseid\': 623209}, {\'name\': "Chaudron d\'envoûteuse", \'text\': \'{1}{B}, {T}, sacrifiez une créature : Vous gagnez 1 point de vie et vous piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Les meilleures recettes nécessitent des ustensiles fiables.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623410&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'086d543d-da53-4830-ba8e-4a8f6dd98e69\', \'multiverseId\': 623410}, \'multiverseid\': 623410}, {\'name\': \'魔女の大釜\', \'text\': \'{1}{B},{T},クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：１点のライフを得、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'最高の調理法には良質な調理器具が必要だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7ef3e7b-8a89-4623-8df3-cc8caef02cd1\', \'multiverseId\': 623812}, \'multiverseid\': 623812}, {\'name\': \'巫婆鼎镬\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}，{T}，牺牲一个生物：你获得1点生命且抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'美味食谱始于可靠炉具。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'499abe64-9560-4eff-95b3-f1540b67a831\', \'multiverseId\': 624214}, \'multiverseid\': 624214}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hidetsugu der Herzlose\', \'text\': \'{T}: Hidetsugu der Herzlose fügt jedem Spieler Schadenspunkte in Höhe der Hälfte des Lebenspunktestandes des jeweiligen Spielers, abgerundet, zu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Oger, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Hidetsugu verfügte über die Blutschwüre von mehr als einem Dutzend Oni. Seine Berührung versengte Felsen. Auf sein Wort hin brannten Städte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626564&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95137476-0f65-49de-a1bd-011b71855233\', \'multiverseId\': 626564}, \'multiverseid\': 626564}, {\'name\': \'Hidetsugu le malfaisant\', \'text\': "{T} : Hidetsugu le malfaisant inflige à chaque joueur un nombre de blessures égal à la moitié des points de vie de ce joueur, arrondie à l\'unité inférieure.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ogre et shamane\', \'flavor\': "Hidetsugu contrôlait une dizaine d\'oni par pacte de sang. La roche se calcinait à son contact. Les cités brûlaient à son ordre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626904&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b6cc046-4735-41e2-93e2-1d64e7097232\', \'multiverseId\': 626904}, \'multiverseid\': 626904}, {\'name\': \'無情の碑出告\', \'text\': \'{T}：無情の碑出告は各プレイヤーにそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーのライフ総量の端数を切り捨てた半分に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — オーガ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'碑出告は十二体もの鬼と血の誓いを結び続けていた。彼が触れれば岩は焼け焦げ、彼が物言えば都市は焼き尽くされた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dba45abc-550b-45a6-8ba0-b2a9b2ae3a9f\', \'multiverseId\': 627244}, \'multiverseid\': 627244}, {\'name\': \'无情碑出告\', \'text\': \'{T}：无情碑出告对每位牌手各造成伤害，其数量等同于该牌手总生命的一半，小数点后舍去。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～食人魔／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'碑出告与许多邪鬼订立血誓。只消轻触，坚石为之焦烂；只须一言，城池就此焚毁。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cb7a502-4ea9-4ef3-ae54-43df13f3c1dd\', \'multiverseId\': 627584}, \'multiverseid\': 627584}]', "[{'name': 'Hidetsugu der Herzlose', 'text': '{T}: Hidetsugu der Herzlose fügt jedem Spieler Schadenspunkte in Höhe der Hälfte des Lebenspunktestandes des jeweiligen Spielers, abgerundet, zu.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Oger, Schamane', 'flavor': 'Hidetsugu verfügte über die Blutschwüre von mehr als einem Dutzend Oni. Seine Berührung versengte Felsen. Auf sein Wort hin brannten Städte.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627929&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f14e26e2-f3de-4d7d-b030-e06d3766921b', 'multiverseId': 627929}, 'multiverseid': 627929}, {'name': 'Hidetsugu el descorazonado', 'text': '{T}: Hidetsugu el descorazonado hace una cantidad de daño a cada jugador igual a la mitad del total de vidas de ese jugador, redondeado hacia abajo.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Chamán ogro', 'flavor': 'Hidetsugu retenía más de una docena de oni con un juramento de sangre. Con su toque, se calcinaban las piedras. Con su palabra, ardían las ciudades.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628163&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8f386f0a-76bf-4509-ad71-fb181a4a0c97', 'multiverseId': 628163}, 'multiverseid': 628163}, {'name': '無情の碑出告', 'text': '{T}：無情の碑出告は各プレイヤーにそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーのライフ総量の端数を切り捨てた半分に等しい点数のダメージを与える。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — オーガ・シャーマン', 'flavor': '碑出告は十二体もの鬼と血の誓いを結び続けていた。彼が触れれば岩は焼け焦げ、彼が物言えば都市は焼き尽くされた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628631&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '84c77383-0fa5-4e4f-a67c-3b325a270640', 'multiverseId': 628631}, 'multiverseid': 628631}, {'name': '无情碑出告', 'text': '{T}：无情碑出告对每位牌手各造成伤害，其数量等同于该牌手总生命的一半，小数点后舍去。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～食人魔／祭师', 'flavor': '碑出告与许多邪鬼订立血誓。只消轻触，坚石为之焦烂；只须一言，城池就此焚毁。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629099&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa1aa735-fa45-4283-a81e-60fc38910f7e', 'multiverseId': 629099}, 'multiverseid': 629099}]", '[{\'name\': \'Hieb der Wanderin\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil und führe dann Wucherung durch. (Bestimme eine beliebige Anzahl an bleibenden Karten und/oder Spielern und gib ihnen dann von jeder Sorte Marke, die dort bereits liegt, eine weitere Marke.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Präzise, saubere Schnitte. Niemand hat irgendetwas gesehen. Wie immer. Archiviere den Bericht unter meinem Code."\\n—Lavinia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622878&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62dda0d0-d387-4f18-8160-db363bd5b8ac\', \'multiverseId\': 622878}, \'multiverseid\': 622878}, {\'name\': \'Golpe de la Errante\', \'text\': \'Exilia la criatura objetivo, luego prolifera. (Elige cualquier cantidad de permanentes y/o jugadores, luego pon sobre cada uno un contador de cada tipo que ya tenga.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Cortes limpios y precisos. Nadie vio nada. Una vez más. Escribe mi código en el informe y archívalo".\\n—Lavinia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31f45421-af7f-4c52-a097-353f616cae20\', \'multiverseId\': 623079}, \'multiverseid\': 623079}, {\'name\': \'Frappe de la Vagabonde\', \'text\': "Exilez une créature ciblée, puis proliférez. (Choisissez n\'importe quel nombre de permanents et/ou de joueurs, puis donnez-leur à chacun un autre marqueur de chaque sorte déjà présente.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Des découpes nettes et précises. Personne n\'a rien vu. Encore une fois. Mettez mon code sur le rapport et archivez-le. »\\n—Lavinia", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623280&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a52c4ec-e7ac-44af-9959-8ed6ac94e3e1\', \'multiverseId\': 623280}, \'multiverseid\': 623280}, {\'name\': \'放浪者の一撃\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放する。その後、増殖を行う。（望む数のパーマネントやプレイヤーを選び、その後、すでにそこにあるカウンター１種類につき、そのカウンターをもう１個与える。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「正確で見事な切り口。目撃者なし。またか。この報告書に私のタグを付けてファイルに入れておいて。」\\n――ラヴィニア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad18157c-9ca0-4a0d-915d-53d26710b6c0\', \'multiverseId\': 623682}, \'multiverseid\': 623682}, {\'name\': \'飘萍斩\', \'text\': \'放逐目标生物，然后增殖。（选择任意数量的永久物和／或牌手，然后为其已有之每种指示物各多放置一个同类的指示物。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「切口精准、整齐。没人看清发生了什么。和上次一样。将报告附上我的代码，整理归档。」\\n～拉温妮\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'473d6954-dc76-43ae-bb5c-0e578d59cf0e\', \'multiverseId\': 624084}, \'multiverseid\': 624084}]', "[{'name': 'Himmelsfang-Spinne', 'text': 'Wachsamkeit, Reichweite', 'type': 'Kreatur — Spinne', 'flavor': 'Das Einzige, was übellauniger ist als ein in ein Netz geratener Greif, ist die Spinne, die ihn überwältigen muss.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628020&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4c108a2b-1638-42e5-a2ff-394e7eb8a18e', 'multiverseId': 628020}, 'multiverseid': 628020}, {'name': 'Araña devoradora del cielo', 'text': 'Vigilancia, alcance.', 'type': 'Criatura — Araña', 'flavor': 'Lo único más malhumorado que un grifo en una red es la araña que debe subyugarlo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628254&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '750c3f13-41e9-4ff1-8e77-e9a601f9e52e', 'multiverseId': 628254}, 'multiverseid': 628254}, {'name': '空網蜘蛛', 'text': '警戒、到達', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 蜘蛛', 'flavor': '蜘蛛の網に捕らえられたグリフィン以上に不機嫌なのは、それを制圧しなければならない蜘蛛である。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628722&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9117d53e-d83d-4f30-8632-41636953a31e', 'multiverseId': 628722}, 'multiverseid': 628722}, {'name': '天网蜘蛛', 'text': '警戒，延势', 'type': '生物 ～蜘蛛', 'flavor': '比落入蛛网的狮鹫脾气更坏的，就只有必须制服它的蜘蛛。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629190&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '77231cac-d7de-436a-9718-74704ba98eae', 'multiverseId': 629190}, 'multiverseid': 629190}]", '[{\'name\': \'Himmelswolken-Weite\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'In großer Höhe bewegt sich die schwebende Stadt Otawara über Kamigawa. Nur wenige wissen, warum.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625697&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe5a564f-ce8d-4e4a-8c02-744aa44d435b\', \'multiverseId\': 625697}, \'multiverseid\': 625697}, {\'name\': \'Immensité de Cielcouvert\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Observant en permanence malgré son isolement, la ville aérienne d\'Otawara survole Kamigawa à des fins que peu comprennent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625954&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e4ed6db-baa5-45bc-8765-462414941f6e\', \'multiverseId\': 625954}, \'multiverseid\': 625954}, {\'name\': \'広漠なるスカイクラウド\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{W}{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'遠方から常に覗いている天上都市大田原は、神河の上空を動き続けている。その目的を知る者はほとんど存在しない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3ac00d3-b329-4452-a110-f80452e34e6d\', \'multiverseId\': 626211}, \'multiverseid\': 626211}]', '[{\'name\': \'Himmlische Klingenmeisterin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Doppelschlag\\nWenn die Himmlische Klingenmeisterin ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine beliebige Anzahl an Auren und Ausrüstungen, die du kontrollierst, an sie anlegen.\\nAndere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 für jede Aura oder Ausrüstung, die an die Himmlische Klingenmeisterin angelegt ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622837&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a764bd9-dc61-48b8-9041-a7bd4feb42ca\', \'multiverseId\': 622837}, \'multiverseid\': 622837}, {\'name\': \'Maestra de filo celestial\', \'text\': \'Vuela, daña dos veces.\\nCuando la Maestra de filo celestial entre al campo de batalla, puedes anexarle cualquier cantidad de Auras y Equipos que controlas.\\nLas otras criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 por cada Aura y Equipo anexados a la Maestra de filo celestial.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab187696-38bf-42ea-a96b-307f832e40e8\', \'multiverseId\': 623038}, \'multiverseid\': 623038}, {\'name\': "Maîtresse d\'épée céleste", \'text\': "Vol, double initiative\\nQuand la Maîtresse d\'épée céleste arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez lui attacher n\'importe quel nombre d\'auras et d\'équipements que vous contrôlez.\\nLes autres créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 pour chaque aura et chaque équipement attachés à la Maîtresse d\'épée céleste.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623239&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b641938b-094c-4ec4-8d0b-8c78d76f8939\', \'multiverseId\': 623239}, \'multiverseid\': 623239}, {\'name\': \'天の刃使い\', \'text\': \'飛行、二段攻撃\\n天の刃使いが戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている望む数のオーラや装備品をこれにつけてもよい。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは、オーラや装備品のうち天の刃使いについている１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdbf09a4-d4aa-4b4f-81c6-29efc8d86451\', \'multiverseId\': 623641}, \'multiverseid\': 623641}, {\'name\': \'天界大剑使\', \'text\': \'飞行，连击\\n当天界大剑使进战场时，你可以将任意数量由你操控的灵气和武具贴附于其上。\\n天界大剑使上每贴附一个灵气和武具，由你操控的其他生物便得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'249a3d66-6f64-417d-8feb-6eb22ea6c35c\', \'multiverseId\': 624043}, \'multiverseid\': 624043}]', '[{\'name\': \'Himmlische Klingenmeisterin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Doppelschlag\\nWenn die Himmlische Klingenmeisterin ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine beliebige Anzahl an Auren und Ausrüstungen, die du kontrollierst, an sie anlegen.\\nAndere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 für jede Aura oder Ausrüstung, die an die Himmlische Klingenmeisterin angelegt ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626486&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66cbbb52-0291-48fb-bea1-0c495fd49a6d\', \'multiverseId\': 626486}, \'multiverseid\': 626486}, {\'name\': "Maîtresse d\'épée céleste", \'text\': "Vol, double initiative\\nQuand la Maîtresse d\'épée céleste arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez lui attacher n\'importe quel nombre d\'auras et d\'équipements que vous contrôlez.\\nLes autres créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 pour chaque aura et chaque équipement attachés à la Maîtresse d\'épée céleste.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626826&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b9cb4b6-3056-4b34-af9a-1b9891170d38\', \'multiverseId\': 626826}, \'multiverseid\': 626826}, {\'name\': \'天の刃使い\', \'text\': \'飛行、二段攻撃\\n天の刃使いが戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている望む数のオーラや装備品をこれにつけてもよい。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは、オーラや装備品のうち天の刃使いについている１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'794e99ce-8b1d-455e-8e26-90d704a2be65\', \'multiverseId\': 627166}, \'multiverseid\': 627166}, {\'name\': \'天界大剑使\', \'text\': \'飞行，连击\\n当天界大剑使进战场时，你可以将任意数量由你操控的灵气和武具贴附于其上。\\n天界大剑使上每贴附一个灵气和武具，由你操控的其他生物便得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f66ea697-e647-4f51-afa1-ce9fdd8f1c4c\', \'multiverseId\': 627506}, \'multiverseid\': 627506}]', "[{'name': 'Himmlischer Feldmarschall', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nLeutnant — Solange du deinen Kommandeur kontrollierst, erhält der Himmlische Feldmarschall +2/+2 und Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Wachsamkeit.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Engel', 'flavor': 'Ihre Präsenz auf dem Schlachtfeld kann eine aufgebrachte Meute in eine disziplinierte Armee verwandeln.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622822&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8c4e86a-fb03-4d88-bb2c-a78b4f15c8b4', 'multiverseId': 622822}, 'multiverseid': 622822}, {'name': 'Mariscal de campo angelical', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nTeniente — Mientras controles a tu comandante, la Mariscal de campo angelical obtiene +2/+2 y las criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de vigilancia.', 'type': 'Criatura — Ángel', 'flavor': 'Su presencia en el campo de batalla puede transformar una turba descontrolada en un ejército disciplinado.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623023&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f1e506e-c7ad-4afe-87fd-1dc65e1fd72d', 'multiverseId': 623023}, 'multiverseid': 623023}, {'name': 'Générale de campagne angélique', 'text': 'Vol\\nLieutenant — Tant que vous contrôlez votre commandant, la Générale de campagne angélique gagne +2/+2 et les créatures que vous contrôlez ont la vigilance.', 'type': 'Créature : ange', 'flavor': 'Sur le champ de bataille, sa présence peut changer une foule indocile en armée disciplinée.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623224&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '105b5e49-be09-47fb-9e76-fc781a496e69', 'multiverseId': 623224}, 'multiverseid': 623224}, {'name': '天使の元帥', 'text': '飛行\\n副官 ― あなたがあなたの統率者をコントロールしているかぎり、天使の元帥は＋２/＋２の修整を受け、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは警戒を持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 天使', 'flavor': '彼女が戦場に存在するだけで、無秩序の暴徒の集団を秩序立った軍隊に変えることができる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623626&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '806d7942-23c6-4942-a451-1ee2815f1cd0', 'multiverseId': 623626}, 'multiverseid': 623626}, {'name': '天使元帅', 'text': '飞行\\n副官～只要你操控你的指挥官，天使元帅便得+2/+2且由你操控的生物具有警戒异能。', 'type': '生物 ～天使', 'flavor': '得她号令，就连难以驾驭的暴民都能成为纪律严明的军队。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624028&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e12d880a-fbf5-4296-9110-4092a74ecbd1', 'multiverseId': 624028}, 'multiverseid': 624028}]", "[{'name': 'Himmlischer Feldmarschall', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nLeutnant — Solange du deinen Kommandeur kontrollierst, erhält der Himmlische Feldmarschall +2/+2 und Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Wachsamkeit.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Engel', 'flavor': 'Ihre Präsenz auf dem Schlachtfeld kann eine aufgebrachte Meute in eine disziplinierte Armee verwandeln.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626481&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de1daeb2-d86f-4ce1-b20e-74ec3c2c1fe7', 'multiverseId': 626481}, 'multiverseid': 626481}, {'name': 'Générale de campagne angélique', 'text': 'Vol\\nLieutenant — Tant que vous contrôlez votre commandant, la Générale de campagne angélique gagne +2/+2 et les créatures que vous contrôlez ont la vigilance.', 'type': 'Créature : ange', 'flavor': 'Sur le champ de bataille, sa présence peut changer une foule indocile en armée disciplinée.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626821&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d5747c6-a52f-4b9f-8a43-00db24795134', 'multiverseId': 626821}, 'multiverseid': 626821}, {'name': '天使の元帥', 'text': '飛行\\n副官 ― あなたがあなたの統率者をコントロールしているかぎり、天使の元帥は＋２/＋２の修整を受け、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは警戒を持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 天使', 'flavor': '彼女が戦場に存在するだけで、無秩序の暴徒の集団を秩序立った軍隊に変えることができる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627161&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c6b8b978-dcf4-4500-8162-12a9a17ec49d', 'multiverseId': 627161}, 'multiverseid': 627161}, {'name': '天使元帅', 'text': '飞行\\n副官～只要你操控你的指挥官，天使元帅便得+2/+2且由你操控的生物具有警戒异能。', 'type': '生物 ～天使', 'flavor': '得她号令，就连难以驾驭的暴民都能成为纪律严明的军队。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627501&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '08613d11-5f15-44fc-892c-37f931165d21', 'multiverseId': 627501}, 'multiverseid': 627501}]", '[{\'name\': \'Hinterlistige Rhetorik\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Gegner dich und/oder einen oder mehrere Planeswalker, die du kontrollierst, angreift, schicke die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jenes Spielers ins Exil. Du kannst die Karte spielen, solange sie im Exil bleibt, und Mana beliebigen Typs kann ausgegeben werden, um sie zu wirken.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625526&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87989a21-75d9-4735-9101-cfb5ef849a08\', \'multiverseId\': 625526}, \'multiverseid\': 625526}, {\'name\': \'Rhétorique rusée\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire vous attaque et/ou attaque au moins un planeswalker que vous contrôlez, exilez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de ce joueur. Vous pouvez jouer cette carte tant qu\'elle reste exilée, et du mana de n\'importe quel type peut être dépensé pour la lancer.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625783&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c5eed84-1be4-4b08-abea-fc7112544881\', \'multiverseId\': 625783}, \'multiverseid\': 625783}, {\'name\': \'狡猾な弁論\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人が、あなたや、あなたがコントロールしている１体以上のプレインズウォーカーを攻撃するたび、そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。そのカードが追放され続けているかぎり、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよく、それを唱えるために任意のタイプのマナを支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a006e8ae-3a0e-476b-9116-72b54f7326c4\', \'multiverseId\': 626040}, \'multiverseid\': 626040}]', "[{'name': 'Hirnbrecher-Harpyie', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug millt jeder Spieler drei Karten. (Jeder Spieler legt die obersten drei Karten seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof.)', 'type': 'Verzauberungskreatur — Harpyie', 'flavor': 'Harpyien gehören zu den meistgehassten Kreaturen auf ganz Theros … und sie verdienen es auch.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625531&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9e99f46f-9e0f-41a8-ad40-88a9fef35c36', 'multiverseId': 625531}, 'multiverseid': 625531}, {'name': 'Harpie de tourmental', 'text': 'Vol\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, chaque joueur meule trois cartes. (Il met les trois cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière.)', 'type': 'Créature-enchantement : harpie', 'flavor': 'Les harpies comptent parmi les créatures les plus détestées de Theros... et elles le méritent largement.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625788&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '71eb39ff-6d23-43fc-9372-76039faca197', 'multiverseId': 625788}, 'multiverseid': 625788}, {'name': '精神潰しのハーピー', 'text': '飛行\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、カード３枚を切削する。（そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚を自分の墓地に置く。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー・エンチャント — ハーピー', 'flavor': 'ハーピーはテーロスで最も嫌われる生き物だが、それは至極もっともだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626045&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '63ef22b5-1739-4a42-a912-6dc1b5a7ae1e', 'multiverseId': 626045}, 'multiverseid': 626045}]", '[{\'name\': \'Horn des Herolds\', \'text\': \'Sowie das Horn des Herolds ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Kreaturentyp.\\nKreaturenzauber des bestimmten Typs, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments schaust du dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Falls es eine Kreaturenkarte des bestimmten Typs ist, kannst du sie offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625615&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0310f9d-9b2a-4dff-b1bf-1cb4b3722244\', \'multiverseId\': 625615}, \'multiverseid\': 625615}, {\'name\': \'Cor du héraut\', \'text\': "Au moment où le Cor du héraut arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un type de créature.\\nLes sorts de créature du type choisi que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.\\nAu début de votre entretien, regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de créature du type choisi, vous pouvez la révéler et la mettre dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625872&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d935e469-5072-4936-b63d-918635eff0f9\', \'multiverseId\': 625872}, \'multiverseid\': 625872}, {\'name\': \'通報の角笛\', \'text\': \'通報の角笛が戦場に出るに際し、クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。\\nあなたがその選ばれたタイプのクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。それがその選ばれたタイプのクリーチャー・カードなら、あなたは「それを公開してあなたの手札に加える。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5401d1bf-45a1-4b13-a33f-eca0a2cd4c42\', \'multiverseId\': 626129}, \'multiverseid\': 626129}]', '[{\'name\': \'Höhnischer Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben „Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, stachle eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die ein Gegner kontrolliert." (Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug greift die Kreatur in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greift einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Art und Weise, wie er sein Haupt schüttelt, ist überraschend irritierend."\\n—Neena, Hinterland-Späherin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625124&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2cfb23e-f057-4520-ba6e-b677be33048c\', \'multiverseId\': 625124}, \'multiverseid\': 625124}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde moqueur\', \'text\': "Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont « Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, incitez une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle. » (Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, cette créature attaque à chaque combat si possible et attaque un joueur autre que vous si possible.)", \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "« La façon dont il secoue son camail est étonnamment agaçante. »\\n—Neena, éclaireuse de l\'horizon", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625156&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04a3ecaa-6625-46b1-a6c5-ace14400e1c6\', \'multiverseId\': 625156}, \'multiverseid\': 625156}, {\'name\': \'挑発スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのスリヴァー・クリーチャーは「このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを使嗾する。」を持つ。（次のあなたのターンまで、そのクリーチャーは、可能なら各戦闘で攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'「あれが襟を震わせているのは、心底イラつくわね。」\\n――辺境地の斥候、ニーナ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7c40d60-7123-4a03-8cda-01a0b72b686f\', \'multiverseId\': 625188}, \'multiverseid\': 625188}]', '[{\'name\': \'Höhnischer Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben „Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, stachle eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die ein Gegner kontrolliert."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624920&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'904da164-c5ef-4e96-9380-55ad47f06b3d\', \'multiverseId\': 624920}, \'multiverseid\': 624920}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde moqueur\', \'text\': "Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont « Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, incitez une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle. »", \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624955&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b42c49a-ebdb-458f-8800-babc8ce4baab\', \'multiverseId\': 624955}, \'multiverseid\': 624955}, {\'name\': \'挑発スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのスリヴァー・クリーチャーは「このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを使嗾する。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6597a582-8334-4458-b149-d21095b33ba4\', \'multiverseId\': 624990}, \'multiverseid\': 624990}, {\'name\': \'引战裂片妖\', \'text\': \'由你操控的裂片妖生物具有「当此生物进战场时，煽惑目标由对手操控的生物。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2ac7da6-2576-4604-ac40-1d32ea806519\', \'multiverseId\': 625025}, \'multiverseid\': 625025}]', "[{'name': 'Ilysischer Karyatide', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe. Falls du eine Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr kontrollierst, erzeuge stattdessen zwei Mana genau einer beliebigen Farbe.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Pflanze', 'flavor': 'Diejenigen, die als Helden sterben, dürfen in Ilysia wohnen, einem geschützten Reich der Unterwelt, das so ruhig und lebendig ist wie der Rest trostlos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627995&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '725c7f06-0b4e-40b0-ab0a-1bcf4d2e01c7', 'multiverseId': 627995}, 'multiverseid': 627995}, {'name': 'Cariátide ilysea', 'text': '{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color. Si controlas una criatura con fuerza de 4 o más, en vez de eso, agrega dos manás de un color cualquiera.', 'type': 'Criatura — Planta', 'flavor': 'A aquellos que mueren como héroes se les permite residir en Ilysea, una región protegida del Inframundo, tan tranquila y alegre como lúgubres son el resto de sitios.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628229&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '97b922e0-d17f-449c-9e2d-c8cfbb142f7c', 'multiverseId': 628229}, 'multiverseid': 628229}, {'name': 'イリーシアの女像樹', 'text': '{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。あなたがパワーが４以上であるクリーチャーをコントロールしているなら、代わりに好きな色１色のマナ２点を加える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 植物', 'flavor': '英雄として死んだ者はイリーシアで暮らすことが許される。ここは死の国の中にある保護された地域で、荒涼とした他の場所に比べると静穏で明るい。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628697&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b05f811a-cb8f-43e8-9a9d-c0769eb1aea5', 'multiverseId': 628697}, 'multiverseid': 628697}, {'name': '依吕夏女像柱', 'text': '{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。如果你操控力量等于或大于4的生物，则改为加两点任意颜色的单色法术力。', 'type': '生物 ～植物', 'flavor': '被尊为英雄者死后可进入安宁兴盛的依吕夏境内。此处为少有的安全境域，与冥界他处的黑暗阴沉形成鲜明对比。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629165&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '302ff2ce-ed9a-4d92-8319-b991ee86fb1b', 'multiverseId': 629165}, 'multiverseid': 629165}]", '[{\'name\': \'Im Leid ertrinken\', \'text\': \'Alle Kreaturen erhalten -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Hellsicht 1.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Die grässliche Wahrheit ist, dass die Peitsche des Erebos lang genug ist, um sich uns allen um den Hals zu schlingen."\\n—Perisophia die Philosophin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622963&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eeab07f5-6299-419f-a2e5-ff29dd3a3ca8\', \'multiverseId\': 622963}, \'multiverseid\': 622963}, {\'name\': \'Ahogado en pena\', \'text\': \'Todas las criaturas obtienen -2/-2 hasta el final del turno. Adivina 1.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"La amarga verdad es que el Látigo de Erebos es lo bastante largo como para enrollarse en torno a todos y cada uno de nuestros cuellos".\\n—Perisofia, la filósofa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7620791-96ce-413a-9786-7feb02920942\', \'multiverseId\': 623164}, \'multiverseid\': 623164}, {\'name\': \'Chagrin accablant\', \'text\': "Toutes les créatures gagnent -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Regard 1.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Le fouet d\'Érébos est assez long pour s\'enrouler autour de toutes nos gorges ; voilà la triste vérité. »\\n—Périsophia la philosophe", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623365&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6716a728-8263-4a6a-80a3-ccf03eee8b5a\', \'multiverseId\': 623365}, \'multiverseid\': 623365}, {\'name\': \'悲哀まみれ\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、すべてのクリーチャーは－２/－２の修整を受ける。占術１を行う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「悲しい事実ですけど、エレボスの鞭には私たち全員の首に巻きつくだけの十分な長さがあるのですよ。」\\n――哲人ペリソフィア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba547bdb-c30a-4ff3-a360-4d55b14f18e2\', \'multiverseId\': 623767}, \'multiverseid\': 623767}, {\'name\': \'陷入悲痛\', \'text\': \'所有生物得-2/-2直到回合结束。占卜1。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「不幸的是，厄睿柏斯的鞭子长到足以勒住我们所有人的脖子。」\\n～哲人珀里索菲娅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d0769bb-abf6-4d5d-b941-27c349c0a88d\', \'multiverseId\': 624169}, \'multiverseid\': 624169}]', '[{\'name\': \'Immervoller Kelch\', \'text\': \'Multibonus {2} (Du kannst zusätzlich beliebig oft {2} bezahlen, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nDer Immervolle Kelch kommt mit X Ladungsmarken ins Spiel, wobei X die Anzahl ist, wie oft seine Bonuskosten bezahlt wurden.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C} für jede Ladungsmarke auf dem Immervollen Kelch.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625610&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'730bec36-85f3-4b07-b6bf-21dbbc7b7f95\', \'multiverseId\': 625610}, \'multiverseid\': 625610}, {\'name\': \'Calice toujours ruisselant\', \'text\': "Multikick {2} (Vous pouvez payer {2} supplémentaires autant de fois que vous le souhaitez au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nLe Calice toujours ruisselant arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur lui, un marqueur « charge » pour chaque fois qu\'il a été kické.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C} pour chaque marqueur « charge » sur le Calice toujours ruisselant.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625867&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e7cf72a-ca0b-4430-96dc-a2848e04ae11\', \'multiverseId\': 625867}, \'multiverseid\': 625867}, {\'name\': \'永遠溢れの杯\', \'text\': \'多重キッカー{2}（あなたはこの呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{2}を望む回数支払ってもよい。）\\n永遠溢れの杯は、これがキッカーされた１回につき１個の蓄積カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：永遠溢れの杯の上にある蓄積カウンター１個につき{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb004d8c-0e1d-4a34-98e5-d0577a604e3d\', \'multiverseId\': 626124}, \'multiverseid\': 626124}]', '[{\'name\': \'Immerändernde Weite\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere die Immerändernde Weite: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Land hat seine eigenen Absichten, die sich dem Verständnis jener, die auf ihm leben, entziehen."\\n—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628126&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18854689-3632-4d7f-8f1c-3bfbbd7bc0e8\', \'multiverseId\': 628126}, \'multiverseid\': 628126}, {\'name\': \'Expansión terramórfica\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar la Expansión terramórfica: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"La tierra tiene sus propias intenciones, más allá del entendimiento de aquellos que viven sobre ella".\\n—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ceba9fd3-f175-48ee-9b7c-e462d77bee38\', \'multiverseId\': 628360}, \'multiverseid\': 628360}, {\'name\': \'広漠なる変幻地\', \'text\': \'{T}, 広漠なる変幻地を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「その土地は、それの上に住まう者の理解を超える意志を持っているの。」\\n――ニッサ・レヴェイン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccd2fb34-9270-4be6-a299-51da14ca9d79\', \'multiverseId\': 628828}, \'multiverseid\': 628828}, {\'name\': \'地塑旷野\', \'text\': \'{T}，牺牲地塑旷野：从你牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「大地自有其想法，所居生灵都难解当中深意。」\\n～妮莎瑞文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c70c4b5-ebbd-4b15-8d87-42e0c7fdf381\', \'multiverseId\': 629296}, \'multiverseid\': 629296}]', '[{\'name\': \'Impulsiver Langfinger\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Impulsive Langfinger stirbt, erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\\nZugabe {3}{R} ({3}{R}, schicke diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge für jeden Gegner eine Spielstein-Kopie, die ihn in diesem Zug angreift, falls möglich. Die Spielsteine erhalten Eile. Opfere sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments. Aktiviere Zugabe wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Pirat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627932&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63f3757f-350e-4abc-9859-4742365bdeb3\', \'multiverseId\': 627932}, \'multiverseid\': 627932}, {\'name\': \'Ladronzuelo impulsivo\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Ladronzuelo impulsivo muera, crea una ficha de Tesoro. (Es un artefacto con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\\nReplicar {3}{R}. ({3}{R}, exiliar esta carta de tu cementerio: Por cada oponente, crea una ficha que es una copia que ataca a ese oponente este turno, si puede. Ganan la habilidad de prisa. Sacrifícalas al comienzo del próximo paso final. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pirata trasgo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69a469b6-c4fe-4585-8d8c-52558a3f29ac\', \'multiverseId\': 628166}, \'multiverseid\': 628166}, {\'name\': \'衝動的なこそ泥\', \'text\': \'衝動的なこそ泥が死亡したとき、宝物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\n再演{3}{R}（{3}{R}, あなたの墓地にあるこのカードを追放する：各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、このカードのコピーであり、このターン可能ならそのプレイヤーを攻撃するトークン１体を生成する。それらは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それらを生け贄に捧げる。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・海賊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6ce4b45-6113-46dc-a746-1ea113b32695\', \'multiverseId\': 628634}, \'multiverseid\': 628634}, {\'name\': \'冲动小偷\', \'text\': \'当冲动小偷死去时，派出一个珍宝衍生物。（它是具有「{T}，牺牲此神器：加一点任意颜色的法术力」的神器。）\\n返场{3}{R}（{3}{R}，从你的坟墓场放逐此牌：为每位对手各进行以下流程～派出一个衍生复制品，且其本回合若能攻击该对手，便须如此作。它们获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它们牺牲。只能于法术时机起动。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／海盗\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9769251d-2f70-45c6-a415-a3d04fd70f5e\', \'multiverseId\': 629102}, \'multiverseid\': 629102}]', '[{\'name\': \'In Ungnade fallen\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nWenn In Ungnade fallen ins Spiel kommt, tappe die verzauberte Kreatur und du wirst zum Monarchen.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur enttappt nicht während des Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers, es sei denn, jener Spieler ist der Monarch.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622902&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6640de79-9166-4a5f-bd00-a3757aaff14a\', \'multiverseId\': 622902}, \'multiverseid\': 622902}, {\'name\': \'Perder el favor\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nCuando Perder el favor entre al campo de batalla, gira la criatura encantada y te conviertes en el monarca.\\nLa criatura encantada no se endereza durante el paso de enderezar de su controlador a menos que ese jugador sea el monarca.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb146092-d938-4873-a0dd-9afc24b2da70\', \'multiverseId\': 623103}, \'multiverseid\': 623103}, {\'name\': \'Perdre les bonnes grâces\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nQuand Perdre les bonnes grâces arrive sur le champ de bataille, engagez la créature enchantée et vous devenez le monarque.\\nLa créature enchantée ne se dégage pas pendant l\'étape de dégagement de son contrôleur à moins que ce joueur ne soit le monarque.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623304&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'366f779b-8235-4961-af2c-9eed0fc276b1\', \'multiverseId\': 623304}, \'multiverseid\': 623304}, {\'name\': \'失墜\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n失墜が戦場に出たとき、エンチャントしているクリーチャーをタップし、あなたが統治者になる。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは、それのコントローラーが統治者でないかぎり、そのプレイヤーのアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d5d1eff-67e7-4287-9c77-6475d0da721f\', \'multiverseId\': 623706}, \'multiverseid\': 623706}, {\'name\': \'失宠\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n当失宠进战场时，横置所结附的生物，且你成为君主。\\n除非所结附之生物的操控者是君主，否则它于该牌手的重置步骤中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f3e52ad-a707-4150-8fcf-f80374f162b3\', \'multiverseId\': 624108}, \'multiverseid\': 624108}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inferno-Titan\', \'text\': \'{R}: Der Inferno-Titan erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nImmer wenn der Inferno-Titan ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, fügt er 3 Schadenspunkte zu, deren Aufteilung auf ein, zwei oder drei Ziele deiner Wahl du bestimmst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626566&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc334954-bc88-41e1-9c10-3fe7e1ab29d1\', \'multiverseId\': 626566}, \'multiverseid\': 626566}, {\'name\': \'Titan de la fournaise\', \'text\': "{R} : Le Titan de la fournaise gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Titan de la fournaise arrive sur le champ de bataille ou qu\'il attaque, il inflige 3 blessures réparties comme vous le désirez entre une, deux ou trois cibles.", \'type\': \'Créature : géant\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626906&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bf989b5-a95c-4b7b-9bf5-111b80e5d440\', \'multiverseId\': 626906}, \'multiverseid\': 626906}, {\'name\': \'業火のタイタン\', \'text\': \'{R}：ターン終了時まで、業火のタイタンは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n業火のタイタンが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、１つか２つか３つを対象として３点分を望むように割り振る。業火のタイタンはそれらにその割り振った点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be0acbf5-aa3b-4aa4-8e89-17a2ce0ef72e\', \'multiverseId\': 627246}, \'multiverseid\': 627246}, {\'name\': \'炼狱泰坦\', \'text\': \'{R}：炼狱泰坦得+1/+0直到回合结束。\\n每当炼狱泰坦进战场或攻击时，它对任意一个，两个或三个目标造成共3点伤害，你可以任意分配。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cb9cd96-4418-49f4-b478-3e2a0606f9cd\', \'multiverseId\': 627586}, \'multiverseid\': 627586}]', "[{'name': 'Inferno-Titan', 'text': '{R}: Der Inferno-Titan erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nImmer wenn der Inferno-Titan ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, fügt er 3 Schadenspunkte zu, deren Aufteilung auf ein, zwei oder drei Ziele deiner Wahl du bestimmst.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Riese', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627933&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d211c34-8e42-4d1c-bd8a-968b57acdd98', 'multiverseId': 627933}, 'multiverseid': 627933}, {'name': 'Titán infernal', 'text': '{R}: El Titán infernal obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\\nSiempre que el Titán infernal entre al campo de batalla o ataque, hace 3 puntos de daño divididos como elijas entre uno, dos o tres objetivos.', 'type': 'Criatura — Gigante', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628167&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '05a06c15-400a-4203-b12e-70943b41ff4f', 'multiverseId': 628167}, 'multiverseid': 628167}, {'name': '業火のタイタン', 'text': '{R}：ターン終了時まで、業火のタイタンは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n業火のタイタンが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、１つか２つか３つを対象として３点分を望むように割り振る。業火のタイタンはそれらにその割り振った点数のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 巨人', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628635&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd902f5db-7f8e-4c26-b820-1ee1a1d91f6b', 'multiverseId': 628635}, 'multiverseid': 628635}, {'name': '炼狱泰坦', 'text': '{R}：炼狱泰坦得+1/+0直到回合结束。\\n每当炼狱泰坦进战场或攻击时，它对任意一个，两个或三个目标造成共3点伤害，你可以任意分配。', 'type': '生物 ～巨人', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629103&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '242eee9b-c16e-42c1-a35a-4f91678fea3a', 'multiverseId': 629103}, 'multiverseid': 629103}]", "[{'name': 'Inga Runenauge', 'text': 'Wenn Inga Runenauge ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 3 an.\\nWenn Inga Runenauge stirbt, ziehe drei Karten, falls in diesem Zug drei oder mehr Kreaturen gestorben sind.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer', 'flavor': 'Jeder Pfad, der jemals von einem Omensucher aufgezeichnet wurde, ist in ihre Augen geritzt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622909&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a7374ce3-c935-46b3-95f5-15e1407532d6', 'multiverseId': 622909}, 'multiverseid': 622909}, {'name': 'Inga Ojosrúnicos', 'text': 'Cuando Inga Ojosrúnicos entre al campo de batalla, adivina 3.\\nCuando Inga Ojosrúnicos muera, roba tres cartas si tres o más criaturas murieron este turno.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano', 'flavor': 'En sus ojos están grabados todos los caminos trazados por los buscapresagios.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623110&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cd03bd94-4eb8-43af-969c-8d5ecddaa8e0', 'multiverseId': 623110}, 'multiverseid': 623110}, {'name': 'Inga Œil-de-rune', 'text': 'Quand Inga Œil-de-rune arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 3.\\nQuand Inga Œil-de-rune meurt, piochez trois cartes si au moins trois créatures sont mortes ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier', 'flavor': 'Tous les chemins jamais tracés par les Cherche-présages sont gravés dans ses yeux.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623311&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b097d32-c369-4ef2-86df-2cfb5136c880', 'multiverseId': 623311}, 'multiverseid': 623311}, {'name': 'ルーン目のインガ', 'text': 'ルーン目のインガが戦場に出たとき、占術３を行う。\\nルーン目のインガが死亡したとき、このターンに３体以上のクリーチャーが死亡していたなら、カード３枚を引く。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': '領界路探しが今までに見出した路が、すべてその目に刻み込まれている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623713&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '596c4d8c-f9bc-404e-89c2-d39c4415d8ee', 'multiverseId': 623713}, 'multiverseid': 623713}, {'name': '符眼茵嘉', 'text': '当符眼茵嘉进战场时，占卜3。\\n当符眼茵嘉死去时，如果本回合中有三个或更多生物死去，则抓三张牌。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～人类／法术师', 'flavor': '预兆觅径人编绘的每条径路，都深深蚀刻在她眼中。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624115&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2c8047a3-77f5-443b-bee5-1bd28a85bf96', 'multiverseId': 624115}, 'multiverseid': 624115}]", "[{'name': 'Insel', 'type': 'Standardland — Insel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624360&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3797465e-4ddf-4c27-b387-67be39088f83', 'multiverseId': 624360}, 'multiverseid': 624360}, {'name': 'Île', 'type': 'Terrain de base : île', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624377&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '25e1baf3-daae-4c1b-90b0-7a3b9c691a6a', 'multiverseId': 624377}, 'multiverseid': 624377}, {'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624394&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f6e5c3b-50d7-4c83-a186-886012b492fb', 'multiverseId': 624394}, 'multiverseid': 624394}]", "[{'name': 'Insel', 'type': 'Standardland — Insel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624361&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c54372de-8cd5-41f3-b299-a2d4d908eb2a', 'multiverseId': 624361}, 'multiverseid': 624361}, {'name': 'Île', 'type': 'Terrain de base : île', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624378&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '69be05ba-7e11-4fc6-9d17-c862d736d098', 'multiverseId': 624378}, 'multiverseid': 624378}, {'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624395&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c59913fa-cb1f-4d16-b13b-7dc2d5d1a540', 'multiverseId': 624395}, 'multiverseid': 624395}]", "[{'name': 'Insel', 'type': 'Standardland — Insel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624362&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55e0d00c-48b4-4b8c-ad2d-fab6f271a427', 'multiverseId': 624362}, 'multiverseid': 624362}, {'name': 'Île', 'type': 'Terrain de base : île', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624379&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fe81019f-e2a7-4d20-9e52-5f730f7273fa', 'multiverseId': 624379}, 'multiverseid': 624379}, {'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624396&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0d43d7eb-2da4-4c82-a25c-87f8b37b007c', 'multiverseId': 624396}, 'multiverseid': 624396}]", '[{\'name\': \'Inspektorin aus Thraben\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Inspektorin aus Thraben ins Spiel kommt, stelle Nachforschungen an. (Erzeuge einen Hinweis-Spielstein. Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.")\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn du das so lange machst wie ich, kann dich nichts mehr überraschen. Das bleibt zumindest zu hoffen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622875&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d59e158b-d499-4b03-b243-853fb4a37264\', \'multiverseId\': 622875}, \'multiverseid\': 622875}, {\'name\': \'Inspectora de Thraben\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Inspectora de Thraben entre al campo de batalla, investiga. (Crea una ficha de Pista. Es un artefacto con "{2}, sacrificar este artefacto: Roba una carta".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Si llevas en esto tanto tiempo como yo, nada puede sorprenderte. O al menos, eso esperas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a5e0f85-658a-4964-96f4-7643881b5e15\', \'multiverseId\': 623076}, \'multiverseid\': 623076}, {\'name\': \'Inspectrice de Thraben\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Inspectrice de Thraben arrive sur le champ de bataille, enquêtez. (Créez un jeton Indice. C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Piochez une carte. »)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Quand on fait ce que je fais depuis aussi longtemps, plus rien ne peut nous surprendre. C\'est ce qu\'on espère en tout cas. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623277&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'598b6ecd-f812-4d8f-b713-fce6c64e7604\', \'multiverseId\': 623277}, \'multiverseid\': 623277}, {\'name\': \'スレイベンの検査官\', \'text\': \'スレイベンの検査官が戦場に出たとき、調査を行う。（手掛かり・トークン１つを生成する。それは、「{2},このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「あなたが私と同じくらいこれをしているのなら、いまさら驚くようなことはないでしょう。少なくとも、そう願いたいわね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdc9d150-9877-4b84-b724-109eecc25b11\', \'multiverseId\': 623679}, \'multiverseid\': 623679}, {\'name\': \'瑟班巡检官\', \'text\': \'当瑟班巡检官进战场时，探查。（派出一个线索衍生物。它是具有「{2}，牺牲此神器：抓一张牌」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你也和我一样在这行干了这么多年，那应该没东西能吓到你了。至少这也算是希望吧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93c1a84b-33e2-4ccc-9c9e-e9a2096f0208\', \'multiverseId\': 624081}, \'multiverseid\': 624081}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inspirierende Statuen\', \'text\': \'Nichtartefakt-Zaubersprüche, die du wirkst, haben Improvisieren. (Deine Artefakte können dir helfen, jene Zaubersprüche zu wirken. Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Ghirapurs am meisten gefeierte Erfinder wurden als mechanische Konstrukte verewigt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626634&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f7c4425-38c3-4904-a8c9-39156a3e55e7\', \'multiverseId\': 626634}, \'multiverseid\': 626634}, {\'name\': \'Statuaire inspiratrice\', \'text\': "Les sorts non-artefact que vous lancez ont l\'improvisation. (Vos artefacts peuvent aider à lancer ces sorts. Chaque artefact que vous engagez après avoir activé des capacités de mana paie {1}.)", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Les plus illustres inventeurs de Ghirapur ont été immortalisés sous forme mécanique.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626974&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69b77f43-2a7f-45de-a936-1e47eac3e8e5\', \'multiverseId\': 626974}, \'multiverseid\': 626974}, {\'name\': \'鼓舞する彫像\', \'text\': \'あなたが唱えてアーティファクトでないすべての呪文は即席を持つ。（あなたのアーティファクトが、それらの呪文を唱える助けとなる。あなたがマナ能力を起動し終えたあとにあなたがタップした各アーティファクトは{1}を支払う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ギラプール最高の発明者は、機械仕掛けが後世まで讃える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f492265a-17ee-451c-8381-79a906f60a0c\', \'multiverseId\': 627314}, \'multiverseid\': 627314}, {\'name\': \'启迪塑像\', \'text\': \'你施放的非神器咒语具有拼造异能。（这些咒语能用你的神器来协助施放。你起动完法术力异能之后每横置一个神器，就能为此咒语支付{1}。）\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'金属塑像容貌相似，齿轮运转举止相同：吉拉波各位知名发明家藉此得以永生。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'141d13c5-0093-4d54-b9f3-332e29dc7c13\', \'multiverseId\': 627654}, \'multiverseid\': 627654}]', "[{'name': 'Inspirierende Statuen', 'text': 'Nichtartefakt-Zaubersprüche, die du wirkst, haben Improvisieren. (Deine Artefakte können dir helfen, jene Zaubersprüche zu wirken. Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': 'Ghirapurs am meisten gefeierte Erfinder wurden als mechanische Konstrukte verewigt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628092&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8dfb2664-92ed-4402-8a0c-2bdc2ed57913', 'multiverseId': 628092}, 'multiverseid': 628092}, {'name': 'Estatuas inspiradoras', 'text': 'Los hechizos que no sean de artefacto que lances tienen la habilidad de improvisar. (Tus artefactos pueden ayudar a lanzar esos hechizos. Cada artefacto que gires una vez que termines de activar habilidades de maná paga {1}.)', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': 'Los inventores más alabados de Ghirapur están inmortalizados en estatuas de engranajes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628326&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1cd36e3b-81e9-4ca4-9941-8ccd83588db8', 'multiverseId': 628326}, 'multiverseid': 628326}, {'name': '鼓舞する彫像', 'text': 'あなたが唱えてアーティファクトでないすべての呪文は即席を持つ。（あなたのアーティファクトが、それらの呪文を唱える助けとなる。あなたがマナ能力を起動し終えたあとにあなたがタップした各アーティファクトは{1}を支払う。）', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': 'ギラプール最高の発明者は、機械仕掛けが後世まで讃える。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628794&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '08ababf2-6190-4c1a-a084-9643e90beb61', 'multiverseId': 628794}, 'multiverseid': 628794}, {'name': '启迪塑像', 'text': '你施放的非神器咒语具有拼造异能。（这些咒语能用你的神器来协助施放。你起动完法术力异能之后每横置一个神器，就能为此咒语支付{1}。）', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '金属塑像容貌相似，齿轮运转举止相同：吉拉波各位知名发明家藉此得以永生。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629262&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07dac677-9963-49a7-b9b1-f15f51c03a1d', 'multiverseId': 629262}, 'multiverseid': 629262}]", "[{'name': 'Instabiler Obelisk', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{7}, {T}, opfere den Instabilen Obelisken: Zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': 'Sein Zerfall ist wie das letzte Aufbäumen einer längst vergangenen Zivilisation, die es nicht ertragen kann, in Vergessenheit zu geraten.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628114&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '118643e6-9dea-4cf3-a5e4-98a959fd2478', 'multiverseId': 628114}, 'multiverseid': 628114}, {'name': 'Obelisco inestable', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{7}, {T}, sacrificar el Obelisco inestable: Destruye el permanente objetivo.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': 'Su derrumbamiento es como la insolencia de una civilización largo tiempo extinta y ofendida por haber sido olvidada.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628348&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b0fec8c7-c593-4350-8acf-b16f9ea29b3c', 'multiverseId': 628348}, 'multiverseid': 628348}, {'name': '不安定なオベリスク', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{7}, {T}, 不安定なオベリスクを生け贄に捧げる：パーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': 'その崩壊は、遠い昔に死に絶えた文明が忘れ去られることへの不満を表す足掻きのようであった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628816&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '835a23e3-c2cb-487a-8d34-b3c925b4472f', 'multiverseId': 628816}, 'multiverseid': 628816}, {'name': '不稳定石碑', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n{7}，{T}，牺牲不稳定石碑：消灭目标永久物。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '远古文明若遭后人遗忘，定会带来惨烈后果以警醒世人。此座石碑之坍塌亦然。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629284&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '54e7229b-f396-4b51-b891-803402bccb7a', 'multiverseId': 629284}, 'multiverseid': 629284}]", "[{'name': 'Interplanarer Signalturm', 'text': 'Immer wenn du einen Planeswalkerzauber wirkst, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Erzeuge zwei Mana in unterschiedlichen Farben. Gib dieses Mana nur aus, um Planeswalkerzauber zu wirken.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625666&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b2330b7a-6e7c-4f3c-b343-0037c8b7e5d9', 'multiverseId': 625666}, 'multiverseid': 625666}, {'name': 'Flambeau interplanaire', 'text': 'À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de planeswalker, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T} : Ajoutez deux manas de couleurs différentes. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer des sorts de planeswalker.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625923&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2a473aaa-5ee1-467b-96cd-494cb7e0e0d6', 'multiverseId': 625923}, 'multiverseid': 625923}, {'name': '次元間の標', 'text': 'あなたがプレインズウォーカー・呪文１つを唱えるたび、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}：異なる色のマナ２点を加える。このマナは、プレインズウォーカー・呪文を唱えるためにしか支払えない。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626180&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de5dd5dd-d448-4574-9ccf-ec815ee29f24', 'multiverseId': 626180}, 'multiverseid': 626180}]", '[{\'name\': \'Invasion der Schreckenshorde\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments verlierst du 1 Lebenspunkt und wendest Zombie-Aufmarsch 1 an. (Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Armee, die du kontrollierst. Sie ist auch ein Zombie. Falls du keine Armee kontrollierst, erzeuge zuerst einen 0/0 schwarzen Zombie-Armee-Kreaturenspielstein.)\\nImmer wenn ein Zombie-Spielstein mit Stärke 6 oder mehr, den du kontrollierst, angreift, erhält er Lebensverknüpfung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625528&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08c3c554-3699-4b2f-97a6-187d621eaa5d\', \'multiverseId\': 625528}, \'multiverseid\': 625528}, {\'name\': "Invasion de la Horde de l\'effroi", \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, vous perdez 1 point de vie et amassez des zombies 1. (Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une armée que vous contrôlez. C\'est aussi un zombie. Si vous ne contrôlez pas d\'armée, créez d\'abord un jeton de créature 0/0 noire Zombie et Armée.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un jeton Zombie de force supérieure ou égale à 6 que vous contrôlez attaque, il acquiert le lien de vie jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625785&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e25932cb-1d33-4400-8c85-e8cf88cf6af3\', \'multiverseId\': 625785}, \'multiverseid\': 625785}, {\'name\': \'戦慄衆の侵略\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたは１点のライフを失いゾンビ動員１を行う。（あなたがコントロールしている軍団１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。それはゾンビでもある。あなたが軍団をコントロールしていないなら、その前に、黒の０/０のゾンビ・軍団・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。）\\nあなたがコントロールしていてパワーが６以上であるゾンビ・トークン１体が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、それは絆魂を得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5702bf4e-8bf2-46a0-8df1-ff0499adbb66\', \'multiverseId\': 626042}, \'multiverseid\': 626042}]', '[{\'name\': \'Irrer Assistent\', \'text\': \'{T}, mille eine Karte: Erzeuge {C}. (Um eine Karte zu millen, lege die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Garl, stell den Schlammapparat neu ein. Garl, hol mir mehr Leichen. Garl, hör auf zu flennen und gib mir dein Hirngewebe. Wenn er weiter so gemein zu mir ist, dann kündige ich."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622896&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdd1cfd9-2f00-461f-bfdb-f1ed77964d62\', \'multiverseId\': 622896}, \'multiverseid\': 622896}, {\'name\': \'Asistente desquiciado\', \'text\': \'{T}, moler una carta: Agrega {C}. (Para moler una carta, pon la primera carta de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Garl, ajusta los canales de lodo. Garl, tráeme más cuerpos. Garl, deja de llorar y dame tu tejido cerebral. Si no deja de ser tan grosero, renuncio".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8acb34f-855a-4cd0-9b4d-a2bf79525e1c\', \'multiverseId\': 623097}, \'multiverseid\': 623097}, {\'name\': \'Assistant dément\', \'text\': \'{T}, meulez une carte : Ajoutez {C}. (Pour meuler une carte, mettez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Garl, ajuste les distributeurs de gruau. Garl, va me chercher d\'autres cadavres. Garl, cesse de pleurnicher et donne-moi un bout de ta cervelle. S\'il ne commence pas à être plus poli, je vais me barrer. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623298&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c18870cd-a686-4c8c-8536-c3155de55837\', \'multiverseId\': 623298}, \'multiverseid\': 623298}, {\'name\': \'錯乱した助手\', \'text\': \'{T}, カード１枚を切削する：{C}を加える。（カードを切削するとは、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカードをあなたの墓地に置くことである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「ガルー、懸濁液の容器を調整してくれ。ガルー、もっと多くの死体を取ってこい。ガルー、泣くのは止めてお前の脳組織をよこせ。こんな横暴を止めないなら、辞めますからね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c2d19e9-7711-45d7-8667-e50e96de15e6\', \'multiverseId\': 623700}, \'multiverseid\': 623700}, {\'name\': \'狂乱助手\', \'text\': \'{T}，磨一张牌：加{C}。（磨一张牌的流程是将你牌库顶的牌置入你的坟墓场。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「嘎耳，把泥浆机调一下。嘎耳，再搬几具尸体来。嘎耳，别哭了，把你的脑组织给我。如果他一直这么粗鲁，我就不干了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90de0cd2-2be5-4a3b-8f1b-5340a95f3201\', \'multiverseId\': 624102}, \'multiverseid\': 624102}]', '[{\'name\': \'Isareth die Erweckerin\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nImmer wenn Isareth die Erweckerin angreift, kannst du {X} bezahlen. Wenn du dies tust, bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag X aus deinem Friedhof mit einer Leichenmarke ins Spiel zurück. Falls jene Kreatur das Spiel verlassen würde, schicke sie ins Exil, anstatt sie irgendwo anders hinzulegen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622977&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c45c4010-a118-487a-b374-2566742b19c1\', \'multiverseId\': 622977}, \'multiverseid\': 622977}, {\'name\': \'Isareth, la Resucitadora\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\nSiempre que Isareth, la Resucitadora ataque, puedes pagar {X}. Cuando lo hagas, regresa la carta de criatura objetivo con valor de maná de X de tu cementerio al campo de batalla con un contador de cadáveres sobre ella. Si esa criatura fuera a dejar el campo de batalla, exíliala en vez de ponerla en cualquier otro lado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92a5581a-146a-4719-afde-7faa0946b576\', \'multiverseId\': 623178}, \'multiverseid\': 623178}, {\'name\': "Isareth l\'éveilleuse", \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'Isareth l\'éveilleuse attaque, vous pouvez payer {X}. Quand vous faites ainsi, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, depuis votre cimetière, une carte de créature avec une valeur mana de X ciblée avec un marqueur « cadavre » sur elle. Si cette créature devait quitter le champ de bataille, exilez-la à la place de la mettre autre part.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623379&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41e44427-1b14-4137-b29b-8e9418965c11\', \'multiverseId\': 623379}, \'multiverseid\': 623379}, {\'name\': \'呼び覚ます者イザレス\', \'text\': \'接死\\n呼び覚ます者イザレスが攻撃するたび、{X}を支払ってもよい。そうしたとき、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量がＸであるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを死体カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に戻す。そのクリーチャーが戦場を離れるなら、それを他の領域に置く代わりに追放する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9918b54c-be48-4a67-ba92-8fe5519cffdd\', \'multiverseId\': 623781}, \'multiverseid\': 623781}, {\'name\': \'唤尸依萨蕾\', \'text\': \'死触\\n每当唤尸依萨蕾攻击时，你可以支付{X}。当你如此作时，将目标法术力值为X的生物牌从你坟墓场移回战场，且上面有一个尸体指示物。如果该生物将离开战场，则改为将它放逐，而非置入其他区域。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'122bcd65-7831-4a7c-ad65-e877272b530b\', \'multiverseId\': 624183}, \'multiverseid\': 624183}]', "[{'name': 'Island', 'text': '({T}: Add {U}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Island', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624236&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '312e22f4-b332-41fa-8c30-c7c53dcfdfe3', 'multiverseId': 624236}, 'multiverseid': 624236}, {'name': 'Island', 'text': '({T}: Add {U}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Island', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624251&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b5c386c4-0ab0-460e-a78b-e7fbcda74ec7', 'multiverseId': 624251}, 'multiverseid': 624251}, {'name': 'Island', 'text': '({T}: Add {U}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Island', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624266&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '425830ec-970f-4c75-b1a6-4c5ef8901452', 'multiverseId': 624266}, 'multiverseid': 624266}, {'name': 'Island', 'text': '({T}: Add {U}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Island', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624296&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '50b3c3a5-b8e0-41f3-abc8-9c5c44838f11', 'multiverseId': 624296}, 'multiverseid': 624296}, {'name': 'Island', 'text': '({T}: Add {U}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Island', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624326&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '18bf8abe-d752-4ad5-beeb-7958716ec28e', 'multiverseId': 624326}, 'multiverseid': 624326}]", "[{'name': 'Island', 'text': '({T}: Add {U}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Island', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624237&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dde51227-d5fd-442f-b704-f67f41ce58dc', 'multiverseId': 624237}, 'multiverseid': 624237}, {'name': 'Island', 'text': '({T}: Add {U}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Island', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624252&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '558575a0-7e7f-47cd-8825-5645e42ced06', 'multiverseId': 624252}, 'multiverseid': 624252}, {'name': 'Island', 'text': '({T}: Add {U}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Island', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624267&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0745033a-4c09-4944-811a-1c07b5bd00a1', 'multiverseId': 624267}, 'multiverseid': 624267}, {'name': 'Island', 'text': '({T}: Add {U}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Island', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624297&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '57173c11-84d6-4dae-9479-fb6021b0b19b', 'multiverseId': 624297}, 'multiverseid': 624297}, {'name': 'Island', 'text': '({T}: Add {U}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Island', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624327&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9e71b105-f08d-40f5-8dce-fdd78845cb1d', 'multiverseId': 624327}, 'multiverseid': 624327}]", "[{'name': 'Island', 'text': '({T}: Add {U}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Island', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624238&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e971a365-acf9-4821-9bfe-db2309b8fc94', 'multiverseId': 624238}, 'multiverseid': 624238}, {'name': 'Island', 'text': '({T}: Add {U}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Island', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624253&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6728e070-9f96-41ef-947f-cc8a1f9215cb', 'multiverseId': 624253}, 'multiverseid': 624253}, {'name': 'Island', 'text': '({T}: Add {U}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Island', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624268&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '90acb528-f618-4c7f-9db0-68fa4906ad2a', 'multiverseId': 624268}, 'multiverseid': 624268}, {'name': 'Island', 'text': '({T}: Add {U}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Island', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624298&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '110739e7-2424-4a8d-a5bc-00a7dfc4fcbd', 'multiverseId': 624298}, 'multiverseid': 624298}, {'name': 'Island', 'text': '({T}: Add {U}.)', 'type': 'Basic Land — Island', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624328&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '29f46a9c-1603-4447-9481-ebf4c9c2970f', 'multiverseId': 624328}, 'multiverseid': 624328}]", '[{\'name\': \'Izzet-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Das Petschaft der Izzet erhält immer wieder ein neues Aussehen, und jedes Mal wird es einem schmeichelnden Portrait von Niv-Mizzet ähnlicher.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625619&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3db9b3a7-9589-4d06-96be-48a9b47cfdf1\', \'multiverseId\': 625619}, \'multiverseid\': 625619}, {\'name\': "Cachet d\'Izzet", \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Le cachet d\'Izzet est régulièrement modifié pour ressembler de plus en plus à un portrait miniature de Niv-Mizzet.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625876&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36ceade5-c19b-4973-b3e4-0d49de36d2eb\', \'multiverseId\': 625876}, \'multiverseid\': 625876}, {\'name\': \'イゼットの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{U}{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'イゼットの印鑑はしばしばデザインし直され、そのたびにニヴ＝ミゼットの虚栄に満ちた肖像に近づいていく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2743ccf-0602-40dd-a0c2-7592fa40d581\', \'multiverseId\': 626133}, \'multiverseid\': 626133}]', "[{'name': 'Jace Beleren', 'text': '+2: Jeder Spieler zieht eine Karte.\\n−1: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zieht eine Karte.\\n−10: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl millt zwanzig Karten.', 'type': 'Legendärer Planeswalker — Jace', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625512&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e7f47d30-f420-475b-a939-e89948c7e386', 'multiverseId': 625512}, 'multiverseid': 625512}, {'name': 'Jace Beleren', 'text': '+2: Chaque joueur pioche une carte.\\n-1: Un joueur ciblé pioche une carte.\\n-10: Un joueur ciblé meule vingt cartes.', 'type': 'Planeswalker légendaire : Jace', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625769&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5411f95b-010e-46c1-be47-1caedcf2ea60', 'multiverseId': 625769}, 'multiverseid': 625769}, {'name': 'ジェイス・ベレレン', 'text': '+2：各プレイヤーはそれぞれカード１枚を引く。\\n-1：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード１枚を引く。\\n-10：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード20枚を切削する。', 'type': '伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ジェイス', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626026&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b3d1fcf7-0707-4bc4-b41a-4b1d5618b0ac', 'multiverseId': 626026}, 'multiverseid': 626026}]", '[{\'name\': \'Jace der Gedankenarchitekt\', \'text\': \'+1: Immer wenn bis zu deinem nächsten Zug eine Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, angreift, erhält sie -1/-0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n−2: Decke die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Ein Gegner teilt jene Karten auf zwei Haufen auf. Nimm einen Haufen auf deine Hand und lege die Karten des anderen in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\\n−8: Für jeden Spieler durchsuchst du dessen Bibliothek nach einer Nichtland-Karte und schickst sie ins Exil, dann mischt der Spieler. Du kannst die Karten wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Jace\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625513&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f994381-02cc-4f71-bd33-64b1b973a1c5\', \'multiverseId\': 625513}, \'multiverseid\': 625513}, {\'name\': \'Jace, architecte des pensées\', \'text\': "+1: Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, à chaque fois qu\'une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle attaque, elle gagne -1/-0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n-2: Révélez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Un adversaire sépare ces cartes en deux tas. Mettez l\'un d\'eux dans votre main et l\'autre au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.\\n-8: Pour chaque joueur, cherchez dans la bibliothèque de ce joueur une carte non-terrain et exilez-la, puis ce joueur mélange. Vous pouvez lancer ces cartes sans payer leur coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Jace\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625770&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b847a85-0875-4100-bfa7-9f861a4e7943\', \'multiverseId\': 625770}, \'multiverseid\': 625770}, {\'name\': \'思考を築く者、ジェイス\', \'text\': \'+1：次のあなたのターンまで、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、それは－１/－０の修整を受ける。\\n-2：あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚を公開する。対戦相手１人はそれらのカードを２つの束に分ける。一方の束をあなたの手札に、もう一方をあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\\n-8：各プレイヤーにつきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーのライブラリーから土地でないカード１枚を探し、追放する。その後、そのプレイヤーはライブラリーを切り直す。あなたはそれらのカードを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ジェイス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1712b553-abcd-4853-84db-3ef1240494f6\', \'multiverseId\': 626027}, \'multiverseid\': 626027}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jace der Spiegelmagier\', \'text\': \'Bonus {2}\\nWenn Jace der Spiegelmagier ins Spiel kommt und falls seine Bonuskosten bezahlt wurden, erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie von Jace dem Spiegelmagier ist, außer dass er nicht legendär ist und Startloyalität 1 hat.\\n+1: Hellsicht 2.\\n0: Ziehe eine Karte und zeige sie offen vor. Entferne Loyalitätsmarken in Höhe des Manabetrags der Karte von Jace dem Spiegelmagier.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Jace\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625514&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f5c6339-7d96-4f02-9971-80d1810a0295\', \'multiverseId\': 625514}, \'multiverseid\': 625514}, {\'name\': \'Jace, mage du miroir\', \'text\': "Kick {2}\\nQuand Jace, mage du miroir arrive sur le champ de bataille, si Jace a été kické, créez un jeton qui est une copie de Jace, mage du miroir, excepté qu\'il n\'est pas légendaire et que sa loyauté de départ est 1.\\n+1: Regard 2.\\n0: Piochez une carte et révélez-la. Retirez un nombre de marqueurs « loyauté » égal à la valeur de mana de cette carte à Jace, mage du miroir.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Jace\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625771&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb80e54d-c239-4a48-a21e-10812936b374\', \'multiverseId\': 625771}, \'multiverseid\': 625771}, {\'name\': \'鏡映魔道士、ジェイス\', \'text\': \'キッカー{2}\\n鏡映魔道士、ジェイスが戦場に出たとき、鏡映魔道士、ジェイスがキッカーされていた場合、伝説でなく初期忠誠度が１であることを除き鏡映魔道士、ジェイスのコピーであるトークン１体を生成する。\\n+1：占術２を行う。\\n0：カード１枚を引き、公開する。そのカードのマナ総量に等しい個数の忠誠カウンターを鏡映魔道士、ジェイスの上から取り除く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ジェイス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94ce2515-c4ad-4f41-bfbc-f39858176a99\', \'multiverseId\': 626028}, \'multiverseid\': 626028}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jaces Eid\', \'text\': \'Wenn Jaces Eid ins Spiel kommt, ziehe drei Karten und wirf dann zwei Karten ab.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments wendest du Hellsicht X an, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Planeswalkern ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Zum Wohle des Multiversums werde ich Wache halten."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625516&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54fcee62-3c10-480a-b332-1fd1f252f676\', \'multiverseId\': 625516}, \'multiverseid\': 625516}, {\'name\': \'Serment de Jace\', \'text\': \'Quand le Serment de Jace arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez trois cartes, puis défaussez-vous de deux cartes.\\nAu début de votre entretien, regard X, X étant le nombre de planeswalkers que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement légendaire\', \'flavor\': "« Dans l\'intérêt du Multivers, je me ferai sentinelle. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625773&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'277e0283-2e53-46af-8119-8d8f20571c80\', \'multiverseId\': 625773}, \'multiverseid\': 625773}, {\'name\': \'ジェイスの誓い\', \'text\': \'ジェイスの誓いが戦場に出たとき、カード３枚を引く。その後、カード２枚を捨てる。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、占術Ｘを行う。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のエンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「多元宇宙の繁栄のため、私はゲートウォッチとなる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8798e85-66a7-4fcd-89c7-f63bec70312f\', \'multiverseId\': 626030}, \'multiverseid\': 626030}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jademagier\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}: Erzeuge einen 1/1 grünen Saproling-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Einsamkeit ist ein Symptom der Zivilisation."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627996&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da226693-9ca1-4916-b232-4ccaeb09eb96\', \'multiverseId\': 627996}, \'multiverseid\': 627996}, {\'name\': \'Mago de jade\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}: Crea una ficha de criatura Saprolín verde 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': \'"La soledad es un síntoma de la civilización".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28cf0613-6e96-4c39-9aac-1d70ec42b550\', \'multiverseId\': 628230}, \'multiverseid\': 628230}, {\'name\': \'翡翠の魔道士\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}：緑の１/１の苗木・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「孤独は文明の対価である。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4b44ad1-5abe-47b7-be2b-b9f7fbe38a6f\', \'multiverseId\': 628698}, \'multiverseid\': 628698}, {\'name\': \'翠玉法师\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}：派出一个1/1绿色腐生物衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「孤独乃文明之病征。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f576953-8e8b-4030-b6ae-a3a61d30aa77\', \'multiverseId\': 629166}, \'multiverseid\': 629166}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jayas Phoenix\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Eile\\nImmer wenn Jayas Phoenix einem Spieler oder Planeswalker Kampfschaden zufügt, kopiere die nächste Loyalitätsfähigkeit, die du in diesem Zug aktivierst, wenn du sie aktivierst. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\\nImmer wenn du einen Planeswalkerzauber wirkst, kannst du Jayas Phoenix aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phoenix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624929&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f228eba-37cb-4c2f-9625-e4d6e3a60e08\', \'multiverseId\': 624929}, \'multiverseid\': 624929}, {\'name\': \'Phénix de Jaya\', \'text\': "Vol, célérité\\nÀ chaque fois que le Phénix de Jaya inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur ou à un planeswalker, copiez la prochaine capacité de loyauté que vous activez ce tour-ci quand vous l\'activez. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de planeswalker, vous pouvez renvoyer sur le champ de bataille le Phénix de Jaya depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : phénix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624964&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d4ff932-bc1b-4bed-9e37-1ff467e8f2ae\', \'multiverseId\': 624964}, \'multiverseid\': 624964}, {\'name\': \'ヤヤのフェニックス\', \'text\': \'飛行、速攻\\nヤヤのフェニックスがプレイヤーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１つに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、このターン、あなたが次に忠誠度能力を起動したとき、その能力をコピーする。そのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\\nあなたがプレインズウォーカー・呪文１つを唱えるたび、あなたの墓地にあるヤヤのフェニックスを戦場に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェニックス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'063cee35-625c-4824-9a5c-684e2193f43a\', \'multiverseId\': 624999}, \'multiverseid\': 624999}, {\'name\': \'雅亚的凤凰\', \'text\': \'飞行，敏捷\\n每当雅亚的凤凰对任一牌手或鹏洛客造成战斗伤害，本回合中，当你下一次起动忠诚异能时，复制该异能。你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。\\n每当你施放鹏洛客咒语时，你可以将雅亚的凤凰从你的坟墓场移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～凤凰\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'387c724d-fe73-40bc-8eb5-8b43722399ea\', \'multiverseId\': 625034}, \'multiverseid\': 625034}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jayas Phoenix\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Eile\\nImmer wenn Jayas Phoenix einem Spieler oder Planeswalker Kampfschaden zufügt, kopiere die nächste Loyalitätsfähigkeit, die du in diesem Zug aktivierst, wenn du sie aktivierst. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\\nImmer wenn du einen Planeswalkerzauber wirkst, kannst du Jayas Phoenix aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phoenix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625135&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a29db387-3f50-43bc-a69a-41ab7c3fb17f\', \'multiverseId\': 625135}, \'multiverseid\': 625135}, {\'name\': \'Phénix de Jaya\', \'text\': "Vol, célérité\\nÀ chaque fois que le Phénix de Jaya inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur ou à un planeswalker, copiez la prochaine capacité de loyauté que vous activez ce tour-ci quand vous l\'activez. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de planeswalker, vous pouvez renvoyer sur le champ de bataille le Phénix de Jaya depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : phénix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625167&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe598b5e-c4e7-4d58-bca8-e1188142ddba\', \'multiverseId\': 625167}, \'multiverseid\': 625167}, {\'name\': \'ヤヤのフェニックス\', \'text\': \'飛行、速攻\\nヤヤのフェニックスがプレイヤーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１つに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、このターン、あなたが次に忠誠度能力を起動したとき、その能力をコピーする。そのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\\nあなたがプレインズウォーカー・呪文１つを唱えるたび、あなたの墓地にあるヤヤのフェニックスを戦場に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェニックス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36e8fd89-041b-4ec5-b7b2-22cd6cc2b404\', \'multiverseId\': 625199}, \'multiverseid\': 625199}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jazal Goldmähne\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\n{3}{W}{W}: Angreifende Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+X, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an angreifenden Kreaturen ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Katze, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Als mein Kha ist er der Quell meiner Inspiration. Als mein Bruder ist er die Verkörperung meiner Ziele."\\n—Ajani Goldmähne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622841&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae9c2c11-4430-4d7d-bf3c-bfdc597c43e0\', \'multiverseId\': 622841}, \'multiverseid\': 622841}, {\'name\': \'Jazal Melena Dorada\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\n{3}{W}{W}: Las criaturas atacantes que controlas obtienen +X/+X hasta el final del turno, donde X es la cantidad de criaturas atacantes.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Como mi kha, es la fuente de mi inspiración. Como mi hermano, es la encarnación de mis aspiraciones".\\n—Ajani Melena Dorada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0c8528e-db3b-49b5-afa3-ba199961c50c\', \'multiverseId\': 623042}, \'multiverseid\': 623042}, {\'name\': \'Jazal Crinièredor\', \'text\': "Initiative\\n{3}{W}{W} : Les créatures attaquantes que vous contrôlez gagnent +X/+X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre de créatures attaquantes.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : chat et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Mon kha, source de mon inspiration. Mon frère, incarnation de mes aspirations. »\\n—Ajani Crinièredor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623243&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c034fd1-e5ef-480c-9e1c-9f8608d39c0e\', \'multiverseId\': 623243}, \'multiverseid\': 623243}, {\'name\': \'黄金のたてがみのジャザル\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n{3}{W}{W}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべての攻撃クリーチャーは＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘは攻撃クリーチャーの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 猫・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「我が王として、あの方は私の勇気の源泉である。我が兄として、あの方は私の願望を体現する者である。」\\n――黄金のたてがみのアジャニ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc2607e1-fc5e-48cb-a924-794e60cad825\', \'multiverseId\': 623645}, \'multiverseid\': 623645}, {\'name\': \'金鬃贾佐\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n{3}{W}{W}：由你操控且进行攻击的生物得+X/+X直到回合结束，X为进行攻击的生物数量。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～猫／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「作为狮王，他是我的精神引领。作为兄长，他是我的志望所向。」\\n～金鬃阿耶尼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47cc6f0d-7e5a-4bbf-a330-af5a5b6a860b\', \'multiverseId\': 624047}, \'multiverseid\': 624047}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jazal Goldmähne\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\n{3}{W}{W}: Angreifende Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+X, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an angreifenden Kreaturen ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Katze, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Als mein Kha ist er der Quell meiner Inspiration. Als mein Bruder ist er die Verkörperung meiner Ziele."\\n—Ajani Goldmähne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626488&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a94c18f-5ff5-4131-a845-824bd9b14dd2\', \'multiverseId\': 626488}, \'multiverseid\': 626488}, {\'name\': \'Jazal Crinièredor\', \'text\': "Initiative\\n{3}{W}{W} : Les créatures attaquantes que vous contrôlez gagnent +X/+X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre de créatures attaquantes.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : chat et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Mon kha, source de mon inspiration. Mon frère, incarnation de mes aspirations. »\\n—Ajani Crinièredor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626828&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61232256-c900-4663-94fd-a7a54e5a0809\', \'multiverseId\': 626828}, \'multiverseid\': 626828}, {\'name\': \'黄金のたてがみのジャザル\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n{3}{W}{W}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべての攻撃クリーチャーは＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘは攻撃クリーチャーの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 猫・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「我が王として、あの方は私の勇気の源泉である。我が兄として、あの方は私の願望を体現する者である。」\\n――黄金のたてがみのアジャニ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e88291b0-f5be-442e-a3f5-1e18e19afe56\', \'multiverseId\': 627168}, \'multiverseid\': 627168}, {\'name\': \'金鬃贾佐\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n{3}{W}{W}：由你操控且进行攻击的生物得+X/+X直到回合结束，X为进行攻击的生物数量。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～猫／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「作为狮王，他是我的精神引领。作为兄长，他是我的志望所向。」\\n～金鬃阿耶尼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c73bd25-a7ca-47ff-9665-affc64c8e66d\', \'multiverseId\': 627508}, \'multiverseid\': 627508}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jolrael, Mwonvuli-Einsiedlerin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, erzeuge einen 2/2 grünen Katze-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n{4}{G}{G}: Bis zum Ende des Zuges haben Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft X/X, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Karten auf deiner Hand ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Menschen bringen nichts als Leid und Täuschung. Sie sind in meinem Wald nicht willkommen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626589&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e14f09ed-92c4-47ee-8db2-fcbd36d5d8e6\', \'multiverseId\': 626589}, \'multiverseid\': 626589}, {\'name\': \'Jolraël, recluse de la Mwônvouli\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous piochez votre deuxième carte à chaque tour, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 verte Chat.\\n{4}{G}{G} : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, les créatures que vous contrôlez ont une force et une endurance de base de X/X, X étant le nombre de cartes dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et druide\', \'flavor\': "« Les humains n\'apportent que souffrance et tromperie. Ils ne sont pas les bienvenus dans ma forêt. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626929&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf651186-efd5-4245-95c0-7544664947fa\', \'multiverseId\': 626929}, \'multiverseid\': 626929}, {\'name\': \'ムウォンヴーリーの世捨て人、ジョルレイル\', \'text\': \'あなたが各ターン内のあなたの２枚目のカードを引くたび、緑の２/２の猫・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{4}{G}{G}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーの基本のパワーとタフネスはＸ/Ｘになる。Ｘはあなたの手札にあるカードの枚数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「人間がもたらすのは苦しみと偽りのみ。私の森には不要。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e76bc54f-d453-419a-959c-41ebe07a1b3a\', \'multiverseId\': 627269}, \'multiverseid\': 627269}, {\'name\': \'木万弗黎隐士裘蕾尔\', \'text\': \'每当你抓每回合中你的第二张牌时，派出一个2/2绿色的猫衍生生物。\\n{4}{G}{G}：直到回合结束，由你操控的生物之基础力量与防御力为X/X，X为你的手牌数量。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「人类带来的只有苦难与欺瞒，别无他物。我的树林不欢迎他们。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e4d45f3-b5f0-4a10-b2a8-642c2ab2731b\', \'multiverseId\': 627609}, \'multiverseid\': 627609}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jolrael, Mwonvuli-Einsiedlerin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, erzeuge einen 2/2 grünen Katze-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n{4}{G}{G}: Bis zum Ende des Zuges haben Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft X/X, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Karten auf deiner Hand ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Menschen bringen nichts als Leid und Täuschung. Sie sind in meinem Wald nicht willkommen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627997&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfbe0bb8-aa24-4871-89ce-73ab3f605fc4\', \'multiverseId\': 627997}, \'multiverseid\': 627997}, {\'name\': \'Jolrael, ermitaña de Mwonvuli\', \'text\': \'Siempre que robes tu segunda carta cada turno, crea una ficha de criatura Felino verde 2/2.\\n{4}{G}{G}: Hasta el final del turno, las criaturas que controlas tienen una fuerza y resistencia base de X/X, donde X es la cantidad de cartas en tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Druida humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Los humanos solo nos engañan y nos hacen sufrir. No son bienvenidos en mi bosque".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffd6e844-e38f-4355-a342-2921f565172f\', \'multiverseId\': 628231}, \'multiverseid\': 628231}, {\'name\': \'ムウォンヴーリーの世捨て人、ジョルレイル\', \'text\': \'あなたが各ターン内のあなたの２枚目のカードを引くたび、緑の２/２の猫・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{4}{G}{G}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーの基本のパワーとタフネスはＸ/Ｘになる。Ｘはあなたの手札にあるカードの枚数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「人間がもたらすのは苦しみと偽りのみ。私の森には不要。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb937271-c9a7-4995-8fe1-28e6fa1d92b3\', \'multiverseId\': 628699}, \'multiverseid\': 628699}, {\'name\': \'木万弗黎隐士裘蕾尔\', \'text\': \'每当你抓每回合中你的第二张牌时，派出一个2/2绿色的猫衍生生物。\\n{4}{G}{G}：直到回合结束，由你操控的生物之基础力量与防御力为X/X，X为你的手牌数量。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「人类带来的只有苦难与欺瞒，别无他物。我的树林不欢迎他们。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be1933ea-c5b0-48ce-b7bb-7525faae869b\', \'multiverseId\': 629167}, \'multiverseid\': 629167}]', "[{'name': 'Judith, geißelnde Diva', 'text': 'Andere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+0.\\nImmer wenn eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, fügt Judith, geißelnde Diva, einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane', 'flavor': 'Am Ende der Vorstellung steht sie allein auf der blutgetränkten Bühne.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628039&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '10f97f2d-5f77-4683-956c-b9d3f46c404b', 'multiverseId': 628039}, 'multiverseid': 628039}, {'name': 'Judith, diva de la flagelación', 'text': 'Las otras criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+0.\\nSiempre que una criatura que no sea ficha que controlas muera, Judith, diva de la flagelación hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Chamán humano', 'flavor': 'Al final del espectáculo, solo queda ella sobre un reluciente escenario ensangrentado.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628273&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '584b0a3f-c7d4-408c-913c-03db4a8a9753', 'multiverseId': 628273}, 'multiverseid': 628273}, {'name': '災いの歌姫、ジュディス', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてトークンでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、１つを対象とする。災いの歌姫、ジュディスはそれに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン', 'flavor': 'ショーの終わりに、ステージに一人立つ彼女の姿は血で輝いていた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628741&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '03e37e60-116a-4dc1-bf3c-2e979614f69e', 'multiverseId': 628741}, 'multiverseid': 628741}, {'name': '灾祸歌伶裘蒂丝', 'text': '由你操控的其他生物得+1/+0。\\n每当一个由你操控且非衍生物的生物死去时，灾祸歌伶裘蒂丝对任意一个目标造成1点伤害。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～人类／祭师', 'flavor': '待演出结束，她独立舞台中央，浑身闪耀血光。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629209&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd55eb613-be37-4fa9-9cf3-722c5ce4126a', 'multiverseId': 629209}, 'multiverseid': 629209}]", '[{\'name\': \'Jukai-Naturalist\', \'text\': \'Lebensverknüpfung\\nVerzauberungszauber, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Mensch, Mönch\', \'flavor\': \'Er hatte von den Städten gehört — dem ständigen Lärm, der verpesteten Luft, dem verdorbenen Wasser — und wollte nicht wissen, ob sie stimmten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625588&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc14a625-a92d-48a3-8596-f344a4c9d7a7\', \'multiverseId\': 625588}, \'multiverseid\': 625588}, {\'name\': \'Naturaliste de Jukai\', \'text\': "Lien de vie\\nLes sorts d\'enchantement que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : humain et moine\', \'flavor\': "Il avait entendu tant de rumeurs sur les villes—le bruit constant, l\'air stagnant, l\'eau polluée—qu\'il n\'avait aucune envie d\'apprendre si elles étaient vraies.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625845&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67e24c82-b638-446f-97db-b7c4c59ac706\', \'multiverseId\': 625845}, \'multiverseid\': 625845}, {\'name\': \'樹海の自然主義者\', \'text\': \'絆魂\\nあなたがエンチャント・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — 人間・モンク\', \'flavor\': \'彼は都会の噂は耳にしていた。鳴り止まない騒音、淀んだ空気、汚れた水。それらの噂の真意を突き止めるつもりはさらさらなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26d3c7be-624f-4257-9464-bc0aaa7d608f\', \'multiverseId\': 626102}, \'multiverseid\': 626102}]', '[{\'name\': \'Juwelenlotus\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere den Juwelenlotus: Erzeuge drei Mana genau einer beliebigen Farbe. Gib dieses Mana nur aus, um deinen Kommandeur zu wirken.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe schon so einige Spielereien gesehen, Herr Minister. Was auch immer Ihr da habt, es wird mich nicht … Oh!"\\n—Kaiser Ayrelion\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626636&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d94cf77-7f07-4a08-9927-89553fc1792d\', \'multiverseId\': 626636}, \'multiverseid\': 626636}, {\'name\': \'Lotus joailler\', \'text\': "{T}, sacrifiez le Lotus joailler : Ajoutez trois manas d\'une seule couleur de votre choix. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Des babioles, j\'en ai vu, ministre. Ce n\'est pas le machin scintillant tape-à-l\'œil que vous avez-là qui me convaincra de... Ça alors. »\\n—Empereur Ayrelion", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626976&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fc74dd1-b67e-4679-938f-ef3c53a130e8\', \'multiverseId\': 626976}, \'multiverseid\': 626976}, {\'name\': \'宝石の睡蓮\', \'text\': \'{T}, 宝石の睡蓮を生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ３点を加える。このマナは、あなたの統率者を唱えるためにしか支払えない。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「余の宝石は見せてもらったぞ。大臣。そこにある派手な光り物程度で、余を納得させることは……なんだと。」\\n――皇帝アイレリオン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c120308-618b-49b2-87f0-eaabc8221b94\', \'multiverseId\': 627316}, \'multiverseid\': 627316}, {\'name\': \'珠光莲花\', \'text\': \'{T}，牺牲珠光莲花：加三点任意颜色的单色法术力。此法术力只能用来施放你的指挥官。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「我已经见过我的那份饰品了，大臣。你不管再拿出怎样的奢华珠宝，都不会让我…哦，我的天。」\\n～艾睿黎皇帝\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ea47bc0-5d63-4555-9b53-8d9d3e6f2bac\', \'multiverseId\': 627656}, \'multiverseid\': 627656}]', '[{\'name\': \'Juwelenlotus\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere den Juwelenlotus: Erzeuge drei Mana genau einer beliebigen Farbe. Gib dieses Mana nur aus, um deinen Kommandeur zu wirken.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe schon so einige Spielereien gesehen, Herr Minister. Was auch immer Ihr da habt, es wird mich nicht … Oh!"\\n—Kaiser Ayrelion\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628094&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef4dbe03-39f4-41d1-bd15-bdcdebf045e8\', \'multiverseId\': 628094}, \'multiverseid\': 628094}, {\'name\': \'Loto enjoyado\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar el Loto enjoyado: Agrega tres manás de un color cualquiera. Usa este maná solo para lanzar a tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"He visto bastantes baratijas, ministro. Da igual qué cosa brillante y ostentosa tenga ahí, no me convencerá para... Oh...".\\n—Emperador Ayrelion\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a48b62e-f90e-4b6a-830d-c3c7231102a4\', \'multiverseId\': 628328}, \'multiverseid\': 628328}, {\'name\': \'宝石の睡蓮\', \'text\': \'{T}, 宝石の睡蓮を生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ３点を加える。このマナは、あなたの統率者を唱えるためにしか支払えない。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「余の宝石は見せてもらったぞ。大臣。そこにある派手な光り物程度で、余を納得させることは……なんだと。」\\n――皇帝アイレリオン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3952425-1e28-47b9-b044-99fe0c3feaee\', \'multiverseId\': 628796}, \'multiverseid\': 628796}, {\'name\': \'珠光莲花\', \'text\': \'{T}，牺牲珠光莲花：加三点任意颜色的单色法术力。此法术力只能用来施放你的指挥官。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「我已经见过我的那份饰品了，大臣。你不管再拿出怎样的奢华珠宝，都不会让我…哦，我的天。」\\n～艾睿黎皇帝\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbe3139f-5d98-44de-9553-3595d96c35bb\', \'multiverseId\': 629264}, \'multiverseid\': 629264}]', '[{\'name\': \'Juwelenlotus\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere den Juwelenlotus: Erzeuge drei Mana genau einer beliebigen Farbe. Gib dieses Mana nur aus, um deinen Kommandeur zu wirken.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624796&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0085256f-9329-4480-b2de-05cda8416c1b\', \'multiverseId\': 624796}, \'multiverseid\': 624796}, {\'name\': \'Loto enjoyado\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar el Loto enjoyado: Agrega tres manás de un color cualquiera. Usa este maná solo para lanzar a tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bcd9848-3fce-41aa-a3b7-c89e9ea0bd15\', \'multiverseId\': 624808}, \'multiverseid\': 624808}, {\'name\': \'Lotus joailler\', \'text\': "{T}, sacrifiez le Lotus joailler : Ajoutez trois manas d\'une seule couleur de votre choix. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624820&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2860cc8-7d47-4442-8a12-f9c9e4634a9a\', \'multiverseId\': 624820}, \'multiverseid\': 624820}, {\'name\': \'宝石の睡蓮\', \'text\': \'{T}, 宝石の睡蓮を生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ３点を加える。このマナは、あなたの統率者を唱えるためにしか支払えない。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d6739c1-0dd4-4144-8147-4f543ca03dbe\', \'multiverseId\': 624844}, \'multiverseid\': 624844}, {\'name\': \'珠光莲花\', \'text\': \'{T}，牺牲珠光莲花：加三点任意颜色的单色法术力。此法术力只能用来施放你的指挥官。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'793c74d7-cd0c-4bc0-b27c-6453922a8c69\', \'multiverseId\': 624868}, \'multiverseid\': 624868}]', '[{\'name\': \'Juwelenlotus\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere den Juwelenlotus: Erzeuge drei Mana genau einer beliebigen Farbe. Gib dieses Mana nur aus, um deinen Kommandeur zu wirken.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626268&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fdad32a-1ce3-4ada-80dd-1ccb8eccf80c\', \'multiverseId\': 626268}, \'multiverseid\': 626268}, {\'name\': \'Lotus joailler\', \'text\': "{T}, sacrifiez le Lotus joailler : Ajoutez trois manas d\'une seule couleur de votre choix. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626278&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8469b2fd-dc06-437b-979a-9ffaf7a8d89f\', \'multiverseId\': 626278}, \'multiverseid\': 626278}, {\'name\': \'宝石の睡蓮\', \'text\': \'{T}, 宝石の睡蓮を生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ３点を加える。このマナは、あなたの統率者を唱えるためにしか支払えない。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d92a7fe5-6e89-4494-82d4-46f9be834f3f\', \'multiverseId\': 626288}, \'multiverseid\': 626288}, {\'name\': \'珠光莲花\', \'text\': \'{T}，牺牲珠光莲花：加三点任意颜色的单色法术力。此法术力只能用来施放你的指挥官。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd9b95db-79a6-42ba-85d3-989899a40d28\', \'multiverseId\': 626298}, \'multiverseid\': 626298}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kadaverbold\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Kadaverbold ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bold\', \'flavor\': \'Der Mund muss aufgeklappt werden, bevor die Totenstarre einsetzt. Anderenfalls findet die zurückkehrende Seele keinen Zutritt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622950&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbabf862-7712-42cf-97d9-e4963cfbc9fe\', \'multiverseId\': 622950}, \'multiverseid\': 622950}, {\'name\': \'Diablillo de cadáveres\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Diablillo de cadáveres entre al campo de batalla, puedes regresar la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Diablillo\', \'flavor\': \'La boca debe abrirse antes de que se produzca el rigor mortis. Si no, al volver el alma no encuentra manera de entrar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98da8b6b-3e0f-4e9d-8c49-ff76a178754b\', \'multiverseId\': 623151}, \'multiverseid\': 623151}, {\'name\': \'Diablotin des cadavres\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nQuand le Diablotin des cadavres arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez renvoyer une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Créature : diablotin\', \'flavor\': "La bouche doit être maintenue ouverte jusqu\'à l\'apparition de la raideur cadavérique. Sinon, l\'âme qui revient ne trouve pas de point d\'entrée.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623352&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8af67e96-c35d-476c-acf7-4f66990365e3\', \'multiverseId\': 623352}, \'multiverseid\': 623352}, {\'name\': \'死者のインプ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n死者のインプが戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — インプ\', \'flavor\': \'死後硬直が始まる前に、口を梃子で開けておかなければいけない。そうしなければ、戻ってきた魂の入り口が見つからなくなる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2dac70c-3dec-4629-bf53-f1c8ff26c7c7\', \'multiverseId\': 623754}, \'multiverseid\': 623754}, {\'name\': \'尸首小恶魔\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当尸首小恶魔进战场时，你可以将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～小恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'在死尸僵硬之前，必须先把嘴给撬开；否则返回的灵魂会找不到入口。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73ce3118-55ac-425d-b792-4b0aa50887c3\', \'multiverseId\': 624156}, \'multiverseid\': 624156}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kaho, Historikerin von Minamo\', \'text\': \'Wenn Kaho, Historikerin von Minamo, ins Spiel kommt, durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu drei Spontanzauberkarten, schicke sie ins Exil und mische danach.\\n{X}, {T}: Du kannst von den von Kaho ins Exil geschickten Karten einen Zauberspruch mit Manabetrag X wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622910&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0701b57-1f76-48ee-9e62-33e87eb7d76f\', \'multiverseId\': 622910}, \'multiverseid\': 622910}, {\'name\': \'Kaho, historiadora de Minamo\', \'text\': \'Cuando Kaho, historiadora de Minamo entre al campo de batalla, busca en tu biblioteca hasta tres cartas de instantáneo, exílialas y luego baraja.\\n{X}, {T}: Puedes lanzar un hechizo con valor de maná de X de entre las cartas exiliadas con Kaho sin pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e5473b6-be60-4da0-9711-19a210df92c6\', \'multiverseId\': 623111}, \'multiverseid\': 623111}, {\'name\': \'Kaho, historienne de Minamo\', \'text\': "Quand Kaho, historienne de Minamo arrive sur le champ de bataille, cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à trois cartes d\'éphémère, exilez-les, puis mélangez.\\n{X}, {T} : Vous pouvez lancer un sort avec une valeur de mana de X parmi les cartes exilées par Kaho sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623312&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b640840-bf1f-43e2-b4b5-066acb792c07\', \'multiverseId\': 623312}, \'multiverseid\': 623312}, {\'name\': \'水面院の歴史家、歌穂\', \'text\': \'水面院の歴史家、歌穂が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーからインスタント・カード最大３枚を探し、追放し、その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\\n{X}, {T}：水面院の歴史家、歌穂によって追放されているカードの中からマナ総量がＸである呪文１つをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c86377ed-0ec5-4f5e-837a-e9a214e4f5a8\', \'multiverseId\': 623714}, \'multiverseid\': 623714}, {\'name\': \'水面院史家歌穗\', \'text\': \'当水面院史家歌穗进战场时，从你牌库中搜寻至多三张瞬间牌，将它们放逐，然后洗牌。\\n{X}，{T}：你可以从以歌穗放逐的牌之中施放一个法术力值为X的咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'074f67c8-0c84-487d-9d35-cf244abc8c0d\', \'multiverseId\': 624116}, \'multiverseid\': 624116}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kaldras Vollendung\', \'text\': \'Lebende Waffe\\nUnzerstörbar\\nDie ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +5/+5, verursacht Trampelschaden, hat Erstschlag. Unzerstörbarkeit, Eile und „Immer wenn diese Kreatur einer Kreatur Kampfschaden zufügt, schicke jene Kreatur ins Exil."\\nAusrüsten {7}\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625620&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'679194ec-e165-4c16-8051-22d4683a462d\', \'multiverseId\': 625620}, \'multiverseid\': 625620}, {\'name\': \'Kaldra parachevée\', \'text\': "Arme vivante\\nIndestructible\\nLa créature équipée gagne +5/+5 et a l\'initiative, le piétinement, l\'indestructible, la célérité et « À chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à une créature, exilez cette créature. »\\nÉquipement {7}", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625877&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef4559f2-f781-444c-8736-46b45e3fed47\', \'multiverseId\': 625877}, \'multiverseid\': 625877}, {\'name\': \'カルドラの完成体\', \'text\': \'生体武器\\n破壊不能\\n装備しているクリーチャーは＋５/＋５の修整を受け、先制攻撃とトランプルと破壊不能と速攻と「このクリーチャーがクリーチャー１体に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのクリーチャーを追放する。」を持つ。\\n装備{7}\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5562e692-598f-460a-a6d9-6780d26860cf\', \'multiverseId\': 626134}, \'multiverseid\': 626134}]', "[{'name': 'Kampfanzug', 'text': 'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+2, hat Eile, kann weder dich noch Planeswalker, die du kontrollierst, angreifen und kann nicht geopfert werden.\\nZu Beginn des Versorgungssegments jedes Gegners kannst du jenen Spieler bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über die ausgerüstete Kreatur übernehmen lassen. Falls du dies tust, enttappe sie.\\nAusrüsten {3}', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628067&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e2f132d8-2e80-4286-88fd-93d2e825f5e7', 'multiverseId': 628067}, 'multiverseid': 628067}, {'name': 'Armadura de asalto', 'text': 'La criatura equipada obtiene +2/+2, tiene la habilidad de prisa, no puede atacarte a ti o a los planeswalkers que controlas y no puede ser sacrificada.\\nAl comienzo del mantenimiento de cada oponente, puedes hacer que ese jugador gane el control de la criatura equipada hasta el final del turno. Si lo haces, enderézala.\\nEquipar {3}.', 'type': 'Artefacto — Equipo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628301&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a4fc1673-644f-4543-a60e-cdff3abf2f63', 'multiverseId': 628301}, 'multiverseid': 628301}, {'name': '突撃鎧', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け、速攻を持ち、あなたやあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃できず、生け贄に捧げられない。\\n各対戦相手のアップキープの開始時に、あなたは「ターン終了時まで、そのプレイヤーは装備しているクリーチャーのコントロールを得る。」を選んでもよい。そうしたなら、それをアンタップする。\\n装備{3}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628769&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9f58dd04-da00-4a73-8769-dd9ea749071c', 'multiverseId': 628769}, 'multiverseid': 628769}, {'name': '突击装', 'text': '佩带此武具的生物得+2/+2，具有敏捷异能，不能攻击你或由你操控的鹏洛客，且不能被牺牲。\\n在每位对手的维持开始时，你可以令该牌手获得佩带此武具之生物的操控权直到回合结束。若你如此作，则将它重置。\\n佩带{3}', 'type': '神器 ～武具', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629237&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '58fe5ede-ceaf-40d7-9613-2e8785753cb9', 'multiverseId': 629237}, 'multiverseid': 629237}]", '[{\'name\': \'Kampfkreischen\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge zwei 1/1 weiße Vogel-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nRückblende — Tappe drei ungetappte weiße Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst. (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Alle Geräusche sind mit der Weltenseele im Einklang.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622826&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c02ce6ec-bc5e-4900-bd92-e5fea634a7b5\', \'multiverseId\': 622826}, \'multiverseid\': 622826}, {\'name\': \'Alarido de guerra\', \'text\': \'Crea dos fichas de criatura Ave blancas 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\nRetrospectiva—Girar tres criaturas blancas enderezadas que controlas. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Todos los sonidos están en armonía con el alma del mundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ccd12f0-20fe-4f32-88b8-994587c8ad9f\', \'multiverseId\': 623027}, \'multiverseid\': 623027}, {\'name\': \'Piaillement de bataille\', \'text\': \'Créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Oiseau avec le vol.\\nFlashback — Engagez trois créatures blanches dégagées que vous contrôlez. (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Tous les bruits sont en harmonie avec l\'Âme du monde.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623228&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2461667-fbd6-486b-b5b1-340c82e8d3d7\', \'multiverseId\': 623228}, \'multiverseid\': 623228}, {\'name\': \'金切るときの声\', \'text\': \'飛行を持つ白の１/１の鳥・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\\nフラッシュバック―あなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態である白のクリーチャー３体をタップする。（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'一切の音が世界魂と響き合う。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb9fe2ca-745e-4104-ae6e-20cdf8cb0b60\', \'multiverseId\': 623630}, \'multiverseid\': 623630}, {\'name\': \'战呼\', \'text\': \'派出两个1/1白色，具飞行异能的鸟衍生生物。\\n返照～横置三个由你操控且未横置的白色生物。（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'无声不与世界之魂相谐。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'321dbcff-3b6a-4b6e-9d22-d050384b943d\', \'multiverseId\': 624032}, \'multiverseid\': 624032}]', "[{'name': 'Kapitänin Ripley Vance', 'text': 'Immer wenn du deinen dritten Zauberspruch innerhalb desselben Zuges wirkst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Kapitänin Ripley Vance. Dann fügt sie einem Ziel deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Pirat', 'flavor': 'Die Brandgeschoss-Bastion strotzt vor Kanonen, die sie von etlichen Schiffen erobert hat.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627907&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '423fdd93-f5b1-4b91-9914-29eed9f5d54c', 'multiverseId': 627907}, 'multiverseid': 627907}, {'name': 'Capitana Ripley Vance', 'text': 'Siempre que lances tu tercer hechizo cada turno, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Capitana Ripley Vance y luego hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a cualquier objetivo.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Pirata humano', 'flavor': 'El Bastión Escupefuego está repleto de cañones de todas las naves que ha conquistado.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628141&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '002a6874-fcf6-43e8-ad3f-189a9fa3f701', 'multiverseId': 628141}, 'multiverseid': 628141}, {'name': 'リプリー・ヴァンス船長', 'text': 'あなたが各ターン内のあなたの３つ目の呪文を唱えるたび、１つを対象とする。リプリー・ヴァンス船長の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。その後、これはそれに自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・海賊', 'flavor': '火を吐く稜堡が集中砲火を始めた。その砲はどれも彼女が制圧した船から得た戦利品だ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628609&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e69e484-dd31-44ad-bec2-61851c918263', 'multiverseId': 628609}, 'multiverseid': 628609}, {'name': '蕾普莉凡丝船长', 'text': '每当你施放每回合中你的第三个咒语时，在蕾普莉凡丝船长上放置一个+1/+1指示物，然后它对任意一个目标造成等同于其力量的伤害。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～人类／海盗', 'flavor': '喷火堡垒上林立的炮阵缴获自她征服的每艘船。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629077&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de622a04-85d6-4ba8-815a-ed674fb639dd', 'multiverseId': 629077}, 'multiverseid': 629077}]", '[{\'name\': \'Karador, Geisterhäuptling\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede Kreaturenkarte in deinem Friedhof {1} weniger.\\nEinmal während jedes deiner Züge kannst du einen Kreaturenzauber aus deinem Friedhof wirken.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Zentaur, Geist\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Tod wollte mir meine Krone rauben. Doch ich bin zurück, und mein Reich ist größer geworden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626606&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0d730eb-25ab-4828-a3a2-b7e48e630b49\', \'multiverseId\': 626606}, \'multiverseid\': 626606}, {\'name\': \'Karador, chef de clan fantôme\', \'text\': \'Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque carte de créature dans votre cimetière.\\nUne fois pendant chacun de vos tours, vous pouvez lancer un sort de créature depuis votre cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : centaure et esprit\', \'flavor\': "« La mort a voulu me détrôner. Mais je reviens aujourd\'hui à la tête d\'un plus grand royaume. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626946&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1906c18b-5c85-420c-a47a-2a66b7382274\', \'multiverseId\': 626946}, \'multiverseid\': 626946}, {\'name\': \'幽霊の酋長、カラドール\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚につき{1}少なくなる。\\nあなたの各ターンに、あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・呪文１つを唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ケンタウルス・スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'「死が私を王座から退かせようとした。しかし、私は今、さらに大いなる国の王として戻ってきた。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d8a27c9-0420-410a-87a0-e1fb301df170\', \'multiverseId\': 627286}, \'multiverseid\': 627286}, {\'name\': \'幽灵酋长卡拉多\', \'text\': \'你坟墓场中每有一张生物牌，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。\\n仅于你的每个回合中且限一次，你可以从你的坟墓场施放生物咒语。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～半人马／精怪\', \'flavor\': \'「死亡试图夺走我的权力。但如今我已归位，治下疆域却更加广阔。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f9655cb-957f-4377-a47f-44a30b33ebd7\', \'multiverseId\': 627626}, \'multiverseid\': 627626}]', '[{\'name\': \'Karador, Geisterhäuptling\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede Kreaturenkarte in deinem Friedhof {1} weniger.\\nEinmal während jedes deiner Züge kannst du einen Kreaturenzauber aus deinem Friedhof wirken.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Zentaur, Geist\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Tod wollte mir meine Krone rauben. Doch ich bin zurück, und mein Reich ist größer geworden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628040&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'105b7023-6923-4dd1-98c5-00dd0a56fad8\', \'multiverseId\': 628040}, \'multiverseid\': 628040}, {\'name\': \'Karador, Cacique Fantasma\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada carta de criatura en tu cementerio.\\nUna vez durante cada uno de tus turnos, puedes lanzar un hechizo de criatura desde tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Espíritu centauro\', \'flavor\': \'"La Muerte intentó destronarme. Pero ahora regreso, rey de un reino aún mayor".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1613f87-f5e5-4d93-a86a-6c72924cbc52\', \'multiverseId\': 628274}, \'multiverseid\': 628274}, {\'name\': \'幽霊の酋長、カラドール\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚につき{1}少なくなる。\\nあなたの各ターンに、あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・呪文１つを唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ケンタウルス・スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'「死が私を王座から退かせようとした。しかし、私は今、さらに大いなる国の王として戻ってきた。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9aaf3185-a085-4cd2-82de-341a69f5417f\', \'multiverseId\': 628742}, \'multiverseid\': 628742}, {\'name\': \'幽灵酋长卡拉多\', \'text\': \'你坟墓场中每有一张生物牌，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。\\n仅于你的每个回合中且限一次，你可以从你的坟墓场施放生物咒语。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～半人马／精怪\', \'flavor\': \'「死亡试图夺走我的权力。但如今我已归位，治下疆域却更加广阔。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd1ce541-1baf-4ed7-bb1b-dfc242f538f8\', \'multiverseId\': 629210}, \'multiverseid\': 629210}]', '[{\'name\': \'Karmesinflotten-Kommodore\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn der Karmesinflotten-Kommodore ins Spiel kommt, wirst du zum Monarchen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Oger, Pirat\', \'flavor\': \'„Bitte meide mit deiner Flotte die Gewässer westlich der Dorneninsel. Es wäre eine Schande, solch exquisite maritime Handwerkskunst einzuäschern."\\n—Kommodore Axurik zu Admiralin Yelise\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627909&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee5ec549-d287-44c1-b659-97cd538f0064\', \'multiverseId\': 627909}, \'multiverseid\': 627909}, {\'name\': \'Comodoro de la Flota Carmesí\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nCuando el Comodoro de la Flota Carmesí entre al campo de batalla, te conviertes en el monarca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pirata ogro\', \'flavor\': \'"Haga el favor de mantener su flota lejos de las aguas al oeste de la isla de Scrub. Sería una pena incinerar una obra de artesanía marítima tan exquisita".\\n—El comodoro Axurik, a la almirante Yelise\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'534c20b9-bf07-4d9a-aa4c-a2b3f1b72acd\', \'multiverseId\': 628143}, \'multiverseid\': 628143}, {\'name\': \'真紅艦隊の准将\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n真紅艦隊の准将が戦場に出たとき、あなたが統治者になる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — オーガ・海賊\', \'flavor\': \'「そっちの艦隊を、スクラブ島西海域に近づけないで欲しいんだがね。繊細で芸術的な船を焼いて灰にしちまうのは気が引けるからな。」\\n――アスリク准将からイェリゼ提督へ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3e50b16-6f64-4162-97b6-4d4f42c4bbb3\', \'multiverseId\': 628611}, \'multiverseid\': 628611}, {\'name\': \'绯红舰队准将\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n当绯红舰队准将进战场时，你成为君主。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～食人魔／海盗\', \'flavor\': \'「恳请贵舰速离斯鲁巴岛以西水域。此等精致画舫倘若付之一炬，甚为至憾。」\\n～亚胥雷准将讯告耶莉兹总帅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18d9c484-56ab-41e8-8689-a79ab9b0a688\', \'multiverseId\': 629079}, \'multiverseid\': 629079}]', '[{\'name\': \'Karns Bastion\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Führe Wucherung durch. (Bestimme eine beliebige Anzahl an bleibenden Karten und/oder Spielern und gib ihnen dann von jeder Sorte Marke, die dort bereits liegt, eine weitere Marke.)\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich kann hier nicht alle beschützen, aber so viele wie möglich."\\n—Karn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625669&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f401210e-ed65-4d09-976e-9a54c671a7f3\', \'multiverseId\': 625669}, \'multiverseid\': 625669}, {\'name\': \'Bastion de Karn\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{4}, {T} : Proliférez. (Choisissez n\'importe quel nombre de permanents et/ou de joueurs, puis donnez-leur à chacun un autre marqueur de chaque sorte déjà présente.)", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Je ne pourrai pas protéger tout le monde. Mais je ferai tout mon possible. »\\n—Karn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625926&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c0b40c6-1008-4093-949a-852de19f9f31\', \'multiverseId\': 625926}, \'multiverseid\': 625926}, {\'name\': \'カーンの拠点\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{4}, {T}：増殖を行う。（望む数のパーマネントやプレイヤーを選び、その後、すでにそこにあるカウンター１種類につき、そのカウンターもう１個を与える。）\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「私はここにいる全員を守ることはできないが、守れる者は守る。」\\n――カーン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d296b249-ab48-4810-befe-560f47b2bf5b\', \'multiverseId\': 626183}, \'multiverseid\': 626183}]', "[{'name': 'Kazuul, der Tyrann der Klippen', 'text': 'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, angreift und falls du der verteidigende Spieler bist, erzeuge einen 3/3 roten Oger-Kreaturenspielstein, es sei denn, der Beherrscher der angreifenden Kreatur bezahlt {3}.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Oger, Krieger', 'flavor': 'Eine Warnung an diejenigen, die durch die Klippen klettern wollen, ohne Tribut zu zahlen: Der Weg nach unten ist lang, dauert aber nur kurz.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627935&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9f6901c6-aec0-4b1e-809a-56b89a1fdda8', 'multiverseId': 627935}, 'multiverseid': 627935}, {'name': 'Kazuul, tirano de los precipicios', 'text': 'Siempre que una criatura que controla un oponente ataque, si eres el jugador defensor, crea una ficha de criatura Ogro roja 3/3 a menos que el controlador de esa criatura pague {3}.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero ogro', 'flavor': 'Advertencia a aquellos que escalan los precipicios sin pagar el peaje: es un largo camino hacia abajo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628169&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b919bf44-8efb-4b49-adb0-dfbb7b14f340', 'multiverseId': 628169}, 'multiverseid': 628169}, {'name': '崖の暴君、カズール', 'text': '対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が攻撃するたび、あなたが防御プレイヤーである場合、そのクリーチャーのコントローラーが{3}を支払わないかぎり、あなたは赤の３/３のオーガ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — オーガ・戦士', 'flavor': '貢ぎ物なしに崖を登る者に警告：長い道のりを覚悟しろ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628637&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a10d1aa0-26f3-4b9c-a12b-737295ec5f96', 'multiverseId': 628637}, 'multiverseid': 628637}, {'name': '山崖暴君克卒', 'text': '每当一个由对手操控的生物攻击时，若你是防御牌手，则除非该生物的操控者支付{3}，否则你派出一个3/3红色食人魔衍生生物。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～食人魔／战士', 'flavor': '警告那些不付过路费就爬上山崖者：往下的路很长。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629105&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bbe4ef5b-82ee-4122-bb1b-ad5f2a2bded6', 'multiverseId': 629105}, 'multiverseid': 629105}]", '[{\'name\': \'Keleth, Sonnenmähnen-Vertraute\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Kommandeur, den du kontrollierst, angreift, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf ihn.\\nPartner (Du kannst zwei Kommandeure haben, falls beide Partner haben.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Pferd\', \'flavor\': \'Sie wählt ihre Reiter mit Bedacht und trägt sie in einer Schlacht nach der anderen zum Ruhm.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622842&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3103e796-0ca2-44fe-a23d-cf4429423bf0\', \'multiverseId\': 622842}, \'multiverseid\': 622842}, {\'name\': \'Keleth, familiar crin solar\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un comandante que controlas ataque, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre él.\\nCamarada. (Puedes tener dos comandantes si ambos tienen camarada.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Caballo\', \'flavor\': \'Elige a sus jinetes con gran cuidado y los lleva a la gloria, una batalla tras otra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27549b45-838f-4211-bd90-ada7acf21a4d\', \'multiverseId\': 623043}, \'multiverseid\': 623043}, {\'name\': \'Keleth, familier à la crinière solaire\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un commandant que vous contrôlez attaque, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui.\\nPartenariat (Vous pouvez avoir deux commandants si les deux ont le partenariat.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : cheval\', \'flavor\': \'Elle choisit avec soin ses cavaliers et assure leur gloire, combat après combat.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623244&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61034710-e1bd-4169-802d-b6cd28bcb203\', \'multiverseId\': 623244}, \'multiverseid\': 623244}, {\'name\': \'陽光たてがみの使い魔、ケレス\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている統率者１体が攻撃するたび、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n共闘（両方が共闘を持つなら、あなたは２体の統率者を使用できる。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 馬\', \'flavor\': \'彼女は注意深く乗り手を選び、戦に次ぐ戦の中で勝利をもたらし続けるのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'316ed381-7c13-46df-81cd-335fba92a226\', \'multiverseId\': 623646}, \'multiverseid\': 623646}, {\'name\': \'阳鬃佣兽凯勒丝\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的指挥官攻击时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n拍档（你可将两个具有拍档异能的生物共同用作指挥官。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～马\', \'flavor\': \'她慎重选择自己的骑手，载着他们在一次次战斗中迈向辉煌。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15e7345e-849d-4a88-8bc6-e2c6a369f73b\', \'multiverseId\': 624048}, \'multiverseid\': 624048}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kemba, Kha-Herrscherin\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments erzeugst du für jede an Kemba, Kha-Herrscherin, angelegte Ausrüstung einen 2/2 weißen Katze-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Katze, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Eine Führungsrolle ist sowohl ein Segen als auch eine Last. Jeden Tag bemühe ich mich, meiner Schar eine würdige Anführerin zu sein."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629337&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0c5bc8f-d3a9-44db-889f-2056b5fe8bc7\', \'multiverseId\': 629337}, \'multiverseid\': 629337}, {\'name\': \'Kemba, regente del kha\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, crea una ficha de criatura Felino blanca 2/2 por cada Equipo anexado a Kemba, regente del kha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Clérigo felino\', \'flavor\': \'"El liderazgo es un arma de doble filo. Cada día debo demostrar que estoy preparada para dirigir a mis seguidores".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'991f2e43-11df-401c-ba1d-3344d26d3e94\', \'multiverseId\': 629361}, \'multiverseid\': 629361}, {\'name\': \'Kemba, kha régente\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Chat pour chaque équipement attaché à Kemba, kha régente.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : chat et clerc\', \'flavor\': "« L\'autorité est à la fois une bénédiction et un fardeau. Chaque jour, je m\'efforce d\'être une digne meneuse. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629385&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53a03aad-1f33-4806-add0-e12c2df07a4c\', \'multiverseId\': 629385}, \'multiverseid\': 629385}, {\'name\': \'王の摂政、ケンバ\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、王の摂政、ケンバについている装備品１つにつき１体の、白の２/２の猫・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 猫・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「指導者であることは恩恵でもあり重荷でもあります。私の支持者たちに相応しい世話役であることを証明しようと日々務めています。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bacd787a-9825-41a8-8c55-0023e363799f\', \'multiverseId\': 629433}, \'multiverseid\': 629433}, {\'name\': \'摄政狮王肯芭\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，摄政狮王肯芭上每贴附一个武具，便派出一个2/2白色的猫衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～猫／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「领袖之责既光荣又沉重。我每天都须证明自己值得部下为我效力。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'120acaf4-8aad-411e-9589-ab943575ed3c\', \'multiverseId\': 629481}, \'multiverseid\': 629481}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kemba, Kha-Herrscherin\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments erzeugst du für jede an Kemba, Kha-Herrscherin, angelegte Ausrüstung einen 2/2 weißen Katze-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Katze, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir müssen Taj-Nar wiederaufbauen. Nicht für Raksha, nicht für die Verschwundenen, sondern für die, die noch übrig sind."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622843&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'261cb902-4571-4190-8dce-0863b0b9ce35\', \'multiverseId\': 622843}, \'multiverseid\': 622843}, {\'name\': \'Kemba, regente del kha\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, crea una ficha de criatura Felino blanca 2/2 por cada Equipo anexado a Kemba, regente del kha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Clérigo felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Debemos reconstruir Taj-Nar. Y no por Raksha ni los Desaparecidos, sino por los que siguen entre nosotros".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8415a37f-9e64-42e6-9dae-1e16b67af897\', \'multiverseId\': 623044}, \'multiverseid\': 623044}, {\'name\': \'Kemba, kha régente\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Chat pour chaque équipement attaché à Kemba, kha régente.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : chat et clerc\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous devons reconstruire Taj-Nar. Pas pour Raksha, pas pour les Disparus, mais pour ceux qui sont encore des nôtres. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623245&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d255d24e-7912-411b-ae57-1755827311d0\', \'multiverseId\': 623245}, \'multiverseid\': 623245}, {\'name\': \'王の摂政、ケンバ\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、王の摂政、ケンバについている装備品１つにつき１体の、白の２/２の猫・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 猫・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「タージ＝ナールを再建せねばなりません。ラクシャの為ではなく、消え去りし者の為でもなく、生き残った者達の為に。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c7dc011-ac26-4b1f-bf82-f3cefcb77dfe\', \'multiverseId\': 623647}, \'multiverseid\': 623647}, {\'name\': \'摄政狮王肯芭\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，摄政狮王肯芭上每贴附一个武具，便派出一个2/2白色的猫衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～猫／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「我们必须重建塔吉纳。这不是为了拉夏，也不是为了消失的一代，而是为了活下来的人。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc9d1408-59c4-44f7-96ab-50aa55cde63d\', \'multiverseId\': 624049}, \'multiverseid\': 624049}]', "[{'name': 'Kirtars Zorn', 'text': 'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen. Sie können nicht regeneriert werden.\\nGrenzwert — Falls sieben oder mehr Karten in deinem Friedhof sind, zerstöre stattdessen alle Kreaturen und erzeuge dann zwei 1/1 weiße Geist-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit. Auf diese Weise zerstörte Kreaturen können nicht regeneriert werden.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622844&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b331a422-7549-42c1-8951-2fd93399a2d9', 'multiverseId': 622844}, 'multiverseid': 622844}, {'name': 'Ira de Kírtar', 'text': 'Destruye todas las criaturas. No pueden ser regeneradas.\\nUmbral — Si hay siete o más cartas en tu cementerio, en vez de eso, destruye todas las criaturas, luego crea dos fichas de criatura Espíritu blancas 1/1 con la habilidad de volar. Las criaturas destruidas de esta manera no pueden ser regeneradas.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623045&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3263ed87-ab35-4377-90dd-4caaa87bedf2', 'multiverseId': 623045}, 'multiverseid': 623045}, {'name': 'Colère selon Kirtar', 'text': 'Détruisez toutes les créatures. Elles ne peuvent pas être régénérées.\\nSeuil — Si vous avez au moins sept cartes dans votre cimetière, détruisez à la place toutes les créatures, puis créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Esprit avec le vol. Les créatures détruites de cette manière ne peuvent pas être régénérées.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623246&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ddd1ffa-c46c-440c-9bdc-01ced653b68b', 'multiverseId': 623246}, 'multiverseid': 623246}, {'name': 'カーターの怒り', 'text': 'すべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。それらは再生できない。\\nスレッショルド ― あなたの墓地に７枚以上のカードがあるなら、代わりに、すべてのクリーチャーを破壊し、その後、飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。これにより破壊されたクリーチャーは再生できない。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623648&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cdb85328-6234-4742-a78b-d0be61ba8275', 'multiverseId': 623648}, 'multiverseid': 623648}, {'name': '柯塔之怒', 'text': '消灭所有生物。它们不能重生。\\n门槛～如果你坟墓场中有七张或更多牌，则改为消灭所有生物，然后派出两个1/1白色，具飞行异能的精怪衍生生物。以此法消灭的生物不能重生。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624050&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '732f9fe7-2348-4b85-bf15-4805cce27cf7', 'multiverseId': 624050}, 'multiverseid': 624050}]", "[{'name': 'Klinge des Helden', 'text': 'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +3/+2.\\nImmer wenn eine legendäre Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du die Klinge des Helden an sie anlegen.\\nAusrüsten {4}', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': 'Die besten Schwerter werden mit Drachenfeuer geschmiedet.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628089&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3c1481ee-8619-427d-b581-fd0635f2fe74', 'multiverseId': 628089}, 'multiverseid': 628089}, {'name': 'Acero del héroe', 'text': 'La criatura equipada obtiene +3/+2.\\nSiempre que una criatura legendaria entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes anexarle el Acero del héroe.\\nEquipar {4}.', 'type': 'Artefacto — Equipo', 'flavor': 'Las mejores espadas están forjadas con fuegodragón.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628323&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b0817486-6329-4f9b-9583-72ed37a1c19f', 'multiverseId': 628323}, 'multiverseid': 628323}, {'name': '英雄の刃', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーは＋３/＋２の修整を受ける。\\n伝説のクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは英雄の刃をそれにつけてもよい。\\n装備{4}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': '最高の剣は龍火によって鍛えられる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628791&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ff998e7d-7db8-43c4-9b1f-11b8aed383c1', 'multiverseId': 628791}, 'multiverseid': 628791}, {'name': '英雄宝刃', 'text': '佩带此武具的生物得+3/+2。\\n每当一个传奇生物在你的操控下进战场时，你可以将英雄宝刃贴附于其上。\\n佩带{4}', 'type': '神器 ～武具', 'flavor': '最好的剑刃乃是经龙炎锤炼而成。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629259&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f5e3e15f-d72b-4847-af2b-44a2d1f9eb03', 'multiverseId': 629259}, 'multiverseid': 629259}]", "[{'name': 'Klinge des Vorfahren', 'text': 'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +3/+0, hat Wachsamkeit und verursacht Trampelschaden.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur stirbt, lege die Klinge des Vorfahren an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst.\\nAusrüsten {3}', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628082&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40d3f856-5388-47b4-998d-dc268d2b5d76', 'multiverseId': 628082}, 'multiverseid': 628082}, {'name': 'Acero de los ancestros', 'text': 'La criatura equipada obtiene +3/+0 y tiene las habilidades de vigilancia y arrollar.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada muera, anexa el Acero de los ancestros a la criatura objetivo que controlas.\\nEquipar {3}.', 'type': 'Artefacto — Equipo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628316&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '72cf9b47-929a-4294-89d6-5af204622c4e', 'multiverseId': 628316}, 'multiverseid': 628316}, {'name': '先祖の刃', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーは＋３/＋０の修整を受けるとともに警戒とトランプルを持つ。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが死亡するたび、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。先祖の刃をそれにつける。\\n装備{3}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628784&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c36e6824-0d03-4466-8ad9-0bd53c92ebb8', 'multiverseId': 628784}, 'multiverseid': 628784}, {'name': '先人之剑', 'text': '佩带此武具的生物得+3/+0且具有警戒与践踏异能。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物死去时，将先人之剑贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。\\n佩带{3}', 'type': '神器 ～武具', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629252&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ba3bcac3-95e1-4936-8a52-eea94e3a18e0', 'multiverseId': 629252}, 'multiverseid': 629252}]", '[{\'name\': \'Klingenremasuri\', \'text\': \'Alle Remasuri-Kreaturen erhalten +1/+0.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'„Viele gefährliche Kreaturen nennen diese Region ihr Zuhause. Sie alle meiden die Remasuris."\\n—Hügelkenner\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625533&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ca29163-ae24-4880-a021-f06cd0099c0a\', \'multiverseId\': 625533}, \'multiverseid\': 625533}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde aiguisé\', \'text\': \'Toutes les créatures Slivoïde gagnent +1/+0.\', \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': \'« Bien des créatures dangereuses se sont établies dans cette région. Elles évitent toutes les slivoïdes. »\\n—Guide des contreforts\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625790&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3eb551e0-4177-4b09-92d9-96cbd6a74fe2\', \'multiverseId\': 625790}, \'multiverseid\': 625790}, {\'name\': \'刀刃スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'すべてのスリヴァー・クリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'「この地には多くの危険な生物が住んでいる。そやつらですら、スリヴァーは避けている。」\\n――山麓の案内人\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d5fb107-dbd4-4dd2-bb85-63724e6e9dde\', \'multiverseId\': 626047}, \'multiverseid\': 626047}]', '[{\'name\': \'Klumpenremasuri\', \'text\': \'Alle Remasuris haben „{2}: Regeneriere diese bleibende Karte." (Das nächste Mal, dass diese bleibende Karte zerstört würde, tappe sie stattdessen, entferne sie aus dem Kampf und heile allen auf ihr vermerkten Schaden.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'„Man kann langsam sagen, dass ich zu einer Expertin für unerwartetes Rückkehren werde."\\n—Hanna, Navigatorin der *Wetterlicht*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625523&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64f50352-f0e6-497c-b692-526dad3b0b3b\', \'multiverseId\': 625523}, \'multiverseid\': 625523}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde coagulé\', \'text\': \'Tous les slivoïdes ont « {2} : Régénérez ce permanent. ». (La prochaine fois que ce permanent devrait être détruit, à la place, engagez-le, retirez-le du combat et soignez toutes ses blessures.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "« Moi qui pensais être habituée aux retours inattendus. »\\n—Hanna, navigatrice de l\'*Aquilon*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625780&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c72063e-54e8-4b33-81ec-18bd60453704\', \'multiverseId\': 625780}, \'multiverseid\': 625780}, {\'name\': \'凝塊スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'すべてのスリヴァーは「{2}：このパーマネントを再生する。」を持つ。（このパーマネントが次に破壊されるなら、代わりに、これをタップし、戦闘から取り除き、これが負っているすべてのダメージを回復する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'「人は私が思いがけないお返しには慣れっこになると思っているんでしょうけどね。」\\n――*ウェザーライト*の航行長、ハナ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22a4cd8c-219b-445a-9f04-c7eb2aa8aacc\', \'multiverseId\': 626037}, \'multiverseid\': 626037}]', '[{\'name\': \'Knochenbrecherremasuri\', \'text\': \'Alle Remasuri-Kreaturen erhalten +2/+0.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'Als der Zeitfluss immer instabiler wurde, mühten sich die Kreaturen von Dominaria, sich daran anzupassen. Der unheimliche Druck, dem sie dabei ausgesetzt waren, ließ einige Arten aussterben, aber so plötzlich wie die Aschenregen entwickelten sich auch neue, tödliche Mutationen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625536&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3b78cce-37d4-435a-83a2-a82a8279c0d8\', \'multiverseId\': 625536}, \'multiverseid\': 625536}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde scinde-os\', \'text\': \'Toutes les créatures Slivoïde gagnent +2/+0.\', \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "Les créatures de Dominaria tentèrent de s\'adapter aux courants temporels de plus en plus instables. Beaucoup périrent, écrasées par tant de pressions contraires, mais de nouvelles formes de vie mortelles firent leur apparition aussi soudainement que les averses de cendres.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625793&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef521aa9-e4df-4a52-bf7f-196d2f80aad7\', \'multiverseId\': 625793}, \'multiverseid\': 625793}, {\'name\': \'断骨スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'すべてのスリヴァー・クリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'時間の流れがどんどん不安定になっていく中、ドミナリアのクリーチャーは必死に適応しようとしていた。過度の抑圧は多くの行き詰まりを迎えたが、決定的な新しい形が灰の雨のように突然姿を現すこともあった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0547b1a-c0e1-47d0-b564-58f2fbee7ee7\', \'multiverseId\': 626050}, \'multiverseid\': 626050}]', '[{\'name\': \'Knochensensenremasuri\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Doppelschlag.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'„Er sieht doch recht zahm aus. Vielleicht können wir ihm beibringen, das Getreide zu mähen — das wäre die leichteste Erntezeit unseres Lebens!"\\n—Georgina, Bäuerin, jüngst verstorben\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625477&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32ec3458-6ab9-479d-9e71-049c475970b0\', \'multiverseId\': 625477}, \'multiverseid\': 625477}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde ossefaux\', \'text\': \'Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont la double initiative.\', \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "« Il a l\'air plutôt docile. On pourrait peut-être le dresser à moissonner le grain. Ce serait la récolte la plus simple de notre vie ! »\\n—Georgina, fermière, aujourd\'hui décédée", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625734&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8dfb6926-f544-47f1-a71c-f82ec461bac3\', \'multiverseId\': 625734}, \'multiverseid\': 625734}, {\'name\': \'骨鎌スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのスリヴァー・クリーチャーは二段攻撃を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'「どうやら大人しそうだな。もしかしたら麦穂を刈るように仕込めるかもしれん。そしたら一生、収穫期は楽できるぞ！」\\n――農夫ジョージーナ、故人\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f945c3a-8060-4cc3-91c6-3e34710f9b9b\', \'multiverseId\': 625991}, \'multiverseid\': 625991}]', '[{\'name\': \'Knochenwüste\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere eine Wüste: Schicke alle Friedhöfe ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wüste\', \'flavor\': \'Erst wenn nur noch Knochen übrig sind, endet der Fluch des Umherirrens und der ewige Schlaf beginnt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625689&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2193f80d-d6f4-4140-afb2-e2a523da2a32\', \'multiverseId\': 625689}, \'multiverseid\': 625689}, {\'name\': \'Terrains des charognards\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez un désert : Exilez tous les cimetières.\', \'type\': \'Terrain : désert\', \'flavor\': "Quand le dernier lambeau de chair se détache, la Malédiction d\'errance est rompue. Le mort peut enfin reposer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625946&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ccce931-c5e0-4b67-9daf-a88be8e78105\', \'multiverseId\': 625946}, \'multiverseid\': 625946}, {\'name\': \'屍肉あさりの地\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, 砂漠１つを生け贄に捧げる：すべての墓地を追放する。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 砂漠\', \'flavor\': \'肉の最後の一片がなくなると放浪の呪いが解け、死者は安眠を許される。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7bc1d8b-8403-4201-a332-72b26b4035d1\', \'multiverseId\': 626203}, \'multiverseid\': 626203}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kommodore Guff\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments legst du eine Loyalitätsmarke auf einen anderen Planeswalker deiner Wahl, den du kontrollierst.\\n+1: Erzeuge einen 1/1 roten Zauberer-Kreaturenspielstein mit „{T}: Erzeuge {R}. Gib dieses Mana nur aus, um einen Planeswalkerzauber zu wirken."\\n−3: Du ziehst X Karten und Kommodore Guff fügt jedem Gegner X Schadenspunkte zu, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Planeswalkern ist, die du kontrollierst.\\nKommodore Guff kann dein Kommandeur sein.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Guff\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625051&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb4654d9-c2c6-436d-9f80-73e6f91e123a\', \'multiverseId\': 625051}, \'multiverseid\': 625051}, {\'name\': \'Commodore Calembredaine\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre étape de fin, mettez un marqueur « loyauté » sur un autre planeswalker ciblé que vous contrôlez.\\n+1: Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 rouge Sorcier avec « {T} : Ajoutez {R}. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer un sort de planeswalker. »\\n-3: Vous piochez X cartes et le Commodore Calembredaine inflige X blessures à chaque adversaire, X étant le nombre de planeswalkers que vous contrôlez.\\nLe Commodore Calembredaine peut être votre commandant.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Calembredaine\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625055&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87f2c20d-7587-4310-828e-1f40fe52c2c5\', \'multiverseId\': 625055}, \'multiverseid\': 625055}, {\'name\': \'ガフ提督\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。それの上に忠誠カウンター１個を置く。\\n+1：「{T}：{R}を加える。このマナはプレインズウォーカー・呪文を唱えるためにしか支払えない。」を持つ赤の１/１のウィザード・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n-3：あなたはカードＸ枚を引き、ガフ提督は各対戦相手にそれぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーの数に等しい。\\nガフ提督は統率者として使用できる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ガフ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43bbf4e9-dd4c-4c9a-9810-26812ee8c949\', \'multiverseId\': 625059}, \'multiverseid\': 625059}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kommodore Guff\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments legst du eine Loyalitätsmarke auf einen anderen Planeswalker deiner Wahl, den du kontrollierst.\\n+1: Erzeuge einen 1/1 roten Zauberer-Kreaturenspielstein mit „{T}: Erzeuge {R}. Gib dieses Mana nur aus, um einen Planeswalkerzauber zu wirken."\\n−3: Du ziehst X Karten und Kommodore Guff fügt jedem Gegner X Schadenspunkte zu, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Planeswalkern ist, die du kontrollierst.\\nKommodore Guff kann dein Kommandeur sein.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Guff\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626239&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'615b4e77-d734-4ed6-a634-91a04ac00ebc\', \'multiverseId\': 626239}, \'multiverseid\': 626239}, {\'name\': \'Commodore Calembredaine\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre étape de fin, mettez un marqueur « loyauté » sur un autre planeswalker ciblé que vous contrôlez.\\n+1: Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 rouge Sorcier avec « {T} : Ajoutez {R}. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer un sort de planeswalker. »\\n-3: Vous piochez X cartes et le Commodore Calembredaine inflige X blessures à chaque adversaire, X étant le nombre de planeswalkers que vous contrôlez.\\nLe Commodore Calembredaine peut être votre commandant.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Calembredaine\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626243&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd089d9b-b5ea-4fc3-9f16-6b34129fe0d7\', \'multiverseId\': 626243}, \'multiverseid\': 626243}, {\'name\': \'ガフ提督\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。それの上に忠誠カウンター１個を置く。\\n+1：「{T}：{R}を加える。このマナはプレインズウォーカー・呪文を唱えるためにしか支払えない。」を持つ赤の１/１のウィザード・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n-3：あなたはカードＸ枚を引き、ガフ提督は各対戦相手にそれぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーの数に等しい。\\nガフ提督は統率者として使用できる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ガフ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc1ed9b3-9540-4ab4-abc5-d3a9c259c1ed\', \'multiverseId\': 626247}, \'multiverseid\': 626247}]', '[{\'name\': \'Komponistin des Frühlings\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn eine Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Länderkarte aus deiner Hand getappt ins Spiel bringen. Falls du du sechs oder mehr Verzauberungen kontrollierst, kannst du stattdessen eine Kreaturen- oder Länderkarte aus deiner Hand getappt ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Satyr, Barde\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624930&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89fb30e2-bd82-44e0-b394-dc6aa72bbc7a\', \'multiverseId\': 624930}, \'multiverseid\': 624930}, {\'name\': \'Compositrice du printemps\', \'text\': "Constellation — À chaque fois qu\'un enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille, engagée, une carte de terrain de votre main. Si vous contrôlez au moins six enchantements, à la place vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille, engagée, une carte de créature ou de terrain de votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : satyre et barde\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624965&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26d36418-3d18-45c3-9939-8b34ce0375aa\', \'multiverseId\': 624965}, \'multiverseid\': 624965}, {\'name\': \'春の作曲家\', \'text\': \'星座 — エンチャント１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたの手札にある土地・カード１枚をタップ状態で戦場に出してもよい。あなたが６つ以上のエンチャントをコントロールしているなら、代わりに、あなたの手札にありクリーチャーや土地であるカード１枚をタップ状態で戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サテュロス・バード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3a0b032-6d69-46ec-9270-66a7b066923b\', \'multiverseId\': 625000}, \'multiverseid\': 625000}, {\'name\': \'迎春作曲家\', \'text\': \'星彩～每当一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，你可以将一张地牌从你手上横置放进战场。若你操控六个或更多结界，则改为你可以将一张生物或地牌从你手上横置放进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～羊蹄人／诗人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53402113-0973-4f82-aa27-a4825719b4db\', \'multiverseId\': 625035}, \'multiverseid\': 625035}]', '[{\'name\': \'Komponistin des Frühlings\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn eine Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Länderkarte aus deiner Hand getappt ins Spiel bringen. Falls du du sechs oder mehr Verzauberungen kontrollierst, kannst du stattdessen eine Kreaturen- oder Länderkarte aus deiner Hand getappt ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Satyr, Barde\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625136&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'171233d4-cc17-487f-ad9c-340ad9b8c312\', \'multiverseId\': 625136}, \'multiverseid\': 625136}, {\'name\': \'Compositrice du printemps\', \'text\': "Constellation — À chaque fois qu\'un enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille, engagée, une carte de terrain de votre main. Si vous contrôlez au moins six enchantements, à la place vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille, engagée, une carte de créature ou de terrain de votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : satyre et barde\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625168&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90bb4cf3-6798-4ad8-8bd3-08ab210e42ae\', \'multiverseId\': 625168}, \'multiverseid\': 625168}, {\'name\': \'春の作曲家\', \'text\': \'星座 — エンチャント１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたの手札にある土地・カード１枚をタップ状態で戦場に出してもよい。あなたが６つ以上のエンチャントをコントロールしているなら、代わりに、あなたの手札にありクリーチャーや土地であるカード１枚をタップ状態で戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サテュロス・バード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af40082c-d94c-434d-8cdf-30677155509a\', \'multiverseId\': 625200}, \'multiverseid\': 625200}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kozilek, Verzerrung der Realität\', \'text\': \'Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst und falls du weniger als sieben Karten auf deiner Hand hast, ziehe so viele Karten, wie die Differenz beträgt.\\nBedrohlich\\nWirf eine Karte mit Manabetrag X ab: Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag X.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Eine Leere, so rätselhaft wie die Realität selbst.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622811&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'880ec18d-e026-4e18-8719-135a9cac0a80\', \'multiverseId\': 622811}, \'multiverseid\': 622811}, {\'name\': \'Kozilek, la Gran Distorsión\', \'text\': \'Cuando lances este hechizo, si tienes menos de siete cartas en la mano, roba una cantidad de cartas igual a la diferencia.\\nAmenaza.\\nDescartar una carta con valor de maná de X: Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo con valor de maná de X.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Un vacío tan críptico como la propia realidad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00daa18d-64e0-4aee-9426-0dcdb4668942\', \'multiverseId\': 623012}, \'multiverseid\': 623012}, {\'name\': \'Kozilek, la Grande Distorsion\', \'text\': "Quand vous lancez ce sort, si vous avez moins de sept cartes en main, piochez un nombre de cartes égal à la différence.\\nMenace\\nDéfaussez-vous d\'une carte avec une valeur de mana de X : Contrecarrez un sort ciblé avec une valeur de mana de X.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Un vide aussi énigmatique que la réalité elle-même.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623213&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67d4d475-5b65-495a-be47-284fa7731117\', \'multiverseId\': 623213}, \'multiverseid\': 623213}, {\'name\': \'大いなる歪み、コジレック\', \'text\': \'あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたの手札にあるカードが７枚未満の場合、その差に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\\n威迫\\nマナ総量がＸであるカード１枚を捨てる：マナ総量がＸである呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': \'虚空としか言い様がないその実体。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b418a241-37dc-46e3-a606-d7038fc9df8a\', \'multiverseId\': 623615}, \'multiverseid\': 623615}, {\'name\': \'无际曲相寇基雷\', \'text\': \'当你施放此咒语时，若你的手牌数量少于七张，则抓等同于该差距数量的牌。\\n威慑\\n弃一张法术力值为X的牌：反击目标法术力值为X的咒语。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～奥札奇\', \'flavor\': \'如现实般神秘的虚无。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c6edbc4-204a-4f54-ac9a-7bdc36aba0f2\', \'multiverseId\': 624017}, \'multiverseid\': 624017}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kozilek, Verzerrung der Realität\', \'text\': \'Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst und falls du weniger als sieben Karten auf deiner Hand hast, ziehe so viele Karten, wie die Differenz beträgt.\\nBedrohlich\\nWirf eine Karte mit Manabetrag X ab: Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag X.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Eine Leere, so rätselhaft wie die Realität selbst.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626477&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c489393-adfa-46b6-9ade-60cc431f1f60\', \'multiverseId\': 626477}, \'multiverseid\': 626477}, {\'name\': \'Kozilek, la Grande Distorsion\', \'text\': "Quand vous lancez ce sort, si vous avez moins de sept cartes en main, piochez un nombre de cartes égal à la différence.\\nMenace\\nDéfaussez-vous d\'une carte avec une valeur de mana de X : Contrecarrez un sort ciblé avec une valeur de mana de X.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Un vide aussi énigmatique que la réalité elle-même.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626817&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8e0aa5a-7a58-430f-b2d6-dac2b429b2d7\', \'multiverseId\': 626817}, \'multiverseid\': 626817}, {\'name\': \'大いなる歪み、コジレック\', \'text\': \'あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたの手札にあるカードが７枚未満の場合、その差に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\\n威迫\\nマナ総量がＸであるカード１枚を捨てる：マナ総量がＸである呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': \'虚空としか言い様がないその実体。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d5e4572-b5a3-45f3-ae53-8f476861cef1\', \'multiverseId\': 627157}, \'multiverseid\': 627157}, {\'name\': \'无际曲相寇基雷\', \'text\': \'当你施放此咒语时，若你的手牌数量少于七张，则抓等同于该差距数量的牌。\\n威慑\\n弃一张法术力值为X的牌：反击目标法术力值为X的咒语。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～奥札奇\', \'flavor\': \'如现实般神秘的虚无。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aba1648d-ddfc-4de1-85d2-ba2f5d933d77\', \'multiverseId\': 627497}, \'multiverseid\': 627497}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kozilek, Verzerrung der Realität\', \'text\': \'Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst und falls du weniger als sieben Karten auf deiner Hand hast, ziehe so viele Karten, wie die Differenz beträgt.\\nBedrohlich\\nWirf eine Karte mit Manabetrag X ab: Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag X.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626259&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe1ae129-e380-49a0-b9c6-8ddd95c3044f\', \'multiverseId\': 626259}, \'multiverseid\': 626259}, {\'name\': \'Kozilek, la Grande Distorsion\', \'text\': "Quand vous lancez ce sort, si vous avez moins de sept cartes en main, piochez un nombre de cartes égal à la différence.\\nMenace\\nDéfaussez-vous d\'une carte avec une valeur de mana de X : Contrecarrez un sort ciblé avec une valeur de mana de X.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626269&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27c4a37c-04ce-48ae-80d0-76a25aead743\', \'multiverseId\': 626269}, \'multiverseid\': 626269}, {\'name\': \'f大いなる歪み、コジレック\', \'text\': \'あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたの手札にあるカードが７枚未満の場合、その差に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\\n威迫\\nマナ総量がＸであるカード１枚を捨てる：マナ総量がＸである呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5fea7f4-2a20-4751-a4fd-33072cf7fc7d\', \'multiverseId\': 626279}, \'multiverseid\': 626279}, {\'name\': \'无际曲相寇基雷\', \'text\': \'当你施放此咒语时，若你的手牌数量少于七张，则抓等同于该差距数量的牌。\\n威慑\\n弃一张法术力值为X的牌：反击目标法术力值为X的咒语。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～奥札奇\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c04d55f8-0fbd-48a9-b33f-d90f0bd3f3f5\', \'multiverseId\': 626289}, \'multiverseid\': 626289}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kozilek, Verzerrung der Realität\', \'text\': \'Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst und falls du weniger als sieben Karten auf deiner Hand hast, ziehe so viele Karten, wie die Differenz beträgt.\\nBedrohlich\\nWirf eine Karte mit Manabetrag X ab: Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag X.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629334&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aab0ba26-46ad-4ec1-806e-6456a4622cc3\', \'multiverseId\': 629334}, \'multiverseid\': 629334}, {\'name\': \'Kozilek, la Gran Distorsión\', \'text\': \'Cuando lances este hechizo, si tienes menos de siete cartas en la mano, roba una cantidad de cartas igual a la diferencia.\\nAmenaza.\\nDescartar una carta con valor de maná de X: Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo con valor de maná de X.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db22a05e-9ba2-4297-9704-2d572721b967\', \'multiverseId\': 629358}, \'multiverseid\': 629358}, {\'name\': \'Kozilek, la Grande Distorsion\', \'text\': "Quand vous lancez ce sort, si vous avez moins de sept cartes en main, piochez un nombre de cartes égal à la différence.\\nMenace\\nDéfaussez-vous d\'une carte avec une valeur de mana de X : Contrecarrez un sort ciblé avec une valeur de mana de X.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629382&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43e7d1ef-14c7-4ac1-b45a-f2f57bbf7b46\', \'multiverseId\': 629382}, \'multiverseid\': 629382}, {\'name\': \'大いなる歪み、コジレック\', \'text\': \'あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたの手札にあるカードが７枚未満の場合、その差に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\\n威迫\\nマナ総量がＸであるカード１枚を捨てる：マナ総量がＸである呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd882cd9-b694-4aea-95c8-79e6522dc167\', \'multiverseId\': 629430}, \'multiverseid\': 629430}, {\'name\': \'无际曲相寇基雷\', \'text\': \'当你施放此咒语时，若你的手牌数量少于七张，则抓等同于该差距数量的牌。\\n威慑\\n弃一张法术力值为X的牌：反击目标法术力值为X的咒语。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～奥札奇\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7ccda19-45ad-4f9c-b822-325557851a09\', \'multiverseId\': 629478}, \'multiverseid\': 629478}]', "[{'name': 'Kozileks Handwerker', 'text': 'Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurückbringen.\\nVernichter 2 (Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift, opfert der verteidigende Spieler zwei bleibende Karten.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Eldrazi', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625463&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a2f7e15-3e1a-4ee0-9298-5a01ffece93f', 'multiverseId': 625463}, 'multiverseid': 625463}, {'name': 'Artisan de Kozilek', 'text': 'Quand vous lancez ce sort, vous pouvez renvoyer sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière.\\nAnnihilateur 2 (À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, le joueur défenseur sacrifie deux permanents.)', 'type': 'Créature : eldrazi', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625720&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8213deb6-7970-4b39-b2e4-0ba1ad78c2fd', 'multiverseId': 625720}, 'multiverseid': 625720}, {'name': 'コジレックの職工', 'text': 'あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻してもよい。\\n滅殺２（このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーはパーマネント２つを生け贄に捧げる。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルドラージ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625977&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '22686341-3117-4b2f-b19b-6872f9fd451a', 'multiverseId': 625977}, 'multiverseid': 625977}]", '[{\'name\': \'Kozileks Jäger\', \'text\': \'Wenn Kozileks Jäger ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei 0/1 farblose Eldrazi-Ausgeburt-Kreaturenspielsteine. Sie haben „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erzeuge {C}."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': \'Es ist nicht einfach, jemanden auszutricksen, der nicht spricht, nicht plant und erst recht nicht strategisch denkt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627999&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4d4f6cb-ad19-4a79-bba1-d3b6cb96d545\', \'multiverseId\': 627999}, \'multiverseid\': 627999}, {\'name\': \'Depredador de Kozilek\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Depredador de Kozilek entre al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de criatura Engendro Eldrazi incoloras 0/1. Tienen "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {C}".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Es difícil vencer a alguien que no habla, planea o siquiera piensa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6059aee5-f75b-440b-908c-65e13d1a64a4\', \'multiverseId\': 628233}, \'multiverseid\': 628233}, {\'name\': \'コジレックの捕食者\', \'text\': \'コジレックの捕食者が戦場に出たとき、無色の０/１のエルドラージ・落とし子・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。それらは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：{C}を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': \'喋らない者、戦略の無い者、考えすらしないものを出し抜くのは骨だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'797bb002-004e-4785-9b1f-124ec0ca8602\', \'multiverseId\': 628701}, \'multiverseid\': 628701}, {\'name\': \'寇基雷猎者\', \'text\': \'当寇基雷猎者进战场时，派出两个0/1无色奥札奇／后裔衍生生物。它们具有「牺牲此生物：加{C}。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': \'很难去智取不说话、不算计，甚至不思考的东西。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73a75814-bc73-40df-b9f5-7bb449fcad95\', \'multiverseId\': 629169}, \'multiverseid\': 629169}]', '[{\'name\': \'Krabbelnde Zikade\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nDu kannst farblose Zaubersprüche wirken, als ob sie Aufblitzen hätten.\\nImmer wenn du einen farblosen Zauberspruch wirkst, verursacht die Krabbelnde Zikade bis zum Ende des Zuges Trampelschaden und erhält +X/+X, wobei X gleich dem Manabetrag jenes Zauberspruchs ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624911&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'253f4a73-6768-4426-b4d9-51bdc57956fb\', \'multiverseId\': 624911}, \'multiverseid\': 624911}, {\'name\': \'Cigale fuyarde\', \'text\': "Flash\\nVous pouvez lancer les sorts incolores comme s\'ils avaient le flash.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort incolore, jusqu\'à la fin du tour, la Cigale fuyarde acquiert le piétinement et gagne +X/+X, X étant la valeur de mana de ce sort.", \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624946&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7bf8d94-2767-4e18-b58f-7403843cf77a\', \'multiverseId\': 624946}, \'multiverseid\': 624946}, {\'name\': \'跳ね回るシケイダ\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nあなたは無色の呪文を、それが瞬速を持つかのように唱えてもよい。\\nあなたが無色の呪文１つを唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、跳ね回るシケイダは＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受けトランプルを得る。Ｘはその呪文のマナ総量に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72a15f79-6e24-435e-90a9-23a50f306c43\', \'multiverseId\': 624981}, \'multiverseid\': 624981}, {\'name\': \'掠行鸣蝉\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n你可以将无色咒语视同具有闪现异能地来施放。\\n每当你施放无色咒语时，直到回合结束，掠行鸣蝉获得践踏异能且得+X/+X，X为该咒语的法术力值。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～昆虫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'413b37dd-0878-495e-a947-70fe4ba404a2\', \'multiverseId\': 625016}, \'multiverseid\': 625016}]', '[{\'name\': \'Krabbelnde Zikade\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nDu kannst farblose Zaubersprüche wirken, als ob sie Aufblitzen hätten.\\nImmer wenn du einen farblosen Zauberspruch wirkst, verursacht die Krabbelnde Zikade bis zum Ende des Zuges Trampelschaden und erhält +X/+X, wobei X gleich dem Manabetrag jenes Zauberspruchs ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625114&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01416d61-b2b7-41c0-af82-2b4278c82121\', \'multiverseId\': 625114}, \'multiverseid\': 625114}, {\'name\': \'Cigale fuyarde\', \'text\': "Flash\\nVous pouvez lancer les sorts incolores comme s\'ils avaient le flash.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort incolore, jusqu\'à la fin du tour, la Cigale fuyarde acquiert le piétinement et gagne +X/+X, X étant la valeur de mana de ce sort.", \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625146&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca74a048-872c-4805-8709-c11e8a7c10d7\', \'multiverseId\': 625146}, \'multiverseid\': 625146}, {\'name\': \'跳ね回るシケイダ\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nあなたは無色の呪文を、それが瞬速を持つかのように唱えてもよい。\\nあなたが無色の呪文１つを唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、跳ね回るシケイダは＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受けトランプルを得る。Ｘはその呪文のマナ総量に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d785fde7-c351-4c34-ba97-1a486a9b00aa\', \'multiverseId\': 625178}, \'multiverseid\': 625178}]', '[{\'name\': \'Krachende Zugbrücke\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger\\n{T}: Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Mauer\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Nördliche Signalfeuer wurde entzündet, und noch ehe die Zugbrücke ganz heruntergelassen war, stürmten die Ritter hinaus."\\n—*Legende der Güldenen Ritter*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625606&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa8dcb7e-8531-4ee2-99f7-3c4193373dc2\', \'multiverseId\': 625606}, \'multiverseid\': 625606}, {\'name\': "Pont-levis d\'assaut", \'text\': "Défenseur\\n{T} : Les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : mur\', \'flavor\': "« Le Flambeau du Nord s\'illumina, et avant même que le pont-levis n\'ait terminé sa descente, les chevaliers chargèrent. »\\n—*Légende des Chevaliers dorés*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625863&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97dcbb2f-a978-40f2-9e06-1c9c0a5233cb\', \'multiverseId\': 625863}, \'multiverseid\': 625863}, {\'name\': \'跳ね橋\', \'text\': \'防衛\\n{T}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 壁\', \'flavor\': \'「北の標は炎上した。跳ね橋がまだ下がりきらないうちに騎士たちは外へと駆け出した。」\\n――*金色騎士の伝説*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44a33bde-9809-433b-98ba-269ef9ba3baf\', \'multiverseId\': 626120}, \'multiverseid\': 626120}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kraj-Experiment\', \'text\': \'Das Kraj-Experiment hat alle aktivierten Fähigkeiten jeder anderen Kreatur, auf der eine +1/+1-Marke liegt.\\n{T}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Schlammwesen, Mutant\', \'flavor\': \'„Natürlich wird sein Wachstum außer Kontrolle geraten — wir haben es so gestaltet, dass es sich seine eigene Entwicklung aussucht."\\n—Momir Vig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626603&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22fa4b74-20ca-4c0b-9b7c-5aafddd7cb0c\', \'multiverseId\': 626603}, \'multiverseid\': 626603}, {\'name\': \'Kraj expérimental\', \'text\': \'Le Kraj expérimental a toutes les capacités activées de chaque autre créature qui a un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.\\n{T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : limon et mutant\', \'flavor\': "« Bien sûr qu\'il va échapper à tout contrôle. Il a été conçu pour choisir sa propre évolution. »\\n—Momir Vig", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626943&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20ddef4e-0b78-4ae3-9ec8-dafafde5e585\', \'multiverseId\': 626943}, \'multiverseid\': 626943}, {\'name\': \'クラージ実験体\', \'text\': \'クラージ実験体は、＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれていてこれでない各クリーチャーのすべての起動型能力を持つ。\\n{T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ウーズ・ミュータント\', \'flavor\': \'「当然、手に負えないところまで成長するだろう。これは自身の進化を自身で選ぶよう設計されているのだ。」\\n――モミール・ヴィグ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da5f356f-4b9e-443e-ab04-cb4e92a50eed\', \'multiverseId\': 627283}, \'multiverseid\': 627283}, {\'name\': \'克戟实验体\', \'text\': \'克戟实验体具有每个其上有+1/+1指示物之其他生物的所有起动式异能。\\n{T}：在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～流浆／突变体\', \'flavor\': \'「它的成长当然会超出我们控制～它在设计上本就是能自行选择进化路线者。」\\n～莫秘维\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8236a707-11fb-43d6-a5a6-0e79622993c7\', \'multiverseId\': 627623}, \'multiverseid\': 627623}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kraj-Experiment\', \'text\': \'Das Kraj-Experiment hat alle aktivierten Fähigkeiten jeder anderen Kreatur, auf der eine +1/+1-Marke liegt.\\n{T}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Schlammwesen, Mutant\', \'flavor\': \'„Natürlich wird sein Wachstum außer Kontrolle geraten — wir haben es so gestaltet, dass es sich seine eigene Entwicklung aussucht."\\n—Momir Vig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628035&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17c46168-420b-470c-acff-30a79371c856\', \'multiverseId\': 628035}, \'multiverseid\': 628035}, {\'name\': \'Experimento Kraj\', \'text\': \'El Experimento Kraj tiene todas las habilidades activadas de cada una de las otras criaturas con contadores +1/+1 sobre ellas.\\n{T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Mutante cieno\', \'flavor\': \'"Por supuesto que crecerá sin control; fue diseñado para elegir su propia evolución".\\n—Mómir Vig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da08137a-1030-4ce5-9159-04ed070c2adb\', \'multiverseId\': 628269}, \'multiverseid\': 628269}, {\'name\': \'クラージ実験体\', \'text\': \'クラージ実験体は、＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれていてこれでない各クリーチャーのすべての起動型能力を持つ。\\n{T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ウーズ・ミュータント\', \'flavor\': \'「当然、手に負えないところまで成長するだろう。これは自身の進化を自身で選ぶよう設計されているのだ。」\\n――モミール・ヴィグ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61f02f47-3ffa-40f0-8083-7d5da85ccd97\', \'multiverseId\': 628737}, \'multiverseid\': 628737}, {\'name\': \'克戟实验体\', \'text\': \'克戟实验体具有每个其上有+1/+1指示物之其他生物的所有起动式异能。\\n{T}：在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～流浆／突变体\', \'flavor\': \'「它的成长当然会超出我们控制～它在设计上本就是能自行选择进化路线者。」\\n～莫秘维\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03cae328-b653-4909-9f66-d9e0b1715a0e\', \'multiverseId\': 629205}, \'multiverseid\': 629205}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kraterhuf-Behemoth\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nWenn der Kraterhuf-Behemoth ins Spiel kommt, verursachen Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, bis zum Ende des Zuges Trampelschaden und erhalten +X/+X, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturen ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Seine Fußstapfen von heute sind die Seen von morgen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626581&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'550bf72d-443d-4728-a9fe-e88759043eb9\', \'multiverseId\': 626581}, \'multiverseid\': 626581}, {\'name\': \'Béhémoth caveur de cratères\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nQuand le Béhémoth caveur de cratères arrive sur le champ de bataille, les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent le piétinement et gagnent +X/+X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "Ses empreintes d\'aujourd\'hui sont les lacs de demain.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626921&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7755cce-20d4-4263-a959-ea90b41bce14\', \'multiverseId\': 626921}, \'multiverseid\': 626921}, {\'name\': \'孔蹄のビヒモス\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n孔蹄のビヒモスが戦場に出たとき、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーはトランプルを得、＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'あれが今日つけた足跡が、明日の湖。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b46fb943-cfea-40ba-8748-0391c845e64a\', \'multiverseId\': 627261}, \'multiverseid\': 627261}, {\'name\': \'陨蹄贝西摩斯\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n当陨蹄贝西摩斯进战场时，直到回合结束，由你操控的生物获得践踏异能且得+X/+X，X为由你操控的生物数量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'它今日的足迹是明日的湖泊。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a185add0-e522-4fbf-8c39-11115bc30973\', \'multiverseId\': 627601}, \'multiverseid\': 627601}]', "[{'name': 'Kraterhuf-Behemoth', 'text': 'Eile\\nWenn der Kraterhuf-Behemoth ins Spiel kommt, verursachen Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, bis zum Ende des Zuges Trampelschaden und erhalten +X/+X, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturen ist, die du kontrollierst.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Bestie', 'flavor': 'Seine Fußstapfen von heute sind die Seen von morgen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627978&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0e4cd140-b084-4989-b515-036ea9b13d90', 'multiverseId': 627978}, 'multiverseid': 627978}, {'name': 'Behemot cascocráter', 'text': 'Prisa.\\nCuando el Behemot cascocráter entre al campo de batalla, las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de arrollar y obtienen +X/+X hasta el final del turno, donde X es la cantidad de criaturas que controlas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Bestia', 'flavor': 'Los pasos que da hoy son los lagos del mañana.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628212&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0584a04a-384b-447c-9d7e-2ac2999fb856', 'multiverseId': 628212}, 'multiverseid': 628212}, {'name': '孔蹄のビヒモス', 'text': '速攻\\n孔蹄のビヒモスが戦場に出たとき、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーはトランプルを得、＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの数に等しい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ビースト', 'flavor': 'あれが今日つけた足跡が、明日の湖。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628680&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '56621f6e-0715-451f-9c7f-ec0775781bdb', 'multiverseId': 628680}, 'multiverseid': 628680}, {'name': '陨蹄贝西摩斯', 'text': '敏捷\\n当陨蹄贝西摩斯进战场时，直到回合结束，由你操控的生物获得践踏异能且得+X/+X，X为由你操控的生物数量。', 'type': '生物 ～野兽', 'flavor': '它今日的足迹是明日的湖泊。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629148&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2edc73c2-9684-4641-871a-163129f3a74b', 'multiverseId': 629148}, 'multiverseid': 629148}]", '[{\'name\': \'Krenko der Boss\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge X 1/1 rote Goblin-Kreaturenspielsteine, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Goblins ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Er verfügt über ein perverses Charisma, das von Gier geprägt ist. Äußerst gefährlich. Empfehle Zivilmaßnahmen."\\n—Agmand Sarv, Azorius-Husar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626568&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e2a9260-f90c-4258-a416-6f8274afc926\', \'multiverseId\': 626568}, \'multiverseid\': 626568}, {\'name\': \'Krenko le caïd\', \'text\': \'{T} : Créez X jetons de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin, X étant le nombre de gobelins que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Il projette un charisme pervers brûlant d\'avarice. Très dangereux. Je recommande des sanctions civiles. »\\n—Agmand Sarv, hussard d\'Azorius", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626908&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'132b6b9a-1621-4b70-900c-13fb76dafcb5\', \'multiverseId\': 626908}, \'multiverseid\': 626908}, {\'name\': \'群衆の親分、クレンコ\', \'text\': \'{T}：赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。Ｘは、あなたがコントロールしているゴブリンの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「彼は強欲のままにねじくれた魅力を放っています。本当に危険です。民事制裁すべきです。」\\n――アゾリウスの騎兵、アグマンド・サーヴ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdc0c6c8-2bb0-48b4-a80b-af806cf7d2c7\', \'multiverseId\': 627248}, \'multiverseid\': 627248}, {\'name\': \'暴民头目克仑可\', \'text\': \'{T}：派出X个1/1红色鬼怪衍生生物，X为由你操控的鬼怪数量。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～鬼怪／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「他展现出贪欲加持的堕落魅力。非常危险。建议采民事制裁。」\\n～俄佐立轻骑兵艾门塞夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b6ab4ba-4d9a-402b-92ac-9359cbf1da35\', \'multiverseId\': 627588}, \'multiverseid\': 627588}]', '[{\'name\': \'Krenko der Boss\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge X 1/1 rote Goblin-Kreaturenspielsteine, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Goblins ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Er verfügt über ein perverses Charisma, das von Gier geprägt ist. Äußerst gefährlich. Empfehle Zivilmaßnahmen."\\n—Agmand Sarv, Azorius-Husar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627936&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5057bf16-6c29-40b7-b470-5e8a2038bc30\', \'multiverseId\': 627936}, \'multiverseid\': 627936}, {\'name\': \'Krenko, jefe de turba\', \'text\': \'{T}: Crea X fichas de criatura Trasgo rojas 1/1, donde X es la cantidad de Trasgos que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'"Muestra un carisma perverso alimentado por la avaricia. Muy peligroso. Se recomiendan sanciones civiles".\\n—Agmand Sarv, húsar azorio\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7283e670-1a5c-473a-af78-3d732ec341db\', \'multiverseId\': 628170}, \'multiverseid\': 628170}, {\'name\': \'群衆の親分、クレンコ\', \'text\': \'{T}：赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。Ｘは、あなたがコントロールしているゴブリンの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「彼は強欲のままにねじくれた魅力を放っています。本当に危険です。民事制裁すべきです。」\\n――アゾリウスの騎兵、アグマンド・サーヴ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9aa0244-5d38-4a51-921d-bf4fbd3f6078\', \'multiverseId\': 628638}, \'multiverseid\': 628638}, {\'name\': \'暴民头目克仑可\', \'text\': \'{T}：派出X个1/1红色鬼怪衍生生物，X为由你操控的鬼怪数量。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～鬼怪／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「他展现出贪欲加持的堕落魅力。非常危险。建议采民事制裁。」\\n～俄佐立轻骑兵艾门塞夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c55a8025-f7bb-4a8c-90c9-c76a39bc8ef5\', \'multiverseId\': 629106}, \'multiverseid\': 629106}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kriegskabinett\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{3}, {T}, bezahle Lebenspunkte in Höhe der Anzahl an Farben in der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Eine Figur wird auf einer Karte bewegt, und der Lauf des Krieges ändert sich.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625716&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee1e3211-aaf3-4f53-a0b1-2e46e8f320ce\', \'multiverseId\': 625716}, \'multiverseid\': 625716}, {\'name\': \'Salle de guerre\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{3}, {T}, payez un nombre de points de vie égal au nombre de couleurs dans l\'identité couleur de vos commandants : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Il suffit de déplacer une figurine sur une carte pour changer le cours de la guerre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625973&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53ad6b7e-ecc1-4b3c-93e3-a51a6707fa22\', \'multiverseId\': 625973}, \'multiverseid\': 625973}, {\'name\': \'作戦室\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{3}, {T}, あなたのすべての統率者の固有色の中の色の種類数に等しい点数のライフを支払う：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'地図の上で駒を動かすと、戦争の流れが変化する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d08ca776-611e-414e-aaa3-5f4016425cf3\', \'multiverseId\': 626230}, \'multiverseid\': 626230}]', "[{'name': 'Kristalliner Remasuri', 'text': 'Alle Remasuris haben Verhülltheit. (Sie können nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Remasuri', 'flavor': 'Eigentlich als lebendige Schilde gezüchtet, haben diese Remasuris schnell ihren Vorteil entdeckt — sie wissen, dass sie nicht eingefangen werden können.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625582&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd5bcb557-4181-4fce-96a8-73e7d017e8b6', 'multiverseId': 625582}, 'multiverseid': 625582}, {'name': 'Slivoïde cristallin', 'text': 'Tous les slivoïdes ont le linceul. (Ils ne peuvent pas être les cibles de sorts ou de capacités.)', 'type': 'Créature : slivoïde', 'flavor': 'Élevés pour être des boucliers vivants, ces slivoïdes se sont révélés trop indisciplinés. Ils se savent intouchables.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625839&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b18eddac-6d56-494f-b107-20fb5f087cb9', 'multiverseId': 625839}, 'multiverseid': 625839}, {'name': '水晶スリヴァー', 'text': 'すべてのスリヴァーは被覆を持つ。（それらは呪文や能力の対象にならない。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スリヴァー', 'flavor': '生きている障壁として育てられたこれらのスリヴァーは、手に負えないものに育ってしまった。彼らは誰も自分たちを捕まえられないことを知っているのだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626096&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f58b6a2d-9d4c-45ce-b23f-c84bf970490b', 'multiverseId': 626096}, 'multiverseid': 626096}]", "[{'name': 'Krosanischer Keiler', 'text': 'Umwandlung {2}{G} ({2}{G}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du den Krosanischen Keiler umwandelst, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf deine Hand nehmen und danach mischen. (Ziehe erst danach eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Wildschwein, Bestie', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628000&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '730ac0b6-9aa0-4b7f-b0bc-bf64063a001f', 'multiverseId': 628000}, 'multiverseid': 628000}, {'name': 'Colmilludo krosano', 'text': 'Ciclo {2}{G}. ({2}{G}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando actives la habilidad de ciclo del Colmilludo krosano, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, mostrarla, ponerla en tu mano y luego barajar. (Haz esto antes de robar.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Bestia jabalí', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628234&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6e06fc47-5b76-47be-b4e7-5ba6274a2b3b', 'multiverseId': 628234}, 'multiverseid': 628234}, {'name': 'クローサの大牙獣', 'text': 'サイクリング{2}{G}（{2}{G}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）\\nあなたがクローサの大牙獣をサイクリングしたとき、「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、公開してあなたの手札に加え、その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。（これはあなたがカードを引く前に行う。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 猪・ビースト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628702&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7707c558-61fa-4a78-8947-fc08f48dab73', 'multiverseId': 628702}, 'multiverseid': 628702}, {'name': '克洛萨长牙野猪', 'text': '循环{2}{G}（{2}{G}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\\n当你循环克洛萨长牙野猪时，你可以从你牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。（先如此作后再抓牌。）', 'type': '生物 ～野猪／野兽', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629170&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e3c7c176-9a01-456d-83e7-e8327d35c47c', 'multiverseId': 629170}, 'multiverseid': 629170}]", '[{\'name\': \'Krosas Waldrand\', \'text\': \'Krosas Waldrand kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere Krosas Waldrand: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Wald- und einer Ebene-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625670&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cac6570-b397-49a1-b3e4-c1ce999f2243\', \'multiverseId\': 625670}, \'multiverseid\': 625670}, {\'name\': \'Orée de la Krosia\', \'text\': "L\'Orée de la Krosia arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Orée de la Krosia : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de forêt et une carte de plaine, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625927&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0b3b371-d63b-45fc-9153-f46d1fae7e31\', \'multiverseId\': 625927}, \'multiverseid\': 625927}, {\'name\': \'クローサの境界\', \'text\': \'クローサの境界はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, クローサの境界を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから森・カード１枚と平地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48d5f6de-00cd-4f2b-a33f-319c2a5e1366\', \'multiverseId\': 626184}, \'multiverseid\': 626184}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kryptische Schlange\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede Spontanzauber- und Hexereikarte in deinem Friedhof {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schlange\', \'flavor\': \'Sie schlängelt sich durch die Sinne, umschlingt das Unterbewusstsein und vergiftet den Verstand.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622892&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe14dd07-2818-47c6-9e8d-33a92d9db941\', \'multiverseId\': 622892}, \'multiverseid\': 622892}, {\'name\': \'Serpiente críptica\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada carta de instantáneo y de conjuro en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Serpiente\', \'flavor\': \'Se desliza por los sentidos, corrompiendo la conciencia y envenenando la percepción.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b181f7e-191f-4a66-99a6-65ab7e8e1544\', \'multiverseId\': 623093}, \'multiverseid\': 623093}, {\'name\': \'Serpent cryptique\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque carte d\'éphémère et de rituel dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : grand serpent\', \'flavor\': \'Il ondule dans votre esprit, entravant votre conscience et empoisonnant vos sens.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623294&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc3bc1c4-6953-4368-a0a8-b320d78d6aea\', \'multiverseId\': 623294}, \'multiverseid\': 623294}, {\'name\': \'謎めいた海蛇\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚につき{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 海蛇\', \'flavor\': \'そいつは感覚を這い進み、意識を押さえつけ知覚を毒す。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7781ab91-34e9-4bb5-9687-2dedb489426d\', \'multiverseId\': 623696}, \'multiverseid\': 623696}, {\'name\': \'隐密巨蛇\', \'text\': \'你坟墓场中每有一张瞬间与法术牌，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨蛇\', \'flavor\': \'它能绕过感官，束缩感觉并毒害感知。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'375be2fc-57c1-4e53-b5e4-de0baef7528f\', \'multiverseId\': 624098}, \'multiverseid\': 624098}]', '[{\'name\': \'Krähenschwarm\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn eine andere Kreatur stirbt, kannst du eine Karte ziehen. Falls du dies tust, wirf eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': \'Sie sehnen sich nach den letzten Worten der Sterbenden noch mehr als nach Aas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622915&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4c1ca10-282a-4447-a179-28182f5446aa\', \'multiverseId\': 622915}, \'multiverseid\': 622915}, {\'name\': \'Bandada de cuervos\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que otra criatura muera, puedes robar una carta. Si lo haces, descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'Más que carroña, desean las últimas palabras del moribundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e6386e7-49d1-4b79-a82e-b5b3a18098f0\', \'multiverseId\': 623116}, \'multiverseid\': 623116}, {\'name\': \'Volée de corneilles\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une autre créature meurt, vous pouvez piocher une carte. Si vous faites ainsi, défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau\', \'flavor\': \'Plus que la charogne, ils se repaissent des dernières paroles des mourants.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623317&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c74350a-1798-48b4-a613-b9f89acbe349\', \'multiverseId\': 623317}, \'multiverseid\': 623317}, {\'name\': \'カラスの群れ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nこれでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、カード１枚を引いてもよい。そうしたなら、カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥\', \'flavor\': \'彼らが求めるのは、死肉よりも瀬戸際にいる者の最期の言葉だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e17f9e19-103d-4e80-8e09-358b1a4554cd\', \'multiverseId\': 623719}, \'multiverseid\': 623719}, {\'name\': \'乌鸦群\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当另一个生物死去时，你可以抓一张牌。若你如此作，则弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鸟\', \'flavor\': \'比起腐肉，它们更渴求死者的临终话语。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97e0810f-4bf9-4186-aec0-9d1389c2e88a\', \'multiverseId\': 624121}, \'multiverseid\': 624121}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kultivieren\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, zeige sie offen vor, bringe eine davon getappt ins Spiel, nimm die andere auf deine Hand und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Alle Samen haben eine Verbindung zueinander, die durch die Unendlichkeit hindurch reicht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625551&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96992cb2-01dc-4ee2-825d-4b2cb0ba3170\', \'multiverseId\': 625551}, \'multiverseid\': 625551}, {\'name\': \'Culture\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, révélez ces cartes, mettez-en une sur le champ de bataille engagée et l\'autre dans votre main, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Toutes les graines partagent un lien les reliant à travers l\'infini.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625808&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c719d55c-2546-49ea-b49b-fff0f768a092\', \'multiverseId\': 625808}, \'multiverseid\': 625808}, {\'name\': \'耕作\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、公開し、そのうち１枚をタップ状態で戦場に、もう１枚をあなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'全ての種には繋がりがあり、互いを無限の彼方から呼び合う。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4977cef-28eb-46c2-a379-15e5a1280ea7\', \'multiverseId\': 626065}, \'multiverseid\': 626065}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kykar, Zorn des Windes\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkst, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Geist-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nOpfere einen Geist: Erzeuge {R}.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vogel, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Der tobende Sturm entfacht die Flammen des rechtschaffenen Zorns."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626607&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'034b6173-a3dd-4f1a-8da8-57a0c763767c\', \'multiverseId\': 626607}, \'multiverseid\': 626607}, {\'name\': \'Kykar, furie du vent\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort non-créature, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Esprit avec le vol.\\nSacrifiez un esprit : Ajoutez {R}.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : oiseau et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Le vent violent attise les flammes du juste courroux. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626947&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bef709e4-3f82-4c31-81a0-c0dcc65d895b\', \'multiverseId\': 626947}, \'multiverseid\': 626947}, {\'name\': \'風の憤怒、カイカ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるたび、飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nスピリット１体を生け贄に捧げる：{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 鳥・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「激しい強風が正義の怒りを煽り立てる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7363da9-a49c-4b8d-9e17-b65553d8f172\', \'multiverseId\': 627287}, \'multiverseid\': 627287}, {\'name\': \'狂风怒火凯卡\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当你施放非生物咒语时，派出一个1/1白色，具飞行异能的精怪衍生生物。\\n牺牲一个精怪：加{R}。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～鸟／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「咆哮狂风助力正义怒火。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13471697-00f0-4b5a-9fdc-5f35238fa86a\', \'multiverseId\': 627627}, \'multiverseid\': 627627}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kykar, Zorn des Windes\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkst, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Geist-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nOpfere einen Geist: Erzeuge {R}.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vogel, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Der tobende Sturm entfacht die Flammen des rechtschaffenen Zorns."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628041&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01f0cb65-75f7-4278-9a22-184a3943ef0e\', \'multiverseId\': 628041}, \'multiverseid\': 628041}, {\'name\': \'Kykar, Furia del Viento\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo que no sea de criatura, crea una ficha de criatura Espíritu blanca 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\nSacrificar un Espíritu: Agrega {R}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero ave\', \'flavor\': \'"Los intensos vendavales avivan las llamas de la ira justificada".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d62f5cd-9223-4345-ad80-4fa613396764\', \'multiverseId\': 628275}, \'multiverseid\': 628275}, {\'name\': \'風の憤怒、カイカ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるたび、飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nスピリット１体を生け贄に捧げる：{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 鳥・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「激しい強風が正義の怒りを煽り立てる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'678d0ecc-9bc4-4cb4-bfee-841360f620fa\', \'multiverseId\': 628743}, \'multiverseid\': 628743}, {\'name\': \'狂风怒火凯卡\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当你施放非生物咒语时，派出一个1/1白色，具飞行异能的精怪衍生生物。\\n牺牲一个精怪：加{R}。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～鸟／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「咆哮狂风助力正义怒火。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b69513e9-1130-4907-a0c5-f0daa24c4e33\', \'multiverseId\': 629211}, \'multiverseid\': 629211}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kykar, Zorn des Windes\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkst, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Geist-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nOpfere einen Geist: Erzeuge {R}.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vogel, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein Leben ist sinnlos, wenn es nicht genutzt wird."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629349&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd32cf5f-b86b-4a94-9d38-d0df539989e7\', \'multiverseId\': 629349}, \'multiverseid\': 629349}, {\'name\': \'Kykar, Furia del Viento\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo que no sea de criatura, crea una ficha de criatura Espíritu blanca 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\nSacrificar un Espíritu: Agrega {R}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero ave\', \'flavor\': \'"Una vida es insignificante hasta que sirve para algo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23456a51-8276-4e12-85ef-525ef2a5d67b\', \'multiverseId\': 629373}, \'multiverseid\': 629373}, {\'name\': \'Kykar, furie du vent\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort non-créature, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Esprit avec le vol.\\nSacrifiez un esprit : Ajoutez {R}.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : oiseau et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Une vie n\'a de sens qu\'une fois mise à contribution. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629397&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38823304-26c1-4b75-ae4e-f0eb97fa0dd1\', \'multiverseId\': 629397}, \'multiverseid\': 629397}, {\'name\': \'風の憤怒、カイカ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるたび、飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nスピリット１体を生け贄に捧げる：{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 鳥・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「命とは、使われるまでは無意味なものである。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1d6b422-a079-4575-b7af-19fc0bd9ee1f\', \'multiverseId\': 629445}, \'multiverseid\': 629445}, {\'name\': \'狂风怒火凯卡\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当你施放非生物咒语时，派出一个1/1白色，具飞行异能的精怪衍生生物。\\n牺牲一个精怪：加{R}。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～鸟／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「生命要奉献才有意义。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69fe3ba7-544c-4857-a3d5-2ce2d246f9e1\', \'multiverseId\': 629493}, \'multiverseid\': 629493}]', "[{'name': 'Königin Marchesa', 'text': 'Todesberührung, Eile\\nWenn Königin Marchesa ins Spiel kommt, wirst du zum Monarchen.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls ein Gegner der Monarch ist, erzeuge einen 1/1 schwarzen Assassine-Kreaturenspielstein mit Todesberührung und Eile.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Assassine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626613&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '049790d7-d795-4e2b-aaa6-122b1950af8e', 'multiverseId': 626613}, 'multiverseid': 626613}, {'name': 'Reine Marchesa', 'text': 'Contact mortel, célérité\\nQuand la Reine Marchesa arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous devenez le monarque.\\nAu début de votre entretien, si un adversaire est le monarque, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 noire Assassin avec le contact mortel et la célérité.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : humain et assassin', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626953&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '537f5009-8dee-43f2-8853-88a6a208fa3b', 'multiverseId': 626953}, 'multiverseid': 626953}, {'name': 'マルチェッサ女王', 'text': '接死、速攻\\nマルチェッサ女王が戦場に出たとき、あなたが統治者になる。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、対戦相手が統治者であった場合、接死と速攻を持つ黒の１/１の暗殺者・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・暗殺者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627293&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '68700019-cb8c-4638-810b-e8032cb2522e', 'multiverseId': 627293}, 'multiverseid': 627293}, {'name': '玛切莎女王', 'text': '死触，敏捷\\n当玛切莎女王进战场时，你成为君主。\\n在你的维持开始时，若任一对手是君主，则你派出一个1/1黑色，具死触与敏捷异能的杀手衍生生物。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～人类／杀手', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627633&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dacad76a-7205-490d-bc91-1803ea6778db', 'multiverseId': 627633}, 'multiverseid': 627633}]", "[{'name': 'Königin Marchesa', 'text': 'Todesberührung, Eile\\nWenn Königin Marchesa ins Spiel kommt, wirst du zum Monarchen.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls ein Gegner der Monarch ist, erzeuge einen 1/1 schwarzen Assassine-Kreaturenspielstein mit Todesberührung und Eile.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Assassine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628048&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '73d2d85f-b5f7-4bc8-870b-e1673bdb5724', 'multiverseId': 628048}, 'multiverseid': 628048}, {'name': 'La reina Marquesa', 'text': 'Toque mortal, prisa.\\nCuando La reina Marquesa entre al campo de batalla, te conviertes en el monarca.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si un oponente es el monarca, crea una ficha de criatura Asesino negra 1/1 con las habilidades de toque mortal y prisa.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Asesino humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628282&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b77e6e9-41e2-4c54-a718-c048bd5e8e4a', 'multiverseId': 628282}, 'multiverseid': 628282}, {'name': 'マルチェッサ女王', 'text': '接死、速攻\\nマルチェッサ女王が戦場に出たとき、あなたが統治者になる。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、対戦相手が統治者であった場合、接死と速攻を持つ黒の１/１の暗殺者・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・暗殺者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628750&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4fea0689-490c-481b-93ea-1dd763cc3a03', 'multiverseId': 628750}, 'multiverseid': 628750}, {'name': '玛切莎女王', 'text': '死触，敏捷\\n当玛切莎女王进战场时，你成为君主。\\n在你的维持开始时，若任一对手是君主，则你派出一个1/1黑色，具死触与敏捷异能的杀手衍生生物。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～人类／杀手', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629218&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6cbd8b26-a8d0-4134-900a-a891eb83f582', 'multiverseId': 629218}, 'multiverseid': 629218}]", '[{\'name\': \'Königlicher Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben „Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, erhalten Remasuris, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges, falls du der Monarch bist. Anderenfalls wirst du zum Monarchen."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'„Möglicherweise werden einige Königinnen nicht als Königinnen geboren, sondern entwickeln sich mit der Zeit zu dieser Gestalt."\\n—Rukarumel, Tagebucheintrag\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625121&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad30d8ca-4789-4fd1-9eae-b9b40ad399f6\', \'multiverseId\': 625121}, \'multiverseid\': 625121}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde royal\', \'text\': "Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont « Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, les slivoïdes que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour si vous êtes le monarque. Sinon, vous devenez le monarque. »", \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': \'« Il est possible que certaines reines ne soient pas nées reines, mais évoluent vers cette forme avec le temps. »\\n—Observations de terrain de Rukarumel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625153&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e03aa2e-3416-41f6-83a8-db218ac0f531\', \'multiverseId\': 625153}, \'multiverseid\': 625153}, {\'name\': \'威厳スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのスリヴァー・クリーチャーは「このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、あなたが統治者であるなら、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのスリヴァーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。そうでないなら、あなたが統治者になる。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'「女王の中には、生まれながらにして女王であるのではなく、時間を掛けてその姿に進化していくものもいる。」\\n――ルカルメルの観察日誌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3010d9d1-62fe-4099-a52c-46edbd906181\', \'multiverseId\': 625185}, \'multiverseid\': 625185}]', '[{\'name\': \'Königlicher Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben „Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, erhalten Remasuris, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges, falls du der Monarch bist. Anderenfalls wirst du zum Monarchen."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624918&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60b04253-ca61-4b0d-94a7-e8402920663d\', \'multiverseId\': 624918}, \'multiverseid\': 624918}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde royal\', \'text\': "Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont « Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, les slivoïdes que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour si vous êtes le monarque. Sinon, vous devenez le monarque. »", \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624953&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f48f7b2-b50d-489b-b78f-b28f44267fe2\', \'multiverseId\': 624953}, \'multiverseid\': 624953}, {\'name\': \'威厳スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのスリヴァー・クリーチャーは「このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、あなたが統治者であるなら、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのスリヴァーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。そうでないなら、あなたが統治者になる。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'defba348-b689-460e-8769-bcb2dcab329e\', \'multiverseId\': 624988}, \'multiverseid\': 624988}, {\'name\': \'威严裂片妖\', \'text\': \'由你操控的裂片妖生物具有「当此生物进战场时，如果你是君主，则由你操控的裂片妖得+1/+1直到回合结束。若否，则你成为君主。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72d48a2f-fc22-4d4e-9224-2af77540d5e3\', \'multiverseId\': 625023}, \'multiverseid\': 625023}]', "[{'name': 'Lagerfeuer', 'text': '{1}, {T}: Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\n{2}, {T}, schicke das Lagerfeuer ins Exil: Nimm alle Kommandeure, die du besitzt, aus der Kommandozone und aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand. Mische dann deinen Friedhof in deine Bibliothek.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628072&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5399db5d-3908-41f8-911e-ace98e840385', 'multiverseId': 628072}, 'multiverseid': 628072}, {'name': 'Hoguera', 'text': '{1}, {T}: Ganas 2 vidas.\\n{2}, {T}, exiliar la Hoguera: Pon en tu mano todos los comandantes de los cuales eres propietario desde la zona de mando y tu cementerio. Luego baraja tu cementerio en tu biblioteca.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628306&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1190dddd-a472-4313-954a-39e246d722e5', 'multiverseId': 628306}, 'multiverseid': 628306}, {'name': '焚火', 'text': '{1},{T}：あなたは２点のライフを得る。\\n{2},{T},焚火を追放する：統率領域やあなたの墓地にありあなたがオーナーであるすべての統率者をあなたの手札に加える。その後、あなたの墓地をあなたのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628774&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a2e1af1c-bd1b-4b0a-ae4a-46dad2c45f5b', 'multiverseId': 628774}, 'multiverseid': 628774}, {'name': '营火', 'text': '{1}，{T}：你获得2点生命。\\n{2}，{T}，放逐营火：将所有由你拥有的指挥官从统帅区和你的坟墓场置于你手上。然后将你的坟墓场洗入你牌库。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629242&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9e78e82d-0659-45ae-8e0c-6bad577918e2', 'multiverseId': 629242}, 'multiverseid': 629242}]", '[{\'name\': \'Launenhafter Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben „Immer wenn diese Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug spielen."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'Sie jagen rein nach Instinkt, getrieben vom Willen des Schwarmbewusstseins, ohne Zeit mit eigenständigem Denken zu verschwenden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625131&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2ea5b53-1151-4835-92ef-33f00d349d43\', \'multiverseId\': 625131}, \'multiverseid\': 625131}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde capricieux\', \'text\': \'Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont « À chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez jouer cette carte ce tour-ci. »\', \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "Ils chassent par pur instinct, poussés par la volonté de l\'esprit de l\'essaim sans perdre de temps en pensées indépendantes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625163&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93ba8124-5720-4423-9bff-bf2561dc214c\', \'multiverseId\': 625163}, \'multiverseid\': 625163}, {\'name\': \'気まぐれスリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのスリヴァー・クリーチャーは「このクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。このターン、そのカードをプレイしてもよい。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'それは集団意識に突き動かされ、個の意志は持たず、己の本能に任せ狩猟を行う。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a74687c7-4ddc-4d35-860a-fbc2cdfcaae7\', \'multiverseId\': 625195}, \'multiverseid\': 625195}]', '[{\'name\': \'Launenhafter Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben „Immer wenn diese Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug spielen."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624926&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09b640cf-e064-4c72-96f1-79a5d49ff83c\', \'multiverseId\': 624926}, \'multiverseid\': 624926}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde capricieux\', \'text\': \'Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont « À chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez jouer cette carte ce tour-ci. »\', \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624961&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a2ced0c-d898-405d-bad4-562bee5fefbc\', \'multiverseId\': 624961}, \'multiverseid\': 624961}, {\'name\': \'気まぐれスリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのスリヴァー・クリーチャーは「このクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。このターン、そのカードをプレイしてもよい。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fb6663c-d092-4e28-9dc9-5d31b9308320\', \'multiverseId\': 624996}, \'multiverseid\': 624996}, {\'name\': \'任性裂片妖\', \'text\': \'由你操控的裂片妖生物具有「每当此生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，放逐你的牌库顶牌。本回合中，你可以使用该牌。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'912d9103-c1a4-4aff-86f6-94e91860ac89\', \'multiverseId\': 625031}, \'multiverseid\': 625031}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lavabauch-Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben „Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, fügt sie einem Spieler oder Planeswalker deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'Heiß genug, um Eier auszubrüten und potenzielle Eierdiebe zu verbrennen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625589&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6fb127d-a680-4d72-91d5-e8449c124629\', \'multiverseId\': 625589}, \'multiverseid\': 625589}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde ventrelave\', \'text\': \'Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont « Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, elle inflige 1 blessure à une cible, joueur ou planeswalker, et vous gagnez 1 point de vie. »\', \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': \'Suffisamment chaud pour incuber des œufs ou incinérer ceux qui voudraient les manger.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625846&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0793d47b-2428-4bab-9e2f-fb0d8dce255b\', \'multiverseId\': 625846}, \'multiverseid\': 625846}, {\'name\': \'溶岩腹スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのスリヴァー・クリーチャーは「このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、プレイヤーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１つを対象とする。これはそれに１点のダメージを与え、あなたは１点のライフを得る。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'ここは十分暖かいので、卵を孵しやすく、卵を食べに来るものを灰にしやすい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a10bccf-b525-480c-affd-1f1147d35084\', \'multiverseId\': 626103}, \'multiverseid\': 626103}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lazotep-Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Pestilenz 2. (Immer wenn eine Kreatur mit Pestilenz 2 geblockt wird, verliert der verteidigende Spieler 2 Lebenspunkte.)\\nImmer wenn ein Nichtspielstein-Remasuri, den du kontrollierst, stirbt, wende Remasuri-Aufmarsch 2 an. (Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Armee, die du kontrollierst. Sie ist auch ein Remasuri. Falls du keine Armee kontrollierst, erzeuge zuerst einen 0/0 schwarzen Remasuri-Armee-Kreaturenspielstein.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Remasuri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625130&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f38a3655-990d-4509-8774-902975bf6c86\', \'multiverseId\': 625130}, \'multiverseid\': 625130}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde de lazotèpe\', \'text\': "Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont affliction 2. (À chaque fois qu\'une créature avec affliction 2 devient bloquée, le joueur défenseur perd 2 points de vie.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un slivoïde non-jeton que vous contrôlez meurt, amassez des slivoïdes 2. (Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une armée que vous contrôlez. C\'est aussi un slivoïde. Si vous ne contrôlez pas d\'armée, créez d\'abord un jeton de créature 0/0 noire Slivoïde et Armée.)", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et slivoïde\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625162&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'678c3eaa-b37c-4fae-93c9-fc03e2a92604\', \'multiverseId\': 625162}, \'multiverseid\': 625162}, {\'name\': \'ラゾテプ・スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのスリヴァー・クリーチャーは加虐２を持つ。（加虐２を持つクリーチャーがブロックされた状態になるたび、防御プレイヤーは２点のライフを失う。）\\nあなたがコントロールしていてトークンでないスリヴァー１体が死亡するたび、スリヴァー動員２を行う。（あなたがコントロールしている軍団１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。それはスリヴァーでもある。あなたが軍団をコントロールしていないなら、その前に、黒の０/０のスリヴァー・軍団・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68026788-1f12-4eef-b319-a97eedc7a987\', \'multiverseId\': 625194}, \'multiverseid\': 625194}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lazotep-Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Pestilenz 2.\\nImmer wenn ein Nichtspielstein-Remasuri, den du kontrollierst, stirbt, wende Remasuri-Aufmarsch 2 an.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Remasuri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624925&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec885ae2-e9b1-4d1e-9dd8-aa905a4fea30\', \'multiverseId\': 624925}, \'multiverseid\': 624925}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde de lazotèpe\', \'text\': "Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont affliction 2.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un slivoïde non-jeton que vous contrôlez meurt, amassez des slivoïdes 2.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et slivoïde\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624960&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'042ff679-33ac-48d8-b959-8015b0543c0d\', \'multiverseId\': 624960}, \'multiverseid\': 624960}, {\'name\': \'ラゾテプ・スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのスリヴァー・クリーチャーは加虐２を持つ。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてトークンでないスリヴァー１体が死亡するたび、スリヴァー動員２を行う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2693002f-9a89-4056-89c4-af74aa5447e6\', \'multiverseId\': 624995}, \'multiverseid\': 624995}, {\'name\': \'拉佐特裂片妖\', \'text\': \'由你操控的裂片妖生物具有折磨2。\\n每当一个由你操控且非衍生物的裂片妖死去时，囤兵裂片妖2。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑／裂片妖\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'916e4225-7c01-4779-939a-0920e023c25f\', \'multiverseId\': 625030}, \'multiverseid\': 625030}]', "[{'name': 'Lebendiger Blitz', 'text': 'Wenn der Lebendige Blitz stirbt, bringe eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Schamane', 'flavor': 'Nicht alle Stürme kommen vom Himmel.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627937&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dcdb46a2-9b45-459e-94a6-d87f4f27112f', 'multiverseId': 627937}, 'multiverseid': 627937}, {'name': 'Rayo viviente', 'text': 'Cuando el Rayo viviente muera, regresa la carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.', 'type': 'Criatura — Chamán elemental', 'flavor': 'No todas las tormentas provienen del cielo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628171&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9e64c883-46ee-4ca2-8071-549ea717853b', 'multiverseId': 628171}, 'multiverseid': 628171}, {'name': '生ける稲妻', 'text': '生ける稲妻が死亡したとき、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・シャーマン', 'flavor': 'すべての嵐が空から来るとは限らない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628639&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3edef5cf-6f9c-48a9-b8aa-12ca0b89025f', 'multiverseId': 628639}, 'multiverseid': 628639}, {'name': '生体闪电', 'text': '当生体闪电死去时，将目标瞬间或法术牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。', 'type': '生物 ～元素／祭师', 'flavor': '并非所有风暴都从天而降。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629107&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e702abd-c18f-44ea-8d4f-497a67431667', 'multiverseId': 629107}, 'multiverseid': 629107}]", '[{\'name\': \'Lebensblut-Hydra\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nDie Lebensblut-Hydra kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Lebensblut-Hydra stirbt, erhältst du Lebenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke dazu und ziehst entsprechend viele Karten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hydra\', \'flavor\': \'In ihre Knochen sind Pharikas Geheimnisse geritzt, so dass nur die Würdigen sie entdecken mögen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626590&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b06cbde1-54c6-477c-9e49-dbc86ac3153c\', \'multiverseId\': 626590}, \'multiverseid\': 626590}, {\'name\': \'Hydre de force vive\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nL\'Hydre de force vive arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.\\nQuand l\'Hydre de force vive meurt, vous gagnez un nombre de points de vie et piochez un nombre de cartes égaux à sa force.", \'type\': \'Créature : hydre\', \'flavor\': "Pour éviter que ses secrets ne tombent aux mains de n\'importe qui, Pharika les a inscrits sur les os de la bête.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626930&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa1404e3-520a-4ebb-924f-ef55247db970\', \'multiverseId\': 626930}, \'multiverseid\': 626930}, {\'name\': \'生命線のハイドラ\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n生命線のハイドラは、＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n生命線のハイドラが死亡したとき、これのパワーに等しい点数のライフを得、これのパワーに等しい枚数のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハイドラ\', \'flavor\': \'ファリカはそれを知る資格のある者のみが発見できるよう、その骨に彼女の持つ秘密を記した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f4b8b2f-f318-4626-bb6d-839cbe667701\', \'multiverseId\': 627270}, \'multiverseid\': 627270}, {\'name\': \'血脉多头龙\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n血脉多头龙进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。\\n当血脉多头龙死去时，你获得等同于其力量的生命，并抓该数量的牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～多头龙\', \'flavor\': \'芳瑞卡将她的秘密写在多头龙骨头上，确保只有值得知晓此秘密的人才能发现。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'482d2e5c-0261-4968-abe6-7c7b9c062535\', \'multiverseId\': 627610}, \'multiverseid\': 627610}]', "[{'name': 'Lebensblut-Hydra', 'text': 'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nDie Lebensblut-Hydra kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Lebensblut-Hydra stirbt, erhältst du Lebenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke dazu und ziehst entsprechend viele Karten.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Hydra', 'flavor': 'In ihre Knochen sind Pharikas Geheimnisse geritzt, so dass nur die Würdigen sie entdecken mögen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628001&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '43608ea2-1100-4e6d-ab6d-1bd75bf9d7ba', 'multiverseId': 628001}, 'multiverseid': 628001}, {'name': 'Hidra sangrienta', 'text': 'Arrolla.\\nLa Hidra sangrienta entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.\\nCuando la Hidra sangrienta muera, ganas una cantidad de vidas y robas una cantidad de cartas igual a su fuerza.', 'type': 'Criatura — Hidra', 'flavor': 'Farika ha escrito sus secretos en sus huesos para que solo aquellos que sean dignos los descubran.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628235&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8cb0266f-3b9f-4f00-80c1-17bbc19ebbc5', 'multiverseId': 628235}, 'multiverseid': 628235}, {'name': '生命線のハイドラ', 'text': 'トランプル\\n生命線のハイドラは、＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n生命線のハイドラが死亡したとき、これのパワーに等しい点数のライフを得、これのパワーに等しい枚数のカードを引く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ハイドラ', 'flavor': 'ファリカはそれを知る資格のある者のみが発見できるよう、その骨に彼女の持つ秘密を記した。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628703&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b07ad050-c5ed-49fa-8eaa-5ebad1b95e05', 'multiverseId': 628703}, 'multiverseid': 628703}, {'name': '血脉多头龙', 'text': '践踏\\n血脉多头龙进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。\\n当血脉多头龙死去时，你获得等同于其力量的生命，并抓该数量的牌。', 'type': '生物 ～多头龙', 'flavor': '芳瑞卡将她的秘密写在多头龙骨头上，确保只有值得知晓此秘密的人才能发现。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629171&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fe417cdb-61f1-4d08-b9a6-0d5cd27ffcf2', 'multiverseId': 629171}, 'multiverseid': 629171}]", '[{\'name\': \'Lebhafter Begleiter\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Lebhafte Begleiter ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Hund\', \'flavor\': \'Sie schloss Freundschaft mit mehreren verspielten Geistern, und bald war „das Rudel" als Quelle für viel Unfug in Eiganjo bekannt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625500&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34c30ee1-eb97-4ec1-9b2c-54078c7c9619\', \'multiverseId\': 625500}, \'multiverseid\': 625500}, {\'name\': \'Compagnon fougueux\', \'text\': \'Quand le Compagnon fougueux arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : chien\', \'flavor\': "Il se lia d\'amitié avec plusieurs esprits espiègles, et bientôt, la « meute » fut connue à Eiganjo comme source de bien des plaisanteries.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625757&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a30d04c-fce6-4c08-8692-cb94fd6ff9d8\', \'multiverseId\': 625757}, \'multiverseid\': 625757}, {\'name\': \'神憑く相棒\', \'text\': \'神憑く相棒が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — 犬\', \'flavor\': \'いくつかの陽気な精霊と友情を築くと、すぐにその「群れ」は永岩城で起きる悪戯の原因として知られるようになった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'130c534f-c454-41f4-98cb-36542b3ef872\', \'multiverseId\': 626014}, \'multiverseid\': 626014}]', '[{\'name\': \'Leerschädel-Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben „{T}, wirf eine Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'„Faszinierend! Die Evolution hat ihre Hirne zurückgebildet, sodass sie weniger Energie verbrauchen. Sie reagieren nur auf Signale vom Schwarmbewusstsein."\\n—Rukarumel, Tagebucheintrag\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625540&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87589559-e144-4f35-be7b-59908fc77887\', \'multiverseId\': 625540}, \'multiverseid\': 625540}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde à tête creuse\', \'text\': "Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont « {T}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte : Piochez une carte ».", \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "« Fantastique ! Ils ont évolué sans pollution cérébrale et ne répondent qu\'aux stimuli vertébraux générés par l\'esprit de l\'essaim. »\\n—Rukarumel, journal de recherches", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625797&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dc04b97-0a4a-4494-aae1-13cc7f9f8d06\', \'multiverseId\': 625797}, \'multiverseid\': 625797}, {\'name\': \'頭空スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのスリヴァー・クリーチャーは「{T}, カード１枚を捨てる：カード１枚を引く。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'「素晴らしい！彼らはエネルギー消費の大きい脳を進化によって捨て去り、巣の精神から届く反射信号のみに反応するのだ。」\\n――ルカルメルの観察日誌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93349ffb-2694-49da-8299-39ad1fd25d0b\', \'multiverseId\': 626054}, \'multiverseid\': 626054}]', '[{\'name\': \'Leichen-Augur\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Leichen-Augur stirbt, ziehst du X Karten und verlierst X Lebenspunkte, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturenkarten ist, die sich im Friedhof eines Spielers deiner Wahl befinden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Selbst wenn das Fleisch kalt wird, sitzt tief in den Knochen noch immer Wissen, das ein Meister zu nutzen versteht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622954&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95bad5e7-81fd-4523-81de-9dbdc6b48205\', \'multiverseId\': 622954}, \'multiverseid\': 622954}, {\'name\': \'Presagio cadavérico\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Presagio cadavérico muera, robas X cartas y pierdes X vidas, donde X es la cantidad de cartas de criatura en el cementerio del jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Incluso cuando la carne se enfría, el conocimiento permanece en los huesos, esperando a que un maestro lo despierte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a37a134-4871-49cd-aa17-456de0c69456\', \'multiverseId\': 623155}, \'multiverseid\': 623155}, {\'name\': \'Augure des cadavres\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Augure des cadavres meurt, vous piochez X cartes et vous perdez X points de vie, X étant le nombre de cartes de créature dans le cimetière d\'un joueur ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Même si la chair se raidit, les os recèlent des connaissances attendant qu\'un maître vienne les libérer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623356&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08c7c2fb-d8cc-4cbb-b6c6-9d556fa4d99b\', \'multiverseId\': 623356}, \'multiverseid\': 623356}, {\'name\': \'死体占い師\', \'text\': \'死体占い師が死亡したとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。あなたはカードＸ枚を引き、Ｘ点のライフを失う。Ｘはそのプレイヤーの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードの枚数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'肉体が冷えてしまっても、知識は骨の中に眠り、それを解放してくれる導師を待っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e847553f-f154-4bac-9eef-410d1b89c757\', \'multiverseId\': 623758}, \'multiverseid\': 623758}, {\'name\': \'尸体卜算师\', \'text\': \'当尸体卜算师死去时，你抓X张牌且失去X点生命，X为目标牌手坟墓场中的生物牌数量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'纵使肉身渐寒，知识仍会存于骸骨之中，等待大师发掘。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f7762f7-52e1-4b44-bc14-eb1b229271e2\', \'multiverseId\': 624160}, \'multiverseid\': 624160}]', '[{\'name\': \'Leidenschaftlicher Schutz\', \'text\': \'Falls du einen Kommandeur kontrollierst, kannst du diesen Zauberspruch wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\nNeutralisiere einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Geistlose Gewalt verblasst vor dem Können eines Meisters."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624788&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cee87061-436e-4692-be4b-277e0b19fda8\', \'multiverseId\': 624788}, \'multiverseid\': 624788}, {\'name\': \'Custodia feroz\', \'text\': \'Si controlas un comandante, puedes lanzar este hechizo sin pagar su coste de maná.\\nContrarresta el hechizo objetivo que no sea de criatura.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La violencia sin sentido palidece ante la presencia de las habilidades de una maestra".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5ca9423-26a1-47cb-b42f-c9b41f1bcdaf\', \'multiverseId\': 624800}, \'multiverseid\': 624800}, {\'name\': \'Tutelle féroce\', \'text\': \'Si vous contrôlez un commandant, vous pouvez lancer ce sort sans payer son coût de mana.\\nContrecarrez un sort non-créature ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« La violence écervelée s\'étiole face au talent du maître. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624812&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd20281a-f07e-4bbc-9d69-42478e728718\', \'multiverseId\': 624812}, \'multiverseid\': 624812}, {\'name\': \'激情の後見\', \'text\': \'あなたが統率者をコントロールしているなら、この呪文をマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\\nクリーチャーでない呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「知性なき暴力は達人の妙技の前に萎れるのです。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'480fcf66-7b26-4779-b6f5-6c0bd3b8db91\', \'multiverseId\': 624836}, \'multiverseid\': 624836}, {\'name\': \'厉行守护\', \'text\': \'如果你操控指挥官，则你可以施放此咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\\n反击目标非生物咒语。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「面对大师巧技，无脑蛮力便要甘拜下风。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'757025a0-fd6a-467f-9479-79d2664ce01e\', \'multiverseId\': 624860}, \'multiverseid\': 624860}]', '[{\'name\': \'Leidenschaftlicher Schutz\', \'text\': \'Falls du einen Kommandeur kontrollierst, kannst du diesen Zauberspruch wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\nNeutralisiere einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Jage irgendwo anders. Das ist deine einzige Warnung."\\n—Gavi die Nesthüterin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622903&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd0e375b-ad06-446a-8132-9cfbde56849c\', \'multiverseId\': 622903}, \'multiverseid\': 622903}, {\'name\': \'Custodia feroz\', \'text\': \'Si controlas un comandante, puedes lanzar este hechizo sin pagar su coste de maná.\\nContrarresta el hechizo objetivo que no sea de criatura.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Caza en otro lugar. Es mi última advertencia".\\n—Gavi, guardiana del nido\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffee9462-82a3-4227-8786-f97910ad08a8\', \'multiverseId\': 623104}, \'multiverseid\': 623104}, {\'name\': \'Tutelle féroce\', \'text\': \'Si vous contrôlez un commandant, vous pouvez lancer ce sort sans payer son coût de mana.\\nContrecarrez un sort non-créature ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Allez chasser ailleurs. Ce sera votre seul avertissement. »\\n—Gavi, garde du nid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623305&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'025d47fc-718f-4741-9e2e-a15441ef724a\', \'multiverseId\': 623305}, \'multiverseid\': 623305}, {\'name\': \'激情の後見\', \'text\': \'あなたが統率者をコントロールしているなら、この呪文をマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\\nクリーチャーでない呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「狩りは他の場所でやりなさい。警告は一度だけよ。」\\n――巣守り、ガヴィ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d6e7e13-06b6-410e-9cbc-18180d1d0826\', \'multiverseId\': 623707}, \'multiverseid\': 623707}, {\'name\': \'厉行守护\', \'text\': \'如果你操控指挥官，则你可以施放此咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\\n反击目标非生物咒语。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「去别处打猎。我只警告这一次。」\\n～巢穴护卫盖薇\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f876c2b3-40da-4cac-8031-dd16676aad80\', \'multiverseId\': 624109}, \'multiverseid\': 624109}]', '[{\'name\': \'Leidenschaftlicher Schutz\', \'text\': \'Falls du einen Kommandeur kontrollierst, kannst du diesen Zauberspruch wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\nNeutralisiere einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Jage irgendwo anders. Das ist deine einzige Warnung."\\n—Gavi die Nesthüterin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626514&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccf2e99f-e119-488e-948a-24558f7756c3\', \'multiverseId\': 626514}, \'multiverseid\': 626514}, {\'name\': \'Tutelle féroce\', \'text\': \'Si vous contrôlez un commandant, vous pouvez lancer ce sort sans payer son coût de mana.\\nContrecarrez un sort non-créature ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Allez chasser ailleurs. Ce sera votre seul avertissement. »\\n—Gavi, garde du nid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626854&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c5d8573-c6a4-4a1f-85a4-734ff0270e77\', \'multiverseId\': 626854}, \'multiverseid\': 626854}, {\'name\': \'激情の後見\', \'text\': \'あなたが統率者をコントロールしているなら、この呪文をマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\\nクリーチャーでない呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「狩りは他の場所でやりなさい。警告は一度だけよ。」\\n――巣守り、ガヴィ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19a1df73-c159-464d-a3bc-25792f9b6444\', \'multiverseId\': 627194}, \'multiverseid\': 627194}, {\'name\': \'厉行守护\', \'text\': \'如果你操控指挥官，则你可以施放此咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\\n反击目标非生物咒语。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「去别处打猎。我只警告这一次。」\\n～巢穴护卫盖薇\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4605d16f-2972-4dc6-a89a-f54240209791\', \'multiverseId\': 627534}, \'multiverseid\': 627534}]', '[{\'name\': \'Leori, funkenberührter Jäger\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn Leori, funkenberührter Jäger, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, bestimme einen Planeswalkertyp. Immer wenn du bis zum Ende des Zuges eine Fähigkeit eines Planeswalkers des bestimmten Typs aktivierst, kopiere jene Fähigkeit. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopien bestimmen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Katze\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624935&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d4e329c-639f-4e90-a7e0-f7cd4a1cd053\', \'multiverseId\': 624935}, \'multiverseid\': 624935}, {\'name\': "Léori, chasseur touché par l\'étincelle", \'text\': "Vol, vigilance\\nÀ chaque fois que Léori, chasseur touché par l\'étincelle inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, choisissez un type de planeswalker. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, à chaque fois que vous activez une capacité d\'un planeswalker de ce type, copiez cette capacité. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour ces copies.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : élémental et chat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624970&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39f1ea28-ea0c-4c1b-8281-a1df468a6125\', \'multiverseId\': 624970}, \'multiverseid\': 624970}, {\'name\': \'灯触れの狩人、レオリ\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒\\n灯触れの狩人、レオリがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、プレインズウォーカー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。ターン終了時まで、あなたがそのタイプであるプレインズウォーカーの能力を起動するたび、その能力をコピーする。あなたはそれらのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エレメンタル・猫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78d56cc5-39f2-45d2-8fde-947e165dbe4b\', \'multiverseId\': 625005}, \'multiverseid\': 625005}, {\'name\': \'触火花猎狮雷奥力\', \'text\': \'飞行，警戒\\n每当触火花猎狮雷奥力对任一牌手造成伤害时，选择一种鹏洛客类别。直到回合结束，每当你起动为该类别之鹏洛客的异能时，复制该异能。你可以为每个复制品选择新的目标。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～元素／猫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60b78dd7-6f44-45ca-a7bd-7d230804b0b1\', \'multiverseId\': 625040}, \'multiverseid\': 625040}]', '[{\'name\': \'Leori, funkenberührter Jäger\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn Leori, funkenberührter Jäger, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, bestimme einen Planeswalkertyp. Immer wenn du bis zum Ende des Zuges eine Fähigkeit eines Planeswalkers des bestimmten Typs aktivierst, kopiere jene Fähigkeit. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopien bestimmen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Katze\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625066&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5123a2c4-67a0-411f-baab-c7cb7bdccc6a\', \'multiverseId\': 625066}, \'multiverseid\': 625066}, {\'name\': "Léori, chasseur touché par l\'étincelle", \'text\': "Vol, vigilance\\nÀ chaque fois que Léori, chasseur touché par l\'étincelle inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, choisissez un type de planeswalker. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, à chaque fois que vous activez une capacité d\'un planeswalker de ce type, copiez cette capacité. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour ces copies.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : élémental et chat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625070&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90434722-1f91-4cb9-91e3-1ee1b5c098c3\', \'multiverseId\': 625070}, \'multiverseid\': 625070}, {\'name\': \'灯触れの狩人、レオリ\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒\\n灯触れの狩人、レオリがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、プレインズウォーカー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。ターン終了時まで、あなたがそのタイプであるプレインズウォーカーの能力を起動するたび、その能力をコピーする。あなたはそれらのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エレメンタル・猫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'415fa64f-4568-45a9-8600-c36764428e92\', \'multiverseId\': 625074}, \'multiverseid\': 625074}]', '[{\'name\': \'Letzter Abschied\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach zwei Karten. Nimm eine davon auf deine Hand und lege die andere auf deinen Friedhof. Mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Schlaf jetzt, Bruder. Wenigstens das kann ich für dich tun."\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622969&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01b2af62-8513-443e-bc77-f69e60945ef7\', \'multiverseId\': 622969}, \'multiverseid\': 622969}, {\'name\': \'Despedida final\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca dos cartas. Pon una en tu mano y la otra en tu cementerio. Luego, baraja.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Descansa ahora, hermano. Es el único regalo que puedo hacerte".\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64839c0a-981a-4df0-a7e3-d8f17ed17bc5\', \'multiverseId\': 623170}, \'multiverseid\': 623170}, {\'name\': \'Dernière séparation\', \'text\': "Cherchez deux cartes dans votre bibliothèque. Mettez l\'une d\'elles dans votre main et l\'autre dans votre cimetière. Puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Dors maintenant, mon frère. C\'est le seul cadeau que je puisse te faire. »\\n—Liliana Vess", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623371&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f4174a5-3d65-4930-81c0-0518fb5eb3b6\', \'multiverseId\': 623371}, \'multiverseid\': 623371}, {\'name\': \'最後の別れ\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーからカード２枚を探す。そのうち１枚をあなたの手札に、もう１枚をあなたの墓地に置く。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「眠ってください、お兄様。私が差し上げられる唯一の贈り物です。」\\n――リリアナ・ヴェス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc5db9d9-1ee1-4d90-a8ed-1240db0dd161\', \'multiverseId\': 623773}, \'multiverseid\': 623773}, {\'name\': \'生离死别\', \'text\': \'从你牌库中搜寻两张牌。将其中一张置于你手上，另一张则置入你的坟墓场。然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「安息吧，哥哥。这便是我能送你的礼物。」\\n～莉莲娜维斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b748032-80f7-4a94-9ea4-137050ff7392\', \'multiverseId\': 624175}, \'multiverseid\': 624175}]', "[{'name': 'Leuchtschatten-Knoten', 'text': 'Sowie der Leuchtschatten-Knoten ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Ebene- oder Sumpf-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt der Leuchtschatten-Knoten getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {B}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Ein flackerndes Leuchtfeuer rechtschaffener Verderbtheit.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625695&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3159d74b-0c47-40e9-bd3c-36750ceb403d', 'multiverseId': 625695}, 'multiverseid': 625695}, {'name': 'Lacis luminombre', 'text': 'Au moment où le Lacis luminombre arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte de plaine ou de marais de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, le Lacis luminombre arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {B}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Un flambeau vacillant de juste corruption.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625952&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37db58be-dc92-4881-9568-4dca842593c5', 'multiverseId': 625952}, 'multiverseid': 625952}, {'name': '光影の交錯', 'text': '光影の交錯が戦場に出るに際し、あなたはあなたの手札にあり平地や沼であるカード１枚を公開してもよい。そうしないなら、光影の交錯はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{B}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '正しい堕落が瞬く標。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626209&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8fa6f5fb-956b-437f-ab8a-b6f9bbf2bf73', 'multiverseId': 626209}, 'multiverseid': 626209}]", '[{\'name\': \'Liebeslied von Nacht und Tag\', \'text\': \'Überblättern (Wähle ein Kapitel und beginne mit so vielen Sagenmarken. Füge nach deinem Ziehsegment eine hinzu. Übersprungene Kapitel werden nicht ausgelöst. Opfern nach III.)\\nI — Du und ein Gegner deiner Wahl zieht jeweils zwei Karten.\\nII — Erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Vogel-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nIII — Lege je eine +1/+1-Marke auf bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Sage\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625489&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8c7178c-cd5e-4582-af5b-78335ee48e23\', \'multiverseId\': 625489}, \'multiverseid\': 625489}, {\'name\': \'Nuit et Jour la chanson de leur amour\', \'text\': "Lecture rapide (Choisissez un chapitre et commencez avec autant de marqueurs « sapience ». Ajoutez-en un après votre étape de pioche. Les chapitres passés ne se déclenchent pas. Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI — Vous et un adversaire ciblé piochez chacun deux cartes.\\nII — Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Oiseau avec le vol.\\nIII — Ciblez jusqu\'à deux créatures. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chacune d\'elles.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625746&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb1c17bd-0ca2-4e86-9594-9fb825dd0605\', \'multiverseId\': 625746}, \'multiverseid\': 625746}, {\'name\': \'夜と昼の恋歌\', \'text\': \'先読（章を選び、それに等しい数の伝承カウンターで始める。あなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンター１個を追加する。飛ばされた章は誘発しない。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI — 対戦相手１人を対象とする。あなたとそのプレイヤーはそれぞれカード２枚を引く。\\nII — 飛行を持つ白の１/１の鳥・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nIII — クリーチャー最大２体を対象とする。それらの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — 英雄譚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'107fb1dc-f8b4-49b2-95d5-28670c763080\', \'multiverseId\': 626003}, \'multiverseid\': 626003}]', "[{'name': 'Lied der Dryaden', 'text': 'Verzaubert eine bleibende Karte\\nDie verzauberte bleibende Karte ist ein farbloses Wald-Land.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': 'Nur wenige, die auf den seltsamen Hain stoßen, ziehen weiter, wenn sie erst den melodischen Gesang der Dryaden vernommen haben.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626597&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f0f09a3-5941-4043-ab46-fe3998c49b48', 'multiverseId': 626597}, 'multiverseid': 626597}, {'name': 'Chant des dryades', 'text': 'Enchanter : permanent\\nLe permanent enchanté est un terrain Forêt incolore.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': 'De tous ceux qui découvrent cet étrange bosquet vivant, rares sont ceux qui en ressortent une fois captivés par le chœur mélodieux des dryades.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626937&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4ca37ad1-0662-4dfe-b341-7d64e1aa8c40', 'multiverseId': 626937}, 'multiverseid': 626937}, {'name': 'ドライアドの歌', 'text': 'エンチャント（パーマネント）\\nエンチャントしているパーマネントは無色の森・土地である。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': 'この奇妙な人の形をした木立と遭遇し、ドライアドたちの陽気な合唱の声がその耳に届いた者のなかで、再びそこから離れることができた者は少ない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627277&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '50301877-4cf8-4c8a-a6c5-c87f501ebdf6', 'multiverseId': 627277}, 'multiverseid': 627277}, {'name': '树灵幽歌', 'text': '结附于永久物\\n所结附的永久物是无色树林地。', 'type': '结界 ～灵气', 'flavor': '鲜有在看到奇异人形树丛，听到树灵的轻快合唱之后还离开者。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627617&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aea4607c-4a59-43de-93cb-f7b04ec6d2c1', 'multiverseId': 627617}, 'multiverseid': 627617}]", "[{'name': 'Lied der Dryaden', 'text': 'Verzaubert eine bleibende Karte\\nDie verzauberte bleibende Karte ist ein farbloses Wald-Land.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': 'Nur wenige, die auf den seltsamen Hain stoßen, ziehen weiter, wenn sie erst den melodischen Gesang der Dryaden vernommen haben.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628022&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9292f20c-ec59-4a53-a209-b0c7bc0ba5ca', 'multiverseId': 628022}, 'multiverseid': 628022}, {'name': 'Canción de las dríadas', 'text': 'Encantar permanente.\\nEl permanente encantado es una tierra Bosque incolora.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': 'Pocos de aquellos que hallan la extraña arboleda de formas humanas la abandonan una vez que el melodioso coro de las dríadas alcanza sus oídos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628256&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8a392ffc-24fb-4b48-bdfc-7a196f8983ae', 'multiverseId': 628256}, 'multiverseid': 628256}, {'name': 'ドライアドの歌', 'text': 'エンチャント（パーマネント）\\nエンチャントしているパーマネントは無色の森・土地である。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': 'この奇妙な人の形をした木立と遭遇し、ドライアドたちの陽気な合唱の声がその耳に届いた者のなかで、再びそこから離れることができた者は少ない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628724&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5799503a-d25b-4da8-8d42-3c40c5d39d18', 'multiverseId': 628724}, 'multiverseid': 628724}, {'name': '树灵幽歌', 'text': '结附于永久物\\n所结附的永久物是无色树林地。', 'type': '结界 ～灵气', 'flavor': '鲜有在看到奇异人形树丛，听到树灵的轻快合唱之后还离开者。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629192&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '77557326-9e33-479c-8289-1ac508613560', 'multiverseId': 629192}, 'multiverseid': 629192}]", '[{\'name\': \'Lorthos, der Gezeitenmacher\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Lorthos, der Gezeitenmacher, angreift, kannst du {8} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, tappe bis zu acht bleibende Karten deiner Wahl. Jene bleibenden Karten enttappen nicht während des nächsten Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Oktopus\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn Lorthos aus seinem Tiefseereich auftaucht, fügt sich die Flut seinem Willen, und die Küste zieht sich zurück.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622912&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'069b79db-25ca-4b41-b4c2-f78360b17e14\', \'multiverseId\': 622912}, \'multiverseid\': 622912}, {\'name\': \'Lorthos, el creador de mareas\', \'text\': \'Siempre que Lorthos, el creador de mareas ataque, puedes pagar {8}. Si lo haces, gira hasta ocho permanentes objetivo. Esos permanentes no se enderezan durante el próximo paso de enderezar de sus controladores.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Pulpo\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando Lorthos emerge de su reino en las profundidades, las mareas se inclinan a su voluntad y la costa se acobarda ante su presencia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35cd14eb-7110-4c0a-8b80-299c5d28fc43\', \'multiverseId\': 623113}, \'multiverseid\': 623113}, {\'name\': \'Lorthos, le Faiseur de marées\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que Lorthos, le Faiseur de marées attaque, vous pouvez payer {8}. Si vous faites ainsi, engagez jusqu\'à huit permanents ciblés. Ces permanents ne se dégagent pas pendant la prochaine étape de dégagement de leurs contrôleurs.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : pieuvre\', \'flavor\': \'Quand Lorthos surgit des profondeurs de son royaume, les marées se plient à ses désirs et la côte tremble en sa présence.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623314&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'936bd105-3ca5-41ac-9fbb-45fe9d4005e8\', \'multiverseId\': 623314}, \'multiverseid\': 623314}, {\'name\': \'潮汐を作るもの、ロートス\', \'text\': \'潮汐を作るもの、ロートスが攻撃するたび、パーマネント最大８つを対象とする。あなたは{8}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、それらのパーマネントをタップする。それらのパーマネントは、それらのコントローラーの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — タコ\', \'flavor\': \'ロートスが深海の王国から姿を現す時、潮流は彼の意志に頭を下げ、海岸は彼の存在に恐れおののく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d6025ed-443f-414f-8a59-f2f44b3c104c\', \'multiverseId\': 623716}, \'multiverseid\': 623716}, {\'name\': \'兴潮罗佐司\', \'text\': \'每当兴潮罗佐司攻击时，你可以支付{8}。若你如此作，则横置至多八个目标永久物。这些永久物于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～章鱼\', \'flavor\': \'罗佐司从其深海国度现身，潮浪为其意志而躬身行礼，海岸见其身形即畏缩奔逃。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b333f6df-8509-4196-8029-4c720dcf954a\', \'multiverseId\': 624118}, \'multiverseid\': 624118}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lorthos, der Gezeitenmacher\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Lorthos, der Gezeitenmacher, angreift, kannst du {8} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, tappe bis zu acht bleibende Karten deiner Wahl. Jene bleibenden Karten enttappen nicht während des nächsten Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Oktopus\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn Lorthos aus seinem Tiefseereich auftaucht, fügt sich die Flut seinem Willen, und die Küste zieht sich zurück.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626515&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eebc823d-5f04-4ec6-9e2e-624621dc6fca\', \'multiverseId\': 626515}, \'multiverseid\': 626515}, {\'name\': \'Lorthos, le Faiseur de marées\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que Lorthos, le Faiseur de marées attaque, vous pouvez payer {8}. Si vous faites ainsi, engagez jusqu\'à huit permanents ciblés. Ces permanents ne se dégagent pas pendant la prochaine étape de dégagement de leurs contrôleurs.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : pieuvre\', \'flavor\': \'Quand Lorthos surgit des profondeurs de son royaume, les marées se plient à ses désirs et la côte tremble en sa présence.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626855&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daad2ff8-9ab6-465e-923f-dce57df252c5\', \'multiverseId\': 626855}, \'multiverseid\': 626855}, {\'name\': \'潮汐を作るもの、ロートス\', \'text\': \'潮汐を作るもの、ロートスが攻撃するたび、パーマネント最大８つを対象とする。あなたは{8}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、それらのパーマネントをタップする。それらのパーマネントは、それらのコントローラーの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — タコ\', \'flavor\': \'ロートスが深海の王国から姿を現す時、潮流は彼の意志に頭を下げ、海岸は彼の存在に恐れおののく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bad868dd-4d97-4f39-882d-bcbada75ed49\', \'multiverseId\': 627195}, \'multiverseid\': 627195}, {\'name\': \'兴潮罗佐司\', \'text\': \'每当兴潮罗佐司攻击时，你可以支付{8}。若你如此作，则横置至多八个目标永久物。这些永久物于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～章鱼\', \'flavor\': \'罗佐司从其深海国度现身，潮浪为其意志而躬身行礼，海岸见其身形即畏缩奔逃。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1802a45b-ce76-494f-b620-b70e9ece801c\', \'multiverseId\': 627535}, \'multiverseid\': 627535}]', '[{\'name\': \'Losheel, Gelehrte der Mechanik\', \'text\': \'Verhindere allen Kampfschaden, der angreifenden Artefaktkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, zugefügt würde.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Artefaktkreaturen unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommen, ziehe eine Karte. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elefant, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622847&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b70b22b9-d0e3-4555-8e6c-c7f52db2b9c8\', \'multiverseId\': 622847}, \'multiverseid\': 622847}, {\'name\': \'Losheel, erudita mecánica\', \'text\': \'Prevén todo el daño de combate que se fuera a hacer a las criaturas artefacto atacantes que controlas.\\nSiempre que una o más criaturas artefacto entren al campo de batalla bajo tu control, roba una carta. Esta habilidad solo se dispara una vez por turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice elefante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e639748-e2bb-4409-8b9e-41e2c12302fb\', \'multiverseId\': 623048}, \'multiverseid\': 623048}, {\'name\': \'Losheel, érudite en mécanique\', \'text\': "Prévenez toutes les blessures de combat qui devraient être infligées aux créatures-artefacts attaquantes que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature-artefact arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, piochez une carte. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : éléphant et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623249&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d15ada29-9cc3-400d-9b16-22ca9f69f22c\', \'multiverseId\': 623249}, \'multiverseid\': 623249}, {\'name\': \'機械細工の学者、ロシール\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていて攻撃しているすべてのアーティファクト・クリーチャーが受けるすべての戦闘ダメージを軽減する。\\n１体以上のアーティファクト・クリーチャーがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、カード１枚を引く。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 象・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fce17159-50c5-41b8-8de4-4a123293882a\', \'multiverseId\': 623651}, \'multiverseid\': 623651}, {\'name\': \'发条学者萝绣\', \'text\': \'防止由你操控且正进行攻击之神器生物将受到的所有战斗伤害。\\n每当一个或数个神器生物在你的操控下进战场时，抓一张牌。此异能每回合只会触发一次。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～象／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4d2d83b-9552-450b-b080-c628a017f5ee\', \'multiverseId\': 624053}, \'multiverseid\': 624053}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lotleth-Riese\', \'text\': \'Totenwelt — Wenn der Lotleth-Riese ins Spiel kommt, fügt er einem Gegner deiner Wahl für jede Kreaturenkarte in deinem Friedhof 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Riese\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich ziehe die Großen und Bedrohlichen den Kleinen und Krabbelnden vor."\\n—Cevraya, Golgari-Schamane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622980&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6177b19-4823-47e5-9ed6-e379a6bb57f0\', \'multiverseId\': 622980}, \'multiverseid\': 622980}, {\'name\': \'Gigante lotleth\', \'text\': \'Despojos — Cuando el Gigante lotleth entre al campo de batalla, hace 1 punto de daño al oponente objetivo por cada carta de criatura en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Prefiero los grandes que se ven bien a los pequeños que se escabullen".\\n—Cevraya, chamán golgari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdfd6fa6-bc1c-4ebe-9358-4c93465e702c\', \'multiverseId\': 623181}, \'multiverseid\': 623181}, {\'name\': \'Géant de Lotleth\', \'text\': \'Maquis — Quand le Géant de Lotleth arrive sur le champ de bataille, il inflige 1 blessure à un adversaire ciblé pour chaque carte de créature dans votre cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et géant\', \'flavor\': "« Je préfère ce qui est grand et qu\'on voit venir de loin à ce qui est petit et qu\'on n\'entend pas arriver. »\\n—Cevraya, shamane de Golgari", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623382&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ee8ae1b-ee63-414f-9a26-93ddb0351b6f\', \'multiverseId\': 623382}, \'multiverseid\': 623382}, {\'name\': \'ロッテスの巨人\', \'text\': \'宿根 ― ロッテスの巨人が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。これはそのプレイヤーに、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚につき１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・巨人\', \'flavor\': \'「あたしは、小さくてちょこまかしているよりも、大きくてどっしりしている方がいいね。」\\n――ゴルガリのシャーマン、セヴリヤ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bccb2e8d-d0e7-4962-8a5e-f96c1cbcac00\', \'multiverseId\': 623784}, \'multiverseid\': 623784}, {\'name\': \'洛特离巨人\', \'text\': \'朽力～当洛特离巨人进战场时，选择目标对手。你坟墓场中每有一张生物牌，它便对该牌手造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑／巨人\', \'flavor\': \'「相比渺小掠行的生物，我更喜欢大到遮天的那种。」\\n～葛加理祭师习拉雅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7c598f7-96b2-4730-84d4-9375c5ac1502\', \'multiverseId\': 624186}, \'multiverseid\': 624186}]', '[{\'name\': \'Loyale Gefolgsleute\', \'text\': \'Opfere die Loyalen Gefolgsleute: Bringe eine legendäre Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur während deines Zuges, bevor Angreifer deklariert werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Berater\', \'flavor\': \'Denn manchmal ist der größte Feind der Papierkram.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622848&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac399f98-8c52-4ad8-9f81-5ecbd6a2a450\', \'multiverseId\': 622848}, \'multiverseid\': 622848}, {\'name\': \'Criados leales\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar los Criados leales: Regresa la carta de criatura legendaria objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Activa esto solo durante tu turno, antes de que se declaren atacantes.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Consejero humano\', \'flavor\': \'A veces el papeleo es el verdadero archienemigo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7cbf513-e680-403d-ae3e-aef73aeb695c\', \'multiverseId\': 623049}, \'multiverseid\': 623049}, {\'name\': \'Serviteurs loyaux\', \'text\': "Sacrifiez les Serviteurs loyaux : Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature légendaire ciblée depuis votre cimetière. N\'activez que pendant votre tour, avant la déclaration des attaquants.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et conseiller\', \'flavor\': \'Car parfois, votre ennemi le plus terrible est la paperasse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623250&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef036e88-0dd4-4603-b52f-db2df179fbf6\', \'multiverseId\': 623250}, \'multiverseid\': 623250}, {\'name\': \'忠臣\', \'text\': \'忠臣を生け贄に捧げる：あなたの墓地にある伝説のクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。あなたのターンの間で、攻撃クリーチャーが指定される前にのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': \'時に最大の敵となるものが書類仕事である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c84df3a2-f732-4cdb-9fc5-9ae0c67bcb52\', \'multiverseId\': 623652}, \'multiverseid\': 623652}, {\'name\': \'忠臣\', \'text\': \'牺牲忠臣：将目标传奇生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。只能于你的回合中、宣告攻击者之前起动。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／参谋\', \'flavor\': \'毕竟最大的敌人有时候是文书工作。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82fc0fd8-d83f-4f90-ab29-be065d760ed7\', \'multiverseId\': 624054}, \'multiverseid\': 624054}]', '[{\'name\': \'Loyale Gefolgsleute\', \'text\': \'Opfere die Loyalen Gefolgsleute: Bringe eine legendäre Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur während deines Zuges, bevor Angreifer deklariert werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Berater\', \'flavor\': \'Denn manchmal ist der größte Feind der Papierkram.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626490&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'144583d3-8146-4ce4-acbf-bf0e3c331729\', \'multiverseId\': 626490}, \'multiverseid\': 626490}, {\'name\': \'Serviteurs loyaux\', \'text\': "Sacrifiez les Serviteurs loyaux : Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature légendaire ciblée depuis votre cimetière. N\'activez que pendant votre tour, avant la déclaration des attaquants.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et conseiller\', \'flavor\': \'Car parfois, votre ennemi le plus terrible est la paperasse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626830&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09480ad6-82d1-40ce-9c72-d7204fc4ea5d\', \'multiverseId\': 626830}, \'multiverseid\': 626830}, {\'name\': \'忠臣\', \'text\': \'忠臣を生け贄に捧げる：あなたの墓地にある伝説のクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。あなたのターンの間で、攻撃クリーチャーが指定される前にのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': \'時に最大の敵となるものが書類仕事である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b315a0cd-06ca-4184-ab8b-39cd495f4ec9\', \'multiverseId\': 627170}, \'multiverseid\': 627170}, {\'name\': \'忠臣\', \'text\': \'牺牲忠臣：将目标传奇生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。只能于你的回合中、宣告攻击者之前起动。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／参谋\', \'flavor\': \'毕竟最大的敌人有时候是文书工作。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b4ae535-6c08-4f3a-b533-38b6d9ed1947\', \'multiverseId\': 627510}, \'multiverseid\': 627510}]', "[{'name': 'Loyaler Lehrling', 'text': 'Eile\\nLeutnant — Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls du deinen Kommandeur kontrollierst, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit. Der Spielstein erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker', 'flavor': 'Weise Gelehrte hören auf diejenigen, die über Vorstellungskraft verfügen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627938&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5a889b69-99e3-40b3-a416-b894356f7e38', 'multiverseId': 627938}, 'multiverseid': 627938}, {'name': 'Aprendiz leal', 'text': 'Prisa.\\nTeniente — Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, si controlas a tu comandante, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Tóptero incolora 1/1 con la habilidad de volar. Esa ficha gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.', 'type': 'Criatura — Artífice humano', 'flavor': 'Los que poseen el conocimiento harían bien en escuchar a quienes tienen el don de la imaginación.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628172&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '63a1ad38-7828-4903-afd6-7cfa541306fe', 'multiverseId': 628172}, 'multiverseid': 628172}, {'name': '忠実な弟子', 'text': '速攻\\n副官 ― あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがあなたの統率者をコントロールしている場合、飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。ターン終了時まで、そのトークンは速攻を得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠', 'flavor': '知識ある者は賢明にして、創意ある者に耳を傾ける。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628640&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '24bbf643-1140-4620-9a38-966baab62302', 'multiverseId': 628640}, 'multiverseid': 628640}, {'name': '忠实学徒', 'text': '敏捷\\n副官～在你回合的战斗开始时，若你操控你的指挥官，则派出一个1/1无色，具飞行异能的振翼机衍生神器生物。该衍生物获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。', 'type': '生物 ～人类／神器师', 'flavor': '知识渊博者都晓得想象丰富者的言论值得一听。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629108&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bbaee43d-344e-4529-8a65-b6d24675b5cc', 'multiverseId': 629108}, 'multiverseid': 629108}]", '[{\'name\': \'Loyaler Sceada\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nLeutnant — Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls du deinen Kommandeur kontrollierst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sceada\', \'flavor\': \'„Brieftauben wird keine Beachtung geschenkt. Wenn ich eine Nachricht sende, muss sie schon Biss haben."\\n—Aeschel, Diplomat des Königs\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622913&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e8996b5-e187-4b9e-80a4-2a8cee8e489a\', \'multiverseId\': 622913}, \'multiverseid\': 622913}, {\'name\': \'Draco leal\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nTeniente — Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, si controlas a tu comandante, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Draco\', \'flavor\': \'"Las palomas son demasiado sutiles. Yo, cuando envío un mensaje, quiero que tenga garra".\\n—Eschel, diplomático real\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f99f34d2-1c4d-4934-9f62-a012089731d5\', \'multiverseId\': 623114}, \'multiverseid\': 623114}, {\'name\': \'Drakôn loyal\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nLieutenant — Au début du combat pendant votre tour, si vous contrôlez votre commandant, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : drakôn\', \'flavor\': "« Les colombes et les pigeons sont trop subtils. Quand j\'envoie un message, je veux qu\'il ait du mordant. »\\n—Aeschel, diplomate royal", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623315&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8eaec163-f0b0-4ff0-9d92-b9373cc77839\', \'multiverseId\': 623315}, \'multiverseid\': 623315}, {\'name\': \'忠実なドレイク\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n副官 ― あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがあなたの統率者をコントロールしている場合、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドレイク\', \'flavor\': \'「ハトではおとなし過ぎる。私の伝書には噛み付く獰猛さが必要なのだ。」\\n――勅命外交官、イーシェル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'495a0c56-6c3d-434c-ae3e-24ae956bb333\', \'multiverseId\': 623717}, \'multiverseid\': 623717}, {\'name\': \'忠诚龙兽\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n副官～在你回合的战斗开始时，若你操控你的指挥官，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙兽\', \'flavor\': \'「鸿雁飞鸽什么的都太不显眼了。传书的时候，我还是喜欢派有牙齿的去。」\\n～皇家外交官伊舍尔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8dcca43c-8376-40f8-b249-049e32bb1205\', \'multiverseId\': 624119}, \'multiverseid\': 624119}]', '[{\'name\': \'Loyaler Untergebener\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich (Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.)\\nLeutnant — Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls du deinen Kommandeur kontrollierst, verliert jeder Gegner 3 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Zombies funktionieren am besten, wenn sie satt sind. Es empfiehlt sich also, sie bei der Arbeit fressen zu lassen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622981&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8ed53e3-31b3-4bc9-b4f4-6b2b2bc6b6a4\', \'multiverseId\': 622981}, \'multiverseid\': 622981}, {\'name\': \'Subordinado leal\', \'text\': \'Amenaza. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por dos o más criaturas.)\\nTeniente — Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, si controlas a tu comandante, cada oponente pierde 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Los zombies son más eficientes cuando se les alimenta adecuadamente, así que no es descabellado permitir que coman mientras trabajan.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e99f1c8-6128-4f46-9c2b-8b121965dd51\', \'multiverseId\': 623182}, \'multiverseid\': 623182}, {\'name\': \'Sous-fifre loyal\', \'text\': \'Menace (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par deux créatures ou plus.)\\nLieutenant — Au début du combat pendant votre tour, si vous contrôlez votre commandant, chaque adversaire perd 3 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': "Les zombies travaillent mieux l\'estomac plein, mieux vaut donc les laisser manger quand ils sont en mission.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623383&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9329bd34-7ec5-460f-809d-70bc6633db0a\', \'multiverseId\': 623383}, \'multiverseid\': 623383}, {\'name\': \'忠実な下僕\', \'text\': \'威迫（このクリーチャーは２体以上のクリーチャーにしかブロックされない。）\\n副官 ― あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがあなたの統率者をコントロールしている場合、各対戦相手はそれぞれ３点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'ゾンビというものは、適切に給餌した方が良く働く。だから仕事中に食べさせるのが賢明だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5402b1ee-77bf-4da7-bf1d-5d5ed8adc951\', \'multiverseId\': 623785}, \'multiverseid\': 623785}, {\'name\': \'忠诚副手\', \'text\': \'威慑（此生物只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。）\\n副官～在你回合的战斗开始时，若你操控你的指挥官，则每位对手各失去3点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'灵俑吃饱时效率最高，因此让它们边工作边进食乃审慎决定。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fb90473-e057-4d3d-937c-4bc466d308e3\', \'multiverseId\': 624187}, \'multiverseid\': 624187}]', "[{'name': 'Loyaler Wächter', 'text': 'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nLeutnant — Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls du deinen Kommandeur kontrollierst, lege auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Nashorn', 'flavor': 'Jede Narbe auf seiner Panzerhaut ist eine Tapferkeitsmedaille.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628002&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e4925d71-b0f9-4f0d-a7e0-32061ac804ac', 'multiverseId': 628002}, 'multiverseid': 628002}, {'name': 'Guardián leal', 'text': 'Arrolla.\\nTeniente — Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, si controlas a tu comandante, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Rinoceronte', 'flavor': 'Cada cicatriz en su piel es una insignia de honor.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628236&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e561ff0-ce73-473c-a34f-8e6fd39725ff', 'multiverseId': 628236}, 'multiverseid': 628236}, {'name': '忠実な守護者', 'text': 'トランプル\\n副官 ― あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがあなたの統率者をコントロールしている場合、あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — サイ', 'flavor': '皮に残った傷一つ一つが名誉の勲章である。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628704&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '74d9d6ef-0d5d-4fcf-a1fd-e51adb1fb416', 'multiverseId': 628704}, 'multiverseid': 628704}, {'name': '忠诚守卫', 'text': '践踏\\n副官～在你回合的战斗开始时，若你操控你的指挥官，则在每个由你操控的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '生物 ～犀牛', 'flavor': '它身上每道伤痕都是荣誉奖章。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629172&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b2de9e7c-a4b2-4cd4-8706-d76b5032f545', 'multiverseId': 629172}, 'multiverseid': 629172}]", '[{\'name\': \'Loyales Einhorn\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nLeutnant — Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls du deinen Kommandeur kontrollierst, verhindere allen Kampfschaden, der in diesem Zug Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, zugefügt würde. Andere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Wachsamkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Einhorn\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622849&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84362d97-7239-41ec-b1fe-39f60394ec11\', \'multiverseId\': 622849}, \'multiverseid\': 622849}, {\'name\': \'Unicornio leal\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nTeniente — Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, si controlas a tu comandante, prevén todo el daño de combate que fuera a hacerse a las criaturas que controlas este turno. Las otras criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de vigilancia hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Unicornio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b988b4c4-8959-4c94-be1e-934dd0722169\', \'multiverseId\': 623050}, \'multiverseid\': 623050}, {\'name\': \'Licorne loyale\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nLieutenant — Au début du combat pendant votre tour, si vous contrôlez votre commandant, prévenez toutes les blessures de combat qui devraient être infligées aux créatures que vous contrôlez ce tour-ci. Les autres créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent la vigilance jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : licorne\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623251&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ca82ee1-0b1e-4342-a779-dab6788f545a\', \'multiverseId\': 623251}, \'multiverseid\': 623251}, {\'name\': \'忠実なユニコーン\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n副官 ― あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがあなたの統率者をコントロールしている場合、このターン、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーに与えられるすべての戦闘ダメージを軽減する。ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは警戒を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ユニコーン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db31b129-23cf-4a7d-b9cd-5be6c8e98e71\', \'multiverseId\': 623653}, \'multiverseid\': 623653}, {\'name\': \'忠诚独角兽\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n副官～在你回合的战斗开始时，若你操控你的指挥官，则于本回合中，防止将对由你操控之生物造成的所有伤害。由你操控的其他生物获得警戒异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～独角兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'477ad845-49ed-47b4-ba26-33afa7a18ea2\', \'multiverseId\': 624055}, \'multiverseid\': 624055}]', '[{\'name\': \'Loyalitätenschinder\', \'text\': \'Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, übernimm bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Enttappe jene Kreatur. Bis zum Ende des Zuges hat sie Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 10/10, erhält Vernichter 2 und Eile und verursacht Trampelschaden.\\nVernichter 2 (Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift, opfert der verteidigende Spieler zwei bleibende Karten.)\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625112&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4bc4099-16af-40e9-abd5-bfd9d19aa125\', \'multiverseId\': 625112}, \'multiverseid\': 625112}, {\'name\': \'Écorcheur de loyautés\', \'text\': "Quand vous lancez ce sort, acquérez le contrôle d\'une créature ciblée jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez cette créature. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, elle a une force et une endurance de base de 10/10 et acquiert le piétinement, annihilateur 2 et la célérité.\\nAnnihilateur 2 (À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, le joueur défenseur sacrifie deux permanents.)\\nPiétinement", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625144&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ba02770-8fa1-4a52-aa01-6c6d098030b4\', \'multiverseId\': 625144}, \'multiverseid\': 625144}, {\'name\': \'忠誠の剝ぎ取り\', \'text\': \'あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それのコントロールを得る。そのクリーチャーをアンタップする。ターン終了時まで、それは基本のパワーとタフネスが10/10になり、トランプルと滅殺２と速攻を得る。\\n滅殺２（このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーはパーマネント２つを生け贄に捧げる。）\\nトランプル\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae5faab1-546c-404b-a83c-985720d604bf\', \'multiverseId\': 625176}, \'multiverseid\': 625176}]', '[{\'name\': \'Loyalitätenschinder\', \'text\': \'Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, übernimm bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Enttappe jene Kreatur. Bis zum Ende des Zuges hat sie Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 10/10, erhält Vernichter 2 und Eile und verursacht Trampelschaden.\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden, Vernichter 2\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624908&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3f76a5b-e753-4ab7-bb0a-e95a7c0dd8a3\', \'multiverseId\': 624908}, \'multiverseid\': 624908}, {\'name\': \'Écorcheur de loyautés\', \'text\': "Quand vous lancez ce sort, acquérez le contrôle d\'une créature ciblée jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez cette créature. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, elle a une force et une endurance de base de 10/10 et acquiert le piétinement, annihilateur 2 et la célérité.\\nPiétinement, annihilateur 2", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624943&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afb311bc-8d8c-48f4-82d1-17b578d01538\', \'multiverseId\': 624943}, \'multiverseid\': 624943}, {\'name\': \'忠誠の剝ぎ取り\', \'text\': \'あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それのコントロールを得る。そのクリーチャーをアンタップする。ターン終了時まで、それは基本のパワーとタフネスが10/10になり、トランプルと滅殺２と速攻を得る。\\nトランプル、滅殺２\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d8698ca-56aa-4e62-b5eb-6a0b0b5dbe91\', \'multiverseId\': 624978}, \'multiverseid\': 624978}, {\'name\': \'夺忠恶体\', \'text\': \'当你施放此咒语时，获得目标生物的操控权直到回合结束。重置该生物。直到回合结束，它的基础力量与防御力为10/10，且获得践踏、歼灭2与敏捷异能。\\n践踏，歼灭2\', \'type\': \'生物 ～奥札奇\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bd155a0-5ef7-45dc-94cb-ee55e71daf21\', \'multiverseId\': 625013}, \'multiverseid\': 625013}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lähmende Furcht\', \'text\': \'Bestimme einen Kreaturentyp. Kreaturen, die nicht vom bestimmten Typ sind, erhalten -3/-3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Panik machte sich breit, als die Dämonen von Immersturm nach Bretagard strömten und auf ihrem Weg alles niedermetzelten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625524&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99a56c81-4745-4b9f-b486-d8e2d41e2789\', \'multiverseId\': 625524}, \'multiverseid\': 625524}, {\'name\': \'Peur paralysante\', \'text\': "Choisissez un type de créature. Les créatures qui ne sont pas du type choisi gagnent -3/-3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "La panique se répandit comme une traînée de poudre quand les démons de l\'Immersturm déferlèrent sur Bretagard, massacrant tout le monde sur leur passage.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625781&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ee19e98-4ab7-4f47-8a79-62f54928325d\', \'multiverseId\': 625781}, \'multiverseid\': 625781}, {\'name\': \'激しい恐怖\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。ターン終了時まで、その選ばれたタイプでないすべてのクリーチャーは－３/－３の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'イマースタームの悪魔が殺戮とともにブレタガルドへ流れ込むと、燃え広がる野火のように恐慌が広がっていった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64a6a962-26b2-484b-8d81-aec39e9b2959\', \'multiverseId\': 626038}, \'multiverseid\': 626038}]', '[{\'name\': \'Machtremasuri\', \'text\': \'Alle Remasuri-Kreaturen erhalten +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'„Das riesige Geschöpf rumpelte über den Kamm und zerbrach dabei Bäume wie Streichhölzer. Diejenigen, gegen die wir bereits kämpften, bellten vor Freude, und als ihre Muskeln plötzlich anschwollen, wussten wir, dass es Zeit war, zu fliehen."\\n—Llanach, Wolkenwaldläufer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625565&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7211113-0216-4e47-8696-4a42b5908e80\', \'multiverseId\': 625565}, \'multiverseid\': 625565}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde de puissance\', \'text\': \'Toutes les créatures Slivoïde gagnent +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "« La chose colossale dégringola du contrefort, précédée de débris d\'arbres. Celles que nous combattions déjà hurlèrent, leurs muscles se développant soudain, et nous sûmes instantanément qu\'il fallait fuir. »\\n—Llanach, ranger de Linciel", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625822&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52462830-cfe7-4b12-8dad-19cf72b439a7\', \'multiverseId\': 625822}, \'multiverseid\': 625822}, {\'name\': \'増力スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'すべてのスリヴァー・クリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'「でっかいやつが、すごい勢いで木の幹を吹き飛ばしながら尾根を越えてきたんだ。俺たちが戦ってたやつは、そいつが来たとたん一声吼えたかと思ったら、突然筋肉がうねりだしたのさ。逃げたほうがいいと思ったね。」\\n――スカイシュラウドのレインジャー、ラナック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19135c04-9baf-4ff9-9f89-b747b23f9851\', \'multiverseId\': 626079}, \'multiverseid\': 626079}]', '[{\'name\': \'Magierring-Netzwerk\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Lege eine Speichermarke auf das Magierring-Netzwerk.\\n{T}, entferne eine beliebige Anzahl an Speichermarken vom Magierring-Netzwerk: Erzeuge {C} für jede auf diese Weise entfernte Speichermarke.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625671&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d939014a-3890-45a8-949a-09822dd1f018\', \'multiverseId\': 625671}, \'multiverseid\': 625671}, {\'name\': \'Réseau des Anneaux du Mage\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur « stock » sur le Réseau des Anneaux du Mage.\\n{T}, retirez n\'importe quel nombre de marqueurs « stock » du Réseau des Anneaux du Mage : Ajoutez {C} pour chaque marqueur « stock » retiré de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625928&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ff826cc-f97f-4502-b8ff-027df67757a0\', \'multiverseId\': 625928}, \'multiverseid\': 625928}, {\'name\': \'魔道士輪の魔力網\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}：魔道士輪の魔力網の上に貯蔵カウンター１個を置く。\\n{T}, 魔道士輪の魔力網の上から望む数の貯蔵カウンターを取り除く：これにより取り除いた貯蔵カウンター１個につき{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01fb79ac-6e54-48ce-9ef8-ab2cef72cded\', \'multiverseId\': 626185}, \'multiverseid\': 626185}]', '[{\'name\': \'Magus des Rads\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, {T}, opfere den Magus des Rads: Jeder Spieler wirft seine Hand ab und zieht dann sieben Karten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Schicksal ist nicht so vorherbestimmt, wie man glauben mag."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626569&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e27794ff-e175-4da6-8e04-94b6dca3095b\', \'multiverseId\': 626569}, \'multiverseid\': 626569}, {\'name\': \'Mage de la Roue\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, {T}, sacrifiez le Mage de la Roue : Chaque joueur se défausse de sa main, puis pioche sept cartes.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Le destin est moins inflexible que vous ne le pensez. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626909&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f6be197-113b-48ab-a48d-52a66ada8c1c\', \'multiverseId\': 626909}, \'multiverseid\': 626909}, {\'name\': \'輪の大魔術師\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, {T}, 輪の大魔術師を生け贄に捧げる：各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分の手札を捨て、その後、カード７枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「運命とは、あなたが考えているほど定まっているものではないのですよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47aa7119-20e4-4981-804e-9a0dcdfa4a97\', \'multiverseId\': 627249}, \'multiverseid\': 627249}, {\'name\': \'崇轮贤者\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}，{T}，牺牲崇轮贤者：每位牌手弃掉其手牌，然后各抓七张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「你或觉得命运天注定，但其实并非完全如此。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6872a02e-6b04-4bfc-9c19-d91212d7a295\', \'multiverseId\': 627589}, \'multiverseid\': 627589}]', '[{\'name\': \'Magus des Rads\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, {T}, opfere den Magus des Rads: Jeder Spieler wirft seine Hand ab und zieht dann sieben Karten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Schicksal ist nicht so vorherbestimmt, wie man glauben mag."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627939&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93431eb2-6df6-4619-9d20-7ef0d6e95e89\', \'multiverseId\': 627939}, \'multiverseid\': 627939}, {\'name\': \'Mago de la rueda\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, {T}, sacrificar el Mago de la rueda: Cada jugador descarta su mano y luego roba siete cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"El destino no es tan inmutable como te pudieses imaginar".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5813ee23-e1cb-4288-b2ed-dfbaecec6057\', \'multiverseId\': 628173}, \'multiverseid\': 628173}, {\'name\': \'輪の大魔術師\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, {T}, 輪の大魔術師を生け贄に捧げる：各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分の手札を捨て、その後、カード７枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「運命とは、あなたが考えているほど定まっているものではないのですよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2166ffdd-161f-4f53-bb93-24393e2e553e\', \'multiverseId\': 628641}, \'multiverseid\': 628641}, {\'name\': \'崇轮贤者\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}，{T}，牺牲崇轮贤者：每位牌手弃掉其手牌，然后各抓七张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「你或觉得命运天注定，但其实并非完全如此。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55535083-6dac-4ef7-a767-09345bd074ee\', \'multiverseId\': 629109}, \'multiverseid\': 629109}]', '[{\'name\': \'Magus des Rads\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, {T}, opfere den Magus des Rads: Jeder Spieler wirft seine Hand ab und zieht dann sieben Karten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Lineare Zeit? Genauso gut kannst du an dreieckige Schwerkraft glauben!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624473&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f271563b-123b-49cc-b993-33c991923eb1\', \'multiverseId\': 624473}, \'multiverseid\': 624473}, {\'name\': \'Mago de la rueda\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, {T}, sacrificar el Mago de la rueda: Cada jugador descarta su mano y luego roba siete cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Tiempo lineal? ¿Qué será lo próximo? ¿Creer en la gravedad triangular?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4546bfa5-c7f3-48e0-87f1-cc79943cdc67\', \'multiverseId\': 624519}, \'multiverseid\': 624519}, {\'name\': \'Mage de la Roue\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, {T}, sacrifiez le Mage de la Roue : Chaque joueur se défausse de sa main, puis pioche sept cartes.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Le temps linéaire ? Et pourquoi pas la gravité triangulaire tant qu\'on y est ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624565&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'878495f0-957a-4d12-ac11-2a3f7b6b2280\', \'multiverseId\': 624565}, \'multiverseid\': 624565}, {\'name\': \'輪の大魔術師\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, {T}, 輪の大魔術師を生け贄に捧げる：各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分の手札を捨て、その後、カード７枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「直線的な時間？お前は三角形の重力も信じているのだろうな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99e0db98-f1f3-426e-93c7-891975a88ad2\', \'multiverseId\': 624657}, \'multiverseid\': 624657}, {\'name\': \'崇轮贤者\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}，{T}，牺牲崇轮贤者：每位牌手弃掉其手牌，然后各抓七张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「你觉得时间是线性的？那看来你也相信重力场是三角形的！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7324bbfd-247a-4f15-8c49-819544d6c13f\', \'multiverseId\': 624749}, \'multiverseid\': 624749}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mahlstrom-Wanderer\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Eile.\\nKaskade, Kaskade (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, schicke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Nichtland-Karte ins Exil schickst, die weniger kostet. Du kannst sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege die so ins Exil geschickten Karten in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek. Dann tust du dies noch einmal.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626608&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'256d5c79-83b3-48b3-9025-80e3fb987154\', \'multiverseId\': 626608}, \'multiverseid\': 626608}, {\'name\': \'Vagabond du maelstrom\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez ont la célérité.\\nCascade, cascade (Quand vous lancez ce sort, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain d\'un coût inférieur. Vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez les cartes exilées au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire. Puis recommencez.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626948&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6baec92-dff0-4436-97ce-8082f50f97e8\', \'multiverseId\': 626948}, \'multiverseid\': 626948}, {\'name\': \'大渦の放浪者\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは速攻を持つ。\\n続唱、続唱（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、コストがこれより低く土地でないカード１枚が追放されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。それをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。それらの追放されているカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。その後、それをもう一度行う。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb98eab8-be7b-4747-8e80-e5c07c003a53\', \'multiverseId\': 627288}, \'multiverseid\': 627288}, {\'name\': \'涡心漫游怪\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物具有敏捷异能。\\n倾曳，倾曳（当你施放此咒语时，从你的牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张费用比此咒语低的非地牌为止。你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。将所放逐的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。然后再作一次。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29ba79a6-e0d7-428e-bff7-d89dd2a3b6ae\', \'multiverseId\': 627628}, \'multiverseid\': 627628}]', "[{'name': 'Mahlstrom-Wanderer', 'text': 'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Eile.\\nKaskade, Kaskade (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, schicke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Nichtland-Karte ins Exil schickst, die weniger kostet. Du kannst sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege die so ins Exil geschickten Karten in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek. Dann tust du dies noch einmal.)', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Elementarwesen', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628042&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '031b71bb-f925-42f9-9e40-5918f37b903a', 'multiverseId': 628042}, 'multiverseid': 628042}, {'name': 'Errante del Remolino', 'text': 'Las criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de prisa.\\nCascada, cascada. (Cuando lances este hechizo, exilia cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra que cueste menos. Puedes lanzarla sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon las cartas exiliadas en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio. Luego hazlo nuevamente.)', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Elemental', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628276&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a4b8e2b3-776f-4f90-86b4-47b406736e90', 'multiverseId': 628276}, 'multiverseid': 628276}, {'name': '大渦の放浪者', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは速攻を持つ。\\n続唱、続唱（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、コストがこれより低く土地でないカード１枚が追放されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。それをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。追放したカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。その後、それをもう一度行う。）', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628744&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1d02fc5-e902-4e94-82e3-c4dd287924c4', 'multiverseId': 628744}, 'multiverseid': 628744}, {'name': '涡心漫游怪', 'text': '由你操控的生物具有敏捷异能。\\n倾曳，倾曳（当你施放此咒语时，从你的牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张费用比此咒语低的非地牌为止。你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。将所放逐的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。然后再作一次。）', 'type': '传奇生物 ～元素', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629212&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5dc63bde-b1a2-44a8-85eb-60f786c3f22a', 'multiverseId': 629212}, 'multiverseid': 629212}]", '[{\'name\': \'Mahlstrom-Wanderer\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Eile.\\nKaskade, Kaskade (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, schicke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Nichtland-Karte ins Exil schickst, die weniger kostet. Du kannst sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege die so ins Exil geschickten Karten in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek. Dann tust du dies noch einmal.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629350&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3570e42-9eec-4036-a66e-39e34c61ee4c\', \'multiverseId\': 629350}, \'multiverseid\': 629350}, {\'name\': \'Errante del Remolino\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de prisa.\\nCascada, cascada. (Cuando lances este hechizo, exilia cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra que cueste menos. Puedes lanzarla sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon las cartas exiliadas en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio. Luego hazlo nuevamente.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da15a950-0c16-4e09-8cea-5030edfedd70\', \'multiverseId\': 629374}, \'multiverseid\': 629374}, {\'name\': \'Vagabond du maelstrom\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez ont la célérité.\\nCascade, cascade (Quand vous lancez ce sort, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain d\'un coût inférieur. Vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez les cartes exilées au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire. Puis recommencez.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629398&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da3c0533-97af-4939-87b5-ada3ad611e13\', \'multiverseId\': 629398}, \'multiverseid\': 629398}, {\'name\': \'大渦の放浪者\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは速攻を持つ。\\n続唱、続唱（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、コストがこれより低く土地でないカード１枚が追放されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。それをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。それらの追放されているカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。その後、それをもう一度行う。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69746ab8-ab43-488c-89e1-d2268498a2d2\', \'multiverseId\': 629446}, \'multiverseid\': 629446}, {\'name\': \'涡心漫游怪\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物具有敏捷异能。\\n倾曳，倾曳（当你施放此咒语时，从你的牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张费用比此咒语低的非地牌为止。你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。将所放逐的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。然后再作一次。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'449544b0-b6af-48db-8542-b999a24eb491\', \'multiverseId\': 629494}, \'multiverseid\': 629494}]', '[{\'name\': \'Managewebe-Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben „{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'Ihre perlmuttartig schimmernden Schuppen sind bei jenen sehr begehrt, denen der Überlebensinstinkt abhanden gekommen ist.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625562&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10c7be82-57ee-4b57-8b36-01cbd55841f2\', \'multiverseId\': 625562}, \'multiverseid\': 625562}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde manaduite\', \'text\': \'Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont « {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »\', \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "Leurs écailles iridescentes sont très recherchées par ceux qui n\'ont aucun instinct de survie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625819&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d39f23d-e6ff-4b2e-a59b-14cb539b7c3c\', \'multiverseId\': 625819}, \'multiverseid\': 625819}, {\'name\': \'マナ編みスリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのスリヴァー・クリーチャーは「{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'その光沢のある鱗は、命知らずの奴らが血眼になって狙っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edddb009-01ec-47d9-bd6b-9af3a5fa87eb\', \'multiverseId\': 626076}, \'multiverseid\': 626076}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mangara der Diplomat\', \'text\': \'Lebensverknüpfung\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner Kreaturen als Angreifer deklariert und falls zwei oder mehr jener Kreaturen dich und/oder Planeswalker, die du kontrollierst, angreifen, ziehe eine Karte.\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner seinen zweiten Zauberspruch innerhalb desselben Zuges wirkt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622851&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'030df9df-542d-4b12-94fd-85d96775d696\', \'multiverseId\': 622851}, \'multiverseid\': 622851}, {\'name\': \'Mangara, el Diplomático\', \'text\': \'Vínculo vital.\\nSiempre que un oponente ataque con criaturas, si dos o más de esas criaturas te atacan y/o atacan a planeswalkers que controlas, roba una carta.\\nSiempre que un oponente lance su segundo hechizo cada turno, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a109951-ff2f-4756-94f9-cc2444b40b15\', \'multiverseId\': 623052}, \'multiverseid\': 623052}, {\'name\': \'Mangara, le diplomate\', \'text\': "Lien de vie\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire attaque avec des créatures, si au moins deux de ces créatures vous attaquent et/ou attaquent un planeswalker que vous contrôlez, piochez une carte.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire lance son deuxième sort à chaque tour, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623253&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c59427fd-ae81-4cb7-b280-0fb36a17b87a\', \'multiverseId\': 623253}, \'multiverseid\': 623253}, {\'name\': \'外交官、マンガラ\', \'text\': \'絆魂\\n対戦相手１人がクリーチャーで攻撃するたび、それらのクリーチャーのうち２体以上があなたやあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃している場合、カード１枚を引く。\\n対戦相手１人が各ターン内の自分の２つ目の呪文を唱えるたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4ef73cf-d525-4cf3-8788-7fb6c775154c\', \'multiverseId\': 623655}, \'multiverseid\': 623655}, {\'name\': \'使节曼格拉\', \'text\': \'系命\\n每当任一对手以生物攻击时，若其中有两个或更多生物攻击你和／或由你操控的鹏洛客，则你抓一张牌。\\n每当任一对手施放每回合中其第二个咒语时，你抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcd84eda-897e-4af6-aa70-3d686d5c24c0\', \'multiverseId\': 624057}, \'multiverseid\': 624057}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mangara der Diplomat\', \'text\': \'Lebensverknüpfung\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner Kreaturen als Angreifer deklariert und falls zwei oder mehr jener Kreaturen dich und/oder Planeswalker, die du kontrollierst, angreifen, ziehe eine Karte.\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner seinen zweiten Zauberspruch innerhalb desselben Zuges wirkt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626491&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c18305d4-4c15-4a09-9c35-1bb07b75f610\', \'multiverseId\': 626491}, \'multiverseid\': 626491}, {\'name\': \'Mangara, le diplomate\', \'text\': "Lien de vie\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire attaque avec des créatures, si au moins deux de ces créatures vous attaquent et/ou attaquent un planeswalker que vous contrôlez, piochez une carte.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire lance son deuxième sort à chaque tour, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626831&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b511b5b-8e1d-474c-934c-56dc0f54467b\', \'multiverseId\': 626831}, \'multiverseid\': 626831}, {\'name\': \'外交官、マンガラ\', \'text\': \'絆魂\\n対戦相手１人がクリーチャーで攻撃するたび、それらのクリーチャーのうち２体以上があなたやあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃している場合、カード１枚を引く。\\n対戦相手１人が各ターン内の自分の２つ目の呪文を唱えるたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'deed59c3-ebe2-4758-9fe3-b17fc8f4a597\', \'multiverseId\': 627171}, \'multiverseid\': 627171}, {\'name\': \'使节曼格拉\', \'text\': \'系命\\n每当任一对手以生物攻击时，若其中有两个或更多生物攻击你和／或由你操控的鹏洛客，则你抓一张牌。\\n每当任一对手施放每回合中其第二个咒语时，你抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b07fee4-bbbf-49d6-a4f6-abf046c255c2\', \'multiverseId\': 627511}, \'multiverseid\': 627511}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mannigfaltige Landschaft\', \'text\': \'Die Mannigfaltige Landschaft kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere die Mannigfaltige Landschaft: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, die einen Landtyp gemeinsam haben, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624490&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f8906c6-2008-4cff-90ab-498d9ead3056\', \'multiverseId\': 624490}, \'multiverseid\': 624490}, {\'name\': \'Paisaje infinito\', \'text\': \'El Paisaje infinito entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Paisaje infinito: Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica que compartan un tipo de tierra, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2daca4e5-c2dd-425d-a0fc-fff4147b7b2b\', \'multiverseId\': 624536}, \'multiverseid\': 624536}, {\'name\': \'Paysage myriadaire\', \'text\': "Le Paysage myriadaire arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez le Paysage myriadaire : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base qui partagent un type de terrain, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624582&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6389077-b5fa-4d26-9bc6-434f538c07e7\', \'multiverseId\': 624582}, \'multiverseid\': 624582}, {\'name\': \'無限地帯\', \'text\': \'無限地帯はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, 無限地帯を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を共通の土地タイプ１つを持つように選んで探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c750be4-16fe-4230-9121-72698b8786b2\', \'multiverseId\': 624674}, \'multiverseid\': 624674}, {\'name\': \'繁茂地境\', \'text\': \'繁茂地境须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{C}。\\n{2}，{T}，牺牲繁茂地境：从你牌库中搜寻至多两张具共通地类别的基本地牌，将它们横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b07dfd97-5ba4-42a4-bdd3-77d7dde6d2dc\', \'multiverseId\': 624766}, \'multiverseid\': 624766}]', "[{'name': 'Mannigfaltige Landschaft', 'text': 'Die Mannigfaltige Landschaft kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere die Mannigfaltige Landschaft: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, die einen Landtyp gemeinsam haben, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628119&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '32787d08-b17f-4dfc-93de-4097d6278ee4', 'multiverseId': 628119}, 'multiverseid': 628119}, {'name': 'Paisaje infinito', 'text': 'El Paisaje infinito entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Paisaje infinito: Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica que compartan un tipo de tierra, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628353&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0c0295fc-9588-4d13-aa3c-94e43e969c54', 'multiverseId': 628353}, 'multiverseid': 628353}, {'name': '無限地帯', 'text': '無限地帯はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2},{T},無限地帯を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を共通の土地タイプを持つように選んで探し、タップ状態で戦場に出し、その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628821&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4a5cc533-23b4-40c1-8b93-8eb80098e9be', 'multiverseId': 628821}, 'multiverseid': 628821}, {'name': '繁茂地境', 'text': '繁茂地境须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{C}。\\n{2}，{T}，牺牲繁茂地境：从你牌库中搜寻至多两张具共通地类别的基本地牌，将它们横置放进战场，然后洗牌。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629289&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e89ac42-6ffc-43dd-bd64-eeae75fd2315', 'multiverseId': 629289}, 'multiverseid': 629289}]", '[{\'name\': \'Mannigfaltiges Konstrukt\', \'text\': \'Bonus {3}\\nFalls die Bonuskosten des Mannigfaltigen Konstrukts bezahlt wurden, kommt es für jedes Nichtstandardland, das deine Gegner kontrollieren, mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Mannigfaltige Konstrukt das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs wird, opfere es und erzeuge so viele 1/1 farblose Konstrukt-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine, wie seine Stärke beträgt.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625625&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d13aefb-7cb8-403d-b9af-2ddb89c0600a\', \'multiverseId\': 625625}, \'multiverseid\': 625625}, {\'name\': \'Construction myriadaire\', \'text\': "Kick {3}\\nSi la Construction myriadaire a été kickée, elle arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle pour chaque terrain non-base que vos adversaires contrôlent.\\nQuand la Construction myriadaire devient la cible d\'un sort, sacrifiez-la et créez un nombre de jetons de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Construction égal à sa force.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625882&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fd18fb1-35a5-44b6-becc-7ab929f4b63b\', \'multiverseId\': 625882}, \'multiverseid\': 625882}, {\'name\': \'無限の構築物\', \'text\': \'キッカー{3}\\n無限の構築物がキッカーされていたなら、これは、対戦相手がコントロールしていて基本でない土地１つにつき１個の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n無限の構築物が呪文の対象になったとき、これを生け贄に捧げ、これのパワーに等しい数の無色の１/１の構築物・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f1269e7-2b81-4e90-9042-327db9a5d8df\', \'multiverseId\': 626139}, \'multiverseid\': 626139}]', '[{\'name\': \'Materie-Umformer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Materie-Umformer stirbt, decke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf. Du kannst jene Karte ins Spiel bringen, falls es eine bleibende Karte mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger ist. Nimm sie sonst auf deine Hand.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625468&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c15895a9-c25e-4233-8b15-c9a862929a10\', \'multiverseId\': 625468}, \'multiverseid\': 625468}, {\'name\': \'Reforgeur de matière\', \'text\': "Quand le Reforgeur de matière meurt, révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre cette carte sur le champ de bataille si c\'est une carte de permanent avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3. Sinon, mettez cette carte dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625725&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5e614e0-e391-4ba6-8cf2-eb32d38871c6\', \'multiverseId\': 625725}, \'multiverseid\': 625725}, {\'name\': \'作り変えるもの\', \'text\': \'作り変えるものが死亡したとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を公開する。それがマナ総量が３以下であるパーマネント・カードなら、あなたはそのカードを戦場に出してもよい。そうでないなら、そのカードをあなたの手札に加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2b5e511-1d1d-4661-8f7e-f18b75e02301\', \'multiverseId\': 625982}, \'multiverseid\': 625982}]', "[{'name': 'Mauer des Verweigerns', 'text': 'Verteidiger, Fliegend\\nVerhüllt (Diese Kreatur kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mauer', 'flavor': 'Sie bietet das, was jeder anspruchsvolle Magier benötigt: Zeit zum Nachdenken.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625601&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b153682-6139-4203-8440-334826fc3dbc', 'multiverseId': 625601}, 'multiverseid': 625601}, {'name': 'Mur de déni', 'text': 'Défenseur, vol\\nLinceul (Cette créature ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités.)', 'type': 'Créature : mur', 'flavor': 'Il procure ce dont tout mage perspicace a le plus besoin — du temps pour la réflexion.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625858&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e6737a03-c4f0-411a-9e68-b5f57641ed7e', 'multiverseId': 625858}, 'multiverseid': 625858}, {'name': '否定の壁', 'text': '防衛、飛行\\n被覆（このクリーチャーは呪文や能力の対象にならない。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 壁', 'flavor': 'それは洞察力のある魔道士すべてが求めるものを与えてくれる。考える時間だ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626115&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f61666c9-f7f3-4ae6-92e8-a8fc0c3ef47d', 'multiverseId': 626115}, 'multiverseid': 626115}]", '[{\'name\': \'Megantischer Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +3/+3.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'Remasuris passen sich schnell an, um jede evolutionäre Nische zu füllen, selbst wenn diese Nische „König der Raubtiere" ist.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625563&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e67026d2-bbdd-4610-bc1e-c0b7e55ab8b7\', \'multiverseId\': 625563}, \'multiverseid\': 625563}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde mégantique\', \'text\': \'Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez gagnent +3/+3.\', \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "Les slivoïdes s\'adaptent rapidement à n\'importe quelle niche évolutive, même si c\'est celle d\'un « superprédateur cataclysmique ».", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625820&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d897876c-41cd-49a5-ae4c-5a186b2cd96b\', \'multiverseId\': 625820}, \'multiverseid\': 625820}, {\'name\': \'大身スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのスリヴァー・クリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'スリヴァーはあらゆる必要に応じて適切な進化を遂げる。例えその必要が「超巨大頂点捕食者」であったとしても。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dabfd81f-f776-451b-8ff1-075a260b397a\', \'multiverseId\': 626077}, \'multiverseid\': 626077}]', "[{'name': 'Melek, Paragon der Izzet', 'text': 'Die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ist offen.\\nDu kannst Spontanzauber und Hexereien oben von deiner Bibliothek wirken.\\nImmer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei aus deiner Bibliothek wirkst, kopiere ihn bzw. sie. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Seltsamkeit, Zauberer', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628043&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ceccad37-8e9b-431d-be0c-3933c981e61d', 'multiverseId': 628043}, 'multiverseid': 628043}, {'name': 'Mélek, ejemplar ízzet', 'text': 'Juega mostrando la primera carta de tu biblioteca.\\nPuedes lanzar hechizos de instantáneo y de conjuro desde la parte superior de tu biblioteca.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro desde tu biblioteca, cópialo. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero extraño', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628277&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d936540-f275-45c0-9657-7dbec8b0aaa0', 'multiverseId': 628277}, 'multiverseid': 628277}, {'name': 'イゼットの模範、メーレク', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を公開したままプレイする。\\nあなたはあなたのライブラリーの一番上からインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えてもよい。\\nあなたがあなたのライブラリーからインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、それをコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 奇魔・ウィザード', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628745&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2adbed16-2960-4a44-a17e-a086ffcac6c5', 'multiverseId': 628745}, 'multiverseid': 628745}, {'name': '伊捷守护者梅列克', 'text': '你以展示牌库顶牌的方式进行游戏。\\n你可以从你的牌库顶施放瞬间和法术咒语。\\n每当你从你的牌库施放瞬间或法术咒语时，将它复制。你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～怪奇／法术师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629213&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '78bae703-0163-4d57-987f-580395224983', 'multiverseId': 629213}, 'multiverseid': 629213}]", '[{\'name\': \'Meren vom Klan Nel Toth\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, erhältst du eine Erfahrungsmarke.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments bestimmst du eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl in deinem Friedhof. Falls der Manabetrag jener Karte kleiner oder gleich der Anzahl an Erfahrungsmarken ist, die du hast, bringe sie ins Spiel zurück. Nimm sie sonst auf deine Hand.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626609&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e23a9240-7d23-412f-b039-f07ff80a3337\', \'multiverseId\': 626609}, \'multiverseid\': 626609}, {\'name\': \'Meren du clan Nel Toth\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature que vous contrôlez meurt, vous gagnez un marqueur « expérience ».\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, choisissez une carte de créature ciblée dans votre cimetière. Si la valeur de mana de cette carte est inférieure ou égale au nombre de marqueurs « expérience » que vous avez, renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille. Sinon, mettez-la dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626949&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be6e5525-09a0-460b-836a-ed688ab414e6\', \'multiverseId\': 626949}, \'multiverseid\': 626949}, {\'name\': \'ネル・トース族のメーレン\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、あなたは経験カウンター１個を得る。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。そのカードのマナ総量があなたが持つ経験カウンターの個数以下なら、それを戦場に戻す。そうでないなら、それをあなたの手札に加える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59541a02-7327-46f6-be4b-3064df7e94c5\', \'multiverseId\': 627289}, \'multiverseid\': 627289}, {\'name\': \'奈拓族的莫伦\', \'text\': \'每当另一个由你操控的生物死去时，你得到一个经验指示物。\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，选择目标在你坟墓场中的生物牌。若该牌的法术力值等于或小于你具有的经验指示物数量，则将它移回战场。若否，则将它置于你手上。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／祭师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'756d8df7-d116-4891-b101-1d3457571add\', \'multiverseId\': 627629}, \'multiverseid\': 627629}]', "[{'name': 'Meren vom Klan Nel Toth', 'text': 'Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, erhältst du eine Erfahrungsmarke.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments bestimmst du eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl in deinem Friedhof. Falls der Manabetrag jener Karte kleiner oder gleich der Anzahl an Erfahrungsmarken ist, die du hast, bringe sie ins Spiel zurück. Nimm sie sonst auf deine Hand.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628044&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd7e3c456-08ce-45c8-9e3c-0f3c5464e6c1', 'multiverseId': 628044}, 'multiverseid': 628044}, {'name': 'Merin del clan Nel Toth', 'text': 'Siempre que otra criatura que controlas muera, obtienes un contador de experiencia.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, elige la carta de criatura objetivo en tu cementerio. Si el valor de maná de esa carta es menor o igual que la cantidad de contadores de experiencia que tengas, regrésala al campo de batalla. De lo contrario, pon esa carta en tu mano.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Chamán humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628278&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ba598755-5692-4675-8315-72413237240e', 'multiverseId': 628278}, 'multiverseid': 628278}, {'name': 'ネル・トース族のメーレン', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、あなたは経験カウンター１個を得る。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。そのカードのマナ総量があなたが持つ経験カウンターの個数以下なら、それを戦場に戻す。そうでないなら、それをあなたの手札に加える。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628746&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '56d5e19b-a80e-4c9e-b850-d236bd0965ee', 'multiverseId': 628746}, 'multiverseid': 628746}, {'name': '奈拓族的莫伦', 'text': '每当另一个由你操控的生物死去时，你得到一个经验指示物。\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，选择目标在你坟墓场中的生物牌。若该牌的法术力值等于或小于你具有的经验指示物数量，则将它移回战场。若否，则将它置于你手上。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～人类／祭师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629214&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '68dd97fc-dc4a-43ba-bd8c-bc5b4ab505fa', 'multiverseId': 629214}, 'multiverseid': 629214}]", '[{\'name\': \'Meren vom Klan Nel Toth\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, erhältst du eine Erfahrungsmarke.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments bestimmst du eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl in deinem Friedhof. Falls der Manabetrag jener Karte kleiner oder gleich der Anzahl an Erfahrungsmarken ist, die du hast, bringe sie ins Spiel zurück. Nimm sie sonst auf deine Hand.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629351&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'376de1b5-8e0c-4c49-807a-727906fab302\', \'multiverseId\': 629351}, \'multiverseid\': 629351}, {\'name\': \'Merin del clan Nel Toth\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura que controlas muera, obtienes un contador de experiencia.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, elige la carta de criatura objetivo en tu cementerio. Si el valor de maná de esa carta es menor o igual que la cantidad de contadores de experiencia que tengas, regrésala al campo de batalla. De lo contrario, pon esa carta en tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c836f52-8486-4255-866b-e2b9de7605a5\', \'multiverseId\': 629375}, \'multiverseid\': 629375}, {\'name\': \'Meren du clan Nel Toth\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature que vous contrôlez meurt, vous gagnez un marqueur « expérience ».\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, choisissez une carte de créature ciblée dans votre cimetière. Si la valeur de mana de cette carte est inférieure ou égale au nombre de marqueurs « expérience » que vous avez, renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille. Sinon, mettez-la dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629399&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c574cb1-8cb4-459c-9802-fdce3cb60672\', \'multiverseId\': 629399}, \'multiverseid\': 629399}, {\'name\': \'ネル・トース族のメーレン\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、あなたは経験カウンター１個を得る。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。そのカードのマナ総量があなたが持つ経験カウンターの個数以下なら、それを戦場に戻す。そうでないなら、それをあなたの手札に加える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffdc8e6f-5a09-4a9e-b472-8f2d721081d3\', \'multiverseId\': 629447}, \'multiverseid\': 629447}, {\'name\': \'奈拓族的莫伦\', \'text\': \'每当另一个由你操控的生物死去时，你得到一个经验指示物。\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，选择目标在你坟墓场中的生物牌。若该牌的法术力值等于或小于你具有的经验指示物数量，则将它移回战场。若否，则将它置于你手上。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／祭师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27d43d1a-1922-4ae0-b042-33c41e24743d\', \'multiverseId\': 629495}, \'multiverseid\': 629495}]', '[{\'name\': \'Messdiener der Pflicht\', \'text\': \'Seelenwandlung 2 (Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt, erzeuge zwei 1/1 weiße und schwarze Geist-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn der Preis für deine Sünden fällig wird, ist die Kirche des Handels zur Stelle.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622852&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f75cf4b7-af5c-410e-bf43-591cce2e028a\', \'multiverseId\': 622852}, \'multiverseid\': 622852}, {\'name\': \'Ministrante de la obligación\', \'text\': \'Ultratumba 2. (Cuando esta criatura muera, crea dos fichas de criatura Espíritu blancas y negras 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando llegue la hora de pagar el precio por tus pecados, la iglesia de los acuerdos estará ahí para cobrarlo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6dfc979-bcf6-45ed-b689-1c0b46b62d0a\', \'multiverseId\': 623053}, \'multiverseid\': 623053}, {\'name\': "Ministre d\'obligation", \'text\': \'Au-delà 2 (Quand cette créature meurt, créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 blanche et noire Esprit avec le vol.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': "Quand le prix de vos péchés arrive à échéance, l\'Église des Transactions est là pour l\'encaisser.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623254&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'243ab980-c807-4dad-b903-c76eb9060a24\', \'multiverseId\': 623254}, \'multiverseid\': 623254}, {\'name\': \'債務の聖職者\', \'text\': \'死後２（このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、飛行を持つ白黒の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'犯した罪への対価を支払う期限を迎えたときには、取引の教会がそれを回収に来る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4c91c38-09f2-40c4-add7-65e7d5253556\', \'multiverseId\': 623656}, \'multiverseid\': 623656}, {\'name\': \'守责主礼人\', \'text\': \'往生2（当此生物死去时，派出两个1/1，白黑双色，具飞行异能的精怪衍生生物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'罪行代价账期一到，行商教会便会上门收取。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c90f157-a8c5-40fb-8fe4-eaba0ea8f126\', \'multiverseId\': 624058}, \'multiverseid\': 624058}]', "[{'name': 'Metallener Koloss', 'text': 'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {X} weniger, wobei X gleich dem Gesamt-Manabetrag aller Nichtkreatur-Artefakte ist, die du kontrollierst.\\nOpfere zwei Artefakte: Bringe den Metallenen Koloss aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625622&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1a9faf6-82d3-437e-8c7b-1e84e0388cc6', 'multiverseId': 625622}, 'multiverseid': 625622}, {'name': 'Colosse de métallurgie', 'text': 'Ce sort coûte {X} de moins à lancer, X étant la valeur de mana totale des artefacts non-créature que vous contrôlez.\\nSacrifiez deux artefacts : Renvoyez dans votre main le Colosse de métallurgie depuis votre cimetière.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : construction', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625879&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c13f021-6d90-4c95-8dcf-daab1cc2fe32', 'multiverseId': 625879}, 'multiverseid': 625879}, {'name': '金属製の巨像', 'text': 'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{X}少なくなる。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしていてクリーチャーでないすべてのアーティファクトのマナ総量の合計に等しい。\\nアーティファクト２つを生け贄に捧げる：あなたの墓地にある金属製の巨像をあなたの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626136&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '043e56e1-dc22-4a26-a7eb-73dc16af7e3b', 'multiverseId': 626136}, 'multiverseid': 626136}]", '[{\'name\': \'Meteor der Auslöschung\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Land deiner Wahl. Der Meteor der Auslöschung fügt jeder Kreatur und jedem Planeswalker 20 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Meine Visionen sind beunruhigend. Ich sehe den Untergang dieser Welt, ausgelöst durch die Suche nach der Immerwährenden Sonne."\\n—Wandlerin Pashona\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626575&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43a9ca5a-986d-45cc-ad95-a43950c12a34\', \'multiverseId\': 626575}, \'multiverseid\': 626575}, {\'name\': "Étoile d\'extinction", \'text\': "Détruisez un terrain ciblé. L\'Étoile d\'extinction inflige 20 blessures à chaque créature et à chaque planeswalker.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Des visions me hantent. Je vois la fin du monde, occasionnée par la quête du Soleil immortel. »\\n—Modeleuse Pashona\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626915&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10ddd1af-0f8e-4509-b9c6-b77b7c913665\', \'multiverseId\': 626915}, \'multiverseid\': 626915}, {\'name\': \'絶滅の星\', \'text\': \'土地１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。絶滅の星は各クリーチャーと各プレインズウォーカーにそれぞれ20点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「幻視が私を苦しめる。不滅の太陽の探索が、世界の終わりを引き起こす。」\\n――形成師のパショーナ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a6095a0-1203-4d57-8a4b-9f9d40046115\', \'multiverseId\': 627255}, \'multiverseid\': 627255}, {\'name\': \'灭绝星落\', \'text\': \'消灭目标地。灭绝星落对每个生物和每个鹏洛客各造成20点伤害。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「这般景象令我不安。我看到了世界末日，看到了寻找永生圣阳引致的末日。」\\n～塑形师帕修娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'984d286b-8ee0-4245-8203-2a27e1f7e6d9\', \'multiverseId\': 627595}, \'multiverseid\': 627595}]', '[{\'name\': \'Meteor der Auslöschung\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Land deiner Wahl. Der Meteor der Auslöschung fügt jeder Kreatur und jedem Planeswalker 20 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Meine Visionen sind beunruhigend. Ich sehe den Untergang dieser Welt, ausgelöst durch die Suche nach der Immerwährenden Sonne."\\n—Wandlerin Pashona\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627957&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2a4f413-53b7-46c0-a132-e6f866553bb9\', \'multiverseId\': 627957}, \'multiverseid\': 627957}, {\'name\': \'Meteorito exterminador\', \'text\': \'Destruye la tierra objetivo. El Meteorito exterminador hace 20 puntos de daño a cada criatura y a cada planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Las visiones me persiguen. Veo el fin del mundo y la razón de su llegada es la búsqueda del Sol Inmortal".\\n—Moldeadora Pashona\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'947f9339-291e-4ba1-abdb-fc9fa534baf7\', \'multiverseId\': 628191}, \'multiverseid\': 628191}, {\'name\': \'絶滅の星\', \'text\': \'土地１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。絶滅の星は各クリーチャーと各プレインズウォーカーにそれぞれ20点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「幻視が私を苦しめる。不滅の太陽の探索が、世界の終わりを引き起こす。」\\n――形成師のパショーナ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f1ba141-1810-408e-877b-96316d764b3e\', \'multiverseId\': 628659}, \'multiverseid\': 628659}, {\'name\': \'灭绝星落\', \'text\': \'消灭目标地。灭绝星落对每个生物和每个鹏洛客各造成20点伤害。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「这般景象令我不安。我看到了世界末日，看到了寻找永生圣阳引致的末日。」\\n～塑形师帕修娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'872c9901-612e-4c82-bb17-906443c8b662\', \'multiverseId\': 629127}, \'multiverseid\': 629127}]', "[{'name': 'Meteorgolem', 'text': 'Wenn der Meteorgolem ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist und die ein Gegner kontrolliert.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Golem', 'flavor': 'Herala seufzte, als sich die Kreatur mit noch glühenden Füßen, unter denen der Boden brodelte, aus der schwelenden Grube erhob. Dabei hatte sie dieses Feld doch gerade umgepflügt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628097&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4a148565-0d74-4530-99ec-5dd760a3f758', 'multiverseId': 628097}, 'multiverseid': 628097}, {'name': 'Gólem meteoro', 'text': 'Cuando el Gólem meteoro entre al campo de batalla, destruye el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra que controla un oponente.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Gólem', 'flavor': 'Herala suspiró en cuanto la criatura se levantó del foso ardiente, cuyo suelo aún hervía bajo sus pies incandescentes. Acababa de arar ese campo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628331&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aaf07009-2861-4801-88f5-8dd37c4d1b61', 'multiverseId': 628331}, 'multiverseid': 628331}, {'name': '隕石ゴーレム', 'text': '隕石ゴーレムが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム', 'flavor': 'その魔物は、触れる地面を沸騰させながら赤く燃え続ける足でくすぶる穴から這い上がった。それを見たヘララはため息をついた。ついさっきその原野を耕したばかりだったのだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628799&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a436d63-ff03-41b5-a133-54be80d23d84', 'multiverseId': 628799}, 'multiverseid': 628799}, {'name': '陨石魔像', 'text': '当陨石魔像进战场时，消灭目标由对手操控的非地永久物。', 'type': '神器生物 ～魔像', 'flavor': '眼看那活物从焦土坑中缓慢起身，火红双脚下大地依然烟气缭绕，荷芮拉不由得叹了口气。她才刚犁完这片地。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629267&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd36e9506-6944-4b00-b89b-3136b6fbe397', 'multiverseId': 629267}, 'multiverseid': 629267}]", "[{'name': 'Meteorstreitkolben', 'text': 'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +4/+0 und verursacht Trampelschaden.\\nAusrüsten {4}\\nKaskade (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, schicke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Nichtland-Karte ins Exil schickst, die weniger kostet. Du kannst sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege die so ins Exil geschickten Karten in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.)', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627941&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c7caed81-37a9-4eac-9b7d-d0fc06453afd', 'multiverseId': 627941}, 'multiverseid': 627941}, {'name': 'Maza meteórica', 'text': 'La criatura equipada obtiene +4/+0 y tiene la habilidad de arrollar.\\nEquipar {4}.\\nCascada. (Cuando lances este hechizo, exilia cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra y que cueste menos. Puedes lanzarla sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon las cartas exiliadas en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.)', 'type': 'Artefacto — Equipo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628175&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '75d9a3bd-192a-4163-8e75-922d499f3a4a', 'multiverseId': 628175}, 'multiverseid': 628175}, {'name': '隕石の鎚鉾', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーは＋４/＋０の修整を受けトランプルを持つ。\\n装備{4}\\n続唱（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、コストがこれより低く土地でないカード１枚が追放されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。それをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。それらの追放されているカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。）', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628643&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9f14ccb5-f68c-45be-8674-b205cd8f6371', 'multiverseId': 628643}, 'multiverseid': 628643}, {'name': '流星锤', 'text': '佩带此武具的生物得+4/+0且具有践踏异能。\\n佩带{4}\\n倾曳（当你施放此咒语时，从你的牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张费用比此咒语低的非地牌为止。你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。将所放逐的牌以随机顺序置于你牌库底。）', 'type': '神器 ～武具', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629111&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4367c858-d636-4031-bcb5-2fa17419714b', 'multiverseId': 629111}, 'multiverseid': 629111}]", '[{\'name\': \'Mikaeus der Unheilige\', \'text\': \'Einschüchtern\\nImmer wenn ein Mensch dir Schaden zufügt, zerstöre ihn.\\nAndere Nicht-Mensch-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 und sind unverwüstlich. (Wenn eine unverwüstliche Kreatur stirbt und falls keine +1/+1-Marke auf ihr lag, bringe sie mit einer +1/+1-Marke unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Zombie, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622982&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69c61fc6-f536-40df-87a3-f519e21a8aaf\', \'multiverseId\': 622982}, \'multiverseid\': 622982}, {\'name\': \'Mikaeus, el impío\', \'text\': \'Intimidar.\\nSiempre que un Humano te haga daño, destrúyelo.\\nLas otras criaturas que no sean Humano que controlas obtienen +1/+1 y tienen la habilidad de resiliencia. (Cuando una criatura con la habilidad de resiliencia muera, si no tenía contadores +1/+1 sobre ella, regrésala al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Clérigo zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf11e151-903f-40a6-b5c6-db4738693f2e\', \'multiverseId\': 623183}, \'multiverseid\': 623183}, {\'name\': \'Mikaeus, le maudit\', \'text\': "Intimidation\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un humain vous inflige des blessures, détruisez-le.\\nLes autres créatures non-Humain que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 et ont la survivance. (Quand une créature avec la survivance meurt, si elle n\'avait pas de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle, renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : zombie et clerc\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623384&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06fa26e8-3130-47ea-b40e-910b43e912be\', \'multiverseId\': 623384}, \'multiverseid\': 623384}, {\'name\': \'不浄なる者、ミケウス\', \'text\': \'威嚇\\n人間１体があなたにダメージを与えるたび、それを破壊する。\\nあなたがコントロールしていて人間でもこれでもないすべてのクリーチャーは、＋１/＋１の修整を受け不死を持つ。（不死を持つクリーチャーが死亡したとき、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれていない場合、それを＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態でオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゾンビ・クレリック\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b76f557a-e2e1-4611-9fb3-b014f53819b1\', \'multiverseId\': 623786}, \'multiverseid\': 623786}, {\'name\': \'孽物米凯耶\', \'text\': \'威吓\\n每当一个人类对你造成伤害时，将它消灭。\\n由你操控的其他非人类生物得+1/+1且具有不息异能。（当具不息异能的生物死去时，若其上没有+1/+1指示物，则将它在其拥有者的操控下移回战场，且其上有一个+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～灵俑／僧侣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0072d28e-6eb4-4941-b351-efe47d27d8c3\', \'multiverseId\': 624188}, \'multiverseid\': 624188}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mikaeus der Unheilige\', \'text\': \'Einschüchtern\\nImmer wenn ein Mensch dir Schaden zufügt, zerstöre ihn.\\nAndere Nicht-Mensch-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 und sind unverwüstlich. (Wenn eine unverwüstliche Kreatur stirbt und falls keine +1/+1-Marke auf ihr lag, bringe sie mit einer +1/+1-Marke unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Zombie, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626263&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13788449-6c3e-488c-a8ff-d813726df735\', \'multiverseId\': 626263}, \'multiverseid\': 626263}, {\'name\': \'Mikaeus, le maudit\', \'text\': "Intimidation\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un humain vous inflige des blessures, détruisez-le.\\nLes autres créatures non-Humain que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 et ont la survivance. (Quand une créature avec la survivance meurt, si elle n\'avait pas de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle, renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : zombie et clerc\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626273&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20b9f253-67e9-4c06-a730-75c6017409d4\', \'multiverseId\': 626273}, \'multiverseid\': 626273}, {\'name\': \'不浄なる者、ミケウス\', \'text\': \'威嚇\\n人間１体があなたにダメージを与えるたび、それを破壊する。\\nあなたがコントロールしていて人間でもこれでもないすべてのクリーチャーは、＋１/＋１の修整を受け不死を持つ。（不死を持つクリーチャーが死亡したとき、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれていない場合、それを＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態でオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゾンビ・クレリック\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84b1a515-bcd4-4576-9360-75aa211d7d7b\', \'multiverseId\': 626283}, \'multiverseid\': 626283}, {\'name\': \'孽物米凯耶\', \'text\': \'威吓\\n每当一个人类对你造成伤害时，将它消灭。\\n由你操控的其他非人类生物得+1/+1且具有不息异能。（当具不息异能的生物死去时，若其上没有+1/+1指示物，则将它在其拥有者的操控下移回战场，且其上有一个+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～灵俑／僧侣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5d8819e-5354-4199-9613-bf65632abdf1\', \'multiverseId\': 626293}, \'multiverseid\': 626293}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mikaeus der Unheilige\', \'text\': \'Einschüchtern\\nImmer wenn ein Mensch dir Schaden zufügt, zerstöre ihn.\\nAndere Nicht-Mensch-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 und sind unverwüstlich. (Wenn eine unverwüstliche Kreatur stirbt und falls keine +1/+1-Marke auf ihr lag, bringe sie mit einer +1/+1-Marke unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Zombie, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626541&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1086ca9b-3e9e-4541-a2aa-a39483c44726\', \'multiverseId\': 626541}, \'multiverseid\': 626541}, {\'name\': \'Mikaeus, le maudit\', \'text\': "Intimidation\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un humain vous inflige des blessures, détruisez-le.\\nLes autres créatures non-Humain que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 et ont la survivance. (Quand une créature avec la survivance meurt, si elle n\'avait pas de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle, renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : zombie et clerc\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626881&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9264124-6408-415a-89f3-87c0c620676f\', \'multiverseId\': 626881}, \'multiverseid\': 626881}, {\'name\': \'不浄なる者、ミケウス\', \'text\': \'威嚇\\n人間１体があなたにダメージを与えるたび、それを破壊する。\\nあなたがコントロールしていて人間でもこれでもないすべてのクリーチャーは、＋１/＋１の修整を受け不死を持つ。（不死を持つクリーチャーが死亡したとき、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれていない場合、それを＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態でオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゾンビ・クレリック\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a00f744-12b5-402a-8363-72ca238f7142\', \'multiverseId\': 627221}, \'multiverseid\': 627221}, {\'name\': \'孽物米凯耶\', \'text\': \'威吓\\n每当一个人类对你造成伤害时，将它消灭。\\n由你操控的其他非人类生物得+1/+1且具有不息异能。（当具不息异能的生物死去时，若其上没有+1/+1指示物，则将它在其拥有者的操控下移回战场，且其上有一个+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～灵俑／僧侣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b38f986-9f00-47f1-bbcd-ddc0ca27b584\', \'multiverseId\': 627561}, \'multiverseid\': 627561}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mikaeus der Unheilige\', \'text\': \'Einschüchtern\\nImmer wenn ein Mensch dir Schaden zufügt, zerstöre ihn.\\nAndere Nicht-Mensch-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 und sind unverwüstlich. (Wenn eine unverwüstliche Kreatur stirbt und falls keine +1/+1-Marke auf ihr lag, bringe sie mit einer +1/+1-Marke unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Zombie, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629341&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2723f19-d17d-4962-a1b1-05889fe52f8a\', \'multiverseId\': 629341}, \'multiverseid\': 629341}, {\'name\': \'Mikaeus, el impío\', \'text\': \'Intimidar.\\nSiempre que un Humano te haga daño, destrúyelo.\\nLas otras criaturas que no sean Humano que controlas obtienen +1/+1 y tienen la habilidad de resiliencia. (Cuando una criatura con la habilidad de resiliencia muera, si no tenía contadores +1/+1 sobre ella, regrésala al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Clérigo zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34a4ad6f-2a40-4d39-b2e1-35d8cfb6ed2a\', \'multiverseId\': 629365}, \'multiverseid\': 629365}, {\'name\': \'Mikaeus, le maudit\', \'text\': "Intimidation\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un humain vous inflige des blessures, détruisez-le.\\nLes autres créatures non-Humain que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 et ont la survivance. (Quand une créature avec la survivance meurt, si elle n\'avait pas de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle, renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : zombie et clerc\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629389&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a569903-fb94-4c75-8f37-24d0b679c88c\', \'multiverseId\': 629389}, \'multiverseid\': 629389}, {\'name\': \'不浄なる者、ミケウス\', \'text\': \'威嚇\\n人間１体があなたにダメージを与えるたび、それを破壊する。\\nあなたがコントロールしていて人間でもこれでもないすべてのクリーチャーは、＋１/＋１の修整を受け不死を持つ。（不死を持つクリーチャーが死亡したとき、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれていない場合、それを＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態でオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゾンビ・クレリック\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d59fa7e0-835f-4548-b678-15146735fb00\', \'multiverseId\': 629437}, \'multiverseid\': 629437}, {\'name\': \'孽物米凯耶\', \'text\': \'威吓\\n每当一个人类对你造成伤害时，将它消灭。\\n由你操控的其他非人类生物得+1/+1且具有不息异能。（当具不息异能的生物死去时，若其上没有+1/+1指示物，则将它在其拥有者的操控下移回战场，且其上有一个+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～灵俑／僧侣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3efecef1-d9a6-40d3-9d6b-0aa8c3202754\', \'multiverseId\': 629485}, \'multiverseid\': 629485}]', '[{\'name\': \'Miraris Nachwirkungen\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\nImmer wenn du ein Land für Mana tappst, erzeuge ein Mana eines beliebigen Typs, den das Land produziert hat.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Selbst nachdem eine falsche Göttin die Magie aus Dominaria gerissen hatte, strahlte das Mirari-Schwert, das sie tötete, immer noch Macht aus.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625590&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef5fb185-4ed2-450a-933d-609c15535c11\', \'multiverseId\': 625590}, \'multiverseid\': 625590}, {\'name\': \'Éveil du Mirari\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous engagez un terrain pour du mana, ajoutez un mana de n\'importe quel type que ce terrain a produit.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Même après qu\'une fausse divinité eut arraché la magie de Dominaria, il émanait encore de l\'épée du Mirari qui l\'avait tuée une certaine puissance.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625847&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41d1218a-d1b3-43ff-a1a7-53bf7e347528\', \'multiverseId\': 625847}, \'multiverseid\': 625847}, {\'name\': \'ミラーリの目覚め\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\nあなたがマナを引き出す目的で土地１つをタップするたび、その土地が生み出したタイプのうち望むタイプのマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'邪神がドミナリアから魔法を切り離した後でも、彼女を殺したミラーリ剣からは力がほとばしっていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfd99464-f429-43e8-a720-0020d30f714d\', \'multiverseId\': 626104}, \'multiverseid\': 626104}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mirri, Duellantin der Wetterlicht\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nImmer wenn Mirri, Duellantin der Wetterlicht, angreift, können Gegner in diesem Kampf nicht mit mehr als jeweils einer Kreatur blocken.\\nSolange Mirri, Duellantin der Wetterlicht, getappt ist, kann dich in jedem Kampf höchstens eine Kreatur angreifen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Katze, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626610&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6cd5809-00d4-45d3-9ec0-65e350933bcb\', \'multiverseId\': 626610}, \'multiverseid\': 626610}, {\'name\': "Mirri, duelliste de l\'Aquilon", \'text\': "Initiative\\nÀ chaque fois que Mirri, duelliste de l\'Aquilon attaque, chaque adversaire ne peut pas bloquer avec plus d\'une créature pendant ce combat.\\nTant que Mirri, duelliste de l\'Aquilon est engagée, pas plus d\'une créature ne peut vous attaquer à chaque combat.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : chat et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626950&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a49e419-8887-40d4-842f-f1d39f85a679\', \'multiverseId\': 626950}, \'multiverseid\': 626950}, {\'name\': \'ウェザーライトの決闘者、ミリー\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\nウェザーライトの決闘者、ミリーが攻撃するたび、この戦闘で、各対戦相手は、それぞれ２体以上のクリーチャーではブロックできない。\\nウェザーライトの決闘者、ミリーがタップ状態であるかぎり、各戦闘で、２体以上のクリーチャーではあなたを攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 猫・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6661e856-9e71-415b-9184-b3369769366d\', \'multiverseId\': 627290}, \'multiverseid\': 627290}, {\'name\': \'晴空号斗士米丽\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n每当晴空号斗士米丽攻击时，本次战斗中每位对手均不能以多于一个生物进行阻挡。\\n只要晴空号斗士米丽已横置，每次战斗攻击你的生物便不能多于一个。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～猫／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'833c687d-a804-4d31-90c3-8096961b2ed1\', \'multiverseId\': 627630}, \'multiverseid\': 627630}]', "[{'name': 'Mirri, Duellantin der Wetterlicht', 'text': 'Erstschlag\\nImmer wenn Mirri, Duellantin der Wetterlicht, angreift, können Gegner in diesem Kampf nicht mit mehr als jeweils einer Kreatur blocken.\\nSolange Mirri, Duellantin der Wetterlicht, getappt ist, kann dich in jedem Kampf höchstens eine Kreatur angreifen.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Katze, Krieger', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628045&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6f64f2ec-72f1-4967-9184-2db9b578b81e', 'multiverseId': 628045}, 'multiverseid': 628045}, {'name': 'Mirri, duelista del Vientoligero', 'text': 'Daña primero.\\nSiempre que Mirri, duelista del Vientoligero ataque, cada oponente no puede bloquear con más de una criatura este combate.\\nMientras Mirri, duelista del Vientoligero esté girada, no te puede atacar más de una criatura cada combate.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero felino', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628279&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e30eaa14-ea9c-45ff-9089-be650118a9fd', 'multiverseId': 628279}, 'multiverseid': 628279}, {'name': 'ウェザーライトの決闘者、ミリー', 'text': '先制攻撃\\nウェザーライトの決闘者、ミリーが攻撃するたび、この戦闘で、各対戦相手は、それぞれ２体以上のクリーチャーではブロックできない。\\nウェザーライトの決闘者、ミリーがタップ状態であるかぎり、各戦闘で、２体以上のクリーチャーではあなたを攻撃できない。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 猫・戦士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628747&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f66bb934-2957-4cfc-a163-abd38ad23a21', 'multiverseId': 628747}, 'multiverseid': 628747}, {'name': '晴空号斗士米丽', 'text': '先攻\\n每当晴空号斗士米丽攻击时，本次战斗中每位对手均不能以多于一个生物进行阻挡。\\n只要晴空号斗士米丽已横置，每次战斗攻击你的生物便不能多于一个。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～猫／战士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629215&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca7f50b5-7466-4b43-a4f8-9387109cfe57', 'multiverseId': 629215}, 'multiverseid': 629215}]", '[{\'name\': \'Mizzix vom Izmagnus\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, dessen bzw. deren Manabetrag höher ist als die Anzahl an Erfahrungsmarken, die du hast, erhältst du eine Erfahrungsmarke.\\nSpontanzauber und Hexereien, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken für jede Erfahrungsmarke, die du hast, {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Goblin, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626611&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41bcd263-f8c3-44ea-97f9-2d4d8f4c30c1\', \'multiverseId\': 626611}, \'multiverseid\': 626611}, {\'name\': "Mizzix de l\'Izmagnus", \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel avec une valeur de mana supérieure au nombre de marqueurs « expérience » que vous avez, vous gagnez un marqueur « expérience ».\\nLes sorts d\'éphémère et de rituel que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque marqueur « expérience » que vous avez.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : gobelin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626951&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bc8493a-e50c-4b8a-aaa7-635a1ce9a783\', \'multiverseId\': 626951}, \'multiverseid\': 626951}, {\'name\': \'イズマグナスのミジックス\', \'text\': \'あなたが、あなたが持つ経験カウンターの個数よりマナ総量が大きくインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは経験カウンター１個を得る。\\nあなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたが持つ経験カウンター１個につき{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゴブリン・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'241e94d1-e8ae-4aa0-b7ad-55ac6359ddea\', \'multiverseId\': 627291}, \'multiverseid\': 627291}, {\'name\': \'伊捷首法师米捷兹\', \'text\': \'每当你施放法术力值大于你具有之经验指示物数量的瞬间或法术咒语时，你得到一个经验指示物。\\n你每有一个经验指示物，你施放的瞬间与法术咒语便减少{1}来施放。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～鬼怪／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=627631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d784090-47fc-4bd0-b36c-e0699b081962\', \'multiverseId\': 627631}, \'multiverseid\': 627631}]', "[{'name': 'Mizzix vom Izmagnus', 'text': 'Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, dessen bzw. deren Manabetrag höher ist als die Anzahl an Erfahrungsmarken, die du hast, erhältst du eine Erfahrungsmarke.\\nSpontanzauber und Hexereien, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken für jede Erfahrungsmarke, die du hast, {1} weniger.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Goblin, Zauberer', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628046&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '00738822-90a3-4435-b238-b1e627f97901', 'multiverseId': 628046}, 'multiverseid': 628046}, {'name': 'Mízzix de los izmagnus', 'text': 'Siempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro con valor de maná mayor que la cantidad de contadores de experiencia que tengas, obtienes un contador de experiencia.\\nTe cuesta {1} menos lanzar los hechizos de instantáneo y de conjuro por cada contador de experiencia que tengas.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero trasgo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628280&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd7c9eea4-bf80-495e-88b5-ea64752527a0', 'multiverseId': 628280}, 'multiverseid': 628280}, {'name': 'イズマグナスのミジックス', 'text': 'あなたが、あなたが持つ経験カウンターの個数よりマナ総量が大きくインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは経験カウンター１個を得る。\\nあなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたが持つ経験カウンター１個につき{1}少なくなる。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — ゴブリン・ウィザード', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628748&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f5e7b753-7fe9-4cf4-8f60-de0366c91437', 'multiverseId': 628748}, 'multiverseid': 628748}, {'name': '伊捷首法师米捷兹', 'text': '每当你施放法术力值大于你具有之经验指示物数量的瞬间或法术咒语时，你得到一个经验指示物。\\n你每有一个经验指示物，你施放的瞬间与法术咒语便减少{1}来施放。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～鬼怪／法术师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629216&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb19c5d9-6dd9-4ebd-bf00-3d6892d75ac1', 'multiverseId': 629216}, 'multiverseid': 629216}]", '[{\'name\': \'Mobilisierter Distrikt\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{4}: Der Mobilisierte Distrikt wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer 3/3 Bürger-Kreatur mit Wachsamkeit. Er ist immer noch ein Land. Diese Fähigkeit kostet beim Aktivieren für jede legendäre Kreatur und jeden legendären Planeswalker, die bzw. den du kontrollierst, {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Manchmal ist Einigkeit die stärkste Waffe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625673&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93fe10b1-6549-4c45-a6fe-f1cb4b5c23fc\', \'multiverseId\': 625673}, \'multiverseid\': 625673}, {\'name\': \'Circonscription mobilisée\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{4} : La Circonscription mobilisée devient une créature 3/3 Citoyen avec la vigilance jusqu\'à la fin du tour. C\'est toujours un terrain. Cette capacité coûte {1} de moins à activer pour chaque créature légendaire et chaque planeswalker légendaire que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Parfois, la meilleure arme qu\'on puisse avoir en main est une autre main.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=625930&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d106313d-0c39-4fbd-98db-23128648c8e6\', \'multiverseId\': 625930}, \'multiverseid\': 625930}, {\'name\': \'総動員地区\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{4}：ターン終了時まで、総動員地区は警戒を持つ３/３の市民・クリーチャーになる。これは土地でもある。この能力を起動するためのコストは、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうちあなたがコントロールしていて伝説である１体につき{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'時として、人が手にできる最強の武器は、もう一人の手である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd7bc2ed-33ad-40df-84fd-532fc347a9a0\', \'multiverseId\': 626187}, \'multiverseid\': 626187}]', '[{\'name\': \'Molimo, Maro-Hexer\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nStärke und Widerstandskraft von Molimo, Maro-Hexer, sind gleich der Anzahl an Ländern, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Mein Geist ist der Schirm des Blätterdachs. Mein Herz ist die Umarmung der Wurzeln. Ich bin das todlose Llanowar, sein Zorn und sein Frieden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628003&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f80eae2-65e6-4e7f-96cf-53c4996fe2c5\', \'multiverseId\': 628003}, \'multiverseid\': 628003}, {\'name\': \'Molimo, hechicero maro\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nTanto la fuerza como la resistencia de Molimo, hechicero maro son iguales a la cantidad de tierras que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi mente es la expansión de la enramada. Mi corazón es el abrazo de las raíces. Soy el inmortal Llanowar, su furia y su paz".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c7c5074-d6b5-498b-b846-c1e86ddc0786\', \'multiverseId\': 628237}, \'multiverseid\': 628237}, {\'name\': \'マローの魔術師モリモ\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nマローの魔術師モリモのパワーとタフネスはそれぞれ、あなたがコントロールしている土地の数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'「我が意思は梢の広がり。我が心は根の抱擁。我は死せざるラノワール、憤怒であり平安。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=628705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69793531-a19c-4169-892b-d8341f315fa8\', \'multiverseId\': 628705}, \'multiverseid\': 628705}, {\'name\': \'玛洛术士莫黎墨\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n玛洛术士莫黎墨的力量和防御力各等同于由你操控的地数量。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': \'「思绪与树冠同展。心灵如盘根紧拥。我便是不朽的罗堰，具现其狂怒与平和。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=629173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4577c1d2-43fe-4ed2-9266-8326f695658a\', \'multiverseId\': 629173}, \'multiverseid\': 629173}]', '[{\'name\': \'Morophon, grenzenloses Etwas\', \'text\': \'Wandelwicht (Diese Karte hat alle Kreaturentypen.)\\nSowie Morophon, grenzenloses Etwas, ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Kreaturentyp.\\nZaubersprüche des bestimmten Typs, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} weniger. Dieser Effekt reduziert nur die Menge an farbigem Mana, die du bezahlen musst.\\nAndere Kreaturen des bestimmten Typs, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=622812&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71367abe-586f-45c0-8d2d-eeeed267846b\', \'multiverseId\': 622812}, \'multiverseid\': 622812}, {\'name\': \'Morophon, el Ilimitado\', \'text\': \'Cambiaformas. (Esta carta es de todos los tipos de criatura.)\\nEn cuanto Morophon, el Ilimitado entre al campo de batalla, elige un tipo de criatura.\\nTe cuesta {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} menos lanzar los hechizos del tipo elegido. Este efecto reduce solo la cantidad de maná de color que pagas.\\nLas otras criaturas que controlas del tipo elegido obtienen +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05ae2155-9a5d-479c-9fcc-367658d490c3\', \'multiverseId\': 623013}, \'multiverseid\': 623013}, {\'name\': "Morophon, l\'Abondant", \'text\': "Changelin (Cette carte a tous les types de créature.)\\nAu moment où Morophon, l\'Abondant arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un type de créature.\\nLes sorts du type choisi que vous lancez coûtent {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} de moins à lancer. Cet effet réduit uniquement la quantité de mana coloré que vous payez.\\nLes autres créatures du type choisi que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : changeforme\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623214&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14168632-5517-4976-97d3-edc8fa58772c\', \'multiverseId\': 623214}, \'multiverseid\': 623214}, {\'name\': \'限りないもの、モロフォン\', \'text\': \'多相（このカードはすべてのクリーチャー・タイプである。）\\n限りないもの、モロフォンが戦場に出るに際し、クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。\\nあなたがその選ばれたタイプの呪文を唱えるためのコストは{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}少なくなる。この効果は、あなたが支払う色マナの点数のみを減らす。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてその選ばれたタイプでありこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=623616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcefd623-307c-4470-a9ae-834694e4e63e\', \'multiverseId\': 623616}, \'multiverseid\': 623616}, {\'name\': \'无形莫洛丰\', \'text\': \'化形（此牌是所有生物类别。）\\n于无形莫洛丰进战场时，选择一种生物类别。\\n你施放的该类别咒语减少{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}来施放。此效应仅减少你支付的有色法术力数量。\\n由你操控的其他该类别生物得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～变形兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=624018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4040684-8a4d-4dbb-85fa-d1b0d058af70\', \'multiverseId\': 624018}, \'multiverseid\': 624018}]', '[{\'name\': \'Morophon, grenzenloses Etwas\', \'text\': \'Wandelwicht (Diese Karte hat alle Kreaturentypen.)\\nSowie Morophon, grenzenloses Etwas, ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Kreaturentyp.\\nZaubersprüche des bestimmten Typs, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} weniger. Dieser Effekt reduziert nur die Menge an farbigem Mana, die du bezahlen musst.\\nAndere Kreaturen des bestimmten Typs, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626260&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'698519ec-d52d-441a-b6be-a1587bf47aaa\', \'multiverseId\': 626260}, \'multiverseid\': 626260}, {\'name\': "Morophon, l\'Abondant", \'text\': "Changelin (Cette carte a tous les types de créature.)\\nAu moment où Morophon, l\'Abondant arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un type de créature.\\nLes sorts du type choisi que vous lancez coûtent {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} de moins à lancer. Cet effet réduit uniquement la quantité de mana coloré que vous payez.\\nLes autres créatures du type choisi que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : changeforme\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=626270&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d719755-844b-414f-9721-b9254ce9b31c\', \'multiverseId\': 626270}, \'multiverseid\': 626270}, {\'name\': \'限りないもの、モロフォン\', \'text\': \'多相（このカードはすべてのクリーチャー・タイプである。）\\n限りないもの、モロフォンが戦場に出るに際し、クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。\\nあなたがその選ばれたタイプの呪文を唱えるためのコストは{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}少なくなる。この効果は、あなたが支払う色マナの点数のみを減らす。\\n