e gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nWhenever a creature you control attacks alone, it gains double strike until end of turn.', "Exile any number of target creatures and/or planeswalkers you control. At the beginning of the next end step, return each of them to the battlefield under its owner's control. Each of them enters the battlefield with an additional +1/+1 counter on it if it's a creature and an additional loyalty counter on it if it's a planeswalker.", 'Exile target artifact or creature. Its controller creates a 4/4 blue and red Elemental creature token.', 'Exile target artifact or enchantment. If you cast this spell during your main phase, you may exile up to one other target artifact or enchantment.', 'Exile target creature, then proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', 'Exile target creature. Its controller gains life equal to its power.', 'Exile target creature. Its controller manifests the top card of their library.', "Exile target creature. Its controller manifests the top card of their library. (That player puts the top card of their library onto the battlefield face down as a 2/2 creature. If it's a creature card, it can be turned face up any time for its mana cost.)", 'Exile target creature. Its controller may search their library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Exile the top eight cards of your library. You may put a land card from among them onto the battlefield. Until end of turn, for each nonland card type, you may cast a spell of that type from among the exiled cards without paying its mana cost.', 'Exile two target artifacts, creatures, and/or lands you control, then return those cards to the battlefield under your control.', 'Experiment Kraj has all activated abilities of each other creature with a +1/+1 counter on it.\\n{T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', 'Firemind Vessel enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add two mana of different colors.', 'First strike, hexproof\\nWhenever Narset, Enlightened Master attacks, exile the top four cards of your library. Until end of turn, you may cast noncreature spells from among those cards without paying their mana costs.', 'First strike, vigilance, lifelink\\nAura and Equipment spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.', 'First strike\\nBalan, Wandering Knight has double strike as long as two or more Equipment are attached to it.\\n{1}{W}: Attach all Equipment you control to Balan.', "First strike\\nWhenever Mirri, Weatherlight Duelist attacks, each opponent can't block with more than one creature this combat.\\nAs long as Mirri, Weatherlight Duelist is tapped, no more than one creature can attack you each combat.", 'First strike\\nWhenever Odric, Master Tactician and at least three other creatures attack, you choose which creatures block this combat and how those creatures block.', 'First strike\\n{3}{W}{W}: Attacking creatures you control get +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the number of attacking creatures.', 'Flash\\nAny player may cast Sliver spells as though they had flash.', "Flash\\nFlying\\nSpells you cast with mana value 5 or greater cost {1} less to cast and can't be countered.", 'Flash\\nFlying\\nYou may cast historic spells as though they had flash. (Artifacts, legendaries, and Sagas are historic.)', 'Flash\\nIf an opponent would draw two or more cards, instead you and that player each draw a card.', 'Flash\\nThis spell costs {1} less to cast for each attacking creature.\\nTrample\\nWhen Ancient Stone Idol dies, create a 6/12 colorless Construct artifact creature token with trample.', 'Flash\\nWhen Cast Out enters the battlefield, exile target nonland permanent an opponent controls until Cast Out leaves the battlefield.\\nCycling {W} ({W}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Flash\\nWhen Omen of the Hunt enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.\\n{2}{G}, Sacrifice Omen of the Hunt: Scry 2.', 'Flash\\nWhen Omen of the Sun enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 white Human Soldier creature tokens and you gain 2 life.\\n{2}{W}, Sacrifice Omen of the Sun: Scry 2.', "Flash\\nWhen Portal Mage enters the battlefield during the declare attackers step, you may reselect which player or permanent target attacking creature is attacking. (It can't attack its controller or their permanents.)", 'Flash\\nWhen Torrential Gearhulk enters the battlefield, you may cast target instant card from your graveyard without paying its mana cost. If that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead.', 'Flash\\nYou may cast artifact spells as though they had flash.', "Flash\\nYou may cast colorless spells as though they had flash.\\nWhenever you cast a colorless spell, until end of turn, Skittering Cicada gains trample and gets +X/+X, where X is that spell's mana value.", 'Flood Plain enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}, Sacrifice Flood Plain: Search your library for a Plains or Island card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Flying', 'Flying, double strike, vigilance, trample, indestructible', 'Flying, double strike\\nWhen Heavenly Blademaster enters the battlefield, you may attach any number of Auras and Equipment you control to it.\\nOther creatures you control get +1/+1 for each Aura and Equipment attached to Heavenly Blademaster.', 'Flying, first strike, vigilance, lifelink', 'Flying, first strike\\nIf a source would deal damage to an opponent or a permanent an opponent controls, that source deals double that damage to that player or permanent instead.\\nIf a source would deal damage to you or a permanent you control, prevent half that damage, rounded up.', 'Flying, haste', 'Flying, haste\\nWhenever Hellkite Charger attacks, you may pay {5}{R}{R}. If you do, untap all attacking creatures and after this phase, there is an additional combat phase.', "Flying, haste\\nWhenever Jaya's Phoenix 