n.', '{2}{G}, {T}, Put a verse counter on Yisan, the Wanderer Bard: Search your library for a creature card with mana value equal to the number of verse counters on Yisan, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{2}{G}, {T}: Create a 1/1 colorless Servo artifact creature token.\\n{4}{G}, {T}: Create an X/X colorless Construct artifact creature token, where X is the number of creatures you control.', '{2}{G}: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', '{2}{G}: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.\\nSacrifice a Saproling: Saproling creatures get +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{2}{U}, {T}: Each player mills three cards. Exile up to two creature cards put into graveyards this way. Create an X/X blue Zombie creature token, where X is the total power of the cards exiled this way.', '{2}{W}: Adapt 1. (If this creature has no +1/+1 counters on it, put a +1/+1 counter on it.)\\nWhenever one or more +1/+1 counters are put on Knighted Myr, it gains double strike until end of turn.', '{3}, Sacrifice Burnished Hart: Search your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{5}, {T}, Exile Perilous Vault: Exile all nonland permanents.', "{B}, {T}, Sacrifice another creature: Create X 2/2 black Zombie creature tokens, where X is the sacrificed creature's power.", '{B}: Regenerate Twisted Abomination. (The next time this creature would be destroyed, instead tap it, remove it from combat, and heal all damage on it.)\\nSwampcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Swamp card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', '{R}, {T}: Spikeshot Goblin deals damage equal to its power to any target.', '{R}: Inferno Titan gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\nWhenever Inferno Titan enters the battlefield or attacks, it deals 3 damage divided as you choose among one, two, or three targets.', '{T}, Mill a card: Add {C}. (To mill a card, put the top card of your library into your graveyard.)', '{T}, Put a page counter on Mazemind Tome: Scry 1.\\n{2}, {T}, Put a page counter on Mazemind Tome: Draw a card.\\nWhen there are four or more page counters on Mazemind Tome, exile it. If you do, you gain 4 life.', '{T}, Sacrifice Jeweled Lotus: Add three mana of any one color. Spend this mana only to cast your commander.', '{T}, Sacrifice Terramorphic Expanse: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}, Sacrifice two creatures: Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', '{T}: Add X mana of any one color, where X is the number of enchantments you control.', "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.", "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.\\nSacrifice Commander's Sphere: Draw a card.", '{T}: Add one mana of any color that a land an opponent controls could produce.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color. If you control a creature with power 4 or greater, add two mana of any one color instead.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Letter of Acceptance: Draw a card.', "{T}: Add one mana of any color.\\n{4}, {T}: Each player who controls a permanent named Bonder's Ornament draws a card.", '{T}: Add three mana of any one color.', '{T}: Add {C}.', "{T}: Add {C}. If you control an Urza's Mine and an Urza's Power-Plant, add {C}{C}{C} instead.", "{T}: Add {C}. If you control an Urza's Mine and an Urza's Tower, add {C}{C} instead.", "{T}: Add {C}. If you control an Urza's Power-Plant and an Urza's Tower, add {C}{C} instead.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\nBasic landcycling {1} ({1}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', '{T}: Add {C}.\\nTap an untapped legendary permanent you control: Untap Honor-Worn Shaku.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Mind Stone: Draw a card.', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity. If you spend this mana to cast your commander, it enters the battlefield with a number of additional +1/+1 counters on it equal to the number of times it's been cast from the command zone this game.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Put a storage counter on Mage-Ring Network.\\n{T}, Remove any number of storage counters from Mage-Ring Network: Add {C} for each storage counter removed this way.', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Until end of turn, creatures your opponents control lose hexproof and shroud and can't have hexproof or shroud.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice a Desert: Exile all graveyards.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Each player draws a card, then discards a card.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Target legendary creature becomes a God in addition to its other types. Put a +1/+1 counter on it.\\n{4}, {T}, Sacrifice Tyrite Sanctum: Put an indestructible counter on target God.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: You gain 1 life for each colorless creature you control.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}{C}, {T}: Draw a card. Activate only if you have no cards in hand.', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{3}, {T}, Pay life equal to the number of colors in your commanders' color identity: Draw a card.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{3}, {T}: Draw a card. Activate only if you control a creature with power 4 or greater.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{4}: Mobilized District becomes a 3/3 Citizen creature with vigilance until end of turn. It's still a land. This ability costs {1} less to activate for each legendary creature and planeswalker you control.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{7}, {T}, Sacrifice Unstable Obelisk: Destroy target permanent.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{GU}, {T}: Add {R}{R}, {R}{W}, or {W}{W}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {G}. Activate only if you control a Swamp.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {C}{C}. Spend this mana only to cast colorless Eldrazi spells or activate abilities of colorless Eldrazi.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {C}{C}. Spend this mana only to cast colorless spells. Activate only if you control seven or more lands.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {W}. Talisman of Conviction deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {R}. Talisman of Creativity deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {B}. Activate only if you control a Swamp.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {U}. Talisman of Progress deals 1 damage to you.', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Choose target commander that entered the battlefield this turn. Put a +1/+1 counter on it if it's a creature and a loyalty counter on it if it's a planeswalker.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{UR}, {T}: Add {U}{U}, {U}{R}, or {R}{R}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{WU}, {T}: Add {W}{W}, {W}{U}, or {U}{U}.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}. Activate only if you control five or more lands.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}. Spend this mana only to cast artifact spells or activate abilities of artifacts.\\n{U}, {T}: Search your library for a card named Heart-Piercer Bow or Vial of Dragonfire, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Hedron Archive: Draw two cards.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}{C}.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}{C}.\\n{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Dreamstone Hedron: Draw three cards.', '{T}: Add {G}.', '{T}: Choose a player. That player adds one mana of any color they choose.', '{T}: Create X 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens, where X is the number of Goblins you control.', '{T}: Draw a card. Activate only if you created a token this turn.\\n{8}, {T}, Sacrifice Idol of Oblivion: Create a 10/10 colorless Eldrazi creature token.', '{T}: Flip a coin. If you win the flip, destroy all nonland permanents.', "{T}: Heartless Hidetsugu deals damage to each player equal to half that player's life total, rounded down.", '{T}: Untap another target permanent.\\nCycling {1}{U} ({1}{U}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\\nWhen you cycle Vizier of Tumbling Sands, untap target permanent.']
